window.EnglishFieldNotes={"20250915-01": {"石缝边露出植株基部和褐色残存组织。": "The base of the plant and brown remnants of older tissue beside a crevice in the rock.", "逆光下的绿色佛焰苞": "The green spathe with light shining through it.", "叶片与下方的花序": "The leaf and the inflorescence below it.", "从叶片下方看放射状叶脉汇合的位置。": "The meeting point of the radiating veins, seen from beneath the leaf.", "两片伞状叶片在林下撑开。": "Two umbrella-like leaves spread beneath the trees.", "青绿色的果序，表面布满排列紧密的小果。": "Small green fruits packed closely together.", "从侧面看弯曲的佛焰苞": "The curved spathe in profile.", "辐射状展开的叶片": "A leaf with its leaflets spread in a circle.", "从叶面正上方看，分裂的小叶围绕中央展开。": "Viewed from above, the leaflets spread around the centre.", "佛焰苞下部的筒状部分": "The tubular lower part of the spathe.", "带有深浅斑纹的叶柄": "Pale and dark markings on the leaf stalk.", "从侧面看尚青绿的果序和它弯曲的基部。": "The still-green cluster of fruits and its curved base, viewed from the side.", "侧光落在狭长的小叶上，叶缘微微起伏。": "Light falls across the long leaflets, whose edges are slightly wavy.", "佛焰苞与细长的尾尖": "The spathe and its long, slender tip.", "像伞一样展开的叶子下面，躲着一条“眼镜蛇”。从佛焰苞的长尾尖，一直看到带花斑的叶柄。": "Beneath a leaf spread like an umbrella, a “cobra” hides. I followed the long tapering tip of the spathe down to the mottled leaf stalk.", "一把伞南星": "Yìbǎsǎn nánxīng (一把伞南星)", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These organisms are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where available.", "虽然长得像魔芋，但有毒不能食用；这花开成这样子，有点不敢凝视它，叶子确实有点像一把伞-一把伞南星": "It looks like konjac, but it is poisonous and must not be eaten. I hardly dare look this flower in the eye! Its leaf really does look like an umbrella. | Arisaema erubescens", "佛焰苞": "Spathe", "伞状叶": "Umbrella-shaped leaf", "林下": "Woodland understorey", "伞下面，藏着一位小伙伴": "A little companion under the umbrella", "在路边发现了它：一把伞南星。先看到的，是一片像伞一样摊开的叶子；再往下面找，那个绿色的身影就冒出来了。\n它的佛焰苞弯弯地罩在花序外面，轮廓很像一条静静抬头的眼镜蛇。我忍不住凑过去，想跟它打个招呼。": "I found this plant by the roadside. What I saw first was a leaf spread out like an umbrella. Then I looked underneath and spotted a little green shape.\nThe spathe curves over the inflorescence, with the outline of a cobra quietly raising its head. I couldn’t resist bending closer to say hello.", "这一条长尾尖，差点挂上蜘蛛网": "That long tip nearly snagged a cobweb", "佛焰苞背面有浅色条纹，顶端越伸越细，颜色也渐渐变深。这次看到的一条长尾尖，刚好被蜘蛛网挂住了。\n换到侧面看，它的弯曲姿态更明显。再看叶柄上的花斑，难怪许多俗名都和蛇、芋头有关。": "Pale stripes run down the back of the spathe. Towards its tip it tapers to a darker and darker thread. On one of the plants I found, that thread had caught in a spider’s web.\nFrom the side, the curve was even more striking. Then I noticed the markings on the leaf stalk. I could see why so many of the plant’s local names bring snakes or taro to mind.", "一把伞，也会遇上两把伞": "One umbrella, sometimes two", "名字里的“伞”，说的就是叶片的样子。许多狭长的裂片从中心向外展开，尖端还拖着细丝。\n一般看到的是一片叶护着花序，这次也遇上了长着两片叶的植株。先记住整体轮廓，再看这些小变化，就更有意思了。": "The “umbrella” in the Chinese name describes the leaf. Long, narrow leaflets fan out from the centre, each tip trailing into a thread.\nI usually see one leaf sheltering the inflorescence. This time I also found a plant with two. Once I had the overall shape in mind, those little variations were a pleasure to spot.", "花谢以后，再看一次": "Another look after flowering", "佛焰苞凋谢后，里面的小果序会露出来，看着有点像小苞米。这次还记录了它的地下块茎，以及随生长状态变化的性别表达。\n花序、果序、块茎，是不同时候能看到的线索。它有毒，不能因为外形像芋头，就把它当成食物。这次先记下这把特别的“伞”。": "When the spathe withers, the little cluster of fruits inside is exposed. It looks a bit like a small ear of corn. In this video I also recorded the underground tuber and the way the plant’s sex expression changes with its growth.\nThe inflorescence, fruit cluster and tuber each offer clues that can be seen at different times. This plant is poisonous. Its resemblance to taro doesn’t make it food. For now, I wanted to remember this remarkable “umbrella”.", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "在路边发现了它：一把伞南星。先看到的，是一片像伞一样摊开的叶子；再往下面找，那个绿色的身影就冒出来了。": "I found this plant by the roadside. What I saw first was a leaf spread out like an umbrella. Then I looked underneath and spotted a little green shape.", "它的佛焰苞弯弯地罩在花序外面，轮廓很像一条静静抬头的眼镜蛇。我忍不住凑过去，想跟它打个招呼。": "The spathe curves over the inflorescence, with the outline of a cobra quietly raising its head. I couldn’t resist bending closer to say hello.", "佛焰苞背面有浅色条纹，顶端越伸越细，颜色也渐渐变深。这次看到的一条长尾尖，刚好被蜘蛛网挂住了。": "Pale stripes run down the back of the spathe. Towards its tip it tapers to a darker and darker thread. On one of the plants I found, that thread had caught in a spider’s web.", "换到侧面看，它的弯曲姿态更明显。再看叶柄上的花斑，难怪许多俗名都和蛇、芋头有关。": "From the side, the curve was even more striking. Then I noticed the markings on the leaf stalk. I could see why so many of the plant’s local names bring snakes or taro to mind.", "名字里的“伞”，说的就是叶片的样子。许多狭长的裂片从中心向外展开，尖端还拖着细丝。": "The “umbrella” in the Chinese name describes the leaf. Long, narrow leaflets fan out from the centre, each tip trailing into a thread.", "一般看到的是一片叶护着花序，这次也遇上了长着两片叶的植株。先记住整体轮廓，再看这些小变化，就更有意思了。": "I usually see one leaf sheltering the inflorescence. This time I also found a plant with two. Once I had the overall shape in mind, those little variations were a pleasure to spot.", "佛焰苞凋谢后，里面的小果序会露出来，看着有点像小苞米。这次还记录了它的地下块茎，以及随生长状态变化的性别表达。": "When the spathe withers, the little cluster of fruits inside is exposed. It looks a bit like a small ear of corn. In this video I also recorded the underground tuber and the way the plant’s sex expression changes with its growth.", "花序、果序、块茎，是不同时候能看到的线索。它有毒，不能因为外形像芋头，就把它当成食物。这次先记下这把特别的“伞”。": "The inflorescence, fruit cluster and tuber each offer clues that can be seen at different times. This plant is poisonous. Its resemblance to taro doesn’t make it food. For now, I wanted to remember this remarkable “umbrella”."}, "20260330-01": {"弯曲的花柱顶端": "The curved tip of the style", "从正面看小花结构": "A flower seen from the front", "手边对照观察小花": "A hand beside the little flowers for scale", "柔软下垂的嫩叶": "Soft, drooping young leaves", "枝头密集的金黄色花序": "Dense golden flower clusters at the tip of a branch", "伸出花外的细长雄蕊": "Long stamens projecting beyond the flower", "逆光下的嫩叶与老叶": "Young and mature leaves against the light", "花序与周围的绿叶": "A flower cluster surrounded by green leaves", "从下方向上看花序": "Looking up into the flower cluster", "一朵花的萼片与花蕊": "Sepals and stamens of a single flower", "花蕊与萼片的侧面": "The stamens and sepals in profile", "花药近看": "Anthers in close-up", "黄灿灿的花序像一团火，嫩叶却柔软地垂着。来到中国无忧花树下，先看看那些细细长长的花蕊。": "Golden clusters look like flames, but the young leaves hang soft and limp. Under this Saraca tree, I start with the long, slender stamens.", "来到一树金黄下面": "Under a canopy of gold", "无忧花，多好的名字。眼前这一树黄灿灿的花，像一簇簇小火焰，也难怪有人叫它火焰花。\n关于“无忧”，有许多传说。我更想做的是在树下坐一坐，看看这些花，也看看花旁边的叶子。": "Wúyōuhuā means “flower without worries.” What a lovely name. The golden clusters in front of me look like little flames; I can see why people call it the flame flower, too.\nThere are plenty of legends about that promise of freedom from worry. For now, I would rather sit under the tree and look at the flowers and the leaves beside them.", "无忧花，多好的名字。眼前这一树黄灿灿的花，像一簇簇小火焰，也难怪有人叫它火焰花。": "Wúyōuhuā means “flower without worries.” What a lovely name. The golden clusters in front of me look like little flames; I can see why people call it the flame flower, too.", "关于“无忧”，有许多传说。我更想做的是在树下坐一坐，看看这些花，也看看花旁边的叶子。": "There are plenty of legends about that promise of freedom from worry. For now, I would rather sit under the tree and look at the flowers and the leaves beside them.", "黄色的部分，不是花瓣": "What's yellow here?", "凑近才发现，中国无忧花没有真正的花瓣。显眼的萼片展开来，细细长长的花蕊从中间伸出去，逆着光看特别有趣。\n用手比一比，才能感觉到一朵小花的大小。花蕊间还能找到弯弯的花柱，像一只小海马，又像一个音乐符号。": "Close up, I can see that this tree has no true petals. The showy parts that spread open are sepals. Long, fine stamens project from the centre; they're especially striking against the light.\nHolding up my hand gives me a sense of how small each flower is. Among the stamens I can pick out a curved style. It looks a little like a seahorse, or a musical note.", "凑近才发现，中国无忧花没有真正的花瓣。显眼的萼片展开来，细细长长的花蕊从中间伸出去，逆着光看特别有趣。": "Close up, I can see that this tree has no true petals. The showy parts that spread open are sepals. Long, fine stamens project from the centre; they're especially striking against the light.", "用手比一比，才能感觉到一朵小花的大小。花蕊间还能找到弯弯的花柱，像一只小海马，又像一个音乐符号。": "Holding up my hand gives me a sense of how small each flower is. Among the stamens I can pick out a curved style. It looks a little like a seahorse, or a musical note.", "再往细处看一点": "Closer still", "我在这里看了很久：有的花柱还是弯着的，有的已经伸展。不同状态挤在一簇花序里，像在跟人打招呼。\n镜头放得更近，花药和上面的花粉也显出来了。原来远远的一团金黄，里面藏着这么多细节。": "I spend a long time here. Some styles are still curled; others have straightened out. They crowd together in the same cluster as if they're waving hello.\nThrough the lens I can even make out the anthers and their pollen. From a distance all that detail looked like a single patch of gold.", "我在这里看了很久：有的花柱还是弯着的，有的已经伸展。不同状态挤在一簇花序里，像在跟人打招呼。": "I spend a long time here. Some styles are still curled; others have straightened out. They crowd together in the same cluster as if they're waving hello.", "镜头放得更近，花药和上面的花粉也显出来了。原来远远的一团金黄，里面藏着这么多细节。": "Through the lens I can even make out the anthers and their pollen. From a distance all that detail looked like a single patch of gold.", "它的嫩叶，像一条领带": "A necktie in the branches", "花之外，柔软下垂的嫩叶也让我停了下来。有人觉得像袈裟，我倒觉得有点像一条安静的领带。\n嫩叶带着红褐色，长大后慢慢变绿。它虽然叫中国无忧花，并不只分布在中国。此刻植物园里开得正好，就借这个名字送一句祝福：无忧花开，愿你无忧。": "The young leaves make me stop, too. They hang so softly. Some people compare them to a monk's robe; to me they look like a necktie hanging quietly from the branch.\nThe leaves start out reddish brown and gradually turn green. The Chinese name includes the word “China,” though the species grows beyond China as well. With the tree in full bloom here in the botanical garden, I'll borrow its name to wish you a little freedom from worry.", "花之外，柔软下垂的嫩叶也让我停了下来。有人觉得像袈裟，我倒觉得有点像一条安静的领带。": "The young leaves make me stop, too. They hang so softly. Some people compare them to a monk's robe; to me they look like a necktie hanging quietly from the branch.", "嫩叶带着红褐色，长大后慢慢变绿。它虽然叫中国无忧花，并不只分布在中国。此刻植物园里开得正好，就借这个名字送一句祝福：无忧花开，愿你无忧。": "The leaves start out reddish brown and gradually turn green. The Chinese name includes the word “China,” though the species grows beyond China as well. With the tree in full bloom here in the botanical garden, I'll borrow its name to wish you a little freedom from worry.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250811-01": {"花序与浓密枝叶": "Flower clusters among dense foliage", "枝头的小花与花苞": "Flowers and buds at the branch tip", "白色花瓣和花蕊近看": "White petals and stamens in close-up", "还没走近，先闻到了花香。九里香把一团团白花开在绿篱上，名字里的“九里”让我忍不住算了一下。": "I smell the flowers before I reach the hedge. White clusters cover the branches, and the “nine li” in the plant's Chinese name has me doing a little arithmetic.", "真的能香到九里之外吗？": "Can its scent really travel nine li?", "隔着几米，我就闻到了九里香。名字确实很形象，不过九里换算下来有四点五公里，想想还是有点夸张。\n七里香、十里香、千里香……这些带着香气的称呼，倒是把第一印象说得很清楚：它真的很香。": "I could smell jiǔlǐxiāng from several metres away. Its name means “fragrant for nine li.” That's four and a half kilometres, which seems a little ambitious.\nSeven li, ten li, even a thousand li: several of its other Chinese names make the same point. This is a fragrant plant.", "隔着几米，我就闻到了九里香。名字确实很形象，不过九里换算下来有四点五公里，想想还是有点夸张。": "I could smell jiǔlǐxiāng from several metres away. Its name means “fragrant for nine li.” That's four and a half kilometres, which seems a little ambitious.", "七里香、十里香、千里香……这些带着香气的称呼，倒是把第一印象说得很清楚：它真的很香。": "Seven li, ten li, even a thousand li: several of its other Chinese names make the same point. This is a fragrant plant.", "一团团白花，风里轻轻摇": "White flowers in the breeze", "细看小花，五片白色花瓣微微向后翻，花蕊围在中间。许多花和花苞聚在枝头，一阵风过去，就像白色的小花球在摇。\n平时常见的是矮矮的绿篱，这次也看到长得很高的一株。原来同一个名字，能有这么不同的身形。": "Each little flower has five white petals that curl back slightly around the stamens. Flowers and buds gather at the tips of the branches; in a breeze they sway like little white balls.\nI'm used to seeing this plant as a low hedge. This time I also saw a tall specimen. I hadn't expected the same species to take such different shapes.", "细看小花，五片白色花瓣微微向后翻，花蕊围在中间。许多花和花苞聚在枝头，一阵风过去，就像白色的小花球在摇。": "Each little flower has five white petals that curl back slightly around the stamens. Flowers and buds gather at the tips of the branches; in a breeze they sway like little white balls.", "平时常见的是矮矮的绿篱，这次也看到长得很高的一株。原来同一个名字，能有这么不同的身形。": "I'm used to seeing this plant as a low hedge. This time I also saw a tall specimen. I hadn't expected the same species to take such different shapes.", "花香之外，还有一片绿": "The scent in the leaves", "九里香和橘子、柚子、柠檬同属芸香科。揉一揉叶片，也能闻到让人联想到柑橘的气味。\n它的枝叶浓密、四季常绿，所以常出现在庭院、绿篱和盆景里。这一段绿篱正开满白花，走到旁边，就像走进了花香里。": "This shrub belongs to the citrus family, along with oranges, pomelos and lemons. Rub a leaf and there's a scent that brings citrus to mind, too.\nIts dense, evergreen branches are a familiar sight in courtyards, hedges and bonsai. This particular hedge is covered in white flowers. Walking alongside it feels like walking into the fragrance itself.", "九里香和橘子、柚子、柠檬同属芸香科。揉一揉叶片，也能闻到让人联想到柑橘的气味。": "This shrub belongs to the citrus family, along with oranges, pomelos and lemons. Rub a leaf and there's a scent that brings citrus to mind, too.", "它的枝叶浓密、四季常绿，所以常出现在庭院、绿篱和盆景里。这一段绿篱正开满白花，走到旁边，就像走进了花香里。": "Its dense, evergreen branches are a familiar sight in courtyards, hedges and bonsai. This particular hedge is covered in white flowers. Walking alongside it feels like walking into the fragrance itself.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "Murraya exotica存在异名同名匹配歧义；按文稿及POWO的Murraya exotica L.记录，接受名为Murraya paniculata，保留原名。": "Murraya exotica can point to different name records. The manuscript and the POWO record for Murraya exotica L. identify the accepted name as Murraya paniculata. The name used in the manuscript has been retained."}, "20251017-01": {"绿色种子表面的浅色斑点": "Pale spots on the surfaces of the green seeds", "种子排列在短轴上": "Seeds arranged along a short axis", "剥开后观察种子外层与内部": "The covering peeled back to show the seed's interior", "藤上成串着生的种子": "Seeds growing in strings on the vine", "藤上挂着一窝窝绿色“果子”，仔细一看，它们其实是种子。买麻藤的名字，又把话题带到了纤维。": "Clusters of green “fruit” hang from this vine. Look closely: they're seeds. The Chinese name of the vine leads me to another part of its story, its fibres.", "一窝窝的绿色小东西": "Green things in bunches", "买麻藤的藤上挂了好多串绿色的小东西，远远看去很像果子。走近以后，表面那些浅色斑点也清楚了。\n不过，从分类上说，买麻藤是裸子植物，眼前这些应当叫种子。这个叫法的变化，也提醒我再仔细看看它的结构。": "There are strings of little green things all over this vine. From a distance they look very much like fruit; up close I can see the pale spots on their surface.\nGnetum is a gymnosperm, so what I'm looking at should be called seeds. Changing that one word prompts me to take a closer look at their structure.", "买麻藤的藤上挂了好多串绿色的小东西，远远看去很像果子。走近以后，表面那些浅色斑点也清楚了。": "There are strings of little green things all over this vine. From a distance they look very much like fruit; up close I can see the pale spots on their surface.", "不过，从分类上说，买麻藤是裸子植物，眼前这些应当叫种子。这个叫法的变化，也提醒我再仔细看看它的结构。": "Gnetum is a gymnosperm, so what I'm looking at should be called seeds. Changing that one word prompts me to take a closer look at their structure.", "外面一层，里面又是一层": "Layer after layer", "把种子拿近看，外面有包被的层次，剥开后内部的样子又不同。这次也聊到了买麻藤属植物的食用和纤维利用。\n这次我更想记住的，是那些看着像果实的种子，以及它作为藤本裸子植物的特别之处。叶子宽大、对生，看外形时还真容易想到别的藤本。": "Held close, a seed shows several layers of covering. Peel them back and the inside looks different again. This time I also talked about the uses of Gnetum plants for food and fibre.\nWhat I'll remember is the sight of those fruit-like seeds on a climbing gymnosperm. The broad, opposite leaves could easily put me in mind of quite a different kind of vine.", "把种子拿近看，外面有包被的层次，剥开后内部的样子又不同。这次也聊到了买麻藤属植物的食用和纤维利用。": "Held close, a seed shows several layers of covering. Peel them back and the inside looks different again. This time I also talked about the uses of Gnetum plants for food and fibre.", "这次我更想记住的，是那些看着像果实的种子，以及它作为藤本裸子植物的特别之处。叶子宽大、对生，看外形时还真容易想到别的藤本。": "What I'll remember is the sight of those fruit-like seeds on a climbing gymnosperm. The broad, opposite leaves could easily put me in mind of quite a different kind of vine.", "名字里，为什么有个“麻”？": "Where does the fibre come in?", "我也困惑过，“买麻藤”到底该怎么理解。查到的旧记载把名字和它的纤维联系在一起：茎皮坚韧，能用来制作绳索等物件。\n顺着一串种子认到一条藤，再从名字认到一种材料。植物的名字，有时候也留着人们怎样使用它的线索。": "I used to puzzle over the Chinese name, mǎimáténg, particularly the character má, with its associations of fibre. Older accounts link the name to the tough bark of the stems, which can be made into rope and other articles.\nA string of seeds led me to a vine, and its name led me to a material. Sometimes a plant name holds a clue to what people once did with it.", "我也困惑过，“买麻藤”到底该怎么理解。查到的旧记载把名字和它的纤维联系在一起：茎皮坚韧，能用来制作绳索等物件。": "I used to puzzle over the Chinese name, mǎimáténg, particularly the character má, with its associations of fibre. Older accounts link the name to the tough bark of the stems, which can be made into rope and other articles.", "顺着一串种子认到一条藤，再从名字认到一种材料。植物的名字，有时候也留着人们怎样使用它的线索。": "A string of seeds led me to a vine, and its name led me to a material. Sometimes a plant name holds a clue to what people once did with it.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20250929-01": {"枝条两侧纤细的针叶": "Fine needles on either side of a branch", "一束束柔软下垂的松针": "Soft pine needles hanging in bundles", "小片松林里层层下垂的针叶": "Layers of drooping needles in a small pine grove", "在昆明植物园，遇见一小片柔软下垂的松针。五针白皮松的名字，把叶子和树皮都写了进去。": "At Kunming Botanical Garden I found a small stand of pines with soft, drooping needles. The Chinese name of this pine describes both its leaves and its bark.", "一树温柔的松针": "A pine with a gentle outline", "我是在昆明植物园见到五针白皮松的。这里种了一小片，远远看过去，先吸引我的就是那些垂下来的叶子。\n针叶纤细柔软，像热得快要化了一样，跟平时印象里挺拔硬朗的松树很不一样。站在这片小林子里，我忍不住多看了一会儿。": "I met this five-needle pine at Kunming Botanical Garden, where a small group of them grow together. Even from a distance it was the hanging leaves that caught my eye first.\nThe needles are fine and soft, as though they were beginning to melt in the heat. It's a departure from the stiff, upright pines I usually picture. I stayed in that little grove for quite a while.", "我是在昆明植物园见到五针白皮松的。这里种了一小片，远远看过去，先吸引我的就是那些垂下来的叶子。": "I met this five-needle pine at Kunming Botanical Garden, where a small group of them grow together. Even from a distance it was the hanging leaves that caught my eye first.", "针叶纤细柔软，像热得快要化了一样，跟平时印象里挺拔硬朗的松树很不一样。站在这片小林子里，我忍不住多看了一会儿。": "The needles are fine and soft, as though they were beginning to melt in the heat. It's a departure from the stiff, upright pines I usually picture. I stayed in that little grove for quite a while.", "五针，是怎样的五针？": "Counting the needles", "它也叫巧家五针松。名字里的“五针”，指的是针叶通常五针一束，这次观察也看到了少数四针成束的情况。\n顺着枝条数一数，再看看细长的针叶怎样垂下来，名字就有了具体的样子。我最喜欢的，还是它这一树轻轻软软的姿态。": "One of its Chinese names means “Qiaojia five-needle pine.” The needles generally grow five to a bundle, though I also saw a few bundles of four.\nCount along a twig, then trace the long, thin needles as they droop, and the name takes shape. What I like best is still that light, soft outline of the whole tree.", "它也叫巧家五针松。名字里的“五针”，指的是针叶通常五针一束，这次观察也看到了少数四针成束的情况。": "One of its Chinese names means “Qiaojia five-needle pine.” The needles generally grow five to a bundle, though I also saw a few bundles of four.", "顺着枝条数一数，再看看细长的针叶怎样垂下来，名字就有了具体的样子。我最喜欢的，还是它这一树轻轻软软的姿态。": "Count along a twig, then trace the long, thin needles as they droop, and the name takes shape. What I like best is still that light, soft outline of the whole tree.", "树皮和松果，也记下来": "Bark and cone", "走到树下，我又看了看开裂剥落的树皮。叶子像五针松，树皮又有白皮松的特点，“五针白皮松”这个名字就把两个线索放在一起了。\n这次还捡到了一枚已经没有种子的球果。照片先留下这片松林和针叶，树皮、球果的细节，就留作下一次继续观察的约定。": "Under the trees I looked at the bark, cracking and peeling away. The foliage resembles a five-needle pine; the bark has something of the white-barked pines about it. Its Chinese name puts those two clues together.\nI also picked up a cone that had already shed its seeds. For now the photographs record the stand and its needles. I'll come back to the details of the bark and cones another time.", "走到树下，我又看了看开裂剥落的树皮。叶子像五针松，树皮又有白皮松的特点，“五针白皮松”这个名字就把两个线索放在一起了。": "Under the trees I looked at the bark, cracking and peeling away. The foliage resembles a five-needle pine; the bark has something of the white-barked pines about it. Its Chinese name puts those two clues together.", "这次还捡到了一枚已经没有种子的球果。照片先留下这片松林和针叶，树皮、球果的细节，就留作下一次继续观察的约定。": "I also picked up a cone that had already shed its seeds. For now the photographs record the stand and its needles. I'll come back to the details of the bark and cones another time.", "视频以梧桐作树皮外观比较。": "The video compares the bark with that of Firmiana simplex.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260717-01": {"膨大的茎基部": "The swollen base of the stem", "枝头的红色小花": "Little red flowers at a branch tip", "几株并排生长，茎基的形态各不相同。": "Several plants growing side by side, each with a differently shaped stem base.", "一簇橙红色花从叶丛上方伸出。": "An orange-red flower cluster rising above the leaves.", "佛肚树 · 本期封面": "Jatropha podagrica, cover photograph", "植株下部膨起的茎呈瓶状。": "The swollen lower stem has the shape of a bottle.", "绿色果实与干果": "Green fruits alongside dried fruits", "树干上的叶痕": "Leaf scars on the trunk", "近看橙红花序中央展开的小花。": "An open flower in the middle of the orange-red cluster.", "红色花序梗与幼果": "A red inflorescence stalk and young fruits", "花梗上的红色花蕾还未完全开放。": "Red buds on the flower stalk, not yet fully open.", "绿色果实": "Green fruits", "植株顶端的叶柄与枝条": "Leaf stalks and branches at the top of the plant", "花与绿色幼果": "Flowers and young green fruits", "宽大的浅裂叶": "A broad leaf with shallow lobes", "分枝与膨大的树干": "Branches and a swollen trunk", "叶片背面的叶柄连接处": "Where the stalk meets the underside of the leaf", "枝头同时可见绿果与颜色较深、已经开裂的果实。": "Green fruits and darker, split fruits on the same branch.", "叶柄着生处，浅色叶脉向四周辐射。": "Pale veins radiate from the attachment of the leaf stalk.", "从上方看宽大的裂叶，有几片叶缘泛黄。": "Broad lobed leaves from above, some yellowing at the margins.", "在佛肚树的花枝旁观察和拍摄。": "Observing and photographing a flowering branch.", "从上方看花序": "The inflorescence from above", "干燥开裂的果实": "A dry fruit that has split open", "鼓鼓的树干、盾牌一样的叶子，再加上一簇红珊瑚。佛肚树把几个有趣的形状放在了一起。": "A swollen trunk, leaves like shields and a spray of red coral: this little tree brings some wonderful shapes together.", "先看这个鼓鼓的肚子": "A look at the belly", "佛肚树的名字，几乎不用解释。看着那段上细下粗、鼓鼓的树干，就像给自己准备了一只水壶。\n膨大的茎基部能够储水。走近树干，还能看到一圈圈叶子脱落后留下的痕迹。光看这一段，就已经很有意思了。": "The Chinese name, “Buddha's belly tree,” hardly needs explaining. The trunk is narrow at the top and fat at the bottom. It looks as though the tree had brought its own water bottle.\nThe swollen base of the stem can indeed store water. Close up, I can see rings where leaves have fallen away. There's plenty to look at before my eyes even reach the branches.", "佛肚树的名字，几乎不用解释。看着那段上细下粗、鼓鼓的树干，就像给自己准备了一只水壶。": "The Chinese name, “Buddha's belly tree,” hardly needs explaining. The trunk is narrow at the top and fat at the bottom. It looks as though the tree had brought its own water bottle.", "膨大的茎基部能够储水。走近树干，还能看到一圈圈叶子脱落后留下的痕迹。光看这一段，就已经很有意思了。": "The swollen base of the stem can indeed store water. Close up, I can see rings where leaves have fallen away. There's plenty to look at before my eyes even reach the branches.", "叶柄藏在盾牌背后": "Behind the shield", "往上看，叶片又是另一种模样：宽宽圆圆，边缘有浅浅的裂口，像一面绿色的小盾牌。\n翻到背面，叶柄连接的位置并不在叶片边缘。顺着叶脉看过去，就能发现这面“盾牌”是怎样举起来的。": "Higher up, the leaves tell another story. Broad and round, with shallow notches along their edges, each looks like a little green shield.\nTurn one over and you can see that the stalk joins the blade inside its edge. Follow the veins and it becomes clear how the plant holds up its “shield.”", "往上看，叶片又是另一种模样：宽宽圆圆，边缘有浅浅的裂口，像一面绿色的小盾牌。": "Higher up, the leaves tell another story. Broad and round, with shallow notches along their edges, each looks like a little green shield.", "翻到背面，叶柄连接的位置并不在叶片边缘。顺着叶脉看过去，就能发现这面“盾牌”是怎样举起来的。": "Turn one over and you can see that the stalk joins the blade inside its edge. Follow the veins and it becomes clear how the plant holds up its “shield.”", "枝头长出一簇红珊瑚": "A spray of red coral", "在深圳看佛肚树，经常能遇见它开花。鲜红的花序向四周伸开，小花开在枝梗顶端，很像一簇珊瑚。“玉树珊瑚”这个别名，就容易记住了。\n有时候花和绿色的小果实挤在一起，红红绿绿的，值得多看几个角度。": "In Shenzhen I often find this tree in flower. The bright red flower clusters branch out in all directions, with tiny flowers at their tips. They look so much like coral that its other Chinese name, “jade-tree coral,” is easy to remember.\nSometimes flowers and little green fruits share a cluster. With all that red and green, it's worth looking from more than one angle.", "在深圳看佛肚树，经常能遇见它开花。鲜红的花序向四周伸开，小花开在枝梗顶端，很像一簇珊瑚。“玉树珊瑚”这个别名，就容易记住了。": "In Shenzhen I often find this tree in flower. The bright red flower clusters branch out in all directions, with tiny flowers at their tips. They look so much like coral that its other Chinese name, “jade-tree coral,” is easy to remember.", "有时候花和绿色的小果实挤在一起，红红绿绿的，值得多看几个角度。": "Sometimes flowers and little green fruits share a cluster. With all that red and green, it's worth looking from more than one angle.", "果实成熟以后": "When the fruit ripens", "绿色果实渐渐变褐，干燥后会开裂，把种子释放出去。这次既看到了还青着的果实，也找到了已经裂开的果壳。\n佛肚树属于大戟科，折伤后会流出乳汁。观察时不必折枝，也不要尝它的任何部分；把这些形状好好记下来，就已经很丰富了。": "The green fruits gradually turn brown. Once dry, they split and release the seeds. This time I saw both the unripe fruit and the empty, split shells.\nThis tree is in the spurge family and releases a milky sap when damaged. There's no need to break a branch to look at it, and no part should be tasted. There is quite enough to discover in the shapes alone.", "绿色果实渐渐变褐，干燥后会开裂，把种子释放出去。这次既看到了还青着的果实，也找到了已经裂开的果壳。": "The green fruits gradually turn brown. Once dry, they split and release the seeds. This time I saw both the unripe fruit and the empty, split shells.", "佛肚树属于大戟科，折伤后会流出乳汁。观察时不必折枝，也不要尝它的任何部分；把这些形状好好记下来，就已经很丰富了。": "This tree is in the spurge family and releases a milky sap when damaged. There's no need to break a branch to look at it, and no part should be tasted. There is quite enough to discover in the shapes alone.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250630-01": {"尚未成熟的黄色果实": "A yellow fruit still ripening", "粉色小花与反卷的萼片": "Little pink flowers with reflexed sepals", "由绿转橙的果实": "Fruits changing from green to orange", "逆光下打开的红色果壳": "Light shining through an open red fruit wall", "打开的蓇葖果与黑色种子": "An open follicle with black seeds", "单个打开的果实": "A single open fruit", "仰望枝头红果": "Looking up at red fruits in the crown", "红色果壳内的种子": "Seeds inside the red fruit wall", "红色果实与绿叶": "Red fruits and green leaves", "树上那些红色“小海星”，竟然不是花。沿着一枚打开的果实，找到假苹婆真正的小花。": "Those little red starfish in the tree aren't flowers after all. An open fruit sends me looking for this tree's real flowers, which are tiny.", "树上怎么挂着小海星？": "Starfish in the branches", "第一次注意到假苹婆，就是被这些红彤彤的“小海星”吸引了。它们挂在枝头，颜色鲜亮，远远看过去还真像花。\n走近才发现，红色部分其实是打开的果实。有的一组展开五瓣，有的少一些，每一枚都有自己的姿态。": "It was those bright red “starfish” that first drew my eye to this tree. They hang from the ends of the branches and from a distance could easily pass for flowers.\nUp close, the red parts turn out to be open fruits. Some groups spread into five arms, others have fewer. No two seem to sit quite the same way.", "第一次注意到假苹婆，就是被这些红彤彤的“小海星”吸引了。它们挂在枝头，颜色鲜亮，远远看过去还真像花。": "It was those bright red “starfish” that first drew my eye to this tree. They hang from the ends of the branches and from a distance could easily pass for flowers.", "走近才发现，红色部分其实是打开的果实。有的一组展开五瓣，有的少一些，每一枚都有自己的姿态。": "Up close, the red parts turn out to be open fruits. Some groups spread into five arms, others have fewer. No two seem to sit quite the same way.", "红壳里面，藏着黑亮的种子": "Glossy black seeds in a red shell", "沿着果实裂开的缝隙看，里面排着几颗黑亮的种子。红色果壳衬着黑色种子，对比特别醒目。\n还没有打开的果实，表面有细毛，尖端微微翘起。它们从绿色、黄色一路变红，直到把里面的种子露出来。": "Look along the split in a fruit and you can see a row of glossy black seeds. Against the red shell they really stand out.\nThe unopened fruits have fine hairs on the surface and tips that turn up slightly. They go from green to yellow to red before they open to reveal the seeds.", "沿着果实裂开的缝隙看，里面排着几颗黑亮的种子。红色果壳衬着黑色种子，对比特别醒目。": "Look along the split in a fruit and you can see a row of glossy black seeds. Against the red shell they really stand out.", "还没有打开的果实，表面有细毛，尖端微微翘起。它们从绿色、黄色一路变红，直到把里面的种子露出来。": "The unopened fruits have fine hairs on the surface and tips that turn up slightly. They go from green to yellow to red before they open to reveal the seeds.", "真正的花，反而小小的": "The flowers are much smaller", "看完果实，再来找花。假苹婆的花很小，淡淡的粉色，五片萼片向后反卷，看着轻巧。\n这些像花瓣的部分实际是花萼，它没有真正的花瓣。认清红色果实之后，再记住这朵小花，就不会把两者弄混了。": "Having looked at the fruits, I go back in search of the flowers. They are tiny and pale pink. Five sepals curl back to give each flower a delicate outline.\nThose petal-like parts are the calyx; this tree has no true petals. Remember this little flower alongside the showy red fruit and the two are easy to tell apart.", "看完果实，再来找花。假苹婆的花很小，淡淡的粉色，五片萼片向后反卷，看着轻巧。": "Having looked at the fruits, I go back in search of the flowers. They are tiny and pale pink. Five sepals curl back to give each flower a delicate outline.", "这些像花瓣的部分实际是花萼，它没有真正的花瓣。认清红色果实之后，再记住这朵小花，就不会把两者弄混了。": "Those petal-like parts are the calyx; this tree has no true petals. Remember this little flower alongside the showy red fruit and the two are easy to tell apart.", "从一颗青果，看到满树红色": "From a green fruit to a tree full of red", "这次在树上看到了几个不同阶段的果实：有的还青着，有的转黄，有的已经张开了。把它们放在一起，变化就很清楚。\n平时经过这样的树，也许只会记得那一树红色。下次再经过，我想先找找新开的花，再看看果实走到了哪一步。": "There were fruits at several stages on the same tree: some still green, some turning yellow, others open. Side by side, they made the progression easy to follow.\nPassing a tree like this, I might once have remembered only the sweep of red. Next time I'll look for newly opened flowers first, then see how far the fruits have come.", "这次在树上看到了几个不同阶段的果实：有的还青着，有的转黄，有的已经张开了。把它们放在一起，变化就很清楚。": "There were fruits at several stages on the same tree: some still green, some turning yellow, others open. Side by side, they made the progression easy to follow.", "平时经过这样的树，也许只会记得那一树红色。下次再经过，我想先找找新开的花，再看看果实走到了哪一步。": "Passing a tree like this, I might once have remembered only the sweep of red. Next time I'll look for newly opened flowers first, then see how far the fruits have come.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250822-01": {"两朵蓝紫色花": "Two blue-violet flowers", "林缘成片的假酸浆与其它植被混生。": "Nicandra grows among other vegetation at the woodland edge.", "正面与侧面的花": "Flowers seen from the front and the side", "果萼表面的网状脉纹": "A network of veins on the calyx enclosing the fruit", "打开的果实里紧挨着许多棕黄色的小种子。": "Many small yellow-brown seeds packed together inside the opened fruit.", "手指拨开花萼，露出其中的绿色果实。": "Fingers part the calyx to reveal the green fruit within.", "结果的枝条": "A fruiting branch", "假酸浆的叶、花和果实手绘": "Sketch of the leaves, flowers and fruits of Nicandra", "枝端叶片与花": "Leaves and a flower near the branch tip", "花冠和花萼侧面": "The corolla and calyx in profile", "从侧面看生长的植株，枝叶间开有浅色花。": "The plant seen from the side, with pale flowers among the leaves.", "枝头垂着一枚枚包在膨大花萼里的果实。": "Fruits hang from branch tips, each enclosed in an enlarged calyx.", "渐渐变黄的果萼": "The calyx around a fruit beginning to turn yellow", "容器中收集的小种子，可以用指尖作比较。": "Collected seeds in a container, with a fingertip for scale.", "叶片与果萼": "A leaf and a fruiting calyx", "枝条上的多个果萼": "Several fruiting calyces on a branch", "边缘带齿的绿叶在植株上相互交叠。": "Overlapping green leaves with toothed edges.", "包围果实的绿色宿存萼": "A green persistent calyx enclosing the fruit", "茎的分枝处与周围的大叶片。": "The branching point of the stem and the broad leaves around it.", "弯腰在高大的假酸浆植株间观察。": "Bending down among the tall Nicandra plants for a closer look.", "带花与果的枝条": "A branch in flower and fruit", "正面观察花冠与深色纹路": "The corolla and its dark markings seen from the front", "蓝紫色小花和纸灯笼一样的果萼，原来与记忆里的冰粉有关。先从一朵假酸浆的花认起。": "Little blue-violet flowers and a fruit wrapped in a paper lantern led me back to a dessert I remember. I started with a single flower.", "一朵蓝紫色的小铃铛": "A little blue-violet bell", "这株假酸浆长得比我想象中高。枝叶之间，蓝紫色的小花像铃铛一样打开，花心附近还有几道深色的纹路。\n从正面看完，再换到侧面，托着花冠的绿色花萼也很清楚。认植物的时候，这样前后看一眼，常常会发现新的线索。": "This Nicandra grew taller than I'd expected. Between the leaves, blue-violet flowers open like little bells, with several darker marks toward the centre.\nAfter looking straight into a flower, I turn to the side. Now I can see the green calyx holding up the corolla. Looking from more than one angle so often gives me a fresh clue.", "这株假酸浆长得比我想象中高。枝叶之间，蓝紫色的小花像铃铛一样打开，花心附近还有几道深色的纹路。": "This Nicandra grew taller than I'd expected. Between the leaves, blue-violet flowers open like little bells, with several darker marks toward the centre.", "从正面看完，再换到侧面，托着花冠的绿色花萼也很清楚。认植物的时候，这样前后看一眼，常常会发现新的线索。": "After looking straight into a flower, I turn to the side. Now I can see the green calyx holding up the corolla. Looking from more than one angle so often gives me a fresh clue.", "花落了，灯笼还留着": "The flower fades; the lantern stays", "花谢以后，花萼没有跟着掉落，而是继续包在果实外面，变成一个小灯笼。这层宿存萼表面，细细的网状脉纹特别好看。\n逆着光看，轮廓和纹路都透了出来。里面才是圆圆的浆果，再往里面，是许多细小的种子。": "After the flower fades, the calyx stays on, enclosing the fruit like a little lantern. Its surface is traced with a particularly lovely network of fine veins.\nHeld up to the light, both the outline and the veins show through. Inside the lantern is a round berry, and inside the berry are many tiny seeds.", "花谢以后，花萼没有跟着掉落，而是继续包在果实外面，变成一个小灯笼。这层宿存萼表面，细细的网状脉纹特别好看。": "After the flower fades, the calyx stays on, enclosing the fruit like a little lantern. Its surface is traced with a particularly lovely network of fine veins.", "逆着光看，轮廓和纹路都透了出来。里面才是圆圆的浆果，再往里面，是许多细小的种子。": "Held up to the light, both the outline and the veins show through. Inside the lantern is a round berry, and inside the berry are many tiny seeds.", "原来，它与冰粉有关": "The link to bīngfěn", "说到种子，就想起了冰粉。假酸浆种子外层的物质可以用来制作冰粉，看着液体慢慢凝起来，是很有意思的过程。\n不过，在野外认识一株植物，和判断哪些材料可以食用，是两回事。不能把眼前的生果当成零食，也不要因为长着“灯笼”，就认成别的可食植物。": "Those seeds remind me of bīngfěn, a jelly dessert. Material on the outside of the seeds is used in making it. Watching the liquid slowly set is rather fascinating.\nRecognising a plant in the wild doesn't establish which of its parts are edible. The raw fruit here isn't a snack; a lantern-shaped calyx alone doesn't identify another plant as edible, either.", "说到种子，就想起了冰粉。假酸浆种子外层的物质可以用来制作冰粉，看着液体慢慢凝起来，是很有意思的过程。": "Those seeds remind me of bīngfěn, a jelly dessert. Material on the outside of the seeds is used in making it. Watching the liquid slowly set is rather fascinating.", "不过，在野外认识一株植物，和判断哪些材料可以食用，是两回事。不能把眼前的生果当成零食，也不要因为长着“灯笼”，就认成别的可食植物。": "Recognising a plant in the wild doesn't establish which of its parts are edible. The raw fruit here isn't a snack; a lantern-shaped calyx alone doesn't identify another plant as edible, either.", "把整株的样子也记住": "Remembering the whole plant", "只记花和果还不够。假酸浆的叶子较宽，叶缘带着不整齐的齿，花果沿着枝条分布。退后一点，整株的轮廓也就连起来了。\n从一朵花，看到一个灯笼，再想到一碗冰粉。这一次的观察，就这样和生活里的记忆接上了。": "Flowers and fruits are only part of the picture. The leaves are broad, with irregular teeth along the margins; the flowers and fruits are spaced along the branches. Step back a little and the whole outline comes together.\nFrom a flower to a lantern to a bowl of bīngfěn: this observation found its way back to something I remembered from everyday life.", "只记花和果还不够。假酸浆的叶子较宽，叶缘带着不整齐的齿，花果沿着枝条分布。退后一点，整株的轮廓也就连起来了。": "Flowers and fruits are only part of the picture. The leaves are broad, with irregular teeth along the margins; the flowers and fruits are spaced along the branches. Step back a little and the whole outline comes together.", "从一朵花，看到一个灯笼，再想到一碗冰粉。这一次的观察，就这样和生活里的记忆接上了。": "From a flower to a lantern to a bowl of bīngfěn: this observation found its way back to something I remembered from everyday life.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260630-01": {"叶面与叶缘的透明颗粒": "Transparent beads on the leaf surface and margin", "叶柄与茎部近看": "The leaf stalk and stem up close", "叶缘囊状细胞特写": "Bladder cells along the leaf edge in close-up", "茎叶连接处的透明囊状细胞": "Transparent bladder cells where stem and leaf meet", "肥厚弯曲的叶片": "A thick, curved leaf", "冰菜 · 本期封面": "Ice plant, cover photograph", "冰菜叶子上的“小水珠”，擦不掉也不会流下来。凑近看看，那是长在植物身上的透明小细胞。": "The “droplets” on an ice plant's leaves won't wipe off or run down. Look up close and you'll find transparent cells growing on the plant itself.", "从餐盘里，认到植物本身": "From the plate to the living plant", "第一次吃冰菜，印象是脆脆的，还带一点淡淡的咸味。后来看到活着的植株，才发现它比餐盘里的样子更有趣。\n叶片肥肥厚厚，茎叶表面像撒满碎冰。光从旁边照过来，每一颗都亮晶晶的。": "My first memory of eating ice plant is of its crunch and a slightly salty taste. When I saw the living plant, there was more to it than I'd seen on the plate.\nThe leaves are thick and fleshy. Stems and leaves look as though they've been dusted with crushed ice; in light from the side, each grain sparkles.", "第一次吃冰菜，印象是脆脆的，还带一点淡淡的咸味。后来看到活着的植株，才发现它比餐盘里的样子更有趣。": "My first memory of eating ice plant is of its crunch and a slightly salty taste. When I saw the living plant, there was more to it than I'd seen on the plate.", "叶片肥肥厚厚，茎叶表面像撒满碎冰。光从旁边照过来，每一颗都亮晶晶的。": "The leaves are thick and fleshy. Stems and leaves look as though they've been dusted with crushed ice; in light from the side, each grain sparkles.", "这些“小水珠”，不是水珠": "Droplets that stay put", "凑近看，透明的小颗粒并不会滚下来。它们是植物表面的囊状细胞，而不是清晨留下的露水。\n茎上、叶柄边、叶片表面都能找到。把镜头放近以后，这层看似随意的“碎冰”显得格外清楚。": "The little transparent beads don't roll away. They're bladder cells on the plant's surface, rather than drops of morning dew.\nI find them on the stems, along the leaf stalks and across the leaf blades. With the camera close, the layer of seemingly scattered “ice” comes into focus.", "凑近看，透明的小颗粒并不会滚下来。它们是植物表面的囊状细胞，而不是清晨留下的露水。": "The little transparent beads don't roll away. They're bladder cells on the plant's surface, rather than drops of morning dew.", "茎上、叶柄边、叶片表面都能找到。把镜头放近以后，这层看似随意的“碎冰”显得格外清楚。": "I find them on the stems, along the leaf stalks and across the leaf blades. With the camera close, the layer of seemingly scattered “ice” comes into focus.", "一片叶子，也有自己的储存办法": "How a leaf stores water and salt", "这些囊状细胞与植物储存水分和盐分有关。再看看厚厚的叶片，就能理解它为什么有这样一种特别的质感。\n冰菜也叫冰叶日中花。名字里的“冰”，来自眼前的模样；但要记住它，还是看看真实的叶片最直接。": "The bladder cells are involved in storing water and salts. Look at them alongside the thick leaves and that unusual texture begins to make sense.\nAnother Chinese name for ice plant is bīngyè rìzhōnghuā. The word bīng, “ice,” comes straight from what we can see. To remember the plant, though, I'd start by looking at an actual leaf.", "这些囊状细胞与植物储存水分和盐分有关。再看看厚厚的叶片，就能理解它为什么有这样一种特别的质感。": "The bladder cells are involved in storing water and salts. Look at them alongside the thick leaves and that unusual texture begins to make sense.", "冰菜也叫冰叶日中花。名字里的“冰”，来自眼前的模样；但要记住它，还是看看真实的叶片最直接。": "Another Chinese name for ice plant is bīngyè rìzhōnghuā. The word bīng, “ice,” comes straight from what we can see. To remember the plant, though, I'd start by looking at an actual leaf.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251230-01": {"枝头疏密相间的黄色花序": "Yellow flower heads, some clustered and others more widely spaced", "不同开放状态的花序": "Flower heads at different stages of opening", "绿叶的边缘有齿，顶部的叶片较小。": "Toothed green leaves; the ones near the top are smaller.", "黄色花丛间出现一个蓬松的白色果序。": "A fluffy white fruiting head among the yellow flowers.", "退后从小路边看见林缘的黄色花丛。": "The yellow flowers at the woodland edge, seen from the path.", "几枚并排的花序": "Several flower heads side by side", "近看果序，白色冠毛向四周展开。": "White pappus hairs spreading in all directions on the fruiting head.", "几枝黄花在绿色枝叶上方交错。": "Yellow flowering stems cross above the green foliage.", "蓝天下，细长花梗上的黄花朝不同方向展开。": "Yellow heads on fine stalks turn in different directions against the blue sky.", "细长枝条开满黄花，交织成一片。": "Slender flowering stems interweave in a patch of yellow.", "舌状花与中央管状花": "Ray florets around the central disc florets", "枝叶间有盛开的黄花，也有已转褐的头状花序。": "Open yellow flowers and browning heads among the leaves.", "冬天路边的一小片金黄，像许多盏小灯。先看千里光的花，再分清它和印象里的野菊花。": "A patch of winter gold at the roadside looks like a cluster of tiny lamps. Looking closely at its flowers helps me tell this Senecio from the wild chrysanthemums it first brings to mind.", "路边亮起一片小太阳": "Little suns along the road", "在路边遇到千里光的时候，最先看到的就是这一片金黄。小花序朝着不同方向开，像许多盏亮起来的小灯。\n名字叫“千里光”，确实很有画面感。不过不必走到千里之外，走进林边，低头看看，就可能遇见它。": "What I noticed first was the patch of gold. The little flower heads face in different directions like lamps shining along the road.\nIts Chinese name, qiānlǐguāng, evokes light reaching a thousand li. Luckily there's no need to travel that far. Looking down near the edge of a wood may be enough to find it.", "在路边遇到千里光的时候，最先看到的就是这一片金黄。小花序朝着不同方向开，像许多盏亮起来的小灯。": "What I noticed first was the patch of gold. The little flower heads face in different directions like lamps shining along the road.", "名字叫“千里光”，确实很有画面感。不过不必走到千里之外，走进林边，低头看看，就可能遇见它。": "Its Chinese name, qiānlǐguāng, evokes light reaching a thousand li. Luckily there's no need to travel that far. Looking down near the edge of a wood may be enough to find it.", "它不是随手叫出的野菊花": "A closer look at the flower heads", "黄色的小花，很容易被笼统地叫成野菊花。仔细看千里光，花序外围的舌状花比较疏，中央则挤着许多管状小花。\n认的时候还要看叶片和茎，不能只凭一团黄色下结论。把这些细节连起来，才是眼前这株植物的样子。": "It's easy to call any small yellow daisy a wild chrysanthemum. On this Senecio the ray florets are spaced fairly loosely around the rim. Many tiny tubular florets crowd together in the centre.\nI need to look at the leaves and stem, too. A patch of yellow alone isn't much to go on; it's the combination of details that gives this plant its character.", "黄色的小花，很容易被笼统地叫成野菊花。仔细看千里光，花序外围的舌状花比较疏，中央则挤着许多管状小花。": "It's easy to call any small yellow daisy a wild chrysanthemum. On this Senecio the ray florets are spaced fairly loosely around the rim. Many tiny tubular florets crowd together in the centre.", "认的时候还要看叶片和茎，不能只凭一团黄色下结论。把这些细节连起来，才是眼前这株植物的样子。": "I need to look at the leaves and stem, too. A patch of yellow alone isn't much to go on; it's the combination of details that gives this plant its character.", "花后，还会有另一副模样": "What comes after the flowers", "这次还记下了它花后带冠毛的小果实。现在看的是金色花序，过些时候再来，可能就换成轻轻散开的白色绒毛。\n关于它，有不少民间称呼和用法。这里先把看到的形态记清楚，不把这些说法当成自行食用或用药的依据。": "I also recorded the little fruits, each with a tuft of hairs. The heads are golden now. If I come back later, I may find white fluff beginning to drift apart.\nThere are many folk names and traditional uses for this plant. Here I want to record what I can see; those traditions aren't a guide to eating it or treating myself with it.", "这次还记下了它花后带冠毛的小果实。现在看的是金色花序，过些时候再来，可能就换成轻轻散开的白色绒毛。": "I also recorded the little fruits, each with a tuft of hairs. The heads are golden now. If I come back later, I may find white fluff beginning to drift apart.", "关于它，有不少民间称呼和用法。这里先把看到的形态记清楚，不把这些说法当成自行食用或用药的依据。": "There are many folk names and traditional uses for this plant. Here I want to record what I can see; those traditions aren't a guide to eating it or treating myself with it.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260724-01": {"茎上的节与对生叶": "Stem nodes and opposite leaves", "近看花冠": "The corolla in close-up", "像风铃一样垂下的小花，还有轻轻触碰后会运动的花柱。": "Little flowers hang like wind chimes. Touch a style gently, and it moves.", "它真的会“逗”人": "A flower with a sense of humour", "叉花草会“逗”人。轻轻碰一下它的花柱，噔！噔！噔！它居然会动。\n我身边这一丛分叉再分叉的，都是叉花草。第一眼看，花序乱得不得了，甚至有点想把它捋一捋。但停下来细细看，越看越有意思。": "This flower has a trick up its sleeve. Touch its style lightly and—boing, boing, boing! It actually moves.\nAll around me the stems branch and branch again. At first the flower clusters look such a tangle that I'm tempted to comb them out. But the longer I stop and look, the more interesting they become.", "叉花草会“逗”人。轻轻碰一下它的花柱，噔！噔！噔！它居然会动。": "This flower has a trick up its sleeve. Touch its style lightly and—boing, boing, boing! It actually moves.", "我身边这一丛分叉再分叉的，都是叉花草。第一眼看，花序乱得不得了，甚至有点想把它捋一捋。但停下来细细看，越看越有意思。": "All around me the stems branch and branch again. At first the flower clusters look such a tangle that I'm tempted to comb them out. But the longer I stop and look, the more interesting they become.", "一串小风铃": "A string of wind chimes", "单看一朵花，其实挺好看。花形像个小高脚杯，细细的花梗上挂着还没开的花苞，像小棒槌；开了花，弯过来，又像小铃铛。\n它还有个名字叫 Chinese Rainbell，也就是“中国雨铃”。很多很多花挂在一起，叮叮当当。玫红？堇紫？反正是那种说不清却很好看的颜色。": "A single flower is rather handsome. It's shaped like a tiny goblet. Unopened buds hang from fine stalks like little drumsticks; once open, the flowers curve over like bells.\nOne English name is Chinese rainbell. With so many hanging together I can almost hear them ringing. Rose pink? Violet? It's a lovely colour, whatever name I give it.", "单看一朵花，其实挺好看。花形像个小高脚杯，细细的花梗上挂着还没开的花苞，像小棒槌；开了花，弯过来，又像小铃铛。": "A single flower is rather handsome. It's shaped like a tiny goblet. Unopened buds hang from fine stalks like little drumsticks; once open, the flowers curve over like bells.", "它还有个名字叫 Chinese Rainbell，也就是“中国雨铃”。很多很多花挂在一起，叮叮当当。玫红？堇紫？反正是那种说不清却很好看的颜色。": "One English name is Chinese rainbell. With so many hanging together I can almost hear them ringing. Rose pink? Violet? It's a lovely colour, whatever name I give it.", "撇开花，我也喜欢它的叶子": "I like the leaves, too", "它的叶子是对生的，叶脉非常明显，正面、背面都好看，叶缘还有锯齿。叶子大小不统一，长得特别自由。\n再看茎，是四棱形的，有膨大的节，远远看有点像小竹子。花冠掉落后，花柱还会留着，底下是刚形成的小蒴果。花里有四枚雄蕊，两长两短。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs. Their prominent veins look good from either side, and the edges are toothed. They vary in size and seem to grow very much as they please.\nThe stem is four-angled with swollen nodes; from a distance it reminds me of a little bamboo. After the corolla falls, the style remains above a newly forming capsule. Inside a flower are four stamens, two long and two short.", "它的叶子是对生的，叶脉非常明显，正面、背面都好看，叶缘还有锯齿。叶子大小不统一，长得特别自由。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs. Their prominent veins look good from either side, and the edges are toothed. They vary in size and seem to grow very much as they please.", "再看茎，是四棱形的，有膨大的节，远远看有点像小竹子。花冠掉落后，花柱还会留着，底下是刚形成的小蒴果。花里有四枚雄蕊，两长两短。": "The stem is four-angled with swollen nodes; from a distance it reminds me of a little bamboo. After the corolla falls, the style remains above a newly forming capsule. Inside a flower are four stamens, two long and two short.", "在林下，重新认识它": "Meeting it again under the trees", "这片林下的叉花草，叶子长得很健康，和我在山上拍到的又是不一样的感觉。大片种在一起，即使不开花，叶子也很好看。\n平时从旁边经过，它可能只是普通的小草。低头认真看一下，才发现有这么多有意思的细节。": "The plants here have healthy leaves and give me quite a different impression from the ones I photographed up in the hills. Growing together in a broad patch, the leaves are beautiful even when there are no flowers.\nOn an ordinary walk I might pass it by as just another little plant. Bend down and look closely, and there are all these details waiting.", "这片林下的叉花草，叶子长得很健康，和我在山上拍到的又是不一样的感觉。大片种在一起，即使不开花，叶子也很好看。": "The plants here have healthy leaves and give me quite a different impression from the ones I photographed up in the hills. Growing together in a broad patch, the leaves are beautiful even when there are no flowers.", "平时从旁边经过，它可能只是普通的小草。低头认真看一下，才发现有这么多有意思的细节。": "On an ordinary walk I might pass it by as just another little plant. Bend down and look closely, and there are all these details waiting.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250729-01": {"花序与镰刀形叶状柄": "Flower heads beside sickle-shaped phyllodes", "草坪上的整株树形": "The outline of the whole tree on the lawn", "树下仰望枝干与天空": "Looking up through the branches to the sky", "开花的树冠枝梢": "Flowering shoots in the crown", "球形黄色花序近看": "A round yellow flower head up close", "一树黄色小绒球，一片疏疏落落的树影。台湾相思最有意思的细节，还藏在那些像镰刀的“叶子”里。": "A tree full of fuzzy yellow balls casts a loose pattern of shade. What intrigues me most about this acacia is hidden in its little sickle-shaped “leaves.”", "一树一树的黄花": "Tree after tree in yellow", "台湾相思开花了，一树一树的黄色，远远看就很壮观。凑近以后，那些花序是一颗颗毛茸茸的小球，还能闻到一点淡淡的香味。\n球形的头状花序沿着枝条分布，风一吹，花和旁边的绿色小镰刀一起轻轻摇晃。": "These acacias are in flower, one yellow tree after another. The display is striking from a distance; up close the flower heads are little furry balls, and there's a faint scent.\nThe round heads are spaced along the branches. In a breeze they sway gently with the little green sickles beside them.", "台湾相思开花了，一树一树的黄色，远远看就很壮观。凑近以后，那些花序是一颗颗毛茸茸的小球，还能闻到一点淡淡的香味。": "These acacias are in flower, one yellow tree after another. The display is striking from a distance; up close the flower heads are little furry balls, and there's a faint scent.", "球形的头状花序沿着枝条分布，风一吹，花和旁边的绿色小镰刀一起轻轻摇晃。": "The round heads are spaced along the branches. In a breeze they sway gently with the little green sickles beside them.", "看起来像叶子，却另有身份": "Leaf-shaped, but what are they?", "台湾相思最让我好奇的，是这些像镰刀的绿色部分。它们是叶状柄：叶柄变得扁平，承担了叶片的工作。\n这次还记录了幼时的羽状复叶。把两种形态连起来，才能看懂为什么同一株植物，会有这么不一样的“叶子”。": "The sickle-shaped green parts intrigue me most. They're phyllodes: flattened leaf stalks that do the work of leaf blades.\nI also recorded the pinnately compound leaves the plant bears when young. Seeing the two forms together helps me understand how the same plant can have such different-looking “leaves.”", "台湾相思最让我好奇的，是这些像镰刀的绿色部分。它们是叶状柄：叶柄变得扁平，承担了叶片的工作。": "The sickle-shaped green parts intrigue me most. They're phyllodes: flattened leaf stalks that do the work of leaf blades.", "这次还记录了幼时的羽状复叶。把两种形态连起来，才能看懂为什么同一株植物，会有这么不一样的“叶子”。": "I also recorded the pinnately compound leaves the plant bears when young. Seeing the two forms together helps me understand how the same plant can have such different-looking “leaves.”", "一定要站到树下看一看": "A view from underneath", "来到台湾相思树下，我总想抬头。枝条疏疏散散地伸开，碰上蓝天，树影尤其好看。\n它明明是一种常用于绿化的树，却把身形长得弯弯曲曲，很有自己的样子。退后看整株，再回到树荫里，这一树“相思”就变得具体了。": "Whenever I'm under one of these acacias, I want to look up. The branches reach out loosely, and against a blue sky the pattern of the canopy is particularly lovely.\nFor a tree so often planted in towns, it has a wonderfully individual, twisting shape. I step back to see the whole tree, then return to its shade. Now the name xiāngsī belongs to something I can picture.", "来到台湾相思树下，我总想抬头。枝条疏疏散散地伸开，碰上蓝天，树影尤其好看。": "Whenever I'm under one of these acacias, I want to look up. The branches reach out loosely, and against a blue sky the pattern of the canopy is particularly lovely.", "它明明是一种常用于绿化的树，却把身形长得弯弯曲曲，很有自己的样子。退后看整株，再回到树荫里，这一树“相思”就变得具体了。": "For a tree so often planted in towns, it has a wonderfully individual, twisting shape. I step back to see the whole tree, then return to its shade. Now the name xiāngsī belongs to something I can picture.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260227-01": {"蓝色花朵与浅色苞片": "Blue flowers with pale bracts", "花序间的花与苞片": "Flowers among the bracts of an inflorescence", "苞片的网状脉纹": "The network of veins on a bract", "枝条节部与叶片背面": "A stem node and the underside of a leaf", "枝端的花序与花苞": "Flower heads and buds at the shoot tip", "长花冠筒侧面": "The long corolla tube in profile", "林下成片开放的喜花草": "A flowering patch under the trees", "单朵花正面": "A single flower from the front", "梧桐山腰的一片蓝，花很可爱，苞片更精致。喜花草把细细的叶脉排成了一层层小瓦片。": "Halfway up Wutong Mountain I came upon a patch of blue. The flowers are lovely, the bracts finer still. Their delicate veins are set out in tiers like tiny roof tiles.", "山腰遇见一片蓝": "A patch of blue on the mountainside", "我是在深圳梧桐山腰看到喜花草的。林下安安静静地开着一片蓝花，旁边还能听见蜜蜂嗡嗡的声音。\n它也叫可爱花，名字和模样很相配。这样纯粹的一片蓝，在树荫下显得特别好看。": "I found this plant halfway up Wutong Mountain in Shenzhen. A patch of blue flowers bloomed quietly under the trees, with bees humming nearby.\nOne of its Chinese names, kě'àihuā, means “lovely flower.” It suits the plant. That pure blue looks particularly lovely in the shade.", "我是在深圳梧桐山腰看到喜花草的。林下安安静静地开着一片蓝花，旁边还能听见蜜蜂嗡嗡的声音。": "I found this plant halfway up Wutong Mountain in Shenzhen. A patch of blue flowers bloomed quietly under the trees, with bees humming nearby.", "它也叫可爱花，名字和模样很相配。这样纯粹的一片蓝，在树荫下显得特别好看。": "One of its Chinese names, kě'àihuā, means “lovely flower.” It suits the plant. That pure blue looks particularly lovely in the shade.", "最吸引我的，其实是苞片": "What stopped me were the bracts", "比起花，我更喜欢它层层叠叠的苞片。白绿色相间，叶脉细密清楚，像一排排小瓦片。\n这些精致的结构也是由叶变化而来。凑近看看，每一片的纹路都很清楚，几乎让人舍不得把镜头移开。": "Even more than the flowers, I like the overlapping bracts. Green and white, with a fine, clearly visible network of veins, they look like rows of little roof tiles.\nThese intricate structures are modified leaves. Up close I can make out the pattern on each one; it's hard to point the camera anywhere else.", "比起花，我更喜欢它层层叠叠的苞片。白绿色相间，叶脉细密清楚，像一排排小瓦片。": "Even more than the flowers, I like the overlapping bracts. Green and white, with a fine, clearly visible network of veins, they look like rows of little roof tiles.", "这些精致的结构也是由叶变化而来。凑近看看，每一片的纹路都很清楚，几乎让人舍不得把镜头移开。": "These intricate structures are modified leaves. Up close I can make out the pattern on each one; it's hard to point the camera anywhere else.", "从侧面，看见长长的花筒": "Turn sideways to see the tube", "从正面看，花冠平展开来；换到侧面，就能看到后面细长的一段花冠筒。这种形状像高脚碟，细看还可以找到伸出的花蕊。\n同一个花序里，花苞、开放的花和苞片挤在一起，各有各的层次。": "From the front, the corolla opens out flat. Turn to the side and a long, slender tube appears behind it. Altogether it looks like a saucer on a stem. Look closely and you can see flower parts projecting beyond it.\nBuds, open flowers and bracts crowd together in a single cluster, each occupying a different layer.", "从正面看，花冠平展开来；换到侧面，就能看到后面细长的一段花冠筒。这种形状像高脚碟，细看还可以找到伸出的花蕊。": "From the front, the corolla opens out flat. Turn to the side and a long, slender tube appears behind it. Altogether it looks like a saucer on a stem. Look closely and you can see flower parts projecting beyond it.", "同一个花序里，花苞、开放的花和苞片挤在一起，各有各的层次。": "Buds, open flowers and bracts crowd together in a single cluster, each occupying a different layer.", "花下面，还有整齐的叶子": "Paired leaves below the flowers", "喜花草的叶片对生，叶脉明显，枝条的节部也很清楚。把花举近一点，再顺着枝条往下看，结构就连起来了。\n要说一点小遗憾，就是花谢以后，枯黄的花冠有时还挂在枝上。不过也正因为如此，一簇花里能同时看到好几个阶段。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs, with conspicuous veins. The nodes stand out on the branches, too. I bring a flower closer, then follow the branch down, and the parts begin to fit together.\nMy one small regret is that a faded, yellowing corolla sometimes stays hanging there. Even that has its advantage: several stages of flowering can be seen in the same cluster.", "喜花草的叶片对生，叶脉明显，枝条的节部也很清楚。把花举近一点，再顺着枝条往下看，结构就连起来了。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs, with conspicuous veins. The nodes stand out on the branches, too. I bring a flower closer, then follow the branch down, and the parts begin to fit together.", "要说一点小遗憾，就是花谢以后，枯黄的花冠有时还挂在枝上。不过也正因为如此，一簇花里能同时看到好几个阶段。": "My one small regret is that a faded, yellowing corolla sometimes stays hanging there. Even that has its advantage: several stages of flowering can be seen in the same cluster.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251209-01": {"五片花瓣近看": "Five petals in close-up", "土人参 · 本期封面": "Talinum paniculatum, cover photograph", "叶片与尚未开放的花苞": "Leaves and unopened flower buds", "粉紫色花与细长花枝": "Pinkish-purple flowers on slender flowering stems", "花与圆形小果实": "Flowers and round little fruits", "两朵小花": "Two tiny flowers", "草丛中的叶片与植株": "The plant and its leaves among the grasses", "花枝的整体姿态": "The outline of a flowering spray", "细细的花枝上，粉紫色小花像散开的星星。土人参让我想起放学路上随手扎起的小花束。": "Tiny pinkish-purple flowers stand like scattered stars on fine stems. They remind me of the little bouquets I gathered on the way home from school.", "一个端庄的名字，一副野草的样子": "A stately name for a roadside flower", "土人参看上去就是路边一株轻轻巧巧的野花。查名字时，又看到了“栌兰”这个称呼，忽然觉得它端庄起来了。\n“土人参”这个名字和它粗壮的根有关，并不意味着它就是通常说的人参。先看眼前的茎叶和花，就能认出另一种完全不同的模样。": "At first glance this looks like a delicate roadside wildflower. Then I came across one of its Chinese names, lúlán, and suddenly it seemed rather dignified.\nAnother name, tǔrénshēn, alludes to its thick root and calls ginseng to mind. But it isn't the ginseng people usually mean. Its stems, leaves and flowers have quite a different appearance.", "土人参看上去就是路边一株轻轻巧巧的野花。查名字时，又看到了“栌兰”这个称呼，忽然觉得它端庄起来了。": "At first glance this looks like a delicate roadside wildflower. Then I came across one of its Chinese names, lúlán, and suddenly it seemed rather dignified.", "“土人参”这个名字和它粗壮的根有关，并不意味着它就是通常说的人参。先看眼前的茎叶和花，就能认出另一种完全不同的模样。": "Another name, tǔrénshēn, alludes to its thick root and calls ginseng to mind. But it isn't the ginseng people usually mean. Its stems, leaves and flowers have quite a different appearance.", "到晚饭时候，星星一样的花开了": "Stars that open at suppertime", "它常在傍晚开花，所以还有“晚饭花”的叫法。这个名字很有烟火气，像在提醒人该回家了。\n细长的花枝上，五片淡紫色花瓣轻轻展开。花很小，风一吹，星星散散地晃着，我就想起小时候放学路上摘过的小花束。": "The flowers often open toward evening, giving the plant the affectionate name “supper flower.” I like how domestic that sounds, as if it were calling everyone home.\nFive pale violet petals open on a slender stem. The flowers are so small; in the wind they sway like scattered stars. I think of the little bouquets I picked on my way home from school.", "它常在傍晚开花，所以还有“晚饭花”的叫法。这个名字很有烟火气，像在提醒人该回家了。": "The flowers often open toward evening, giving the plant the affectionate name “supper flower.” I like how domestic that sounds, as if it were calling everyone home.", "细长的花枝上，五片淡紫色花瓣轻轻展开。花很小，风一吹，星星散散地晃着，我就想起小时候放学路上摘过的小花束。": "Five pale violet petals open on a slender stem. The flowers are so small; in the wind they sway like scattered stars. I think of the little bouquets I picked on my way home from school.", "别漏掉小球球和厚叶片": "The little spheres and thick leaves", "枝上圆圆的小东西，要看清是花苞还是已经长起来的小果实。同一根花枝上，往往能看到不同阶段。\n下面的叶片倒卵形，厚厚的，和上面细弱的花枝形成了反差。把视线从花移到叶，再看一次整株，它就不只是几颗粉色小星星了。": "It's worth stopping to see whether a round object on the stem is a bud or a developing fruit. Several stages often share a single flowering stem.\nLower down, the thick, egg-shaped leaves are broader toward the tip. They're quite a contrast to the delicate stems above. Once my eye travels down to the leaves and back out to the whole plant, there's more to it than a handful of pink stars.", "枝上圆圆的小东西，要看清是花苞还是已经长起来的小果实。同一根花枝上，往往能看到不同阶段。": "It's worth stopping to see whether a round object on the stem is a bud or a developing fruit. Several stages often share a single flowering stem.", "下面的叶片倒卵形，厚厚的，和上面细弱的花枝形成了反差。把视线从花移到叶，再看一次整株，它就不只是几颗粉色小星星了。": "Lower down, the thick, egg-shaped leaves are broader toward the tip. They're quite a contrast to the delicate stems above. Once my eye travels down to the leaves and back out to the whole plant, there's more to it than a handful of pink stars.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20250801-01": {"枝头绿色蒴果": "Green capsules on a branch", "花与幼果同枝": "Flowers and young fruits on the same branch", "土沉香 · 本期封面": "Aquilaria sinensis, cover photograph", "成熟果实与悬垂种子": "A mature fruit with hanging seeds", "黄绿色小花": "Small yellow-green flowers", "尚未开裂的果实": "A fruit that has not yet opened", "叶片与开裂果实": "Leaves beside an open fruit", "果实表面的细毛": "Fine hairs on the fruit surface", "裂成两瓣的果壳": "A fruit wall split into two valves", "土沉香的枝叶、花果与种子手绘": "Sketch of the shoots, leaves, flowers, fruits and seeds", "种子悬在打开的果壳下": "Seeds suspended beneath the open fruit", "打开的果壳下面，种子被细细地吊在半空。土沉香这一次最让我着迷的，是一树小小的“吊灯”。": "Below the open fruits, seeds hang suspended on fine threads. It was those miniature pendant lamps that fascinated me most about this agarwood tree.", "从名字里的“香”说起": "The fragrance in the name", "土沉香也叫白木香，是能够形成沉香的树种之一。这期从这个“香”字，聊到了树木受伤后的防御反应，也聊到了人与香料的关系。\n不过这次走到树下，我先被满枝的绿色果实吸引了。它们表面有细毛，垂在叶子之间，像一盏盏小灯笼。": "Tǔchénxiāng, also called báimùxiāng, is one of the trees that can produce agarwood. The word for fragrance in its name led me to talk about the tree's response to injury and people's relationship with aromatic materials.\nUnder the tree, though, what caught my eye first were the green fruits all along the branches. Finely hairy, they hung among the leaves like little lanterns.", "土沉香也叫白木香，是能够形成沉香的树种之一。这期从这个“香”字，聊到了树木受伤后的防御反应，也聊到了人与香料的关系。": "Tǔchénxiāng, also called báimùxiāng, is one of the trees that can produce agarwood. The word for fragrance in its name led me to talk about the tree's response to injury and people's relationship with aromatic materials.", "不过这次走到树下，我先被满枝的绿色果实吸引了。它们表面有细毛，垂在叶子之间，像一盏盏小灯笼。": "Under the tree, though, what caught my eye first were the green fruits all along the branches. Finely hairy, they hung among the leaves like little lanterns.", "果壳开了，种子却没有掉下去": "The fruit opens but the seeds stay up", "成熟的果实裂成两瓣，里面的种子居然还吊在半空中。细细的一段结构连着种子，风吹来时轻轻晃动。\n乍一看，我还以为树上吊着小毛毛虫。把镜头凑近，才看清果壳、种子，以及种子旁边浅色的附属部分。": "A ripe fruit splits into two halves. To my surprise, the seeds stay hanging in the air. A slender attachment connects each one, letting it move gently in the wind.\nAt first I thought the tree was hung with tiny caterpillars. Only through the lens did I make out the shell, the seed and the pale appendage beside it.", "成熟的果实裂成两瓣，里面的种子居然还吊在半空中。细细的一段结构连着种子，风吹来时轻轻晃动。": "A ripe fruit splits into two halves. To my surprise, the seeds stay hanging in the air. A slender attachment connects each one, letting it move gently in the wind.", "乍一看，我还以为树上吊着小毛毛虫。把镜头凑近，才看清果壳、种子，以及种子旁边浅色的附属部分。": "At first I thought the tree was hung with tiny caterpillars. Only through the lens did I make out the shell, the seed and the pale appendage beside it.", "它在等谁来把种子带走？": "Who will carry the seed away?", "土沉香的种子传播与胡蜂有关：种子上的油质附属物会吸引胡蜂，取食过程中可能把种子带走。\n但眼前也有一些种子，附属部分已经不见了，种子却还挂着。我忍不住觉得好笑：这一次，小帮手似乎只吃了东西，并没有把搬运工作做完。": "Wasps can help disperse the seeds. An oily appendage attracts them, and a wasp that feeds on it may carry the seed away in the process.\nBut on some of the seeds in front of me, the appendage was already gone while the seed still hung there. I had to laugh: this time the little helper seems to have taken the food without finishing the delivery.", "土沉香的种子传播与胡蜂有关：种子上的油质附属物会吸引胡蜂，取食过程中可能把种子带走。": "Wasps can help disperse the seeds. An oily appendage attracts them, and a wasp that feeds on it may carry the seed away in the process.", "但眼前也有一些种子，附属部分已经不见了，种子却还挂着。我忍不住觉得好笑：这一次，小帮手似乎只吃了东西，并没有把搬运工作做完。": "But on some of the seeds in front of me, the appendage was already gone while the seed still hung there. I had to laugh: this time the little helper seems to have taken the food without finishing the delivery.", "把春天的小花也接上": "Remembering the spring flowers", "看着一树果实，我又想起春天拍下的花。黄绿色的小花并不张扬，近闻有一点淡淡的香气。\n叶片正面较深，背面偏灰绿。从花到果实，再到悬垂的种子，几次不同季节的观察，就这样接成了同一株土沉香的故事。": "A tree full of fruit brought back the flowers I'd photographed in spring. The small yellow-green blossoms didn't draw much attention, but up close they had a faint fragrance.\nThe leaves are darker above and grey-green below. Flowers, fruits, hanging seeds: visits in different seasons have come together as the story of one tree.", "看着一树果实，我又想起春天拍下的花。黄绿色的小花并不张扬，近闻有一点淡淡的香气。": "A tree full of fruit brought back the flowers I'd photographed in spring. The small yellow-green blossoms didn't draw much attention, but up close they had a faint fragrance.", "叶片正面较深，背面偏灰绿。从花到果实，再到悬垂的种子，几次不同季节的观察，就这样接成了同一株土沉香的故事。": "The leaves are darker above and grey-green below. Flowers, fruits, hanging seeds: visits in different seasons have come together as the story of one tree.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250912-01": {"高高伸出的粉色花枝": "A tall pink flowering stem", "绿色叶片与叶缘": "Green leaves and their margins", "花序与旁边的花苞": "A flower head and a neighbouring bud", "逆光下的叶片脉纹": "Veins visible in a backlit leaf", "尚未完全开放的花苞": "A bud not yet fully open", "墙边并开的花序": "Flower heads opening beside a wall", "屋檐旁的粉色花序": "A pink flower head near the eaves", "层叠的舌状花": "Layers of ray florets", "整片植株与花枝": "A stand of dahlias and their flowering stems", "橙红色大丽花花序": "An orange-red dahlia flower head", "蓝天下的粉色花序": "A pink flower head against a blue sky", "大理门前的大丽花，长得比人还高。先看一张张精神饱满的“花脸”，再看看背后的叶子和花苞。": "The dahlias by the doors in Dali grow taller than a person. After meeting those splendid flower faces, I take a look at the leaves and buds behind them.", "门前这一朵，比脸还大": "A flower bigger than my face", "在大理看到的大丽花，长得比我还高，花序也大得让人想伸手比一比。种在门口，精神十足，很有花开富贵的感觉。\n在深圳，我更多是在花店里看到它；到了这里，门边、墙角都能遇到，让人羡慕。": "The dahlias I saw in Dali were taller than I am. The flower heads were so large I wanted to hold up a hand for scale. At a doorway, they look full of life, with just the abundance people associate with flowers in full bloom.\nIn Shenzhen I see dahlias more often in florists' shops. Here they grow beside doors and in the corners of walls. I rather envy the people who live with them.", "在大理看到的大丽花，长得比我还高，花序也大得让人想伸手比一比。种在门口，精神十足，很有花开富贵的感觉。": "The dahlias I saw in Dali were taller than I am. The flower heads were so large I wanted to hold up a hand for scale. At a doorway, they look full of life, with just the abundance people associate with flowers in full bloom.", "在深圳，我更多是在花店里看到它；到了这里，门边、墙角都能遇到，让人羡慕。": "In Shenzhen I see dahlias more often in florists' shops. Here they grow beside doors and in the corners of walls. I rather envy the people who live with them.", "一张“花脸”，里面有许多小花": "One face, many florets", "大丽花属于菊科。眼前这一层层展开的，并不是一朵简单的花，而是许多小花组成的头状花序。\n显眼的舌状花层层铺开，颜色从橙红过渡到浅黄。换一株，又成了柔和的粉色。光是看这些排列和颜色，就能看很久。": "Dahlias belong to the daisy family. Those unfolding layers are the many florets of a single flower head, rather than just one flower.\nShowy ray florets spread in tiers, shading from orange-red to pale yellow. Another plant is a soft pink. I could spend quite a while just looking at the colours and the way the florets are arranged.", "大丽花属于菊科。眼前这一层层展开的，并不是一朵简单的花，而是许多小花组成的头状花序。": "Dahlias belong to the daisy family. Those unfolding layers are the many florets of a single flower head, rather than just one flower.", "显眼的舌状花层层铺开，颜色从橙红过渡到浅黄。换一株，又成了柔和的粉色。光是看这些排列和颜色，就能看很久。": "Showy ray florets spread in tiers, shading from orange-red to pale yellow. Another plant is a soft pink. I could spend quite a while just looking at the colours and the way the florets are arranged.", "花苞也有自己的光泽": "Even the buds have a sheen", "还没完全打开的花苞，把花序包得圆圆的。外面的总苞片带着光泽，看起来厚实而整齐，我一开始甚至觉得像做出来的。\n从小花苞看到盛开的花序，同一根枝上，就能找到展开过程的几个片段。": "A bud still partly closed wraps the developing head into a round package. The outer involucral bracts are glossy, thick and so neatly fitted that at first I wondered if someone had made them.\nFrom a small bud to a head in full bloom, several moments in the opening sequence can be found on the same stem.", "还没完全打开的花苞，把花序包得圆圆的。外面的总苞片带着光泽，看起来厚实而整齐，我一开始甚至觉得像做出来的。": "A bud still partly closed wraps the developing head into a round package. The outer involucral bracts are glossy, thick and so neatly fitted that at first I wondered if someone had made them.", "从小花苞看到盛开的花序，同一根枝上，就能找到展开过程的几个片段。": "From a small bud to a head in full bloom, several moments in the opening sequence can be found on the same stem.", "抬头看花，也低头看叶": "Look up at the flowers and down at the leaves", "花序梗很长，把花高高举起来，长得太长时又会微微弯垂。下面的叶片分裂，叶脉清楚，叶缘也有齿。\n它还有番薯花、地瓜花这样的别名，与膨大的地下块根有关。虽然这次最抢眼的是花，叶子和整株的高度，也值得一起记住。": "Long stalks lift the heads up high, bending slightly when they've grown very long. Below, the leaves are divided, with clear veins and toothed margins.\nChinese names such as “sweet-potato flower” refer to the swollen tuberous roots. The flowers took centre stage this time, but I'd like to remember the leaves and the height of the plant as well.", "花序梗很长，把花高高举起来，长得太长时又会微微弯垂。下面的叶片分裂，叶脉清楚，叶缘也有齿。": "Long stalks lift the heads up high, bending slightly when they've grown very long. Below, the leaves are divided, with clear veins and toothed margins.", "它还有番薯花、地瓜花这样的别名，与膨大的地下块根有关。虽然这次最抢眼的是花，叶子和整株的高度，也值得一起记住。": "Chinese names such as “sweet-potato flower” refer to the swollen tuberous roots. The flowers took centre stage this time, but I'd like to remember the leaves and the height of the plant as well.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260707-01": {"较年轻菌盖上的鳞片": "Scales on a younger cap.", "林下展开的大果鹅膏": "Amanita macrocarpa with its cap open on the woodland floor.", "展开的菌盖与粗壮菌柄": "An open cap and a stout stem.", "菌盖表面的细小鳞片": "Small scales on the surface of the cap.", "菌褶与菌环": "The gills and the ring around the stem.", "底部膨大的幼小子实体": "A young fruiting body with a swollen base.", "菌褶侧面": "The gills seen from the side.", "不同大小的子实体": "Fruiting bodies of several sizes.", "林下撑起一把大伞，小时候却像一枚保龄球。从菌盖上的鳞片，到菌柄上的“裙摆”，逐一看看大果鹅膏。": "An umbrella on the woodland floor, a bowling ball when young. I took a closer look at the scales on the cap and the little “skirt” around the stem of Amanita macrocarpa.", "大果鹅膏": "Dàguǒ égāo (大果鹅膏)", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "灰絮鳞鹅膏 Amanita griseofarinosa；小豹斑鹅膏 Amanita parvipantherina；致命鹅膏 Amanita exitialis；假褐云斑鹅膏 Amanita pseudoporphyria": "Amanita griseofarinosa, Amanita parvipantherina, Amanita exitialis and Amanita pseudoporphyria.", "这是我见过最大的一朵鹅膏菌｜大果鹅膏": "The biggest Amanita I have ever seen | Amanita macrocarpa", "林下撑起一把大伞": "A great umbrella on the woodland floor", "这一群大果鹅膏，是我见过很大的蘑菇。眼前这一枚菌盖直径约有二十五厘米，在落叶之间像一把撑开的伞。\n不过，真正让我看了很久的，不只是它有多大，而是它身上几层特别的结构。": "These are some of the biggest mushrooms I’ve seen. The cap in front of me is about 25 centimetres across. It looks like an open umbrella among the fallen leaves.\nWhat kept me looking, though, was more than its size. There were several distinct layers to look at.", "菌盖上的小鳞片": "Little scales on the cap", "从上面看，菌盖并不光滑，而是布满一块块鳞片。这些痕迹与幼时包裹子实体的外菌幕有关，随着蘑菇长大，包被被撑开、破裂。\n年轻一些的菌盖还比较圆，鳞片显得厚厚的；展开以后，又是另一种排列。把两种状态放在一起，就能看到变化。": "Viewed from above, the cap is covered in patches of scales. They are remnants of the universal veil that enclosed the young fruiting body. As the mushroom grew, the covering stretched and broke apart.\nThe younger cap is still fairly round and its scales look thick. On an open cap they’re arranged differently. It helps to look at the two stages side by side.", "伞下面，还有一圈裙摆": "A skirt under the umbrella", "换到菌盖下面，可以看到密密的菌褶，颜色偏乳白到浅黄。菌柄上还留着明显的菌环，像系了一圈裙摆，是内菌幕留下的痕迹。\n这次并没有拍到清楚完整的菌托，不能把照片里没看清的部分当成已经观察到了。认蘑菇，需要把多个特征放在一起看。": "Underneath the cap are closely spaced gills, cream to pale yellow. A distinct ring circles the stem like a little skirt. It is what remains of the partial veil.\nI didn’t get a clear photograph of an intact cup at the base, the volva, so I can’t say I saw it here. To identify a mushroom, several features have to be considered together.", "小时候，像一颗保龄球": "A bowling ball when young", "我尤其喜欢它幼时的样子：菌柄底部圆鼓鼓的，上面顶着还没完全展开的菌盖，真的有点像保龄球。\n林下既有这样的“小球”，也有已经开伞的个体。这份记录是一次形态观察，不作为野生蘑菇的食用鉴定。认识它，并不需要把它带回餐桌。": "I especially like the young ones. The base of the stem is round and swollen, with a cap above it that hasn’t quite opened. It really does look a bit like a bowling ball.\nHere in the woods there are both little “balls” and individuals with their caps already spread. I’m recording their forms. These observations don’t establish whether a wild mushroom is edible. I’m happy to get to know it right here.", "灰絮鳞鹅膏": "Amanita griseofarinosa", "视频开篇提及的鹅膏菌之一，未在本档案照片中逐一对应。": "One of the Amanita species mentioned at the start of the video. The photographs in this record do not identify each one individually.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "小豹斑鹅膏": "Amanita parvipantherina", "视频开篇提及。": "Mentioned at the start of the video.", "致命鹅膏": "Amanita exitialis", "视频中亦称白毒伞。": "The video also uses the Chinese name báidúsǎn (白毒伞).", "假褐云斑鹅膏": "Amanita pseudoporphyria", "这一群大果鹅膏，是我见过很大的蘑菇。眼前这一枚菌盖直径约有二十五厘米，在落叶之间像一把撑开的伞。": "These are some of the biggest mushrooms I’ve seen. The cap in front of me is about 25 centimetres across. It looks like an open umbrella among the fallen leaves.", "不过，真正让我看了很久的，不只是它有多大，而是它身上几层特别的结构。": "What kept me looking, though, was more than its size. There were several distinct layers to look at.", "从上面看，菌盖并不光滑，而是布满一块块鳞片。这些痕迹与幼时包裹子实体的外菌幕有关，随着蘑菇长大，包被被撑开、破裂。": "Viewed from above, the cap is covered in patches of scales. They are remnants of the universal veil that enclosed the young fruiting body. As the mushroom grew, the covering stretched and broke apart.", "年轻一些的菌盖还比较圆，鳞片显得厚厚的；展开以后，又是另一种排列。把两种状态放在一起，就能看到变化。": "The younger cap is still fairly round and its scales look thick. On an open cap they’re arranged differently. It helps to look at the two stages side by side.", "换到菌盖下面，可以看到密密的菌褶，颜色偏乳白到浅黄。菌柄上还留着明显的菌环，像系了一圈裙摆，是内菌幕留下的痕迹。": "Underneath the cap are closely spaced gills, cream to pale yellow. A distinct ring circles the stem like a little skirt. It is what remains of the partial veil.", "这次并没有拍到清楚完整的菌托，不能把照片里没看清的部分当成已经观察到了。认蘑菇，需要把多个特征放在一起看。": "I didn’t get a clear photograph of an intact cup at the base, the volva, so I can’t say I saw it here. To identify a mushroom, several features have to be considered together.", "我尤其喜欢它幼时的样子：菌柄底部圆鼓鼓的，上面顶着还没完全展开的菌盖，真的有点像保龄球。": "I especially like the young ones. The base of the stem is round and swollen, with a cap above it that hasn’t quite opened. It really does look a bit like a bowling ball.", "林下既有这样的“小球”，也有已经开伞的个体。这份记录是一次形态观察，不作为野生蘑菇的食用鉴定。认识它，并不需要把它带回餐桌。": "Here in the woods there are both little “balls” and individuals with their caps already spread. I’m recording their forms. These observations don’t establish whether a wild mushroom is edible. I’m happy to get to know it right here."}, "20260710-01": {"叶鞘与叶柄排列": "The arrangement of leaf sheaths and stalks", "花蕊与蓝色花瓣近看": "The reproductive parts and blue petals up close", "打开蓝色花瓣观察内部": "Parting the blue petals to look inside", "白色萼片与蓝色花瓣": "White sepals and blue petals", "高大叶片之间的花序": "The inflorescence between tall leaves", "箭头状的蓝色花瓣": "The arrow-shaped blue petals", "花朵侧面整体": "The whole flower in profile", "打开的果实与橙色假种皮": "An open fruit with orange arils", "深色苞片与花朵侧面": "A dark bract and a flower seen from the side", "像白鹤伸长脖子望向远方，大鹤望兰的蓝色花瓣里还藏着花蕊。花谢以后，又找到一抹橙色。": "A white crane seems to stretch its neck to look into the distance. Inside the blue petals are the flower's reproductive parts; after flowering I found a flash of orange, too.", "一只望向远方的白鹤": "A white crane looking into the distance", "大鹤望兰最吸引我的，就是它的花。深色苞片像有力的鸟嘴，白色萼片层层伸出，仿佛一只白鹤正伸长脖子望向远方。\n整株又高大挺拔，这个名字起得很贴切。它明明是一株植物，却像藏着一颗想变成鸟的心。": "It's the flower of this Strelitzia that draws me in. A dark bract forms a strong beak, and white sepals rise one above the next, as if a crane were stretching its neck to see into the distance.\nThe whole plant is tall and upright. Its Chinese name evokes just this sight: a plant with the heart of a bird.", "大鹤望兰最吸引我的，就是它的花。深色苞片像有力的鸟嘴，白色萼片层层伸出，仿佛一只白鹤正伸长脖子望向远方。": "It's the flower of this Strelitzia that draws me in. A dark bract forms a strong beak, and white sepals rise one above the next, as if a crane were stretching its neck to see into the distance.", "整株又高大挺拔，这个名字起得很贴切。它明明是一株植物，却像藏着一颗想变成鸟的心。": "The whole plant is tall and upright. Its Chinese name evokes just this sight: a plant with the heart of a bird.", "蓝色箭头里面，藏着什么？": "Inside the blue arrow", "两枚蓝色花瓣合在一起，形成箭头一样的结构，花蕊就包在其中。镜头靠近以后，这种组合看得特别清楚。\n这期还聊到它的鸟类传粉方式：鸟取食花蜜时，可能压开花瓣，与花蕊接触。看花的结构，再想象一只鸟落上来的情景，就很有意思。": "Two blue petals meet to form an arrowhead, enclosing the reproductive parts of the flower. Close through the lens the arrangement is remarkably clear.\nI also talked about pollination by birds. A bird taking nectar may press the petals apart and come into contact with the structures within. Looking at the flower, I try to picture a bird landing there.", "两枚蓝色花瓣合在一起，形成箭头一样的结构，花蕊就包在其中。镜头靠近以后，这种组合看得特别清楚。": "Two blue petals meet to form an arrowhead, enclosing the reproductive parts of the flower. Close through the lens the arrangement is remarkably clear.", "这期还聊到它的鸟类传粉方式：鸟取食花蜜时，可能压开花瓣，与花蕊接触。看花的结构，再想象一只鸟落上来的情景，就很有意思。": "I also talked about pollination by birds. A bird taking nectar may press the petals apart and come into contact with the structures within. Looking at the flower, I try to picture a bird landing there.", "花谢以后，找到一抹橙色": "A flash of orange after the flower", "刚好遇到一个已经打开的果实，里面能看到种子旁橙色的假种皮。我也拿它与近亲旅人蕉作了比较，后者的假种皮是蓝色的。\n干掉的花枝仍然很有造型，像某种外星生物。原来一朵花谢了，观察还可以继续。": "I happened upon a fruit that had already opened. An orange aril showed beside the seed. Its relative, the traveller's tree, offered a comparison: on that plant the aril is blue.\nEven the dried flower stalks have a striking shape, like creatures from another planet. There's still plenty to observe after a flower fades.", "刚好遇到一个已经打开的果实，里面能看到种子旁橙色的假种皮。我也拿它与近亲旅人蕉作了比较，后者的假种皮是蓝色的。": "I happened upon a fruit that had already opened. An orange aril showed beside the seed. Its relative, the traveller's tree, offered a comparison: on that plant the aril is blue.", "干掉的花枝仍然很有造型，像某种外星生物。原来一朵花谢了，观察还可以继续。": "Even the dried flower stalks have a striking shape, like creatures from another planet. There's still plenty to observe after a flower fades.", "最后，抬头看看那把大扇子": "Look up at that enormous fan", "它的叶子宽大，第一眼很容易想到芭蕉。沿着叶柄往下看，层层相接的叶鞘又显出整齐的排列。\n大鹤望兰、鹤望兰和旅人蕉，远看有些相像。把花的颜色、植株姿态和种子细节一起记住，就比只看一片大叶子更有把握。": "At first sight the broad leaves remind me of a banana plant. Follow the leaf stalks down and the overlapping sheaths reveal a surprisingly orderly arrangement.\nThis large bird-of-paradise, the smaller bird-of-paradise and the traveller's tree look somewhat alike from a distance. The flower colour, bearing of the whole plant and details of the seeds give me more to go on than one broad leaf.", "它的叶子宽大，第一眼很容易想到芭蕉。沿着叶柄往下看，层层相接的叶鞘又显出整齐的排列。": "At first sight the broad leaves remind me of a banana plant. Follow the leaf stalks down and the overlapping sheaths reveal a surprisingly orderly arrangement.", "大鹤望兰、鹤望兰和旅人蕉，远看有些相像。把花的颜色、植株姿态和种子细节一起记住，就比只看一片大叶子更有把握。": "This large bird-of-paradise, the smaller bird-of-paradise and the traveller's tree look somewhat alike from a distance. The flower colour, bearing of the whole plant and details of the seeds give me more to go on than one broad leaf.", "视频中用于比较花色与植株大小。": "Compared in the video for flower colour and plant size.", "视频中比较叶片排列与假种皮颜色。": "The video compares the arrangement of the leaves and the colour of the arils.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250718-01": {"叶片之间的花序": "An inflorescence among the leaves", "白色花朵正面": "A white flower face-on", "花药与花柱近看": "Anther and style in close-up", "花朵侧面与绿色苞片": "The flower and its green bracts in profile", "花序与条状叶片": "An inflorescence beside long, narrow leaves", "并开的白花": "White flowers open side by side", "白色花朵像蝴蝶，清淡的香气是夏天的味道。姜花不是生姜开的花，近看它还有一套特别的花部结构。": "White butterfly-like flowers have a light scent that always makes me think of summer. This ginger lily is a different plant from culinary ginger, and its flower parts deserve a closer look.", "好一朵又白又香的花": "A white flower with the scent of summer", "俯下身闻一闻，姜花的香味清清淡淡，没有白兰、含笑那么浓。我很喜欢这种味道，闻到它，就想到夏天。\n先说清楚，姜花不是我们吃的生姜开的花。它们同属姜科，但分属不同的属。这个名字乍听简单，其实很容易让人误会。": "I bend down to smell it. The fragrance is light, not as strong as that of white champaca or banana shrub. I like it very much. It smells like summer to me.\nThe Chinese name jiānghuā literally means “ginger flower,” which can give the wrong impression: the ginger we eat and this ginger lily belong to the same family but to different genera.", "俯下身闻一闻，姜花的香味清清淡淡，没有白兰、含笑那么浓。我很喜欢这种味道，闻到它，就想到夏天。": "I bend down to smell it. The fragrance is light, not as strong as that of white champaca or banana shrub. I like it very much. It smells like summer to me.", "先说清楚，姜花不是我们吃的生姜开的花。它们同属姜科，但分属不同的属。这个名字乍听简单，其实很容易让人误会。": "The Chinese name jiānghuā literally means “ginger flower,” which can give the wrong impression: the ginger we eat and this ginger lily belong to the same family but to different genera.", "小蝴蝶从绿色苞片间飞出来": "White butterflies among green bracts", "花序顶在茎的上方，绿色苞片一层层排列，像笋壳，也有点像松果。白花从苞片之间伸出来，整朵看着像蝴蝶。\n所以蝴蝶姜、蝴蝶花这些别名，一看就能明白。换到侧面看，花和苞片之间的关系也更清楚。": "At the top of the stem, tiers of green bracts form a cluster rather like the husks of a bamboo shoot, or perhaps a pine cone. White flowers emerge between them looking like butterflies.\nChinese names such as “butterfly ginger” and “butterfly flower” immediately make sense. From the side I can see more clearly how the flowers sit among the bracts.", "花序顶在茎的上方，绿色苞片一层层排列，像笋壳，也有点像松果。白花从苞片之间伸出来，整朵看着像蝴蝶。": "At the top of the stem, tiers of green bracts form a cluster rather like the husks of a bamboo shoot, or perhaps a pine cone. White flowers emerge between them looking like butterflies.", "所以蝴蝶姜、蝴蝶花这些别名，一看就能明白。换到侧面看，花和苞片之间的关系也更清楚。": "Chinese names such as “butterfly ginger” and “butterfly flower” immediately make sense. From the side I can see more clearly how the flowers sit among the bracts.", "最显眼的白色部分，是什么？": "What are those showy white parts?", "宽宽的白色唇瓣与侧面的花瓣状结构，来自退化雄蕊；真正的花冠裂片反而狭长，不那么抢眼。它们共同组成一朵花，并不是说显眼的部分就“不算花”。\n再凑近看，能找到细长的花药和花柱。原来蝴蝶般轻巧的外形，里面藏着这样特别的结构。": "The broad white lip and the petal-like structures beside it are modified sterile stamens. The actual corolla lobes are long, narrow and less conspicuous. All these parts belong to the flower, whatever their origin.\nCloser still, I can pick out the slender anther and the style. The butterfly outline conceals a rather extraordinary arrangement.", "宽宽的白色唇瓣与侧面的花瓣状结构，来自退化雄蕊；真正的花冠裂片反而狭长，不那么抢眼。它们共同组成一朵花，并不是说显眼的部分就“不算花”。": "The broad white lip and the petal-like structures beside it are modified sterile stamens. The actual corolla lobes are long, narrow and less conspicuous. All these parts belong to the flower, whatever their origin.", "再凑近看，能找到细长的花药和花柱。原来蝴蝶般轻巧的外形，里面藏着这样特别的结构。": "Closer still, I can pick out the slender anther and the style. The butterfly outline conceals a rather extraordinary arrangement.", "一阶一阶向上排的叶子": "Leaves rising in steps", "油绿的叶片沿着假茎两侧排列，整齐地向上展开。假茎由叶鞘包裹形成，地下还有根状茎。\n我喜欢在潮湿环境里看到它，一片绿叶中托起白花，香气也刚刚好。从整丛看到一朵，再看回整丛，夏天的感觉就完整了。": "Glossy green leaves spread in neat ranks along two sides of the pseudostem. The pseudostem is made of overlapping leaf sheaths; there's a rhizome below ground.\nI like finding this plant in damp places, the white flowers lifted above a bank of green leaves, the scent just strong enough. From the whole clump to one flower and back out again: that's my picture of summer.", "油绿的叶片沿着假茎两侧排列，整齐地向上展开。假茎由叶鞘包裹形成，地下还有根状茎。": "Glossy green leaves spread in neat ranks along two sides of the pseudostem. The pseudostem is made of overlapping leaf sheaths; there's a rhizome below ground.", "我喜欢在潮湿环境里看到它，一片绿叶中托起白花，香气也刚刚好。从整丛看到一朵，再看回整丛，夏天的感觉就完整了。": "I like finding this plant in damp places, the white flowers lifted above a bank of green leaves, the scent just strong enough. From the whole clump to one flower and back out again: that's my picture of summer.", "视频列出的姜科植物比较对象。": "A member of the ginger family mentioned for comparison.", "视频提及的园艺品种。": "A cultivar mentioned in the video.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260120-01": {"蓝天下变色的枝叶": "Branches changing colour against a blue sky", "枝端开裂的果实": "Split fruits at the tip of a branch", "灰白色树皮": "Grey-white bark", "近地枝条上的彩色叶片": "Colourful leaves on a low branch", "细枝上的叶痕": "Leaf scars on a twig", "绿叶与红叶交错": "Green and red leaves intermingle", "仰望山乌桕树冠": "Looking up into the canopy", "叶脉与渐变叶色": "Leaf veins and gradations of colour", "绿、黄、橙、红，同一株山乌桕把山野的秋色挂在枝头。沿着叶脉看过去，每一片都不一样。": "Green, yellow, orange and red hang together on one tree: autumn in the hills. Follow the veins and each leaf looks a little different.", "岭南山里的秋色": "Autumn colour in the Lingnan hills", "山乌桕的叶子红了。和野漆一样，它给岭南山林添上了一种难得的季节感。\n山坡和林缘都能遇见它，身形很有山野气。抬头看，红叶衬着蓝天，树冠一下子变得轻快起来。": "The leaves of this Triadica have turned red. Like the wax tree, it gives the woods of Lingnan, in southern China, a welcome sense of the changing season.\nI find it on hillsides and woodland edges, where it seems perfectly at home. Looking up, the red leaves against the blue sky give the whole crown a sudden lightness.", "山乌桕的叶子红了。和野漆一样，它给岭南山林添上了一种难得的季节感。": "The leaves of this Triadica have turned red. Like the wax tree, it gives the woods of Lingnan, in southern China, a welcome sense of the changing season.", "山坡和林缘都能遇见它，身形很有山野气。抬头看，红叶衬着蓝天，树冠一下子变得轻快起来。": "I find it on hillsides and woodland edges, where it seems perfectly at home. Looking up, the red leaves against the blue sky give the whole crown a sudden lightness.", "同一片叶上，也有好几种颜色": "Several colours on a single leaf", "我很喜欢看山乌桕的叶子：绿、黄绿、黄、橙，再到红，颜色和叶脉叠在一起，非常有层次。\n它与乌桕只有一字之差，却不是同一种树。山乌桕的叶子较长，乌桕常见菱形叶，先从叶形比较，比只记名字直观。": "I love watching these leaves: green shades through yellow-green, yellow and orange into red. The colours overlie the veins and give each leaf a depth of its own.\nIts Chinese name, shānwūjiù, differs by only one character from wūjiù, the Chinese tallow tree, but they're different species. This tree has longer leaves; the tallow tree often has diamond-shaped ones. Comparing leaves is easier than relying on the names alone.", "我很喜欢看山乌桕的叶子：绿、黄绿、黄、橙，再到红，颜色和叶脉叠在一起，非常有层次。": "I love watching these leaves: green shades through yellow-green, yellow and orange into red. The colours overlie the veins and give each leaf a depth of its own.", "它与乌桕只有一字之差，却不是同一种树。山乌桕的叶子较长，乌桕常见菱形叶，先从叶形比较，比只记名字直观。": "Its Chinese name, shānwūjiù, differs by only one character from wūjiù, the Chinese tallow tree, but they're different species. This tree has longer leaves; the tallow tree often has diamond-shaped ones. Comparing leaves is easier than relying on the names alone.", "叶子之外，枝条也会留下痕迹": "What the branches remember", "变色的叶子不会一下子全部落尽，所以能慢慢看它变化。叶子脱落以后，枝条上留下小小的叶痕，树皮也有灰白色的纹理。\n枝端还找到已经开裂的果实。看完一树颜色，回头留意这些不太起眼的小地方，山乌桕就更容易记住了。": "The changing leaves don't fall all at once, which gives me time to watch. Each fallen leaf leaves a small scar on its twig; the bark has a grey-white pattern of its own.\nAt a branch tip I also found a fruit that had split open. After taking in that whole tree of colour, going back to the less conspicuous details makes it easier to recognise next time.", "变色的叶子不会一下子全部落尽，所以能慢慢看它变化。叶子脱落以后，枝条上留下小小的叶痕，树皮也有灰白色的纹理。": "The changing leaves don't fall all at once, which gives me time to watch. Each fallen leaf leaves a small scar on its twig; the bark has a grey-white pattern of its own.", "枝端还找到已经开裂的果实。看完一树颜色，回头留意这些不太起眼的小地方，山乌桕就更容易记住了。": "At a branch tip I also found a fruit that had split open. After taking in that whole tree of colour, going back to the less conspicuous details makes it easier to recognise next time.", "视频比较岭南山林中会变红的秋叶。": "The video compares plants whose autumn foliage turns red in the hills of Lingnan.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251103-01": {"果实顶端与表面沟纹": "The tip of a fruit and grooves on its surface", "手边观察黄白色小花": "A hand beside the tiny yellow-white flowers", "枝条上成串下垂的果实": "Fruits hanging in bunches from a branch", "叶片之间的小果实": "Small fruits among the leaves", "枝头淡黄绿色的小果，名字里带着“油柑”，却不是饮料里熟悉的余甘子。山油柑还有一股芸香科的清香。": "The pale yellow-green fruits have a Chinese name reminiscent of the yóugān found in drinks, but this is a different plant, with a fragrance that recalls its citrus relatives.", "名字相近，认的却不是同一种": "Similar names, different plants", "山油柑不是饮料里常说的油柑、余甘子。这次山行中，它的香气和味道留下了特别的印象，让我想仔细认识它。\n“山柑”“砂糖木”等别名，留下了人们对它的感受。不过相似的俗名容易混淆，认识时还是要回到具体形态。": "Shānyóugān is different from the Indian gooseberry, called yóugān or yúgānzǐ, that's familiar from drinks. Its distinctive scent and taste on this walk made me want to get to know the tree.\nOther Chinese names, including shāngān and shātángmù, preserve people's impressions of it. Similar vernacular names can be confusing, though; I find it helps to return to the plant itself.", "山油柑不是饮料里常说的油柑、余甘子。这次山行中，它的香气和味道留下了特别的印象，让我想仔细认识它。": "Shānyóugān is different from the Indian gooseberry, called yóugān or yúgānzǐ, that's familiar from drinks. Its distinctive scent and taste on this walk made me want to get to know the tree.", "“山柑”“砂糖木”等别名，留下了人们对它的感受。不过相似的俗名容易混淆，认识时还是要回到具体形态。": "Other Chinese names, including shāngān and shātángmù, preserve people's impressions of it. Similar vernacular names can be confusing, though; I find it helps to return to the plant itself.", "小果子，顶端有一个尖尖": "Small fruits with pointed tips", "果实淡黄绿色，顶端有短短的尖头，表面还能看到几道浅沟。逆着光时，有一点若隐若现的感觉。\n它们一串串悬在枝条下面，沿路晃来晃去。热天上山时，碰到这样的一树小果，观察的兴致又来了。": "The pale yellow-green fruits have short points at the tip and several shallow grooves on their surface. Against the light they have a faintly translucent look.\nThey hang in bunches below the branches and bob beside the path. Coming upon them on a hot climb gives me fresh enthusiasm for looking around.", "果实淡黄绿色，顶端有短短的尖头，表面还能看到几道浅沟。逆着光时，有一点若隐若现的感觉。": "The pale yellow-green fruits have short points at the tip and several shallow grooves on their surface. Against the light they have a faintly translucent look.", "它们一串串悬在枝条下面，沿路晃来晃去。热天上山时，碰到这样的一树小果，观察的兴致又来了。": "They hang in bunches below the branches and bob beside the path. Coming upon them on a hot climb gives me fresh enthusiasm for looking around.", "细碎的小花，也值得靠近看": "Flowers worth getting close to", "山油柑有时花果同枝。黄白色的小花，花瓣细长，边缘微卷，花蕊从中间伸出来。用手在旁边比一比，才感觉到它有多小。\n它属于芸香科，叶片的香气也让人想到柑橘。视频中还提到九里香：同一个家族的不同植物，就这样从一次次观察中串了起来。": "Flowers and fruits sometimes share a branch. The tiny yellowish-white flowers have narrow petals with slightly curled edges, and the floral organs project from the centre. A hand held beside one shows just how small it is.\nThis is a member of the citrus family; the smell of the leaves suggests citrus, too. I mentioned Murraya paniculata in the video. Little by little, these encounters connect different members of one family.", "山油柑有时花果同枝。黄白色的小花，花瓣细长，边缘微卷，花蕊从中间伸出来。用手在旁边比一比，才感觉到它有多小。": "Flowers and fruits sometimes share a branch. The tiny yellowish-white flowers have narrow petals with slightly curled edges, and the floral organs project from the centre. A hand held beside one shows just how small it is.", "它属于芸香科，叶片的香气也让人想到柑橘。视频中还提到九里香：同一个家族的不同植物，就这样从一次次观察中串了起来。": "This is a member of the citrus family; the smell of the leaves suggests citrus, too. I mentioned Murraya paniculata in the video. Little by little, these encounters connect different members of one family.", "视频比较同科植物的叶片与芳香。": "The video compares the leaves and scent of plants in the same family.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260123-01": {"绿色与蓝紫色果实同枝": "Green and blue-violet fruits on the same branch", "林下成丛的叶片": "A clump of leaves under the trees", "展开的花被片": "Tepals spread open", "成熟的蓝紫色浆果": "Ripe blue-violet berries", "花与黄色花药": "A flower with yellow anthers", "手边对照蓝紫色果实大小": "A hand beside the blue-violet fruits for scale", "果序与带状叶片": "A fruit cluster above strap-shaped leaves", "蓝紫色果实像挂在草丛里的小宝石。山菅兰名字里有“兰”，却不是兰科植物。": "Blue-violet fruits hang like jewels in the grass. This Dianella has lán, the Chinese word associated with orchids, in its name, but it doesn't belong to the orchid family.", "草丛里挂着小宝石": "Jewels among the grass", "山菅兰的果实成熟以后，变成特别醒目的蓝紫色。细枝上挂着一颗颗“小宝石”，一下子就把目光吸引过去了。\n漂亮归漂亮，不能因此尝它。鲜艳不代表可以食用，认识它的形态就好，不把这些果实当成野外零食。": "The ripe fruits are an arresting blue-violet. Each one hangs like a little jewel from a fine branch, and my eye goes straight to it.\nHowever pretty they look, the fruits shouldn't be tasted. Bright colours don't tell me something is edible. I'm here to learn their shape, not to gather a snack.", "山菅兰的果实成熟以后，变成特别醒目的蓝紫色。细枝上挂着一颗颗“小宝石”，一下子就把目光吸引过去了。": "The ripe fruits are an arresting blue-violet. Each one hangs like a little jewel from a fine branch, and my eye goes straight to it.", "漂亮归漂亮，不能因此尝它。鲜艳不代表可以食用，认识它的形态就好，不把这些果实当成野外零食。": "However pretty they look, the fruits shouldn't be tasted. Bright colours don't tell me something is edible. I'm here to learn their shape, not to gather a snack.", "像兰花，却不是兰花": "An orchid-like silhouette", "它的叶子细长，基部一层层重叠成鞘，整丛看上去确实有几分兰花的姿态。不过山菅兰并不属于兰科。\n在岭南的溪边、林下和山坡草丛，很容易碰到它。先记住宽长的叶片，再找到上方疏散的花果枝，就能把轮廓认出来。": "The leaves are long and narrow, their bases overlapping in sheaths. The whole clump does have something of the look of an orchid, though Dianella belongs to a different family.\nIt's easy to come across it beside streams, under trees and on grassy slopes in Lingnan. Look for the long blades, then for the open, branching spray of flowers or fruits above them. Together they give the plant its outline.", "它的叶子细长，基部一层层重叠成鞘，整丛看上去确实有几分兰花的姿态。不过山菅兰并不属于兰科。": "The leaves are long and narrow, their bases overlapping in sheaths. The whole clump does have something of the look of an orchid, though Dianella belongs to a different family.", "在岭南的溪边、林下和山坡草丛，很容易碰到它。先记住宽长的叶片，再找到上方疏散的花果枝，就能把轮廓认出来。": "It's easy to come across it beside streams, under trees and on grassy slopes in Lingnan. Look for the long blades, then for the open, branching spray of flowers or fruits above them. Together they give the plant its outline.", "低头的小花，也很精致": "Little flowers that bow their heads", "小花轻轻垂着，像铃铛。花被片展开以后，中间黄色的花药特别显眼，侧面又是另一种姿态。\n视频中还提到了园林里常见的银边山菅兰。带斑纹的叶子让人容易注意到，但这次在山里，普通绿叶旁的花与蓝果，已经足够好看。": "The flowers hang down gently like bells. Once the tepals spread, the yellow anthers stand out at the centre. From the side the flower takes on quite a different shape.\nI also mentioned the silver-edged Dianella often seen in landscaped gardens. The striped leaves catch the eye, but on this walk in the hills the flowers and blue fruits beside plain green leaves were more than enough.", "小花轻轻垂着，像铃铛。花被片展开以后，中间黄色的花药特别显眼，侧面又是另一种姿态。": "The flowers hang down gently like bells. Once the tepals spread, the yellow anthers stand out at the centre. From the side the flower takes on quite a different shape.", "视频中还提到了园林里常见的银边山菅兰。带斑纹的叶子让人容易注意到，但这次在山里，普通绿叶旁的花与蓝果，已经足够好看。": "I also mentioned the silver-edged Dianella often seen in landscaped gardens. The striped leaves catch the eye, but on this walk in the hills the flowers and blue fruits beside plain green leaves were more than enough.", "视频提及的斑叶园艺类型，未进一步确定栽培品种学名。": "A variegated horticultural form mentioned in the video. No cultivar name has been established.", "视频比较细长叶片与植株大小。": "Compared in the video for narrow leaves and overall size.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260210-01": {"成串果实与绿叶": "Strings of fruits with green leaves", "树干上的攀援藤本": "The vine climbing a tree trunk", "花序与叶片着生位置": "The points where the inflorescence and leaf attach", "叶片与果序": "A leaf and a fruiting spike", "穗状花序近看": "A flower spike up close", "弯曲果序上的黄色小果": "Small yellow fruits on a curved spike", "果实近看": "Fruits in close-up", "下垂的细长花序": "A long, slender, hanging inflorescence", "树干上攀着不起眼的绿藤，叶旁垂下一串串黄色小果。山蒟是胡椒的亲戚，也叫酒饼藤。": "An unassuming green vine climbs a tree trunk, with strings of little yellow fruits hanging beside its leaves. This pepper relative also has the local name jiǔbǐngténg.", "胡椒的亲戚，挂在树上": "A pepper relative in the trees", "岭南山里常见这条藤，也许见过很多次，却一直叫不出名字。它叫山蒟，属于胡椒属。\n黄色小果紧紧排成一串，有些地方叫它假胡椒。不过名字相似，并不意味着可以把它当胡椒使用。这次还记下了酒饼藤这个与地方利用有关的别名。": "This vine is common in the Lingnan hills. I could easily have passed it many times without knowing its name. It's shānjǔ, a member of the pepper genus.\nThe yellow fruits are packed into tight strings. In some places it's known as “false pepper”; that doesn't make it a substitute for pepper. I also noted the name jiǔbǐngténg, which reflects a local use.", "岭南山里常见这条藤，也许见过很多次，却一直叫不出名字。它叫山蒟，属于胡椒属。": "This vine is common in the Lingnan hills. I could easily have passed it many times without knowing its name. It's shānjǔ, a member of the pepper genus.", "黄色小果紧紧排成一串，有些地方叫它假胡椒。不过名字相似，并不意味着可以把它当胡椒使用。这次还记下了酒饼藤这个与地方利用有关的别名。": "The yellow fruits are packed into tight strings. In some places it's known as “false pepper”; that doesn't make it a substitute for pepper. I also noted the name jiǔbǐngténg, which reflects a local use.", "像毛毛虫的，是它的花序": "The little caterpillars are flower spikes", "还没有结出明显果实的枝条上，垂着一根根细长的小穗，像毛毛虫一样。这就是山蒟的穗状花序。\n每朵花都很小，许多小花排在一起，才形成了眼前这一条。看清它与叶片的位置，再对照果序，就能把花果接起来。": "On branches where no obvious fruits have formed, slender spikes hang down like little caterpillars. These are the inflorescences.\nEach flower is tiny; many are set together to make a single spike. I look at its position beside the leaf, then compare it with a cluster of fruits. Now I can connect the two stages.", "还没有结出明显果实的枝条上，垂着一根根细长的小穗，像毛毛虫一样。这就是山蒟的穗状花序。": "On branches where no obvious fruits have formed, slender spikes hang down like little caterpillars. These are the inflorescences.", "每朵花都很小，许多小花排在一起，才形成了眼前这一条。看清它与叶片的位置，再对照果序，就能把花果接起来。": "Each flower is tiny; many are set together to make a single spike. I look at its position beside the leaf, then compare it with a cluster of fruits. Now I can connect the two stages.", "顺着树干，一路向上": "Up the tree trunk", "山蒟是一种攀援藤本，茎节上能够长根，贴着树干、石面向上生长。林下光线不强，它的叶片仍然绿油油的。\n以前还认识过同属的假蒟。这一次，最先让我记住山蒟的，就是沿着树干攀上去的本领。下次爬山，再多看看这些不显眼的小藤。": "The vine can put out roots at its stem nodes and cling to tree trunks or rock as it climbs. Its leaves are glossy green even in the low light under the trees.\nI'd met another pepper vine, jiǎjǔ, before. What I'll remember first about this one is how it climbs a trunk. On my next walk I'll pay more attention to those easily overlooked vines.", "山蒟是一种攀援藤本，茎节上能够长根，贴着树干、石面向上生长。林下光线不强，它的叶片仍然绿油油的。": "The vine can put out roots at its stem nodes and cling to tree trunks or rock as it climbs. Its leaves are glossy green even in the low light under the trees.", "以前还认识过同属的假蒟。这一次，最先让我记住山蒟的，就是沿着树干攀上去的本领。下次爬山，再多看看这些不显眼的小藤。": "I'd met another pepper vine, jiǎjǔ, before. What I'll remember first about this one is how it climbs a trunk. On my next walk I'll pay more attention to those easily overlooked vines.", "视频提及此前观察的同属植物，以生长姿态作比较，未在本期资料中补定学名。": "A species of the same genus observed earlier, mentioned here to compare growth habit. No scientific name was established from the material for this video.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260602-01": {"细枝上的花序": "Flower clusters on slender twigs", "树冠叶片": "Leaves in the crown", "黄白色小花序": "Small yellow-white flower clusters", "天空下的疏散枝条": "Open branches against the sky", "树皮上的浅色皮孔": "Light-coloured lenticels on the bark", "花部近看": "Flower parts in close-up", "球形果实近看": "A round fruit in close-up", "掌中的小果实": "Small fruits in my palm", "嫩叶与结果枝条": "Young leaves and fruiting branches", "叶片旁的绿色果实": "Green fruits beside a leaf", "逆光下的开花枝条": "A flowering branch against the light", "像柠檬，又有一点辛香。山鸡椒的气味很难忘，花与果实则把几次山行串成了四季的记录。": "Lemony, with a little spice: this Litsea has an unforgettable scent. Its flowers and fruits have turned a series of walks into a record of the seasons.", "一闻，就很难忘": "A scent that stays with you", "山鸡椒的气味像柠檬、像香茅，又带一点辛香。对不少西南地区的人来说，这也是熟悉的木姜子味道。\n这期从木姜子油、酸汤这些生活记忆说起。有人特别喜欢，有人第一次闻觉得像香水掉进了菜里，这种鲜明的气味让它很容易被记住。": "The scent reminds me of lemon and lemongrass, with something spicy underneath. For many people in southwest China it's the familiar smell of mùjiāngzǐ.\nI began with memories of the oil and of sour soup. Some people love the flavour; to a newcomer it can seem as though perfume has fallen into the food. Either way, the plant is hard to forget.", "山鸡椒的气味像柠檬、像香茅，又带一点辛香。对不少西南地区的人来说，这也是熟悉的木姜子味道。": "The scent reminds me of lemon and lemongrass, with something spicy underneath. For many people in southwest China it's the familiar smell of mùjiāngzǐ.", "这期从木姜子油、酸汤这些生活记忆说起。有人特别喜欢，有人第一次闻觉得像香水掉进了菜里，这种鲜明的气味让它很容易被记住。": "I began with memories of the oil and of sour soup. Some people love the flavour; to a newcomer it can seem as though perfume has fallen into the food. Either way, the plant is hard to forget.", "小小的绿果，挂满枝头": "Branches full of little green fruits", "果实圆圆小小，一簇簇长在细梗上，远看确实让人想到胡椒粒。不过山鸡椒属于樟科，是樟树的亲戚。\n把镜头靠近，能看清每一颗果实怎样连着枝条。再退后看嫩绿的叶子，夏天的模样就出来了。": "The fruits are small and round, grouped on slender stalks. At a distance they do suggest peppercorns, but this tree belongs to the laurel family and is related to the camphor tree.\nClose up, I can follow each fruit to the branch that bears it. Step back to take in the fresh green leaves and the summer tree comes into view.", "果实圆圆小小，一簇簇长在细梗上，远看确实让人想到胡椒粒。不过山鸡椒属于樟科，是樟树的亲戚。": "The fruits are small and round, grouped on slender stalks. At a distance they do suggest peppercorns, but this tree belongs to the laurel family and is related to the camphor tree.", "把镜头靠近，能看清每一颗果实怎样连着枝条。再退后看嫩绿的叶子，夏天的模样就出来了。": "Close up, I can follow each fruit to the branch that bears it. Step back to take in the fresh green leaves and the summer tree comes into view.", "花比想象中更小": "Even smaller flowers than I'd imagined", "开花时，黄白色小花聚在细枝上。一朵朵靠近看，花被片显得厚厚的，还带一点透光的感觉。\n这次留下的照片里，既有满枝小花，也有后来结出的青果。几次经过同一种树，就能看到不同的面貌。": "When the tree is in flower, clusters of yellowish-white blooms dot the thin twigs. Up close, the tepals look thick, yet let a little light through.\nMy photographs show both branches full of flowers and the green fruits that came later. Passing the same kind of tree on different walks lets me see quite different faces of it.", "开花时，黄白色小花聚在细枝上。一朵朵靠近看，花被片显得厚厚的，还带一点透光的感觉。": "When the tree is in flower, clusters of yellowish-white blooms dot the thin twigs. Up close, the tepals look thick, yet let a little light through.", "这次留下的照片里，既有满枝小花，也有后来结出的青果。几次经过同一种树，就能看到不同的面貌。": "My photographs show both branches full of flowers and the green fruits that came later. Passing the same kind of tree on different walks lets me see quite different faces of it.", "同一株树，换着季节来看": "Visiting the same tree through the seasons", "我喜欢它四季不同的样子：花开、嫩叶长出、青果挂上枝头，之后叶子又渐渐落下。具体时间会随地方与天气变化，值得在自己的路线里持续记。\n树皮上的细小皮孔也留下了照片。花果最醒目，这些安静的细节，则帮我在没有花果的时候认回它。": "I like the succession: flowers, new leaves, green fruits on the branches, then leaves slowly falling. The timing changes with place and weather, which makes it worth keeping a record along my own walking routes.\nI photographed the small lenticels on the bark as well. Flowers and fruits are conspicuous; the quieter details help me recognise the tree when neither is there.", "我喜欢它四季不同的样子：花开、嫩叶长出、青果挂上枝头，之后叶子又渐渐落下。具体时间会随地方与天气变化，值得在自己的路线里持续记。": "I like the succession: flowers, new leaves, green fruits on the branches, then leaves slowly falling. The timing changes with place and weather, which makes it worth keeping a record along my own walking routes.", "树皮上的细小皮孔也留下了照片。花果最醒目，这些安静的细节，则帮我在没有花果的时候认回它。": "I photographed the small lenticels on the bark as well. Flowers and fruits are conspicuous; the quieter details help me recognise the tree when neither is there.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251003-01": {"访花昆虫停在花序上": "An insect resting on the flower spike", "花被片与花蕊近看": "Tepals and reproductive parts in close-up", "成丛叶片间的花序": "Flower spikes among the clumped leaves", "林下植株整体": "The plant in its woodland setting", "开放小花与花苞": "Open flowers and buds", "粉紫色小花穗": "A spike of pinkish-purple flowers", "山坡上的一丛细叶，举起粉紫色小花穗。山麦冬像山中的小精灵，也把一段插花记忆带了回来。": "A clump of narrow leaves on the hillside lifts spikes of pinkish-purple flowers. This Liriope looks like a little mountain sprite and brings back a memory of arranging flowers.", "草丛里，一穗穗紫色": "Purple spikes among the grass", "爬山时，杂草之间忽然出现一丛山麦冬。细长的叶子里举起蓝紫色花穗，清清雅雅，真的有一点山中精灵的感觉。\n它像兰花，却不是兰科植物。开花时尤其好认，沿着花穗一朵朵看，就能发现颜色深浅和开放状态的变化。": "On a mountain walk I suddenly spotted a clump of Liriope among the weeds. Spikes of blue-violet flowers rose from its slender leaves. It had such a delicate presence that I thought of a sprite in the hills.\nIt has the look of an orchid but belongs to a different family. It's particularly easy to recognise when flowering: follow a spike from flower to flower and you can see the colours and stages of opening change.", "爬山时，杂草之间忽然出现一丛山麦冬。细长的叶子里举起蓝紫色花穗，清清雅雅，真的有一点山中精灵的感觉。": "On a mountain walk I suddenly spotted a clump of Liriope among the weeds. Spikes of blue-violet flowers rose from its slender leaves. It had such a delicate presence that I thought of a sprite in the hills.", "它像兰花，却不是兰科植物。开花时尤其好认，沿着花穗一朵朵看，就能发现颜色深浅和开放状态的变化。": "It has the look of an orchid but belongs to a different family. It's particularly easy to recognise when flowering: follow a spike from flower to flower and you can see the colours and stages of opening change.", "小花展开，花蕊露出来": "When the little flowers open", "花被片展开后，黄色花蕊从中间显出来。还没开的花苞圆圆的，和开着的小花排在同一根花序上。\n这次还拍到一只来访的昆虫。小小一穗花，在镜头里看久了，原来一点也不安静。": "As the tepals spread, the yellow floral parts at the centre come into view. Round, unopened buds share a stalk with the open flowers.\nThis time I also photographed a visiting insect. Spend a while with the camera on one little spike and it turns out to be quite a busy place.", "花被片展开后，黄色花蕊从中间显出来。还没开的花苞圆圆的，和开着的小花排在同一根花序上。": "As the tepals spread, the yellow floral parts at the centre come into view. Round, unopened buds share a stalk with the open flowers.", "这次还拍到一只来访的昆虫。小小一穗花，在镜头里看久了，原来一点也不安静。": "This time I also photographed a visiting insect. Spend a while with the camera on one little spike and it turns out to be quite a busy place.", "花之后，还有叶子和冬日的期待": "Leaves now, and something to look for in winter", "不开花时，山麦冬就是一丛细细长长的叶。叶片自然弯曲，我曾把这样的叶子用在中式插花里，线条很好看。\n这次还记下了花后紫黑色的种子，以及与麦冬、沿阶草的比较。这次照片以花期为主，等到花后再来，就能把这一段接上。": "Out of flower, this Liriope is a clump of long, fine leaves. I once used leaves like these in Chinese flower arrangements; their natural curves make lovely lines.\nI also noted the purplish-black seeds that follow the flowers, and compared the plant with the related ones known as màidōng and yánjiēcǎo. Most of these photographs show it flowering. A return after flowering would let me pick up the story there.", "不开花时，山麦冬就是一丛细细长长的叶。叶片自然弯曲，我曾把这样的叶子用在中式插花里，线条很好看。": "Out of flower, this Liriope is a clump of long, fine leaves. I once used leaves like these in Chinese flower arrangements; their natural curves make lovely lines.", "这次还记下了花后紫黑色的种子，以及与麦冬、沿阶草的比较。这次照片以花期为主，等到花后再来，就能把这一段接上。": "I also noted the purplish-black seeds that follow the flowers, and compared the plant with the related ones known as màidōng and yánjiēcǎo. Most of these photographs show it flowering. A return after flowering would let me pick up the story there.", "视频列出的斑叶栽培品种。": "A variegated cultivar named in the video.", "视频用于比较的近似植物。": "A similar plant shown for comparison.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260407-01": {"大花的整体轮廓": "The outline of a large flower", "花被卷曲的边缘": "The curving edge of the perianth", "暗红色花纹特写": "Dark red markings in close-up", "巨花马兜铃 · 本期封面": "Aristolochia gigantea, cover photograph", "花背面膨大结构近看": "The swollen structure at the back of a flower", "逆光下的心形叶片": "A heart-shaped leaf against the light", "粗糙有棱的老茎": "A rough, ridged older stem", "藤架上的整株姿态": "The vine growing over its support", "花被的网状花纹": "The network of markings on the perianth", "花背面膨大的囊部": "The inflated pouch behind the flower", "藤架旁的花与叶": "Flowers and leaves beside the trellis", "棚架下悬垂的大花": "A large flower suspended beneath the trellis", "花正面中央的深色入口": "The dark central entrance, seen from the front", "暗红色大花像手帕，也像展开的蝴蝶。巨花马兜铃不是捕虫植物，奇特的花形与传粉有关。": "A dark red bloom suggests a handkerchief, or a butterfly with open wings. The flower's unusual shape has to do with pollination; this vine doesn't eat insects.", "这是花，不是猪笼草": "A flower on a vine", "不开花时，巨花马兜铃只是棚架上一条藤；一开花，就很难不注意它。有人说像胃、像肺，也有人觉得像一块大手帕。\n我倒觉得像展开的蝴蝶，或者一件暗红色袍子。它不是吃虫的猪笼草，眼前这一大片，确实是一朵花。": "Out of flower, this Aristolochia is simply a vine on a trellis. In flower, it's impossible to overlook. Some people see a stomach or lungs; others see a great handkerchief.\nTo me it looks like a butterfly with wings spread, or a dark red robe. It isn't a carnivorous pitcher plant. That great expanse really is one flower.", "不开花时，巨花马兜铃只是棚架上一条藤；一开花，就很难不注意它。有人说像胃、像肺，也有人觉得像一块大手帕。": "Out of flower, this Aristolochia is simply a vine on a trellis. In flower, it's impossible to overlook. Some people see a stomach or lungs; others see a great handkerchief.", "我倒觉得像展开的蝴蝶，或者一件暗红色袍子。它不是吃虫的猪笼草，眼前这一大片，确实是一朵花。": "To me it looks like a butterfly with wings spread, or a dark red robe. It isn't a carnivorous pitcher plant. That great expanse really is one flower.", "紫白色纹路，铺成一张大花被": "Dark red and pale lines across a single flower", "展开的花被上，紫红色与浅色纹路交织，凑近看更有层次。翻到背面，又能看见一个浅绿色、膨大的囊部。\n从正面、侧面到背面，这朵花的样子差别很大。只留一个角度，还真不容易看懂它。": "Deep reddish-purple and pale markings interlace across the open perianth. Up close there's more depth to the pattern. Look around the back and there's a pale green, swollen pouch.\nThe front, side and back give such different views that a single photograph could scarcely explain the shape.", "展开的花被上，紫红色与浅色纹路交织，凑近看更有层次。翻到背面，又能看见一个浅绿色、膨大的囊部。": "Deep reddish-purple and pale markings interlace across the open perianth. Up close there's more depth to the pattern. Look around the back and there's a pale green, swollen pouch.", "从正面、侧面到背面，这朵花的样子差别很大。只留一个角度，还真不容易看懂它。": "The front, side and back give such different views that a single photograph could scarcely explain the shape.", "一间与传粉有关的小房间": "A little chamber for pollination", "视频中讲到马兜铃类花的陷阱式传粉：昆虫进入花筒后，会暂时受到内部结构限制，之后带着花粉离开。它借助昆虫传粉，并不把昆虫当食物消化。\n这次没有连续观察到昆虫进出的全过程；眼前的花形和入口，已经让人很好奇。": "In the video I talked about trap pollination in Aristolochia. An insect that enters the flower tube can be detained for a time by its internal structures, then leave carrying pollen. The insect is a pollinator; the flower doesn't digest it.\nI didn't watch an insect enter and leave from beginning to end on this occasion. The shape of the flower and its entrance have certainly made me curious.", "视频中讲到马兜铃类花的陷阱式传粉：昆虫进入花筒后，会暂时受到内部结构限制，之后带着花粉离开。它借助昆虫传粉，并不把昆虫当食物消化。": "In the video I talked about trap pollination in Aristolochia. An insect that enters the flower tube can be detained for a time by its internal structures, then leave carrying pollen. The insect is a pollinator; the flower doesn't digest it.", "这次没有连续观察到昆虫进出的全过程；眼前的花形和入口，已经让人很好奇。": "I didn't watch an insect enter and leave from beginning to end on this occasion. The shape of the flower and its entrance have certainly made me curious.", "大花旁边，是清清爽爽的心形叶": "Heart-shaped leaves beside those extraordinary flowers", "看惯了暗红色大花，再看旁边心形的绿叶，感觉一下子清新起来。叶脉透着光，层层叠叠地爬在架上。\n老茎却很粗糙，带着纵向的棱。一边是柔软叶片，一边是有力量的木质藤茎，这才是巨花马兜铃完整的样子。": "After looking at the dark red flowers, the heart-shaped green leaves feel wonderfully fresh. Light shines through their veins as they climb over the trellis in layers.\nThe old stems are rough and ridged lengthwise. The soft leaf blades and the strong woody stems belong together; both are part of the vine I've come to see.", "看惯了暗红色大花，再看旁边心形的绿叶，感觉一下子清新起来。叶脉透着光，层层叠叠地爬在架上。": "After looking at the dark red flowers, the heart-shaped green leaves feel wonderfully fresh. Light shines through their veins as they climb over the trellis in layers.", "老茎却很粗糙，带着纵向的棱。一边是柔软叶片，一边是有力量的木质藤茎，这才是巨花马兜铃完整的样子。": "The old stems are rough and ridged lengthwise. The soft leaf blades and the strong woody stems belong together; both are part of the vine I've come to see.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260616-01": {"叶心积存的水": "Water pooled in the centre of the rosette", "叶片表面的纹理": "Texture on the leaf surface", "向四周展开的厚叶": "Thick leaves spreading outwards", "柱头与花药近看": "Stigma and anthers in close-up", "莲座状叶丛": "Rosette of leaves", "花序分枝与绿色苞片": "Inflorescence branches and green bracts", "花序上的苞片排列": "Arrangement of bracts on the inflorescence", "高高伸出的花序": "Tall inflorescence rising above the foliage", "白色花朵与伸出的花蕊": "White flowers with protruding reproductive parts", "白花中心的花蕊": "Reproductive parts at the centre of a white flower", "巨大的莲座中，伸出高高的花序。帝王凤梨的气场来自体量，也来自叶心里那一池水。": "A towering inflorescence rises from an enormous rosette. This bromeliad owes its presence both to its size and to the pool of water at its heart.", "这株植物，气场很强": "A plant with real presence", "第一次看见帝王凤梨，我想到的是一座巨大的莲座雕塑。厚叶一圈圈向外展开，开花时又把长长的花序举到头顶上方。\n现场工作人员说，这几株已经培育了十四年。看着眼前的体量，再想想它们生长的时间，确实很壮观。": "The first time I saw this bromeliad, I thought of a huge sculpture in the shape of a rosette. Its thick leaves fan out in rings, and when it flowers the long flowering shoot rises above my head.\nStaff told me that these particular plants had been grown here for fourteen years. Their size was impressive enough; thinking about the time it took made them more so.", "第一次看见帝王凤梨，我想到的是一座巨大的莲座雕塑。厚叶一圈圈向外展开，开花时又把长长的花序举到头顶上方。": "The first time I saw this bromeliad, I thought of a huge sculpture in the shape of a rosette. Its thick leaves fan out in rings, and when it flowers the long flowering shoot rises above my head.", "现场工作人员说，这几株已经培育了十四年。看着眼前的体量，再想想它们生长的时间，确实很壮观。": "Staff told me that these particular plants had been grown here for fourteen years. Their size was impressive enough; thinking about the time it took made them more so.", "走近，才看清一朵花": "Up close to a single flower", "远处看到的是整簇巨大的花序，走近以后，白色小花从绿色苞片间伸出来，花瓣细长，花蕊也清清楚楚。\n花上还挂着液滴。原来那个很有力量感的轮廓，近看又有这样轻巧的细节。": "From a distance I see one huge inflorescence. Up close, little white flowers reach out from between green bracts. The petals are long and slender, and I can make out the reproductive parts clearly.\nDroplets hang from the flowers. For a plant with such a commanding outline, there are some remarkably delicate details.", "远处看到的是整簇巨大的花序，走近以后，白色小花从绿色苞片间伸出来，花瓣细长，花蕊也清清楚楚。": "From a distance I see one huge inflorescence. Up close, little white flowers reach out from between green bracts. The petals are long and slender, and I can make out the reproductive parts clearly.", "花上还挂着液滴。原来那个很有力量感的轮廓，近看又有这样轻巧的细节。": "Droplets hang from the flowers. For a plant with such a commanding outline, there are some remarkably delicate details.", "叶子围出一个小水池": "A pool made of leaves", "顺着厚厚的叶片往中心看，叶心真的存着水。层层叠叠的叶片把雨水接住，形成一处小小的水池。\n叶面还能看到细细的鳞片。这些结构与吸收水分有关，也让叶片有一种带粉的质感。": "Follow the thick leaves inward: there really is water at the centre. Overlapping leaves catch the rain and form a little pool.\nI can also see fine scales on the leaf surfaces. They help the plant take up water and give the leaves a powdery texture.", "顺着厚厚的叶片往中心看，叶心真的存着水。层层叠叠的叶片把雨水接住，形成一处小小的水池。": "Follow the thick leaves inward: there really is water at the centre. Overlapping leaves catch the rain and form a little pool.", "叶面还能看到细细的鳞片。这些结构与吸收水分有关，也让叶片有一种带粉的质感。": "I can also see fine scales on the leaf surfaces. They help the plant take up water and give the leaves a powdery texture.", "开花之后，还会继续生长吗？": "What grows on after flowering?", "开花的母株会逐渐衰老，旁边的新芽继续生长。眼前这次盛大的开花，也是它生命过程中的一个阶段。\n它和我们吃的菠萝同属凤梨科。我最想记住的，还是那一圈展开如裙摆的叶子。": "After flowering, the mother plant gradually declines; new shoots beside it keep growing. This magnificent display marks one stage in its life.\nIt's in the same family as the pineapple we eat. What I most want to remember is that ring of leaves spreading like the hem of a skirt.", "开花的母株会逐渐衰老，旁边的新芽继续生长。眼前这次盛大的开花，也是它生命过程中的一个阶段。": "After flowering, the mother plant gradually declines; new shoots beside it keep growing. This magnificent display marks one stage in its life.", "它和我们吃的菠萝同属凤梨科。我最想记住的，还是那一圈展开如裙摆的叶子。": "It's in the same family as the pineapple we eat. What I most want to remember is that ring of leaves spreading like the hem of a skirt.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260501-01": {"树干与新芽": "Trunk and new buds", "透光的嫩叶与叶脉": "Light shining through a young leaf and its veins", "对生叶片": "Opposite leaves", "小簇果实近看": "A small cluster of fruits in close-up", "果序背面的枝梗": "Stalks behind the fruit cluster", "灌木上的多簇果实": "Several fruit clusters on the shrub", "结果枝条整体": "The whole fruiting branch", "叶间成簇的蓝色果实": "Clusters of blue fruits among the leaves", "密集的果序": "Dense fruiting cluster", "手边对照果序大小": "Fruiting cluster beside a hand for scale", "果实表面细节": "Fruit surface in close-up", "蓝色果实与顶端宿存萼": "Blue fruits with persistent calyces at their tips", "绿叶间的一簇电光蓝，像青金石，也像一排小纽扣。靠近常山，先把这抹蓝看清楚。": "Electric blue among the green: the fruits look like lapis lazuli or a row of little buttons. I step closer to get a better look at the colour.", "蓝得有点不真实": "A blue that's almost hard to believe", "在梧桐山看到常山的果实，我总觉得像一簇青金石。那种蓝在绿叶衬托下特别明显，有一点电光般的感觉。\n路过时也听见有人把它叫成蓝莓。认识这种差别很重要，不能因为颜色好看就摘来尝。": "When I see this Hydrangea in fruit on Wutong Mountain, it always reminds me of a cluster of lapis lazuli. The blue stands out against the green leaves with an almost electric brilliance.\nI've heard people walking past call the fruits blueberries. The distinction matters. A beautiful colour is no reason to pick one and taste it.", "在梧桐山看到常山的果实，我总觉得像一簇青金石。那种蓝在绿叶衬托下特别明显，有一点电光般的感觉。": "When I see this Hydrangea in fruit on Wutong Mountain, it always reminds me of a cluster of lapis lazuli. The blue stands out against the green leaves with an almost electric brilliance.", "路过时也听见有人把它叫成蓝莓。认识这种差别很重要，不能因为颜色好看就摘来尝。": "I've heard people walking past call the fruits blueberries. The distinction matters. A beautiful colour is no reason to pick one and taste it.", "每颗果子上，都有一枚小纽扣": "A little button on each fruit", "再往近处看，果实顶端有凹凸的小圈，像扣上了一枚纽扣。这是花后保留下来的萼部结构。\n同一簇果实里，大小和颜色略有不同；换个角度，枝梗怎样把它们托起来，也能看得清楚。": "At close range there's a raised, uneven ring at the tip of each fruit, like a button fastened there. It's part of the calyx, left over from flowering.\nIn one cluster the fruits differ a little in size and colour. A change of angle shows how the branching stalks support them.", "再往近处看，果实顶端有凹凸的小圈，像扣上了一枚纽扣。这是花后保留下来的萼部结构。": "At close range there's a raised, uneven ring at the tip of each fruit, like a button fastened there. It's part of the calyx, left over from flowering.", "同一簇果实里，大小和颜色略有不同；换个角度，枝梗怎样把它们托起来，也能看得清楚。": "In one cluster the fruits differ a little in size and colour. A change of angle shows how the branching stalks support them.", "关于蓝色，先留下一个问题": "A question about that colour", "视频中讨论了这抹蓝是否与色素和微观结构共同有关。仅凭这组照片，无法分辨它们各自的作用，因此这里先保留实际观察到的颜色和光泽。\n为什么这么蓝，是值得继续查证的问题；而一簇簇果实在光线下的变化，已经足够让人看很久。": "In the video I wondered whether pigments and microscopic structure both contribute to this blue. These photographs can't tell me how much each contributes, so for now I'm recording the colour and sheen I actually saw.\nWhy the blue is so intense is a question to pursue. Meanwhile the changing appearance of the fruit clusters in different light is enough to keep me looking.", "视频中讨论了这抹蓝是否与色素和微观结构共同有关。仅凭这组照片，无法分辨它们各自的作用，因此这里先保留实际观察到的颜色和光泽。": "In the video I wondered whether pigments and microscopic structure both contribute to this blue. These photographs can't tell me how much each contributes, so for now I'm recording the colour and sheen I actually saw.", "为什么这么蓝，是值得继续查证的问题；而一簇簇果实在光线下的变化，已经足够让人看很久。": "Why the blue is so intense is a question to pursue. Meanwhile the changing appearance of the fruit clusters in different light is enough to keep me looking.", "从果实，认回整株常山": "Getting to know the plant beyond its fruit", "常山属于绣球科，花也会一小朵一小朵聚成簇。眼前照片主要记录果期，枝上的对生叶片和明显叶脉，也很值得看。\n它长成灌木或小乔木的样子，花果量却不少。记住叶子和枝条，下次没有蓝果的时候，也能试着把它认回来。": "Chángshān belongs to the hydrangea family. Its flowers, too, gather in clusters of individual little blooms. These photographs mainly show the fruiting stage, but the opposite leaves and conspicuous veins on the branches deserve a look.\nIt grows as a shrub or small tree and can bear plenty of flowers and fruits. If I remember the leaves and branches, perhaps I'll recognise it next time without the blue fruits to help.", "常山属于绣球科，花也会一小朵一小朵聚成簇。眼前照片主要记录果期，枝上的对生叶片和明显叶脉，也很值得看。": "Chángshān belongs to the hydrangea family. Its flowers, too, gather in clusters of individual little blooms. These photographs mainly show the fruiting stage, but the opposite leaves and conspicuous veins on the branches deserve a look.", "它长成灌木或小乔木的样子，花果量却不少。记住叶子和枝条，下次没有蓝果的时候，也能试着把它认回来。": "It grows as a shrub or small tree and can bear plenty of flowers and fruits. If I remember the leaves and branches, perhaps I'll recognise it next time without the blue fruits to help.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260106-01": {"成簇的白色头状花序": "Clusters of white flower heads", "花序与花苞": "Inflorescence and buds", "带冠毛的小果实": "Small fruits with a pappus", "开花枝条": "Flowering branch", "微甘菊叶片、花序和冠毛果实手绘": "Drawing of Mikania micrantha: leaves, flower heads and fruits with pappus", "白色小花近看": "Small white flowers in close-up", "看似安静的一片白花，已经盖住了原本想看的灌木。认识微甘菊，也要看见它与周围植物的关系。": "A seemingly quiet patch of white flowers has covered the shrub I came back to see. To get to know Mikania, I need to look at what's growing underneath it.", "想看的果子，已经被盖住了": "The fruits I came to see were under a vine", "上一次来，还在拍这里的野牡丹花，想着下次可以看看果实。再来时，枝叶却已经被另一种藤本盖住，很难找到原来的样子。\n覆盖在上面的，就是微甘菊。远看是一片白花，近看才意识到，它正在占据周围植物的空间。": "Last time I was here, I photographed the flowers of a Melastoma and thought I'd come back to see the fruits. On my return another plant had covered its branches and leaves. I could hardly make out the shrub I'd seen before.\nThe vine on top was Mikania. From a distance I saw a patch of white flowers; only close up did I realise how much of its neighbours' space it was taking.", "上一次来，还在拍这里的野牡丹花，想着下次可以看看果实。再来时，枝叶却已经被另一种藤本盖住，很难找到原来的样子。": "Last time I was here, I photographed the flowers of a Melastoma and thought I'd come back to see the fruits. On my return another plant had covered its branches and leaves. I could hardly make out the shrub I'd seen before.", "覆盖在上面的，就是微甘菊。远看是一片白花，近看才意识到，它正在占据周围植物的空间。": "The vine on top was Mikania. From a distance I saw a patch of white flowers; only close up did I realise how much of its neighbours' space it was taking.", "花很小，数量却很多": "So many tiny flowers", "微甘菊属于菊科，白色小花聚成头状花序，许多花序又挤在枝端。逆光时，这一片白确实很好看。\n我一边赞叹花的样子，一边担心它的蔓延。看清一种植物，也包括看清它对环境的影响。": "Mikania is a member of the daisy family. Tiny white florets form flower heads, and many heads crowd together at the ends of the branches. Seen against the light, all that white is undeniably lovely.\nI can admire the flowers and still worry about how far the vine is spreading. Observing a plant means paying attention to its effect on the plants around it, too.", "微甘菊属于菊科，白色小花聚成头状花序，许多花序又挤在枝端。逆光时，这一片白确实很好看。": "Mikania is a member of the daisy family. Tiny white florets form flower heads, and many heads crowd together at the ends of the branches. Seen against the light, all that white is undeniably lovely.", "我一边赞叹花的样子，一边担心它的蔓延。看清一种植物，也包括看清它对环境的影响。": "I can admire the flowers and still worry about how far the vine is spreading. Observing a plant means paying attention to its effect on the plants around it, too.", "小伞一张开，就能随风走": "Little parasols ready for the wind", "花后的小果实带着冠毛，像缩小的蒲公英。单独放近看，一根根细毛展开成一把小伞。\n再想想它柔软、能攀援的茎，就能理解为什么这种植物如此容易扩展。下一次看见林边一片白花，我也会留意下面原本生长着什么。": "Each tiny fruit carries a tuft of hairs, like a dandelion in miniature. Up close the individual hairs spread into a little parasol.\nAdd those wind-borne fruits to the supple climbing stems and it's easier to see how readily the plant can spread. The next time I see white flowers along the edge of a wood, I'll look to see what was growing underneath them.", "花后的小果实带着冠毛，像缩小的蒲公英。单独放近看，一根根细毛展开成一把小伞。": "Each tiny fruit carries a tuft of hairs, like a dandelion in miniature. Up close the individual hairs spread into a little parasol.", "再想想它柔软、能攀援的茎，就能理解为什么这种植物如此容易扩展。下一次看见林边一片白花，我也会留意下面原本生长着什么。": "Add those wind-borne fruits to the supple climbing stems and it's easier to see how readily the plant can spread. The next time I see white flowers along the edge of a wood, I'll look to see what was growing underneath them.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260908-01": {"一串逐渐变红的果实": "A fruit cluster gradually turning red", "向外展开的小叶": "Leaflets spreading outwards", "树冠整体": "The entire crown", "手边的一串红色果实": "A bunch of red fruits beside a hand", "结果枝条": "Fruiting branch", "水滴状果实与掌状复叶": "Droplet-shaped fruits and palmately compound leaves", "贵州路边遇见一串红色小水滴。抬头看看果实，再低头数数叶片，掌叶木的名字就有了形状。": "On a roadside in Guizhou I came upon a string of little red droplets. Look up at the fruits, then down to count the leaflets, and the Chinese name of this tree begins to take shape.", "红色小水滴，挂在路边": "Red droplets by the road", "在贵州走路时，先看到树上挂着红色的小东西，像一串水滴。走近一看，原来是掌叶木。\n果实正在变红，底部圆一些，上面细一些，又有点像小梨子。风吹动时，仿佛能听见叮叮当当的声音。": "Walking in Guizhou, I noticed little red things hanging from a tree like a string of water droplets. A closer look showed me it was zhǎngyèmù.\nThe fruits were turning red. Broader and rounder below, narrower above, they had something of the shape of little pears. As they moved in the wind I could almost hear them chime.", "在贵州走路时，先看到树上挂着红色的小东西，像一串水滴。走近一看，原来是掌叶木。": "Walking in Guizhou, I noticed little red things hanging from a tree like a string of water droplets. A closer look showed me it was zhǎngyèmù.", "果实正在变红，底部圆一些，上面细一些，又有点像小梨子。风吹动时，仿佛能听见叮叮当当的声音。": "The fruits were turning red. Broader and rounder below, narrower above, they had something of the shape of little pears. As they moved in the wind I could almost hear them chime.", "把绿色手掌张开": "A green hand opens", "它的几片小叶从同一个位置向外伸展，很像张开的手掌，所以名字特别形象。\n这次边看边数，常见五片，也找到了六片、七片的叶。一个名字里，仍然藏着不少具体的变化，值得再看一眼。": "Several leaflets spread from a single point, just like a hand opening. Zhǎng refers to the palm of a hand, which makes the Chinese name wonderfully descriptive.\nI counted as I went. Five leaflets were common, but I found leaves with six and seven as well. Even a name that fits so well leaves room for variations worth a second look.", "它的几片小叶从同一个位置向外伸展，很像张开的手掌，所以名字特别形象。": "Several leaflets spread from a single point, just like a hand opening. Zhǎng refers to the palm of a hand, which makes the Chinese name wonderfully descriptive.", "这次边看边数，常见五片，也找到了六片、七片的叶。一个名字里，仍然藏着不少具体的变化，值得再看一眼。": "I counted as I went. Five leaflets were common, but I found leaves with six and seven as well. Even a name that fits so well leaves room for variations worth a second look.", "在山林里，把它好好留下": "Leaving the tree in the hills", "掌叶木生长在我国西南的石灰岩山地。成熟果实会裂开，露出种子。这次照片里，主要还是尚未开裂的红果。\n遇见这样的树很幸运。把果实、叶片和整株树形拍下来，继续让它留在原来的地方生长，就是这次相遇最好的纪念。": "This tree grows in the limestone hills of southwest China. Its ripe fruits split to reveal the seeds. In this set of photographs, most of the red fruits were still closed.\nI felt lucky to meet a tree like this. I photographed the fruits, leaves and outline of the whole tree and left it growing where I'd found it. That's the keepsake I wanted from this encounter.", "掌叶木生长在我国西南的石灰岩山地。成熟果实会裂开，露出种子。这次照片里，主要还是尚未开裂的红果。": "This tree grows in the limestone hills of southwest China. Its ripe fruits split to reveal the seeds. In this set of photographs, most of the red fruits were still closed.", "遇见这样的树很幸运。把果实、叶片和整株树形拍下来，继续让它留在原来的地方生长，就是这次相遇最好的纪念。": "I felt lucky to meet a tree like this. I photographed the fruits, leaves and outline of the whole tree and left it growing where I'd found it. That's the keepsake I wanted from this encounter.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250905-01": {"展开的白色小花": "Small white flowers fully open", "花序侧面": "Inflorescence viewed from the side", "茎上的纵向棱": "Lengthwise ridges on the stem", "白花与黄色杯状结构": "White flowers and yellow cup-like structures", "花苞与初开的小花": "Buds and newly opened flowers", "白色小星星之间，摆着黄色小杯子。接骨草的花序，让一面路边的绿墙变得格外热闹。": "Little yellow cups sit among white stars. The flower clusters of this Sambucus have brought a roadside wall of greenery to life.", "这一面绿墙，好热闹": "A lively green wall", "在大理，看到一面由落葵薯和接骨草组成的绿墙。第一次见到这么多接骨草一起开花，白色一片，很漂亮。\n它还有陆英、八棱麻等名字。我喜欢“陆英”的读音，看着花轻轻晃动，总会想到落英缤纷，不过这只是自己的联想。": "In Dali I found a wall covered in Madeira vine and this Sambucus. It was the first time I'd seen so many of the latter flowering together: a lovely sweep of white.\nAmong its Chinese names are lùyīng and bāléngmá. I like the sound of lùyīng. Watching the flowers sway always reminds me of an expression for fallen petals drifting everywhere, though that's just my own association.", "在大理，看到一面由落葵薯和接骨草组成的绿墙。第一次见到这么多接骨草一起开花，白色一片，很漂亮。": "In Dali I found a wall covered in Madeira vine and this Sambucus. It was the first time I'd seen so many of the latter flowering together: a lovely sweep of white.", "它还有陆英、八棱麻等名字。我喜欢“陆英”的读音，看着花轻轻晃动，总会想到落英缤纷，不过这只是自己的联想。": "Among its Chinese names are lùyīng and bāléngmá. I like the sound of lùyīng. Watching the flowers sway always reminds me of an expression for fallen petals drifting everywhere, though that's just my own association.", "小星星之间，摆着小杯子": "Little cups among the stars", "花序里有两种醒目的模样：白色小花展开五个裂片，像星星；旁边黄色杯状的不育花结构，像一只只小杯子。\n这些杯状结构能够分泌蜜液，吸引访花昆虫。我最喜欢的，正是白色和黄色疏疏散散排在一起的样子。": "Two shapes catch my eye in each cluster. The little white flowers open into five star-like lobes. Beside them, yellow structures formed by sterile flowers look like tiny cups.\nThe cups can secrete nectar that attracts visiting insects. What I like most is the loose arrangement of white and yellow together.", "花序里有两种醒目的模样：白色小花展开五个裂片，像星星；旁边黄色杯状的不育花结构，像一只只小杯子。": "Two shapes catch my eye in each cluster. The little white flowers open into five star-like lobes. Beside them, yellow structures formed by sterile flowers look like tiny cups.", "这些杯状结构能够分泌蜜液，吸引访花昆虫。我最喜欢的，正是白色和黄色疏疏散散排在一起的样子。": "The cups can secrete nectar that attracts visiting insects. What I like most is the loose arrangement of white and yellow together.", "顺着茎，看看八棱麻的名字": "The ridges on the stem", "往下看，茎表面有清楚的纵向棱，八棱麻这个名字就有了依据。叶片是羽状复叶，小叶边缘带齿，揉碎时的气味也给我留下了深刻印象。\n这次拍摄在八月，与所查资料里的花期不完全一致。地点和环境都可能影响物候，先把本次观察记下来，留待以后继续比较。": "Lower down I can see distinct ridges running the length of the stem. They help explain bāléngmá, a Chinese name that refers to eight ridges. The leaves are pinnately compound, with toothed leaflets; their smell when crushed also made a lasting impression on me.\nI filmed the plant in August, which doesn't quite match the flowering period I found in the literature. Place and growing conditions can affect the timing. I'll keep this observation as a point of comparison for future visits.", "往下看，茎表面有清楚的纵向棱，八棱麻这个名字就有了依据。叶片是羽状复叶，小叶边缘带齿，揉碎时的气味也给我留下了深刻印象。": "Lower down I can see distinct ridges running the length of the stem. They help explain bāléngmá, a Chinese name that refers to eight ridges. The leaves are pinnately compound, with toothed leaflets; their smell when crushed also made a lasting impression on me.", "这次拍摄在八月，与所查资料里的花期不完全一致。地点和环境都可能影响物候，先把本次观察记下来，留待以后继续比较。": "I filmed the plant in August, which doesn't quite match the flowering period I found in the literature. Place and growing conditions can affect the timing. I'll keep this observation as a point of comparison for future visits.", "本期视频中与接骨草共同组成路边绿墙。": "Shown growing alongside the featured plant in the green wall of vegetation by the road.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript", "中国植物志：接骨草相关描述": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae: description of 接骨草", "神农本草经（原文稿提及）": "Shennong Bencao Jing, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260623-01": {"单朵花侧面": "Single flower from the side", "花朵正面与唇瓣": "Front view of the flower and its lip", "疏散排列的花与花苞": "Loosely spaced flowers and buds", "林下植株整体": "The whole plant beneath the trees", "蕨丛里的花序": "Inflorescence emerging among ferns", "花序中段": "Middle of the inflorescence", "不同开放状态的花": "Flowers at different stages of opening", "一片蕨丛里，几根没有绿叶的花序忽然出现。第一次在野外遇见无叶美冠兰，连逆光里的花瓣都想多看一会儿。": "Several flower stalks with no green leaves rose suddenly from a patch of ferns. It was my first encounter with this leafless orchid in the wild, and I couldn't resist lingering over the backlit petals.", "蕨丛里，发现了两位新朋友": "Two new acquaintances among the ferns", "路上走着走着，在一片蕨里面发现了无叶美冠兰。这是我第一次在野外碰到它，而且一下遇见两株。\n没有一丛绿叶托着，只见花序从林下伸出来，黄褐色的花在周围的绿叶中格外明显。": "On my walk I came upon this Eulophia growing among ferns. It was the first time I'd encountered it in the wild, and here were two plants at once.\nNo clump of green leaves supported them. Flower stalks rose straight from the woodland floor, the yellow-brown flowers standing out against the surrounding foliage.", "路上走着走着，在一片蕨里面发现了无叶美冠兰。这是我第一次在野外碰到它，而且一下遇见两株。": "On my walk I came upon this Eulophia growing among ferns. It was the first time I'd encountered it in the wild, and here were two plants at once.", "没有一丛绿叶托着，只见花序从林下伸出来，黄褐色的花在周围的绿叶中格外明显。": "No clump of green leaves supported them. Flower stalks rose straight from the woodland floor, the yellow-brown flowers standing out against the surrounding foliage.", "没有绿叶，养分从哪里来？": "Without green leaves, where does its nourishment come from?", "无叶美冠兰依靠与真菌的联系获得养分，属于菌异养植物。过去常说的“腐生兰”，容易让人以为它直接吸收腐烂落叶；理解它与真菌的关系，才更接近实际。\n脚下厚厚的落叶，周围阴凉潮湿的环境，都让这次相遇有了具体的背景。": "The orchid obtains nutrients through its association with fungi. The term for this is mycoheterotrophy. The older description “saprophytic orchid” can suggest that it feeds directly on decaying leaves, overlooking the role of the fungi.\nThere was a thick litter of fallen leaves underfoot, in a damp, shady stretch of woodland. That's the setting in which I'll remember finding it.", "无叶美冠兰依靠与真菌的联系获得养分，属于菌异养植物。过去常说的“腐生兰”，容易让人以为它直接吸收腐烂落叶；理解它与真菌的关系，才更接近实际。": "The orchid obtains nutrients through its association with fungi. The term for this is mycoheterotrophy. The older description “saprophytic orchid” can suggest that it feeds directly on decaying leaves, overlooking the role of the fungi.", "脚下厚厚的落叶，周围阴凉潮湿的环境，都让这次相遇有了具体的背景。": "There was a thick litter of fallen leaves underfoot, in a damp, shady stretch of woodland. That's the setting in which I'll remember finding it.", "逆着光，花瓣好通透": "Backlit, the petals seem translucent", "花朵带着黄褐色，唇瓣上又有红褐和浅黄色。我尤其喜欢逆光时的样子，花被片轻轻透亮，很有精神。\n凑近闻，气味与印象中清甜的兰花香不同。这一回先把相遇记下来，下一次经过，还想再来看看这两株兰。": "The flowers are yellowish brown, with reddish brown and pale yellow on the lip. I especially like them against the light: the tepals let a little light through and seem full of life.\nUp close the scent was quite unlike the sweet orchid fragrance I had in mind. For now I'll record the encounter. Next time I pass, I'd like to look in on these two orchids again.", "花朵带着黄褐色，唇瓣上又有红褐和浅黄色。我尤其喜欢逆光时的样子，花被片轻轻透亮，很有精神。": "The flowers are yellowish brown, with reddish brown and pale yellow on the lip. I especially like them against the light: the tepals let a little light through and seem full of life.", "凑近闻，气味与印象中清甜的兰花香不同。这一回先把相遇记下来，下一次经过，还想再来看看这两株兰。": "Up close the scent was quite unlike the sweet orchid fragrance I had in mind. For now I'll record the encounter. Next time I pass, I'd like to look in on these two orchids again.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251031-01": {"浅粉色重瓣花": "Pale pink double flower", "阳光下的粉色重瓣花": "Pink double flower in sunlight", "花朵与掌状裂叶": "Flower and palmately lobed leaves", "单瓣花与花蕊": "Single flower and its reproductive parts", "白色、粉色、深粉色，木芙蓉让一棵树上有了好几种心情。单瓣和重瓣，也各有模样。": "White, pink and deep rose give a single hibiscus tree several different moods. Single and double flowers each have a character of their own.", "这一朵，也会慢慢喝醉吗？": "Will this flower blush as it opens?", "木芙蓉因花色随开放过程变化而有名，“三醉芙蓉”这个名字很形象。视频中记下了从偏白到粉色、再到深粉色的变化。\n一树粉白相间，确实让人看得有些陶醉。这组照片保留了不同花色，没有把不同花朵拼成同一朵的连续变化。": "This hibiscus is known for changing colour as its flowers open. One Chinese name evokes a hibiscus getting tipsy three times over. In the video I recorded the change from whitish to pink to deep rose.\nThe mixture of white and pink on one tree is rather intoxicating in its own right. These photographs show flowers of different colours; they don't claim to follow one individual bloom through all those changes.", "木芙蓉因花色随开放过程变化而有名，“三醉芙蓉”这个名字很形象。视频中记下了从偏白到粉色、再到深粉色的变化。": "This hibiscus is known for changing colour as its flowers open. One Chinese name evokes a hibiscus getting tipsy three times over. In the video I recorded the change from whitish to pink to deep rose.", "一树粉白相间，确实让人看得有些陶醉。这组照片保留了不同花色，没有把不同花朵拼成同一朵的连续变化。": "The mixture of white and pink on one tree is rather intoxicating in its own right. These photographs show flowers of different colours; they don't claim to follow one individual bloom through all those changes.", "单瓣和重瓣，都在这里": "Single and double, both in reach", "这次很巧，一边看到重瓣，另一边又找到单瓣。单瓣花中心的蕊柱更容易看清，花瓣基部还有深色区域。\n旁边鼓鼓的花苞也很大。看盛开的花，再看等着打开的花苞，一枝上就有不同阶段。": "As luck would have it, I found double flowers on one side and single ones on the other. In the single flowers the central column of stamens is easier to see. There's also a darker patch at the base of the petals.\nThe plump buds nearby are large, too. On one branch I can compare an open flower with a bud still waiting to unfold.", "这次很巧，一边看到重瓣，另一边又找到单瓣。单瓣花中心的蕊柱更容易看清，花瓣基部还有深色区域。": "As luck would have it, I found double flowers on one side and single ones on the other. In the single flowers the central column of stamens is easier to see. There's also a darker patch at the base of the petals.", "旁边鼓鼓的花苞也很大。看盛开的花，再看等着打开的花苞，一枝上就有不同阶段。": "The plump buds nearby are large, too. On one branch I can compare an open flower with a bud still waiting to unfold.", "从花，看到整棵木芙蓉": "From the flowers to the whole tree", "叶片常有掌状裂片，叶脉明显，长叶柄把叶子举起来，风吹时像在打招呼。\n在深圳能看到它开很长一段时间。这期还聊到成都的蓉城之名、花的传统用途和带毛蒴果；这次照片先留下最鲜明的花与叶。": "The leaves are often palmately lobed, with clear veins. Long stalks hold them up, and in the wind they seem to wave hello.\nIn Shenzhen I see this hibiscus flowering over quite a long period. I also spoke about Chengdu's nickname, the Hibiscus City, about traditional uses of the flowers, and about the hairy capsules. These photographs record the most conspicuous features first: flowers and leaves.", "叶片常有掌状裂片，叶脉明显，长叶柄把叶子举起来，风吹时像在打招呼。": "The leaves are often palmately lobed, with clear veins. Long stalks hold them up, and in the wind they seem to wave hello.", "在深圳能看到它开很长一段时间。这期还聊到成都的蓉城之名、花的传统用途和带毛蒴果；这次照片先留下最鲜明的花与叶。": "In Shenzhen I see this hibiscus flowering over quite a long period. I also spoke about Chengdu's nickname, the Hibiscus City, about traditional uses of the flowers, and about the hairy capsules. These photographs record the most conspicuous features first: flowers and leaves.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260303-01": {"花朵与绿叶": "Flowers and green leaves", "成片开花的植株": "A patch of plants in bloom", "花冠内部的深色纹路": "Dark markings inside the corolla", "叶缘与叶脉": "Leaf margin and veins", "叶间浅紫色花": "Pale purple flowers among the leaves", "直立花序": "Upright inflorescence", "花冠筒侧面": "Corolla tube in side view", "路边淡紫色的小花，背后连着蓝染的故事。板蓝的“蓝”，从一片绿叶开始。": "Pale violet flowers by the roadside have a place in the story of indigo dye. For this plant the blue begins with a green leaf.", "从一片绿叶，说到蓝色": "How a green leaf leads to blue", "板蓝是一种传统蓝染植物。视频中讲到叶片中的前体物质经过处理、氧化，生成靛蓝，一片绿叶就与布上的蓝色连在了一起。\n知道这层关系后，再在路边遇到它，感觉很奇妙：安安静静的一株植物，原来参与了那么长的生活历史。": "This Strobilanthes has a long history as an indigo dye plant. In the video I talked about precursor compounds in the leaves: with processing and oxidation they yield indigo. That's how a green leaf becomes connected to the blue on a piece of cloth.\nKnowing that, I find it quite extraordinary to meet it again at the roadside: an unassuming plant with such a long part in people's lives.", "板蓝是一种传统蓝染植物。视频中讲到叶片中的前体物质经过处理、氧化，生成靛蓝，一片绿叶就与布上的蓝色连在了一起。": "This Strobilanthes has a long history as an indigo dye plant. In the video I talked about precursor compounds in the leaves: with processing and oxidation they yield indigo. That's how a green leaf becomes connected to the blue on a piece of cloth.", "知道这层关系后，再在路边遇到它，感觉很奇妙：安安静静的一株植物，原来参与了那么长的生活历史。": "Knowing that, I find it quite extraordinary to meet it again at the roadside: an unassuming plant with such a long part in people's lives.", "名字相似，也要看清是哪一种": "Similar names, different dye plants", "视频中把南板蓝与俗称北板蓝的菘蓝放在一起讨论。名称相似，实际是不同的植物，不能把它们的分类和用途混在一起。\n眼前板蓝的叶片较大，叶脉明显，边缘有齿。先把这些细节认清楚，再回到名字，就不容易绕晕。": "I discussed this southern indigo plant alongside woad, often called “northern indigo” in Chinese. The names are similar, but the plants differ. Their classifications and uses shouldn't be mixed up.\nThe plant in front of me has fairly large leaves with prominent veins and toothed margins. Once I've looked at those details, the names are a good deal less confusing.", "视频中把南板蓝与俗称北板蓝的菘蓝放在一起讨论。名称相似，实际是不同的植物，不能把它们的分类和用途混在一起。": "I discussed this southern indigo plant alongside woad, often called “northern indigo” in Chinese. The names are similar, but the plants differ. Their classifications and uses shouldn't be mixed up.", "眼前板蓝的叶片较大，叶脉明显，边缘有齿。先把这些细节认清楚，再回到名字，就不容易绕晕。": "The plant in front of me has fairly large leaves with prominent veins and toothed margins. Once I've looked at those details, the names are a good deal less confusing.", "淡紫色花里，有几道深色线": "Dark lines inside pale violet flowers", "直立的花序上，淡紫色花冠一朵朵打开。花冠内部的深色纹路非常清楚，侧面则能看到长长的花筒。\n同属爵床科的喜花草、叉花草，也在此前的观察里出现过。看着相近的结构，再找各自不同的细节，慢慢就能把它们串起来。": "Pale violet corollas open one by one on upright flowering spikes. Their inner surfaces have clear dark markings; from the side I can see the long floral tube.\nTwo other members of the acanthus family, Eranthemum pulchellum and Strobilanthes hamiltoniana, turned up in earlier observations. Looking for a shared structure and then for each plant's particular details helps me make the connections.", "直立的花序上，淡紫色花冠一朵朵打开。花冠内部的深色纹路非常清楚，侧面则能看到长长的花筒。": "Pale violet corollas open one by one on upright flowering spikes. Their inner surfaces have clear dark markings; from the side I can see the long floral tube.", "同属爵床科的喜花草、叉花草，也在此前的观察里出现过。看着相近的结构，再找各自不同的细节，慢慢就能把它们串起来。": "Two other members of the acanthus family, Eranthemum pulchellum and Strobilanthes hamiltoniana, turned up in earlier observations. Looking for a shared structure and then for each plant's particular details helps me make the connections.", "视频中称北板蓝，用于说明同名药材对应不同植物；本页不据此补定其学名。": "The video calls it běibǎnlán (北板蓝) to illustrate how plants sold under a single medicinal name can differ. No scientific name is assigned here.", "视频中称可爱花，作为爵床科植物比较。": "The video calls it kěàihuā (可爱花) and uses it for comparison within the acanthus family.", "视频提及的同科植物。": "Another member of the same family mentioned in the video.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20251121-01": {"成熟果实表面纹路": "Markings on the surface of a ripe fruit", "构棘枝叶与果实手绘": "Drawing of Maclura cochinchinensis: branches, leaves and fruits", "带果的细枝与叶片": "A slender fruiting twig and its leaves", "手边观察成熟果实": "Ripe fruit beside a hand", "不同成熟阶段的果实": "Fruits at different stages of ripeness", "果内的小核果": "Small drupelets inside the fruit", "尚未成熟的聚花果": "Immature multiple fruit", "构棘 · 本期封面": "Maclura cochinchinensis · video cover", "橙色果实表面像拼着龟裂的纹路。构棘的果子柔软，枝上的刺却很有存在感。": "The surface of the orange fruit has a pattern like a mosaic of fine cracks. The fruit is soft, but the thorns on the branches make a rather different impression.", "一颗带着龟裂花纹的小果": "A little fruit patterned with cracks", "构棘的果实表面满是拼接般的纹路，从青绿转成橙红，像一件小小的老物件。甚至觉得，认识它就像认识恐龙一样。\n轻轻触碰时表面有柔软感，还会渗出白色乳汁。它属于桑科，眼前这一团是许多小果共同形成的聚花果。": "The fruits of this Maclura have a surface of neatly fitted patches, turning from green to orange-red. Each looks like a tiny ancient object. Getting to know it even put me in mind of getting to know a dinosaur.\nThe surface feels soft to a light touch and exudes white latex. The plant belongs to the mulberry family, and what looks like one fruit is a multiple fruit made up of many smaller ones.", "构棘的果实表面满是拼接般的纹路，从青绿转成橙红，像一件小小的老物件。甚至觉得，认识它就像认识恐龙一样。": "The fruits of this Maclura have a surface of neatly fitted patches, turning from green to orange-red. Each looks like a tiny ancient object. Getting to know it even put me in mind of getting to know a dinosaur.", "轻轻触碰时表面有柔软感，还会渗出白色乳汁。它属于桑科，眼前这一团是许多小果共同形成的聚花果。": "The surface feels soft to a light touch and exudes white latex. The plant belongs to the mulberry family, and what looks like one fruit is a multiple fruit made up of many smaller ones.", "里面还藏着许多小颗粒": "Many little units inside", "这次观察留下了气味和口感的联想：菠萝、菠萝蜜、草莓，又带一点淡淡奶香。打开后，里面能找到一颗颗小核果。\n照片把这些内部结构也留下了。不同成熟阶段排在一根枝上时，外面的颜色变化同样好看。": "Its smell and texture brought pineapple, jackfruit and strawberry to mind, with a faint milky note. Open the fruit and you can pick out the small individual drupes inside.\nI photographed those inner structures as well. When several stages of ripeness occur on a single branch, the changing colours outside are just as lovely.", "这次观察留下了气味和口感的联想：菠萝、菠萝蜜、草莓，又带一点淡淡奶香。打开后，里面能找到一颗颗小核果。": "Its smell and texture brought pineapple, jackfruit and strawberry to mind, with a faint milky note. Open the fruit and you can pick out the small individual drupes inside.", "照片把这些内部结构也留下了。不同成熟阶段排在一根枝上时，外面的颜色变化同样好看。": "I photographed those inner structures as well. When several stages of ripeness occur on a single branch, the changing colours outside are just as lovely.", "看着柔软的果，长在带刺的枝上": "Soft fruits on thorny branches", "构棘是攀援状灌木，枝条向旁边伸展，很有韧性。这次靠近时还被刺扎了一下，才真切记住了它。\n它还有穿破石、柘藤等别名。沿着果子往回看整条枝，才能把这株善于攀爬、又带着刺的植物认完整。": "This Maclura is a climbing shrub with tough branches that stretch out to the sides. A thorn pricked me as I leaned closer this time, which certainly helped fix it in my memory.\nIts other Chinese names include chuānpòshí and zhèténg. Follow a fruit back along its whole branch and you begin to see the plant in full: soft fruit, sharp thorns and a good climber.", "构棘是攀援状灌木，枝条向旁边伸展，很有韧性。这次靠近时还被刺扎了一下，才真切记住了它。": "This Maclura is a climbing shrub with tough branches that stretch out to the sides. A thorn pricked me as I leaned closer this time, which certainly helped fix it in my memory.", "它还有穿破石、柘藤等别名。沿着果子往回看整条枝，才能把这株善于攀爬、又带着刺的植物认完整。": "Its other Chinese names include chuānpòshí and zhèténg. Follow a fruit back along its whole branch and you begin to see the plant in full: soft fruit, sharp thorns and a good climber.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260512-01": {"花心柱头近看": "A close look at the stigma in the centre.", "风车状展开的花冠": "The open corolla with its pinwheel shape.", "栀子 · 本期封面": "Gardenia, cover image.", "逐渐变黄的花": "A flower turning yellow.", "果实顶端的宿存萼": "The persistent calyx at the tip of the fruit.", "绿色花苞": "Green flower bud", "数朵白花": "Several white flowers", "开花枝条": "Flowering branch", "橙色有棱果实": "Orange fruit with prominent ribs.", "未开放的花苞": "An unopened flower bud", "多枚果实与宿存萼": "Several fruits with persistent calyces", "花序与新叶": "Inflorescence and new leaves", "枝头橙红色果实": "Orange-red fruits on the branches", "叶间白花": "White flower among leaves", "白色花冠正面": "Front view of the white corolla", "一边是橙红色、有棱的小果，一边是白色的小风车。两段观察，把栀子的花香与颜色接了起来。": "A ribbed orange-red fruit on one visit, a white pinwheel on another. Between them, I got to know the colour and scent of the gardenia.", "橙红小果，头上带着小爪子": "Little claws on an orange-red fruit", "先认识的是栀子果。橙红色的果实有棱有角，顶端还留着绿色萼片，像几只小爪子。\n这期从果实谈到了天然黄色染料。捏开后显出的黄色，把一颗山间小果与日常用色联系了起来。": "I met the fruit first. The orange-red fruit has pronounced ridges, with green sepals still perched on top like little claws.\nIn this video I followed the fruit into the story of a natural yellow dye. When I squeezed it open, the colour inside connected this little fruit on a mountain to the colours we use in daily life.", "先认识的是栀子果。橙红色的果实有棱有角，顶端还留着绿色萼片，像几只小爪子。": "I met the fruit first. The orange-red fruit has pronounced ridges, with green sepals still perched on top like little claws.", "这期从果实谈到了天然黄色染料。捏开后显出的黄色，把一颗山间小果与日常用色联系了起来。": "In this video I followed the fruit into the story of a natural yellow dye. When I squeezed it open, the colour inside connected this little fruit on a mountain to the colours we use in daily life.", "后来，白色小风车开了": "The white pinwheels finally opened", "等到花开，再来认识栀子。白色花冠厚厚的，有蜡质感，展开后带一点旋转的样子，像小风车。\n我一直喜欢它的香气，浓郁却又清雅。一到夏天，空气里出现这个味道，就知道附近可能有栀子开花。": "I came back when it flowered. The white corolla is thick and waxy. When it opens, its slight twist makes it look like a little pinwheel.\nI’ve always liked the scent: rich and yet delicate. When I catch it on a summer day, I start looking for a gardenia in flower nearby.", "等到花开，再来认识栀子。白色花冠厚厚的，有蜡质感，展开后带一点旋转的样子，像小风车。": "I came back when it flowered. The white corolla is thick and waxy. When it opens, its slight twist makes it look like a little pinwheel.", "我一直喜欢它的香气，浓郁却又清雅。一到夏天，空气里出现这个味道，就知道附近可能有栀子开花。": "I’ve always liked the scent: rich and yet delicate. When I catch it on a summer day, I start looking for a gardenia in flower nearby.", "走近花心，看那个小锤子": "A little hammer at the heart of the flower", "花心的柱头像一把小锤子，周围能找到细长的花药。视频中记录了花上来访的小昆虫，也留下了花药姿态为何如此的疑问。\n这些疑问继续保留，不把现场猜想写成已经确定的传粉结论。先把看见的结构拍清楚。": "At the centre, the stigma looks like a little hammer, with slender anthers around it. I filmed small insects visiting the flowers and wondered why the anthers sat at that particular angle.\nI’ll leave that as a question rather than draw a conclusion about pollination from this visit. For now, I wanted a clear shot of the parts I could see.", "花心的柱头像一把小锤子，周围能找到细长的花药。视频中记录了花上来访的小昆虫，也留下了花药姿态为何如此的疑问。": "At the centre, the stigma looks like a little hammer, with slender anthers around it. I filmed small insects visiting the flowers and wondered why the anthers sat at that particular angle.", "这些疑问继续保留，不把现场猜想写成已经确定的传粉结论。先把看见的结构拍清楚。": "I’ll leave that as a question rather than draw a conclusion about pollination from this visit. For now, I wanted a clear shot of the parts I could see.", "花瓣下面，原来连成了一段筒": "Follow the petals down into a tube", "乍看花冠裂片分开，往下却连在一起，是合瓣的结构。换到侧面看，这段花冠筒就很明显。\n有的花已经由白变黄，逐渐衰老。把花苞、白花和黄花一起看，能找到开放过程的几个片段。": "The lobes of the corolla look separate at first glance, but lower down they join into one piece. From the side the tube is easy to see.\nSome ageing flowers had already turned from white to yellow. Buds, white flowers and yellow ones together gave me glimpses of several stages of flowering.", "乍看花冠裂片分开，往下却连在一起，是合瓣的结构。换到侧面看，这段花冠筒就很明显。": "The lobes of the corolla look separate at first glance, but lower down they join into one piece. From the side the tube is easy to see.", "有的花已经由白变黄，逐渐衰老。把花苞、白花和黄花一起看，能找到开放过程的几个片段。": "Some ageing flowers had already turned from white to yellow. Buds, white flowers and yellow ones together gave me glimpses of several stages of flowering.", "花与果，是两次相遇的同一条线": "Two encounters, one plant", "这次记录从果实说到花期。最初遗憾没有拍到的花，后来终于补上了。\n从橙红果实到白色花冠，再等下一批果实长出来。同一株熟悉的植物，也总有可以继续看的地方。": "This record begins with fruit and comes back at flowering time. I finally got to photograph the flowers I’d missed on my first visit.\nFrom orange-red fruit to white corollas, and then the wait for the next crop. Even on a familiar plant there’s always something more to see.", "这次记录从果实说到花期。最初遗憾没有拍到的花，后来终于补上了。": "This record begins with fruit and comes back at flowering time. I finally got to photograph the flowers I’d missed on my first visit.", "从橙红果实到白色花冠，再等下一批果实长出来。同一株熟悉的植物，也总有可以继续看的地方。": "From orange-red fruit to white corollas, and then the wait for the next crop. Even on a familiar plant there’s always something more to see.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20251024-01": {"成熟的紫黑色果实": "Ripe purple-black fruit.", "五片花瓣与金黄色花蕊": "Five petals and golden reproductive parts", "花蕊近看": "A close view of the floral parts.", "打开果实观察果肉与种子": "The fruit opened to show the flesh and seeds.", "粉色花与叶片": "Pink flower and leaves", "稔子，是许多人记忆里的山间小果。桃金娘的果实低调，花里的金色细丝却十分灿烂。": "Many people remember rénzi as a little fruit from the hills. The fruit of Rhodomyrtus tomentosa is easily overlooked, but the golden threads in its flowers are quite dazzling.", "山里的稔子，原来叫桃金娘": "The rénzi of the hills", "稔子、岗稔、山稔子，说的都是许多人熟悉的桃金娘。成熟果实带着灰灰的紫黑色，低调地藏在枝叶之间。\n童年的记忆，从山间摘果一直延伸到把多余果实留作别的用途。小小一颗果实，连着的是熟悉的山路。": "Rénzi, gǎngrěn and shānrěnzǐ are all names for this familiar shrub. Its ripe fruits are a muted, greyish purple-black, tucked among the leaves.\nI remember picking them in the hills as a child, and putting the extra fruit aside for other uses. A single fruit brings back a whole stretch of familiar mountain path.", "稔子、岗稔、山稔子，说的都是许多人熟悉的桃金娘。成熟果实带着灰灰的紫黑色，低调地藏在枝叶之间。": "Rénzi, gǎngrěn and shānrěnzǐ are all names for this familiar shrub. Its ripe fruits are a muted, greyish purple-black, tucked among the leaves.", "童年的记忆，从山间摘果一直延伸到把多余果实留作别的用途。小小一颗果实，连着的是熟悉的山路。": "I remember picking them in the hills as a child, and putting the extra fruit aside for other uses. A single fruit brings back a whole stretch of familiar mountain path.", "小提壶里，装着许多种子": "A little jug full of seeds", "细看果实，外形有点像带着口沿的小提壶，表面有柔和的绒感。打开以后，软软的果肉里藏着许多小种子。\n和山里那些亮红色果实相比，它的颜色并不张扬，认熟以后才更容易从叶间发现。": "Up close, a fruit looks something like a little jug with a rim. Its surface has a soft down. Inside, the flesh is soft too, and packed with small seeds.\nIt’s much less conspicuous than the bright red berries that also grow in these hills. Once you know its colour, it becomes easier to spot among the leaves.", "细看果实，外形有点像带着口沿的小提壶，表面有柔和的绒感。打开以后，软软的果肉里藏着许多小种子。": "Up close, a fruit looks something like a little jug with a rim. Its surface has a soft down. Inside, the flesh is soft too, and packed with small seeds.", "和山里那些亮红色果实相比，它的颜色并不张扬，认熟以后才更容易从叶间发现。": "It’s much less conspicuous than the bright red berries that also grow in these hills. Once you know its colour, it becomes easier to spot among the leaves.", "花瓣落了，金色细丝更清楚": "Once the petals fall, the golden threads stand out", "花也很好看，五片粉紫色花瓣围着许多金黄色雄蕊。小时候曾拿花做小花束，但花瓣容易掉，反而让里面细细的花丝更显眼。\n旁边的叶子对生，几条主脉很清楚，叶背颜色较浅。把花、果和叶连在一起，就是眼前这株桃金娘。": "The flower is lovely: five pinkish-purple petals surround a crowd of golden stamens. As a child I used to make little bouquets of them. The petals fell off easily, which made the fine filaments stand out even more.\nThe leaves grow in opposite pairs, several main veins are clearly visible, and the undersides are paler. Flower, fruit and leaves together give me a picture of the shrub in front of me.", "花也很好看，五片粉紫色花瓣围着许多金黄色雄蕊。小时候曾拿花做小花束，但花瓣容易掉，反而让里面细细的花丝更显眼。": "The flower is lovely: five pinkish-purple petals surround a crowd of golden stamens. As a child I used to make little bouquets of them. The petals fell off easily, which made the fine filaments stand out even more.", "旁边的叶子对生，几条主脉很清楚，叶背颜色较浅。把花、果和叶连在一起，就是眼前这株桃金娘。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs, several main veins are clearly visible, and the undersides are paler. Flower, fruit and leaves together give me a picture of the shrub in front of me.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250829-01": {"梧桐叶片、花与果实手绘": "Drawing of Firmiana simplex: leaves, flowers and fruits", "伸到树干前方的一丛果枝。": "A cluster of fruiting shoots extends in front of the trunk.", "梧桐 · 本期封面": "Wútóng, cover image.", "树林中的梧桐树冠和果序。": "The canopy and fruit clusters of Firmiana simplex in woodland.", "几片绿色掌状裂叶在枝条上舒展开。": "Green, palmately lobed leaves spread along a branch.", "仰头看金黄色的梧桐树冠。": "Looking up at the golden crown of Firmiana simplex.", "叶柄在枝梢相接，近处可见棕色芽。": "Leaf stalks meet at the shoot tip; a brown bud is visible in front.", "隔着宽大的叶片仰看树冠。": "Looking up into the canopy past broad leaves.", "阳光透过暖黄色的叶幕。": "Sunlight filters through the warm yellow canopy.", "枝头展开的果壳": "Fruit shells open on the branches.", "从树下向上看纸片般展开的果瓣。": "Looking up from below at the fruit valves, opened like sheets of paper.", "从道路旁看一株叶色转黄的梧桐。": "A roadside view of the tree as its foliage turns yellow.", "从林下看叶片与浅色果瓣在树冠不同位置交错。": "From below, leaves and pale fruit valves overlap at different heights in the crown.", "退后看，几串果实挂在树冠中。": "From a little farther back, clusters of fruits can be seen hanging in the crown.", "枝头的掌状叶片已呈黄色和橙色。": "Palm-shaped leaves on the branches have turned yellow and orange.", "浅绿色枝条横穿叶丛，枝上有明显的节。": "A pale green shoot crosses the leaves; its nodes stand out clearly.", "细枝上尚未完全展开的果实在亮天空前勾出轮廓。": "Not quite open, the fruits on a slender twig stand out against the bright sky.", "细碎花序在大叶片的上方伸展。": "Sprays of tiny flowers extend above the large leaves.", "浅褐色的果瓣悬在绿色叶片上方。": "Light brown fruit valves hang above green leaves.", "树冠间的果实": "Fruit among the branches of the crown.", "满枝果壳像小鸟，也像小船。八月站在梧桐树下，先看看种子怎样坐在船边。": "The fruit shells covering the branches look like little birds, or little boats. Standing beneath a wútóng tree in August, I first noticed the seeds sitting along the gunwales.", "满树小鸟，在等凤凰吗？": "Little birds in the branches, waiting for a phoenix?", "八月抬头看梧桐，满枝都是果实。远远看去，像一只只探头向外的小鸟，我忍不住想到那些与凤凰有关的故事。\n这里的梧桐属于锦葵科，和日常俗称“法国梧桐”的悬铃木类植物不同，认名字时要分清。": "I looked up in August and found the branches laden with fruit. From a distance they looked like little birds poking their heads out. I couldn’t help thinking of stories about the phoenix.\nThis wútóng belongs to the mallow family. The plane trees commonly called “French wútóng” in Chinese are different trees, despite the similar name.", "八月抬头看梧桐，满枝都是果实。远远看去，像一只只探头向外的小鸟，我忍不住想到那些与凤凰有关的故事。": "I looked up in August and found the branches laden with fruit. From a distance they looked like little birds poking their heads out. I couldn’t help thinking of stories about the phoenix.", "这里的梧桐属于锦葵科，和日常俗称“法国梧桐”的悬铃木类植物不同，认名字时要分清。": "This wútóng belongs to the mallow family. The plane trees commonly called “French wútóng” in Chinese are different trees, despite the similar name.", "果壳展开，变成一叶小船": "A shell opens into a boat", "梧桐的蓇葖果会在种子成熟前开裂，展开后像小船，也像汤勺。圆圆的种子排在边缘，很有辨识度。\n一簇簇挂在树上，风一吹，仿佛许多小船一起摇起来。这个季节最让我着迷的，就是这些轻巧的果壳。": "Each follicle splits before the seeds ripen. Opened out, it’s shaped like a little boat, or the bowl of a spoon. The round seeds are easy to recognise, arranged right along the edge.\nThe fruit hangs in clusters. A breath of wind sets a whole flotilla rocking. Of everything on this tree in August, those light little shells held my attention the longest.", "梧桐的蓇葖果会在种子成熟前开裂，展开后像小船，也像汤勺。圆圆的种子排在边缘，很有辨识度。": "Each follicle splits before the seeds ripen. Opened out, it’s shaped like a little boat, or the bowl of a spoon. The round seeds are easy to recognise, arranged right along the edge.", "一簇簇挂在树上，风一吹，仿佛许多小船一起摇起来。这个季节最让我着迷的，就是这些轻巧的果壳。": "The fruit hangs in clusters. A breath of wind sets a whole flotilla rocking. Of everything on this tree in August, those light little shells held my attention the longest.", "树荫里，再记住叶子和树皮": "Leaves and bark in the shade", "抬头看树荫，宽大的掌状裂叶一片搭着一片。再把目光放低一点，枝条是青绿色的，“青桐”这个名字便有了颜色。\n深圳八月很晒，站在这把大伞下特别舒服。同一篇里再看看果瓣和转黄的树冠，就能把眼前这片绿色和另一季的梧桐连起来。": "Overhead, the broad, palmately lobed leaves overlapped to make a canopy. Lower down, the branches were green, and suddenly the local name qīngtóng, “green tóng”, had a colour to go with it.\nThe August sun is strong in Shenzhen. Standing under this great umbrella felt wonderful. The open fruit and the yellowing crown elsewhere in the record connect the green in front of me with another season on the same tree.", "抬头看树荫，宽大的掌状裂叶一片搭着一片。再把目光放低一点，枝条是青绿色的，“青桐”这个名字便有了颜色。": "Overhead, the broad, palmately lobed leaves overlapped to make a canopy. Lower down, the branches were green, and suddenly the local name qīngtóng, “green tóng”, had a colour to go with it.", "深圳八月很晒，站在这把大伞下特别舒服。同一篇里再看看果瓣和转黄的树冠，就能把眼前这片绿色和另一季的梧桐连起来。": "The August sun is strong in Shenzhen. Standing under this great umbrella felt wonderful. The open fruit and the yellowing crown elsewhere in the record connect the green in front of me with another season on the same tree.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260807-01": {"枝头果实与叶片": "Fruit and leaves on the branches", "蓝天下的果实": "Fruit against a blue sky", "树冠中的果实": "Fruit in the canopy", "化橘红切片与茶汤": "Dried slices of Huàjǔhóng and the resulting infusion.", "果皮表面的细绒毛": "The fine down on the peel.", "橘红化州柚 · 本期封面": "Huazhou pomelo, cover image.", "成簇悬挂的果实": "Clusters of hanging fruits", "植株整体": "The whole plant", "手边对照果实大小": "A hand beside the fruit for scale.", "长着细绒毛的柚子，连着化橘红的故事。凑近看果皮，再闻闻晒干后的那股柑橘香。": "A fine down on a pomelo connects it to the story of Huàjǔhóng. I leaned in to look at the peel, then smelled the citrus fragrance of a dried slice.", "你见过长毛的柚子吗？": "Have you seen a fuzzy pomelo?", "化州柚表面有一层细绒毛，刚看到时，容易误以为是别的东西附在上面。近看才发现，那就是果皮本身的样子。\n它与橘子、柠檬一样属于柑橘家族，也是化橘红的原料植物。名字里的“橘”，并不表示这份材料来自普通橘子。": "The Huazhou pomelo has a fine down on its surface. At first I thought something might be stuck to it. A closer look showed me that the fuzz was part of the peel itself.\nLike mandarins and lemons, this is a citrus fruit. Its peel is the source of a material called Huàjǔhóng. Although the Chinese name includes the character for mandarin, ordinary mandarins are not the source of this particular material.", "化州柚表面有一层细绒毛，刚看到时，容易误以为是别的东西附在上面。近看才发现，那就是果皮本身的样子。": "The Huazhou pomelo has a fine down on its surface. At first I thought something might be stuck to it. A closer look showed me that the fuzz was part of the peel itself.", "它与橘子、柠檬一样属于柑橘家族，也是化橘红的原料植物。名字里的“橘”，并不表示这份材料来自普通橘子。": "Like mandarins and lemons, this is a citrus fruit. Its peel is the source of a material called Huàjǔhóng. Although the Chinese name includes the character for mandarin, ordinary mandarins are not the source of this particular material.", "这一次，主角是外面那层皮": "This time the peel gets the attention", "平时看柚子，总惦记着里面的果肉；认识化州柚时，我却把注意力放在了厚厚的果皮上。\n果实挂满枝头，有的大，有的小。用手在旁边比一比，再退后看看整株，才感觉到它们的体量。": "When I look at a pomelo, I usually think about the pulp inside. With this one it was the thick peel that caught my eye.\nThe branches were laden with fruit, some large and some small. I held my hand beside one for scale, then stepped back to look at the whole tree. Only then did I get a sense of their size.", "平时看柚子，总惦记着里面的果肉；认识化州柚时，我却把注意力放在了厚厚的果皮上。": "When I look at a pomelo, I usually think about the pulp inside. With this one it was the thick peel that caught my eye.", "果实挂满枝头，有的大，有的小。用手在旁边比一比，再退后看看整株，才感觉到它们的体量。": "The branches were laden with fruit, some large and some small. I held my hand beside one for scale, then stepped back to look at the whole tree. Only then did I get a sense of their size.", "从树上，走到一片干燥切片": "From a tree to a dried slice", "晒干后的材料有明显的柑橘香气，切片泡开后，茶汤带着金黄色。这是熟悉的岭南生活片段。\n从毛茸茸的青果，到桌上的一片切片，外形变化很大，但闻到那股香气，又能把两者联系起来。": "The dried material had a distinct citrus fragrance. Steeping a slice made a golden infusion, a familiar sight in Lingnan.\nThe fuzzy green fruit and the slice on the table look very different, yet one breath of that scent brings them together again.", "晒干后的材料有明显的柑橘香气，切片泡开后，茶汤带着金黄色。这是熟悉的岭南生活片段。": "The dried material had a distinct citrus fragrance. Steeping a slice made a golden infusion, a familiar sight in Lingnan.", "从毛茸茸的青果，到桌上的一片切片，外形变化很大，但闻到那股香气，又能把两者联系起来。": "The fuzzy green fruit and the slice on the table look very different, yet one breath of that scent brings them together again.", "文稿对应Citrus maxima；保留素材名称，未据中文名推定变种或栽培品种等级。": "The manuscript corresponds to Citrus maxima. Its Chinese name is retained as supplied; no variety or cultivar rank has been inferred from that name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260605-01": {"菌盖逐渐展开": "The cap gradually opening.", "从白色菌盖到黑色液滴，记录一朵蘑菇逐渐自溶的过程。": "From a white cap to droplets of black liquid, I followed a mushroom as it slowly dissolved.", "毛头鬼伞": "Máotóu guǐsǎn (毛头鬼伞)", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "Species Fungorum · 英国皇家植物园邱园": "Species Fungorum · Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew", "鸡腿菇": "Jītuǐgū (鸡腿菇), literally “chicken drumstick mushroom”", "路边捡的蘑菇居然能当墨水，真的写出字来了": "I wrote with ink from a roadside mushroom, and it worked", "自溶": "Autodigestion", "菌盖": "Mushroom cap", "手绘": "Nature sketch", "这个蘑菇，会自己化成“墨水”": "A mushroom that turns itself into ink", "我把它的黑色液体收集起来，写了一行字，真的写出来了。它叫毛头鬼伞，也叫鸡腿菇。雨后在路边、草地，常能见到它。\n不过，它最有趣的，不只是长什么样子，而是它会慢慢“消失”。": "I collected some of its black liquid and wrote a line with it. It worked! The mushroom is called máotóu guǐsǎn in Chinese, or jītuǐgū. You often see it in grass or beside roads after rain.\nIts appearance is only part of what interests me. This mushroom slowly disappears.", "一只毛茸茸的“鸡腿”": "A shaggy little “drumstick”", "没开伞的时候，白白的，还有点可爱。一根白色菌柄，上面顶着一个长长的菌盖，表面裂成一层一层的毛状鳞片。\n乍一看，真的有点像毛茸茸的鸡腿。这也是我观察它时特别想留下来的细节。": "Before the cap opens, it’s white and rather endearing. Above the white stem sits a long cap with layers of shaggy scales where its surface has split.\nAt first glance it really does look like a fuzzy chicken drumstick. That was a detail I particularly wanted to record.", "从白色，到墨黑": "From white to inky black", "一旦开伞，菌盖边缘慢慢变黑、卷起，颜色从白色到灰色，再到墨黑。结构逐渐分解，变成像墨汁一样的液体，一点点往下流。\n这个过程叫自溶。黑色液体里包含孢子和分解的有机物。看，真的好黑啊。": "As the cap opens, its margin slowly darkens and curls. White gives way to grey and then to inky black. The tissue breaks down into liquid that trickles from the cap.\nThis is autodigestion. The black liquid contains spores and broken-down organic matter. Look how dark it is!", "写下来的字，也在变化": "Even the writing changes", "那我之前写的那行字呢？再看，已经开始变淡了。这些“墨水”还会继续分解、变化，并不会像日常书写用的墨水一样稳定。\n它确实让我写出了字，但这一行字，也和这朵蘑菇一样，还在变化。": "What about the line I wrote? When I looked again it had already begun to fade. This “ink” keeps breaking down and changing. Ordinary writing ink lasts much longer.\nI really did write with it. Like the mushroom itself, the line I wrote is still changing.", "我把它的黑色液体收集起来，写了一行字，真的写出来了。它叫毛头鬼伞，也叫鸡腿菇。雨后在路边、草地，常能见到它。": "I collected some of its black liquid and wrote a line with it. It worked! The mushroom is called máotóu guǐsǎn in Chinese, or jītuǐgū. You often see it in grass or beside roads after rain.", "不过，它最有趣的，不只是长什么样子，而是它会慢慢“消失”。": "Its appearance is only part of what interests me. This mushroom slowly disappears.", "没开伞的时候，白白的，还有点可爱。一根白色菌柄，上面顶着一个长长的菌盖，表面裂成一层一层的毛状鳞片。": "Before the cap opens, it’s white and rather endearing. Above the white stem sits a long cap with layers of shaggy scales where its surface has split.", "乍一看，真的有点像毛茸茸的鸡腿。这也是我观察它时特别想留下来的细节。": "At first glance it really does look like a fuzzy chicken drumstick. That was a detail I particularly wanted to record.", "一旦开伞，菌盖边缘慢慢变黑、卷起，颜色从白色到灰色，再到墨黑。结构逐渐分解，变成像墨汁一样的液体，一点点往下流。": "As the cap opens, its margin slowly darkens and curls. White gives way to grey and then to inky black. The tissue breaks down into liquid that trickles from the cap.", "这个过程叫自溶。黑色液体里包含孢子和分解的有机物。看，真的好黑啊。": "This is autodigestion. The black liquid contains spores and broken-down organic matter. Look how dark it is!", "那我之前写的那行字呢？再看，已经开始变淡了。这些“墨水”还会继续分解、变化，并不会像日常书写用的墨水一样稳定。": "What about the line I wrote? When I looked again it had already begun to fade. This “ink” keeps breaking down and changing. Ordinary writing ink lasts much longer.", "它确实让我写出了字，但这一行字，也和这朵蘑菇一样，还在变化。": "I really did write with it. Like the mushroom itself, the line I wrote is still changing."}, "20260327-01": {"树下仰望花枝": "Looking up at the flowering branches", "枝头成簇花朵": "Clusters of flowers on the branch tips.", "树枝上的花与花苞": "Flowers and buds on a branch", "花冠与悬垂的花": "A corolla hanging beside the flowers.", "盛花的树冠": "The crown in full bloom.", "花冠斑点与长花蕊": "Corolla markings and projecting floral parts.", "山坡上的粉色花团": "Pink clusters of flowers on the hillside", "往年不是来早，就是来晚，这次终于赶上毛棉杜鹃盛开。梧桐山的粉白花团，让每根枝条都值得看。": "In other years I came too early or too late. This time I caught Rhododendron moulmainense in full bloom. On Wutong Mountain each branch seemed to carry its own cloud of pink and white.", "今年，来得刚刚好": "This year my timing was just right", "往年看毛棉杜鹃，不是来早了，就是来晚了。这一次，满山一团团、一簇簇的花正好盛开，像云朵落在山坡上。\n粉白花色与周围深浅不同的绿交织，每一根枝条都让人想停一会儿。": "Other years I’d arrived too early or too late for these rhododendrons. This time the bushes were in full bloom all over the mountain, clusters of flowers like clouds resting on the hillside.\nPink and white flowers mingled with greens of every shade. I wanted to stop at every branch.", "往年看毛棉杜鹃，不是来早了，就是来晚了。这一次，满山一团团、一簇簇的花正好盛开，像云朵落在山坡上。": "Other years I’d arrived too early or too late for these rhododendrons. This time the bushes were in full bloom all over the mountain, clusters of flowers like clouds resting on the hillside.", "粉白花色与周围深浅不同的绿交织，每一根枝条都让人想停一会儿。": "Pink and white flowers mingled with greens of every shade. I wanted to stop at every branch.", "一片花冠上，藏着小斑点": "A splash of spots inside the corolla", "凑近看，花冠内部有一块醒目的斑纹，长长的花蕊从花中伸出。视频中把这些纹路与访花昆虫寻找花蜜联系起来。\n花苞也很可爱，圆圆尖尖的，和盛开的花排在同一枝上。盛花之外，这些将开的花也值得看。": "Up close, I could see a distinct patch of markings inside the corolla, with the long reproductive parts projecting from the flower. In the video I considered how the markings might help visiting insects find nectar.\nThe buds were lovely too, rounded with pointed tips, beside open flowers on the same branch. Even in full bloom, the flowers still to come were worth a look.", "凑近看，花冠内部有一块醒目的斑纹，长长的花蕊从花中伸出。视频中把这些纹路与访花昆虫寻找花蜜联系起来。": "Up close, I could see a distinct patch of markings inside the corolla, with the long reproductive parts projecting from the flower. In the video I considered how the markings might help visiting insects find nectar.", "花苞也很可爱，圆圆尖尖的，和盛开的花排在同一枝上。盛花之外，这些将开的花也值得看。": "The buds were lovely too, rounded with pointed tips, beside open flowers on the same branch. Even in full bloom, the flowers still to come were worth a look.", "花落时，还会被轻轻挂住": "The flower catches as it falls", "有些花冠脱落时，会被长长的花柱暂时勾住，像用丝线吊着。看着这一幕，“丝线吊芙蓉”的联想就变得生动起来。\n站到树下，抬头从枝条之间看过去，粉色和绿叶又换了一种排列。春天这次相遇，来得正好。": "Sometimes a fallen corolla catches for a while on the long style, as if hanging from a fine thread. Seeing that brought to mind the Chinese image of a hibiscus suspended on silk.\nFrom under the shrub I looked up through the branches. The pink and the green leaves fell into quite a different pattern. For this spring encounter, I had come at just the right time.", "有些花冠脱落时，会被长长的花柱暂时勾住，像用丝线吊着。看着这一幕，“丝线吊芙蓉”的联想就变得生动起来。": "Sometimes a fallen corolla catches for a while on the long style, as if hanging from a fine thread. Seeing that brought to mind the Chinese image of a hibiscus suspended on silk.", "站到树下，抬头从枝条之间看过去，粉色和绿叶又换了一种排列。春天这次相遇，来得正好。": "From under the shrub I looked up through the branches. The pink and the green leaves fell into quite a different pattern. For this spring encounter, I had come at just the right time.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260918-01": {"花药与伸出的花柱": "Anthers and a projecting style.", "绿色小果实": "Small green fruits.", "白色花冠与黄色花药": "White corolla and yellow anthers", "花与裂叶": "Flower and lobed leaves", "果序与枝条": "Fruiting cluster and branch", "叶脉上的刺": "Prickles along the veins.", "叶间花序": "Inflorescence among leaves", "不同叶形": "Different leaf shapes.", "茎表面的毛": "Hairs on the stem surface", "手中小果实": "A small fruit held in the hand.", "枝条与叶柄上的毛": "Hairs on the branch and leaf stalk", "植株与人物的高度对照": "Plant beside a person for scale", "逆光下的叶脉": "Leaf veins lit from behind", "小果像青豌豆，白花像星星，叶片却藏着尖刺。水茄的几副面孔，要靠近才能看清。": "Round fruits like green peas, white flowers like stars, and sharp prickles hidden on the leaves. I had to get close to see all these sides of Solanum torvum.", "看起来像一串青豌豆": "A bunch of green peas?", "水茄在广东路边很容易见到，小果圆圆的，像一串青豌豆，底下还有花萼托着。视频中也聊到了云南部分地区称作苦果的地方饮食。\n从一种熟悉的野外植物，看到另一地的生活习惯，很有意思；具体辨认仍然要看整株形态。": "This plant is a familiar sight by roads in Guangdong. The round fruits hang like a bunch of green peas, each with a calyx beneath it. In the video I also talked about a local food known in parts of Yunnan as “bitter fruit”.\nIt was interesting to find a connection between a plant I knew in the wild and everyday life elsewhere. To recognise the plant itself, I still need to look at the whole of it.", "水茄在广东路边很容易见到，小果圆圆的，像一串青豌豆，底下还有花萼托着。视频中也聊到了云南部分地区称作苦果的地方饮食。": "This plant is a familiar sight by roads in Guangdong. The round fruits hang like a bunch of green peas, each with a calyx beneath it. In the video I also talked about a local food known in parts of Yunnan as “bitter fruit”.", "从一种熟悉的野外植物，看到另一地的生活习惯，很有意思；具体辨认仍然要看整株形态。": "It was interesting to find a connection between a plant I knew in the wild and everyday life elsewhere. To recognise the plant itself, I still need to look at the whole of it.", "这朵白色小星星，好眼熟": "A familiar little white star", "白色花冠分成五个明显裂片，中间黄色花药靠在一起，很容易让人想到茄子、番茄这一类茄科植物。\n镜头再近一点，还能看见花柱的位置。不同花朵的花柱伸出程度有所差别，视频中也专门记录了这一点。": "The white corolla divides into five distinct lobes. Yellow anthers stand close together in the centre, bringing other nightshade relatives, like aubergines and tomatoes, to mind.\nMoving the camera closer revealed the style. It projected farther from some flowers than from others, a difference I made a point of filming.", "白色花冠分成五个明显裂片，中间黄色花药靠在一起，很容易让人想到茄子、番茄这一类茄科植物。": "The white corolla divides into five distinct lobes. Yellow anthers stand close together in the centre, bringing other nightshade relatives, like aubergines and tomatoes, to mind.", "镜头再近一点，还能看见花柱的位置。不同花朵的花柱伸出程度有所差别，视频中也专门记录了这一点。": "Moving the camera closer revealed the style. It projected farther from some flowers than from others, a difference I made a point of filming.", "叶子翻过来，竟然有刺": "Prickles underneath the leaves", "叶脉上的尖刺一下子就能看到，枝条也并不光滑。再放大，表面密密的毛又让它有一种柔软而带颗粒的质感。\n摸起来的感觉很特别：像摸到一堆长了毛的沙子。看起来普通的绿叶，细节一点也不少。": "The sharp prickles on the veins were easy to spot once I turned a leaf over, and the branches weren’t smooth either. Under magnification, the dense hairs gave the surface a texture that looked both soft and grainy.\nTo me it felt like touching a heap of sand covered in fur. An ordinary-looking green leaf had plenty of detail.", "叶脉上的尖刺一下子就能看到，枝条也并不光滑。再放大，表面密密的毛又让它有一种柔软而带颗粒的质感。": "The sharp prickles on the veins were easy to spot once I turned a leaf over, and the branches weren’t smooth either. Under magnification, the dense hairs gave the surface a texture that looked both soft and grainy.", "摸起来的感觉很特别：像摸到一堆长了毛的沙子。看起来普通的绿叶，细节一点也不少。": "To me it felt like touching a heap of sand covered in fur. An ordinary-looking green leaf had plenty of detail.", "同一株，找到了好几种叶形": "Several leaf shapes on one plant", "有的叶片裂得深，有的轮廓比较完整。同一株植物上，也能找到不同形状。\n这次遇见的植株已经长得很高，花、果、刺和毛都拍了下来。把这些线索放在一起，才不会只记住那一串绿色小球。": "Some leaves were deeply lobed, others had a nearly unbroken outline. Both shapes occurred on the very same plant.\nThe individual I found this time stood quite tall. I photographed flowers, fruit, prickles and hairs. Taken together, those details give me much more to remember than a bunch of little green balls.", "有的叶片裂得深，有的轮廓比较完整。同一株植物上，也能找到不同形状。": "Some leaves were deeply lobed, others had a nearly unbroken outline. Both shapes occurred on the very same plant.", "这次遇见的植株已经长得很高，花、果、刺和毛都拍了下来。把这些线索放在一起，才不会只记住那一串绿色小球。": "The individual I found this time stood quite tall. I photographed flowers, fruit, prickles and hairs. Taken together, those details give me much more to remember than a bunch of little green balls.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260130-01": {"打开花部观察": "Floral parts opened for inspection", "花序局部": "Part of the inflorescence", "花朵整体": "The entire flower", "手上的花粉团": "The pollinia on my hand.", "花部特写": "Floral parts in close-up", "手边观察花朵": "Flower examined beside a hand", "花粉团近看": "Pollinia in close-up", "花朵侧面": "Flower from the side", "展开的花被与唇瓣": "Open tepals and the lip.", "植株叶片与花": "Leaves and flowers on the plant", "现场观察过程": "During the observation", "下垂花序": "Hanging inflorescence", "粘在指尖的花粉团": "Pollinia adhering to a fingertip.", "观察花心": "Looking into the centre of a flower", "轻轻一碰，花粉团“啪”地弹了出来。沙卡顿瓢唇兰把送走花粉这件事，做成了一次意外的惊喜。": "A light touch, a pop, and out shot the pollinia. This orchid had a surprise in store for me in the way it sent its pollen on its way.", "它真的弹出来了": "It really did shoot out", "这株兰花看起来很温柔，里面却藏着机关。拍摄时一碰到花里的触须，花粉团就弹了出来，我竟然把这一瞬间拍到了。\n当时惊讶得头皮发麻。花粉团粘在手上，眼前那朵花一下变得很不一样。": "This orchid looked so gentle, yet there was a trigger hidden inside. While filming, I touched a little feeler in the flower. Out shot the pollinia, the packets of pollen. Somehow I caught the moment on camera.\nI was so startled my scalp tingled. There was pollen stuck to my hand, and suddenly I saw the flower in quite a different light.", "这株兰花看起来很温柔，里面却藏着机关。拍摄时一碰到花里的触须，花粉团就弹了出来，我竟然把这一瞬间拍到了。": "This orchid looked so gentle, yet there was a trigger hidden inside. While filming, I touched a little feeler in the flower. Out shot the pollinia, the packets of pollen. Somehow I caught the moment on camera.", "当时惊讶得头皮发麻。花粉团粘在手上，眼前那朵花一下变得很不一样。": "I was so startled my scalp tingled. There was pollen stuck to my hand, and suddenly I saw the flower in quite a different light.", "小小的触须，是开关": "The little feeler is a trigger", "瓢唇兰雄花中有能够被触动的结构。访花者碰到后，花粉团被迅速送出，粘附在来访者身上。\n近看花心，再看指尖上的花粉团，就能把这个过程的前后联系起来。静态照片留下的是结构和弹出后的结果，动作可以在本期视频里看。": "The male flowers of Catasetum have a structure that responds to touch. When a visitor trips it, the pollen packets are propelled out and stick to the visitor.\nI could piece the sequence together by looking at the centre of the flower and then at the pollinia on my fingertip. The photographs show the structures and what was left afterwards. The movement itself is in the video.", "瓢唇兰雄花中有能够被触动的结构。访花者碰到后，花粉团被迅速送出，粘附在来访者身上。": "The male flowers of Catasetum have a structure that responds to touch. When a visitor trips it, the pollen packets are propelled out and stick to the visitor.", "近看花心，再看指尖上的花粉团，就能把这个过程的前后联系起来。静态照片留下的是结构和弹出后的结果，动作可以在本期视频里看。": "I could piece the sequence together by looking at the centre of the flower and then at the pollinia on my fingertip. The photographs show the structures and what was left afterwards. The movement itself is in the video.", "送走花粉，也是一种办法": "One way to send pollen on its way", "这样的弹射与授粉有关，并不是花在主动攻击人。雄花把花粉送出去，之后还需要到达合适的雌花，才有结种子的机会。\n从一次意外的“啪”，认识了一套特别的花部结构。这也是这次观察最让我兴奋的地方。": "The launch is part of pollination. The flower wasn’t attacking me. After the pollen leaves a male flower, it still has to reach a suitable female flower for seeds to form.\nOne unexpected pop introduced me to a remarkable set of structures inside the flower. That was the most exciting part of this encounter.", "这样的弹射与授粉有关，并不是花在主动攻击人。雄花把花粉送出去，之后还需要到达合适的雌花，才有结种子的机会。": "The launch is part of pollination. The flower wasn’t attacking me. After the pollen leaves a male flower, it still has to reach a suitable female flower for seeds to form.", "从一次意外的“啪”，认识了一套特别的花部结构。这也是这次观察最让我兴奋的地方。": "One unexpected pop introduced me to a remarkable set of structures inside the flower. That was the most exciting part of this encounter.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251205-01": {"海杧果花果枝叶手绘": "Drawing of Cerbera manghas: flowers, fruits, branches and leaves", "干燥果核与纤维表面": "Dry fruit stone and its fibrous surface", "果核纹理近看": "The texture of the fruit stone in close-up.", "白色花冠与红色喉部": "A white corolla with a red throat.", "果实与长叶": "Fruit and long leaves", "枝头绿色果实": "Green fruits at the branch tips.", "海边的白花很香，果实却容易让人误认成芒果。海杧果的花、果和干燥果核，各有不同的模样。": "By the sea, fragrant white flowers give way to fruits that could easily be mistaken for mangoes. The flower, fresh fruit and dry stone of Cerbera manghas each have a different shape and texture.", "像芒果，名字也容易误导": "A mango lookalike with a misleading name", "在海边看到海杧果，叶子和绿色果实很容易让人想到芒果。拍摄时还听到路人讨论要不要摘来吃，让我很紧张。\n海杧果属于夹竹桃科，有毒，不能当芒果食用。先把这件事记住，再来欣赏它的样子。": "I found this tree by the sea. Its leaves and green fruit immediately brought mango to mind. While I was filming, I heard passers-by debating whether to pick some to eat. That made me anxious.\nCerbera manghas belongs to the dogbane family. It is poisonous and must not be eaten as a mango. With that clear, I could enjoy looking at the tree.", "在海边看到海杧果，叶子和绿色果实很容易让人想到芒果。拍摄时还听到路人讨论要不要摘来吃，让我很紧张。": "I found this tree by the sea. Its leaves and green fruit immediately brought mango to mind. While I was filming, I heard passers-by debating whether to pick some to eat. That made me anxious.", "海杧果属于夹竹桃科，有毒，不能当芒果食用。先把这件事记住，再来欣赏它的样子。": "Cerbera manghas belongs to the dogbane family. It is poisonous and must not be eaten as a mango. With that clear, I could enjoy looking at the tree.", "白花中心，有一抹红": "A touch of red at the heart of a white flower", "花冠白色，喉部染红，几朵聚在枝端，很好看。靠近还能闻到香气，花苞和已经打开的花也常在同一枝上。\n叶片长长的，枝头有时夹着变色的老叶。它在南方海边很常见，树冠也能撑出一片阴凉。": "The white flowers have red throats and cluster at the tips of the branches. Up close I could smell their fragrance. Buds and open flowers often shared a branch.\nThe leaves are long, and here and there an older leaf had changed colour. This is a common tree on the southern coast, and its crown casts a welcome patch of shade.", "花冠白色，喉部染红，几朵聚在枝端，很好看。靠近还能闻到香气，花苞和已经打开的花也常在同一枝上。": "The white flowers have red throats and cluster at the tips of the branches. Up close I could smell their fragrance. Buds and open flowers often shared a branch.", "叶片长长的，枝头有时夹着变色的老叶。它在南方海边很常见，树冠也能撑出一片阴凉。": "The leaves are long, and here and there an older leaf had changed colour. This is a common tree on the southern coast, and its crown casts a welcome patch of shade.", "果肉退去，又是另一种纹理": "A different texture once the flesh is gone", "素材还留下了干燥果核的样子，表面粗糙的纤维与绿色鲜果很不一样。换个角度，纵向纹路更加清楚。\n从花到果，再到这副干燥后的形态，海杧果的辨认线索就丰富了。观察时也要避免接触破损部位流出的乳汁。": "I also recorded a dry fruit stone. Its rough fibres look quite unlike the green surface of a fresh fruit. From another angle the lengthwise ridges stood out more clearly.\nFrom flower to fruit to dry stone, I now had several clues for recognising this tree. When looking closely, take care to avoid the milky sap that comes from damaged parts.", "素材还留下了干燥果核的样子，表面粗糙的纤维与绿色鲜果很不一样。换个角度，纵向纹路更加清楚。": "I also recorded a dry fruit stone. Its rough fibres look quite unlike the green surface of a fresh fruit. From another angle the lengthwise ridges stood out more clearly.", "从花到果，再到这副干燥后的形态，海杧果的辨认线索就丰富了。观察时也要避免接触破损部位流出的乳汁。": "From flower to fruit to dry stone, I now had several clues for recognising this tree. When looking closely, take care to avoid the milky sap that comes from damaged parts.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260526-01": {"球状小枝与连接它们的藻体": "Rounded branchlets and the thallus that connects them.", "铺展开的海葡萄藻体": "A spreading patch of sea grapes.", "浅水里的海葡萄": "Sea grapes in shallow water.", "密集排列的绿色球状小枝": "A dense arrangement of rounded green branchlets.", "海葡萄 · 本期封面": "Sea grapes, the cover photograph.", "拿近一点，观察藻体的形状": "A closer look at the shape of the thallus.", "水边的一簇海葡萄": "A cluster of sea grapes at the water’s edge.", "海葡萄：沙滩上的绿色球状小枝": "Rounded green branchlets on the sand.", "同次海岸观察：对照手中不同形态的藻类": "From the same shore visit: comparing the shapes of several seaweeds in my hand.", "海岸边的一串绿色小球，摸起来像葡萄。它看似分成许多小段，内部却有着连通的结构。": "On the shore I picked up a string of green beads that felt like little grapes. The branches look divided into pieces, but inside the alga they share a continuous space.", "海岸边，捧起一串绿色小球": "A handful of sea grapes", "看，这些一粒一粒、像葡萄一样的小球，就是大家常说的海葡萄。它还有另一个名字：长茎葡萄蕨藻。\n放在手里，绿色有一点半透明，真的很像一串小珠子。我凑近闻了闻，有点腥、有点咸，是大海的味道。": "These grape-like green beads are what people call sea grapes, Caulerpa lentillifera. Its longer Chinese name is chángjīng pútao juézǎo (长茎葡萄蕨藻).\nIn my hand the green is almost translucent, like a string of tiny beads. I lean in for a sniff: a little fishy, a little salty. It smells of the sea.", "一颗“葡萄”，不是一个独立细胞": "One bead is not one cell", "这次最让我意外的，是它的结构。看上去像一串串小球连在枝条上，却不能把每一颗球都理解成一个独立细胞。\n海葡萄是管状、共质体结构的绿藻：藻体内部有连通的细胞质空间，并含有许多细胞核。因此，科普里常把这类蕨藻称作“巨型单细胞海藻”。\n这些小球是球状小枝。照片能看见它们的外形，内部连通的结构则需要借助研究来认识。": "The structure surprised me most. To the eye it looks like bunches of beads attached to stalks, but each bead is not a separate cell.\nThis green alga has a tubular, coenocytic body, or thallus. Its cytoplasm is continuous and contains many nuclei. This is why seaweeds of this kind are sometimes described as giant single cells.\nThe beads themselves are rounded branchlets. My photographs show their shape; what we know about their connected interior comes from research.", "看着像枝叶，长法却不同": "They look like stems and leaves", "再把视线放远一点，海葡萄铺开成一小片。外形上，我们很容易把其中一些部分叫作“叶子”“茎”或者“根”。\n不过，它是绿藻，没有陆生维管植物那样真正的根、茎、叶。那些看似分开的部分，共同构成了不断延伸的藻体。知道这一点后，再看眼前的一团绿色，感觉也不一样了。": "Step back and the sea grapes form a little patch. It is tempting to call the different parts leaves, stems and roots.\nThis green alga has none of the true roots, stems or leaves of a land vascular plant. The apparently separate parts belong to a single, spreading thallus. Knowing that changes how I see the little tangle in front of me.", "一条海岸线，不止一种藻": "One shore, several kinds of seaweed", "沿着海岸走，还能捡到形态很不一样的藻。有的细细碎碎，有的颜色更深，也有的像一条长带子。\n这次我把几种放在一起看，海葡萄的小球尤其显眼。有些对象在视频里只是初步辨认，所以这里也保留当时的不确定。下一次再到海边，可以从这些形状的差别开始看。": "Further along the same stretch of shore I found seaweeds of quite different shapes. Some were delicate and finely divided, some darker, and one looked like a long ribbon.\nLaid side by side, the beads of the sea grapes were particularly easy to spot. Some of the other names in the video were only tentative, and I have kept them that way. Next time I am by the sea I can start with these differences in shape.", "A siphonous macroalgal genome suggests convergent functions of homeobox genes in algae and land plants": "A siphonous macroalgal genome suggests convergent functions of homeobox genes in algae and land plants", "分类按WoRMS所载的AlgaeBase记录展示。该记录将海葡萄列在植物界、绿藻门，未提供亚纲。表格以“空（来源未提供）”说明，图谱保留“空”占位，以便各层对齐；占位不是分类名称。": "The classification follows the AlgaeBase record supplied by WoRMS. It places sea grapes in Plantae and Chlorophyta and does not give a subclass. The table marks the missing rank; the empty place in the atlas keeps the levels aligned and is not a taxon name.", "同次海岸观察还拿起了其它藻类。下列名称保留文稿中的辨认程度，带“待确认”的对象不据此填写确定学名。": "Other algae were picked up during the same shore visit. The names follow the level of certainty in the manuscript; tentative identifications are not assigned definite scientific names.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "按视频称呼保留，具体分类待核对": "Name retained from the video. Its precise classification needs checking.", "视频中的初步辨认，待确认": "A tentative identification in the video, awaiting confirmation."}, "20261002-01": {"羽状复叶": "Pinnately compound leaf", "单朵花冠侧面": "Side view of a single corolla", "枝端花序": "Inflorescence at the end of a branch", "花后的花萼": "Calyx after flowering", "整株开花树形": "The whole tree in flower.", "树冠上的红色花团": "Red flower clusters in the canopy", "弯曲的花苞": "Curved flower buds.", "带薄翅的种子": "Seeds with thin wings.", "打开的木质蒴果": "Open woody capsule", "成簇红花与黄边": "A cluster of red flowers with yellow rims.", "满枝花苞": "A branch covered in buds", "红色花冠与黄色边缘": "A red corolla edged in yellow.", "红花描着金边，花苞像弯弯的手指。火焰木把枝头点亮，果壳里还装着会乘风的小种子。": "Red flowers edged in gold, buds like bent fingers. The African tulip tree lights up the treetops, and inside its woody pods are seeds light enough to travel on the wind.", "像树上开满了郁金香": "A treetop full of tulips", "火焰木也常被叫作火焰树，开花时名字就很好理解了。红色一团团挂在树梢，远看还有点像树上开满郁金香。\n花冠边缘描着亮黄色，红黄叠在一起，太阳一照特别醒目。": "The Chinese names huǒyànmù and huǒyànshù both evoke a flame, and when the tree flowers it is easy to see why. Clumps of red hang at the ends of the branches. From a distance they look a little like tulips blooming in a tree.\nA bright yellow line traces the rim of each corolla. In the sun the yellow against the red is especially striking.", "火焰木也常被叫作火焰树，开花时名字就很好理解了。红色一团团挂在树梢，远看还有点像树上开满郁金香。": "The Chinese names huǒyànmù and huǒyànshù both evoke a flame, and when the tree flowers it is easy to see why. Clumps of red hang at the ends of the branches. From a distance they look a little like tulips blooming in a tree.", "花冠边缘描着亮黄色，红黄叠在一起，太阳一照特别醒目。": "A bright yellow line traces the rim of each corolla. In the sun the yellow against the red is especially striking.", "花苞，像一把弯弯的手指": "A handful of bent fingers", "我很喜欢它的花苞。棕绿色的外面带着毛，花萼弯成角状，一簇排在一起，有点像佛手。\n等花冠伸出来，又变成宽宽的红色小兜。开花前和开花后，模样差别真大。": "I particularly like the buds. The brownish-green outside is hairy, and the calyx curves into a horn. A cluster of them lined up together looks a bit like a fingered citron.\nWhen the corolla emerges, it opens into a wide red pouch. Bud and open flower could hardly look more different.", "我很喜欢它的花苞。棕绿色的外面带着毛，花萼弯成角状，一簇排在一起，有点像佛手。": "I particularly like the buds. The brownish-green outside is hairy, and the calyx curves into a horn. A cluster of them lined up together looks a bit like a fingered citron.", "等花冠伸出来，又变成宽宽的红色小兜。开花前和开花后，模样差别真大。": "When the corolla emerges, it opens into a wide red pouch. Bud and open flower could hardly look more different.", "一艘小船，装着许多翅膀": "A little boat full of wings", "成熟的木质蒴果打开后像小船，里面是带薄翅的种子。单独放近看，那层翅薄得几乎透明。\n风来的时候，这样的种子就有机会被带走。树上热闹的红花，最终接上的是这些轻轻的小东西。": "The ripe woody capsule opens like a boat. Inside are seeds with thin wings. Close up, a single wing looks almost transparent.\nWhen the wind comes, a seed like this has a chance to be carried away. Those exuberant red flowers end up giving way to something astonishingly light.", "成熟的木质蒴果打开后像小船，里面是带薄翅的种子。单独放近看，那层翅薄得几乎透明。": "The ripe woody capsule opens like a boat. Inside are seeds with thin wings. Close up, a single wing looks almost transparent.", "风来的时候，这样的种子就有机会被带走。树上热闹的红花，最终接上的是这些轻轻的小东西。": "When the wind comes, a seed like this has a chance to be carried away. Those exuberant red flowers end up giving way to something astonishingly light.", "在两棵树之间，长出自己的线条": "Drawing its own line between two trees", "我最喜欢的一幕，是它从两棵树的空隙里长出来，枝条和红花像一幅画。\n深绿色羽状复叶一片片展开。花开一阵又一阵，每次路过，看到的线条和颜色都有一点不同。": "My favourite view was of the tree growing into a gap between two others. The branches and red flowers made a picture of their own.\nDark green pinnate leaves spread along the branches. The flowers come in flushes, and every time I pass, the lines and colours have changed a little.", "我最喜欢的一幕，是它从两棵树的空隙里长出来，枝条和红花像一幅画。": "My favourite view was of the tree growing into a gap between two others. The branches and red flowers made a picture of their own.", "深绿色羽状复叶一片片展开。花开一阵又一阵，每次路过，看到的线条和颜色都有一点不同。": "Dark green pinnate leaves spread along the branches. The flowers come in flushes, and every time I pass, the lines and colours have changed a little.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智 iPlant：火焰树属 Spathodea": "iPlant: the genus Spathodea"}, "20260417-01": {"同片对照画面中，一株树开满粉红色花。": "A tree in full pink bloom shown for comparison in the same video.", "白色与粉色木兰同景": "White and pink magnolias in the same view", "粉色木兰花，品种未定": "A pink magnolia flower. The cultivar has not been determined.", "粉色木兰树冠": "Pink-flowering magnolia canopy", "从树下仰看一树白花。": "Looking up at a treeful of white blossoms.", "仰看粉色花枝，透过枝间能看到蓝天。": "Looking up through pink flowering branches to the blue sky beyond.", "白玉兰花部近看": "Floral parts of the white yulan in close-up.", "白玉兰的满树花枝": "The white yulan in full bloom.", "白玉兰的白色花被": "White tepals of Magnolia denudata", "黄色木兰花心，文稿称飞黄玉兰": "Centre of a yellow magnolia flower, called 飞黄玉兰 in the manuscript", "同片对照画面中的白花，花被片细长而舒展。": "A white blossom in a comparison shot, with narrow tepals spread out.", "同片记录的木兰属绿叶，宽大的叶片聚在枝梢。": "The same video also shows broad green magnolia leaves gathered at the shoot tips.", "黄色木兰花，文稿称飞黄玉兰": "A yellow magnolia called fēihuáng yùlán in the manuscript.", "同片记录的木兰属聚合果，绿色小果紧挨在一起。": "A Magnolia aggregate fruit recorded in the same video. Individual green fruits are crowded together.", "蓝天下，尚未长满叶子的枝条上开着白花。": "White flowers open against a blue sky before the branches are fully leafed out.", "满树白玉兰是这次观察的主角，旁边还有粉色与鹅黄色的木兰。花未落，叶子还在等春天的下一步。": "The white-flowered yulan magnolia was the tree I came to see, with pink and pale yellow magnolias nearby. While the flowers are still on the branches, the leaves are waiting for their turn in spring.", "远远看见一树白花": "A tree white with flowers, visible from afar", "我非常喜欢玉兰，早春满树开花时，远远就能看见。这次主角是白玉兰，枝头花已经开了，叶片却还没明显展开。\n弯曲的枝条托着一朵朵白花，蓝天从缝隙里透出来，正是印象里玉兰该有的样子。": "I love magnolias. In early spring you can see a tree in full flower from a long way off. This time I came for the white yulan, Magnolia denudata. The flowers were open, but the leaves had barely begun to unfold.\nEach bent branch held up white flowers, with blue sky showing through the gaps. It looked just as I remembered a yulan should.", "我非常喜欢玉兰，早春满树开花时，远远就能看见。这次主角是白玉兰，枝头花已经开了，叶片却还没明显展开。": "I love magnolias. In early spring you can see a tree in full flower from a long way off. This time I came for the white yulan, Magnolia denudata. The flowers were open, but the leaves had barely begun to unfold.", "弯曲的枝条托着一朵朵白花，蓝天从缝隙里透出来，正是印象里玉兰该有的样子。": "Each bent branch held up white flowers, with blue sky showing through the gaps. It looked just as I remembered a yulan should.", "厚厚的花被，围出一个小杯子": "Thick tepals make a little cup", "花被片厚实，层层围着中心。开得更大一些时，里面的雄蕊和雌蕊也能看到。\n这期还聊到木兰类与甲虫传粉的关系。这次留下的是花形与花部照片，并没有连续拍到访花和传粉全过程。": "Layers of thick tepals curve around the centre. In a more fully open flower I could see the stamens and female parts inside.\nThe video also discusses beetles and pollination in magnolias. What I photographed here was the shape and structure of the flowers. I didn’t film a continuous sequence of a beetle visiting and pollinating one.", "花被片厚实，层层围着中心。开得更大一些时，里面的雄蕊和雌蕊也能看到。": "Layers of thick tepals curve around the centre. In a more fully open flower I could see the stamens and female parts inside.", "这期还聊到木兰类与甲虫传粉的关系。这次留下的是花形与花部照片，并没有连续拍到访花和传粉全过程。": "The video also discusses beetles and pollination in magnolias. What I photographed here was the shape and structure of the flowers. I didn’t film a continuous sequence of a beetle visiting and pollinating one.", "同一段路上，遇见不同颜色": "Other colours along the same path", "旁边的粉色木兰，从浅色顶端向深色基部过渡，很好看。还有鹅黄色的花，视频中介绍的是飞黄玉兰，花心的结构也拍得很清楚。\n这些都作为同一视频中的其它木兰记录保留，照片说明会标出区别，不都归作白玉兰。": "On a pink magnolia nearby, the colour deepened from the tips to the base of the tepals. There were pale yellow flowers too, called fēihuáng yùlán in the video. I got a clear photograph of the parts at their centre.\nThese other magnolias belong to the same walk and video. The captions distinguish them from the white yulan.", "旁边的粉色木兰，从浅色顶端向深色基部过渡，很好看。还有鹅黄色的花，视频中介绍的是飞黄玉兰，花心的结构也拍得很清楚。": "On a pink magnolia nearby, the colour deepened from the tips to the base of the tepals. There were pale yellow flowers too, called fēihuáng yùlán in the video. I got a clear photograph of the parts at their centre.", "这些都作为同一视频中的其它木兰记录保留，照片说明会标出区别，不都归作白玉兰。": "These other magnolias belong to the same walk and video. The captions distinguish them from the white yulan.", "花后，还想再看一次": "One more visit after the flowers", "同片还记录了其它玉兰的花和木兰属的聚合果。近看那一串绿色的果子，小果一个挨着一个。先把这个形状记下来，单凭这张果实照片还不能确定它属于哪一种玉兰。\n白玉兰是这期的主对象。下次花落、叶出的时候，再回来沿着枝头看一次。": "The video also includes flowers of other magnolias and a Magnolia aggregate fruit. The green structure is made up of many small fruits sitting close together. I wanted to remember that shape. This photograph alone does not establish which magnolia bore it.\nThe white yulan is the main subject of this visit. I’d like to come back as the flowers fall and the leaves emerge, and follow those branches again.", "同片还记录了其它玉兰的花和木兰属的聚合果。近看那一串绿色的果子，小果一个挨着一个。先把这个形状记下来，单凭这张果实照片还不能确定它属于哪一种玉兰。": "The video also includes flowers of other magnolias and a Magnolia aggregate fruit. The green structure is made up of many small fruits sitting close together. I wanted to remember that shape. This photograph alone does not establish which magnolia bore it.", "白玉兰是这期的主对象。下次花落、叶出的时候，再回来沿着枝头看一次。": "The white yulan is the main subject of this visit. I’d like to come back as the flowers fall and the leaves emerge, and follow those branches again.", "视频主对象为白玉兰（玉兰，Magnolia denudata）；视频另有其它玉兰记录。文稿明确提到星花玉兰、飞黄玉兰，作为视频涉及的其它对象保存，具体学名或园艺品种待核对，不增加独立档案数量。": "The video is principally about Magnolia denudata. It also mentions the magnolias called 星花玉兰 and 飞黄玉兰. Their species or cultivar names await verification. They do not count as separate records here.", "中文名称按视频保留，具体学名或园艺品种待核对": "Chinese name as recorded; the species or cultivar has not been confirmed.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260626-01": {"弯垂的完整叶片": "A whole arching frond", "叶背孢子囊群": "Sori on the underside of a frond.", "珠芽狗脊 · 本期封面": "Woodwardia prolifera, cover image.", "孢子囊群的排列": "Arrangement of the sori", "尚未展开的新叶": "New frond not yet unfurled", "成丛弯垂的叶片": "Clump of arching fronds", "叶片上的珠芽与新叶": "Bulbil and new frond on the blade", "叶面新植株": "New plant growing on the frond", "叶面密集的小蕨苗": "Young fern plants crowded on the frond surface", "珠芽近看": "A bulbil in close-up.", "红褐色卷曲幼叶": "A curled, reddish-brown young frond.", "叶面长出小蕨苗，叶背排着孢子囊群。珠芽狗脊把两种繁殖线索，放在了一片叶子的两面。": "Young ferns grow on the upper surface, and clusters of spore cases line the underside. A single Woodwardia frond shows signs of two ways of reproducing.", "一片叶上，长出许多小叶子": "A whole crop of little leaves on a frond", "珠芽狗脊的叶面上，密密麻麻长着小小的新植株。我忍不住想数一数，结果越看越多。\n这些来自珠芽，是无性繁殖结构。看起来像直接“生孩子”，但不是动物那样的胎生，而是植物繁殖自身的一种方式。": "The upper surface of this fern’s frond was crowded with tiny new plants. I tried to count them. The longer I looked, the more I found.\nThey grow from bulbils, structures for asexual reproduction. It looks almost as if the plant has given birth, but this is quite different from live birth in animals. It is one way for a fern to produce more of itself.", "珠芽狗脊的叶面上，密密麻麻长着小小的新植株。我忍不住想数一数，结果越看越多。": "The upper surface of this fern’s frond was crowded with tiny new plants. I tried to count them. The longer I looked, the more I found.", "这些来自珠芽，是无性繁殖结构。看起来像直接“生孩子”，但不是动物那样的胎生，而是植物繁殖自身的一种方式。": "They grow from bulbils, structures for asexual reproduction. It looks almost as if the plant has given birth, but this is quite different from live birth in animals. It is one way for a fern to produce more of itself.", "翻到背面，又是一套线索": "A different set of clues underneath", "叶面看完，再翻到背面，孢子囊群排列得整整齐齐，沿着叶脉形成一列列弯弯的纹路。\n它不开花也不结果，仍能通过珠芽和孢子参与繁殖。正反两面连着看，是这次最有意思的发现。": "I turned the frond over. The sori, clusters of spore cases, formed neat, curved rows along the veins.\nThis fern has neither flowers nor fruits, yet it can reproduce through both bulbils and spores. Seeing the upper and lower surfaces together was my favourite discovery of the visit.", "叶面看完，再翻到背面，孢子囊群排列得整整齐齐，沿着叶脉形成一列列弯弯的纹路。": "I turned the frond over. The sori, clusters of spore cases, formed neat, curved rows along the veins.", "它不开花也不结果，仍能通过珠芽和孢子参与繁殖。正反两面连着看，是这次最有意思的发现。": "This fern has neither flowers nor fruits, yet it can reproduce through both bulbils and spores. Seeing the upper and lower surfaces together was my favourite discovery of the visit.", "新叶像还没有睡醒": "A new frond still half asleep", "春天的新叶卷着，带着褐色，有点像还没睡醒。我开玩笑地想，如果自己是虫子，可能会以为它已经萎蔫。\n其实卷曲包护着嫩小的部分，之后才慢慢展开。成年叶片弯垂下来，又能托起一片小蕨苗。": "The new spring fronds were curled and brownish, as though they hadn’t woken up yet. I joked that if I were an insect, I might have thought they had wilted.\nIn fact the curl encloses the tender parts until the frond slowly unfurls. A mature frond bends down and can carry a whole patch of young ferns.", "春天的新叶卷着，带着褐色，有点像还没睡醒。我开玩笑地想，如果自己是虫子，可能会以为它已经萎蔫。": "The new spring fronds were curled and brownish, as though they hadn’t woken up yet. I joked that if I were an insect, I might have thought they had wilted.", "其实卷曲包护着嫩小的部分，之后才慢慢展开。成年叶片弯垂下来，又能托起一片小蕨苗。": "In fact the curl encloses the tender parts until the frond slowly unfurls. A mature frond bends down and can carry a whole patch of young ferns.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260320-01": {"叶片与分枝": "Leaves and branches", "根与膨大的叶鞘基部": "The root and the swollen bases of the leaf sheaths.", "细裂的绿色叶丛": "Finely divided green foliage", "丝状叶片": "Thread-like leaf segments.", "切开的茴香头": "A cut through the fennel bulb.", "菜地里高高的植株": "Tall plants in the vegetable bed", "菜地采收球茎茴香": "Harvesting bulb fennel in the vegetable bed", "地面上的植株基部": "Base of the plant at ground level", "白色膨大部分近看": "The swollen white base in close-up.", "菜地里拔出一个白白的“小拳头”，上面顶着绿色细发。球茎茴香的名字，值得从叶鞘说起。": "I pulled a plump white “fist” from the vegetable bed, with a head of fine green hair. To understand the name “bulb fennel”, I started with the leaf sheaths.", "这个“小拳头”，比我的还大": "A “fist” even bigger than mine", "在菜地拔起球茎茴香，白白胖胖的基部很抢眼，忍不住拿来和拳头比一比。\n俗称茴香头的这一部分，主要由膨大的叶鞘基部组成，一层层包在一起。名字里虽然有“球茎”，观察时还是要把具体结构说清楚。": "When I pulled up the fennel, its plump white base caught my eye. I couldn’t resist holding my fist beside it.\nThis “bulb” is made mainly of swollen leaf-sheath bases, one layer wrapped around the next. The common name is handy, but it helps to look closely at the structure in front of me.", "在菜地拔起球茎茴香，白白胖胖的基部很抢眼，忍不住拿来和拳头比一比。": "When I pulled up the fennel, its plump white base caught my eye. I couldn’t resist holding my fist beside it.", "俗称茴香头的这一部分，主要由膨大的叶鞘基部组成，一层层包在一起。名字里虽然有“球茎”，观察时还是要把具体结构说清楚。": "This “bulb” is made mainly of swollen leaf-sheath bases, one layer wrapped around the next. The common name is handy, but it helps to look closely at the structure in front of me.", "茴香的名字，有时对不上": "When names for fennel don’t quite match", "这期从南北方的叫法聊起：做馅的茴香，与香料里俗称大茴香的八角，并不是同一种植物。\n球茎茴香则属于茴香的栽培类型。日常名字很方便，但到了菜地里，看看眼前到底长着什么，才最直接。": "This video starts with names used in different parts of China. The fennel used in fillings and the spice called dàhuíxiāng, or star anise, come from different plants.\nBulb fennel is a cultivated form of fennel. Everyday names are useful, but in the vegetable bed I can see for myself what’s growing.", "这期从南北方的叫法聊起：做馅的茴香，与香料里俗称大茴香的八角，并不是同一种植物。": "This video starts with names used in different parts of China. The fennel used in fillings and the spice called dàhuíxiāng, or star anise, come from different plants.", "球茎茴香则属于茴香的栽培类型。日常名字很方便，但到了菜地里，看看眼前到底长着什么，才最直接。": "Bulb fennel is a cultivated form of fennel. Everyday names are useful, but in the vegetable bed I can see for myself what’s growing.", "站在一丛绿色头发里面": "Standing among tufts of green hair", "叶子分裂得细细的，真像绿色头发。风吹来，整片细叶一起点头，看起来很轻。\n我还把它与胡萝卜的叶子作比较，它们都属于伞形科。看完这丛绿色细发，再切开茴香头，菜地与厨房就接上了。": "The leaves are so finely divided they really do look like green hair. When the wind blows, a whole patch nods together and looks light as air.\nI compared the foliage with carrot leaves. Both plants belong to the carrot family. From that fine green foliage to a cut through the bulb, the garden led me straight into the kitchen.", "叶子分裂得细细的，真像绿色头发。风吹来，整片细叶一起点头，看起来很轻。": "The leaves are so finely divided they really do look like green hair. When the wind blows, a whole patch nods together and looks light as air.", "我还把它与胡萝卜的叶子作比较，它们都属于伞形科。看完这丛绿色细发，再切开茴香头，菜地与厨房就接上了。": "I compared the foliage with carrot leaves. Both plants belong to the carrot family. From that fine green foliage to a cut through the bulb, the garden led me straight into the kitchen.", "今天，把它带回厨房": "Taking it home to cook", "切开以后，里面紧密的层次显出来了。沙拉、炖汤、烤制，有好多不同做法；最后我决定拿回去做一道菜。\n熟悉的蔬菜，也能藏着不少名字和结构上的小误会。这回从头到叶看一遍，下次买菜时又多了一个观察角度。": "A cut across the base revealed its tightly packed layers. There were all sorts of possibilities: salad, soup, roasting. In the end I took it home to make a dish.\nEven a familiar vegetable can conceal a misunderstanding about its name or its parts. After looking at it from base to leaf, I’ll have something new to notice next time I shop.", "切开以后，里面紧密的层次显出来了。沙拉、炖汤、烤制，有好多不同做法；最后我决定拿回去做一道菜。": "A cut across the base revealed its tightly packed layers. There were all sorts of possibilities: salad, soup, roasting. In the end I took it home to make a dish.", "熟悉的蔬菜，也能藏着不少名字和结构上的小误会。这回从头到叶看一遍，下次买菜时又多了一个观察角度。": "Even a familiar vegetable can conceal a misunderstanding about its name or its parts. After looking at it from base to leaf, I’ll have something new to notice next time I shop.", "文稿Foeniculum dulce在WCVP归入Foeniculum vulgare；膨大叶鞘的栽培类型单独说明，不冒充独立接受种。": "WCVP treats the manuscript name Foeniculum dulce under Foeniculum vulgare. The cultivated fennel with enlarged leaf sheaths is described separately rather than counted as another accepted species.", "视频比较同科植物的细裂叶形。": "The comparison concerns the finely divided leaves of related plants.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "视频中俗称大茴香，用于说明名称相近而植物不同。": "Known in the video as dàhuíxiāng (大茴香), it illustrates how similar names can refer to different plants.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251110-01": {"花序与花苞": "Inflorescence and buds", "带刺果壳近看": "Prickly fruit case in close-up", "灰白色叶背与叶形": "The grey-white underside and outline of the leaf.", "开裂果实中的深色种子": "Dark seeds in a split fruit.", "雄花序": "A male flower spike.", "枝头成熟果序": "Ripe fruit cluster at a branch tip.", "把绿叶翻过来，忽然变成灰白色。白背叶的小魔术，就藏在一片叶子的背面。": "Turn a green leaf over and it suddenly becomes grey-white. The little magic trick of Mallotus apelta is all on the underside.", "别眨眼，绿色变白色": "Green to white in the turn of a leaf", "把白背叶的叶片翻过来，绿色忽然变成灰白色，像一个简单的小魔术。它的名字，几乎就写在叶背上。\n叶尖长，两侧也微微突出，有点像风筝。背面细毛带来的柔软感，也让这片叶子很容易被记住。": "I turned the leaf over and green suddenly became grey-white, like a simple magic trick. The plant’s Chinese name, báibèiyè, “white-backed leaf”, could almost have been written on its underside.\nThe tip is long and the sides project a little, giving it the outline of a kite. Fine hairs make the back feel soft. It’s an easy leaf to remember.", "把白背叶的叶片翻过来，绿色忽然变成灰白色，像一个简单的小魔术。它的名字，几乎就写在叶背上。": "I turned the leaf over and green suddenly became grey-white, like a simple magic trick. The plant’s Chinese name, báibèiyè, “white-backed leaf”, could almost have been written on its underside.", "叶尖长，两侧也微微突出，有点像风筝。背面细毛带来的柔软感，也让这片叶子很容易被记住。": "The tip is long and the sides project a little, giving it the outline of a kite. Fine hairs make the back feel soft. It’s an easy leaf to remember.", "一串小刺球，里面藏着亮种子": "Little spiky balls with shiny seeds inside", "果实一串串挂着，外面有细刺。成熟开裂后，深色种子露出来，表面亮亮的。\n远看有点像小板栗。凑近再看，果壳的形状和种子的着生位置，就能分得更清楚。": "The fruits hang in clusters, covered on the outside with fine spines. When they ripen and split, dark, glossy seeds are revealed.\nAt a distance they reminded me of little chestnuts. Closer in, I could make out the shape of the husk and where the seeds were attached.", "果实一串串挂着，外面有细刺。成熟开裂后，深色种子露出来，表面亮亮的。": "The fruits hang in clusters, covered on the outside with fine spines. When they ripen and split, dark, glossy seeds are revealed.", "远看有点像小板栗。凑近再看，果壳的形状和种子的着生位置，就能分得更清楚。": "At a distance they reminded me of little chestnuts. Closer in, I could make out the shape of the husk and where the seeds were attached.", "小花聚在一起，像放烟花": "Tiny flowers like a burst of fireworks", "白背叶雌雄异株，照片中这一簇簇伸出许多雄蕊的是雄花。许多小花沿轴排列，远看有一点烟花散开的感觉。\n从白叶背到带刺果实，再到这串花，山路上常见的白背叶就有了几个很鲜明的记号。": "Male and female flowers grow on different trees in this species. The clusters in my photographs, with their many projecting stamens, are male. The little flowers run along an axis and, from a distance, look rather like a firework bursting.\nA white leaf back, a spiny fruit, a spray of flowers: I now have several clear ways to recognise this familiar tree on a mountain walk.", "白背叶雌雄异株，照片中这一簇簇伸出许多雄蕊的是雄花。许多小花沿轴排列，远看有一点烟花散开的感觉。": "Male and female flowers grow on different trees in this species. The clusters in my photographs, with their many projecting stamens, are male. The little flowers run along an axis and, from a distance, look rather like a firework bursting.", "从白叶背到带刺果实，再到这串花，山路上常见的白背叶就有了几个很鲜明的记号。": "A white leaf back, a spiny fruit, a spray of flowers: I now have several clear ways to recognise this familiar tree on a mountain walk.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260618-01": {"深裂叶片": "A deeply divided leaf.", "素材中的紫花与白花对照": "Purple and white flowers compared in the source material", "花萼与花后结构": "Calyx and the structures remaining after flowering", "花后的宿存萼": "Persistent calyx after flowering", "下唇与上唇": "The lower and upper lips.", "完整花序": "The whole inflorescence", "二唇形花侧面": "Two-lipped flower in side view", "白花沿茎成轮排列": "White flowers arranged in whorls along the stem.", "轮伞花序近看": "A close view of a whorl of flowers.", "开花枝条": "Flowering branch", "花药近看": "Anther in close-up", "一圈圈白花像小脸，叶片越往上越细。白花益母草这次先从花色和花部近看认起。": "Rings of white flowers look like little faces, and the leaves grow narrower towards the top of the stem. I started with the flower colour and a close look at the floral parts.", "好大一株，开的是白花": "Such a tall plant, and the flowers are white", "第一眼看叶子，很容易想到艾草；再看花，就发现不是同一回事。这里记录的是原素材称作白花益母草的植株，白花一圈圈围着茎。\n园艺或材料名称与分类来源中的接受种名，在分类栏分别说明，不能只凭花色另造一个正式种名。": "At first sight the leaves brought mugwort to mind. Then I looked at the flowers. The plant recorded here as white-flowered motherwort bore rings of white flowers around its stem.\nThe taxonomy section distinguishes the name used in the material from the accepted species name in the classification source. Flower colour alone does not establish a separate species.", "第一眼看叶子，很容易想到艾草；再看花，就发现不是同一回事。这里记录的是原素材称作白花益母草的植株，白花一圈圈围着茎。": "At first sight the leaves brought mugwort to mind. Then I looked at the flowers. The plant recorded here as white-flowered motherwort bore rings of white flowers around its stem.", "园艺或材料名称与分类来源中的接受种名，在分类栏分别说明，不能只凭花色另造一个正式种名。": "The taxonomy section distinguishes the name used in the material from the accepted species name in the classification source. Flower colour alone does not establish a separate species.", "一朵花，像一张小脸": "A little face in each flower", "把镜头凑近，花冠明显分成上唇和下唇，里面几枚花药像小眼睛。张开的下唇，又有点像吐舌头的小朋友。\n侧面和正面各看一次，这张“小脸”的结构就清楚了。": "Close up, the corolla has a distinct upper and lower lip. Several anthers inside look like little eyes, and the spread lower lip reminded me of a child sticking out its tongue.\nA view from the side and another from the front made the parts of that little “face” much easier to read.", "把镜头凑近，花冠明显分成上唇和下唇，里面几枚花药像小眼睛。张开的下唇，又有点像吐舌头的小朋友。": "Close up, the corolla has a distinct upper and lower lip. Several anthers inside look like little eyes, and the spread lower lip reminded me of a child sticking out its tongue.", "侧面和正面各看一次，这张“小脸”的结构就清楚了。": "A view from the side and another from the front made the parts of that little “face” much easier to read.", "沿着茎，看看叶子怎样变化": "Following the leaves up the stem", "下面的叶片较宽、分裂明显，往上则变得更狭长。花后留下的萼也排成一圈圈，顶端带尖。\n这次还记下了揉叶后的特殊气味。叶形、花色和气味，是这次观察留下的三条线索。": "The lower leaves are broader and more deeply divided. Farther up the stem they become long and narrow. After flowering, the calyces remain in rings, each with pointed tips.\nI also recorded the distinctive smell of a rubbed leaf. Leaf shape, flower colour and scent are the three things I took away from this visit.", "下面的叶片较宽、分裂明显，往上则变得更狭长。花后留下的萼也排成一圈圈，顶端带尖。": "The lower leaves are broader and more deeply divided. Farther up the stem they become long and narrow. After flowering, the calyces remain in rings, each with pointed tips.", "这次还记下了揉叶后的特殊气味。叶形、花色和气味，是这次观察留下的三条线索。": "I also recorded the distinctive smell of a rubbed leaf. Leaf shape, flower colour and scent are the three things I took away from this visit.", "素材展示白花益母草，原文名称Leonurus artemisia var. albiflorus (Migo) S.Y.Hu单独保留。POWO将这个变种名归并至种级接受名Paraleonurus japonicus（益母草）；该种级页面及图片不代表白花类型的鉴定证据。正文称夏至草的内容仍需区分并校对。": "The material shows white-flowered motherwort. Its manuscript name, Leonurus artemisia var. albiflorus (Migo) S.Y.Hu, is retained separately. POWO places this variety name under the accepted species Paraleonurus japonicus. The species page and its images do not establish the identity of the white-flowered form. The passages referring to 夏至草 still need to be distinguished and checked.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "Turkish Journal of Botany · 原论文中文名更正：益母草属 Paraleonurus": "Turkish Journal of Botany: correction of the Chinese label for Paraleonurus"}, "20250707-01": {"自然生长的花丛": "The established flowering clump.", "深蓝紫与白花同景": "Deep blue-purple and white flowers together.", "球状花序与花苞": "A rounded flower head and its buds.", "白花花蕊近看": "Reproductive parts of a white flower, up close", "白色花丛": "Clump of white flowers", "蓝紫花序侧面": "Blue-violet inflorescence in side view", "蓝紫色小花": "Small blue-purple flowers.", "白色花序": "White inflorescence", "白花与未开花苞": "White blossoms and unopened buds", "在仙湖植物园，重新认识一丛自由生长的百子莲。修长花葶上，蓝紫与白色小花像一把把伞。": "I met a long-established clump of Agapanthus anew at Fairy Lake Botanical Garden. On slender stalks, its blue-purple and white flowers stood like little umbrellas.", "这次，像是重新认识了它": "Meeting a familiar plant all over again", "在仙湖植物园偶然经过，看到百子莲开得正好。以前更多在花展、商业空间见到它，这次看到多年生长的一丛，忽然觉得很不一样。\n花葶修长，顶着一把把花伞，亭亭玉立，仿佛它本来就属于这片小天地。": "I happened upon it in full flower at Fairy Lake Botanical Garden. I’d mostly seen agapanthus at flower shows or in commercial displays. A clump that had been growing here for years felt quite different.\nLong flower stalks held their umbrellas aloft, so poised that they seemed to belong to this little corner.", "在仙湖植物园偶然经过，看到百子莲开得正好。以前更多在花展、商业空间见到它，这次看到多年生长的一丛，忽然觉得很不一样。": "I happened upon it in full flower at Fairy Lake Botanical Garden. I’d mostly seen agapanthus at flower shows or in commercial displays. A clump that had been growing here for years felt quite different.", "花葶修长，顶着一把把花伞，亭亭玉立，仿佛它本来就属于这片小天地。": "Long flower stalks held their umbrellas aloft, so poised that they seemed to belong to this little corner.", "一把花伞，有许多小花": "Many flowers make one umbrella", "单朵花蓝紫色，也有白色，外形像小小的百合。许多花梗从顶端伸出，长短错落，组成整团花序。\n花苞鼓鼓的，旁边已经有花张开。凑近看花蕊，再退后看整个轮廓，各有不同的美。": "Individual flowers are blue-purple, sometimes white, each like a small lily. Flower stalks of different lengths radiate from the top of the main stalk and together make up the flower head.\nPlump buds stood beside open flowers. Up close I could see the floral parts, then a few steps back revealed the outline of the whole cluster. Each view had its own beauty.", "单朵花蓝紫色，也有白色，外形像小小的百合。许多花梗从顶端伸出，长短错落，组成整团花序。": "Individual flowers are blue-purple, sometimes white, each like a small lily. Flower stalks of different lengths radiate from the top of the main stalk and together make up the flower head.", "花苞鼓鼓的，旁边已经有花张开。凑近看花蕊，再退后看整个轮廓，各有不同的美。": "Plump buds stood beside open flowers. Up close I could see the floral parts, then a few steps back revealed the outline of the whole cluster. Each view had its own beauty.", "从名字，想到一份偶然的幸福": "A name and an unexpected pleasure", "百子莲与莲花并非同一家族，它属于石蒜科。属名常被解释为与“爱”和“花”有关，难怪花艺里也叫爱情花。\n我还记得小区里一丛被当成别的植物种下的百子莲。开花时特意绕过去看看，这份幸福来得有一点偶然。": "Despite the lotus in its Chinese name bǎizǐlián, agapanthus is in the amaryllis family. Its genus name is often explained as combining “love” and “flower”, which helps explain why florists call it the flower of love.\nI remember a clump planted in my neighbourhood under the impression it was something else. I made a special detour to see it in bloom. That small pleasure came entirely by chance.", "百子莲与莲花并非同一家族，它属于石蒜科。属名常被解释为与“爱”和“花”有关，难怪花艺里也叫爱情花。": "Despite the lotus in its Chinese name bǎizǐlián, agapanthus is in the amaryllis family. Its genus name is often explained as combining “love” and “flower”, which helps explain why florists call it the flower of love.", "我还记得小区里一丛被当成别的植物种下的百子莲。开花时特意绕过去看看，这份幸福来得有一点偶然。": "I remember a clump planted in my neighbourhood under the impression it was something else. I made a special detour to see it in bloom. That small pleasure came entirely by chance.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智 iPlant：百子莲属 Agapanthus": "iPlant: the genus Agapanthus"}, "20260508-01": {"叶片表面褶皱": "Folds on the leaf surface.", "直立茎与对生叶": "Upright stem and opposite leaves", "皱叶与新芽": "Crinkled leaves and new growth.", "菜地里的植株": "The plant growing in the vegetable bed.", "带红色的茎": "Reddish stem", "成片叶丛": "Foliage spreading into a patch.", "单根茎上的叶片": "Leaves on a single stem", "皱皱厚厚的叶子，带着熟悉的厨房香气。皱叶留兰香长得自在，也很容易把自己铺成一片。": "Thick, wrinkled leaves with a familiar kitchen scent. Curly spearmint grows readily, and one clump can spread into a whole patch.", "闻一闻，是熟悉的厨房香草": "A familiar kitchen herb by scent", "皱叶留兰香是我常用的厨房香草之一，豆腐汤、凉拌菜、鸡蛋面，我一下就想到好几种搭配。\n它的香气让人觉得清新，但不同薄荷类植物的气味各有差别。日常都叫“薄荷”，仔细认时还要继续往下分。": "Curly spearmint is one of the herbs I use in the kitchen. Tofu soup, cold dishes, egg noodles: several combinations came to mind at once.\nI find its scent refreshing, but different mints smell different. We may call them all “mint” in everyday conversation, and still have more to distinguish when we look closely.", "皱叶留兰香是我常用的厨房香草之一，豆腐汤、凉拌菜、鸡蛋面，我一下就想到好几种搭配。": "Curly spearmint is one of the herbs I use in the kitchen. Tofu soup, cold dishes, egg noodles: several combinations came to mind at once.", "它的香气让人觉得清新，但不同薄荷类植物的气味各有差别。日常都叫“薄荷”，仔细认时还要继续往下分。": "I find its scent refreshing, but different mints smell different. We may call them all “mint” in everyday conversation, and still have more to distinguish when we look closely.", "我就喜欢它长皱了的样子": "I like it for its wrinkles", "叶子厚厚的，表面起伏明显，边缘也卷卷皱皱，好像被揉过一样。凑近看，叶脉和褶皱交织，非常有质感。\n这里记录的是留兰香的皱叶栽培品种，园艺名与所属接受种会在分类里分别列出。": "The leaves are thick and deeply puckered, with curled, crinkled edges. They look as though someone has crumpled them by hand. Viewed close up, the veins weave through the folds to make quite a texture.\nThis is a curly-leaved cultivar of spearmint. Its horticultural name and the accepted species it belongs to are given separately under Taxonomy.", "叶子厚厚的，表面起伏明显，边缘也卷卷皱皱，好像被揉过一样。凑近看，叶脉和褶皱交织，非常有质感。": "The leaves are thick and deeply puckered, with curled, crinkled edges. They look as though someone has crumpled them by hand. Viewed close up, the veins weave through the folds to make quite a texture.", "这里记录的是留兰香的皱叶栽培品种，园艺名与所属接受种会在分类里分别列出。": "This is a curly-leaved cultivar of spearmint. Its horticultural name and the accepted species it belongs to are given separately under Taxonomy.", "一株，慢慢长成一片": "From one clump to a patch", "它会沿着地面扩展，在菜地里长得很自在。原来一小丛，后来就可能铺开一大片。\n花园里已经有这样的趋势，所以日常栽培也会留意控制生长范围。看着这一片皱皱的绿叶，厨房里的香气又有了具体的来源。": "It spreads along the ground and seems very much at home in a vegetable bed. What starts as a small clump can eventually cover quite an area.\nMine was already heading that way, so I keep an eye on its spread in the garden. Looking over that patch of crinkled green, I know exactly where the scent in my kitchen comes from.", "它会沿着地面扩展，在菜地里长得很自在。原来一小丛，后来就可能铺开一大片。": "It spreads along the ground and seems very much at home in a vegetable bed. What starts as a small clump can eventually cover quite an area.", "花园里已经有这样的趋势，所以日常栽培也会留意控制生长范围。看着这一片皱皱的绿叶，厨房里的香气又有了具体的来源。": "Mine was already heading that way, so I keep an eye on its spread in the garden. Looking over that patch of crinkled green, I know exactly where the scent in my kitchen comes from.", "按Mentha spicata种级分类，文稿栽培名称Mentha spicata 'Crispa'单独保留。": "The species classification follows Mentha spicata. The manuscript’s cultivar name Mentha spicata 'Crispa' is recorded separately.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251202-01": {"细碎小花组成的大花序": "Large inflorescence made up of tiny flowers", "较浅的新叶与深绿色的成叶并排。": "Paler new leaves beside mature dark green ones.", "渐红的小果实": "Small fruits beginning to turn red.", "叶片沿中轴左右排列，边缘可见齿。": "Leaflets line either side of the axis, with teeth along their edges.", "枝端花序整体": "The whole inflorescence at the tip of a branch", "盐麸木的复叶从低矮的植株间伸出。": "The compound leaves of Rhus chinensis rise from low vegetation.", "拉远看，同一片枝叶间的红色虫瘿。": "Red insect galls among the same branches, seen from farther away.", "补拍的虫瘿近景，粉红色膨大结构成团，轮廓不规则。": "A later close-up of the gall. The pink swelling has an irregular, clustered outline.", "尚未开放的花苞": "Unopened flower buds", "树冠高处的复叶映在蓝天下。": "Compound leaves high in the canopy against a blue sky.", "用手托住复叶，便于看清一对对小叶的排列。": "A hand supports the compound leaf to show its pairs of leaflets.", "手掌后方的果序，能看清小果的形状。": "A hand held behind the cluster makes the shapes of the small fruits easier to see.", "近看带有浅色细毛的叶柄和枝节。": "Fine pale hairs on the leaf stalk and a node of the branch.", "花序上的访花昆虫": "An insect visiting the flower cluster.", "叶轴近景，两侧的小叶和浅色细毛清晰可见。": "Leaf axis in close-up, with leaflets on either side and fine pale hairs.", "从上方观察复叶整体轮廓。": "The outline of the entire compound leaf seen from above.", "一串棕黄色小果实沿果枝排列。": "A cluster of yellow-brown fruits arranged along the fruiting shoot.", "细碎白花开成一大簇，旁边小果逐渐转红。盐麸木的名字，把好奇心引向了果实表面。": "Clouds of tiny white flowers and little fruits just beginning to turn red. The word “salt” in the Chinese name for Rhus chinensis made me curious about what coats its fruits.", "名字里，为什么有一个盐字？": "Why is there “salt” in the name?", "这期从盐麸木果实表面的附着物和酸咸感聊起，想知道它是否真能代替盐。这个名字很容易引起好奇，但不能只凭尝到的感觉判断成分。\n这次照片留下了开始转红的小果，也提醒我把观察和成分解释分开。": "I started with the coating on the fruit and the sour, salty impression it gives. Could it really take the place of salt? The name invites the question, but a taste alone cannot tell me what the coating contains.\nI photographed fruits just beginning to turn red. They reminded me to distinguish what I could observe from an explanation of the chemistry.", "这期从盐麸木果实表面的附着物和酸咸感聊起，想知道它是否真能代替盐。这个名字很容易引起好奇，但不能只凭尝到的感觉判断成分。": "I started with the coating on the fruit and the sour, salty impression it gives. Could it really take the place of salt? The name invites the question, but a taste alone cannot tell me what the coating contains.", "这次照片留下了开始转红的小果，也提醒我把观察和成分解释分开。": "I photographed fruits just beginning to turn red. They reminded me to distinguish what I could observe from an explanation of the chemistry.", "一簇花里，有好多小花": "A cluster made up of tiny flowers", "在海岛上碰到它开花，圆锥花序一大串挂在枝头。靠近看，每朵小花都很细巧，花瓣轻轻向外展开。\n照片里还有来访的昆虫。退后是满枝的白色，靠近又能找到许多小动作。": "I came across it in flower on an island. Large, branched panicles hung at the ends of the twigs. Up close each flower was delicate, its petals spreading gently outwards.\nVisiting insects made it into the photographs too. From a distance the branches were white with flowers. Close up there were all sorts of little movements to watch.", "在海岛上碰到它开花，圆锥花序一大串挂在枝头。靠近看，每朵小花都很细巧，花瓣轻轻向外展开。": "I came across it in flower on an island. Large, branched panicles hung at the ends of the twigs. Up close each flower was delicate, its petals spreading gently outwards.", "照片里还有来访的昆虫。退后是满枝的白色，靠近又能找到许多小动作。": "Visiting insects made it into the photographs too. From a distance the branches were white with flowers. Close up there were all sorts of little movements to watch.", "叶子上的鼓包，是另一段故事": "A swelling on a leaf tells another story", "我还追着叶间的虫瘿看，聊到了五倍子。镜头里这团红粉色的膨大物，表面凹凸不平，和旁边那一串一颗颗的小果子长得很不一样。\n先拉远，看看它在树枝上的位置，再把镜头推近。这一回，叶子上的鼓包和枝上的果实都有了可以对照的画面。": "I also followed the insect galls among the leaves and talked about the galls called wǔbèizǐ. The pinkish-red swelling I filmed had a bumpy surface and looked quite unlike the cluster of separate little fruits beside it.\nI drew back to show where it sat on the branch, then brought the camera close again. This time I had pictures that let me compare the swelling on the leaf with the fruits on the twig.", "我还追着叶间的虫瘿看，聊到了五倍子。镜头里这团红粉色的膨大物，表面凹凸不平，和旁边那一串一颗颗的小果子长得很不一样。": "I also followed the insect galls among the leaves and talked about the galls called wǔbèizǐ. The pinkish-red swelling I filmed had a bumpy surface and looked quite unlike the cluster of separate little fruits beside it.", "先拉远，看看它在树枝上的位置，再把镜头推近。这一回，叶子上的鼓包和枝上的果实都有了可以对照的画面。": "I drew back to show where it sat on the branch, then brought the camera close again. This time I had pictures that let me compare the swelling on the leaf with the fruits on the twig.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250804-01": {"深绿色叶片与花序": "Dark green foliage and a flower cluster.", "小花与众多雄蕊": "A small flower with many stamens.", "花部侧面": "Floral parts seen from the side", "花苞与淡黄色小花": "Buds beside small pale yellow flowers.", "名字叫破布叶，眼前却是一片好看的深绿。淡黄色小花，藏在叶片之间。": "Its Chinese name means “rag leaf”, yet the leaves in front of me were a handsome deep green. Pale yellow flowers hid among them.", "这片叶子，看起来一点也不破": "Nothing ragged about this leaf", "破布叶也叫布渣叶，是岭南凉茶文化里会遇到的名字。第一次认真看它，我却觉得叶片深绿好看，和“破布”不太相称。\n这期从叶上的虫眼联想到名字由来。叶片纸质，几条主脉明显，完整和被啃食后的样子，给人的感觉确实不同。": "Pòbùyè is also called bùzhāyè, a name familiar in the herbal-tea traditions of Lingnan. The first time I really looked at the plant, the rich green leaves didn’t seem to deserve the name “rag leaf”.\nThe insect holes made me wonder about the origin of the name. The blades are papery and have several prominent main veins. An intact leaf and a well-chewed one really do give rather different impressions.", "破布叶也叫布渣叶，是岭南凉茶文化里会遇到的名字。第一次认真看它，我却觉得叶片深绿好看，和“破布”不太相称。": "Pòbùyè is also called bùzhāyè, a name familiar in the herbal-tea traditions of Lingnan. The first time I really looked at the plant, the rich green leaves didn’t seem to deserve the name “rag leaf”.", "这期从叶上的虫眼联想到名字由来。叶片纸质，几条主脉明显，完整和被啃食后的样子，给人的感觉确实不同。": "The insect holes made me wonder about the origin of the name. The blades are papery and have several prominent main veins. An intact leaf and a well-chewed one really do give rather different impressions.", "黄绿之间，花很精致": "Small, intricate flowers among the green", "淡黄色小花聚在枝端，花苞、展开的花和绿叶交叠。花瓣并不抢眼，许多雄蕊围着中间，第一眼容易把其它花部当成花瓣。\n靠近看，花梗和花序轴上也有细毛。平常忽略的一簇小花，放大以后很丰富。": "Pale yellow flowers cluster at the tips of the branches, with buds, open flowers and green leaves overlapping. The petals are inconspicuous. Many stamens surround the centre, and at first glance it’s easy to mistake other parts for petals.\nCloser still, I could see fine hairs on the flower stalks and the axis of the cluster. There was plenty to see in a little spray I might usually overlook.", "淡黄色小花聚在枝端，花苞、展开的花和绿叶交叠。花瓣并不抢眼，许多雄蕊围着中间，第一眼容易把其它花部当成花瓣。": "Pale yellow flowers cluster at the tips of the branches, with buds, open flowers and green leaves overlapping. The petals are inconspicuous. Many stamens surround the centre, and at first glance it’s easy to mistake other parts for petals.", "靠近看，花梗和花序轴上也有细毛。平常忽略的一簇小花，放大以后很丰富。": "Closer still, I could see fine hairs on the flower stalks and the axis of the cluster. There was plenty to see in a little spray I might usually overlook.", "叶子背后，还有别的居民": "Other residents behind the leaves", "这次还记录了叶片上的虫食痕迹和卷叶现象。植物既进入人的生活，也为昆虫提供食物和栖身处。\n这次照片以花和叶为主，具体是哪一种昆虫留下的痕迹，仍要有进一步观察才好确定。": "I also photographed feeding marks and rolled leaves. A plant that finds its way into people’s lives also provides insects with food and shelter.\nMy photographs this time were chiefly of the flowers and foliage. It would take further observation to say which insects left the marks.", "这次还记录了叶片上的虫食痕迹和卷叶现象。植物既进入人的生活，也为昆虫提供食物和栖身处。": "I also photographed feeding marks and rolled leaves. A plant that finds its way into people’s lives also provides insects with food and shelter.", "这次照片以花和叶为主，具体是哪一种昆虫留下的痕迹，仍要有进一步观察才好确定。": "My photographs this time were chiefly of the flowers and foliage. It would take further observation to say which insects left the marks.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260911-01": {"橙红色头状花序": "An orange-red flower head.", "花序侧面": "Inflorescence viewed from the side", "大片橙黄花海": "A sweep of orange and yellow flowers.", "分裂的叶片": "Divided leaves", "花海中的花枝": "Flowering stems in a field of blossom", "手边观察细长果实": "A slender fruit held up for a closer look.", "蓝天下的花枝": "Flowering branch against a blue sky", "花后的细长果实": "Slender fruits after flowering", "深橙色花序": "Deep orange flower head", "舌状花与中央管状花": "Ray florets around the central disc florets.", "黄色花丛": "A patch of yellow flowers", "走进一片饱和的橙色，像走进秋日油画。硫华菊的花海里，也有值得低头看的小果实。": "Walking into a patch of intense orange felt like walking into an autumn painting. Among the cosmos flowers were small fruits worth bending down to see.", "欢迎来到橙色的世界": "A world of orange", "眼前这片硫华菊，橙得特别饱和，很有秋日油画的感觉。走在花间，心里也暖暖的，远看像许多小花在招手。\n硫华菊也叫黄秋英，与常说的波斯菊同属秋英属。名字里的硫，与学名中表示硫黄色的词有关。": "The orange of these cosmos was so saturated it reminded me of an autumn oil painting. Walking among the flowers felt wonderfully warm. From farther off they looked like little hands waving.\nThis species is also called huáng qiūyīng in Chinese. It belongs to the same genus, Cosmos, as the familiar garden cosmos. Its scientific epithet refers to the sulphur-yellow colour.", "眼前这片硫华菊，橙得特别饱和，很有秋日油画的感觉。走在花间，心里也暖暖的，远看像许多小花在招手。": "The orange of these cosmos was so saturated it reminded me of an autumn oil painting. Walking among the flowers felt wonderfully warm. From farther off they looked like little hands waving.", "硫华菊也叫黄秋英，与常说的波斯菊同属秋英属。名字里的硫，与学名中表示硫黄色的词有关。": "This species is also called huáng qiūyīng in Chinese. It belongs to the same genus, Cosmos, as the familiar garden cosmos. Its scientific epithet refers to the sulphur-yellow colour.", "一张花脸，原来是许多朵花": "One face, many flowers", "外围显眼的部分是舌状花，中间密密的小花是管状花，合在一起组成头状花序。\n透着光看，橙色更亮了。花海里的深浅黄橙各不相同，拿近看一朵，再退回整片花海，是两种完全不同的感受。": "The conspicuous parts around the outside are ray florets. The little flowers packed in the middle are tubular disc florets. Together they form a single flower head.\nWith light shining through, the orange looked brighter still. The shades ran from yellow to orange across the patch. Holding one head close and stepping back into the whole sea of colour were two quite different experiences.", "外围显眼的部分是舌状花，中间密密的小花是管状花，合在一起组成头状花序。": "The conspicuous parts around the outside are ray florets. The little flowers packed in the middle are tubular disc florets. Together they form a single flower head.", "透着光看，橙色更亮了。花海里的深浅黄橙各不相同，拿近看一朵，再退回整片花海，是两种完全不同的感受。": "With light shining through, the orange looked brighter still. The shades ran from yellow to orange across the patch. Holding one head close and stepping back into the whole sea of colour were two quite different experiences.", "花谢后，细长的小果留下来": "Slender fruits after the flowers", "花谢以后，一根根细长的果实露出来。它们远没有花色抢眼，但也是这株植物生活中的下一步。\n再看看分裂的叶子，绿里带一点冷色调，把橙花衬得更暖。这回花、叶和果都留下了记录。": "After the flowers faded, long, narrow fruits emerged. They’re much less conspicuous than the flowers, but they are the next stage in the plant’s life.\nThe divided leaves were a cooler green that made the orange look warmer. This time I had photographs of flower, leaf and fruit together.", "花谢以后，一根根细长的果实露出来。它们远没有花色抢眼，但也是这株植物生活中的下一步。": "After the flowers faded, long, narrow fruits emerged. They’re much less conspicuous than the flowers, but they are the next stage in the plant’s life.", "再看看分裂的叶子，绿里带一点冷色调，把橙花衬得更暖。这回花、叶和果都留下了记录。": "The divided leaves were a cooler green that made the orange look warmer. This time I had photographs of flower, leaf and fruit together.", "视频中亦称波斯菊，用于同属花形比较。": "The video also uses the Chinese name bōsījú (波斯菊) and compares flower shapes in the same genus.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260714-01": {"带刺树干": "Prickly trunk", "转红的果实": "Fruits turning red", "手中果实与种子": "Fruit and seeds in a hand", "结果枝条": "Fruiting branch", "细长小叶与叶轴": "Slender leaflets and the leaf axis.", "果实表面腺点": "Glandular dots on the surface of the fruit.", "叶面腺点近看": "Gland dots on the leaf surface", "竹叶花椒 · 本期封面": "Zanthoxylum armatum, cover image.", "蓝天下的细叶枝条": "Branches with fine leaflets against blue sky", "树干上的刺": "Prickles on the trunk.", "树冠枝叶": "Leaves and branches in the canopy", "枝头绿色果实": "Green fruits on the branches", "细叶像竹叶，果实却带着熟悉的花椒香。竹叶花椒的枝上还有一对对锋利的刺。": "The slender leaflets suggest bamboo, but the fruits smell unmistakably of Sichuan pepper. Pairs of sharp prickles line the branches of Zanthoxylum armatum.", "这股香气，有一点柠檬和橙皮": "A little lemon, a little orange peel", "说到竹叶花椒的果实，先想起的是香气和麻感。除了熟悉的花椒气味，还联想到柠檬、橙皮，甚至一点松脂。\n近看果皮，表面那些小腺点很明显。果实与叶片中的芳香物质，让这株植物有了很鲜明的记忆点。": "What first comes to mind about the fruits is their fragrance and their numbing sensation. Along with the familiar pepper scent, I thought of lemon, orange peel and even a hint of pine resin.\nUp close, small glandular dots were clear on the fruit wall. The aromas in the fruit and leaves gave me a vivid way to remember this plant.", "说到竹叶花椒的果实，先想起的是香气和麻感。除了熟悉的花椒气味，还联想到柠檬、橙皮，甚至一点松脂。": "What first comes to mind about the fruits is their fragrance and their numbing sensation. Along with the familiar pepper scent, I thought of lemon, orange peel and even a hint of pine resin.", "近看果皮，表面那些小腺点很明显。果实与叶片中的芳香物质，让这株植物有了很鲜明的记忆点。": "Up close, small glandular dots were clear on the fruit wall. The aromas in the fruit and leaves gave me a vivid way to remember this plant.", "竹叶两个字，写在叶形上": "Bamboo in the name, bamboo in the leaf", "小叶细长，乍看像竹叶。沿着叶轴看，小叶之间还有狭窄的翅，这些比单看一片叶更有辨识度。\n逆着蓝天看过去，叶子又轻又透。这期从这些香气想到古人对芳香植物的利用，让一次山路相遇多了一层历史感。": "The leaflets are long and narrow, rather like bamboo leaves at first glance. Follow the leaf axis and you can also see narrow wings between them. Those features together are more distinctive than an isolated leaflet.\nAgainst the blue sky the leaves looked light and translucent. Their scent led me to think about how people used aromatic plants in the past, and added a sense of history to this meeting on a mountain path.", "小叶细长，乍看像竹叶。沿着叶轴看，小叶之间还有狭窄的翅，这些比单看一片叶更有辨识度。": "The leaflets are long and narrow, rather like bamboo leaves at first glance. Follow the leaf axis and you can also see narrow wings between them. Those features together are more distinctive than an isolated leaflet.", "逆着蓝天看过去，叶子又轻又透。这期从这些香气想到古人对芳香植物的利用，让一次山路相遇多了一层历史感。": "Against the blue sky the leaves looked light and translucent. Their scent led me to think about how people used aromatic plants in the past, and added a sense of history to this meeting on a mountain path.", "香味之外，记住它的刺": "Remember the prickles as well as the scent", "枝条伸得有些凌乱，树干上能看到明显的刺。果实由绿渐红，开裂以后，里面深色的种子又是另一种质感。\n认识它的时候，既记住好闻的香气，也记住带刺的枝干。下次靠近，眼睛就会多看几个地方。": "The branches reached out rather untidily, and there were conspicuous prickles on the trunk. The fruits turn from green to red. When they split, the dark seeds inside have quite a different texture.\nI want to remember both the pleasant scent and those prickly stems. Next time I approach one, I’ll have several places to look.", "枝条伸得有些凌乱，树干上能看到明显的刺。果实由绿渐红，开裂以后，里面深色的种子又是另一种质感。": "The branches reached out rather untidily, and there were conspicuous prickles on the trunk. The fruits turn from green to red. When they split, the dark seeds inside have quite a different texture.", "认识它的时候，既记住好闻的香气，也记住带刺的枝干。下次靠近，眼睛就会多看几个地方。": "I want to remember both the pleasant scent and those prickly stems. Next time I approach one, I’ll have several places to look.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251021-01": {"绿白色花序近看": "Greenish-white flower clusters in close-up.", "满树密集花序": "Dense flower clusters all over the tree.", "轮生叶片与枝端花序": "Leaves in whorls beneath a terminal inflorescence.", "满树绿白色小花，香气浓得让人意见不一。换个角度，看看糖胶树这一场树上的花海。": "A whole tree of greenish-white flowers, with a scent strong enough to divide opinion. I took a different look at this cloud of bloom in Alstonia scholaris.", "先看看，这一树花开得多认真": "Look at the sheer effort of all that flowering", "糖胶树开花时，气味常常引起不同反应，有人喜欢，也有人觉得太浓。先抬头看看，满树都是密密的绿白色花团。\n我忍不住感叹，怎么会有这么多能量，一下开出这么多花。单从形态看，确实像挂满迷你绣球。": "When this tree flowers, some people love the smell and others find it overpowering. I began by looking up. Greenish-white clusters crowded the entire crown.\nI found myself wondering how a tree could muster the energy to open so many flowers at once. Going by their shape, it looked as though the branches were hung with miniature hydrangeas.", "糖胶树开花时，气味常常引起不同反应，有人喜欢，也有人觉得太浓。先抬头看看，满树都是密密的绿白色花团。": "When this tree flowers, some people love the smell and others find it overpowering. I began by looking up. Greenish-white clusters crowded the entire crown.", "我忍不住感叹，怎么会有这么多能量，一下开出这么多花。单从形态看，确实像挂满迷你绣球。": "I found myself wondering how a tree could muster the energy to open so many flowers at once. Going by their shape, it looked as though the branches were hung with miniature hydrangeas.", "小花挨着小花，挤成一团": "Flower against flower in a tight cluster", "花序长在枝端，一朵朵小花紧紧靠在一起。花冠很小，绿白色，在深绿叶片旁边尤其清楚。\n气味的感受因人而异，也会随距离和环境变化。这份观察保留现场感受，不用“完全无害”这样的绝对说法概括所有人的反应。": "The clusters grow at the ends of the branches. Each little flower nestles against the next. The small greenish-white corollas stood out particularly clearly against the dark foliage.\nPeople experience the scent differently, and it changes with distance and surroundings too. I can describe what I noticed there, but I wouldn’t describe everyone’s response with a blanket claim that it is “completely harmless”.", "花序长在枝端，一朵朵小花紧紧靠在一起。花冠很小，绿白色，在深绿叶片旁边尤其清楚。": "The clusters grow at the ends of the branches. Each little flower nestles against the next. The small greenish-white corollas stood out particularly clearly against the dark foliage.", "气味的感受因人而异，也会随距离和环境变化。这份观察保留现场感受，不用“完全无害”这样的绝对说法概括所有人的反应。": "People experience the scent differently, and it changes with distance and surroundings too. I can describe what I noticed there, but I wouldn’t describe everyone’s response with a blanket claim that it is “completely harmless”.", "叶子围成一圈，托着花序": "A ring of leaves around the flowers", "糖胶树的单叶轮生，长圆形，侧脉密集。叶子像围成一圈，把枝端花序托在中间。\n视频中还讨论了行道树的用途与种植位置。把树形、花量和周围人的使用感受一起考虑，才是认识一棵城市树木的完整方式。": "The simple, oblong leaves form whorls and have closely spaced side veins. They appear to form a ring holding the cluster of flowers in the middle.\nThe video also considers where these trees are planted and what they do as street trees. To get to know a tree in a city, it helps to look at its form, the abundance of its flowers and the experience of the people who share the street with it.", "糖胶树的单叶轮生，长圆形，侧脉密集。叶子像围成一圈，把枝端花序托在中间。": "The simple, oblong leaves form whorls and have closely spaced side veins. They appear to form a ring holding the cluster of flowers in the middle.", "视频中还讨论了行道树的用途与种植位置。把树形、花量和周围人的使用感受一起考虑，才是认识一棵城市树木的完整方式。": "The video also considers where these trees are planted and what they do as street trees. To get to know a tree in a city, it helps to look at its form, the abundance of its flowers and the experience of the people who share the street with it.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260522-01": {"紫色叶背": "The purple underside of a leaf.", "枝端嫩叶": "Young leaves at a shoot tip", "紫色茎与新芽": "A purple stem and new growth.", "橙黄色管状花": "Orange-yellow tubular florets.", "头状花序正面": "Flower head from the front", "叶片正面": "Upper surface of a leaf", "绿色叶面": "Green upper leaf surface", "叶背与锯齿边缘": "The underside of a leaf and its toothed margin.", "花序侧面与总苞": "Side view of the flower head and its involucre", "正面绿，背面紫，红凤菜一翻叶子就让人记住。开出的橙黄色小花，又透露了它的菊科身份。": "Green above and purple beneath, Gynura bicolor is easy to remember once you turn over a leaf. Its orange-yellow flowers give away its place in the daisy family.", "把叶子翻过来，颜色就变了": "Turn a leaf over and the colour changes", "红凤菜也常被叫作紫背菜。叶面绿色，叶背紫红，翻过来的一瞬间最有记忆点。\n叶子厚厚的，边缘有小齿，摸起来却柔软。紫色与花青素有关，光看这一片叶子的两面，就很有意思。": "This vegetable is often called zǐbèicài, “purple-backed greens”. The upper surface is green and the underside purplish red. That moment of turning the leaf over stayed with me.\nThe blades are thick, with small teeth along the edge, but feel soft. The purple is associated with anthocyanins. The two sides of just one leaf gave me plenty to look at.", "红凤菜也常被叫作紫背菜。叶面绿色，叶背紫红，翻过来的一瞬间最有记忆点。": "This vegetable is often called zǐbèicài, “purple-backed greens”. The upper surface is green and the underside purplish red. That moment of turning the leaf over stayed with me.", "叶子厚厚的，边缘有小齿，摸起来却柔软。紫色与花青素有关，光看这一片叶子的两面，就很有意思。": "The blades are thick, with small teeth along the edge, but feel soft. The purple is associated with anthocyanins. The two sides of just one leaf gave me plenty to look at.", "菜地里的熟悉香气": "A familiar scent in the vegetable bed", "这期从采摘嫩梢聊到餐桌：口感有一点滑软，带草本气味，让人联想到菠菜和木耳菜。\n不同地方有不同俗名，紫背菜、红背菜、血皮菜……很多名字都抓住了叶背这个特点。": "The video follows the tender shoots from picking to the table. The texture is soft and a little slippery, with an herbal smell that brought spinach and Malabar spinach to mind.\nLocal names include “purple-backed greens”, “red-backed greens” and xuèpícài. Many pick out the same distinctive feature: the colour underneath the leaves.", "这期从采摘嫩梢聊到餐桌：口感有一点滑软，带草本气味，让人联想到菠菜和木耳菜。": "The video follows the tender shoots from picking to the table. The texture is soft and a little slippery, with an herbal smell that brought spinach and Malabar spinach to mind.", "不同地方有不同俗名，紫背菜、红背菜、血皮菜……很多名字都抓住了叶背这个特点。": "Local names include “purple-backed greens”, “red-backed greens” and xuèpícài. Many pick out the same distinctive feature: the colour underneath the leaves.", "它居然是菊科植物": "It turns out to be a member of the daisy family", "看到橙黄色花序时，家族线索就显出来了。许多管状小花聚成头状花序，像一团小绒球，下面还有整齐的总苞。\n从熟悉的叶菜，认到一簇小花，这次又多认识了它的一面。": "The family connection became clear when I saw the orange-yellow heads. Many small tubular florets make up each head, like a little pompom, with neat involucral bracts beneath.\nI knew it as a leafy vegetable. Coming across a cluster of its flowers showed me another side of it.", "看到橙黄色花序时，家族线索就显出来了。许多管状小花聚成头状花序，像一团小绒球，下面还有整齐的总苞。": "The family connection became clear when I saw the orange-yellow heads. Many small tubular florets make up each head, like a little pompom, with neat involucral bracts beneath.", "从熟悉的叶菜，认到一簇小花，这次又多认识了它的一面。": "I knew it as a leafy vegetable. Coming across a cluster of its flowers showed me another side of it.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251114-01": {"红黄绿不同阶段的果实": "Red, yellow and green fruits at different stages.", "带果枝条": "Fruiting branch", "树冠挂满小果实": "Small fruits hanging all over the crown.", "树下仰望果实": "Looking up at the fruit from beneath the tree.", "红色有棱果实": "A ribbed red fruit.", "满树迷你小南瓜，红的、黄的、绿的都有。昆明植物园里的红果仔，让人仰着头看了又看。": "A tree full of miniature pumpkins, red, yellow and green. Beneath Eugenia uniflora at Kunming Botanical Garden, I kept tilting my head back for another look.", "发现一树小灯笼": "A tree of little lanterns", "在昆明植物园，第一次看到这么高、又结这么多果的红果仔。平时见到的多是小灌木，这一株却让人站在下面仰头看。\n果实像小灯笼，也像迷你南瓜，抬头一望，满树都是，连没能参观其它地方的小失落都被冲淡了。": "At Kunming Botanical Garden I found the tallest, most heavily laden tree of this species I’d ever seen. The ones I usually meet are small shrubs. This time I had to stand underneath and look up.\nThe fruits looked like little lanterns or miniature pumpkins, everywhere I turned. The sight soon took the edge off my disappointment at not getting to visit other parts of the garden.", "在昆明植物园，第一次看到这么高、又结这么多果的红果仔。平时见到的多是小灌木，这一株却让人站在下面仰头看。": "At Kunming Botanical Garden I found the tallest, most heavily laden tree of this species I’d ever seen. The ones I usually meet are small shrubs. This time I had to stand underneath and look up.", "果实像小灯笼，也像迷你南瓜，抬头一望，满树都是，连没能参观其它地方的小失落都被冲淡了。": "The fruits looked like little lanterns or miniature pumpkins, everywhere I turned. The sight soon took the edge off my disappointment at not getting to visit other parts of the garden.", "八道棱，把小果分成几瓣": "Eight ribs divide each small fruit", "圆圆的浆果上有明显纵棱，配着细果柄，真的很可爱。成熟程度不同，绿、黄、红同时挂在枝头。\n它有番樱桃、苏里南樱桃等别名，属于桃金娘科，与通常说的樱桃不同。名字像，家族却要另外认。": "The round berries have pronounced lengthwise ribs and hang on slender stalks. Different stages of ripening meant there were green, yellow and red berries on the branches all at once.\nOne of its names is Surinam cherry. Despite the name, it belongs to the myrtle family, unlike familiar cherries. A similar name can lead to a different family.", "圆圆的浆果上有明显纵棱，配着细果柄，真的很可爱。成熟程度不同，绿、黄、红同时挂在枝头。": "The round berries have pronounced lengthwise ribs and hang on slender stalks. Different stages of ripening meant there were green, yellow and red berries on the branches all at once.", "它有番樱桃、苏里南樱桃等别名，属于桃金娘科，与通常说的樱桃不同。名字像，家族却要另外认。": "One of its names is Surinam cherry. Despite the name, it belongs to the myrtle family, unlike familiar cherries. A similar name can lead to a different family.", "再看叶子，和树皮的小变化": "Another look at the leaves and bark", "叶片对生，新叶带着红色，长大后转绿。视频中还记下树皮剥落后露出浅色部分的变化。\n那天最难忘的还是树下的视角，像一只小松鼠在看满树果子。脖子有点酸，却总想再看一眼。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs. New leaves are red and turn green as they grow. I also recorded lighter patches where bark had peeled away.\nWhat I remember best from that day is the view beneath the tree. I felt like a squirrel surveying a canopy full of fruit. My neck ached a little, but I still wanted another look.", "叶片对生，新叶带着红色，长大后转绿。视频中还记下树皮剥落后露出浅色部分的变化。": "The leaves grow in opposite pairs. New leaves are red and turn green as they grow. I also recorded lighter patches where bark had peeled away.", "那天最难忘的还是树下的视角，像一只小松鼠在看满树果子。脖子有点酸，却总想再看一眼。": "What I remember best from that day is the view beneath the tree. I felt like a squirrel surveying a canopy full of fruit. My neck ached a little, but I still wanted another look.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260317-01": {"草丛里的小花序": "Small inflorescence in grass", "花部细节": "Floral details", "小花侧面": "A small flower viewed from the side.", "叶片与生长环境": "Leaves and habitat", "白花与褐色苞片": "White flower and brown bract", "花后的蒴果": "A capsule after flowering.", "草地上的植株": "Plants growing in the grass.", "白色小花与淡黄唇瓣": "Small white flower and pale yellow lip", "线柱兰 · 本期封面": "Zeuxine strateumatica, cover image.", "线柱兰的植株、花序与花部手绘": "Drawing of Zeuxine strateumatica: plant, inflorescence and floral parts", "草坪里藏着一座迷你兰花森林。线柱兰的白色小花，凑近才看见凝脂般的细节。": "A miniature forest of orchids was hiding in the lawn. I had to get close to see the smooth, almost waxy details of the white Zeuxine flowers.", "认识了是宝，不认识是草": "A treasure once you notice it", "终于拍到心心念念的线柱兰。它藏在一片小草地里，不留神就走过去了，低下身才看见这座迷你“小森林”。\n叶子很不起眼，开花以后才发现，原来脚边也藏着兰花。": "I finally photographed Zeuxine strateumatica, the orchid I’d been hoping to see. It was tucked into a little patch of grass. I might have walked straight past if I hadn’t bent down to look at this miniature “forest”.\nThe leaves don’t stand out at all. It took the flowers to reveal that there were orchids right at my feet.", "终于拍到心心念念的线柱兰。它藏在一片小草地里，不留神就走过去了，低下身才看见这座迷你“小森林”。": "I finally photographed Zeuxine strateumatica, the orchid I’d been hoping to see. It was tucked into a little patch of grass. I might have walked straight past if I hadn’t bent down to look at this miniature “forest”.", "叶子很不起眼，开花以后才发现，原来脚边也藏着兰花。": "The leaves don’t stand out at all. It took the flowers to reveal that there were orchids right at my feet.", "小花像在吐舌头": "A little white flower sticks out its tongue", "白色小花带一点肉质感，唇瓣微黄，向前伸出，像在吐小舌头。旁边的褐色苞片又把白色衬得很清楚。\n放大看，花被片有凝脂般的质感。我趴近一点又看一会儿，越看越觉得古灵精怪。": "The small white flowers look slightly fleshy. A yellowish lip projects forward like a tiny tongue. The brown bracts beside them set off the white beautifully.\nUnder magnification the tepals had a creamy, wax-like texture. I crouched for a while longer. The more I looked, the more character those little flowers seemed to have.", "白色小花带一点肉质感，唇瓣微黄，向前伸出，像在吐小舌头。旁边的褐色苞片又把白色衬得很清楚。": "The small white flowers look slightly fleshy. A yellowish lip projects forward like a tiny tongue. The brown bracts beside them set off the white beautifully.", "放大看，花被片有凝脂般的质感。我趴近一点又看一会儿，越看越觉得古灵精怪。": "Under magnification the tepals had a creamy, wax-like texture. I crouched for a while longer. The more I looked, the more character those little flowers seemed to have.", "花很小，故事还没结束": "Even a tiny flower has more of a story", "花后会留下小小的蒴果。兰花的种子极细小，一枚小果里也能容纳许多。\n这次照片把草地、花序、小花和花后结构都留下了。以后走过草坪，不妨偶尔低头，也许就在脚边遇见它。": "A little capsule remains after flowering. Orchid seeds are so fine that a single small capsule can hold many.\nThis time I photographed the patch of grass, the flower spike, individual flowers and what remained after flowering. Next time you cross a lawn, try looking down. You might find one right at your feet.", "花后会留下小小的蒴果。兰花的种子极细小，一枚小果里也能容纳许多。": "A little capsule remains after flowering. Orchid seeds are so fine that a single small capsule can hold many.", "这次照片把草地、花序、小花和花后结构都留下了。以后走过草坪，不妨偶尔低头，也许就在脚边遇见它。": "This time I photographed the patch of grass, the flower spike, individual flowers and what remained after flowering. Next time you cross a lawn, try looking down. You might find one right at your feet.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260313-01": {"较狭长叶片的罗勒": "Basil with relatively narrow leaves", "轮伞花序与花蕊": "Flowers in verticillasters, with the floral parts visible.", "枝端新叶": "New leaves at the shoot tip", "罗勒叶片与嫩芽": "Basil leaves and a young shoot.", "叶缘与叶脉": "Leaf margin and veins", "带紫色的枝端花苞": "Purplish buds at the end of a shoot", "文稿所述甜罗勒类型": "The type called sweet basil in the manuscript.", "开花植株": "Plant in bloom", "直立花序": "An upright flower spike.", "菜地里几种罗勒，各有自己的叶形和香气。走近一丛小塔一样的花序，再认认熟悉的厨房香草。": "Several basils in the vegetable bed, each with a different leaf and scent. A flower spike like a little tower gave me a fresh look at a familiar kitchen herb.", "菜地里，遇到几种罗勒": "Several kinds of basil in one bed", "这次菜地里有普通罗勒、疏柔毛罗勒和甜罗勒。我分别记下了叶片的细毛、光泽与气味差别。\n轻轻靠近，香气就能闻到。不同类型进入汤、沙拉、意面或其它菜肴，同一个罗勒名字背后，也有丰富的日常经验。": "In the vegetable bed I saw plants called common basil, sparsely hairy basil and sweet basil in the material for this video. I noted differences in the fine hairs, the sheen of the leaves and the scent.\nI could smell them just by standing close. Different basils find their way into soups, salads, pasta and other dishes. There’s a surprising variety of everyday experience behind a single name.", "这次菜地里有普通罗勒、疏柔毛罗勒和甜罗勒。我分别记下了叶片的细毛、光泽与气味差别。": "In the vegetable bed I saw plants called common basil, sparsely hairy basil and sweet basil in the material for this video. I noted differences in the fine hairs, the sheen of the leaves and the scent.", "轻轻靠近，香气就能闻到。不同类型进入汤、沙拉、意面或其它菜肴，同一个罗勒名字背后，也有丰富的日常经验。": "I could smell them just by standing close. Different basils find their way into soups, salads, pasta and other dishes. There’s a surprising variety of everyday experience behind a single name.", "每一片叶子，都有自己的味道": "Each leaf has its own scent", "有的叶片较宽而光滑，有的细一些，表面带毛。罗勒的芳香与叶片上的分泌结构有关，不是揉过才凭空出现。\n我最喜欢普通罗勒带一点辛香的气味，觉得很安心。照片保留这些不同叶形，具体类型仍按素材中的称呼说明。": "Some leaves were broad and smooth, others narrower and hairy. Basil’s scent is associated with secretory structures on the leaves. Rubbing a leaf releases a smell that was already there.\nI especially like the slightly spicy scent of the common basil. It feels reassuring. The photographs show the different leaf shapes, and I’ve kept the names used in the source material for these plants.", "有的叶片较宽而光滑，有的细一些，表面带毛。罗勒的芳香与叶片上的分泌结构有关，不是揉过才凭空出现。": "Some leaves were broad and smooth, others narrower and hairy. Basil’s scent is associated with secretory structures on the leaves. Rubbing a leaf releases a smell that was already there.", "我最喜欢普通罗勒带一点辛香的气味，觉得很安心。照片保留这些不同叶形，具体类型仍按素材中的称呼说明。": "I especially like the slightly spicy scent of the common basil. It feels reassuring. The photographs show the different leaf shapes, and I’ve kept the names used in the source material for these plants.", "九层塔，原来这么形象": "A nine-storey tower", "开花的枝条上，小花一层层沿着轴排列，像一座小塔。“九层塔”这个名字，看到花序就容易理解。\n白色小花有明显的唇形结构，细小花蕊从花中伸出。熟悉的厨房香草，开花以后也值得专门看一次。": "On the flowering shoots, small flowers stand in tiers along the axis like the storeys of a little tower. Once you see the spike it’s easy to understand the Chinese name jiǔcéngtǎ, “nine-storey tower”.\nThe white flowers have a distinct two-lipped shape, with tiny floral parts projecting from them. Even a herb you know well in the kitchen is worth a separate visit when it flowers.", "开花的枝条上，小花一层层沿着轴排列，像一座小塔。“九层塔”这个名字，看到花序就容易理解。": "On the flowering shoots, small flowers stand in tiers along the axis like the storeys of a little tower. Once you see the spike it’s easy to understand the Chinese name jiǔcéngtǎ, “nine-storey tower”.", "白色小花有明显的唇形结构，细小花蕊从花中伸出。熟悉的厨房香草，开花以后也值得专门看一次。": "The white flowers have a distinct two-lipped shape, with tiny floral parts projecting from them. Even a herb you know well in the kitchen is worth a separate visit when it flowers.", "视频使用的类型名称，另列为同视频记录，不新增独立档案。": "A type named in the video. It is listed here as part of the same observation.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "按视频中的园艺名称记录。": "The horticultural name follows the video.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260924-01": {"掌中的种子与种托": "Seed and its fleshy support in a hand", "种子和种托近看": "The seed and its fleshy receptacle in close-up.", "枝上的种子与红色种托": "Seed above its red fleshy support on a branch", "粉色新梢": "A pink new shoot.", "浅绿色嫩叶": "Pale green young leaves", "粉色嫩叶": "Pink young leaves", "罗汉松 · 本期封面": "Podocarpus macrophyllus, cover image.", "短叶类型的新叶": "New growth on a short-leaved form", "不同颜色的种托与种子": "Seeds with receptacles of different colours.", "叶间彩色种托": "Coloured seed supports among the leaves", "整丛结种植株": "A whole seed-bearing plant.", "两个种子共依的形态": "Two seeds carried together", "上面一颗小圆球，下面一个彩色软垫，像一群坐着的小罗汉。罗汉松的种子与种托，给名字添了形状。": "A round seed on a little coloured cushion looks like a seated luóhàn. The seed and its fleshy support gave the Chinese name for Podocarpus macrophyllus a shape I could remember.", "一个小罗汉，两个小罗汉": "One little luóhàn, then another", "罗汉松的种子和种托连在一起，看着真像小罗汉坐在软垫上。有的还像长着两只耳朵的小动物，可可爱爱。\n下面肉质的部分是种托，上面的圆球才是种子。分清这两部分，名字就更容易记住。": "The seed and its fleshy support together really do look like a little luóhàn, a Buddhist figure seated on a cushion. Some even looked like little animals with two ears.\nThe fleshy part below is the receptacle. The round part on top is the seed itself. Once I saw those as two parts, the name was much easier to remember.", "罗汉松的种子和种托连在一起，看着真像小罗汉坐在软垫上。有的还像长着两只耳朵的小动物，可可爱爱。": "The seed and its fleshy support together really do look like a little luóhàn, a Buddhist figure seated on a cushion. Some even looked like little animals with two ears.", "下面肉质的部分是种托，上面的圆球才是种子。分清这两部分，名字就更容易记住。": "The fleshy part below is the receptacle. The round part on top is the seed itself. Once I saw those as two parts, the name was much easier to remember.", "这一树，竟然五颜六色": "So many colours in one tree", "种托从绿色慢慢变粉、变红，成熟得更深时颜色又暗下来。同一株上，不同阶段聚在一起，特别热闹。\n罗汉松属于裸子植物，因此这些不能严格叫作果实。种子没有被真正的果皮包住，和被子植物的果实结构不同。": "The receptacles change from green to pink and red, then darken as they mature. Several stages on the same tree made a lively display.\nPodocarpus is a gymnosperm, so strictly speaking these aren’t fruits. Its seeds are not enclosed in a true fruit wall as they are in flowering plants.", "种托从绿色慢慢变粉、变红，成熟得更深时颜色又暗下来。同一株上，不同阶段聚在一起，特别热闹。": "The receptacles change from green to pink and red, then darken as they mature. Several stages on the same tree made a lively display.", "罗汉松属于裸子植物，因此这些不能严格叫作果实。种子没有被真正的果皮包住，和被子植物的果实结构不同。": "Podocarpus is a gymnosperm, so strictly speaking these aren’t fruits. Its seeds are not enclosed in a true fruit wall as they are in flowering plants.", "嫩叶也会有另一种颜色": "New leaves can have a different colour too", "老叶常绿，新叶有浅黄绿的，也拍到了带粉色的新梢。远看像开着一朵朵小花，靠近才知道是叶子。\n素材里还有不同叶长的栽培形态，照片按实际模样记录，没有仅凭叶长另定品种名。": "The older leaves are evergreen. Some new leaves were pale yellow-green, and I also photographed pink shoots. From a distance they looked like little flowers. Up close I could see they were leaves.\nThe material includes cultivated forms with different leaf lengths. I recorded their appearance without assigning cultivar names on leaf length alone.", "老叶常绿，新叶有浅黄绿的，也拍到了带粉色的新梢。远看像开着一朵朵小花，靠近才知道是叶子。": "The older leaves are evergreen. Some new leaves were pale yellow-green, and I also photographed pink shoots. From a distance they looked like little flowers. Up close I could see they were leaves.", "素材里还有不同叶长的栽培形态，照片按实际模样记录，没有仅凭叶长另定品种名。": "The material includes cultivated forms with different leaf lengths. I recorded their appearance without assigning cultivar names on leaf length alone.", "庭院里的熟面孔": "A familiar face in the courtyard", "罗汉松在岭南庭院、寺院与盆景里都很常见，枝干的姿态往往比高度更让人记住。\n这期从民间寓意聊到老树的年龄。下次遇到一株矮矮的罗汉松，也许可以多看一眼它的枝干，再找找有没有“小罗汉”坐在叶间。": "This tree is common in courtyards, temples and potted landscapes in Lingnan. The posture of its trunk and branches often stays in the memory more than its height.\nThe video touches on traditional meanings associated with the tree and on the age of old specimens. Next time I see a low-growing one, I’ll take another look at the branches and see whether there are any little “luóhàn” sitting among the leaves.", "罗汉松在岭南庭院、寺院与盆景里都很常见，枝干的姿态往往比高度更让人记住。": "This tree is common in courtyards, temples and potted landscapes in Lingnan. The posture of its trunk and branches often stays in the memory more than its height.", "这期从民间寓意聊到老树的年龄。下次遇到一株矮矮的罗汉松，也许可以多看一眼它的枝干，再找找有没有“小罗汉”坐在叶间。": "The video touches on traditional meanings associated with the tree and on the age of old specimens. Next time I see a low-growing one, I’ll take another look at the branches and see whether there are any little “luóhàn” sitting among the leaves.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251107-01": {"植株在草丛间生长，开花枝顶着绿叶伸出。": "The plant grows among grasses, its flowering shoot extending above the leaves.", "拉近镜头看浅绿色果实相接的位置。": "A closer look at the junction of two pale green fruits.", "山坡生境中，拍摄者走近植株。": "The observer approaches the plant on a hillside.", "一对分叉的绿色果实": "A pair of green fruits branching in opposite directions.", "花冠细长的尾部垂在枝梢，像一串细线。": "The long corolla tails hang from the shoot like fine threads.", "花冠中央具红色斑纹，黄色长尾向四面伸出。": "Red markings at the flower’s centre, with long yellow tails spreading outwards.", "手边对照果实大小": "A hand beside the fruit for scale", "枝叶间垂着许多细长的花冠尾部。": "Long, narrow corolla tails hang among the branches and leaves.", "绿色果实近景，能看清相接的基部和长形轮廓。": "Close-up of the green fruits, showing their joined bases and elongated outlines.", "侧面看花朵的中心和延伸的细长尾部。": "Side view of the centre and the long, slender tails.", "细枝上长着一簇簇叶片和花蕾。": "Clusters of leaves and flower buds grow along slender twigs.", "以手为参照，观察两枚向两侧伸出的果实。": "A hand provides scale for the pair of fruits extending in opposite directions.", "光亮的绿色叶片从枝梢向上展开。": "Glossy green leaves spread upward from the shoot tip.", "从正面观察花朵，红黄斑纹与细长裂片清晰可见。": "The flower from the front. Red and yellow markings and slender corolla lobes are clearly visible.", "果实与叶片": "Fruits and leaves.", "果实近看": "The fruit in close-up.", "一对长条形绿色果实在同一处相接。": "Two long green fruits meet at the same point.", "两枚果实向左右伸开，羊角拗的名字一看就懂。认识这株岭南常见植物，从奇特的果形开始。": "Two fruits pointing in opposite directions: one look explains the “goat horns” in the Chinese name for Strophanthus divaricatus. I got to know this familiar Lingnan plant by starting with its remarkable fruit.", "枝上，长着一对羊角": "A pair of goat horns on a branch", "羊角拗的蓇葖果成对向两边伸开，几乎水平分叉，名字非常形象。枝条之间忽然出现这样一对绿色“羊角”，很难不注意。\n这次转换好的四张照片，留下了不同角度的果形。": "The follicles grow in pairs and spread almost horizontally to either side. The Chinese name describes them beautifully. It was hard to miss a pair of green “horns” suddenly jutting out among the branches.\nThe four photographs included here show their shape from different angles.", "羊角拗的蓇葖果成对向两边伸开，几乎水平分叉，名字非常形象。枝条之间忽然出现这样一对绿色“羊角”，很难不注意。": "The follicles grow in pairs and spread almost horizontally to either side. The Chinese name describes them beautifully. It was hard to miss a pair of green “horns” suddenly jutting out among the branches.", "这次转换好的四张照片，留下了不同角度的果形。": "The four photographs included here show their shape from different angles.", "成熟之后，种子会乘风走": "Seeds that travel on the wind", "果实成熟开裂后，带绒毛的种子能够随风传播。现有照片拍到的是仍然闭合的绿色果实，开裂后的过程留作下次观察。\n它属于夹竹桃科，有毒，尤其不能因为果形有趣就采来玩或尝食。": "When the ripe follicles split, their hairy seeds can be carried away by the wind. My photographs show green fruits that are still closed. I’d like to come back for the opening stage.\nThis plant belongs to the dogbane family and is poisonous. However intriguing the fruits look, leave them on the plant rather than picking them to play with or taste.", "果实成熟开裂后，带绒毛的种子能够随风传播。现有照片拍到的是仍然闭合的绿色果实，开裂后的过程留作下次观察。": "When the ripe follicles split, their hairy seeds can be carried away by the wind. My photographs show green fruits that are still closed. I’d like to come back for the opening stage.", "它属于夹竹桃科，有毒，尤其不能因为果形有趣就采来玩或尝食。": "This plant belongs to the dogbane family and is poisonous. However intriguing the fruits look, leave them on the plant rather than picking them to play with or taste.", "还记得，春天水母一样的花": "I still remember its jellyfish flowers in spring", "春天曾在海岛上遇见它开花。黄色花冠带着长长的尾尖，像一群小水母，这段记忆一直留到了现在。\n从花到果，都是它特别的样子。给它一点生长的空间，站在旁边看看，也能认识很多。": "I had seen it flowering on an island in spring. The yellow corollas had such long, trailing tips that they looked like a group of little jellyfish. The memory has stayed with me.\nBoth flower and fruit have extraordinary shapes. Giving the plant room to grow and watching from beside it is enough to discover a great deal.", "春天曾在海岛上遇见它开花。黄色花冠带着长长的尾尖，像一群小水母，这段记忆一直留到了现在。": "I had seen it flowering on an island in spring. The yellow corollas had such long, trailing tips that they looked like a group of little jellyfish. The memory has stayed with me.", "从花到果，都是它特别的样子。给它一点生长的空间，站在旁边看看，也能认识很多。": "Both flower and fruit have extraordinary shapes. Giving the plant room to grow and watching from beside it is enough to discover a great deal.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260519-01": {"叶面与卷边": "Leaf surface and curled margin", "卷曲叶丛": "A mass of curled leaves", "叶脉与叶缘": "Leaf veins and margin.", "植株近看": "Plant in close-up", "细密卷曲的叶缘": "The densely curled margin of the leaf.", "俯看叶片排列": "Leaf arrangement from above", "浅绿色新叶": "Pale green new leaves", "菜地中的高茎植株": "A tall-stemmed plant in the vegetable bed.", "叶缘一圈圈打着卷，像鹿角，也像精细的花边。羽衣甘蓝把一片菜叶长成了绿色艺术品。": "The edges curl in repeated waves, like antlers or a finely worked lace trim. Kale makes a single vegetable leaf look like a little work of green art.", "这片叶子，做工好精细": "Such intricate work in one leaf", "羽衣甘蓝的叶缘不断打卷，弯弯曲曲，像鹿角，也像一层层精细花边。看到它，总想多靠近一点。\n照片里既有深绿老叶，也有浅一点的新叶。同样的卷边，颜色和展开程度又不一样。": "The edge of a kale leaf curls and curls again, suggesting antlers in one place and tiers of fine lace in another. It always makes me want to step closer.\nMy photographs include deep green older leaves and paler new ones. Both have frilled edges, but the colour and the extent to which they’ve unfolded differ.", "羽衣甘蓝的叶缘不断打卷，弯弯曲曲，像鹿角，也像一层层精细花边。看到它，总想多靠近一点。": "The edge of a kale leaf curls and curls again, suggesting antlers in one place and tiers of fine lace in another. It always makes me want to step closer.", "照片里既有深绿老叶，也有浅一点的新叶。同样的卷边，颜色和展开程度又不一样。": "My photographs include deep green older leaves and paler new ones. Both have frilled edges, but the colour and the extent to which they’ve unfolded differ.", "与圆白菜，是一个大家族": "A close relative of cabbage", "它和圆白菜、花椰菜、青花菜都属于甘蓝的栽培类群。人们选育不同部位和形态，于是同一类植物走进厨房时，有了很不一样的样子。\n眼前记录的是卷叶类型，日常名称与正式分类在分类栏分别说明。": "Kale, head cabbage, cauliflower and broccoli are all cultivated forms of Brassica oleracea. People have selected different parts and shapes, and the same species reaches our kitchens in strikingly different forms.\nThe plant pictured here is a curly-leaved type. Its everyday name and formal classification are given separately under Taxonomy.", "它和圆白菜、花椰菜、青花菜都属于甘蓝的栽培类群。人们选育不同部位和形态，于是同一类植物走进厨房时，有了很不一样的样子。": "Kale, head cabbage, cauliflower and broccoli are all cultivated forms of Brassica oleracea. People have selected different parts and shapes, and the same species reaches our kitchens in strikingly different forms.", "眼前记录的是卷叶类型，日常名称与正式分类在分类栏分别说明。": "The plant pictured here is a curly-leaved type. Its everyday name and formal classification are given separately under Taxonomy.", "既能看，也进入日常餐桌": "Good to look at in the garden as well as on the table", "这期聊到榨汁、凉拌等日常做法，也喜欢把它留在菜地里观赏。长高以后，叶子集中在上方，整株又换了一种姿态。\n从细密花边退后到整片菜地，这次对一片菜叶的欣赏，就变成了对整株植物的认识。": "The video mentions familiar ways of using kale, including in juice and cold dishes. I also like to leave it in the vegetable bed to look at. As the stem gets taller the leaves gather towards the top, and the whole plant takes on another posture.\nStepping back from the fine frilled edge to the whole bed, I had gone from admiring a single leaf to recognising the plant it grew on.", "这期聊到榨汁、凉拌等日常做法，也喜欢把它留在菜地里观赏。长高以后，叶子集中在上方，整株又换了一种姿态。": "The video mentions familiar ways of using kale, including in juice and cold dishes. I also like to leave it in the vegetable bed to look at. As the stem gets taller the leaves gather towards the top, and the whole plant takes on another posture.", "从细密花边退后到整片菜地，这次对一片菜叶的欣赏，就变成了对整株植物的认识。": "Stepping back from the fine frilled edge to the whole bed, I had gone from admiring a single leaf to recognising the plant it grew on.", "按Brassica oleracea种级分类，羽衣甘蓝作为栽培类型保留；未擅自补写品种名。": "The species is classified as Brassica oleracea. Kale is retained as a cultivated form; no cultivar name has been inferred.", "原视频使用的卷叶栽培类型名称，未单设独立档案。": "A curly-leaved cultivated form named in the original video. It does not have a separate record here.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智 iPlant：芸薹属 Brassica": "iPlant: the genus Brassica"}, "20260815-01": {"科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The observations and images come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "翠云草": "Cuìyúncǎo (翠云草)", "阴凉处的一片孔雀蓝，换一个角度，看叶片如何把光变成颜色。": "A flash of peacock blue in the shade. Look from another angle and see what these leaves do with light.", "翠云草：大自然的调色家，它为什么会发出蓝光？": "Cuìyúncǎo, nature’s colourist: why does it gleam blue?", "蓝凤凰蕨": "Lánfènghuángjué (蓝凤凰蕨)", "孔雀蕨": "Kǒngquèjué (孔雀蕨)", "结构色": "Structural colour", "林下": "Forest understory", "孢子": "Spores", "阴凉角落里的孔雀蓝": "Peacock blue in a shady corner", "在这一片阴凉的角落，翠云草的叶子泛着孔雀蓝一样的金属光泽。没有滤镜，没有染色，更没有打灯，它真的就是这个颜色。\n但走到光线更亮一点的地方，它又会变成绿色，有些甚至还会泛着一点红色。为什么会这样呢？": "In this shady corner, the leaves of cuìyúncǎo have a metallic, peacock-blue sheen. I didn’t use a filter, dye the leaves or set up a light. This is the colour I saw.\nWalk a little way into brighter light and the leaves look green. Some even have a tinge of red. Why the difference?", "在这一片阴凉的角落，翠云草的叶子泛着孔雀蓝一样的金属光泽。没有滤镜，没有染色，更没有打灯，它真的就是这个颜色。": "In this shady corner, the leaves of cuìyúncǎo have a metallic, peacock-blue sheen. I didn’t use a filter, dye the leaves or set up a light. This is the colour I saw.", "但走到光线更亮一点的地方，它又会变成绿色，有些甚至还会泛着一点红色。为什么会这样呢？": "Walk a little way into brighter light and the leaves look green. Some even have a tinge of red. Why the difference?", "换个角度，再看一眼": "Take another look from a different angle", "翠云草的蓝色来自叶片内部精细的微观结构。光线进入叶片后发生反射、干涉，我们的眼睛就看到了这样的蓝色。这种颜色，有一个名字：结构色。\n我觉得最有趣的是，同一片叶子，换一个观察角度，颜色也会跟着变化。是不是很神奇？": "The blue comes from tiny structures inside the leaves. Light is reflected within the leaf, and the reflected light waves interfere with one another. We see the result as blue. There’s a name for this: structural colour.\nWhat intrigues me most is that I can look at the very same leaf from another angle and see a different colour.", "翠云草的蓝色来自叶片内部精细的微观结构。光线进入叶片后发生反射、干涉，我们的眼睛就看到了这样的蓝色。这种颜色，有一个名字：结构色。": "The blue comes from tiny structures inside the leaves. Light is reflected within the leaf, and the reflected light waves interfere with one another. We see the result as blue. There’s a name for this: structural colour.", "我觉得最有趣的是，同一片叶子，换一个观察角度，颜色也会跟着变化。是不是很神奇？": "What intrigues me most is that I can look at the very same leaf from another angle and see a different colour.", "蓝色的秘密，还没有讲完": "What does the blue do?", "这种叶片结构可能与适应林下弱光环境有关，帮助利用微弱的光线，或调节进入叶片的光能。不过，它真正的作用，目前还没有完全确定。\n看这片叶子，有的泛蓝，有的发绿，还有一点红色。放在一起看，更能感受到颜色的变化。": "This leaf structure may help the plant make use of the faint light beneath the forest canopy, or regulate how much light enters the leaf. Its precise role is still uncertain.\nLooking at the leaves together, I can see blue on some, green on others and a little red here and there. Side by side, the shifts in colour are easier to see.", "这种叶片结构可能与适应林下弱光环境有关，帮助利用微弱的光线，或调节进入叶片的光能。不过，它真正的作用，目前还没有完全确定。": "This leaf structure may help the plant make use of the faint light beneath the forest canopy, or regulate how much light enters the leaf. Its precise role is still uncertain.", "看这片叶子，有的泛蓝，有的发绿，还有一点红色。放在一起看，更能感受到颜色的变化。": "Looking at the leaves together, I can see blue on some, green on others and a little red here and there. Side by side, the shifts in colour are easier to see.", "一片蓝绿色的羽毛地毯": "A feathery blue-green carpet", "翠云草也被叫作蓝凤凰蕨、孔雀蕨。它不会开花，也不会结果，靠孢子繁殖；此外也可以扦插。剪下一小段枝条，保持湿润和适当通风，它就有机会慢慢铺开。\n如果长期闷在密闭的玻璃容器里，叶片容易腐烂。看着这一片蓝绿色，我最感兴趣的，还是它怎样把光变成了颜色。": "Two other Chinese names for this plant are lánfènghuángjué (蓝凤凰蕨) and kǒngquèjué (孔雀蕨). It reproduces by spores and bears neither flowers nor fruit. It can also grow from a cutting. A small piece of a shoot, kept moist with some airflow, may gradually spread.\nThe leaves can rot if they’re shut in a sealed glass container for too long. Looking over this patch of blue and green, I keep coming back to the same question: how do these leaves turn light into colour?", "翠云草也被叫作蓝凤凰蕨、孔雀蕨。它不会开花，也不会结果，靠孢子繁殖；此外也可以扦插。剪下一小段枝条，保持湿润和适当通风，它就有机会慢慢铺开。": "Two other Chinese names for this plant are lánfènghuángjué (蓝凤凰蕨) and kǒngquèjué (孔雀蕨). It reproduces by spores and bears neither flowers nor fruit. It can also grow from a cutting. A small piece of a shoot, kept moist with some airflow, may gradually spread.", "如果长期闷在密闭的玻璃容器里，叶片容易腐烂。看着这一片蓝绿色，我最感兴趣的，还是它怎样把光变成了颜色。": "The leaves can rot if they’re shut in a sealed glass container for too long. Looking over this patch of blue and green, I keep coming back to the same question: how do these leaves turn light into colour?", "叶片近看": "A closer look at the leaves.", "枝叶间的蓝绿色": "Blue and green among the leafy shoots.", "界": "Kingdom", "门": "Phylum", "纲": "Class", "亚纲": "Subclass", "目": "Order", "科": "Family", "属": "Genus", "种": "Species", "植物界": "Plants", "链型植物门": "Streptophytes", "木贼纲": "Equisetopsida", "石松亚纲": "Lycopodiidae", "卷柏目": "Selaginellales", "卷柏科": "Selaginellaceae", "卷柏属": "Selaginella", "石松类": "Lycophytes", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "植物界 / Plantae": "Plants / Plantae", "链型植物门 / Streptophyta": "Streptophytes / Streptophyta", "木贼纲 / Equisetopsida": "Equisetopsida", "石松亚纲 / Lycopodiidae": "Lycopodiidae", "卷柏目 / Selaginellales": "Selaginellales", "卷柏科 / Selaginellaceae": "Selaginellaceae", "卷柏属 / Selaginella": "Selaginella", "翠云草 / Selaginella uncinata": "Cuìyúncǎo (翠云草) / Selaginella uncinata"}, "20260422-01": {"叶片正面": "The upper surface of the foliage.", "逆光下的叶丛": "Backlit foliage", "采收的胡萝卜": "Freshly harvested carrots", "分叉弯曲的肉质根": "A forked, curved fleshy root.", "新叶与叶柄": "New leaves and leaf stalks", "土面露出的肉质根": "Storage root showing above the soil", "从土中拔起胡萝卜": "Pulling a carrot from the soil", "多色胡萝卜对照": "Carrots of different colours.", "细裂叶片": "Finely divided leaf", "菜地里的叶丛": "Foliage in the vegetable bed", "拔出来以前，谁也不知道这根胡萝卜长什么样。土里的人参娃娃，地上还有一丛轻轻的绿叶。": "Until I pulled it up, there was no telling what shape this carrot would be. A little ginseng doll hid below ground, with a tuft of delicate green leaves above.", "拔出来，像个人参娃娃": "Out came a little ginseng doll", "拔胡萝卜之前，地上只看得见一丛叶子。等根离开土，才发现这一根居然分叉弯曲，像个小人参娃娃。\n根在土中生长，遇到障碍、受伤或环境差异时，形态可能改变。光凭分叉，不能反推出唯一原因，但这个结果确实很有趣。": "Before I pulled the carrot, all I could see above ground was a clump of leaves. Once the root came out, I found it was forked and bent, like a little doll made from ginseng.\nAn obstacle in the soil, an injury or differences in growing conditions can alter a root’s shape. The fork alone doesn’t tell me exactly what happened, but the result certainly caught my eye.", "拔胡萝卜之前，地上只看得见一丛叶子。等根离开土，才发现这一根居然分叉弯曲，像个小人参娃娃。": "Before I pulled the carrot, all I could see above ground was a clump of leaves. Once the root came out, I found it was forked and bent, like a little doll made from ginseng.", "根在土中生长，遇到障碍、受伤或环境差异时，形态可能改变。光凭分叉，不能反推出唯一原因，但这个结果确实很有趣。": "An obstacle in the soil, an injury or differences in growing conditions can alter a root’s shape. The fork alone doesn’t tell me exactly what happened, but the result certainly caught my eye.", "地上这一半，也很好看": "The half above ground is lovely too", "叶子分裂得细细的，风一吹，有一种轻盈的野趣。平常买胡萝卜只看根，这次在菜地里，叶子的样子也值得留下。\n我们常吃的膨大部分是肉质根，用来储存物质，支持植物后续生长。": "The leaves are divided into fine segments and look wonderfully light in the wind. I usually look only at the root when buying carrots. In the vegetable bed I wanted to record the foliage too.\nThe swollen part we usually eat is a fleshy root. It stores reserves the plant can use for growth later.", "叶子分裂得细细的，风一吹，有一种轻盈的野趣。平常买胡萝卜只看根，这次在菜地里，叶子的样子也值得留下。": "The leaves are divided into fine segments and look wonderfully light in the wind. I usually look only at the root when buying carrots. In the vegetable bed I wanted to record the foliage too.", "我们常吃的膨大部分是肉质根，用来储存物质，支持植物后续生长。": "The swollen part we usually eat is a fleshy root. It stores reserves the plant can use for growth later.", "胡萝卜，也不只有橙色": "Carrots come in more than orange", "桌上排开橙色、黄色和紫色胡萝卜，一下子又热闹起来。不同栽培类型的颜色，让熟悉的蔬菜显得新鲜。\n视频中还提到白色复伞形花序，这次素材主要记录根和叶。等它开花，再去看看那一片白色蕾丝。": "I laid orange, yellow and purple carrots out on the table. The range of colours among cultivated forms made a familiar vegetable feel new again.\nThe video also mentions the white compound umbels, though this set of photographs mostly records roots and leaves. When the carrots flower, I want to come back and see that white lace.", "桌上排开橙色、黄色和紫色胡萝卜，一下子又热闹起来。不同栽培类型的颜色，让熟悉的蔬菜显得新鲜。": "I laid orange, yellow and purple carrots out on the table. The range of colours among cultivated forms made a familiar vegetable feel new again.", "视频中还提到白色复伞形花序，这次素材主要记录根和叶。等它开花，再去看看那一片白色蕾丝。": "The video also mentions the white compound umbels, though this set of photographs mostly records roots and leaves. When the carrots flower, I want to come back and see that white lace.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智 iPlant：胡萝卜属 Daucus": "iPlant: the genus Daucus"}, "20251007-01": {"整丛植株与人物高度对照": "A whole clump beside a person for scale", "花叶芦竹叶片、茎节和花序手绘": "Drawing of variegated giant reed: leaves, stem nodes and inflorescence", "手边观察茎节": "A hand beside the nodes of the stem.", "花序近看": "Inflorescence in close-up", "叶片基部与叶舌区域": "Base of the leaf and the ligule region", "叶片抱茎处": "Leaf clasping the stem", "蓝天下的圆锥花序": "A panicle against the blue sky.", "小穗近看": "Spikelet in close-up", "高茎与顶端花序": "Tall stems with terminal panicles.", "花序细枝与小穗": "Fine inflorescence branches and spikelets", "茎节与叶鞘": "Stem node and leaf sheath", "条带状叶片": "Ribbon-like leaves", "叶片上的浅色条纹": "Pale stripes along the leaf.", "白、黄、绿的条纹，沿着长叶一路伸展。花叶芦竹高过人头，顶端还举着蓬松的花序。": "White, yellow and green stripes run the length of each blade. This variegated giant reed stood taller than my head, holding its fluffy panicles above me.", "比我高很多的一丛条纹": "A clump of stripes that towers over me", "花叶芦竹长得很高，叶片上白、黄、绿的条纹沿着纵向伸开，很醒目。它是芦竹的园艺品种，看到叶色就有了第一条线索。\n它与竹子、芦苇都属于禾本科，但认种还要结合茎、叶和花序，不能只凭俗名或茎是否空心。": "It was tall enough to tower above me, and the lengthwise white, yellow and green stripes really stood out. This is a cultivar of giant reed, so the variegation was my first clue.\nIt shares the grass family with bamboos and common reeds. But to recognise the species I need to consider stem, leaves and flower head together, rather than relying on an everyday name or whether a stem is hollow.", "花叶芦竹长得很高，叶片上白、黄、绿的条纹沿着纵向伸开，很醒目。它是芦竹的园艺品种，看到叶色就有了第一条线索。": "It was tall enough to tower above me, and the lengthwise white, yellow and green stripes really stood out. This is a cultivar of giant reed, so the variegation was my first clue.", "它与竹子、芦苇都属于禾本科，但认种还要结合茎、叶和花序，不能只凭俗名或茎是否空心。": "It shares the grass family with bamboos and common reeds. But to recognise the species I need to consider stem, leaves and flower head together, rather than relying on an everyday name or whether a stem is hollow.", "一边一片，沿着茎往上排": "A leaf on one side, then one on the other", "长叶从茎两侧交替伸出，叶鞘抱着茎，排列很有秩序。走近看茎节，再看叶片如何从这里展开，结构很清楚。\n同一丛里，浅色条纹的比例并不完全一样，现有照片把这些差异都留下了。": "Long leaves project alternately from either side of the stem, their sheaths wrapped neatly around it. Up close, I could see the nodes and how a blade opened out from each one.\nEven in the same clump, the proportion of pale striping varied from leaf to leaf. The photographs show some of that variation.", "长叶从茎两侧交替伸出，叶鞘抱着茎，排列很有秩序。走近看茎节，再看叶片如何从这里展开，结构很清楚。": "Long leaves project alternately from either side of the stem, their sheaths wrapped neatly around it. Up close, I could see the nodes and how a blade opened out from each one.", "同一丛里，浅色条纹的比例并不完全一样，现有照片把这些差异都留下了。": "Even in the same clump, the proportion of pale striping varied from leaf to leaf. The photographs show some of that variation.", "头顶上，举着一把大尾巴": "A great plume overhead", "补充素材拍到了顶端圆锥花序，蓬蓬松松地向上伸，像一把大尾巴。近看，是许多细枝与小穗组合起来。\n退后再看整丛，花序、长叶和高茎形成了完整的轮廓。园林里用它做背景，确实很有存在感。": "The additional photographs show the terminal panicle rising like a great fluffy tail. Up close it resolves into many small branches and spikelets.\nFarther back, the panicles, long leaves and tall stems made up the outline of the entire clump. As a backdrop in a garden, it certainly makes its presence felt.", "补充素材拍到了顶端圆锥花序，蓬蓬松松地向上伸，像一把大尾巴。近看，是许多细枝与小穗组合起来。": "The additional photographs show the terminal panicle rising like a great fluffy tail. Up close it resolves into many small branches and spikelets.", "退后再看整丛，花序、长叶和高茎形成了完整的轮廓。园林里用它做背景，确实很有存在感。": "Farther back, the panicles, long leaves and tall stems made up the outline of the entire clump. As a backdrop in a garden, it certainly makes its presence felt.", "按Arundo donax种级分类，文稿栽培名称Arundo donax 'Versicolor'单独保留。": "The species is classified as Arundo donax. The manuscript’s cultivar name Arundo donax 'Versicolor' is recorded separately.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250909-01": {"厚实的浅绿叶片": "Thick, pale green leaves", "枝端花苞": "Buds at the branch tip", "绿色幼果": "A young green fruit.", "枝头扇形白花": "Fan-shaped white flower at the tip of a branch", "花冠裂片与弯曲花柱": "Corolla lobes and the curved style.", "手边观察花朵": "Flower examined beside a hand", "开花枝条": "Flowering branch", "花冠背面": "The back of the corolla.", "花后的子房与花萼": "Ovary and calyx after flowering", "草海桐花果枝叶手绘": "Drawing of Scaevola taccada: flowers, fruits, branches and leaves", "花与细长花苞": "Flower and slender bud", "海风里，白花只向一侧展开，像一把把小扇子。草海桐的“半边花”，越看越有意思。": "In the sea breeze, the white flowers opened on one side only, like so many little fans. The longer I looked, the more interesting each “half flower” became.", "这些小扇子，原来都是花": "Those little fans are flowers", "海边一丛草海桐，开着一把把白色小扇子。五个花冠裂片向一侧排列，看着像只开了半朵花。\n细看还能找到淡淡的条纹和边缘细毛，花柱向前弯着，像一盏小路灯。": "A clump of Scaevola by the sea was covered in little white fans. The five lobes of each corolla lie to one side, making it look as if only half a flower has opened.\nUp close I could see faint stripes and fine hairs at the edges. The style curved forwards like a miniature streetlamp.", "海边一丛草海桐，开着一把把白色小扇子。五个花冠裂片向一侧排列，看着像只开了半朵花。": "A clump of Scaevola by the sea was covered in little white fans. The five lobes of each corolla lie to one side, making it look as if only half a flower has opened.", "细看还能找到淡淡的条纹和边缘细毛，花柱向前弯着，像一盏小路灯。": "Up close I could see faint stripes and fine hairs at the edges. The style curved forwards like a miniature streetlamp.", "换个角度，看这把扇子": "The fan from another angle", "从侧面和背面看，花冠的结构更清楚。旁边长长的小筒是还没有展开的花苞，一朵朵沿着枝端出现。\n视频中把这种花形与传粉昆虫的停留联系起来。只看形状，也足够让人感叹它的特别。": "From the side and from behind I could make out the structure of the corolla more clearly. The long little tubes beside the flowers were unopened buds, appearing along the tips of the branches.\nIn the video I considered how the flower shape might relate to where a visiting insect settles. Even just looking at the shape, I found it extraordinary.", "从侧面和背面看，花冠的结构更清楚。旁边长长的小筒是还没有展开的花苞，一朵朵沿着枝端出现。": "From the side and from behind I could make out the structure of the corolla more clearly. The long little tubes beside the flowers were unopened buds, appearing along the tips of the branches.", "视频中把这种花形与传粉昆虫的停留联系起来。只看形状，也足够让人感叹它的特别。": "In the video I considered how the flower shape might relate to where a visiting insect settles. Even just looking at the shape, I found it extraordinary.", "叶子油亮，朝着海风长": "Glossy leaves facing the sea breeze", "叶片厚厚的，浅绿而有光泽，集中在枝端。连着雨天以后，看上去尤其精神。\n草海桐常生长在海岸边，整株有时直立，有时向外铺开。花旁边还能找到绿色幼果，成熟后会转白，这次照片先留下青果的样子。": "The thick, glossy, light green leaves cluster at the branch tips. After several rainy days they looked particularly fresh.\nThis plant is often found on the coast, sometimes standing upright, sometimes spreading outwards. Beside the flowers I also found green young fruits. They turn white when ripe, but this time I photographed the green stage.", "叶片厚厚的，浅绿而有光泽，集中在枝端。连着雨天以后，看上去尤其精神。": "The thick, glossy, light green leaves cluster at the branch tips. After several rainy days they looked particularly fresh.", "草海桐常生长在海岸边，整株有时直立，有时向外铺开。花旁边还能找到绿色幼果，成熟后会转白，这次照片先留下青果的样子。": "This plant is often found on the coast, sometimes standing upright, sometimes spreading outwards. Beside the flowers I also found green young fruits. They turn white when ripe, but this time I photographed the green stage.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260306-01": {"草莓田中的花、叶与成熟果": "Flowers, leaves and ripe fruit in the strawberry field.", "手中成熟草莓与切面": "A ripe strawberry held in the hand and a cut surface.", "草莓切面及表面小瘦果": "A cut strawberry and the small achenes on its surface.", "翻开叶子找草莓，也看看红色花托上的小小果实。": "Lift the leaves to find the strawberries, then look for the tiny fruits sitting on the red receptacle.", "冬天最期待的一件事": "One of the things I look forward to most in winter", "在南方，冬天最期待的活动之一就是摘草莓。翻开叶子，红彤彤的草莓藏在下面，一丛又一丛，真让人羡慕。\n田里有花也有果，白色的小花衬着深绿的叶子。很多时候我们只顾着找果子，差点忘了花也这么好看。": "Here in the south, picking strawberries is one of my favourite winter outings. Lift a leaf and there is another bright red strawberry underneath: clump after clump. What a crop to envy!\nThere were flowers as well as fruit in the field. The little white flowers stood out against dark green leaves. In our hunt for strawberries it was easy to forget how lovely the flowers were.", "在南方，冬天最期待的活动之一就是摘草莓。翻开叶子，红彤彤的草莓藏在下面，一丛又一丛，真让人羡慕。": "Here in the south, picking strawberries is one of my favourite winter outings. Lift a leaf and there is another bright red strawberry underneath: clump after clump. What a crop to envy!", "田里有花也有果，白色的小花衬着深绿的叶子。很多时候我们只顾着找果子，差点忘了花也这么好看。": "There were flowers as well as fruit in the field. The little white flowers stood out against dark green leaves. In our hunt for strawberries it was easy to forget how lovely the flowers were.", "红色的部分，原来是花托": "The red part is the receptacle", "拿起一颗细看，表面密密的小点才是一颗颗小果实；我们吃的红色部分主要是膨大的花托。切开之后，这个平日熟悉的水果又有了另一种样子。\n栽培草莓的学名中有一个乘号，它与北美的弗吉尼亚草莓和南美的智利草莓的杂交起源有关。": "I held one up to look closely. Each of the little dots on the surface is a fruit. The red part we eat is mainly the swollen receptacle. Cutting it open gave me another view of a fruit I thought I knew well.\nThe multiplication sign in the scientific name of the cultivated strawberry indicates its hybrid origin, involving the Virginia strawberry of North America and the Chilean strawberry of South America.", "拿起一颗细看，表面密密的小点才是一颗颗小果实；我们吃的红色部分主要是膨大的花托。切开之后，这个平日熟悉的水果又有了另一种样子。": "I held one up to look closely. Each of the little dots on the surface is a fruit. The red part we eat is mainly the swollen receptacle. Cutting it open gave me another view of a fruit I thought I knew well.", "栽培草莓的学名中有一个乘号，它与北美的弗吉尼亚草莓和南美的智利草莓的杂交起源有关。": "The multiplication sign in the scientific name of the cultivated strawberry indicates its hybrid origin, involving the Virginia strawberry of North America and the Chilean strawberry of South America.", "还没入口，香气已经到了": "The scent reaches me first", "它的叶子是三出复叶，叶脉和边缘的锯齿很明显。青色的小果逐渐变红，沉甸甸地垂下来，摘的时候还得记得往叶子下面找。\n我摘了一捧，先闻一下：好香啊！有时候来不及细细描写，它已经进了嘴里，只剩下一句：甜，太幸福了。": "Each leaf has three leaflets, with conspicuous veins and toothed edges. The young green strawberries gradually turn red and hang heavy. When picking them, remember to look under the leaves.\nI picked a handful and stopped to smell them first. What a fragrance! Sometimes a strawberry is in my mouth before I’ve had time to describe it. All I can say then is: sweet. What a pleasure.", "它的叶子是三出复叶，叶脉和边缘的锯齿很明显。青色的小果逐渐变红，沉甸甸地垂下来，摘的时候还得记得往叶子下面找。": "Each leaf has three leaflets, with conspicuous veins and toothed edges. The young green strawberries gradually turn red and hang heavy. When picking them, remember to look under the leaves.", "我摘了一捧，先闻一下：好香啊！有时候来不及细细描写，它已经进了嘴里，只剩下一句：甜，太幸福了。": "I picked a handful and stopped to smell them first. What a fragrance! Sometimes a strawberry is in my mouth before I’ve had time to describe it. All I can say then is: sweet. What a pleasure.", "视频提及的栽培草莓亲本。": "Mentioned as a parent of cultivated strawberries.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260609-01": {"枝上的叶片": "Leaves on a branch", "满枝的白花": "Branch covered in white blossoms", "尚未开裂的果实": "A fruit that has yet to split", "抬头看树冠间的缝隙，低头捡起落花，认识山林里的木荷。": "Look up at the gaps in the canopy, then down to pick up a fallen flower: two ways to get to know this forest tree.", "先抬头，看看树冠": "Look up into the canopy", "在木荷这里，很容易看到“树冠羞闭”的现象：相邻的树冠之间，留出一道细细的缝隙。特别是在春天，树冠真的非常好看，像云一样连在一起，又隔着一点距离。": "Look up into a stand of Schima superba and you can see a fine gap between neighbouring crowns, a pattern called crown shyness. In spring the crowns are especially lovely, like banks of cloud drifting side by side without quite touching.", "沿着山脊走一走": "A walk along the ridge", "我在山顶这条路上走着，两边是防火林，有木荷和楠树，还点缀着几棵台湾相思。嫩绿嫩绿的，有初夏的感觉。\n木荷常被用在防火林带里。它的革质叶摸起来有一点硬。说它是“防火树”，指的是它在林带中帮助减缓火势、阻隔传播的作用，并不是说一棵树可以灭火。": "The ridge path runs through a firebreak planted with Schima and nanmu trees, with a few Taiwan acacias in between. All those fresh greens make it feel like early summer.\nSchima is often planted in firebreaks. Its leathery leaves feel a little stiff. Calling it a firebreak tree means that a belt of these trees can help slow a fire's spread; an individual tree will not put a fire out.", "花太高了，我捡几朵给你看": "The flowers are high, so I picked some up", "现在是五月中旬，我身后这棵木荷开花了，可是花很高。我刚刚在地上捡了几朵，给大家近一点看。\n你看，雄蕊和花瓣还齐整整地在一起，没有散开。闻一下，有点淡淡的茶香。它的花像山茶花，和茶树一样，属于山茶科。": "It is mid-May, and the tree behind me is in flower, but the blossoms are too high to reach. I found a few on the ground so we can see them close up.\nLook: the stamens and petals are still neatly together. There is a faint scent of tea. The flowers remind me of camellias; Schima and the tea plant belong to the same family, Theaceae.", "像小风车一样的果实": "Little windmills", "木荷的果实是木质蒴果，小球圆滚滚的，成熟后会开裂，乍一看像一个小风车。它的种子带着翅膀，借着风远行。\n要加油哦，下一批守护山林的任务，也要继续交给你们了。": "The fruit is a woody capsule, round until it splits open at maturity. Once open it looks, at first glance, like a little windmill. Its winged seeds travel on the wind.\nOff you go, seeds. The forest will be counting on the next generation of trees as well.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250902-01": {"拆开的花部": "Dissected floral parts", "挂果枝条全貌": "The whole fruiting branch", "对生叶片与枝条连接处": "Where opposite leaves join the branch", "紧贴枝条的小花": "Small flowers close against the branch", "枝上的成熟福木果实": "Ripe Garcinia subelliptica fruits on a branch", "果实与厚革质叶": "Fruit and thick, leathery leaves", "手中三个成熟果实": "Three ripe fruits in a hand", "黄澄澄的果子、枝上的小花，还有厚实得让人印象深刻的叶子。": "Golden-yellow fruits, little flowers on the branches, and leaves whose thickness is hard to forget.", "一捧黄澄澄的果子": "A handful of golden fruit", "这一捧果子叫菲岛福木。它和山竹同属藤黄属，剥开时，也能看见分瓣的果肉。\n这次记录里，我最难描述的是它的气味：仿佛几种热带水果混在一起，徘徊在好闻与不好闻之间。成熟的果子黄澄澄，未成熟时则像一个个绿橘子。": "These golden fruits are from Garcinia subelliptica. It belongs to the same genus as mangosteen, and the flesh inside also comes in segments.\nThe hardest thing to describe is the smell. Imagine several tropical fruits mixed together, somewhere on the border between pleasant and decidedly odd. The ripe fruits are golden yellow; the unripe ones look like green tangerines.", "果子大，花却很小": "Big fruit, tiny flowers", "看过果子，再回头看看五月拍到的花，反差真大。小花一簇簇贴着枝条，花瓣厚厚的，初看有点像蜡梅。\n把花部放在叶片上细看，雌雄花的结构并不一样。那些小小的花，后来竟能长成这样醒目的果子。": "After the fruits I went back to the flowers I photographed in May. What a contrast! Little clusters sit close against the branches. The thick petals made me think of wintersweet at first.\nI laid the flower parts on a leaf to look more closely. The male and female flowers are built differently. It is remarkable that such small flowers can lead to such conspicuous fruit.", "厚厚的叶子，很有精神": "Thick, glossy leaves", "福木的叶子让我印象很深：大、厚，摸起来很有质感，正面深绿，背面颜色浅一些，顶端钝钝的，有的微凹。\n一对、两对，顺着枝条能看清对生的排列。密实的叶子合成紧凑的树冠，整棵树看起来很有生命力。": "I remember the feel of these leaves: large and thick, dark green above and paler underneath. The tips are blunt, some with a small notch.\nOne pair, then another: it is easy to follow their opposite arrangement along the branch. Together they make a dense, compact canopy that gives the whole tree such a vigorous look.", "视频用于比较果实的同属植物。": "Another species of the genus, included for comparison of the fruits.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260821-01": {"萝芙木：枝间的小白花": "Small white flowers among the branches of R. verticillata.", "萝芙木：紫黑色果实近看": "A closer look at the purple-black fruits of R. verticillata.", "同片物种 · 蛇根木：枝梢的红色果实": "Also in the video: bright red fruits near the tip of a shoot of R. serpentina.", "萝芙木：一簇果实呈现出不同的颜色": "Fruits at several stages of ripening in a single cluster of R. verticillata.", "萝芙木：从枝条上看轮生的叶片": "A branch of R. verticillata showing its whorled leaves.", "同片记录的白色小花已经开放，旁边仍有淡红花蕾。": "Small white flowers have opened beside buds that are still pale red.", "同片物种 · 四叶萝芙木：叶丛间的果实": "Also in the video: fruits among the leaves of R. tetraphylla.", "同片对照的枝条上，暗色和红色果实并存。": "Dark and red fruits on one of the branches shown for comparison.", "一簇花蕾生在叶片上方。": "A cluster of buds above the leaves.", "同片物种 · 蛇根木：由红转黑的果实": "Also in the video: fruits of R. serpentina turning from red to black.", "萝芙木：叶面与叶脉": "The leaf surface and veins of R. verticillata.", "同片对照的花枝，小花有浅色花管和淡红色花蕾。": "A flowering branch shown for comparison, with pale flower tubes and reddish buds.", "同片物种 · 四叶萝芙木：叶片、花与果实": "Also in the video: leaves, flowers and fruit of R. tetraphylla.", "一次遇见三种萝芙木属植物，从叶片和果实的区别，聊到植物分类学家的工作。": "Three species of Rauvolfia in one botanical garden. Looking at their leaves and fruit led me to a question: what does a plant taxonomist actually do?", "一次遇见三个相似的名字": "Three similar names in one garden", "今天在植物园，看见了三种萝芙木属植物：萝芙木、四叶萝芙木和蛇根木。它们长得有点相似，枝头又都挂着果实，很适合放在一起看一看。\n这一页先从萝芙木开始。小小的果实挤在一起，同一簇里能看到绿色、暗红色和紫黑色，好像把变化的过程摆在了眼前。": "At the botanical garden today I found three members of the same genus: Rauvolfia verticillata, R. tetraphylla and R. serpentina. All three were in fruit, which made this a good chance to compare them.\nI started with R. verticillata. Its little fruits crowd together. Green, dark red and almost black fruits share the same cluster; it is like seeing successive stages all at once.", "先看萝芙木的叶子": "Start with the leaves", "萝芙木是我国南方可以见到的乡土树种。它的叶片变化比较大，可以看到三至五枚叶片轮生。\n只盯着一颗果子，不一定能把它们分清。退后一点，看叶子怎样着生，再把花、果一起对照，线索就多起来了。": "Rauvolfia verticillata is native to southern China. Its leaves are quite variable, with three to five sometimes growing in a whorl.\nA single fruit may not tell me which species I am looking at. I step back to see how the leaves are arranged, then look at the flowers and fruit together.", "四叶萝芙木，像一个蝴蝶结": "Four leaves like a bow", "四叶萝芙木最让我想指给大家看的，是它的叶子。通常四枚叶片轮生，常常两大两小，展开来很像一个蝴蝶结。\n再往叶丛里找，还能看到小花和果实。名字里有“四叶”，但观察时还是要把叶片、枝条和花果合在一起看。": "The leaves are what I wanted to show you on R. tetraphylla. There are usually four in a whorl, often two large and two small. Spread out, they look just like a bow.\nLook among the leaves and you can find flowers and fruit as well. The name refers to the four leaves, but it helps to look at the whole branch.", "蛇根木，把故事带到了另一处": "A name that sent me looking", "蛇根木也叫印度萝芙木。镜头里，它的红色果实很醒目；真正让我继续查下去的，却是它的名字和根部的故事。\n查资料时，我读到了从蛇根木中分离利血平的研究，也读到了蒋英教授调查萝芙木属植物的经历。于是，这次观察又多了一个问题：植物分类学家，到底在做什么？": "Rauvolfia serpentina is also called Indian snakeroot. Its red fruits stand out in the photographs, but it was the name and the story of its roots that sent me back to the books.\nI came across research on the isolation of reserpine from this plant, and accounts of the botanist Jiang Ying’s work on Rauvolfia. What, I began to wonder, does a plant taxonomist actually do?", "找到之后，还要确认它是谁": "Finding a plant is only the beginning", "我最初读到的故事，把植物资源调查和药物生产连在了一起。但再看下去，发现“找到一株植物”和“确认一种资源”，中间还有很多工作。\n蒋英教授和同行调查的，是我国有没有蛇根木或相近的植物、它们在哪里、彼此有什么区别。采集标本、比较形态、确认分类，才让后来的研究有了可以对照的依据。\n所以让我感兴趣的，不只是植物被找到了。还有那条从找到、辨认到留下证据的路。回头再看眼前这三种相似的植物，分类这件事就不那么抽象了。": "The story I first read went straight from a plant survey to the production of a medicine. The more I read, the clearer it became just how much work lies between finding one plant and establishing the identity of a botanical resource.\nJiang Ying and his colleagues were trying to find out whether R. serpentina or its relatives grew in China, where they occurred and how to tell them apart. They collected specimens, compared their features and established their identities, leaving evidence that other researchers could check.\nThat is the part I find most interesting: seeing the plant, working out what it is and keeping the evidence. Looking again at the three plants in front of me, taxonomy feels much less abstract.", "矢志不移发掘祖国绿色宝藏——记著名植物分类学家蒋英教授": "Exploring China’s plant resources: a portrait of the taxonomist Jiang Ying", "基于CiteSpace的萝芙木属植物研究知识图谱可视化分析": "Mapping research on Rauvolfia using CiteSpace", "《中国植物志》：萝芙木": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae: Rauvolfia verticillata", "纪念蒋英教授（英文）": "In memory of Professor Jiang Ying (in English)", "云南萝芙木的名称记录": "The name record for Rauvolfia yunnanensis", "抗战时期粤北地区植物标本采集研究（2）——以中国数字植物标本馆数据为例": "Plant collecting in northern Guangdong during the War of Resistance, part 2: evidence from the Chinese Virtual Herbarium", "植物分类学家蒋英先生在粤北“学术抗战”的烽火岁月": "Jiang Ying’s botanical work in northern Guangdong during the war", "“以立德树人为根本，以强农兴农为己任。”——学史明德、传承“丁颖精神”、勇攀科学高峰系列专题": "A series on education, agricultural research and the legacy of Ding Ying", "著名植物分类学家、华南农学院一级教授蒋英": "Jiang Ying, plant taxonomist and professor at South China Agricultural College", "黄家驷代表的发言（1960年4月9日《人民日报》）": "Speech by Huang Jiasi, People’s Daily, 9 April 1960", "珍奇的热带植物（1958年6月13日《人民日报》）": "Rare tropical plants, People’s Daily, 13 June 1958", "再论传统国产复方制剂在我国高血压防治中的作用与创新": "The role and development of traditional Chinese compound preparations in hypertension care", "利血平说明书": "Reserpine prescribing information", "中国高血压防治追梦半世纪——那些年 那些人 那些事（原稿推荐阅读）": "A half-century of work on hypertension in China: people, events and memories (further reading in the manuscript)", "本档案的主对象是萝芙木。四叶萝芙木和蛇根木是同一期视频中另外记录的两个物种，各自的名称与分类来源列在下方；本期仍计为一个视频档案。": "This record is about Rauvolfia verticillata. R. tetraphylla and R. serpentina also appear in the same video; their names and sources are listed separately. The video counts as one record.", "这一期还记录了下面两个物种。照片与段落分别标明对象，分类表对应本档案主对象萝芙木。": "The two additional species shown in this video are identified separately in the photographs and text. The taxonomy table describes Rauvolfia verticillata, the subject of this record.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250926-01": {"藤蔓铺开在林缘，花枝与其它植被相互交错。": "At the woodland edge, flowering vines intertwine with other vegetation.", "抬头看，藤蔓一直延伸到高处的树冠。": "Looking up, the vines extend all the way into the canopy.", "花序之间，可以看到略带肉质的叶片": "Slightly fleshy leaves visible between flower clusters", "花序近看：花苞与已经开放的小花": "Inflorescence in close-up: buds and open flowers", "藤蔓旁交错的花序": "Inflorescences crossing beside the vine", "湿润的叶片与带白花的细长花序。": "Damp leaves and a slender inflorescence bearing white flowers.", "藤蔓与叶丛间，垂下许多白色花序": "White flower clusters hang among the vines and leaves", "一条花序上的花苞与小花": "Buds and small flowers on one inflorescence", "白色花序": "White inflorescence", "长长的白花序从叶丛中向下垂。": "Long white inflorescences hang down through the foliage.", "白色花穗铺满叶丛": "White flower spikes covering the foliage", "本期落葵薯手绘，记录藤枝、心形叶、花和珠芽等细节。": "Drawing of Anredera cordifolia: climbing stems, heart-shaped leaves, flowers and bulbils", "大片落葵薯藤蔓覆盖在林缘植被上。": "An expanse of Anredera cordifolia covering vegetation at the woodland edge.", "落葵薯 · 本期封面": "Anredera cordifolia · video cover", "心形绿叶沿围栏向外生长。": "Heart-shaped leaves grow outward along the fence.", "小花的花被片与伸出的雄蕊": "Tepals and protruding stamens of a small flower", "栅栏上垂下一串串白花。顺着藤蔓找下去，还有它不断蔓延的秘密。": "Strings of white flowers hang down from the fence. Follow the vine and you’ll find a clue to how it keeps spreading.", "栅栏上，挂满了白色流苏": "White tassels on a fence", "路边的这个栅栏，几乎被它爬满了。这边是，那边也是，藤蔓缠缠绕绕，顺着支撑物往上走。它叫落葵薯，也常被叫作藤三七。\n开花的时候，一条条白色花序从叶子间垂下来，像挂了一树的流苏。远远看过去，很难不注意到它。": "The roadside fence is almost covered. There are vines here and on the other side too, twisting around their supports as they climb. This is Anredera cordifolia, known as luòkuíshǔ or téngsānqī in Chinese.\nWhen it flowers, long white clusters hang from between the leaves like tassels. Even from a distance they catch the eye.", "凑近看，像一把小刷子": "A little bottlebrush", "这些碎碎的小点，有些还是花苞，有些已经打开了。每一条花序上都挤着许多小花，难怪我看着它，总想到实验室里的试管刷。\n再近一点，能看清浅绿的小苞片、白色的花被片，还有伸出来的细长雄蕊。原来远看一整片的白，都是这样一朵朵小花组成的。": "Look closely at those tiny specks: some are buds, others are open flowers. So many flowers crowd each inflorescence that I keep thinking of the brushes used for cleaning test tubes.\nA little closer and I can see pale green bracts, white tepals and the long stamens projecting beyond them. All that white I saw from far away is made up of individual flowers.", "它和木耳菜，是亲戚": "A relative of Malabar spinach", "花穗旁边的叶子也值得看一眼：叶片有一点肉质，卵形到近圆形，摸起来比较光滑。它和常说的木耳菜，确实有点像。\n木耳菜的名字是落葵，和落葵薯只差一个字。它们同属落葵科，却分在不同的属里。至于“藤三七”这个别称，也别把它和三七当成同一种植物。": "Look beside the flower spikes at the leaves. They are slightly fleshy and smooth to the touch, oval to almost round, rather like those of Malabar spinach.\nThe Chinese name for Malabar spinach is luòkuí, just one character shorter than luòkuíshǔ. They belong to different genera in the same family, Basellaceae. The other name, téngsānqī, does not make this vine the same plant as sānqī.", "没见到种子，它怎么爬得到处都是？": "How did it spread so far?", "这次观察时，我没有找到种子，却看到它已经从栅栏蔓延到了附近的树和围墙。这个反差让我很好奇。\n落葵薯还有另一种繁殖方式：叶腋能长出小块茎，也就是珠芽。珠芽落地后，在适合的条件下可以长成新的植株。原来，蔓延开来的线索，不只藏在花和种子里。": "I found no seeds on this visit, yet the vine had spread from the fence to nearby trees and walls. I wondered how it got there.\nAnredera has another way to reproduce. Small tubers, or bulbils, develop in its leaf axils. When they fall they can start new plants under the right conditions. The flowers and seeds are only part of the story.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "《中国植物志》第26卷：落葵薯及同属植物": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, vol. 26: Anredera cordifolia and related species"}, "20251027-01": {"叶片和花果枝": "Leaves and a shoot bearing flowers and fruit", "花序与分节荚果": "Inflorescence and jointed pods", "叶片及翅状叶柄": "Blade and winged leaf stalk", "分节荚果近景": "Jointed pods in close-up", "开花枝条": "Flowering branch", "长叶与花序": "Long leaves and inflorescence", "叶背与花序": "Leaf underside and inflorescence", "蝶形小花近景": "Small pea-shaped flower in close-up", "成串紫色小花": "Clusters of small purple flowers", "叶柄也长出翅，和叶片一起拼成了“葫芦”。": "Even the leaf stalk has wings: together with the blade they make the shape of a “gourd.”", "不是葫芦，也不是茶": "A gourd shape on a leaf", "葫芦茶还有百劳舌、咸鱼草、剃刀柄等名字。名字这么多，先从叶子看起：上面是叶片，下面宽宽的一段是带翅的叶柄，连起来才有了“葫芦”的轮廓。\n《Flora of China》将它记为单小叶复叶。看清小叶与带翅叶柄的连接，再看深绿色叶面上清楚的叶脉，就容易记住了。": "Húluchá has several Chinese nicknames, among them ‘butcherbird's tongue’, ‘salted-fish plant’ and ‘razor handle’. Start with a leaf: above is the blade, below it a broad, winged leaf stalk. Together they make the outline of a gourd.\nFlora of China describes a compound leaf with a single leaflet. Follow the joint between that leaflet and the winged stalk, then trace the veins on its dark green surface. It is a memorable shape.", "记忆里的竹壳茶": "A drink I remember", "小时候夏天喝过竹壳茶，竹壳包着里面的材料，味道甘甘的，有一点甜。葫芦茶就是其中的其中一种材料。\n名字和生活连在一起，再遇见这片叶子，便不只是路旁一株陌生的小草了。": "As a child I used to drink zhúkéchá in summer. The ingredients were wrapped in bamboo sheaths, and the drink tasted mild and a little sweet. Húluchá was one of those ingredients.\nWith a memory like that, the plant is more than an unfamiliar bit of greenery beside the road.", "小麻雀一样的花": "Flowers like resting sparrows", "这一串串紫色小花，像一群停下来休息的小麻雀。凑近看，是豆科植物熟悉的蝶形花。\n花的下面还有一节一节的小荚果，表面有细毛，一侧较直，另一侧起伏。花和果挨在同一条枝上，正好可以对照着看。": "These little purple flowers look like a flock of sparrows stopping for a rest. Up close they have the familiar pea-flower shape of the legume family.\nBelow them are small, segmented pods covered with fine hairs, straight on one side and wavy on the other. The flowers and pods sit on the same branch, perfect for comparison.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "Flora of China：Tadehagi（葫芦茶属）形态描述": "Flora of China: morphology of the genus Tadehagi"}, "20250918-01": {"单个绿色蒴果": "A single green capsule", "高大植株与叶冠": "Tall plant and its crown of leaves", "种皮斑纹近景": "Seed coat markings in close-up", "叶片上的种子": "Seeds resting on a leaf", "带白霜的茎节": "Waxy white bloom on a stem node", "带刺蒴果": "Prickly capsule", "转红的果序": "Fruiting cluster turning red", "花果同枝": "Flowers and fruits on one branch", "逆光下的掌状叶": "Palmately lobed leaf lit from behind", "枝干与叶柄": "Branches and leaf stalks", "绿色果序": "Green fruiting cluster", "绿色蒴果": "Green capsule", "成簇蒴果": "Cluster of capsules", "雄花与幼果": "Male flowers and young fruits", "蓖麻形态手绘": "Drawing of castor plant form", "红色柱头与花序": "Red stigmas and inflorescence", "雄花近景": "Male flower in close-up", "大手掌似的叶子下面，藏着珊瑚般的花和带斑纹的种子。": "Beneath big hand-shaped leaves are coral-like flowers and seeds patterned with mottled markings.", "一片大大的手掌": "A hand big enough for a high five", "我身边这些蓖麻长得好高，叶子也特别大。掌状叶展开，辐射状的叶脉清清楚楚，像在向人打招呼：give me five！\n粗壮的茎一节一节，表面带着白霜，远看有点像紫色的竹子。": "The castor plants beside me are tall, with enormous leaves. The lobes spread out like a hand, the veins radiating so clearly that the plant seems to be greeting me: give me five!\nThe stout stems have prominent joints and a whitish bloom. From a distance they look a little like purple bamboo.", "珊瑚和红色的小叉": "Coral and little red forks", "蓖麻的花没有醒目的花瓣，却很值得细看。同一株上能看到雌花和雄花：雄花聚成浅黄色的一团团，雌花伸出红色、分叉的柱头。\n沿着花序从下往上看，颜色和形状都在变化，好像珊瑚旁边冒出几根小小的红叉。": "Castor flowers have no showy petals, but take a close look. Male and female flowers share a plant: the male flowers form pale yellow tufts, while the female flowers bear red, forked stigmas.\nFollow the inflorescence upwards and both the colours and the shapes change. It looks as though little red forks have sprung up beside a piece of coral.", "像小刺猬的果子": "Fruits like little hedgehogs", "蒴果表面有许多刺状突起，圆圆地聚在一起，乍看像小刺猬，又有些像海胆。从绿色到泛红，每一串都很好看。\n剥出的种子表面光滑，灰褐色斑纹各不相同，像古老的图案。蓖麻种子有毒，不能误食；这里记录的是它的形态。": "The capsules are covered with prickly projections. Gathered into round clusters, they remind me of hedgehogs or sea urchins. Each cluster has its own colours, from green to reddish.\nInside, the seeds are smooth, each with a different grey-brown pattern like an old design. Castor seeds are poisonous and must not be eaten. I am describing their appearance here.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20251011-01": {"蓝紫色花冠与细长叶": "Blue-violet corolla and slender leaves", "花冠五裂及放射状纹路": "Five corolla lobes and radiating markings", "花苞与开放的小花": "Buds and open flowers", "叶丛中的蓝紫色花": "Blue-violet blossom among leaves", "上班路上的蓝紫色小喇叭，用接连不断的花苞向人道早安。": "On my way to work, little blue-violet trumpets say good morning, with a succession of buds still to open.", "陪我们出门的早安花": "Flowers to greet you on the way out", "风一吹，这些蓝紫色的小喇叭轻轻晃动。蓝花草，也常叫翠芦莉，是南方绿化带里很熟悉的面孔。\n上班上学的路上低头看一眼，也许脚边就有它。平时不起眼的一丛绿叶，开花时忽然变得明亮起来。": "A breeze sets these little blue-violet trumpets swaying. Ruellia simplex, called lánhuācǎo or cuìlúlì in Chinese, is a familiar sight in planted strips in southern China.\nLook down on your way to school or work and it may be at your feet. An unremarkable patch of green suddenly lights up when the flowers open.", "花开不断的秘密": "Why does it seem to flower for so long?", "在深圳的观察里，它能从春天一直开到很晚。单朵花并不长久，枝上却有许多接替开放的花苞。\n顺着枝条找过去，一枚接一枚，难怪总觉得它一直在开花。这股源源不断的劲头，真让人佩服。": "Here in Shenzhen I have seen it flowering from spring until much later in the year. A single bloom does not last long, but each branch carries plenty of buds waiting their turn.\nFollow a stem and you can see one bud after another. No wonder it feels as though the plant is always in flower.", "蓝花草，究竟蓝不蓝": "How blue is a blue-flower plant?", "说是蓝花草，眼前的花却更接近蓝紫色。花冠像一顶小喇叭，展开的五裂边缘带着皱褶，表面还有放射状纹路。\n细长的叶子成对排列，像柳叶一样。花色和深绿的叶丛搭配在一起，是每天都能遇见、却很值得多看一眼的风景。": "Its Chinese name suggests blue flowers, but these are closer to blue-violet. The corolla opens like a little trumpet, with five crinkled lobes and a pattern of lines radiating across them.\nLong narrow leaves grow in pairs, rather like willow leaves. Blue-violet against that deep green is an everyday sight well worth a second glance.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260127-01": {"沿树干向上生长": "Growing upwards along a trunk", "白果与绿叶": "White fruits and green leaves", "石壁上的枝叶纹路": "The pattern of branches and leaves on a rock face", "岩石上的密集叶片": "Dense foliage on a rock", "幼叶近景": "Young leaves in close-up", "石上成对叶片": "Paired leaves on stone", "攀满树干的挂果枝": "Fruiting shoots climbing over a trunk", "手旁的对生叶": "Opposite leaves beside a hand", "白色核果近景": "White drupe in close-up", "圆叶与匍匐茎": "Round leaves and a creeping stem", "附着树皮的气生根": "Aerial roots attached to bark", "高处挂果枝": "Fruiting shoots high above", "果序侧面": "Fruiting cluster from the side", "白色果序": "White fruiting cluster", "枝端幼果": "Young fruits at a shoot tip", "树皮上的蔓九节": "Psychotria serpens on tree bark", "石上分枝": "Branching stem on stone", "树干上的攀缘枝": "Climbing shoot on a trunk", "树上繁密的果序": "Abundant fruit clusters on a tree", "攀着石壁和树干，一笔一笔长成自然的画。": "Climbing a rock face or a trunk, the vine draws a picture one brushstroke of growth at a time.", "上树龙的作品": "A vine that draws", "我好喜欢蔓九节的“作品”。它沿着石头匍匐，顺着树干攀爬，每一条枝的走向都像一笔画，慢慢拼出天然的图案。\n它也叫上树龙、石上蜈蚣。看看贴在石壁上的枝条，就很容易理解这些名字了。": "I love the patterns Psychotria serpens makes. It creeps over stone and climbs tree trunks; each branch is like a brushstroke in a picture the vine draws for itself.\nTwo of its Chinese nicknames mean ‘tree-climbing dragon’ and ‘centipede on stone’. Look at a stem pressed against a rock face and you can see why.", "一排抓住树皮的小脚": "Little feet gripping the bark", "秘密藏在茎旁边：细细的气生根像许多只脚，紧贴着树皮和石面，把枝条固定下来。\n叶片则成对排列。嫩叶较圆，长大的叶片更修长，厚厚的叶面让这幅绿画一年四季都很精神。": "Look beside the stem: fine aerial roots cling to bark and stone like rows of tiny feet, holding the branches in place.\nThe leaves grow in pairs. Young leaves are rounder; older ones are longer and narrower. Their thick blades keep this green picture looking lively all year.", "树上许多白色的小眼睛": "White eyes in a tree", "这次遇见的蔓九节已经结了果，白色核果成簇挂在高处，多得数不过来。果顶的小点看起来像许多小眼睛，藏在绿叶之间。\n从贴着石头的一小枝，到攀满高大树干的整片枝叶，它总有让人惊喜的样子。下次进山，不妨也抬头找找这位画画高手。": "The vine I found this time was already in fruit, with clusters of white drupes hanging overhead, more than I could count. A little dot at the top of each fruit makes it look like a white eye among the leaves.\nWhether it is a single twig against a rock or a tangle of branches covering a tall trunk, this vine always has something to surprise me. Next time you head into the hills, look up for this little artist.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260224-01": {"有毛且叶脉凹凸的叶片": "Hairy leaves with veins raised and sunken", "对照：黄粉色马缨丹花序": "Comparison: yellow and pink Lantana flowers", "绿色苞片近景": "Green bracts in close-up", "紫色花苞": "Purple buds", "花苞排列": "Arrangement of flower buds", "开放中的花序": "Inflorescence beginning to open", "浅紫花与白色花心": "Pale purple flowers with white centres", "成片紫色头状花序": "A patch of purple flower heads", "花序下方层叠苞片": "Layered bracts beneath the inflorescence", "低头看一片紫色的小绣球，再闻闻叶子那股独特的气味。": "Look down at a patch of little purple flower balls, then smell the distinctive scent of the leaves.", "低处的小绣球": "Tiny flower heads close to the ground", "如果不低头，很容易错过蔓马缨丹。柔软的枝条匍匐着、垂下来，星星点点的小花连成一片淡紫色。\n一团团头状花序像缩小的绣球，又像散在绿叶间的蝴蝶结。蹲下来，才发现这一小片花海也很热闹。": "If you do not look down it is easy to miss trailing lantana. Soft branches creep along the ground or hang over an edge. Dots of blossom run together into a patch of pale purple.\nIts rounded flower heads look like miniature hydrangeas, or little bows scattered over the leaves. Crouch down and the patch is suddenly full of life.", "和马缨丹放在一起看": "Beside its relative", "蔓马缨丹和马缨丹是同属近亲。这次记录里，前者低伏生长，花多为淡紫色；作对照的马缨丹花序则能看见黄、粉等颜色。\n细看蔓马缨丹，变化也藏在花心里：有的带白圈，有的中心透着橘黄。花色之外，还要连着株形一起观察。": "Trailing lantana and Lantana camara belong to the same genus. The trailing plant here grows low and has mostly pale violet flowers. The heads of the L. camara I photographed for comparison include yellow and pink flowers.\nLook into a trailing lantana flower and there are variations here too: some have a white ring, others a touch of orange-yellow in the centre. Colour is one clue; how the whole plant grows is another.", "花苞也像一朵花": "A flower head before it opens", "还没开放的花序同样有趣。苞片层层排开，里面的小花苞带着紫色，像一枚小小的装饰。\n叶片摸起来粗糙、有细毛，轻揉便散出很浓的气味。有人觉得臭，我却觉得还挺特别；看花之外，这也是记住它的一种方式。": "Even the unopened flower head is interesting. Bracts overlap in layers, with little purple buds inside, like a tiny ornament.\nThe hairy leaves feel rough and release a strong smell when gently rubbed. Some people find it unpleasant; to me it is distinctive. It is another way to remember this plant.", "视频中用于比较株形和花色，图片9为此种。": "Included to compare growth habit and flower colour. Photograph 9 shows this species.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260413-01": {"屋檐前的开花枝": "Flowering branch in front of the eaves", "深粉花苞与浅色花": "Deep pink buds and pale blossoms", "仰望花簇": "Looking up at flower clusters", "花枝与传统屋檐": "Flowering branches beside traditional eaves", "粉白花朵与嫩叶": "Pale pink flowers and young leaves", "庭院中的树形": "Shape of the tree in a courtyard", "蓝天下的花枝": "Flowering branch against a blue sky", "深粉的花苞、浅粉的花和新叶，把庭院里的春天挤满枝头。": "Deep pink buds, pale pink blossoms and new leaves crowd the branches with a courtyard’s spring.", "终于遇见一树海棠": "A crabapple in blossom at last", "春天里终于拍到了海棠。满树都是花，也有刚长出的叶子，深粉、浅粉和绿色挤在一起，真是好看。\n眼前这株西府海棠和庭院的屋檐相衬，格外雅致。站在树下，抬头就是一片热闹的春天。": "This spring I finally photographed a crabapple in flower. The whole tree was blooming while new leaves were coming out: deep pink, pale pink and green all crowded together.\nThe blossoms of this Malus × kaido looked particularly graceful against the courtyard eaves. Stand underneath and spring is busy overhead.", "花和叶一起到来": "Flowers and leaves together", "它开花的时候，叶子也在展开。花朵一簇簇聚在枝端，花瓣圆润，粉红的花苞打开后颜色淡了许多。\n近看每朵花，远看整条枝，感觉又不一样。站在树下，还能闻到淡淡的香气。": "The leaves unfold as the tree flowers. Blossoms cluster at the branch tips, with rounded petals that fade to a much paler colour than the pink buds.\nA single flower close up and the whole branch from further back make quite different pictures. Under the tree I can catch a faint fragrance too.", "花开以后，还有时间": "The season after the flowers", "从含苞到盛放，再到花少叶多，海棠让人很容易想到古诗里的春天。庭院中一棵树，就能把季节的变化表现得这么清楚。\n这次拍下的是眼前的花与树形。西府海棠在栽培中有不同面貌，你遇见的那一树，也许又有自己的颜色。": "Buds open, the tree comes into full bloom, and soon there are more leaves than flowers. This crabapple makes me think of spring in old Chinese poems. One tree in a courtyard can mark the turning of the season so clearly.\nThese are the flowers and the shape of the tree I saw. Malus × kaido varies in cultivation; yours may have a colour all its own.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "文稿Malus × micromalus在WCVP归入Malus × kaido；保留杂交符号和原文名称。": "WCVP places the manuscript name Malus × micromalus under Malus × kaido. The hybrid sign and the original name have been retained.", "群芳谱（原文稿提及）": "Qunfang Pu, mentioned in the manuscript", "植物智 iPlant：苹果属 Malus": "iPlant: the genus Malus"}, "20260428-01": {"四瓣花与黄色花蕊": "Four-petalled flower and yellow reproductive parts", "开放的十字形花": "Open cross-shaped flower", "花冠及细长花萼": "Corolla and slender calyx", "淡紫色花序": "Pale purple inflorescence", "路旁的诸葛菜花丛": "Orychophragmus flowers beside the road", "还没走到目的地，就被路旁一整片紫色的春天留住。": "I hadn’t reached my destination when a whole patch of purple spring by the roadside stopped me.", "先被路边的花留住": "Stopped by the roadside flowers", "故宫、天坛还没来得及看，我就被路边的野花吸引住了。一整片淡紫到蓝紫色在风里轻轻晃，像铺在地上的春天。\n它叫诸葛菜，也叫二月兰。名字里虽有“兰”，却不是兰科植物，而是十字花科的一员。": "I had not yet made it to the Forbidden City or the Temple of Heaven when some roadside flowers stopped me. A patch of pale to blue-violet blooms moved gently in the breeze, like spring spread across the ground.\nIn Chinese it is zhūgěcài, also called èryuèlán, ‘February orchid’. It belongs to the mustard family, Brassicaceae.", "看花，便懂了十字": "Four petals make a cross", "凑近看，四片花瓣展开，组成很清楚的十字。中央是黄色花蕊，花朵沿着花序陆续开放，旁边还有细长的花苞。\n花色有深有浅，薄薄的花瓣被风一吹，格外轻盈。原本只是路过，现在却忍不住停下来一朵朵看。": "Look closely and four petals make a clear cross around the yellow centre. Flowers open in turn along the stem, with slender buds beside them.\nThere are lighter and darker shades, and the thin petals look almost weightless in the breeze. I was only passing through; now I find myself stopping for one flower after another.", "一层一层往上长": "From the bottom of the stem to the top", "花下面的茎比较直立，叶子的形状沿着茎向上变化，下部较大，上部叶片抱着茎。\n关于诸葛菜的名字，有与诸葛亮相关的传说，但传说不等于已经确证的植物身份。对我来说，这次最鲜明的记忆，还是路旁随风起伏的紫色花海。": "The stems stand fairly upright. The leaves change shape along them: the lower leaves are larger, while those higher up clasp the stem.\nA legend links the Chinese name with Zhuge Liang. It is a story about the name, not confirmed evidence of the plant's identity. My strongest memory is still that roadside sea of purple rising and falling in the wind.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250923-01": {"古杉全貌": "The whole ancient Chinese fir", "仰望古杉树冠": "Looking up into the old tree’s crown", "柔软披针形叶": "Soft, lance-shaped leaves", "树干孔洞与基部": "Hollow and base of the trunk", "枝端叶片": "Leaves at the branch tip", "无为寺古杉的苍老树干旁，长着柔软而清新的叶子。": "Beside the time-worn trunk of an old Chinese fir at Wuwei Temple grow leaves that are fresh and soft.", "在无为寺遇见古杉": "An old tree at Wuwei Temple", "在大理无为寺，遇到了一棵很壮观的古杉。当地称它“唐杉”，也叫老龙树，关于它的栽植流传着很久远的故事。\n站在树下看，枝干遒劲地向外伸展，真的有一种老龙攀向天空的感觉。": "At Wuwei Temple in Dali I came across a magnificent old Chinese fir. Locally it is called the Tang fir or the Old Dragon Tree, and stories about its planting go back a long way.\nStanding below those powerful outstretched branches I could see the resemblance to an old dragon climbing into the sky.", "杉叶原来也能这么软": "A softer kind of fir leaf", "走近看看叶子：披针形，比较薄，迎着光能看清叶缘。叶尖不像常见杉木那样尖硬，触感也柔和一些。\n“软叶杉木”这个园艺品种名，在这时变得很直观。苍老的树干上，依然长着这样清新的绿叶。": "Up close the leaves are slender, lance-shaped and quite thin; hold one to the light and you can make out the margin. The tips are softer to the touch than the sharp, stiff points of the Chinese fir I usually see.\nThe Chinese name of this cultivar means ‘soft-leaved Chinese fir’. Standing there I could see exactly why. Such fresh green leaves on that weathered old trunk.", "树干留下的时间": "Time in the bark", "树皮有一道道纵向沟缝，灰褐色的表面覆着苔藓。树干的空洞和下方的填石，也都留在了这次照片里。\n从远处看树形，再到近处看叶子、树皮，同一棵树能让人停留很久。这是这趟相遇中最让我难忘的一棵杉木。": "Long grooves run down the grey-brown bark, with moss growing on the surface. I also photographed the hollow in the trunk and the stones set into it below.\nFrom the distant outline to the leaves and bark at arm's length, one tree can keep me looking for a long time. Of all the Chinese firs I met on this trip, this is the one I remember best.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "文稿为Cunninghamia lanceolata 'Mollifolia'栽培名称。分类树挂到接受种C. lanceolata；栽培名称单独保留，不新增虚构分类等级。": "The manuscript uses the cultivar name Cunninghamia lanceolata 'Mollifolia'. The tree shows the accepted species, C. lanceolata. The cultivar name is recorded separately without creating a taxonomic rank."}, "20260505-01": {"转红的羽状复叶": "Pinnate leaves turning red", "绿叶与果序": "Green leaves and fruit cluster", "蓝天下的嫩叶与花序": "Young leaves and flowers against blue sky", "新叶展开": "New leaves unfolding", "扁圆核果近景": "Flattened, round drupe in close-up", "细碎的花序": "A spray of tiny flowers", "春季花叶": "Spring flowers and leaves", "林间红叶枝": "Branch with red leaves in woodland", "红叶近景": "Red leaves in close-up", "褐色核果": "Brown drupe", "春天嫩绿，秋天通红，在南方也能遇见这一树季节的颜色。": "Tender green in spring, brilliant red in autumn: even in the south, one tree can carry the colours of the seasons.", "嫩绿可爱，也要认清它": "Fresh green leaves on a tree worth recognising", "春天的野漆一点也不像传说中“会咬人”的树。嫩叶舒展开，细碎的小花挤在枝头，满是生机。\n但它的汁液可能引起接触性过敏，观察时不必折枝或揉叶。隔着一点距离，一样能看清它的样子。": "In spring Toxicodendron succedaneum looks nothing like the tree people say can ‘bite’. New leaves unfold, and tiny flowers crowd the tips of its lively branches.\nIts sap can cause an allergic skin reaction. There is no need to break a branch or rub a leaf; I can see its features perfectly well from a little distance.", "在南方看见一树红": "A blaze of red in the south", "秋天再遇见，简直换了一棵树。绿色渐渐变成橙色、红色，一片片羽状复叶垂在枝头，整棵树都亮了起来。\n我忍不住在南方感受了一回“层林尽染”。原来身边的山林，也有这么鲜明的季节变化。": "Meeting it again in autumn was like meeting another tree. The green turns gradually to orange and red; pinnate leaves hang from the branches and the whole canopy lights up.\nIt gave me a glimpse of the ‘dyed forests’ of Chinese poetry, right here in the south. Our local woods can show the seasons in remarkably vivid colours.", "看清一整枚叶子": "Look at the whole leaf", "它是奇数羽状复叶，小叶沿着叶轴排列，末端还有一片。辨认时要看完整叶片，别把其中一片小叶当作全部。\n果实也成簇挂着，近看略扁，有一点不对称。把春花、秋叶和果实放在一起，这棵树的形象才慢慢完整起来。": "Each pinnate leaf has paired leaflets along a central axis and one more at its tip. To recognise it correctly, look at a whole leaf rather than mistaking a leaflet for one.\nThe fruits hang in clusters too. Up close they look slightly flattened and a little asymmetrical. The spring flowers, autumn leaves and fruits together give me a much better picture of the tree.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260220-01": {"逆光叶片与花": "Backlit leaves and flowers", "绿叶下的金花茶": "Golden camellia blossom beneath green leaves", "革质叶片和叶脉": "Veins on a leathery leaf", "金黄色花冠与雄蕊": "Golden corolla and stamens", "枝上蒴果": "Capsule on a branch", "仰看花心": "Looking up into the centre of a flower", "花枝侧面": "Flowering branch from the side", "饱满花苞": "Plump flower bud", "一列花苞与开放的花": "A row of buds and an open blossom", "低垂的花冠": "Downward-facing corolla", "绿叶下面，一朵金黄色的山茶花像涂了一层蜡。": "Under green leaves, a golden-yellow camellia blossom looks as though it has been coated in wax.", "山茶花也有金黄色": "A camellia in gold", "你见过金黄色的山茶花吗？眼前这朵金花茶，颜色浓郁，花瓣厚实而有光泽，像轻轻涂过一层蜡。\n花心聚着许多雄蕊，橙黄色在浅一些的花瓣中格外醒目。换一个角度，金色也随着光线变化。": "Have you ever seen a golden camellia? The flower in front of me is richly coloured, with thick, glossy petals that look thinly coated in wax.\nA crowd of orange-yellow stamens stands out against the paler petals. Change the angle and the gold changes with the light.", "低下头，换个角度看": "Bend down for a better view", "花朵低垂在枝间，站着容易只看到花的背面。稍微俯身，才能看见完整的花心。\n旁边还有一串饱满的花苞，没有开放时圆圆的；打开之后，花瓣便舒展出柔和的弧度。同一条枝上，能看见不同的进度。": "These flowers hang low among the branches. Standing upright I can easily see only the back of a flower. Bending down lets me look into its centre.\nNearby, plump buds are still round and closed. In the open flowers the petals have spread into soft curves. A single branch holds several stages.", "花之外的叶与果": "Leaves and fruit as well", "叶片厚实，深绿色的表面有清楚的叶脉，边缘带细小锯齿。花藏在这样的绿叶下面，颜色更显得明亮。\n这次素材还拍到了枝上的蒴果。把花、花苞、叶子和果实并排看，认识它便不止记住一个“金”字。": "The thick dark green leaves have clear veins and finely toothed edges. The golden flowers tucked below them seem all the brighter.\nI also photographed a capsule on a branch. Set a flower, bud, leaf and fruit side by side and there is more to remember than just the gold.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20250704-01": {"花冠及绿色花萼近景": "Corolla and green calyx in close-up", "枝上的小灯笼": "Little lantern on a branch", "垂挂花朵正面": "Hanging blossom viewed from the front", "花与掌状叶": "Flower and palmate leaf", "花瓣脉纹与外露花蕊": "Petal veins and exposed reproductive parts", "橘黄花瓣上织着深红脉纹，一盏小灯笼随风摇。": "Deep red veins are woven across orange-yellow petals. A little lantern swings in the breeze.", "植物园里一直亮着的小灯笼": "Little lanterns in the botanical garden", "每次来植物园，似乎都能遇见它开花。这次终于要好好记录：金铃花，也叫显脉苘麻。\n细长的花梗垂着一朵橘黄色花，风一吹，摇啊摇，真像挂在枝上的小灯笼。": "Almost every time I come to the botanical garden this plant seems to be in flower. Today I finally stopped to record it: Callianthe picta, known as jīnlínghuā or xiǎnmàiqǐngmá.\nA long slender stalk suspends an orange-yellow blossom. When the wind moves it, it rocks like a little lantern hung from the branch.", "灯笼上织着红色纹路": "Red veins woven through the lantern", "让我印象最深的是花瓣上的深红脉纹。五片花瓣彼此叠合，没有完全摊开，保留着钟形的轮廓。\n向下看，花蕊从花冠里露出来。许多雄蕊聚成一柱，是认识锦葵科时很有意思的细节。": "The deep red veins on the petals are what I remember most. The five petals overlap without opening flat, so the flower keeps its bell shape.\nLook underneath and you can see the reproductive parts projecting from the corolla. Many stamens join to make a column, a feature I enjoy looking for in the mallow family.", "花好看，叶子也好看": "A little palm beside the lantern", "花萼像灯笼上方的小帽子，旁边的叶片则像张开的小手掌，边缘还有锯齿。\n对很少见到枫叶的南方人来说，这样的叶形也很亲切。小灯笼配着小手掌，让人忍不住多看一会儿。": "The calyx looks like a little cap above the flower. Beside it the leaf spreads like a small hand, with teeth along the edges.\nAs someone from the south who seldom sees maple leaves, I find the shape particularly appealing. Little lanterns and little hands: it is hard to walk past without another look.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按 POWO 链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。“金铃花属”采用 Wikidata 中文辅助标签，尚未核实植物智对应中文属名。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked POWO record. The Chinese genus label 金铃花属 is from Wikidata; a corresponding iPlant name has not been verified.", "Wikidata · 中文辅助标签：金铃花属 Callianthe": "Wikidata: supplementary Chinese label for Callianthe"}, "20251219-01": {"银叶树古树与板根": "Old Heritiera littoralis tree and its buttress roots", "带龙骨状突起的果实": "Fruit with a keel-like ridge", "板根旁的落果": "Fallen fruits beside a buttress root", "落果间萌发的幼苗": "Seedlings germinating among fallen fruits", "树洞与弯曲枝干": "Hollow and curved branches", "根与岩石相贴": "Root pressed against a rock", "墙一般的板根": "Wall-like buttress roots", "银叶树叶果及板根手绘": "Drawing of Heritiera littoralis: leaves, fruits and buttress roots", "海岸边的树形": "Shape of the tree by the coast", "沿海古树把根长成城墙，也把果实做成了漂流的小船。": "An old coastal tree grows roots like ramparts and makes fruits like little boats that can drift away.", "海边的老先生": "An old gentleman by the sea", "来到坝光红树林湿地，第一次见到这样大的银叶树。古树沿着海岸生长，弯曲的枝干自己组成一幅画，像走进了仙境。\n银叶树常见于潮间带后缘，是连接海岸和陆地的一种半红树植物。": "At the Baguang mangrove wetland I saw an enormous Heritiera littoralis for the first time. Old trees grow along the shore, their twisting branches composing pictures of their own. It felt like walking into a fairy tale.\nThis mangrove associate often grows at the landward edge of the intertidal zone, where shore meets land.", "根长成了一座城堡": "A castle of roots", "最震撼的是板根。它们从树干基部向外延伸，高起的部分像一堵堵城墙；有些贴着岩石，乍看还以为也是石头。\n我站在旁边，才感到它们有多大。支撑着这棵老树的根，也成了最让人难忘的风景。": "The buttress roots astonished me. They extend from the base of the trunk, their raised edges like ramparts. Some hug the rocks so closely that at first I took them for stone.\nOnly when I stood beside them did I grasp their size. The very roots supporting this old tree are the part of the scene I remember best.", "准备出发的小木船": "Little boats about to set out", "树下散着许多果子，褐色外壳上有突出的棱，像饺子，也像小木船。这样的果实可以随水漂流。\n落叶间还找到了冒出新叶的小苗。从落果到扎根，海边的生命又开始了新的一程。": "Fruits lay scattered under the tree. Each brown shell has a raised ridge and looks something like a dumpling or a small wooden boat. The fruits can travel by water.\nAmong the fallen leaves I also found a seedling putting out new foliage. From fallen fruit to rooted plant, another journey was beginning by the shore.", "名字藏在叶子背面": "The name is underneath the leaf", "银叶树叶片正面深绿，翻到背面，银白的鳞片状毛让它像镀了一层银。这个小小的翻转，就能让名字变得好记。\n临走再看看古树和板根，真幸运，能遇见这样的老先生。": "The upper surface is dark green. Turn the leaf over and silvery, scale-like hairs make the underside look plated with silver. One turn of the wrist explains its Chinese name, the ‘silver-leaf tree’.\nBefore leaving I took one more look at the old tree and its buttresses. I felt lucky to have met this old gentleman.", "视频比较能随海水漂流的果实。": "Included in the comparison of fruits that disperse by sea.", "与本站已收录档案对应。": "A corresponding record is available in this archive.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20251124-01": {"树干旁的金黄叶丛": "Golden foliage beside the trunk", "亭前秋叶": "Autumn leaves in front of a pavilion", "金黄枝叶与屋檐": "Golden foliage and roof eaves", "绿色叶片与未成熟种子": "Green leaves and immature seeds", "金色银杏与传统屋檐": "Golden ginkgo foliage and traditional eaves", "仰望金色树冠": "Looking up at the golden canopy", "垂下的扇形叶": "Drooping, fan-shaped leaves", "满树小扇子由绿转金黄，屋檐下的秋天一下子明亮起来。": "A treeful of little fans changes from green to gold, and suddenly the autumn scene under the eaves glows.", "银杏开始变装了": "The ginkgo changes its colours", "天气转凉，满树绿色慢慢换成了金黄色。抬头看，好多好多小扇子挂在枝上，把屋檐也衬得明亮起来。\n叶绿素逐渐降解，原先被绿色遮住的色彩显现出来。每年看见，还是会为这一树金黄感到高兴。": "As the weather cools, the green canopy slowly turns gold. Looking up, I see little fans everywhere, brightening even the eaves behind them.\nAs chlorophyll gradually breaks down, colours once masked by green become visible. I see it every year and still feel delighted by a whole tree in gold.", "一把小扇子的纹路": "Tracing a little fan", "银杏的叶子像扇子，顶端常有一道裂口。顺着叶脉看，它不断地分叉，再分叉，和熟悉的网状叶脉很不一样。\n从一片叶，到满树叶子，形状始终简单，却怎么也看不腻。": "The ginkgo leaf is fan-shaped, often with a notch at the outer edge. Follow a vein and it forks, then forks again, quite unlike the net of veins in so many familiar leaves.\nThe same simple outline repeats from a single leaf to the whole canopy, and I never tire of looking at it.", "白果不是果实": "What we call a fruit is a seed", "再看另一季拍下的绿色枝叶，旁边挂着圆圆的种子。我们叫它“白果”，但银杏是裸子植物，外面软软的一层属于种皮，并不是真正的果皮。\n同一棵树，春夏和秋天留下不同的样子。很高兴认识你，银杏。": "In photographs from another season there are round seeds hanging beside the green leaves. In Chinese we call them báiguǒ, ‘white fruits’. Ginkgo is a gymnosperm: the soft outer layer belongs to the seed coat, not a fruit wall.\nOne tree, different portraits in spring, summer and autumn. I am glad to have met you, ginkgo.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260703-01": {"黏亮菌盖与白色菌幕": "A sticky, shiny cap and a white veil.", "修长菌柄与菌盖": "The long, slender stem and its cap.", "菌盖下方细密管孔": "Closely spaced pores on the underside of the cap.", "林中不同大小的子实体": "Fruiting bodies of different sizes in the woods.", "俯看黄褐色菌盖": "The yellow-brown cap viewed from above.", "菌盖下的菌幕": "The veil beneath the cap.", "表面出现白色霉状覆盖的子实体": "A fruiting body with a white, mould-like surface covering.", "菌盖表面近景": "A close view of the cap surface.", "落叶里撑起细长的菌柄，亮晶晶的菌盖下还有另一番结构。": "Slender stems rise through the leaf litter. Turn over one of the shiny caps and there’s quite a different surface underneath.", "长柄金牛肝菌": "Chángbǐng jīnniúgānjūn (长柄金牛肝菌)", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These organisms are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where available.", "这朵牛肝菌，为什么会“流胶”？菌柄竟然比菌盖还长？—长柄金牛肝菌": "Why does this bolete seem to ooze “glue”? Can the stem really be longer than the cap? | Aureoboletus longicollis", "落叶里藏着老大老二老三": "Three sizes tucked into the leaf litter", "虽然没有下雨，林子里还是湿湿的，落叶铺了厚厚一层。在壳斗科树下，长柄金牛肝菌陆续冒出来，刚好有大有小。\n路过时差点没发现，它们的颜色和落叶融在一起。细长的菌柄撑着小小的菌盖，身形真修长。": "It hadn’t rained, but the woods were still damp and the fallen leaves lay thick on the ground. Under trees of the beech family, these boletes were coming up one after another. I happened upon several sizes together.\nI almost walked past them: their colour blended into the leaves. Each little cap rested on such a long, slender stem.", "菌盖亮晶晶": "A cap with a sheen", "最让我印象深刻的是菌盖表面的黏亮感。黄褐到红褐的表面像带了一层湿润的光，凑近看，起伏纹理也很明显。\n看见这样的表面，总会忍不住问：这层黏性物质有什么作用？这次先把实际看到的样子记录下来。": "What struck me most was the sticky shine of the cap. Its yellow-brown to reddish-brown surface had a wet sheen, and up close I could see how uneven it was.\nWhat might that sticky coating do? For now, I wanted to record what I could actually see.", "下面不是一排排菌褶": "Under the cap, a sponge", "幼时菌盖下还能看见白色菌幕。展开后，下面露出的是细密管孔，看起来像海绵，并不是常见蘑菇的一排排菌褶。\n把正面、侧面和下方放在一起，同一朵菌也能显得很不一样。": "A white veil is visible under the young cap. Once the cap opens, tiny pores are exposed. Seen together they look like a sponge, quite different from rows of gills.\nLooking at the top, side and underside in turn, it’s hard to believe how different the same mushroom can look.", "旁边还有另一个状态": "Another stage nearby", "附近一朵的表面已经出现白色霉状覆盖，与旁边新鲜的子实体形成鲜明对比。仅凭这些照片，不能确定是哪一种真菌造成的。\n同一片落叶里，既有刚冒出的，也有正在衰败的。森林里的变化，一直在脚边发生。": "A neighbour already had a white, mould-like covering on its surface. It stood out beside the fresh fruiting bodies. The photographs alone don’t tell us which fungus caused it.\nIn the same patch of leaf litter, some were just coming up and others were already in decline. All these changes were happening right at my feet.", "虽然没有下雨，林子里还是湿湿的，落叶铺了厚厚一层。在壳斗科树下，长柄金牛肝菌陆续冒出来，刚好有大有小。": "It hadn’t rained, but the woods were still damp and the fallen leaves lay thick on the ground. Under trees of the beech family, these boletes were coming up one after another. I happened upon several sizes together.", "路过时差点没发现，它们的颜色和落叶融在一起。细长的菌柄撑着小小的菌盖，身形真修长。": "I almost walked past them: their colour blended into the leaves. Each little cap rested on such a long, slender stem.", "最让我印象深刻的是菌盖表面的黏亮感。黄褐到红褐的表面像带了一层湿润的光，凑近看，起伏纹理也很明显。": "What struck me most was the sticky shine of the cap. Its yellow-brown to reddish-brown surface had a wet sheen, and up close I could see how uneven it was.", "看见这样的表面，总会忍不住问：这层黏性物质有什么作用？这次先把实际看到的样子记录下来。": "What might that sticky coating do? For now, I wanted to record what I could actually see.", "幼时菌盖下还能看见白色菌幕。展开后，下面露出的是细密管孔，看起来像海绵，并不是常见蘑菇的一排排菌褶。": "A white veil is visible under the young cap. Once the cap opens, tiny pores are exposed. Seen together they look like a sponge, quite different from rows of gills.", "把正面、侧面和下方放在一起，同一朵菌也能显得很不一样。": "Looking at the top, side and underside in turn, it’s hard to believe how different the same mushroom can look.", "附近一朵的表面已经出现白色霉状覆盖，与旁边新鲜的子实体形成鲜明对比。仅凭这些照片，不能确定是哪一种真菌造成的。": "A neighbour already had a white, mould-like covering on its surface. It stood out beside the fresh fruiting bodies. The photographs alone don’t tell us which fungus caused it.", "同一片落叶里，既有刚冒出的，也有正在衰败的。森林里的变化，一直在脚边发生。": "In the same patch of leaf litter, some were just coming up and others were already in decline. All these changes were happening right at my feet."}, "20260323-01": {"两列排列的叶": "Leaves arranged in two rows", "花背面与距基部": "Back of the flower and base of the spur", "厚实叶片": "Thick leaves", "星形花与细长花距": "Star-shaped flower and long, slender spur", "唇瓣与花心近景": "Lip and centre of the flower in close-up", "花冠正面": "Corolla from the front", "白色花朵侧面": "White flower from the side", "叶尖与水滴": "Leaf tip and water droplet", "另一角度的花": "Flower from another angle", "慕名来看一颗白色的星星，后面还拖着长长的花距。": "I came in search of a white star I had heard so much about. Trailing behind it is an extraordinarily long floral spur.", "慕名来看一颗星星": "A star worth a special trip", "这次是专程来看仙湖的长距彗星兰。白色的萼片和花瓣伸展开，乍看像一颗星，后面还拖着很长的尾巴。\n三枚萼片、三枚花瓣，其中一枚形成醒目的唇瓣。凑近闻，白天只有很淡的气味。": "I came to Xianhu especially to see this comet orchid. Spread wide, its white sepals and petals make the shape of a star, with a long tail extending behind it.\nThere are three sepals and three petals, one of the petals forming a conspicuous lip. In daylight I could detect only a faint scent.", "尾巴其实是花距": "The tail is a nectar spur", "那根细长的“尾巴”不是装饰，而是藏着花蜜的花距。长距彗星兰与长喙蛾的故事，也正是从这里开始的。\n达尔文曾根据长长的花距，推测会有能伸入口器取蜜的蛾类。这让一朵花成为观察传粉关系的经典例子。": "That long, slender ‘tail’ is a spur holding nectar. This is where the story of the comet orchid and the long-tongued moth begins.\nSeeing how long the spur was, Darwin predicted a moth with mouthparts long enough to reach the nectar. The flower has become a classic example for anyone interested in pollination.", "名字不能替代尺子": "A name is not a ruler", "视频中从种加词说到“一个半英尺”，我也忍不住想量一量眼前这一朵。实际花距并不是每朵都照着名字长成同一尺寸。\n再看看厚实的叶子，两列向上排列，表面还留着水珠。看完传奇故事，回到眼前这株，细节一样有趣。": "The video traces the species epithet to ‘a foot and a half’. I felt like measuring the flower in front of me, but the spurs do not all grow to a single length prescribed by the name.\nLook too at the thick leaves arranged in two rising rows, with drops of water on the surface. After the famous story it is rewarding to come back to the plant right here.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "文稿Angraecum sespuipedale为拼写差异，依旧库及接受名写Angraecum sesquipedale，并保留素材原文。": "The manuscript spells the name Angraecum sespuipedale. The accepted spelling used in the archive is Angraecum sesquipedale; the original wording remains in the source material."}, "20251014-01": {"茎与闭合叶鞘": "Stem and closed leaf sheath", "白花和红苞片": "White flower and red bracts", "林下植株": "Plant on the woodland floor", "逆光叶序": "Leaf arrangement lit from behind", "花朵侧面": "Flower from the side", "俯看螺旋叶序近景": "Spiral leaf arrangement viewed closely from above", "红色苞片组成的花序": "Inflorescence with red bracts", "唇瓣上的昆虫": "Insect on the lip", "俯看螺旋排列的叶": "Looking down on spirally arranged leaves", "闭鞘姜 · 本期封面": "Hellenia speciosa · video cover", "红色花序侧面": "Red inflorescence from the side", "幼花序": "Young inflorescence", "叶子绕着茎排成旋转楼梯，红色苞片上开出白色小喇叭。": "Leaves wind around the stem like a spiral staircase. Little white trumpets emerge from red bracts.", "如果我是小昆虫": "If I were a tiny insect", "闭鞘姜的叶子绕着茎，一层一层向上排列，看起来像旋转楼梯。要是我是小昆虫，真想每天在这里玩滑梯。\n从上面看，叶片错落地展开；从侧面看，又能看见它们连接茎的位置。换个角度，这株植物便换了一种图案。": "The leaves of Hellenia speciosa spiral up the stem in tiers like a winding staircase. If I were an insect I would come here every day to slide down them.\nFrom above the blades spread in a staggered pattern. From the side I can see where they join the stem. Change the angle and the plant presents quite a different design.", "名字写在叶鞘里": "A name in the leaf sheath", "叶片基部的叶鞘闭合成管，套在茎外，“闭鞘姜”的名字就和这个结构有关。它属于闭鞘姜科。\n摸起来带绒感的叶背、长圆而略尖的叶片，也都是这次观察中很有意思的小细节。": "At the base of each blade, the sheath closes into a tube around the stem. The Chinese name bìqiàojiāng refers to this closed sheath. The plant belongs to Costaceae.\nThe softly hairy undersides and the oblong blades with slightly pointed tips are two more details that caught my attention.", "红色的是苞片": "The red parts are bracts", "远看像一座红色小塔，但红色部分并不是真正的花，而是层层叠叠的苞片。\n白色的花从中伸出来，展开的唇瓣像薄薄的小喇叭，边缘有皱褶。花谢后，红色苞片还会留在枝头。": "It looks like a little red tower from a distance. The red comes from overlapping bracts. The actual flowers are white.\nThey emerge from among the bracts, with a lip that opens like a thin trumpet with crinkled edges. The red bracts stay on the stem after the flowers fade.", "来访的小客人": "Little visitors", "镜头里陆续有昆虫进入花朵，白色唇瓣成了一处落脚点。花心泛黄，和红色苞片、绿色叶子放在一起，颜色很鲜明。\n“白头偕老花”的别名很美，不过这次一丛里只有少数花序同时开着两朵，并不是每一座小塔都成双。": "Insects entered the flowers one after another as I watched, using the white lip as a landing place. The yellowish centre, red bracts and green leaves make a striking combination.\nOne Chinese nickname evokes a couple growing old together. But in this clump only a few heads had two flowers open at once; the little towers did not all carry pairs.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260102-01": {"密集的小花": "Dense clusters of small flowers", "开花枝叶": "Flowering branches and leaves", "透光荚果中的种子轮廓": "Seed outline in a backlit pod", "荚果近景": "Pod in close-up", "蝶形小花近景": "Small pea-shaped flower in close-up", "羽状复叶与树冠": "Pinnate leaves and tree canopy", "熟悉的黄花梨，原来有细碎的香花和藏在叶间的薄果荚。": "The familiar huanghuali rosewood turns out to have tiny fragrant blossoms and thin pods hidden among its leaves.", "这次来拜访果子": "A visit to see the pods", "降香黄檀，也就是常听到的黄花梨。这次来，先找它藏在叶子间的果荚：绿绿的，薄薄的，不细看真不容易分出来。\n迎着光看，果荚里种子的轮廓很清楚。果瓣上的细纹和中间隆起的部分，让一片小果荚也显得很有质感。": "Dalbergia odorifera is the tree often called huánghuālí. This time I came to look for its pods, hidden among the leaves. So thin and green, they are hard to pick out at first.\nHold one to the light and the seed inside becomes quite distinct. Fine lines on the valves and the thicker part in the middle give even a small pod a wonderful texture.", "春天的花很香": "Spring flowers with a fragrance", "回看春天的记录，枝上是一簇簇黄白色的小花，数量很多。我闻着，觉得有一种清清的茶香。\n近看是豆科熟悉的蝶形小花，花苞像小米粒。平日谈起它总想到木材，站在树下才发现花也这样值得记住。": "In my spring photographs the branches carry clusters of creamy yellow flowers, a great many of them. To me their scent was a little like fresh tea.\nClose up they have the familiar pea-flower shape, with buds like grains of millet. This tree usually makes me think of timber; standing beneath it I found the flowers just as memorable.", "一树鲜亮的绿": "A tree of bright green", "羽状复叶上，一片片小叶依次排列，枝条柔软，风吹起来有一点柳树的感觉。树冠展开，像一把大伞。\n这些年常来看看它，不知不觉记录了花、叶和果。认识一棵树，有时就是这样从一次次经过开始的。": "Leaflets line the axes of the pinnate leaves. The branches are supple and wave a little like a willow in the wind. The spreading canopy opens like a large umbrella.\nVisiting over the years, I have gradually recorded flowers, leaves and fruits. Sometimes getting to know a tree starts with simply passing it again and again.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260828-01": {"白天舒展的叶丛与抽出的花序": "Leaves spread in daylight, with a flower head rising among them.", "花序下部的小花近看": "A closer view of a small flower low on the flower head.", "青莲竹芋：层层展开的粉色苞片": "The pink bracts overlap in layers.", "不同展开状态的花序": "Flower heads at different stages of opening.", "苞片之间探出的浅色小花": "A small pale flower emerging between the bracts.", "青莲竹芋 · 本期封面": "Calathea 'Bicajoux Gecko Pink', the cover photograph for this record.", "从侧面看苞片的层次": "The overlapping bracts seen from the side.", "叶面天然形成的深浅斑纹与水珠": "Natural markings on the leaf, with drops of water on its surface.", "粉色苞片像一朵小莲花，真正的花却藏在下面。再看叶子，也有值得细看的花纹。": "The pink bracts look like a little lotus. The actual flowers are tucked lower down, and the leaves have a pattern well worth a closer look.", "像莲花，却不是莲花": "A little lotus at first glance", "先吸引我的是这一层层粉色。花序从叶丛中抽出来，远看很像一朵小莲花，走近才发现，显眼的部分是一层压着一层的苞片。\n它叫青莲竹芋，也叫荷花肖竹芋。这个园艺品种的名字是 Calathea 'Bicajoux Gecko Pink'。": "It was the layers of pink that first caught my eye. The flower head rises above the leaves like a little lotus. Up close, those showy layers turn out to be overlapping bracts.\nThe Chinese names I recorded for this plant are qīnglián zhúyù (青莲竹芋) and héhuā xiāozhúyù (荷花肖竹芋). The cultivar name is Calathea 'Bicajoux Gecko Pink'.", "真正的小花，藏在这里": "Where the little flowers hide", "把视线从粉色的顶端往下移，就能找到真正的小花。它从苞片之间探出来，浅浅的颜色，不像苞片那么抢眼。\n如果只远远拍一张，很容易把最显眼的那一部分当成花。换个角度，靠近一点，就能看见两者的区别。": "Follow the pink tip down and you can find the actual flower. It peeps out between the bracts, a much paler colour than its surroundings.\nIn a photograph taken from a distance it is easy to assume the most conspicuous part is the flower. Move a little closer and change the angle: the two parts are quite distinct.", "叶子上的花纹，像画上去的": "Leaves that look hand-painted", "除了花序，它的叶子也很好看。我第一次看到时，还以为这些纹路是人工画上去的。\n深浅不同的绿色，沿着叶面铺开，像羽毛，也像被画笔轻轻晕染过。镜头放近后，还能看见叶面上的水珠，把颜色衬得更鲜明。": "I like the leaves as much as the flower head. The first time I saw them I thought someone might have painted the markings on.\nLight and dark greens spread across each blade like feathers, or a wash of colour from a brush. Up close, beads of water make the pattern stand out even more.", "它还会“睡觉”吗？": "Does it go to sleep?", "竹芋还有一种有趣的叶片运动：白天舒展，夜晚逐渐抬起、收拢。人们常把这种随昼夜变化的运动叫作“睡眠运动”。\n它当然不是真的睡着了。叶柄附近的叶枕能通过细胞膨压变化带动叶片转动。英文里常说的 Prayer Plant，也借用了叶片合拢时像双手祈祷的样子。\n这次照片记录的是白天的叶片；想看到它怎样慢慢改变姿势，还可以在入夜后再观察一次。": "Prayer plants have a daily leaf movement: the leaves spread by day, then rise and fold as night falls. This daily change is often called sleep movement, or nyctinasty.\nWhat turns the leaf is a change in water pressure in the cells of a joint near the leaf stalk, the pulvinus. The English name “prayer plant” recalls the way the folded leaves resemble hands held together in prayer.\nMy photographs show the daytime position. To see the leaves change posture I would have to come back after dark.", "Bicajoux系列介绍（品种系列资料）": "Introduction to the Bicajoux series (cultivar series information)", "The functions of foliar nyctinasty: a review and hypothesis": "The functions of foliar nyctinasty: a review and hypothesis", "肖竹芋属 Calathea（中文名称辅助对照）": "Calathea: comparison of Chinese and scientific names", "本期记录的园艺品种名为 Calathea 'Bicajoux Gecko Pink'，按素材名称保留。POWO链接对应Calathea属，提供上级分类；它不是这个园艺品种的种级接受记录。亲本种尚未确定，种一栏明确留作未确定。": "This record uses the horticultural name Calathea 'Bicajoux Gecko Pink' from the source material. The POWO link is for the genus Calathea and supplies its higher classification. The parent species has not been established; the species row is therefore marked undetermined.", "文稿末尾还提到以下竹芋。名称按原稿保留，用于记录本期涉及的对象；不将这些名称当作本档案主品种的别名，也不增加档案数量。": "The following prayer plants are mentioned at the end of the manuscript. Their names describe other plants in the video, not additional names for the featured cultivar or separate archive entries.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "视频名称；未作为当前接受名核对": "Name as used in the video. Its current accepted status has not been verified.", "视频仅列到属，未确定具体种": "Only the genus was given in the video. No species was determined."}, "20251226-01": {"花序逐段开放": "Inflorescence opening one section at a time", "紫白相间的青葙花序": "Purple and white Celosia inflorescence", "小花结构特写": "Structure of a small flower in close-up", "花被与伸出的花蕊": "Perianth and protruding reproductive parts", "荒地中的花序": "Inflorescence on waste ground", "荒地里安静开花的小草，把细小的花排成一支柔软的笔。": "On a patch of waste ground, a quiet little plant has arranged its tiny flowers into a soft paintbrush.", "你看不看，我都在开花": "Flowering whether anyone looks or not", "这片地方成了荒地之后，青葙便安静地开着。两个月里来来回回经过，每次都会被它吸引。\n它像在说：我就在这里，你看不看我，我都在开花。那种安静又独立的样子，真让人喜欢。": "Since this patch of ground fell vacant, Celosia argentea has been quietly flowering here. For two months I have been passing it, and it catches my attention every time.\nIt seems to say: here I am, flowering whether you look at me or not. I like that quiet independence.", "花序里藏着小星星": "Stars hidden in a spike", "尖尖的花序有人说像毛笔头，也有人说像火焰。我觉得它毛茸茸的轮廓还有点像兔尾巴。\n凑近看，每朵小花都很精致，浅色花被片近乎半透明，花蕊伸出来。原来这一支花序里，藏着这么多小星星。": "Some see a brush tip in the pointed flower head; others a flame. Its soft outline reminds me a little of a rabbit's tail.\nLook closer and every flower is delicate, with almost translucent pale tepals and floral parts projecting beyond them. A single spike contains so many little stars.", "上面开花，下面结实": "Flowers above, fruits below", "同一支花序，上方还带着紫色花苞，下方已经进入另一个阶段。成熟的小果会开盖，留下小碗一样的下半部，里面是黑亮的种子。\n这里提到的“青葙子”，指的就是种子。眼前一株普通的小草，换近一点的距离看，内容一点也不少。": "At the top of one spike there are still purple buds, while the base has reached quite a different stage. A ripe fruit opens with a lid, leaving a little bowl below with shiny black seeds inside.\nThe term qīngxiāngzǐ in this account refers to those seeds. An ordinary wayside herb has plenty to show when I move a little closer.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "神农本草经（原文稿提及）": "Shennong Bencao Jing, mentioned in the manuscript", "救荒本草（原文稿提及）": "Jiuhuang Bencao, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260515-01": {"针叶向外放射，枝梢中间聚着浅黄色的球花。": "Needles fan out around pale yellow cones clustered at the shoot tip.", "展开的雄球花": "Open pollen cones", "从远处观察马尾松向两侧舒展的枝层。": "From a distance, tiers of Masson pine branches spread out on either side.", "仰拍树干，可见粗糙深色树皮和分枝。": "Looking up the trunk reveals its dark, rough bark and branches.", "枝端松针与球花": "Pine needles and cones at the branch tip", "枝梢覆有褐色鳞片的细节。": "Brown scales covering the tip of a shoot.", "雄球花近景": "Pollen cones in close-up", "俯看雄球花簇": "Pollen cone cluster from above", "松针间的雄球花簇": "Cluster of pollen cones among pine needles", "仰望松枝": "Looking up at pine branches", "枝端幼小球花": "Young cone at a branch tip", "向上伸展的枝梢顶着一束束松针。": "Bundles of pine needles at the tips of upward-reaching shoots.", "从树下仰望针叶与细枝形成的树冠。": "Looking up through a canopy of needles and fine twigs.", "蓝天下的松枝": "Pine branch against blue sky", "雄球花细部": "Details of a pollen cone", "密集雄球花": "Closely packed pollen cones", "细长松针间藏着一簇簇雄球花，把春天交给风。": "Clusters of pollen cones hide among the long, slender needles. The pine entrusts its spring to the wind.", "枝头冒出黄色的烟": "A puff of yellow at the branch tips", "马尾松的雄球花一簇簇长在枝端，近看很精致。花粉特别细、特别轻，散开时像一阵淡黄色的烟。\n它借助风传粉，不需要用鲜艳花瓣招呼昆虫。我们习惯说松树“开花”，但它是裸子植物，球花和被子植物的花并不相同。": "The male pollen cones of Masson pine grow in clusters near the tips of the shoots. The pollen is so fine and light that it looks like a puff of pale yellow smoke when released.\nWind carries the pollen, so there is no need for bright petals to attract insects. We commonly speak of pines ‘flowering’, but these are gymnosperms and their cones differ from the flowers of angiosperms.", "松塔里的童年好奇": "A childhood question inside a cone", "小时候在山上看到松塔，总想知道里面的种子长什么样。松塔是球果，并不是真正的果实，鳞片之间藏着带翅的种子。\n常见食用松子并不能直接等同于马尾松种子。认识松树时，把树种也认清，才不会只凭一个松塔就混在一起。": "As a child on a mountain walk I was always curious about the seeds inside pine cones. A cone is not a true fruit: winged seeds lie between its scales.\nThe pine nuts sold for eating cannot simply be identified as seeds of Masson pine. When learning to recognise pines, it helps to look at the tree as well as the cone.", "一束束马尾": "Bunches of horsetails", "细长的针叶向外舒展，风里轻轻摇，真有点像马的尾巴。抬头望，针叶又把蓝天分成了细碎的空隙。\n从粗糙树皮到轻柔松针，这棵熟悉的树里，藏着许多不同的触感和线条。": "The long, slender needles stretch out and sway gently in the wind, like the tail of a horse. Looking up, I see them dividing the blue sky into little openings.\nFrom rough bark to soft, fine needles, this familiar tree holds a whole assortment of lines and textures.", "视频提及的食用松子来源之一。": "Mentioned in the video as one source of edible pine nuts.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本草纲目（原文稿提及）": "Bencao Gangmu (Compendium of Materia Medica), mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20250815-01": {"岩石旁的果实": "Fruit beside a rock", "橙黄聚花果与叶片": "Orange-yellow multiple fruit and leaves", "不同成熟程度的果序": "Fruit clusters at different stages of ripeness", "枝端果序与对生叶": "Terminal fruit cluster and opposite leaves", "藤蔓垂下来，橙黄色的果子像一群睁着眼睛的小精灵。": "The vine hangs down, its orange-yellow fruits like a crowd of little sprites with their eyes wide open.", "植物也长了眼睛": "A plant with eyes", "这次海边遇见的鸡眼藤正在结果。黄色到橙色的小果聚成一团，表面一个个凹点，像眼睛，也像小外星人。\n枝端一簇又一簇，细看每一团都不太一样。名字原来可以这么直观。": "The Gynochthodes parvifolia I found by the sea was in fruit. The little yellow to orange units cluster together, their surfaces pitted like eyes. They look rather like tiny aliens.\nThere were clusters at one shoot tip after another, each a little different. The Chinese name, which evokes a chicken's eye, suddenly made perfect sense.", "是近亲，不是同一种": "A relative I almost mistook it for", "远远看见时，我一度想到巴戟天。它们同属茜草科巴戟天属，但并不是同一种植物。\n眼前这些果子和对生的叶片，让这次相遇有了很清楚的记忆。叶片厚实，绿色衬着橙黄，颜色真好看。": "From a distance I first thought of the plant called bājǐtiān. The two are related, both members of the same genus in the coffee family, but they are different species.\nThese fruits and the paired leaves are what I will remember from this visit. The leaves are thick, and their green sets off the orange-yellow beautifully.", "顺着岩石垂下来": "Trailing over rock", "鸡眼藤的枝条攀着、垂着，从树旁一直延到岩石边，韧韧地占据了一片空间。\n视频中还记下五月见过的小花；这次照片重点留下了果实。沿着藤再找一圈，每一簇小眼睛都像在和人打招呼。": "The stems climb and hang down, stretching from beside a tree to the edge of the rocks, taking up a surprising amount of space.\nI mention the little flowers I saw in May in the video; the photographs on this visit mostly show fruit. I followed the stems round again and every cluster of little eyes seemed to be greeting me.", "视频用于比较的同属植物。": "Another member of the same genus, shown for comparison.", "视频比较枝条韧性；本次暂不开放其独立档案。": "The video compares the flexibility of the branches. Its separate record was held back in the earlier edition.", "视频记录鸡眼藤攀在朴树下；本次暂不开放其独立档案。": "The video shows the vine growing beneath a hackberry tree. The hackberry record was held back in the earlier edition.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20260731-01": {"新生的分叉叶": "New forked frond", "叶片之间": "Among the fronds", "向上生长的叶片": "Upright fronds", "贴着树干的盾状叶，与向外舒展的鹿角状叶，一株植物的两种叶型。": "Shield-shaped fronds hug the trunk; antler-shaped fronds spread outwards. Two kinds of frond on one fern.", "看，这棵鹿角蕨好大呀": "Look at the size of this staghorn fern", "工作人员告诉我，这棵鹿角蕨大概已经种了三四十年，非常壮观。因为叶片酷似鹿角，“鹿角蕨”的名字就这么来了。\n但最吸引我的，是同一株植物，长出了两种很不一样的叶子。": "The staff told me this magnificent fern has probably been growing here for thirty or forty years. The resemblance of its fronds to antlers explains the name ‘staghorn fern’.\nWhat really draws me to it, though, is that a single plant produces two such different kinds of frond.", "先看贴住树干的这一片": "Start with the frond against the trunk", "一种是紧贴树干生长的营养叶，也叫盾状叶，像一块圆盘。它能拦住落叶和灰尘、接住雨水，积累起来的有机物慢慢腐解，提供养分。\n我们近一点看，叶片上的脉纹也很好看。": "One kind, the sterile shield frond, hugs the tree trunk like a round plate. It catches falling leaves, dust and rainwater. The organic litter slowly breaks down and supplies nutrients.\nTake a closer look: the veins on the frond are beautiful too.", "再看伸出去的“鹿角”": "Antlers that reach out", "另一种是孢子叶，向外展开，叶子的末端一次次分叉，像鹿的角。它的背面有褐色孢子囊群。\n两种叶子看起来不同，分工也不同。一株附生在树上的植物，就这样在自己的位置上生长、繁殖。": "The other kind is fertile. These fronds reach outwards and fork repeatedly towards their tips, like antlers. Brown sori, clusters of spore cases, form on the underside.\nThe two fronds look different and do different jobs. Together they allow this epiphyte to grow and reproduce in its place on the tree.", "谢谢你，陪了我十多年": "More than a decade together", "对于我来说，鹿角蕨是很好养的植物之一。我很喜欢养它，有时候出门十天半个月，回来的时候，它还长得很好。这是我自己这株的养护经历。\n我把它放在散射光比较多的窗台、阳台边。我养的这株已经有十多年了，依然充满生命力地陪着我。再看看干掉的营养叶，脉纹真好看。谢谢你啊～": "In my own experience the staghorn fern has been one of the easier plants to grow. Sometimes I have gone away for ten days or a fortnight and found mine doing well on my return. That is the experience of this particular plant.\nI keep it by a window or near a balcony with plenty of indirect light. It has been with me for over ten years and is still full of life. Even the dried shield fronds have lovely veins. Thank you for keeping me company.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "旧库同名有Platycerium bifurcatum和P. wallichii，本次文稿明确P. bifurcatum，仅保留这一条。": "The older name index associated the Chinese name with both Platycerium bifurcatum and P. wallichii. The manuscript explicitly identifies P. bifurcatum, which is used here."}, "20260116-01": {"果序上的黑色小坚果": "Black nutlets on a fruiting stem", "林缘丛生植株": "Clump of plants at a woodland edge", "黑亮果实近景": "Glossy black fruits in close-up", "山坡上的整丛黑莎草": "A whole clump of Gahnia tristis on a hillside", "花序细部": "Detail of the inflorescence", "果序侧面": "Fruiting cluster from the side", "手旁的修长花序": "A slender inflorescence beside a hand", "直立的花果序与细叶": "Upright flowering and fruiting stems among narrow leaves", "花序上伸出的细丝": "Fine threads protruding from the inflorescence", "细长叶丛": "A clump of slender leaves", "成串黑色果实": "Clusters of black fruits", "一丛细长的绿线条，挂着黑亮的小坚果。": "A tuft of fine green lines, hung with small, glossy black nuts.", "被一丛草留住": "Stopped by a clump of sedge", "山里走着走着，竟被一丛草吸引住了。黑莎草细细长长的叶子垂下来，像胡须，风一吹，很有线条感。\n它也有“老虎须”的别名。不过叶缘粗糙锋利，观察这头茂盛的“头发”，不必用手顺着划。": "Walking in the hills I found myself stopping for a clump of Gahnia tristis. Its long, slender leaves hang like whiskers, drawing fine lines in the wind.\nOne of its Chinese names means ‘tiger's whiskers’. The margins are rough and sharp, so there is no need to run a hand through that great head of hair.", "黑色藏在果序里": "The black is in the fruits", "名字中的“黑”，在果序上就能找到答案：黑亮的小坚果挂在枝轴边，闪闪的，很可爱。\n褐色的旧花序和亮黑的果实搭在一起，与周围一丛绿叶形成鲜明对照。": "The ‘black’ in its Chinese name is easy to find among the fruits: small, shiny black nutlets hang beside the branching axes.\nOld brown flower heads and gleaming black fruits stand out against the green of the clump.", "细看没有花瓣的花": "A flower without showy petals", "花序直直地立在叶丛中，近看才能发现伸出的细小花部。它没有醒目的花瓣，花藏在鳞片状结构之间。\n从远处的一丛草，到近处一串果，原来野趣就藏在这些不太起眼的细节里。": "The inflorescences stand upright among the leaves. Only close up can I see the little floral parts protruding. There are no conspicuous petals; the flowers are tucked among scale-like structures.\nFrom a distant tussock to a string of fruits at arm's length, the interest is all in these easily overlooked details.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "中国植物志（原文稿提及）": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20250725-01": {"手中的黄绿果实": "Yellow-green fruit in a hand", "透光的裂叶": "Light shining through a lobed leaf", "龙珠果花叶果手绘": "Drawing of Passiflora foetida: flowers, leaves and fruit", "花与藤蔓": "Flower and vine", "花果同枝": "Flowers and fruits on one branch", "幼果和分裂苞片": "Young fruit and divided bracts", "龙珠果花部正面": "Passiflora foetida flower from the front", "不同成熟程度的果实": "Fruits in different stages of ripeness", "叶旁的绿色果实": "Green fruit beside the leaf", "丝状苞片包裹果实": "Threadlike bracts enclosing the fruit", "垂挂藤蔓与叶片": "Trailing vine and its leaves", "像网笼的苞片包着小果，旁边却开着精细的白色花。": "Netted bracts form a cage around each little fruit; an intricate white flower opens beside them.", "果子外面有个小网笼": "A little cage around the fruit", "龙珠果的小果外面，包着三枚分裂得很细的苞片。它们像网笼一样，乍看似乎扎手，实际细丝柔软，还带着黏性。\n果实由绿色渐渐转黄。把不同阶段放在一起，才发现这层外衣也在跟着变化。": "Three finely divided bracts enclose each small fruit of Passiflora foetida. They look like a netted cage and rather prickly at first glance, but the threads are soft and sticky.\nThe fruit turns gradually from green to yellow. Set the stages side by side and the outer covering changes with them.", "一朵小小飞行器": "A tiny flying machine", "看到花，就容易理解它和百香果为什么是近亲。花萼、花瓣、副花冠一层层展开，中间再托起花蕊，精细得像小飞行器。\n三个醒目的柱头不等于三枚独立雌蕊。这种结构，值得换几个角度慢慢看。": "The flower makes its kinship with passionfruit easy to see. Sepals, petals and corona spread in layers, with the reproductive parts held above them, as intricate as a tiny flying machine.\nThe three conspicuous stigmas belong to one pistil. It is a structure worth looking at slowly from several angles.", "想见花，要早点来": "Come early to catch the flowers", "这次记录里，早上开放的花到了日光渐强时便慢慢合拢。想看完整花形，需要一点等待。\n旁边叶片常呈三裂，藤蔓伸出卷须，抓着栏杆和枝条往上爬。一小株不声不响，就能铺开很大一片。": "During this observation the flowers opened in the morning, then began to close as the sun grew stronger. It takes a little patience to catch the complete flower.\nNearby the leaves are often three-lobed, and the vine sends out tendrils that catch on railings and branches. One small plant can quietly cover quite a large area.", "视频比较的同属植物。": "A species of the same genus mentioned for comparison.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250808-01": {"透明假种皮与黑色种子": "Translucent aril and black seed", "龙眼林与草地": "Longan grove and grass", "挂果树冠近景": "Fruit-laden canopy in close-up", "曲折树干和枝条": "Twisting trunks and branches", "满枝龙眼": "Branches laden with longans", "走进龙眼林，看黑色树干、满枝果子和果肉里的一只“眼睛”。": "In a longan grove, take in the dark trunks and fruit-laden branches, then look for an “eye” inside the flesh.", "一片让人想转圈的树林": "A grove that makes me want to turn in circles", "成片的龙眼树真好看。雨后的草地绿绿的，树干颜色深，枝条舒展开，整片树林有一种古朴的感觉。\n每次走进来，都有想转一圈的冲动。这次枝上又挂满了果子，沉甸甸的，真是丰收的样子。": "The longan trees look lovely together. After rain the grass is a fresh green, the trunks are dark, and the outstretched branches lend the grove a quiet, old-fashioned air.\nEvery time I walk in I feel like turning a full circle to take it all in. This time the branches are heavy with fruit: it looks like a fine harvest.", "龙的眼睛原来在这里": "Where the dragon's eye is hiding", "剥开果壳，透明的部分包着黑亮的种子，整体看起来很像眼睛。“龙眼”这个名字，一下就好理解了。\n我们吃的部分，在植物学上叫假种皮。熟悉的水果，换个方式看，也能发现新的细节。": "Peel away the shell and the transparent flesh surrounds a glossy black seed. Together they look uncannily like an eye, which makes the Chinese name lóngyǎn, ‘dragon's eye’, easy to remember.\nThe part we eat is called an aril. Even a familiar fruit has something new to show when I look at it a different way.", "从果子再看看树": "Step back from the fruit to see the tree", "一串串龙眼藏在叶丛里，多得让人担心枝条会不会太累。它与荔枝同属无患子科，但各有自己的样子。\n看完果子，再退远一点。粗糙的树干、弯曲的枝条，和这片草地配在一起，也是我很喜欢的龙眼。": "There are so many bunches of longan among the leaves that I wonder how the branches hold them all. Like lychee, longan belongs to the soapberry family, Sapindaceae. Each has its own distinctive character.\nNow stand a little further back. The rough trunks, curved branches and green grass are just as much a part of what I love about these trees.", "视频比较的同科果树。": "A fruit tree in the same family, included for comparison.", "名称按视频记录；未单独核对接受名。": "Name as given in the video. Its accepted status has not been checked separately.", "以下是本期视频展示或提及的其它对象。已有独立档案的可以继续查看，其余保留名称与说明。": "These plants or fungi are shown or mentioned in the same video. Links lead to separate records where one is available.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "神农本草经（原文稿提及）": "Shennong Bencao Jing, mentioned in the manuscript"}, "20261009-01": {"蓝天下的花序": "Inflorescence against blue sky", "同一花序上的深浅花色": "Several shades of blossom in one cluster", "向上伸展的花序": "Inflorescence extending upwards", "深浅不同的花色": "Flowers in varying shades", "直立植株的枝干": "Branches of an upright plant", "粉红色花朵": "Pink blossoms", "淡粉色单花": "A single pale pink flower", "红色与粉色的花": "Red and pink flowers", "深红色单花": "One deep red flower", "另处找到的未成熟果实": "Immature fruit found elsewhere", "尚未展开的花蕾": "Unopened flower buds", "逆光下的叶片": "Leaf lit from behind", "花园里的直立使君子": "An upright Combretum indicum growing in the garden", "细长的花管": "Slender flower tube", "使君子 · 本期封面": "Combretum indicum · video cover", "带浅褐色的新叶": "New leaves tinged with pale brown", "白色花蕾与细长花管": "White buds and a long, slender flower tube", "同一簇花，从白色走到粉红与深红。为了找它的种子，又多走了一段路。": "In the same cluster, flowers pass from white to pink to deep red. Finding the seeds took me a little farther down the road.", "一簇花，几种颜色": "Several colours in one cluster", "使君子的花特别有意思：同一簇花序上，能同时看到白色、粉红和深红。\n花刚开放时偏白，随着开放时间增加，颜色逐渐加深。看着它，很容易想问：一朵花为什么要换这么多次颜色？": "What I love about Combretum indicum is seeing white, pink and deep red flowers together in the very same cluster.\nA newly opened blossom is whitish, and its colour gradually deepens as it ages. Looking at it, I cannot help wondering why a single flower changes colour so many times.", "换颜色，也换来访者": "Different colours, different visitors?", "花色和香气的变化，让我想到不同时间来访的昆虫。夜里的白花、白天的粉红和红色，在不同光线下都很醒目。\n这次先把颜色变化记录下来。至于每一位访客怎样找到它，还需要更多时段的观察。": "The changes in colour and scent make me think of insects visiting at different times of day. White flowers at night, pink and red by day: each stands out under its own light.\nFor now I have recorded the colour change. To learn how each visitor finds its way to the flowers, I would need to watch at more times of day.", "这几株是直立型": "An upright garden form", "印象里的使君子很会攀爬，而眼前这几株是花园里种植的直立型。枝条站起来，花序也更容易凑近观察。\n本期主对象按文稿保留园艺名 Combretum indicum 'Erect'，正式种级分类对应使君子 Combretum indicum，两者在分类说明里分别记录。": "I usually think of this plant as an enthusiastic climber. The ones in front of me are an upright form planted in the garden. The branches stand up, bringing the flower heads within easy reach of the camera.\nThis record retains the manuscript's horticultural name, Combretum indicum 'Erect'. Its species is Combretum indicum. The two names appear separately in the classification notes.", "为了这个名字，去找一找果实": "A name that sent me looking for the fruit", "“使君子”这个名字让我很好奇，尤其是最后那个“子”。所以拍花之后，我还特意找了它的果实。\n在这几株上没有找到，后来换了地方，终于遇见一串还没成熟的小果子，形状像小梭子。这张照片是另处的观察，不能据此说眼前的直立园艺型已经结果。": "The Chinese name shǐjūnzǐ made me curious, particularly the final character, 子, which can refer to a seed. After photographing the flowers I made a point of looking for fruit.\nI found none on these plants. In another place, at last, I came across a cluster of unripe fruits shaped like little weaving shuttles. That photograph records a different visit; it does not show that the upright garden plants were fruiting.", "文稿另找果实；与直立园艺型区分。": "The author found the fruit at another site. The fruit cannot be attributed to the upright horticultural form photographed here.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。 本期为文稿记录的直立园艺型 Erect；正式种级记录为 Combretum indicum，园艺名不另作种级等级。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source. The manuscript records the upright horticultural form 'Erect'. Its species is Combretum indicum; the cultivar name is recorded separately."}, "20250425-01": {"花朵正面": "Flower viewed from the front", "新叶与老叶": "New and old leaves", "半开与展开的花": "Partly open and fully open flowers", "含笑花与叶的手绘": "Drawing of Magnolia figo flowers and leaves", "展开的花与花蕊": "Open flower and its reproductive parts", "花蕾与绿叶": "Buds and green leaves", "半开的花苞": "Partly open bud", "枝头的叶片": "Leaves at the tip of a branch", "花被脱落后的花轴": "Floral axis after the tepals have fallen", "新梢与叶片": "New shoot and leaves", "毛茸茸的芽": "Furry bud", "花后留下的花轴": "Floral axis remaining after flowering", "含笑植株": "Magnolia figo plant", "含笑花 · 本期封面": "Magnolia figo · video cover", "半开的含笑花": "Partly open Magnolia figo flower", "枝头的花蕾与花朵": "Flowers and buds at a branch tip", "树下的观察现场": "Observation site beneath the tree", "一阵像香蕉的香味，把我留在含笑树下。半开的花、毛茸茸的芽，都值得再看一眼。": "A whiff of banana held me under this magnolia. The half-open flowers and furry buds were each worth a second look.", "先被香味叫住": "Called over by a fragrance", "走着走着，被一棵含笑吸引了过来。好香，是让我想到香蕉的味道，“香蕉花”这个称呼一下就记住了。\n爬山好像也没有那么疲惫了。我很喜欢在树下待一会儿，闻着花香，就会莫名开心。": "I was walking along when the scent of Magnolia figo drew me over. It reminded me so much of bananas that the name ‘banana flower’ stuck at once.\nEven the climb felt less tiring. I like spending a little time beneath this tree; the smell of the flowers makes me happy for no particular reason.", "花开到一半，像在含笑": "A half-open flower, almost a smile", "它的花常常半开着，没有一下子完全展开。淡黄色的花被片带一点红紫色的边，像是轻轻描了一圈。\n“含笑美人”的说法，放在这个花形上很贴切。等到花展开，里面一圈圈的花蕊就露出来了。": "The blossoms often open only partway at first. Pale yellow tepals have a reddish purple edging, as though someone had lightly traced the outline.\nThe Chinese image of a beauty holding back a smile suits this shape. As a flower opens further, the rings of reproductive parts come into view.", "从花心看到毛茸茸的芽": "From the centre of a flower to a furry bud", "花被片掉落以后，枝上留下了细长的花轴。那一排排小结构，像小麦穗一样。这次没有拍到成熟的果实，留待以后再看。\n再看旁边还没开放的芽，毛茸茸的；配上油亮的叶子，倒像一位整装待发的严肃先生。": "After the tepals fall, a slender floral axis remains on the branch. Its rows of little structures look like a tiny ear of wheat. I did not photograph a mature fruit this time; that can wait for another visit.\nBeside it is an unopened bud, all soft hair against the glossy leaves. It looks rather like a solemn gentleman dressed and ready to go.", "树下再多站一会儿": "A little longer under the tree", "这棵含笑比我平常见到的高大得多。站在树下，才发现它已经长成了这样一片树冠。\n拍摄时也曾好奇，它是不是另一个近似种？这个疑问先留在观察里，不凭树高就改掉名字。今天最确定的收获，还是这一阵花香。": "This specimen is much taller than the ones I usually see. Standing underneath, I realised how broad its canopy had become.\nAs I photographed it I did wonder whether it might be another, similar species. I will keep that question open rather than change a name on the strength of height alone. The thing I am sure of today is that delicious fragrance.", "原文为疑问，不确认鉴定。": "The manuscript poses this as a question. The identification is unconfirmed.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。 文稿中的 Michelia figo 对应本档案采用的接受名 Magnolia figo。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source. The manuscript name Michelia figo corresponds to the accepted Magnolia figo."}, "20250509-01": {"黑亮果实近景": "Glossy black fruits in close-up", "绿色与黑紫色果实": "Green and purple-black fruits", "白色小花正面": "A small white flower from the front", "掌心里的果实": "Fruit in the palm of a hand", "路边的观察现场": "Roadside observation site", "小花侧面": "Small flower from the side", "花、果、叶与根系手绘": "Drawing of flowers, fruits, leaves and roots", "反卷的花冠与黄色花药": "Reflexed corolla and yellow anthers", "挂满果实的植株": "Fruit-laden plant", "植株与周围环境": "Plant in its surroundings", "少花龙葵 · 本期封面": "Solanum americanum · video cover", "不同成熟阶段的浆果": "Berries at different stages of ripeness", "黄色花药近景": "Yellow anthers in close-up", "同一枝上的花果": "Flowers and fruits on the same branch", "枝头的黑色果实": "Black fruits at the branch tip", "叶片与白色小花": "Leaves and tiny white flowers", "花与叶": "Flower and leaves", "花枝": "Flowering shoot", "根系观察": "Examining the roots", "黑亮的果子很抢眼，细看白色小花，才发现它还有另一种精致。": "The glossy black fruits catch the eye first. Look closely at the white flowers and you’ll find a different sort of delicacy.", "一株挂满小果子的草": "A little plant laden with fruit", "我前面这一株，果子特别多。绿色的、黑紫色的，都挂在同一株上；成熟的果子亮晶晶，很抢眼。\n这期记录的是少花龙葵。只看俗名很容易混在一起，观察时还要留意花梗、果梗怎样排列。": "There are so many fruits on the plant in front of me. Green ones and blackish purple ones hang together, the ripe fruits gleaming.\nThis record is of Solanum americanum. Common names can be confusing, so it helps to look at the way the individual flower and fruit stalks are arranged.", "小灯笼里的一点黄": "Yellow at the heart of a little lantern", "果子看过了，再看看花。白色花冠分成五瓣，慢慢向后反卷，中心是醒目的黄色花药。\n整朵花小小的，侧面看有点像一盏灯笼。如此普通的一丛野草，镜头放大之后竟然这么精致。": "Now for the flowers. The white corolla has five lobes that gradually curl back, exposing conspicuous yellow anthers in the centre.\nThe whole blossom is tiny, rather like a lantern when seen from the side. What looked like an ordinary patch of weeds is surprisingly intricate through the lens.", "从枝叶看到根": "From the branches down to the roots", "叶片、花和果挤在枝上，生长得很热闹。这次也把根系拍了下来，细细的根向四周展开。\n它让我好奇的，不只是能长多少果子，还有这么一株普通的草，是怎样在路边生长起来的。": "Leaves, flowers and fruit crowd the branches. This time I photographed the root system as well, with fine roots spreading out in every direction.\nI wonder not only how much fruit it can carry, but how an inconspicuous little plant like this gets established beside the road.", "你们那里叫它什么": "What do people call it where you live?", "黑天天、悠悠、天星星……这类小果子在不同地方有很多叫法，听起来就带着童年的气息。\n俗名不一定只对应同一个种。这里保留本期的少花龙葵记录；照片中的采集是观察过程，不作为辨认野果或食用的依据。": "Hēitiāntiān, yōuyōu, tiānxīngxīng: there are many local names for little berries like these, and they sound full of childhood memories.\nA common name may refer to more than one species. This observation is recorded as Solanum americanum. The collecting shown here was part of making the observation; the photographs are not a guide to identifying or eating wild berries.", "与少花龙葵对照，不与主对象混名。": "Shown alongside Solanum americanum without merging the two names.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source."}, "20250409-01": {"枝头的长角果": "Long siliques at a shoot tip", "果序与白色小花": "Fruit cluster and small white flowers", "分枝的茎": "Branched stem", "向上伸展的花序": "Inflorescence extending upwards", "卷曲的果瓣与种子": "Curled fruit valves and seeds", "草丛中的花枝": "Flowering shoot among grasses", "角果表面的种子轮廓": "Outlines of seeds visible through the wall of a silique", "花、叶、角果与种子手绘": "Drawing of flowers, leaves, siliques and seeds", "枝条上的叶与小白花": "Leaves and small white flowers on a branch", "草地里的一丛植株": "A clump of plants on the lawn", "草地上的观察现场": "Observation site on the grass", "整丛植株与手掌对照": "A whole clump beside a hand for scale", "弯曲碎米荠 · 本期封面": "Cardamine flexuosa · video cover", "四瓣小花": "Small flower with four petals", "细长的角果": "Slender siliques", "小花近景": "Small flower in close-up", "花序顶端的小白花": "Small white flowers at the tip of an inflorescence", "仍挂在果瓣上的种子": "Seeds still attached to a fruit valve", "草地里的小米粒花，细长的果实里还藏着一次种子的冒险。": "The little flowers in the grass are hardly larger than grains of rice. Inside the slender pods, the seeds have an adventure in store.", "草地里的小米粒花": "White flowers like grains of millet", "我在草地里找到了一丛小米粒一样的白花。单单这样一丛，还挺好看的，仿佛是缩小的草甸。\n这次记录的是弯曲碎米荠。花太小了，好不容易才拍清楚；凑近看，四片白色花瓣展开，是熟悉的十字形。": "In the grass I spotted a clump of white blossoms like grains of millet. It was lovely even on its own, a whole meadow in miniature.\nThis is Cardamine flexuosa. Its flowers are so small I could barely get a clear photograph. Up close the four white petals make the familiar cross.", "先看果子，再认名字": "Look at the fruits before choosing a name", "乍一看，茎和叶子有点像荠菜。不过把目光移到果实上，就看出区别了：这里挂着的是一根根细长的角果。\n果实沿着果序向上排列，和小花挤在同一株上。比起只看花，花、叶和果一起看，会多出不少线索。": "At first glance the stems and leaves reminded me a little of shepherd's purse. The fruits are a better clue: here they are long, slender siliques.\nThey stand in succession along the fruiting stem, on the same plant as the tiny flowers. Looking at flowers, leaves and fruit together gives me more to go on than a flower alone.", "种子的一次小冒险": "A seed's little adventure", "果瓣卷起来，种子就有了离开母株的机会。这一次也有没走成的：几粒种子还挂在弯弯的果瓣上。\n哈哈，冒险似乎还没正式开始。镜头把这一瞬间留下来，才发现这么普通的一丛草，也有这么细的小机关。": "When a fruit valve curls back, the seeds get their chance to leave the parent plant. A few did not quite make it this time: I can still see them clinging to a curved valve.\nPerhaps their adventure has not started yet. My camera caught that moment, and with it a tiny mechanism I would never have noticed in this ordinary patch of grass.", "把整株也记下来": "A portrait of the whole plant", "看完花和果，再回头看看它的茎。从基部伸出不少分枝，斜着向上散开。\n这些小花很容易淹没在草地里，但蹲下来、换个角度，整株的轮廓就清楚了。": "After the flowers and fruit, look back at the stems. Several branches rise from the base, slanting upwards and outwards.\nThe little flowers are easily lost in the grass, but crouch down and change the angle, and the outline of the whole plant becomes clear.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source."}, "20230602-01": {"同片兜兰：红褐色花朵": "Another slipper orchid in the video: reddish brown flower", "彩云兜兰的单花": "A single Paphiopedilum wardii flower", "同片兜兰：黄色花朵": "Another slipper orchid in the video: yellow flower", "同片兜兰：深红色花朵": "Another slipper orchid in the video: dark red flower", "同片兜兰：浅色囊状唇瓣": "Another slipper orchid in the video: pale pouch-shaped lip", "彩云兜兰的花朵与花梗": "Paphiopedilum wardii flower and stalk", "同片兜兰：绿色囊状唇瓣": "Another slipper orchid in the video: green pouch-shaped lip", "同片兜兰：花朵正面": "Another slipper orchid in the video: flower from the front", "同片兜兰：绿色花朵正面": "Another slipper orchid in the video: green flower from the front", "彩云兜兰的斑点花瓣与囊状唇瓣": "Spotted petals and pouch-shaped lip of Paphiopedilum wardii", "彩云兜兰的花朵": "Paphiopedilum wardii flower", "同片兜兰：深红与绿色花朵": "Another slipper orchid in the video: dark red and green flower", "彩云兜兰 · 本期封面": "Paphiopedilum wardii · video cover", "像一只遗落在花丛里的小拖鞋。以彩云兜兰为起点，看看兜兰们不同的花形。": "Like a little slipper lost among the flowers. Starting with Paphiopedilum wardii, we look at the many shapes a slipper orchid can take.", "花丛里的一只小拖鞋": "A little slipper among the flowers", "兜兰也叫仙履兰、拖鞋兰。名字听着有点梦幻，看看它的花就明白了：下方鼓起来的唇瓣，确实像一只小小的拖鞋。\n这次以彩云兜兰为例，凑近看看。上方的纹路、两侧的斑点和中间的“鞋头”，各有各的样子。": "Slipper orchids have some rather dreamy Chinese names. One look explains them: the swollen lip at the bottom of the flower really does look like a tiny slipper.\nHere I am taking Paphiopedilum wardii as my example. Look closely at the lines above, the spots at the sides and the ‘toe’ in the middle. Each part has its own pattern.", "同样是兜，模样可不一样": "The same pouch in different shapes", "这一期还记录了其它兜兰。有黄的、绿的，也有深红色的；有的唇瓣圆鼓鼓，有的显得修长。\n把它们放在一起看，共同的轮廓很容易认出来，细节却一点也不单调。图集中保留了这些同片对象，不把它们都当成彩云兜兰。": "Other slipper orchids appear in this video as well. Some are yellow, some green, some dark red. Some lips are round and plump; others look long and slender.\nSide by side they share an unmistakable outline, yet the details are wonderfully varied. The gallery keeps these other orchids as comparisons; they are not all P. wardii.", "这个兜里藏着什么": "What does the pouch hold?", "最让我好奇的还是这只“兜”：花为什么会长成这样？\n兜兰的囊状唇瓣与昆虫访花有关。观察时，可以顺着兜口向里看，找找花中央的合蕊柱。与其只记住一个名字，我更想把这个独特的花形记下来。": "It is the pouch I keep coming back to: why would a flower take this shape?\nThe slipper orchid's pouch-shaped lip is linked to visits from insects. Follow the rim inwards with your eyes and look for the column in the middle of the flower. More than the name, it is this extraordinary shape that I want to remember.", "园艺名称采用植物智PPBC记录；可查看独立档案。": "The horticultural name follows an iPlant PPBC record. A separate archive entry is available.", "文稿提及。": "Mentioned in the manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source."}, "20250613-01": {"挺立的叶片": "Upright leaves", "花序侧面": "Inflorescence viewed from the side", "花与叶丛": "Flowers and foliage", "长心形的叶片": "Long heart-shaped leaf", "花上的黄色斑点": "Yellow spot on a flower", "正在开放的花序": "Inflorescence coming into bloom", "梭鱼草 · 本期封面": "Pontederia cordata · video cover", "花序与访花昆虫": "Inflorescence and a flower-visiting insect", "蓝紫色小花": "Small blue-violet flowers", "水边成片的梭鱼草": "A stand of Pontederia cordata at the water’s edge", "花序正面": "Inflorescence viewed from the front", "水中的茎与叶柄": "Stems and leaf stalks in the water", "叶面的纵向纹理": "Lengthwise lines on a leaf surface", "蓝紫色花序从水边升起，每朵小花上还有醒目的黄色斑点。": "Blue-violet spikes rise at the water’s edge. Each little flower bears a bright yellow spot.", "水边的小精灵": "Little figures at the water's edge", "一串串蓝紫色的小花，乍一看像小精灵，非常吸引人。它就是梭鱼草，一种常见的水生植物。\n成片生长的时候，绿色叶子上方浮着许多蓝紫色的小点，远看像一片水上的花海。": "The spikes of blue-violet flowers look like little sprites. This is Pontederia cordata, a familiar aquatic plant.\nIn a large stand, blue-violet dots seem to hover above the green leaves. From a distance it looks like a patch of flowers floating on the water.", "每朵花上都有小路标": "A signpost on each flower", "花序上的小花逐渐开放，已经展开的和还没展开的，可以同时看到。\n最有趣的是花上醒目的黄色斑点，在蓝紫色中特别突出。镜头放大以后，这些小花就不再只是远处的一串颜色了。": "The flowers open in succession along the spike. Open blossoms and unopened buds are visible together.\nMy favourite detail is the conspicuous yellow spot, bright against the blue-violet. Through a close lens each flower becomes much more than a speck of colour at the water's edge.", "叶子也不输给花": "The leaves deserve a look too", "叶片像一个长长的心形，叶尖指向天空。叶面很平滑，还能看到一条条流畅的纹理。\n往下看，叶柄和茎从水里伸出来。把花、叶和水边的环境一起记住，下次就更容易认出它。": "The blade forms an elongated heart, with the tip pointing skyward. Its smooth surface is crossed by a pattern of flowing lines.\nLook down and the leaf stalks and stems emerge from the water. Remember flowers, leaves and waterside setting together, and the plant is easier to recognise next time.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source."}, "20250516-01": {"一串红色小花": "A string of little red flowers", "槭叶酒瓶树 · 本期封面": "Brachychiton acerifolius · video cover", "掌状分裂的叶片": "Palmately lobed leaf", "枝头开裂的果实": "Split fruit on a branch", "挂果的枝条": "Fruit-bearing branch", "树冠的红花": "Red blossoms in the canopy", "叶丛": "Foliage", "蓝天下的红色花序": "Red flower clusters against blue sky", "红花与枝条": "Red flowers and branches", "拾起的红色落花": "A fallen red blossom picked up from the ground", "绿色树皮": "Green bark", "逆光下的叶片": "Leaf lit from behind", "树冠像燃起一团火，细看却是一串串红色小铃铛。": "The crown of the tree looks ablaze. Up close, the flames resolve into strings of little red bells.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "满树红彤彤": "A tree glowing red", "这棵树开花的枝头几乎看不到叶子，满树红彤彤，像火焰一样。站在树下，仿佛都能感受到它的热情。\n它也叫澳洲火焰木。这份档案用槭叶酒瓶树这个名字，花、叶、树干，都能从名字里找到一点线索。": "There were hardly any leaves on the flowering branches. The whole tree glowed red like a flame. Standing beneath it, I could almost feel the warmth of all that colour.\nIt is also called the Australian flame tree. The Chinese name used here, “maple-leaved bottle tree”, offers a few clues to its leaves and trunk as well as the flowers I had come to see.", "这棵树开花的枝头几乎看不到叶子，满树红彤彤，像火焰一样。站在树下，仿佛都能感受到它的热情。": "There were hardly any leaves on the flowering branches. The whole tree glowed red like a flame. Standing beneath it, I could almost feel the warmth of all that colour.", "它也叫澳洲火焰木。这份档案用槭叶酒瓶树这个名字，花、叶、树干，都能从名字里找到一点线索。": "It is also called the Australian flame tree. The Chinese name used here, “maple-leaved bottle tree”, offers a few clues to its leaves and trunk as well as the flowers I had come to see.", "火焰原来是小铃铛": "The flames are little bells", "一串串红色花朵挂在枝上，远看是火，近看倒像一只只铃铛。\n树下也有落花，捡起来放在掌心，才能感受到它们其实很小。大树的热闹，原来是这些小花一起凑出来的。": "Clusters of red flowers hung from the branches. From far away I saw fire. Up close each looked like a little bell.\nThere were fallen flowers beneath the tree. I picked one up and laid it in my palm, and only then realised how small it was. All that splendour in the crown came from tiny flowers in great numbers.", "一串串红色花朵挂在枝上，远看是火，近看倒像一只只铃铛。": "Clusters of red flowers hung from the branches. From far away I saw fire. Up close each looked like a little bell.", "树下也有落花，捡起来放在掌心，才能感受到它们其实很小。大树的热闹，原来是这些小花一起凑出来的。": "There were fallen flowers beneath the tree. I picked one up and laid it in my palm, and only then realised how small it was. All that splendour in the crown came from tiny flowers in great numbers.", "叶子像一只手掌": "A leaf shaped like a hand", "换到有叶子的枝条，样子又不一样了。叶片向外裂开，像手掌，也让人想到槭树的叶子。\n阳光从背后透过来，叶脉很清楚。红花之外，这些绿叶也值得单独拍一张。": "A branch still in leaf looked quite different. The blade spread into lobes like the fingers of a hand, and reminded me of a maple leaf.\nWith sunlight behind it, the veins showed clearly. The green leaves deserved a photograph of their own.", "换到有叶子的枝条，样子又不一样了。叶片向外裂开，像手掌，也让人想到槭树的叶子。": "A branch still in leaf looked quite different. The blade spread into lobes like the fingers of a hand, and reminded me of a maple leaf.", "阳光从背后透过来，叶脉很清楚。红花之外，这些绿叶也值得单独拍一张。": "With sunlight behind it, the veins showed clearly. The green leaves deserved a photograph of their own.", "小花后面的大果子": "Big fruits after such little flowers", "枝上还挂着开裂的果实。很难想象，这样的果子竟然接在那些小花后面。\n再看看树干，带着绿色的树皮很特别。这次还没见到明显鼓起的“酒瓶肚子”，那就把这个观察留给以后。": "Split fruits still hung on the tree. It was hard to imagine that something so substantial had followed those little bells.\nThe green tint of the bark was striking too. I didn’t see a conspicuously swollen “bottle belly” on the trunk this time. That’s something to look for on a future visit.", "枝上还挂着开裂的果实。很难想象，这样的果子竟然接在那些小花后面。": "Split fruits still hung on the tree. It was hard to imagine that something so substantial had followed those little bells.", "再看看树干，带着绿色的树皮很特别。这次还没见到明显鼓起的“酒瓶肚子”，那就把这个观察留给以后。": "The green tint of the bark was striking too. I didn’t see a conspicuously swollen “bottle belly” on the trunk this time. That’s something to look for on a future visit."}, "20250526-01": {"毛茸茸的唇瓣近景": "Hairy lip in close-up", "花序背面": "Back of the inflorescence", "唇瓣侧面": "Lip from the side", "叶片与盆边根系": "Leaves and exposed roots beside the pot", "唇瓣与花被": "Lip and perianth", "花后的小果实": "Small fruit after flowering", "花序上的毛状唇瓣": "Hairy lip on the inflorescence", "花的侧面结构": "Structure of the flower in side view", "细长的毛状唇瓣": "Long, narrow, hairy lip", "花与果实手绘": "Drawing of flowers and fruits", "毛唇石豆兰 · 本期封面": "Bulbophyllum barbigerum · video cover", "花序轴与花梗": "Inflorescence axis and flower stalk", "假鳞茎与叶片": "Pseudobulbs and leaves", "花序与单花": "Inflorescence and a single flower", "花上长着一团会晃的“毛毛虫”，再看看小果实和豆子般的假鳞茎。": "A furry “caterpillar” wobbles on the flower. Look also for the little fruits and the bean-shaped pseudobulbs.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "盆里养了一只毛毛虫？": "A caterpillar in the flowerpot?", "镜头下这团像毛毛虫的东西，竟然是一朵花。它叫毛唇石豆兰，也是我见过很特别的一种兰花。\n棕色、毛茸茸的部位是唇瓣。拍摄时，它会轻轻晃动，不知道名字之前，真容易以为是虫子落在了花上。": "That caterpillar-like tuft in front of the camera was actually a flower. Bulbophyllum barbigerum is one of the more unusual orchids I’ve seen.\nThe brown hairy part is the lip. It swayed gently as I filmed. Before I knew the plant’s name, I could easily have taken it for an insect perched on the flower.", "镜头下这团像毛毛虫的东西，竟然是一朵花。它叫毛唇石豆兰，也是我见过很特别的一种兰花。": "That caterpillar-like tuft in front of the camera was actually a flower. Bulbophyllum barbigerum is one of the more unusual orchids I’ve seen.", "棕色、毛茸茸的部位是唇瓣。拍摄时，它会轻轻晃动，不知道名字之前，真容易以为是虫子落在了花上。": "The brown hairy part is the lip. It swayed gently as I filmed. Before I knew the plant’s name, I could easily have taken it for an insect perched on the flower.", "换个角度看它的机关": "A different angle on the moving parts", "沿着花序看过去，每朵花都有自己伸展的角度。侧面看，唇瓣的连接处和花的其它部分就更清楚了。\n这样会动的结构，让我很想知道昆虫来访时会发生什么。照片先把形态记下来，摆动的过程则留在视频里。": "Each flower along the inflorescence opened at its own angle. From the side I could see where the lip was attached and how it sat among the other floral parts.\nThat moving lip made me wonder what happens when an insect visits. The photographs record the shape. You can see the swaying movement in the video.", "沿着花序看过去，每朵花都有自己伸展的角度。侧面看，唇瓣的连接处和花的其它部分就更清楚了。": "Each flower along the inflorescence opened at its own angle. From the side I could see where the lip was attached and how it sat among the other floral parts.", "这样会动的结构，让我很想知道昆虫来访时会发生什么。照片先把形态记下来，摆动的过程则留在视频里。": "That moving lip made me wonder what happens when an insect visits. The photographs record the shape. You can see the swaying movement in the video.", "我家这一株还结果了": "The one at home produced a fruit", "这次还发现了一颗小果实，绿绿的，接在花后面。和手指放在一起看，才发现它也不算太小。\n从开花到结果，家里一盆植物的变化，就这样一点点被记了下来。": "I found a little green fruit where a flower had been. Set beside my finger, it wasn’t quite as small as it had looked.\nFrom flower to fruit, I’ve been recording the changes in this one potted plant at home, little by little.", "这次还发现了一颗小果实，绿绿的，接在花后面。和手指放在一起看，才发现它也不算太小。": "I found a little green fruit where a flower had been. Set beside my finger, it wasn’t quite as small as it had looked.", "从开花到结果，家里一盆植物的变化，就这样一点点被记了下来。": "From flower to fruit, I’ve been recording the changes in this one potted plant at home, little by little.", "豆子般的假鳞茎": "Pseudobulbs like beans", "花很奇特，叶子倒显得朴素。叶片下方膨大的部位是假鳞茎，有点像豆子，沿着根状茎一个个长出来。\n石豆兰是附生兰。它们借树木或其它表面落脚，并不是靠寄主提供养分的寄生植物。": "The flowers are extraordinary, but the leaves look quite plain. The swelling below each leaf is a pseudobulb. They look like beans growing one after another along the rhizome.\nThis is an epiphytic orchid. Trees and other surfaces give it a foothold. It doesn’t draw nourishment from the host as a parasite would.", "花很奇特，叶子倒显得朴素。叶片下方膨大的部位是假鳞茎，有点像豆子，沿着根状茎一个个长出来。": "The flowers are extraordinary, but the leaves look quite plain. The swelling below each leaf is a pseudobulb. They look like beans growing one after another along the rhizome.", "石豆兰是附生兰。它们借树木或其它表面落脚，并不是靠寄主提供养分的寄生植物。": "This is an epiphytic orchid. Trees and other surfaces give it a foothold. It doesn’t draw nourishment from the host as a parasite would."}, "20250507-01": {"花境里的火炬花": "Kniphofia in a flower border", "花序顶端": "Tip of the inflorescence", "一簇簇火炬般的花序": "Clusters of torch-like inflorescences", "尚在开放的花序": "Inflorescence still coming into bloom", "花序下部已经展开的花": "Open flowers at the base of an inflorescence", "俯看花序与叶丛": "Inflorescence and foliage from above", "成丛的狭长叶片": "Clump of narrow leaves", "火炬花 · 本期封面": "Kniphofia uvaria · video cover", "橙色花序": "Orange inflorescence", "一把把小火炬立在叶丛中，花从下往上开放，把渐变的颜色举得高高的。": "Little torches stand above the leaves. The flowers open from the bottom upwards, holding a gradient of colour high in the air.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "这不是芦荟花": "A torch in flower", "这不是芦荟花，一把一把像火一样的，是火炬花。这几年逛花展，它总是我会特意看望的花之一。\n一支支花序冲出草丛，颜色由浅到深，好像正在燃烧的小火把。“火把莲”这个名字，也很形象。": "Those handfuls of flame aren’t aloe flowers. They’re Kniphofia, the torch lily. In recent years it has been one of the plants I make a point of visiting at flower shows.\nThe spikes rise straight out of the greenery, their colours going from light to dark like little burning torches. No wonder the Chinese name huǒbǎlián evokes a torch.", "这不是芦荟花，一把一把像火一样的，是火炬花。这几年逛花展，它总是我会特意看望的花之一。": "Those handfuls of flame aren’t aloe flowers. They’re Kniphofia, the torch lily. In recent years it has been one of the plants I make a point of visiting at flower shows.", "一支支花序冲出草丛，颜色由浅到深，好像正在燃烧的小火把。“火把莲”这个名字，也很形象。": "The spikes rise straight out of the greenery, their colours going from light to dark like little burning torches. No wonder the Chinese name huǒbǎlián evokes a torch.", "一把火炬，许多小花": "One torch, many small flowers", "凑近以后，才发现一把“火炬”是由许多筒状小花组成的。下方已经开放，上方还是紧紧的花蕾。\n花开后，雄蕊和雌蕊从花口伸出来。把上下两段放在一起看，同一个花序里就能读到开放的次序。": "Close up, I saw that each “torch” was made of many tubular flowers. The lower ones had opened while those at the top were still tight buds.\nIn an open flower the reproductive parts project from the mouth of the tube. The lower and upper sections together let me read the order of opening on a single spike.", "凑近以后，才发现一把“火炬”是由许多筒状小花组成的。下方已经开放，上方还是紧紧的花蕾。": "Close up, I saw that each “torch” was made of many tubular flowers. The lower ones had opened while those at the top were still tight buds.", "花开后，雄蕊和雌蕊从花口伸出来。把上下两段放在一起看，同一个花序里就能读到开放的次序。": "In an open flower the reproductive parts project from the mouth of the tube. The lower and upper sections together let me read the order of opening on a single spike.", "叶子把花托起来": "A fountain of leaves beneath the flowers", "花很热闹，叶子倒是干干净净的。狭长的叶片一丛丛生长，从基部向四周散开。\n从上方看，叶子和圆圆的花序又是另一种组合。我尤其喜欢在花境里见到它，和周围的植物搭配起来，格外有精神。": "For all the commotion in the flowers, the leaves have such clean lines. Long narrow blades grow in clumps, spreading from the base in all directions.\nFrom above, the leaves and rounded flower spikes made another arrangement altogether. I especially like seeing the plant in a mixed border, where it looks so lively among its neighbours.", "花很热闹，叶子倒是干干净净的。狭长的叶片一丛丛生长，从基部向四周散开。": "For all the commotion in the flowers, the leaves have such clean lines. Long narrow blades grow in clumps, spreading from the base in all directions.", "从上方看，叶子和圆圆的花序又是另一种组合。我尤其喜欢在花境里见到它，和周围的植物搭配起来，格外有精神。": "From above, the leaves and rounded flower spikes made another arrangement altogether. I especially like seeing the plant in a mixed border, where it looks so lively among its neighbours."}, "20250604-01": {"植株与观察现场": "Plant at the observation site", "山脚的白兰树": "Magnolia × alba at the foot of the mountain", "白兰花与叶手绘": "Drawing of Magnolia × alba flowers and leaves", "半开的白兰花": "Partly open white magnolia", "长椭圆形叶片": "Long, elliptical leaves", "花朵与叶片": "Flower and leaves", "花苞与开放的花对照": "Bud beside an open flower", "半开的花": "Partly open blossom", "盛开的白兰": "Magnolia × alba in full bloom", "花被脱落后留下的花蕊": "Reproductive parts left after the tepals fall", "枝上的新叶": "New leaves on a branch", "枝上的花苞": "Bud on a branch", "展开的白色花被片": "White tepals spread open", "灰白色树干": "Greyish white trunk", "树冠枝叶": "Leaves and branches in the canopy", "白兰 · 本期封面": "Magnolia × alba · video cover", "花后的花轴": "Floral axis after flowering", "远远闻到香味，才找到树上的白兰。花苞、半开、盛开，香气里还藏着不同的形态。": "I caught the scent from a distance before I found the white flowers on the tree. Buds, half-open flowers and full blossoms offer different shapes within that familiar fragrance.", "文稿提及，未独立核对。": "Mentioned in the manuscript, without independent verification.", "文稿提及砧木。": "The manuscript mentions this plant as a rootstock.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。 科学名称中的 × 表示杂交来源，与白玉兰分别建档。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source. The multiplication sign (×) indicates hybrid origin. Magnolia denudata has a separate record.", "闻着香味找过来": "Following the scent", "远远的地方就闻到香味了，所以特意过来看看。难得找到一棵枝条比较低的白兰，终于可以好好拍它的花。\n在广东，常能看见它长成树；在别处，也有人把它精心养在阳台上。对我来说，最容易记住它的，还是这股香气。": "I could smell it from a long way off and came over for a closer look. At last I’d found a white champaca with branches low enough to photograph its flowers properly.\nIn Guangdong I often see it grown as a tree. Elsewhere, people tend it carefully on balconies. The easiest way for me to remember it is still that fragrance.", "远远的地方就闻到香味了，所以特意过来看看。难得找到一棵枝条比较低的白兰，终于可以好好拍它的花。": "I could smell it from a long way off and came over for a closer look. At last I’d found a white champaca with branches low enough to photograph its flowers properly.", "在广东，常能看见它长成树；在别处，也有人把它精心养在阳台上。对我来说，最容易记住它的，还是这股香气。": "In Guangdong I often see it grown as a tree. Elsewhere, people tend it carefully on balconies. The easiest way for me to remember it is still that fragrance.", "从花苞到一朵小莲花": "From a bud to a little lotus", "白色的花被片细长，开放时慢慢向外散开，像一朵小莲花。把花苞、半开的花和盛开的花放在一起，变化就很直观。\n我特别喜欢它香气的层次。花形和香味都留在记忆里，却很难只用一句话说清楚。": "The white tepals are long and narrow. As the flower opens they slowly spread outwards like a little lotus. Put a bud, a half-open flower and a fully open one together and the change is clear.\nI particularly like the different layers of its scent. Both shape and fragrance stay with me, though neither is easy to capture in a single sentence.", "白色的花被片细长，开放时慢慢向外散开，像一朵小莲花。把花苞、半开的花和盛开的花放在一起，变化就很直观。": "The white tepals are long and narrow. As the flower opens they slowly spread outwards like a little lotus. Put a bud, a half-open flower and a fully open one together and the change is clear.", "我特别喜欢它香气的层次。花形和香味都留在记忆里，却很难只用一句话说清楚。": "I particularly like the different layers of its scent. Both shape and fragrance stay with me, though neither is easy to capture in a single sentence.", "花落以后，还留下什么": "What remains after the tepals fall?", "花被片逐渐掉落，里面的花蕊和花轴露出来。这次也把这个不那么显眼的阶段拍下来了。\n白兰的科学名称里有一个“×”，说明它是杂交来源的对象。它和另一个档案里的白玉兰不同，不能只凭近似的俗名混在一起。": "The tepals gradually drop away, exposing the reproductive parts and floral axis. I photographed this quieter stage too.\nThe multiplication sign in Magnolia × alba indicates its hybrid origin. This is a different tree from the white yulan, Magnolia denudata, in another record. The similar Chinese names can be confusing.", "花被片逐渐掉落，里面的花蕊和花轴露出来。这次也把这个不那么显眼的阶段拍下来了。": "The tepals gradually drop away, exposing the reproductive parts and floral axis. I photographed this quieter stage too.", "白兰的科学名称里有一个“×”，说明它是杂交来源的对象。它和另一个档案里的白玉兰不同，不能只凭近似的俗名混在一起。": "The multiplication sign in Magnolia × alba indicates its hybrid origin. This is a different tree from the white yulan, Magnolia denudata, in another record. The similar Chinese names can be confusing.", "抬头再看树叶": "Looking up at the leaves", "叶子长椭圆形，顶端渐尖，叶脉清楚。花藏在叶间，树干则是很朴素的灰白色。\n从一朵香香的花，一直看到整棵树，白兰的样子才算完整了一些。": "The leaves are long and elliptic, with tapering tips and clear veins. Flowers nestle among them. The trunk is an unassuming greyish white.\nI started with one fragrant flower and ended up looking at the whole tree. Now I have a fuller picture of it.", "叶子长椭圆形，顶端渐尖，叶脉清楚。花藏在叶间，树干则是很朴素的灰白色。": "The leaves are long and elliptic, with tapering tips and clear veins. Flowers nestle among them. The trunk is an unassuming greyish white.", "从一朵香香的花，一直看到整棵树，白兰的样子才算完整了一些。": "I started with one fragrant flower and ended up looking at the whole tree. Now I have a fuller picture of it."}, "20250610-01": {"膨大的假鳞茎与叶片": "Swollen pseudobulbs and leaves", "章鱼兰整株与花部手绘": "Drawing of Prosthechea cochleata: whole plant and floral parts", "盆栽与周围植物": "Potted specimen and neighbouring plants", "花序侧面": "Inflorescence viewed from the side", "叶片与花梗": "Leaf and flower stalk", "章鱼兰 · 本期封面": "Prosthechea cochleata · video cover", "合蕊柱与黄色花粉块": "Column and yellow pollinia", "像小章鱼的花朵": "Flower resembling a tiny octopus", "两朵章鱼兰": "Two Prosthechea cochleata flowers", "叶丛旁的花朵": "Flowers beside the foliage", "上方的深色唇瓣": "Dark lip above the flower", "花蕾与开放的花": "Buds and open flowers", "花序上的花朵": "Flowers on the inflorescence", "花盆里像游来一群小章鱼，抬头的唇瓣里还藏着漂亮的放射条纹。": "A school of little octopuses seems to have swum into the flowerpot. The upturned lip hides a pattern of radiating stripes.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "花盆里的小章鱼": "Little octopuses in a flowerpot", "小朋友在花盆里养了一群“章鱼”，游啊游，实在太可爱了，必须介绍一下。\n这盆章鱼兰从春天开始开花，拍摄时已经陪我们很久。花序上有花蕾，也有已经张开的花，一直有得看。": "A child had a pot full of little “octopuses”, all looking as if they were swimming about. They were too endearing to keep to myself.\nThis orchid had been flowering since spring and had already kept us company for quite a while by the time I filmed it. Buds and open flowers shared the spike, so there was always something to see.", "小朋友在花盆里养了一群“章鱼”，游啊游，实在太可爱了，必须介绍一下。": "A child had a pot full of little “octopuses”, all looking as if they were swimming about. They were too endearing to keep to myself.", "这盆章鱼兰从春天开始开花，拍摄时已经陪我们很久。花序上有花蕾，也有已经张开的花，一直有得看。": "This orchid had been flowering since spring and had already kept us company for quite a while by the time I filmed it. Buds and open flowers shared the spike, so there was always something to see.", "头在上面，爪子垂下来": "Head above, arms hanging down", "单看一朵花，上方深色的唇瓣像章鱼的头，下面细长的花瓣和萼片微微弯曲，自然下垂，像伸开的爪子。\n它也叫扇贝兰。只看上面那片唇瓣，又确实有点像一只小扇贝。": "In a single flower, the dark lip at the top looks like an octopus’s head. The slender petals and sepals below it curve slightly and hang down like outstretched arms.\nAnother name for it is the clamshell orchid. Look just at the lip and it really does resemble a small shell.", "单看一朵花，上方深色的唇瓣像章鱼的头，下面细长的花瓣和萼片微微弯曲，自然下垂，像伸开的爪子。": "In a single flower, the dark lip at the top looks like an octopus’s head. The slender petals and sepals below it curve slightly and hang down like outstretched arms.", "它也叫扇贝兰。只看上面那片唇瓣，又确实有点像一只小扇贝。": "Another name for it is the clamshell orchid. Look just at the lip and it really does resemble a small shell.", "顺着条纹往里看": "Following the stripes inwards", "唇瓣内侧有一条条放射状纹路，褐色和浅色交替，非常有秩序。\n把镜头再凑近一些，可以看到花中央的合蕊柱和黄色花粉块。原来“小章鱼”的脸上，还藏着这么细的结构。": "On the inside of the lip, brown stripes and paler bands alternate in an orderly pattern, radiating outwards.\nA closer look revealed the column at the centre of the flower and the yellow pollinia. There was a surprising amount of detail in that little octopus’s “face”.", "唇瓣内侧有一条条放射状纹路，褐色和浅色交替，非常有秩序。": "On the inside of the lip, brown stripes and paler bands alternate in an orderly pattern, radiating outwards.", "把镜头再凑近一些，可以看到花中央的合蕊柱和黄色花粉块。原来“小章鱼”的脸上，还藏着这么细的结构。": "A closer look revealed the column at the centre of the flower and the yellow pollinia. There was a surprising amount of detail in that little octopus’s “face”.", "花下面的储藏室": "A storehouse beneath the flowers", "看完花，再找找叶子下面膨大的部分——假鳞茎。叶片从这里长出来，花梗也从叶间向上伸展。\n整盆看起来并不张扬，开出的花却这么特别。我很喜欢这样越看越有意思的植物。": "After looking at the flowers, I searched below the leaves for the swollen part: the pseudobulb. The leaves grow from it, and the flower stalk rises between them.\nThe plant looks quite modest in its pot, yet the flowers are so distinctive. I like plants that get more interesting the longer I look.", "看完花，再找找叶子下面膨大的部分——假鳞茎。叶片从这里长出来，花梗也从叶间向上伸展。": "After looking at the flowers, I searched below the leaves for the swollen part: the pseudobulb. The leaves grow from it, and the flower stalk rises between them.", "整盆看起来并不张扬，开出的花却这么特别。我很喜欢这样越看越有意思的植物。": "The plant looks quite modest in its pot, yet the flowers are so distinctive. I like plants that get more interesting the longer I look."}, "20250606-01": {"粉紫色小花近景": "Small pink-violet flowers in close-up", "紫娇花 · 本期封面": "Tulbaghia violacea · video cover", "丛生的狭长叶片": "Narrow leaves growing in a clump", "细长花葶顶端的小花": "Small flowers at the tip of a slender scape", "单个花序": "A single inflorescence", "花丛旁的观察现场": "The observation site beside the flowers", "花境里的紫娇花": "Tulbaghia in a flower border", "一片粉紫色花海": "An expanse of pink-purple blossoms", "细长叶丛里升起粉紫色的小花，风一吹，就轻轻晃起来。": "Pink-violet flowers rise above narrow leaves and sway gently in the breeze.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "又误入一片花海": "Walking into another sea of flowers", "我又误入了一片花海。眼前这些看起来很像韭菜的植物，叫紫娇花，也常被叫作南非韭菜。\n名字听起来娇气，种在花境里却很有精神。广东夏天能见到这样一片粉紫色，我还是很喜欢的。": "I found myself in another sea of flowers. These plants looked much like chives. They’re called zǐjiāohuā in Chinese, or sometimes “South African chives”.\nThe name sounds delicate, but the plants looked quite vigorous in the border. I’m always happy to come across a sweep of pinkish purple like this in a Guangdong summer.", "我又误入了一片花海。眼前这些看起来很像韭菜的植物，叫紫娇花，也常被叫作南非韭菜。": "I found myself in another sea of flowers. These plants looked much like chives. They’re called zǐjiāohuā in Chinese, or sometimes “South African chives”.", "名字听起来娇气，种在花境里却很有精神。广东夏天能见到这样一片粉紫色，我还是很喜欢的。": "The name sounds delicate, but the plants looked quite vigorous in the border. I’m always happy to come across a sweep of pinkish purple like this in a Guangdong summer.", "叶子一丛丛，花举得高高的": "Tufts of leaves and flowers held high", "狭长的绿叶从基部一丛丛抽出来，难怪会让人想到韭菜。\n细长的花葶伸到叶丛上方，把一簇小花举起来。花和叶分开看很简单，放在一起却清清爽爽。": "Long, narrow green leaves emerge in clumps from the base. It’s easy to see why they bring chives to mind.\nSlender flower stalks extend well above the leaves and hold up clusters of little flowers. Each element is simple on its own. Together they look wonderfully fresh.", "狭长的绿叶从基部一丛丛抽出来，难怪会让人想到韭菜。": "Long, narrow green leaves emerge in clumps from the base. It’s easy to see why they bring chives to mind.", "细长的花葶伸到叶丛上方，把一簇小花举起来。花和叶分开看很简单，放在一起却清清爽爽。": "Slender flower stalks extend well above the leaves and hold up clusters of little flowers. Each element is simple on its own. Together they look wonderfully fresh.", "风里的小百合": "Little lilies in the wind", "单独看一朵花，有点像缩小的粉紫色百合。几朵挨在一起，朝不同方向打开。\n风一来，它们就在细细的花葶上轻轻晃动。花海的好看，有一半就在这样的摇曳里。": "A single flower looks like a tiny pink-purple lily. Several sit together, opening in different directions.\nWhen the wind comes, they sway gently on those fine stalks. Half the beauty of a mass of flowers like this is in the movement.", "单独看一朵花，有点像缩小的粉紫色百合。几朵挨在一起，朝不同方向打开。": "A single flower looks like a tiny pink-purple lily. Several sit together, opening in different directions.", "风一来，它们就在细细的花葶上轻轻晃动。花海的好看，有一半就在这样的摇曳里。": "When the wind comes, they sway gently on those fine stalks. Half the beauty of a mass of flowers like this is in the movement."}, "20250417-01": {"叶缘的齿": "Teeth along the leaf margin", "俯看花序": "Inflorescence viewed from above", "高高伸出的花葶": "Tall, projecting flowering stalk", "尚未开放的花蕾": "Unopened bud", "花序顶端": "Tip of the inflorescence", "花境里的芦荟": "Aloe in a flower border", "淡黄色筒状花": "Pale yellow tubular flowers", "草丛上方的黄色花序": "A yellow inflorescence above the grass", "叶丛与周围植被": "Leaves and surrounding vegetation", "基部莲座状的肉质叶": "Fleshy leaves in a basal rosette", "芦荟 · 本期封面": "Aloe vera · video cover", "向上伸展的叶片": "Leaves extending upwards", "垂挂的筒状花": "Hanging tubular flowers", "芦荟的花序与草丛": "Aloe inflorescence and surrounding grass", "熟悉的肉质叶子上方，竟然举起了一串串像小香蕉的黄花。": "Above those familiar fleshy leaves, the aloe has lifted clusters of yellow flowers shaped like little bananas.", "视频标题提及；与本期主对象关系待确认。": "Mentioned in the video title. Its relationship to the main subject has not been established.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "草丛里探出一串香蕉": "A bunch of bananas above the grass", "我身后这些从草丛里探出头的，是芦荟的花。高高的花葶顶着一串黄花，形状好像一串小香蕉。\n凑近看，花从下往上排得整整齐齐。原来熟悉的芦荟，开花时是这个样子。": "What’s sticking up through the grass behind me? Aloe flowers. Each tall stalk holds a cluster of yellow flowers shaped rather like little bananas.\nCloser in, the flowers stand in neat rows from the bottom of the stalk to the top. This is what that familiar aloe looks like in bloom.", "我身后这些从草丛里探出头的，是芦荟的花。高高的花葶顶着一串黄花，形状好像一串小香蕉。": "What’s sticking up through the grass behind me? Aloe flowers. Each tall stalk holds a cluster of yellow flowers shaped rather like little bananas.", "凑近看，花从下往上排得整整齐齐。原来熟悉的芦荟，开花时是这个样子。": "Closer in, the flowers stand in neat rows from the bottom of the stalk to the top. This is what that familiar aloe looks like in bloom.", "小鱼在吐泡泡": "Little fish blowing bubbles", "淡黄色的花垂下来，花口露出细细的结构。乍一看，好像好多小鱼在吐泡泡。\n从侧面看是长长一串，从上面看又是另一种排列。它的花让我想起火炬花，两种植物的花序放在一起看，也很有意思。": "The pale yellow flowers hang down, with fine structures peeking from their mouths. At first glance they look like little fish blowing bubbles.\nIn profile I saw one long cluster. From above the arrangement looked different again. The flowers reminded me of torch lilies, and I enjoyed comparing the two spikes.", "淡黄色的花垂下来，花口露出细细的结构。乍一看，好像好多小鱼在吐泡泡。": "The pale yellow flowers hang down, with fine structures peeking from their mouths. At first glance they look like little fish blowing bubbles.", "从侧面看是长长一串，从上面看又是另一种排列。它的花让我想起火炬花，两种植物的花序放在一起看，也很有意思。": "In profile I saw one long cluster. From above the arrangement looked different again. The flowers reminded me of torch lilies, and I enjoyed comparing the two spikes.", "还是这些肉乎乎的叶子最熟悉": "The familiar fleshy leaves", "芦荟的叶子粉绿色，边缘带齿，一簇一簇从基部散开。厚厚的叶片和高高的花葶，形成了很鲜明的对比。\n小时候，亲戚同学之间常常互赠芦荟苗。多年以后，阳台上很多植物都换过了，那一盆芦荟却还在。": "The bluish-green leaves have toothed margins and spread out from the base in clumps. The thick leaves make quite a contrast with the tall flowering stalks.\nWhen I was a child, relatives and school friends often gave one another young aloe plants. Over the years many of the plants on the balcony have come and gone, but that one pot of aloe is still there.", "芦荟的叶子粉绿色，边缘带齿，一簇一簇从基部散开。厚厚的叶片和高高的花葶，形成了很鲜明的对比。": "The bluish-green leaves have toothed margins and spread out from the base in clumps. The thick leaves make quite a contrast with the tall flowering stalks.", "小时候，亲戚同学之间常常互赠芦荟苗。多年以后，阳台上很多植物都换过了，那一盆芦荟却还在。": "When I was a child, relatives and school friends often gave one another young aloe plants. Over the years many of the plants on the balcony have come and gone, but that one pot of aloe is still there."}, "20250624-01": {"剥开的果实与种子": "Peeled fruit and its seed", "荔枝 · 本期封面": "Litchi chinensis · video cover", "树冠旁的果串": "Fruit clusters beside the canopy", "果园中的树": "Tree in an orchard", "不同颜色的荔枝": "Lychees of different colours", "树上的复叶": "Compound leaves on the tree", "细小的荔枝花": "Tiny lychee flowers", "果园里的采收现场": "Harvesting in the orchard", "一串串果实": "Bunches of fruit", "枝头的红色荔枝": "Red lychees at the tips of branches", "春天的荔枝花序": "Lychee inflorescence in spring", "挂果的树枝": "Fruit-bearing branches", "掌心里的荔枝": "Lychee in the palm of a hand", "油亮的小叶": "Glossy leaflets", "树下的观察现场": "Observation site beneath the tree", "荔枝压弯枝头的季节，顺着一颗果子，看看果皮、种子和春天的小花。": "In the season when lychees weigh down the branches, follow one fruit from its skin to its seed, then back to the small flowers of spring.", "文稿或视频标题提及的荔枝品种；不另计档案。": "A lychee cultivar mentioned in the manuscript or video title. It is not counted as a separate record.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "今年荔枝压弯了枝": "Fruit weighing down the branches", "今年荔枝大丰收，我来摘荔枝了。一串串果子挂在枝头，红的、还带绿色的，在叶间挤得热热闹闹。\n妃子笑、三月红、白糖罂、糯米糍、桂味、挂绿……光听这些品种名，就已经很有岭南夏天的感觉。": "It’s a bumper lychee year, and I’ve come picking. Clusters hang from the branches, some red, some still green, crowding together among the leaves.\nFeizixiao, Sanyuehong, Baitangying, Nuomici, Guiwei, Gualü… Just hearing the cultivar names brings back summers in Lingnan.", "今年荔枝大丰收，我来摘荔枝了。一串串果子挂在枝头，红的、还带绿色的，在叶间挤得热热闹闹。": "It’s a bumper lychee year, and I’ve come picking. Clusters hang from the branches, some red, some still green, crowding together among the leaves.", "妃子笑、三月红、白糖罂、糯米糍、桂味、挂绿……光听这些品种名，就已经很有岭南夏天的感觉。": "Feizixiao, Sanyuehong, Baitangying, Nuomici, Guiwei, Gualü… Just hearing the cultivar names brings back summers in Lingnan.", "给果子穿上的小盔甲": "A little suit of armour", "我很喜欢荔枝果皮的纹理，凹凸有致，带着裂纹。摸起来坑坑洼洼，像给柔软的里面穿了一副小盔甲。\n不同果子的大小和颜色也有差别。这期按荔枝建立一份档案，提及的栽培品种放在同片对象里，不另外增加档案数。": "I love the texture of lychee skin, with its ridges, hollows and cracks. It feels like a little suit of armour protecting the soft flesh inside.\nThe fruits vary in size and colour. There is one record here for lychee. The cultivars mentioned in the video are listed within it rather than counted as separate records.", "我很喜欢荔枝果皮的纹理，凹凸有致，带着裂纹。摸起来坑坑洼洼，像给柔软的里面穿了一副小盔甲。": "I love the texture of lychee skin, with its ridges, hollows and cracks. It feels like a little suit of armour protecting the soft flesh inside.", "不同果子的大小和颜色也有差别。这期按荔枝建立一份档案，提及的栽培品种放在同片对象里，不另外增加档案数。": "The fruits vary in size and colour. There is one record here for lychee. The cultivars mentioned in the video are listed within it rather than counted as separate records.", "剥开之后，再看一眼": "Another look after peeling", "剥开果皮，薄膜、白色的可食部分和里面的种子，各有各的位置。平时吃得太熟悉，反而容易忽略这些层次。\n荔枝离枝后不耐久放，也是这趟观察想到的话题。比起只记住诗句，亲眼看看树上的果子，会多一份具体的印象。": "Under the skin there is a thin membrane, the white edible part and the seed, each in its own place. I’m so used to eating lychees that it’s easy to overlook the layers.\nThe fruit doesn’t keep long once it’s picked, another thing that came to mind on this trip. It’s one thing to remember lines of poetry about lychees and another to see the fruit on the tree.", "剥开果皮，薄膜、白色的可食部分和里面的种子，各有各的位置。平时吃得太熟悉，反而容易忽略这些层次。": "Under the skin there is a thin membrane, the white edible part and the seed, each in its own place. I’m so used to eating lychees that it’s easy to overlook the layers.", "荔枝离枝后不耐久放，也是这趟观察想到的话题。比起只记住诗句，亲眼看看树上的果子，会多一份具体的印象。": "The fruit doesn’t keep long once it’s picked, another thing that came to mind on this trip. It’s one thing to remember lines of poetry about lychees and another to see the fruit on the tree.", "把时间拨回开花的时候": "Back to flowering time", "看到这么多果实，回头再看春天的花序，就不意外了。一枝枝分开的小花，密密地开在枝端。\n它的花远没有果子抢眼，配着油亮的小叶，安安静静。花与果放在一起，才把这一季的荔枝接起来。": "After seeing this much fruit, I looked back at the spring flower clusters and wasn’t surprised. Branching sprays of tiny flowers crowded the tips of the twigs.\nThey were much quieter than the fruit, set against glossy leaflets. The flowers and the fruit together tell the story of this lychee season.", "看到这么多果实，回头再看春天的花序，就不意外了。一枝枝分开的小花，密密地开在枝端。": "After seeing this much fruit, I looked back at the spring flower clusters and wasn’t surprised. Branching sprays of tiny flowers crowded the tips of the twigs.", "它的花远没有果子抢眼，配着油亮的小叶，安安静静。花与果放在一起，才把这一季的荔枝接起来。": "They were much quieter than the fruit, set against glossy leaflets. The flowers and the fruit together tell the story of this lychee season."}, "20250520-01": {"枝端花序": "Inflorescence at the end of a branch", "花序侧面": "Inflorescence viewed from the side", "层叠的小花": "Small flowers with layers of petals", "重瓣臭茉莉 · 本期封面": "Double-flowered Clerodendrum chinense · video cover", "宽大的近心形叶片": "Broad, almost heart-shaped blade", "花序中部的红紫色结构": "Red-purple structure in the middle of the cluster", "逆光下的大叶": "Large backlit leaf", "重瓣花朵与叶片": "Double flowers and leaves", "尚未展开的花序": "Unopened flower cluster", "成丛的茎与叶": "Clump of stems and leaves", "叶面纹理": "Texture of the leaf surface", "叶背的叶脉与柔毛": "Veins and fine hairs on the leaf underside", "远看像臭牡丹，近看是重重叠叠的小花。花香与叶子的气味，在同一株上相遇。": "From a distance it resembles a related glorybower. Come closer and you’ll see little flowers with layer upon layer of petals, and smell how differently the flowers and leaves of one plant can be scented.", "文稿对照，不认作同一主对象。": "Used for comparison in the manuscript; it is distinct from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "走近以后，认错了": "A different plant up close", "刚从远处看过来，还以为是臭牡丹。走近一看，花是一团团、重重叠叠的，原来是重瓣臭茉莉。\n名字很有意思，又“臭”又“茉莉”。闻花和闻叶，感受还真不一样。": "From a distance I thought it was chòumǔdān. Closer in, I saw the clusters of pale double flowers, their petals in layer upon layer. This was the double-flowered chòumòlì.\nThe Chinese name puts “smelly” and “jasmine” together. Smelling the flowers and smelling the foliage really were two different experiences.", "刚从远处看过来，还以为是臭牡丹。走近一看，花是一团团、重重叠叠的，原来是重瓣臭茉莉。": "From a distance I thought it was chòumǔdān. Closer in, I saw the clusters of pale double flowers, their petals in layer upon layer. This was the double-flowered chòumòlì.", "名字很有意思，又“臭”又“茉莉”。闻花和闻叶，感受还真不一样。": "The Chinese name puts “smelly” and “jasmine” together. Smelling the flowers and smelling the foliage really were two different experiences.", "先摸摸这片大叶子": "First, feel that enormous leaf", "叶子很大，接近心形，长长的叶柄把它举起来。叶面上有清楚的纹理，翻到背面，还能看到柔毛。\n摸起来毛茸茸的，和叶子的气味相比，手感倒是挺温柔。": "The large, almost heart-shaped leaf stands on a long stalk. Its upper surface is strongly patterned, and turning it over reveals soft hairs underneath.\nThe hairiness feels surprisingly gentle, especially compared with the smell of the leaves.", "叶子很大，接近心形，长长的叶柄把它举起来。叶面上有清楚的纹理，翻到背面，还能看到柔毛。": "The large, almost heart-shaped leaf stands on a long stalk. Its upper surface is strongly patterned, and turning it over reveals soft hairs underneath.", "摸起来毛茸茸的，和叶子的气味相比，手感倒是挺温柔。": "The hairiness feels surprisingly gentle, especially compared with the smell of the leaves.", "重重叠叠的一团花": "Clusters upon clusters of petals", "枝端的小花挤成一团，淡色花瓣层层叠叠，红紫色的结构夹在其间。凑近闻，有很浓的花香。\n它和印象里细长花蕊伸出老远的臭牡丹，确实是两种不同的感觉。认植物的时候，多走近几步，常常就会改掉第一眼的判断。": "At the ends of the branches the small flowers crowd together, pale petals overlapping with reddish-purple parts between them. Up close the floral fragrance is strong.\nIt’s a different impression from the chòumǔdān I had in mind, with its long flower parts projecting far out. A few steps closer are often enough to change a first guess at a plant’s identity.", "枝端的小花挤成一团，淡色花瓣层层叠叠，红紫色的结构夹在其间。凑近闻，有很浓的花香。": "At the ends of the branches the small flowers crowd together, pale petals overlapping with reddish-purple parts between them. Up close the floral fragrance is strong.", "它和印象里细长花蕊伸出老远的臭牡丹，确实是两种不同的感觉。认植物的时候，多走近几步，常常就会改掉第一眼的判断。": "It’s a different impression from the chòumǔdān I had in mind, with its long flower parts projecting far out. A few steps closer are often enough to change a first guess at a plant’s identity."}, "20250617-01": {"兜口与花中央结构": "Opening of the pouch and structures at the centre of the flower", "叶面上的深浅斑纹": "Light and dark markings on the leaf", "魔帝兜兰 · 本期封面": "“Red Emperor” slipper orchid · video cover", "花瓣上的深色斑点": "Dark spots on the petals", "兜兰形态手绘": "Drawing of slipper orchid form", "本期主对象的花朵": "Flower of the main subject of this video", "中萼片上的条纹": "Stripes on the dorsal sepal", "花朵侧面": "Flower from the side", "花朵背面": "Back of the flower", "同片对照：深红色花朵": "Comparison in the same video: a deep red flower", "同片对照：绿色花朵": "Comparison in the same video: a green flower", "囊状唇瓣与花瓣斑点": "Pouch-shaped lip and spotted petals", "借家里的“红魔帝”，近看兜兰的囊状唇瓣、花瓣斑点和叶面花纹。": "The “Red Emperor” slipper orchid at home gives us a close look at the pouch-shaped lip, spots on the petals and patterns across the leaves.", "文稿列举。": "Listed in the manuscript.", "原文园艺称呼，尚未核对注册写法。": "A horticultural name from the manuscript. Its registered spelling has not been verified.", "原文商品类型，未确定独立学名。": "The manuscript gives a trade designation. A separate scientific name has not been determined.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "园艺名称与科属对照，不代表照片鉴定或具体克隆认证": "Used to compare horticultural, family and genus names. It does not verify a photograph or a particular clone.", "园艺主对象名称按植物智PPBC记录；科属按POWO。红魔帝为文稿称呼，不声称已核实具体克隆或杂交亲本。": "The horticultural name follows an iPlant PPBC record; family and genus follow POWO. 红魔帝 is the name in the manuscript. Its clone and hybrid parents have not been independently verified.", "魔帝兜兰 · 园艺名称与科属对照": "Paphiopedilum 'Maudiae': the horticultural name, family and genus", "借小朋友的花，认识一只兜": "Borrowing a child’s orchid for a closer look", "这株兜兰在家里已经开了两个多月，趁着它还在，借来好好看看。园艺里把这类红色对象叫“红魔帝”。\n本档案的园艺名称按植物智记录为魔帝兜兰 Paphiopedilum 'Maudiae'，不把它写成一个独立的野生种。": "This slipper orchid had been in flower at home for more than two months. I borrowed it for a closer look while the bloom was still there. Red-flowered plants of this horticultural type are called hóng módì in Chinese.\nThe horticultural name here follows the iPlant record, Paphiopedilum 'Maudiae'. It is not treated as a separate wild species.", "这株兜兰在家里已经开了两个多月，趁着它还在，借来好好看看。园艺里把这类红色对象叫“红魔帝”。": "This slipper orchid had been in flower at home for more than two months. I borrowed it for a closer look while the bloom was still there. Red-flowered plants of this horticultural type are called hóng módì in Chinese.", "本档案的园艺名称按植物智记录为魔帝兜兰 Paphiopedilum 'Maudiae'，不把它写成一个独立的野生种。": "The horticultural name here follows the iPlant record, Paphiopedilum 'Maudiae'. It is not treated as a separate wild species.", "拖鞋的轮廓，花的结构": "Making sense of the slipper", "最显眼的就是宽大的囊状唇瓣，像一只拖鞋。顶上直立的大“帽子”是中萼片，两侧展开的是花瓣。\n换到背面再看，前后的位置关系就清楚了。同一朵花，只转一个角度，感觉就很不一样。": "The broad, pouch-like lip is the most conspicuous part: it looks like a slipper. The big upright “hat” above it is the dorsal sepal, and the parts spread to either side are the petals.\nLooking from behind made their positions clearer. Just turning the same flower around gave me a surprisingly different impression.", "最显眼的就是宽大的囊状唇瓣，像一只拖鞋。顶上直立的大“帽子”是中萼片，两侧展开的是花瓣。": "The broad, pouch-like lip is the most conspicuous part: it looks like a slipper. The big upright “hat” above it is the dorsal sepal, and the parts spread to either side are the petals.", "换到背面再看，前后的位置关系就清楚了。同一朵花，只转一个角度，感觉就很不一样。": "Looking from behind made their positions clearer. Just turning the same flower around gave me a surprisingly different impression.", "这些斑点可不是画上去的": "Spots that nobody painted", "花瓣上散着深色斑点，还能看到细毛。唇瓣则是另一种颜色和质感，伸到下方，鼓鼓的。\n兜兰的花形让我不断想到昆虫来访时会怎样走动。具体到这盆花，没有拍到传粉过程，就先把看见的结构记下来。": "The petals are scattered with dark spots and fine hairs. The lip has a different colour and texture, hanging below them in a rounded pouch.\nThe shape kept me wondering how a visiting insect might move around the flower. I didn’t film pollination in this pot, so I’ve recorded the structures I could actually see.", "花瓣上散着深色斑点，还能看到细毛。唇瓣则是另一种颜色和质感，伸到下方，鼓鼓的。": "The petals are scattered with dark spots and fine hairs. The lip has a different colour and texture, hanging below them in a rounded pouch.", "兜兰的花形让我不断想到昆虫来访时会怎样走动。具体到这盆花，没有拍到传粉过程，就先把看见的结构记下来。": "The shape kept me wondering how a visiting insect might move around the flower. I didn’t film pollination in this pot, so I’ve recorded the structures I could actually see.", "花之外，也有花纹": "Patterns beyond the flowers", "叶片贴近基部生长，深浅不同的绿色在叶面上拼出花纹。没有花的时候，它也不是一盆单调的绿叶。\n本期还对照了其它颜色的兜兰。照片保留在图集中，名称按视频提及记录，不凭花色推定具体克隆。": "The leaves grow near the base, with patches of lighter and darker green across the blades. Even without a flower this wouldn’t be a pot of plain green leaves.\nThe video also compares slipper orchids of other colours. Their pictures are in the gallery, with the names used in the video. Colour alone doesn’t identify a particular clone.", "叶片贴近基部生长，深浅不同的绿色在叶面上拼出花纹。没有花的时候，它也不是一盆单调的绿叶。": "The leaves grow near the base, with patches of lighter and darker green across the blades. Even without a flower this wouldn’t be a pot of plain green leaves.", "本期还对照了其它颜色的兜兰。照片保留在图集中，名称按视频提及记录，不凭花色推定具体克隆。": "The video also compares slipper orchids of other colours. Their pictures are in the gallery, with the names used in the video. Colour alone doesn’t identify a particular clone."}, "20250513-01": {"鲫鱼胆 · 本期封面": "Maesa perlarius · video cover", "满枝的白花与绿叶": "White flowers and green leaves all along a branch", "挂果的枝条": "Fruit-bearing branch", "小花侧面": "Small flower from the side", "叶与花序": "Leaf and inflorescence", "小花正面": "Small flower from the front", "枝上的浅色果实": "Pale fruits on a branch", "叶腋附近的小花": "Small flowers near a leaf axil", "花序与叶片": "Inflorescence and leaves", "叶缘的锯齿": "Serrated leaf margin", "枝条上的小花": "Small flowers on a branch", "花序上的访花昆虫": "A flower-visiting insect on the inflorescence", "花叶相间的枝条": "A branch alternating flowers and leaves", "梧桐山脚的观察现场": "Observation site at the foot of Mount Wutong", "枝头新叶": "New leaves at a shoot tip", "名字叫鲫鱼胆，花却像一串细小的白风铃。低下头看，才发现它的精致。": "Its Chinese name means something like “crucian carp gall,” but its flowers look like strings of tiny white bells. Bend down and their delicacy becomes clear.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "名字先把我吸引住了": "It was the name that caught me", "这么清新可爱的小花，竟然叫鲫鱼胆？名字成功吸引了我的注意，但看了半天，我还没找到它和鲫鱼有什么联系。\n春天一到，小花密密麻麻爬满枝头。远看很低调，认真注视以后，却被它惊艳到了。": "These dainty little flowers have a name that means “crucian carp gallbladder”? That certainly got my attention, though after a long look I still couldn’t see what the plant had to do with a fish.\nIn spring the tiny flowers cover the twigs. They’re easy to miss from a distance, but the more closely I looked, the more striking they became.", "这么清新可爱的小花，竟然叫鲫鱼胆？名字成功吸引了我的注意，但看了半天，我还没找到它和鲫鱼有什么联系。": "These dainty little flowers have a name that means “crucian carp gallbladder”? That certainly got my attention, though after a long look I still couldn’t see what the plant had to do with a fish.", "春天一到，小花密密麻麻爬满枝头。远看很低调，认真注视以后，却被它惊艳到了。": "In spring the tiny flowers cover the twigs. They’re easy to miss from a distance, but the more closely I looked, the more striking they became.", "一朵完整的小风铃": "A complete little bell", "镜头拉近，白色花冠围着中间的小结构，花口像一只小风铃。这样小小一朵，就是一朵完整的花。\n平时走过去很容易忽略它。只有停下来对准焦，才看见花里还有这么多细节。": "Through the camera I could see the white corolla surrounding the parts at the centre. Its opening looked like the mouth of a tiny bell. Each one, small as it was, was a complete flower.\nI might easily have passed it by. It took stopping and getting the focus right to see how much was inside.", "镜头拉近，白色花冠围着中间的小结构，花口像一只小风铃。这样小小一朵，就是一朵完整的花。": "Through the camera I could see the white corolla surrounding the parts at the centre. Its opening looked like the mouth of a tiny bell. Each one, small as it was, was a complete flower.", "平时走过去很容易忽略它。只有停下来对准焦，才看见花里还有这么多细节。": "I might easily have passed it by. It took stopping and getting the focus right to see how much was inside.", "花后又挂满小球": "Little round fruits after the flowers", "回头看另一些枝条，已经挂着一颗颗小果子。花和果交替出现，让整根枝条都不显得空。\n拍摄时也有昆虫停在花间。这么小的花，对它们来说，却是值得专程来的地方。": "Other branches already bore small round fruits. Between the flowers and the fruits, there was scarcely an empty stretch of twig.\nDuring filming, insects settled among the flowers. Tiny as they seemed to me, they were evidently worth a visit to those insects.", "回头看另一些枝条，已经挂着一颗颗小果子。花和果交替出现，让整根枝条都不显得空。": "Other branches already bore small round fruits. Between the flowers and the fruits, there was scarcely an empty stretch of twig.", "拍摄时也有昆虫停在花间。这么小的花，对它们来说，却是值得专程来的地方。": "During filming, insects settled among the flowers. Tiny as they seemed to me, they were evidently worth a visit to those insects.", "最先记住的，其实是叶子": "The leaves stayed in my memory first", "叶子边缘的锯齿很疏朗，叶面清清爽爽。薄薄一片，和密密的花序搭在一起，在灌木丛里也挺出挑。\n这株是在梧桐山脚拍到的。以后再路过这里，除了花，我也能靠这片叶子多留意它。": "The leaf edges have widely spaced teeth, and the surface looks clean and fresh. The thin blades beside those dense flower clusters really stood out among the shrubs.\nI photographed this plant at the foot of Wutong Mountain. Next time I pass, I’ll have the leaves as well as the flowers to help me spot it.", "叶子边缘的锯齿很疏朗，叶面清清爽爽。薄薄一片，和密密的花序搭在一起，在灌木丛里也挺出挑。": "The leaf edges have widely spaced teeth, and the surface looks clean and fresh. The thin blades beside those dense flower clusters really stood out among the shrubs.", "这株是在梧桐山脚拍到的。以后再路过这里，除了花，我也能靠这片叶子多留意它。": "I photographed this plant at the foot of Wutong Mountain. Next time I pass, I’ll have the leaves as well as the flowers to help me spot it."}, "20250627-01": {"卷成钩的花梗": "Flower stalk bent into a hook", "聚在一起的绿色果实": "Green fruits clustered together", "黄色花朵与绿叶": "Yellow flower and green leaves", "下垂的黄色花": "Drooping yellow flower", "攀到高处的枝叶": "Branches and leaves climbing high", "花的侧面": "Flower seen from the side", "浓密的叶丛": "Dense foliage", "花上方的弯钩": "Hook above the flower", "花朵与宽大的叶片": "Flower beside broad leaves", "花被向内弯曲": "Perianth bent inwards", "聚合果近景": "Aggregate fruit in close-up", "花、果和钩状花梗手绘": "Drawing of flowers, fruits and hooked flower stalks", "一簇绿色果实": "A cluster of green fruits", "鹰爪花 · 本期封面": "Artabotrys hexapetalus · video cover", "分开的花部结构": "Floral parts separated for examination", "攀援生长的植株": "A climbing plant", "钩住枝条的花梗": "Flower stalk hooked around a branch", "果实与手掌对照": "Fruit beside a hand for scale", "枝条间的果实": "Fruit between branches", "枝上的花与叶": "Flower and leaves on a branch", "像鹰爪的花，和真正抓住枝条的钩子。顺着攀爬的方向，找出名字里的秘密。": "A flower that resembles an eagle’s claw, and a hook that really does catch hold of a branch. Follow the climbing shoots for the secret of the Chinese name.", "文稿有花、叶和果实对照；具体学名未核对。": "The manuscript compares flowers, leaves and fruits; the scientific name has not been checked.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "花旁边还挂着一串葡萄？": "A bunch of grapes beside the flowers?", "花很好看，旁边竟然还挂着一串串像葡萄的绿色果实。它叫鹰爪花，名字听起来挺霸气。\n花从偏绿色慢慢变黄，黄色花朵的香气很好闻，会让我想到柑橘和热带水果。": "The flowers were lovely, and right beside them hung clusters of green, grape-like fruits. The Chinese name yīngzhǎohuā, “eagle-claw flower”, has quite a ring to it.\nThe flowers change slowly from greenish to yellow. The scent of a yellow flower reminded me of citrus and tropical fruit.", "花很好看，旁边竟然还挂着一串串像葡萄的绿色果实。它叫鹰爪花，名字听起来挺霸气。": "The flowers were lovely, and right beside them hung clusters of green, grape-like fruits. The Chinese name yīngzhǎohuā, “eagle-claw flower”, has quite a ring to it.", "花从偏绿色慢慢变黄，黄色花朵的香气很好闻，会让我想到柑橘和热带水果。": "The flowers change slowly from greenish to yellow. The scent of a yellow flower reminded me of citrus and tropical fruit.", "真正的鹰爪在这里": "Here is the eagle’s claw", "原先以为名字来自弯曲的花瓣，可沿着枝条往上看，发现更像“鹰爪”的东西：花梗弯成了钩。\n这些钩子紧紧抓住别的枝条，帮它向上攀爬。没有气生根，也不用靠刺，原来秘密藏在这里。": "I first thought the name came from the curled petals. Then I followed a branch upwards and found something much more like a claw: a flower stalk curved into a hook.\nThese hooks grip other branches and help the plant climb. No aerial roots or prickles needed. That was where its trick lay.", "原先以为名字来自弯曲的花瓣，可沿着枝条往上看，发现更像“鹰爪”的东西：花梗弯成了钩。": "I first thought the name came from the curled petals. Then I followed a branch upwards and found something much more like a claw: a flower stalk curved into a hook.", "这些钩子紧紧抓住别的枝条，帮它向上攀爬。没有气生根，也不用靠刺，原来秘密藏在这里。": "These hooks grip other branches and help the plant climb. No aerial roots or prickles needed. That was where its trick lay.", "花心藏在里面": "Hidden in the centre", "六片厚厚的花瓣分成内外两轮，向里弯曲，把中间的小结构包起来。不仔细找，花蕊还真不容易看见。\n把花部展开以后，原来藏起来的位置就清楚了。这样的花，总让人想多换几个角度观察。": "Six thick petals in two whorls curve inwards around the small parts at the centre. I had to look carefully to see the reproductive structures.\nOpening the flower out made their positions clear. A flower like this is an invitation to keep changing the angle of view.", "六片厚厚的花瓣分成内外两轮，向里弯曲，把中间的小结构包起来。不仔细找，花蕊还真不容易看见。": "Six thick petals in two whorls curve inwards around the small parts at the centre. I had to look carefully to see the reproductive structures.", "把花部展开以后，原来藏起来的位置就清楚了。这样的花，总让人想多换几个角度观察。": "Opening the flower out made their positions clear. A flower like this is an invitation to keep changing the angle of view.", "花与果同时出现在枝上": "Flower and fruit on the same branch", "六月这一次，花和果可以一起看到。绿色小果聚在一起，从下往上拍，轮廓很漂亮。\n视频里还提到了假鹰爪，用念珠状的果实作比较。这里的聚合果照片仍按鹰爪花展示，不把两个对象混在一起。": "On this June visit I could see flowers and fruits at the same time. The little green fruits gathered together made a beautiful outline photographed from below.\nThe video also mentions a plant called jiǎ yīngzhǎo, whose fruits look like strings of beads. It appears as a comparison. The aggregate fruits pictured here belong to Artabotrys hexapetalus.", "六月这一次，花和果可以一起看到。绿色小果聚在一起，从下往上拍，轮廓很漂亮。": "On this June visit I could see flowers and fruits at the same time. The little green fruits gathered together made a beautiful outline photographed from below.", "视频里还提到了假鹰爪，用念珠状的果实作比较。这里的聚合果照片仍按鹰爪花展示，不把两个对象混在一起。": "The video also mentions a plant called jiǎ yīngzhǎo, whose fruits look like strings of beads. It appears as a comparison. The aggregate fruits pictured here belong to Artabotrys hexapetalus."}, "20250620-01": {"路旁的黄荆": "Roadside Vitex negundo", "密集的小花": "Dense clusters of small flowers", "掌状复叶与手掌对照": "Palmately compound leaf beside a hand", "掌心里的干果": "Dry fruit in the palm of a hand", "黄荆的枝叶": "Branches and leaves of Vitex negundo", "开花的枝条": "A branch in flower", "观察现场": "Observation site", "淡紫色花序": "Pale purple inflorescence", "花序上的绿色幼果": "Young green fruit on the inflorescence", "枝端的花序": "Terminal inflorescence", "黄荆 · 本期封面": "Vitex negundo · video cover", "一阵熟悉的气味，带回叶子、酒缸和枕头里的童年记忆。": "A familiar smell brings back childhood memories of leaves, a wine jar and the filling of a pillow.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "一种安心的味道": "A scent that puts me at ease", "远远就闻到熟悉的气味，有点香，又带一点特别的味道。准确来说，对我是一种安心的感觉。\n眼前这株是黄荆。枝头一串串淡紫色的小花，近看密密地聚在一起；气味和花，都是我认出它的线索。": "I recognised the scent from a distance. It was fragrant but with something quite distinctive about it. More precisely, it gave me a feeling of calm.\nThis was huángjīng, Vitex negundo. Little pale purple flowers crowded the clusters at the branch tips. Both the scent and those flowers helped me recognise it.", "远远就闻到熟悉的气味，有点香，又带一点特别的味道。准确来说，对我是一种安心的感觉。": "I recognised the scent from a distance. It was fragrant but with something quite distinctive about it. More precisely, it gave me a feeling of calm.", "眼前这株是黄荆。枝头一串串淡紫色的小花，近看密密地聚在一起；气味和花，都是我认出它的线索。": "This was huángjīng, Vitex negundo. Little pale purple flowers crowded the clusters at the branch tips. Both the scent and those flowers helped me recognise it.", "叶子把小时候带回来": "Leaves that bring childhood back", "小时候，长辈会用黄荆叶擦拭酒缸，也会讲起做粽子的事。那些场景和叶子的气味，到现在还连在一起。\n再仔细看这片掌状复叶，几枚小叶从同一处展开，边缘带齿，背面显得更浅。“五指枫”这个称呼，很容易让人想到它的样子。": "When I was a child, my elders wiped wine jars with these leaves and told stories about making zòngzi, the wrapped rice dumplings. Those scenes still come back to me with the smell of the leaves.\nThe leaf is palmately compound, with several leaflets spreading from one point. Their margins are toothed and their undersides paler. The local name wǔzhǐfēng, “five-finger maple”, brings the shape straight to mind.", "小时候，长辈会用黄荆叶擦拭酒缸，也会讲起做粽子的事。那些场景和叶子的气味，到现在还连在一起。": "When I was a child, my elders wiped wine jars with these leaves and told stories about making zòngzi, the wrapped rice dumplings. Those scenes still come back to me with the smell of the leaves.", "再仔细看这片掌状复叶，几枚小叶从同一处展开，边缘带齿，背面显得更浅。“五指枫”这个称呼，很容易让人想到它的样子。": "The leaf is palmately compound, with several leaflets spreading from one point. Their margins are toothed and their undersides paler. The local name wǔzhǐfēng, “five-finger maple”, brings the shape straight to mind.", "枝条和花，都是熟悉的轮廓": "Twigs and flowers I know well", "细长枝条伸出去，叶子和花序沿着枝条排开。我们常听到的“荆条”，让我对它的枝条也多留意了几分。\n抛开故事，单看这一株路边植物，花序的颜色和叶片的形状已经很好认。": "The slender twigs reach outwards with leaves and flower clusters arranged along them. Hearing people call them jīngtiáo made me pay a little more attention to the twigs themselves.\nEven setting the stories aside, the colour of the inflorescences and the shape of the leaves make this roadside plant quite distinctive.", "细长枝条伸出去，叶子和花序沿着枝条排开。我们常听到的“荆条”，让我对它的枝条也多留意了几分。": "The slender twigs reach outwards with leaves and flower clusters arranged along them. Hearing people call them jīngtiáo made me pay a little more attention to the twigs themselves.", "抛开故事，单看这一株路边植物，花序的颜色和叶片的形状已经很好认。": "Even setting the stories aside, the colour of the inflorescences and the shape of the leaves make this roadside plant quite distinctive.", "枕头里也有它的记忆": "Even a pillow holds a memory", "我小时候还收集过黄荆的果子，用来填枕头。拿在手里，小小的，很有触感。\n这次既拍到了枝上的绿色幼果，也留下了掌心里干果的样子。记下这些生活记忆，比急着给它附会一种功效，更接近我这次想说的事。": "As a child I collected these fruits for pillow stuffing. They were small but had a very particular feel in my hand.\nThis time I photographed the green young fruits on the branch and the dry ones in my palm. Those everyday memories are closer to what I wanted to share than any claim about what the plant might do for you.", "我小时候还收集过黄荆的果子，用来填枕头。拿在手里，小小的，很有触感。": "As a child I collected these fruits for pillow stuffing. They were small but had a very particular feel in my hand.", "这次既拍到了枝上的绿色幼果，也留下了掌心里干果的样子。记下这些生活记忆，比急着给它附会一种功效，更接近我这次想说的事。": "This time I photographed the green young fruits on the branch and the dry ones in my palm. Those everyday memories are closer to what I wanted to share than any claim about what the plant might do for you."}, "20250429-01": {"花序与手掌对照": "Inflorescence beside a hand for scale", "带壳斗的果实": "Fruit in its cupule", "细长花序上的小花": "Small flowers on a slender inflorescence", "山坡上的花海": "A hillside covered in blossom", "开花的树冠": "Tree canopy in flower", "林间的枝叶": "Branches and foliage in woodland", "雄蕊细节": "Stamens in detail", "下垂的花序": "Drooping inflorescences", "黧蒴锥 · 本期封面": "Castanopsis fissa · video cover", "叶片正反面对照": "Upper and lower leaf surfaces compared", "掌心里的坚果": "Nut in the palm of a hand", "雄花近景": "Male flower in close-up", "舒展的花序": "Outstretched inflorescence", "四月的梧桐山，黧蒴锥把山坡染成黄白色，也留下了很有辨识度的气味。": "On Mount Wutong in April, Castanopsis fissa washes the hillsides in yellow-white and leaves behind a smell you won’t mistake.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称依据官方WCVP 2026-06-04数据快照核对；分类等级按所列来源记录。": "The scientific name was checked against the official WCVP snapshot of 4 June 2026. Ranks follow the linked source.", "属于四月的梧桐山": "April on Wutong Mountain", "我在梧桐山几乎没有发现过梧桐树，反倒一到四月，就总被黧蒴锥的花吸引。\n一团团、一簇簇，远远看过去，是黄绿色里透着黄白色的花海。山坡和树冠连在一起，真是花团锦簇。": "I hardly ever come across a wútóng tree on Wutong Mountain. What catches my eye every April is the flowering of Castanopsis fissa.\nFrom a distance the flowers form a sea of yellow-white against yellow-green, clustered across the hillside wherever the crowns meet.", "我在梧桐山几乎没有发现过梧桐树，反倒一到四月，就总被黧蒴锥的花吸引。": "I hardly ever come across a wútóng tree on Wutong Mountain. What catches my eye every April is the flowering of Castanopsis fissa.", "一团团、一簇簇，远远看过去，是黄绿色里透着黄白色的花海。山坡和树冠连在一起，真是花团锦簇。": "From a distance the flowers form a sea of yellow-white against yellow-green, clustered across the hillside wherever the crowns meet.", "一根根花序，和一种特别的气味": "Long flower spikes and a memorable smell", "走近以后，才看清那一根根、一条条的花序。细小的花密密排开，雄蕊像向外伸出的细线。\n拍摄那天，鼻子里一直是它的气味，香香的又带点臭臭的。哈哈，这也算是属于梧桐山的记忆了。": "Closer in, I could make out the long, individual inflorescences. Tiny flowers were packed along them, with stamens projecting like fine threads.\nThe smell stayed in my nose throughout the day I filmed: fragrant, but with a slightly unpleasant edge too. That has become one of my memories of Wutong Mountain!", "走近以后，才看清那一根根、一条条的花序。细小的花密密排开，雄蕊像向外伸出的细线。": "Closer in, I could make out the long, individual inflorescences. Tiny flowers were packed along them, with stamens projecting like fine threads.", "拍摄那天，鼻子里一直是它的气味，香香的又带点臭臭的。哈哈，这也算是属于梧桐山的记忆了。": "The smell stayed in my nose throughout the day I filmed: fragrant, but with a slightly unpleasant edge too. That has become one of my memories of Wutong Mountain!", "掌心里的一把坚果": "A handful of nuts", "它的坚果看起来和栗子有一点像，毕竟都属于壳斗科。裹在外面的壳斗带着一层层纹理，和刺球一样的栗壳很不相同。\n山上常常看到松鼠跳来跳去。看着这一把坚果，很容易想象它们忙着觅食的样子。": "The nuts look a little like chestnuts. Both trees are in the beech family. But the cup enclosing each nut here has a layered texture quite unlike a prickly chestnut burr.\nI often see squirrels leaping about on the mountain. A handful of these nuts made it easy to imagine them busy foraging.", "它的坚果看起来和栗子有一点像，毕竟都属于壳斗科。裹在外面的壳斗带着一层层纹理，和刺球一样的栗壳很不相同。": "The nuts look a little like chestnuts. Both trees are in the beech family. But the cup enclosing each nut here has a layered texture quite unlike a prickly chestnut burr.", "山上常常看到松鼠跳来跳去。看着这一把坚果，很容易想象它们忙着觅食的样子。": "I often see squirrels leaping about on the mountain. A handful of these nuts made it easy to imagine them busy foraging.", "翻一翻叶片": "Turning over a leaf", "叶子长长的，正面绿色，背面显得灰白，边缘还能看到齿。\n把一片叶子翻过来，就又多记住了一个特点。再抬头看那一整片树冠，眼前的花海也有了更具体的名字。": "The long leaves are green above, greyish white beneath, with teeth along the edges.\nOne turn of a leaf gave me another feature to remember. When I looked back up at the whole crown, that sea of flowers had a name I could picture.", "叶子长长的，正面绿色，背面显得灰白，边缘还能看到齿。": "The long leaves are green above, greyish white beneath, with teeth along the edges.", "把一片叶子翻过来，就又多记住了一个特点。再抬头看那一整片树冠，眼前的花海也有了更具体的名字。": "One turn of a leaf gave me another feature to remember. When I looked back up at the whole crown, that sea of flowers had a name I could picture."}, "20250122-01": {"枝叶间有未展开的花蕾，细长花冠仍卷合着。": "Unopened buds among the leaves, their slender corollas still tightly rolled.", "藤梢和嫩叶近照，茎沿支撑物盘旋。": "Close-up of a vine tip and young leaves as the stem winds around a support.", "阳光透过掌状分裂的叶片，细藤缠在栏杆旁。": "Sunlight passes through the palmately lobed leaves; a thin vine twines beside the railing.", "花冠展开后的内部观察，白色花药与细长花丝清楚可见。": "The corolla spread open reveals white anthers and fine filaments.", "栏杆上的五爪金龙，叶片从叶柄顶端向几个方向展开。": "Ipomoea cairica on the railing, its leaf lobes spreading in several directions from each stalk.", "正面看五爪金龙，淡紫色花冠向深紫色的花心收拢。": "From the front, the pale violet corolla narrows towards the darker purple centre.", "五爪金龙自然手绘：缠绕枝、掌状裂叶、花冠和花部细节。": "Drawing of Ipomoea cairica: twining stem, lobed leaves, corolla and floral details.", "细长的藤梢伸出绿篱，弯弯绕绕地寻找支撑。": "A slender vine tip emerges from the hedge and curves about in search of support.", "拨开花冠后，花筒中的白色花部露出来。": "The corolla is parted to expose the white floral parts inside the tube.", "退远看看，藤蔓沿着坡边和灌丛铺开。": "Stepping back, the vines can be seen spreading over the edge of the slope and shrubs.", "细茎绕着绿色支撑茎打圈，旁边展开了掌状裂叶。": "A thin stem coils around a green supporting stem beside a palmately lobed leaf.", "置于木纹背景上的花部近照，可见白色柱头和花柱。": "Against a wood-grain background, the white stigma and style are visible.", "花冠近照：浅紫色褶纹通向深色花喉。": "Close-up of folds in the pale purple corolla leading to the dark throat.", "一层层叶片覆盖在绿篱上，紫色花朵从叶间露出来。": "Purple flowers peek out between layers of leaves covering the hedge.", "侧面看，花冠有一段细长的筒，向外展开成小喇叭。": "From the side, the long, narrow tube flares into a little trumpet.", "叶片的裂片像张开的手掌，是观察五爪金龙的一条线索。": "The lobes spread like an open hand, one clue to this vine’s identity.", "从另一个角度近看花筒内的白色花部。": "Another view of the white structures inside the flower tube.", "紫色小喇叭，五爪般的叶子，顺着缠绕的茎认识这条爬满绿篱的藤。": "Purple trumpets and five-clawed leaves: trace the twining stem of a vine that has spread all over the hedge.", "同片提及或用于比较的对象，不另计主档案。": "Shown or mentioned for comparison in the same video. It does not add another archive entry.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "五爪金龙与牵牛花有什么不同？": "How do 五爪金龙 and morning glories differ?", "小喇叭，霸气的名字": "Little trumpets with a grand name", "看，这一个个紫色小喇叭，乍一看很像平时说的牵牛花。走近一点，花心的颜色比花瓣深，花冠从细长的筒口向外展开。\n\n它有个很霸气的名字：五爪金龙。也有人叫它牵牛藤。这么温柔的一朵花，怎么配了这样一个名字？答案得往叶子上找。": "These little purple trumpets look at first like familiar morning-glory flowers. A closer look shows a deeper colour in the throat, where the narrow tube opens into a flaring corolla.\n\nOne of the vine’s Chinese names, wǔzhǎo jīnlóng, means “five-clawed golden dragon”. It is also called qiānniú téng. How did such a gentle flower get that grand name? I looked at the leaves for an answer.", "看，这一个个紫色小喇叭，乍一看很像平时说的牵牛花。走近一点，花心的颜色比花瓣深，花冠从细长的筒口向外展开。": "These little purple trumpets look at first like familiar morning-glory flowers. A closer look shows a deeper colour in the throat, where the narrow tube opens into a flaring corolla.", "它有个很霸气的名字：五爪金龙。也有人叫它牵牛藤。这么温柔的一朵花，怎么配了这样一个名字？答案得往叶子上找。": "One of the vine’s Chinese names, wǔzhǎo jīnlóng, means “five-clawed golden dragon”. It is also called qiānniú téng. How did such a gentle flower get that grand name? I looked at the leaves for an answer.", "五爪，原来在叶子上": "Five claws in the outline of a leaf", "把花旁边的叶子翻出来看看，几个裂片从同一个地方向外伸开，像张开的手掌，也像想象中的龙爪。原来“五爪”的线索，就藏在这里。\n\n只盯着喇叭形的花，很容易把几种藤本混在一起。多看一眼叶形，再顺着叶柄找到茎，认识它就有了更清楚的方向。": "I turned out a leaf beside a flower. Several lobes spread from the same point like fingers on an open hand, or the claws of an imaginary dragon. There was the clue to the “five claws”.\n\nLook only at the trumpet flowers and several vines are easily confused. One more look at the leaf shape, then a look along its stalk to the stem, gave me a better way of recognising this one.", "把花旁边的叶子翻出来看看，几个裂片从同一个地方向外伸开，像张开的手掌，也像想象中的龙爪。原来“五爪”的线索，就藏在这里。": "I turned out a leaf beside a flower. Several lobes spread from the same point like fingers on an open hand, or the claws of an imaginary dragon. There was the clue to the “five claws”.", "只盯着喇叭形的花，很容易把几种藤本混在一起。多看一眼叶形，再顺着叶柄找到茎，认识它就有了更清楚的方向。": "Look only at the trumpet flowers and several vines are easily confused. One more look at the leaf shape, then a look along its stalk to the stem, gave me a better way of recognising this one.", "绕着支撑，一圈一圈往上走": "Twining upwards, one turn after another", "我更喜欢顺着它的藤梢看下去。细细的茎绕过栏杆，又绕上旁边的枝条，一圈一圈地往上走。它不是靠一只小爪子抓住东西，而是用茎缠绕支撑物。\n\n有些藤梢已经伸出绿篱，还在空中弯着。等它找到下一个可以依靠的地方，叶子和小喇叭就会跟着铺过去。": "I especially enjoyed following the growing tip. The fine stem wound round a railing and on round a neighbouring branch, turn after turn. The stem itself twines around its support. There are no little claws doing the gripping.\n\nSome shoots had grown beyond the hedge and were curving out into the air. When they find their next support, leaves and little trumpets will follow.", "我更喜欢顺着它的藤梢看下去。细细的茎绕过栏杆，又绕上旁边的枝条，一圈一圈地往上走。它不是靠一只小爪子抓住东西，而是用茎缠绕支撑物。": "I especially enjoyed following the growing tip. The fine stem wound round a railing and on round a neighbouring branch, turn after turn. The stem itself twines around its support. There are no little claws doing the gripping.", "有些藤梢已经伸出绿篱，还在空中弯着。等它找到下一个可以依靠的地方，叶子和小喇叭就会跟着铺过去。": "Some shoots had grown beyond the hedge and were curving out into the air. When they find their next support, leaves and little trumpets will follow.", "从一朵花，看到一大片藤": "From one flower to a whole sweep of vine", "退后几步，眼前就不只是一朵漂亮的小喇叭了。叶子一层叠着一层，沿着坡边、绿篱和其它枝叶铺开，紫色的花散落在这片绿色里。\n\n我一方面喜欢它的花与叶，一方面又忍不住去想：当藤蔓覆盖了别的植物，下面的叶子还能分到多少阳光？从一朵花看到它周围的生境，问题也跟着变多了。": "A few steps back showed me more than one pretty trumpet. Leaves overlapped along the slope, over the hedge and across other branches, with purple flowers scattered through the green.\n\nI like the flowers and the leaves, but I also wondered how much sunlight reaches the leaves of plants underneath that covering. Looking from one flower to its surroundings gave me more questions to take away.", "退后几步，眼前就不只是一朵漂亮的小喇叭了。叶子一层叠着一层，沿着坡边、绿篱和其它枝叶铺开，紫色的花散落在这片绿色里。": "A few steps back showed me more than one pretty trumpet. Leaves overlapped along the slope, over the hedge and across other branches, with purple flowers scattered through the green.", "我一方面喜欢它的花与叶，一方面又忍不住去想：当藤蔓覆盖了别的植物，下面的叶子还能分到多少阳光？从一朵花看到它周围的生境，问题也跟着变多了。": "I like the flowers and the leaves, but I also wondered how much sunlight reaches the leaves of plants underneath that covering. Looking from one flower to its surroundings gave me more questions to take away."}, "20250218-01": {"吊钟花自然手绘：叶脉、花枝、花部及子房横切面。": "Drawing of Enkianthus: leaf veins, flowering branch, floral parts and ovary in cross-section.", "山坡林中观察吊钟花，花枝分布在人的身旁与头顶。": "On the wooded hillside, flowering branches grow beside the observer and overhead.", "一簇下垂的粉色花蕾，几根红色花梗从枝顶伸出来。": "A cluster of hanging pink buds on several red stalks extending from the shoot tip.", "绿色子房的横切面，内部腔室清楚可见。": "Cross-section of the green ovary showing its chambers.", "细枝上垂着一簇粉色花蕾，后方是林中的枝干。": "Pink buds hang from a twig, with woodland stems behind.", "一朵花的侧面，粉色花冠有细细的纵向纹路。": "A side view shows the fine lengthwise lines on the pink corolla.", "吊钟花近照，浅粉花冠的边缘向外翻卷。": "Close-up of an Enkianthus blossom, its pale pink corolla curling back at the rim.", "花冠取下后，绿色子房和细长花柱露出来。": "Removal of the corolla exposes the green ovary and slender style.", "从花口下方向上看，可以看见花冠内的花部。": "Looking up through the opening reveals the structures inside the corolla.", "逆光下的叶片，主脉、侧脉和细密网脉清楚可见。": "Backlighting picks out the midrib, side veins and fine network of smaller veins.", "盛开的吊钟花与嫩叶：淡粉花冠、红色花梗和外翻的花冠边缘。": "Enkianthus in bloom with young leaves: pale pink corollas with curled-back edges on red stalks.", "两片带红褐色斑点的叶片之间，直立着一枚粉红色芽。": "A pink bud stands between two leaves speckled with reddish brown.", "抬头看花枝，花口朝下，叶片映着明亮的天空。": "Looking up, the bells open downwards against leaves silhouetted in the bright sky.", "枝顶的小铃铛已经开放，花上方还有正在抽出的嫩叶。": "Little bells have opened at the shoot tip; fresh leaves are emerging above them.", "枝顶的嫩叶向上抽出，粉色小花在下方成簇悬垂。": "Fresh leaves reach upwards, while small pink flowers hang in clusters below.", "从枝条下方近看花口，粉色花朵紧挨着革质绿叶。": "A close view from below shows the pink flowers tucked against leathery green leaves.", "从枝条下方抬头看，粉色吊钟花与绿叶一起迎着天空。": "Looking up from below a branch, pink Enkianthus bells and green leaves face the sky.", "花部展开观察：浅色花冠围着中央的雄蕊与雌蕊。": "The flower opened for examination: pale corolla around the central stamens and pistil.", "阳光中的花枝，几簇粉色小铃铛分散在绿叶之间。": "Sunlit branches with little clusters of pink bells among the leaves.", "林中的枝干近照，几根灰褐色枝干向上分开。": "Grey-brown trunks fork upwards in the woodland.", "终于赶上吊钟花开放，抬头看一串串透光的小铃铛，再看看旁边的新叶。": "At last I caught this shrub in bloom. Look up at the strings of translucent bells, and at the new leaves beside them.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "吊钟花（《中国植物志》）": "吊钟花 in Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae", "终于赶上这一树小铃铛": "At last I caught the little bells in bloom", "叮叮当，叮叮当。这么多年，不是来早了，就是来晚了，这回终于拍到了正在开放的吊钟花。\n\n它的花就像一个个小铃铛，一串串挂在枝头。抬头往上看，阳光从浅粉色的花冠透过来，亮得有点不真实。风一吹，我仿佛已经听到了风铃声。": "Ding-dong, ding-dong. For years I’d come too early or too late. This time I finally photographed the bell flowers as they opened.\n\nThey really did hang in bunches like little bells at the ends of the branches. Looking up, I saw sunlight through the pale pink corollas, almost too bright to be real. A breeze came through and I could practically hear wind chimes.", "叮叮当，叮叮当。这么多年，不是来早了，就是来晚了，这回终于拍到了正在开放的吊钟花。": "Ding-dong, ding-dong. For years I’d come too early or too late. This time I finally photographed the bell flowers as they opened.", "它的花就像一个个小铃铛，一串串挂在枝头。抬头往上看，阳光从浅粉色的花冠透过来，亮得有点不真实。风一吹，我仿佛已经听到了风铃声。": "They really did hang in bunches like little bells at the ends of the branches. Looking up, I saw sunlight through the pale pink corollas, almost too bright to be real. A breeze came through and I could practically hear wind chimes.", "花苞也有自己的出场顺序": "The buds take their turns", "先看看还没完全打开的花。粉色花苞挤在一起，细长花梗弯下来，把它们悬在枝顶。再看旁边已经张开的花冠，下面的边缘微微外翻。\n\n把不同阶段摆在一起看，就像看小铃铛一个个准备登场。第一朵打开，第二朵也打开了，这一枝便有了叮叮当当的热闹。": "I started with the flowers that hadn’t quite opened. Pink buds gathered together on slender stalks that curved down from the twig tips. Beside them, the rims of open corollas turned out a little at the bottom.\n\nSide by side, the different stages looked like little bells getting ready to perform one after another. The first opened, then the second. Soon the whole branch seemed ready to ring.", "先看看还没完全打开的花。粉色花苞挤在一起，细长花梗弯下来，把它们悬在枝顶。再看旁边已经张开的花冠，下面的边缘微微外翻。": "I started with the flowers that hadn’t quite opened. Pink buds gathered together on slender stalks that curved down from the twig tips. Beside them, the rims of open corollas turned out a little at the bottom.", "把不同阶段摆在一起看，就像看小铃铛一个个准备登场。第一朵打开，第二朵也打开了，这一枝便有了叮叮当当的热闹。": "Side by side, the different stages looked like little bells getting ready to perform one after another. The first opened, then the second. Soon the whole branch seemed ready to ring.", "抬头，再往花里看一眼": "A view up into the flowers", "吊钟花的花口朝下，平视时只能看见圆鼓鼓的外形。把视线放低一点，再向上看，花口里的细节才露出来。\n\n花梗这么细，却把一串串小花稳稳吊住。为什么要这样垂着开？我边看边想。先不急着替它回答，把花形、花口和枝条的关系仔细记下来，也已经很有趣了。": "The openings face downwards. At eye level I could see only the rounded outlines. I had to lower my gaze and look back up before the details inside came into view.\n\nSuch fine stalks held their clusters so steadily. Why do the flowers hang down? I wondered about that as I looked. For now it was enough to trace the shape, the opening and the way each flower hung from its twig.", "吊钟花的花口朝下，平视时只能看见圆鼓鼓的外形。把视线放低一点，再向上看，花口里的细节才露出来。": "The openings face downwards. At eye level I could see only the rounded outlines. I had to lower my gaze and look back up before the details inside came into view.", "花梗这么细，却把一串串小花稳稳吊住。为什么要这样垂着开？我边看边想。先不急着替它回答，把花形、花口和枝条的关系仔细记下来，也已经很有趣了。": "Such fine stalks held their clusters so steadily. Why do the flowers hang down? I wondered about that as I looked. For now it was enough to trace the shape, the opening and the way each flower hung from its twig.", "铃铛旁边，还有新叶": "New leaves beside the bells", "看完花，别漏掉枝顶的新叶。它们从花上方抽出来，带着浅浅的粉色和嫩绿色，像一小撮竖起来的头发。我忍不住把这一枝叫作“小火娃”。\n\n再把镜头转向成熟叶片，逆着光，叶脉的走向也很漂亮。小小一根花枝，值得从花看到叶。我忍住没有捏那些花苞，把它们留在山坡上，等下一阵风。": "After the flowers, I looked for the new leaves at the twig tip. They emerged above the flowers, pale pink and fresh green, like a tuft of hair sticking straight up. I found myself calling the branch a “little fire sprite”.\n\nThen I turned to the mature leaves. Their veins were lovely against the light. A short flowering twig had given me plenty to see from flower to leaf. I resisted the urge to squeeze the buds and left them on the slope for the next breeze.", "看完花，别漏掉枝顶的新叶。它们从花上方抽出来，带着浅浅的粉色和嫩绿色，像一小撮竖起来的头发。我忍不住把这一枝叫作“小火娃”。": "After the flowers, I looked for the new leaves at the twig tip. They emerged above the flowers, pale pink and fresh green, like a tuft of hair sticking straight up. I found myself calling the branch a “little fire sprite”.", "再把镜头转向成熟叶片，逆着光，叶脉的走向也很漂亮。小小一根花枝，值得从花看到叶。我忍住没有捏那些花苞，把它们留在山坡上，等下一阵风。": "Then I turned to the mature leaves. Their veins were lovely against the light. A short flowering twig had given me plenty to see from flower to leaf. I resisted the urge to squeeze the buds and left them on the slope for the next breeze."}, "20241231-01": {"含羞草长在草丛中，细小叶片排成一对对，果实簇生在枝间。": "Sensitive plant growing among grasses, with paired leaflets and fruit clusters between the branches.", "放大看绿色荚果，扁平果片围成一簇。": "A closer look at the cluster of flat green pods.", "沿着草丛寻找含羞草，细长枝条混在周围的植物之间。": "Following the thin stems in the grass, where they mingle with surrounding plants.", "绿叶下悬着粉紫色小花球，旁边还有未开放的花序。": "A pink-purple flower head hangs beneath green leaves, with unopened heads nearby.", "蹲在草丛旁，近距离观察含羞草的叶与果实。": "Crouching in the grass to examine the leaves and fruits of sensitive plant.", "掌中收集的种子与干燥果片，大小和形状各不相同。": "Seeds and dry fruit segments of different shapes and sizes gathered in a hand.", "叶柄旁的一簇绿色荚果，边缘有明显毛刺。": "Green pods beside a leaf stalk have conspicuously bristly edges.", "含羞草展开的复叶，成对的小叶排列得十分整齐。": "The open compound leaf has tiny leaflets in neat pairs.", "粉紫色花序近照，许多细长花丝向四周伸开。": "Close-up of a pink-purple flower head, its slender filaments reaching in all directions.", "展开的复叶旁边，有花后形成的绿色果实。": "Green fruits have formed beside an open compound leaf.", "一段枝条上同时有粉色花球、花蕾和花后的花序。": "One stem carries a pink head, buds and spent inflorescences together.", "含羞草自然手绘：展开与合拢的复叶、花序和荚果。": "Drawing of sensitive plant: open and folded compound leaves, inflorescence and pods.", "干燥的果实近照，褐色果片周围留着细长的毛刺。": "Dry fruit in close-up: long fine bristles remain around the brown segments.", "轻碰就会合拢的叶子之外，含羞草还有粉色小花球和带毛刺边缘的小果实。": "Besides leaves that fold at a touch, the sensitive plant has little balls of pink flowers and small fruits fringed with bristles.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "含羞草（植物智）": "Mimosa pudica on iPlant", "Calcium-mediated rapid movements defend against herbivorous insects in Mimosa pudica": "Calcium-mediated rapid movements defend against herbivorous insects in Mimosa pudica", "碰一下，叶子收起来了": "One touch and the leaves close", "今天遇见一种特别有互动感的植物：含羞草。轻轻碰一下，原本舒展开的小叶就会合拢，像突然把小扇子收了起来。\n\n没碰它的时候，成对的小叶排得整整齐齐，绿得很精神。正因为记住了它展开的样子，那一下迅速的变化才显得特别神奇。": "Today I met a plant that really responds to a visitor: the sensitive plant. With a light touch, its spread leaflets folded together in a flash like a closing fan.\n\nWhen undisturbed, pairs of green leaflets stood in orderly rows. Having that open shape in mind made the speed of the change all the more astonishing.", "今天遇见一种特别有互动感的植物：含羞草。轻轻碰一下，原本舒展开的小叶就会合拢，像突然把小扇子收了起来。": "Today I met a plant that really responds to a visitor: the sensitive plant. With a light touch, its spread leaflets folded together in a flash like a closing fan.", "没碰它的时候，成对的小叶排得整整齐齐，绿得很精神。正因为记住了它展开的样子，那一下迅速的变化才显得特别神奇。": "When undisturbed, pairs of green leaflets stood in orderly rows. Having that open shape in mind made the speed of the change all the more astonishing.", "它为什么会“害羞”？": "What makes it “shy”?", "“害羞”是我们给它起的可爱说法。触碰带来的刺激会引起植物体内的信号变化，信号传开后，叶枕这个负责运动的部位让叶片迅速改变姿态。\n\n研究者也观察到，含羞草的快速叶片运动能帮助它抵御取食昆虫。原来这一下小小的合拢，背后还有一套认真工作的反应机制。": "“Shy” is our affectionate way of describing it. Touch triggers changes in signalling within the plant. As the signal spreads, a structure called the pulvinus, the moving joint at the base of a leaf or leaflet, brings about the rapid change in posture.\n\nResearchers have also observed that this fast movement can help protect the plant against feeding insects. There is quite a chain of responses behind that little fold.", "“害羞”是我们给它起的可爱说法。触碰带来的刺激会引起植物体内的信号变化，信号传开后，叶枕这个负责运动的部位让叶片迅速改变姿态。": "“Shy” is our affectionate way of describing it. Touch triggers changes in signalling within the plant. As the signal spreads, a structure called the pulvinus, the moving joint at the base of a leaf or leaflet, brings about the rapid change in posture.", "研究者也观察到，含羞草的快速叶片运动能帮助它抵御取食昆虫。原来这一下小小的合拢，背后还有一套认真工作的反应机制。": "Researchers have also observed that this fast movement can help protect the plant against feeding insects. There is quite a chain of responses behind that little fold.", "还有一个个粉色小球": "Little pink spheres as well", "除了会动的叶子，含羞草的花也很可爱。一个个粉紫色小球，从枝叶旁冒出来。靠近看，细细的花丝向四面伸开，像蓬松的小绒球。\n\n同一根枝条上，有的还没开，有的开得正好，有的已经褪去鲜艳的颜色。它的花也在悄悄换班，只是平时我们太容易把注意力全放在叶子上了。": "Alongside the moving leaves, the flowers were lovely too. Pinkish-purple balls emerged beside the leafy branches. Up close, fine filaments reached in every direction like a fluffy pompom.\n\nOn one branch there were unopened heads, heads in full bloom and others that had already lost their bright colour. The flowers were quietly taking turns, although it’s usually the leaves that get all our attention.", "除了会动的叶子，含羞草的花也很可爱。一个个粉紫色小球，从枝叶旁冒出来。靠近看，细细的花丝向四面伸开，像蓬松的小绒球。": "Alongside the moving leaves, the flowers were lovely too. Pinkish-purple balls emerged beside the leafy branches. Up close, fine filaments reached in every direction like a fluffy pompom.", "同一根枝条上，有的还没开，有的开得正好，有的已经褪去鲜艳的颜色。它的花也在悄悄换班，只是平时我们太容易把注意力全放在叶子上了。": "On one branch there were unopened heads, heads in full bloom and others that had already lost their bright colour. The flowers were quietly taking turns, although it’s usually the leaves that get all our attention.", "花球之后，是一簇小果实": "A cluster of fruits follows each flower head", "再往花后看看，小果实扁扁的，挤成一簇，边缘带着细长的毛刺。绿色时能看清果片的轮廓，干燥后就变成了褐色。\n\n掌中这些小小的种子与果片，是这次观察的另一个收获。从会合拢的叶，到粉色花球，再到果实，含羞草远比一次“碰一下”的游戏丰富。": "Behind the flower heads I found small, flat fruits crowded together, with fine bristles along their edges. When green, the outlines of the segments were easy to see. Once dry they turned brown.\n\nThe little seeds and fruit segments in my hand were another discovery. Folding leaves, pink flower heads, then fruits: this plant has much more to offer than a game of touching it once.", "再往花后看看，小果实扁扁的，挤成一簇，边缘带着细长的毛刺。绿色时能看清果片的轮廓，干燥后就变成了褐色。": "Behind the flower heads I found small, flat fruits crowded together, with fine bristles along their edges. When green, the outlines of the segments were easy to see. Once dry they turned brown.", "掌中这些小小的种子与果片，是这次观察的另一个收获。从会合拢的叶，到粉色花球，再到果实，含羞草远比一次“碰一下”的游戏丰富。": "The little seeds and fruit segments in my hand were another discovery. Folding leaves, pink flower heads, then fruits: this plant has much more to offer than a game of touching it once."}, "20250311-01": {"从树下看，双裂叶片与紫红色花朵交错在枝间。": "Looking up from below at two-lobed leaves interspersed with purplish red flowers.", "两朵浅粉花近照，深红色纹路集中在上方花瓣。": "Two pale pink flowers with deep red markings concentrated on their upper petals.", "同片对照：深紫红花的侧面，花瓣与向外伸出的花部。": "Comparison: side view of the deep red flower, with petals and protruding floral parts.", "灰褐色树干近照，可以看见粗糙纹理与分枝。": "Close-up of the rough grey-brown trunk and its branching.", "一枝浅粉色花与花蕾，背景是满树花色。": "Pale pink blossom and buds in front of a treeful of flowers.", "枝条在蓝天下曲折伸展，浅粉色花朵散布枝头。": "Winding branches against blue sky, with pale pink flowers scattered at the tips.", "同片采集的扁平褐色种子，表面带着细细纹理。": "Flat brown seeds collected in the same video, with fine markings on the surface.", "同片白花枝条，白色花朵与绿色叶片映着天空。": "A white-flowered branch in the same video; blossoms and green leaves against the sky.", "羊蹄甲属植物的叶片，顶端分成两瓣，叶脉从基部向外散开。": "Bauhinia leaf with two apical lobes and veins fanning out from the base.", "同片记录的干燥荚果与散落种子，荚壳已经裂开并卷曲。": "Dry pods and scattered seeds recorded in the same video; the pod valves have split and curled.", "宫粉羊蹄甲自然手绘：花枝、双裂叶、荚果、种子和花部。": "Drawing of Bauhinia variegata: flowering branch, bilobed leaf, pod, seeds and floral parts.", "宫粉羊蹄甲的浅粉色花，上方花瓣有深色条纹。": "Pale pink Bauhinia variegata flower with dark stripes on its upper petal.", "嫩枝上的双裂叶片，叶柄与新芽聚在枝节附近。": "Bilobed leaf on a young shoot, with leaf stalk and new bud near the node.", "浅粉色宫粉羊蹄甲花枝，枝条向上伸入蓝天。": "A pale pink Bauhinia variegata branch reaching into a blue sky.", "同片记录的白花型，上方花瓣带浅黄绿色纹路。": "White-flowered form from the video, with pale yellow-green markings on its upper petal.", "同片对照：深紫红色的羊蹄甲属花，与后面的浅粉花比较花色和花形。": "Comparison: deep purplish red Bauhinia flowers alongside pale pink flowers, showing differences in colour and shape.", "树干与林下环境，地面上铺着落叶和小苗。": "Trunk and woodland floor, with fallen leaves and seedlings below.", "宫粉羊蹄甲的花正面，宽阔花瓣围着中央的雄蕊与花柱。": "Front view of Bauhinia variegata: broad petals surround the stamens and style.", "浅粉花的侧面，绿色子房与细长花柱从花中伸出来。": "Side view of a pale pink flower, its green ovary and slender style projecting outwards.", "从宫粉羊蹄甲的浅粉花纹出发，看看同片的深红花、白花和像羊蹄的叶子。": "Start with pale pink markings on a Bauhinia flower; then compare the deep red and white blossoms in the same video, and the leaves shaped like a goat’s hoof.", "本期对照介绍的羊蹄甲属对象，不与主对象合并。": "A Bauhinia mentioned for comparison, distinct from the plant featured here.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "宫粉羊蹄甲（植物智）": "宫粉羊蹄甲 on iPlant", "名字容易绕晕，先认眼前的花": "When the names get tangled, begin with the flower", "羊蹄甲、宫粉羊蹄甲、红花羊蹄甲，再加上紫荆、洋紫荆这些常用称呼，名字常常把我绕晕。这一期，就从眼前的宫粉羊蹄甲开始认识这个小家族。\n\n本页主对象是宫粉羊蹄甲 Bauhinia variegata。同一期里还记录和比较了其它羊蹄甲属对象，它们的花色、花形和结果情况，可以放在一起慢慢辨认。": "Yángtíjiǎ, gōngfěn yángtíjiǎ, hónghuā yángtíjiǎ, zǐjīng, yángzǐjīng… I often get tangled in the Chinese names. Today I began with the pink Bauhinia in front of me as a way into this little family.\n\nThe main subject is Bauhinia variegata. The same video also shows and compares other Bauhinia. Flower colour, flower shape and whether the trees set fruit all give me ways to compare them.", "羊蹄甲、宫粉羊蹄甲、红花羊蹄甲，再加上紫荆、洋紫荆这些常用称呼，名字常常把我绕晕。这一期，就从眼前的宫粉羊蹄甲开始认识这个小家族。": "Yángtíjiǎ, gōngfěn yángtíjiǎ, hónghuā yángtíjiǎ, zǐjīng, yángzǐjīng… I often get tangled in the Chinese names. Today I began with the pink Bauhinia in front of me as a way into this little family.", "本页主对象是宫粉羊蹄甲 Bauhinia variegata。同一期里还记录和比较了其它羊蹄甲属对象，它们的花色、花形和结果情况，可以放在一起慢慢辨认。": "The main subject is Bauhinia variegata. The same video also shows and compares other Bauhinia. Flower colour, flower shape and whether the trees set fruit all give me ways to compare them.", "浅粉色里，藏着一道道深色纹路": "Dark stripes against pale pink", "深圳街头的宫粉羊蹄甲开得热闹，走近却很温柔。浅浅的粉色花瓣展开，上面那一瓣有特别醒目的深色条纹。风一吹，整枝花都轻轻晃起来。\n\n别只看颜色，再看看从花心伸出来的雄蕊与花柱。把视角转到侧面，花瓣后面的绿色花萼也露出来了，花的结构一下清楚了许多。": "Bauhinia variegata put on quite a show along the streets of Shenzhen. Up close the flowers had a gentler look. The pale pink petals spread apart, with marked dark stripes on the uppermost one. A breeze set the whole branch swaying.\n\nBeyond the colour, I could see stamens and the style projecting from the flower. From the side the green calyx behind the petals came into view and the arrangement was much clearer.", "深圳街头的宫粉羊蹄甲开得热闹，走近却很温柔。浅浅的粉色花瓣展开，上面那一瓣有特别醒目的深色条纹。风一吹，整枝花都轻轻晃起来。": "Bauhinia variegata put on quite a show along the streets of Shenzhen. Up close the flowers had a gentler look. The pale pink petals spread apart, with marked dark stripes on the uppermost one. A breeze set the whole branch swaying.", "别只看颜色，再看看从花心伸出来的雄蕊与花柱。把视角转到侧面，花瓣后面的绿色花萼也露出来了，花的结构一下清楚了许多。": "Beyond the colour, I could see stamens and the style projecting from the flower. From the side the green calyx behind the petals came into view and the arrangement was much clearer.", "同样的花形，换成白色再看一遍": "The same flower shape in white", "这一期还遇到了白花宫粉羊蹄甲。远看是一树清爽的白，近看，上方花瓣还有浅浅的黄绿色纹路。枝条在空中交错，随便一枝都像可以放进中式插花里。\n\n深紫红、浅粉、白色放在一起，花色的差别很显眼。但认名字不能只靠深浅，本页也把同片提到的对象分开列了出来，方便对照。": "I also came across a white-flowered Bauhinia variegata. From afar the tree looked all fresh white. Close up, the upper petal carried pale yellow-green markings. Its branches crossed in the air, each looking as if it belonged in a Chinese floral arrangement.\n\nDark purplish red, pale pink and white look quite different side by side. Depth of colour alone won’t identify a tree. The other subjects mentioned in the video are listed separately for comparison.", "这一期还遇到了白花宫粉羊蹄甲。远看是一树清爽的白，近看，上方花瓣还有浅浅的黄绿色纹路。枝条在空中交错，随便一枝都像可以放进中式插花里。": "I also came across a white-flowered Bauhinia variegata. From afar the tree looked all fresh white. Close up, the upper petal carried pale yellow-green markings. Its branches crossed in the air, each looking as if it belonged in a Chinese floral arrangement.", "深紫红、浅粉、白色放在一起，花色的差别很显眼。但认名字不能只靠深浅，本页也把同片提到的对象分开列了出来，方便对照。": "Dark purplish red, pale pink and white look quite different side by side. Depth of colour alone won’t identify a tree. The other subjects mentioned in the video are listed separately for comparison.", "像翻开的书，也像一对小羊蹄": "An open book, or a pair of little hooves", "花的名字容易混，那就换个部位看看。叶片顶端分成两瓣，打开时像一本摊开的书，也很像一对小羊蹄。羊蹄甲这个名字，突然就变得特别好记。\n\n对着光，能看见叶脉从基部向外展开。看完花，再翻一翻叶子，这个小家族又多了一条能记住的线索。": "When the flower names became confusing, I looked at another part. The tip of the leaf divides into two lobes like an open book or a pair of little goat hooves. Suddenly yángtíjiǎ, the Chinese name that evokes a goat’s hoof, was easy to remember.\n\nAgainst the light I could see the veins radiating from the base. Turning over a leaf after looking at the flower gave me another clue to this group.", "花的名字容易混，那就换个部位看看。叶片顶端分成两瓣，打开时像一本摊开的书，也很像一对小羊蹄。羊蹄甲这个名字，突然就变得特别好记。": "When the flower names became confusing, I looked at another part. The tip of the leaf divides into two lobes like an open book or a pair of little goat hooves. Suddenly yángtíjiǎ, the Chinese name that evokes a goat’s hoof, was easy to remember.", "对着光，能看见叶脉从基部向外展开。看完花，再翻一翻叶子，这个小家族又多了一条能记住的线索。": "Against the light I could see the veins radiating from the base. Turning over a leaf after looking at the flower gave me another clue to this group.", "低头，还有荚果与种子": "Pods and seeds underfoot", "树下也有东西可看。这一期拍到了已经裂开的干燥荚果，荚壳卷曲，旁边散落着扁扁的褐色种子。捧在手里，小小一颗也能看见细细纹理。\n\n从枝头的花看到地上的果荚，才觉得观察接上了后半段。不同羊蹄甲属对象的结果情况也是辨认线索，采集到的果实和种子，还要和它们原来的树一一对应着看。": "There was plenty to see beneath the tree too. I photographed dry, split pods, their valves curling beside scattered flat brown seeds. Even a small seed in my hand showed fine markings.\n\nFrom the flowers on the branches to the pods on the ground, the second half of this observation was coming together. Fruiting can help distinguish Bauhinia, but each collected pod or seed needs to be matched with the tree it came from.", "树下也有东西可看。这一期拍到了已经裂开的干燥荚果，荚壳卷曲，旁边散落着扁扁的褐色种子。捧在手里，小小一颗也能看见细细纹理。": "There was plenty to see beneath the tree too. I photographed dry, split pods, their valves curling beside scattered flat brown seeds. Even a small seed in my hand showed fine markings.", "从枝头的花看到地上的果荚，才觉得观察接上了后半段。不同羊蹄甲属对象的结果情况也是辨认线索，采集到的果实和种子，还要和它们原来的树一一对应着看。": "From the flowers on the branches to the pods on the ground, the second half of this observation was coming together. Fruiting can help distinguish Bauhinia, but each collected pod or seed needs to be matched with the tree it came from."}, "20250205-01": {"木豆枝叶展开，三片小叶组成一片复叶，枝间夹着黄色花。": "Pigeon pea branches with three-leaflet leaves and yellow flowers among the shoots.", "野外观察木豆，植株展开成一大丛，枝头散布黄色花。": "Pigeon pea observed in the field: a spreading clump with yellow flowers dotted along its branches.", "木豆种子近照，黄褐色种皮上可见浅色种脐。": "Close-up of a pigeon pea, with the pale hilum visible on the yellow-brown seed coat.", "花朵侧面近照，黄色花瓣与浅色花部露出来。": "Side view of a flower showing yellow petals and paler floral parts.", "木豆的分枝、三出复叶、花蕾和黄色花朵。": "Branches of pigeon pea with trifoliate leaves, buds and yellow flowers.", "嫩茎与花萼近照，表面带着细密柔毛。": "Fine, dense hairs on the young stem and calyx.", "木豆自然手绘：三出复叶、花部、荚果和种子细节。": "Drawing of pigeon pea: trifoliate leaves, floral parts, pods and seeds.", "旗瓣背面的近照，黄色底色上有紫褐色条纹。": "Purple-brown stripes on the yellow back of the banner petal.", "枝头开放的黄色小花，花瓣向前展开。": "The yellow flowers at the shoot tip open with their petals facing forwards.", "掌中的黄褐色木豆种子，旁边放着干燥荚壳。": "Yellow-brown pigeon peas in a hand beside a dry pod.", "黄色花朵旁有一只访花昆虫，花萼外侧带着细毛。": "An insect visits a yellow flower; fine hairs cover the outside of the calyx.", "托起一片复叶，三片狭长的小叶并排垂下来。": "A supported compound leaf shows its three slender leaflets hanging side by side.", "叶背放大观察，浅色叶脉与表面的细毛清楚可见。": "Magnified underside of the leaf, with pale veins and fine surface hairs.", "捧起一把木豆，再看黄色小花上的条纹，最后找到“三叶豆”名字里的三片小叶。": "Hold a handful of pigeon peas, then find the stripes on the yellow flowers and the three leaflets behind the Chinese name “three-leaf bean.”", "同片提及或用于比较的对象，不另计主档案。": "Shown or mentioned for comparison in the same video. It does not add another archive entry.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "木豆（《深圳植物志》）": "Pigeon pea in Flora of Shenzhen", "红豆、绿豆之外，还有木豆": "Beyond red beans and mung beans", "吃过红豆和绿豆，你见过木豆吗？这次把成熟的豆子捧在手里，一颗颗黄褐色的小种子很有光泽，浅色的种脐也看得清楚。\n\n最初吸引我的是它的荚果与纹理，后来又查到《深圳植物志》记有把煮熟的种子制成豆蓉的用途。我还没尝过，先把这份好奇留着，继续看看长出这些豆子的植物。": "You’ve eaten red beans and mung beans. Have you seen a pigeon pea? I held a handful of ripe seeds, yellow-brown and glossy, with pale seed scars clearly visible.\n\nThe pods and their patterns first drew me in. Later I found a record in the Flora of Shenzhen of cooked seeds being made into bean paste. I haven’t tasted it myself. For now I wanted to take that curiosity back to the plant that produced the seeds.", "吃过红豆和绿豆，你见过木豆吗？这次把成熟的豆子捧在手里，一颗颗黄褐色的小种子很有光泽，浅色的种脐也看得清楚。": "You’ve eaten red beans and mung beans. Have you seen a pigeon pea? I held a handful of ripe seeds, yellow-brown and glossy, with pale seed scars clearly visible.", "最初吸引我的是它的荚果与纹理，后来又查到《深圳植物志》记有把煮熟的种子制成豆蓉的用途。我还没尝过，先把这份好奇留着，继续看看长出这些豆子的植物。": "The pods and their patterns first drew me in. Later I found a record in the Flora of Shenzhen of cooked seeds being made into bean paste. I haven’t tasted it myself. For now I wanted to take that curiosity back to the plant that produced the seeds.", "站远一点，看它长在哪里": "Standing back to see where it grows", "这丛木豆长得很精神，分枝舒展开来，黄色花朵散在一层层叶子间。站在旁边拍它，才发现它已经占了不小的一片空间。\n\n我把镜头也留给了周围的植物。认识一种植物，有时候不能只截取一朵花：它长在哪里，旁边挤着谁，枝条又朝哪个方向伸展，都是这次相遇的一部分。": "This clump was vigorous, its branches spread out and yellow flowers scattered among layers of leaves. Standing beside it with the camera, I realised how much space it occupied.\n\nI also filmed the neighbouring plants. Getting to know a plant sometimes takes more than a close-up of a flower. Where it grows, what’s crowded in beside it and which way its branches reach are all part of this encounter.", "这丛木豆长得很精神，分枝舒展开来，黄色花朵散在一层层叶子间。站在旁边拍它，才发现它已经占了不小的一片空间。": "This clump was vigorous, its branches spread out and yellow flowers scattered among layers of leaves. Standing beside it with the camera, I realised how much space it occupied.", "我把镜头也留给了周围的植物。认识一种植物，有时候不能只截取一朵花：它长在哪里，旁边挤着谁，枝条又朝哪个方向伸展，都是这次相遇的一部分。": "I also filmed the neighbouring plants. Getting to know a plant sometimes takes more than a close-up of a flower. Where it grows, what’s crowded in beside it and which way its branches reach are all part of this encounter.", "黄花翻过来，背面还有条纹": "The back of the yellow flower has stripes", "木豆的花是明亮的黄色，像一只只停在枝头的小蝴蝶。花前面好看，翻到背面也有惊喜：圆圆的旗瓣上，竟然有一道道紫褐色线纹。\n\n花萼和小枝上还能看见柔毛。镜头拉近以后，这些原来容易忽略的纹理，比远看的一抹黄色更让我舍不得走开。": "The bright yellow flowers look like little butterflies resting on the branches. The front is beautiful, but the surprise came when I turned one over: thin purplish-brown lines ran across the rounded standard petal.\n\nThe calyx and young twigs were softly hairy too. Those markings that were easy to miss at a distance kept me there longer than the first flash of yellow.", "木豆的花是明亮的黄色，像一只只停在枝头的小蝴蝶。花前面好看，翻到背面也有惊喜：圆圆的旗瓣上，竟然有一道道紫褐色线纹。": "The bright yellow flowers look like little butterflies resting on the branches. The front is beautiful, but the surprise came when I turned one over: thin purplish-brown lines ran across the rounded standard petal.", "花萼和小枝上还能看见柔毛。镜头拉近以后，这些原来容易忽略的纹理，比远看的一抹黄色更让我舍不得走开。": "The calyx and young twigs were softly hairy too. Those markings that were easy to miss at a distance kept me there longer than the first flash of yellow.", "“三叶豆”的答案，就在叶子上": "Three leaflets explain another name", "木豆还有个名字叫三叶豆。托起一片叶子，三片小叶一起垂下来，名字里的“三”就找到了。\n\n把叶背转过来，浅色叶脉和细细柔毛又是另一种样子。我摸了摸，毛茸茸的。认完豆子、花和叶子，再退回来看整丛木豆，眼前这团绿色已经不再陌生。": "One Chinese name for pigeon pea is sānyèdòu, “three-leaf bean”. I held up a leaf and its three leaflets hung down together. There was the “three” in the name.\n\nOn the underside, pale veins and fine soft hairs gave it a different look. I felt the fuzziness with my fingers. After seeing seeds, flowers and leaves, I stepped back. The whole green clump was familiar now.", "木豆还有个名字叫三叶豆。托起一片叶子，三片小叶一起垂下来，名字里的“三”就找到了。": "One Chinese name for pigeon pea is sānyèdòu, “three-leaf bean”. I held up a leaf and its three leaflets hung down together. There was the “three” in the name.", "把叶背转过来，浅色叶脉和细细柔毛又是另一种样子。我摸了摸，毛茸茸的。认完豆子、花和叶子，再退回来看整丛木豆，眼前这团绿色已经不再陌生。": "On the underside, pale veins and fine soft hairs gave it a different look. I felt the fuzziness with my fingers. After seeing seeds, flowers and leaves, I stepped back. The whole green clump was familiar now."}, "20241216-01": {"从上方看花簇，细长的花蕊向四周伸展。": "Viewed from above, slender reproductive parts spread out around the cluster.", "站在开花的洋金凤旁，枝叶与人同框，可以比较植株的高度。": "A person standing beside flowering Caesalpinia pulcherrima gives a sense of its height.", "向上延伸的花序轴，两侧排列着尚未开放的花苞。": "Unopened buds line an upright inflorescence axis.", "一朵橙黄色的花伸出长蕊，旁边是细密的小叶。": "Long floral parts project from one orange-yellow flower beside fine leaflets.", "阳光下成片的花枝，橙红色点缀在绿色叶丛之间。": "Sunlit orange-red blossoms dot the foliage across a stand of plants.", "花簇近景：花苞、盛开的花和细长红蕊。": "Close-up of a cluster: buds, open flowers and slender red stamens.", "枝条上的洋金凤，花簇后方是蓝天与绿色枝叶。": "A flower cluster on a branch, with blue sky and foliage behind.", "打开的荚果，果皮内侧还能看见圆扁的种子。": "Inside the open pod, round, flat seeds are still visible.", "一片二回羽状复叶，许多小叶整齐地排在细轴两侧。": "A bipinnate leaf, with small leaflets in neat rows on either side of slender axes.", "一朵花向下探出花蕊，上方还留着数枚圆花苞。": "The reproductive parts extend down from one flower; round buds remain above.", "手中深褐色的干荚果，薄薄的果皮已经卷曲张开。": "Dry dark brown pod in a hand, its thin valves already curled open.", "蓝天下，洋金凤的花簇高低错落地伸出枝叶。": "Flower clusters rise at different heights above the foliage against a blue sky.", "侧看一朵洋金凤，细长花蕊划出向上的弧线。": "From the side, the long floral parts sweep upwards in an arc.", "花簇中，开放的花与圆圆的花苞同时可见。": "Open flowers and round buds share a cluster.", "橙红与金黄相间的花瓣，配着伸出花外的红色花蕊。": "Orange-red and gold petals with red reproductive parts extending beyond them.", "橙红花瓣配上长长的花蕊，洋金凤像一只张开翅膀的小凤凰。": "Orange-red petals and long stamens make the flower look like a little phoenix spreading its wings.", "同片提及或用于比较的对象，不另计主档案。": "Shown or mentioned for comparison in the same video. It does not add another archive entry.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智：洋金凤——中文名与物种资料入口": "iPlant: Chinese name and species information for 洋金凤", "植物科普：洋金凤": "An introduction to 洋金凤", "一只张扬的小凤凰": "A flamboyant little phoenix", "这是我很喜欢的观花灌木之一。橙红色的花配着金黄色的边，漂亮得很张扬。\n\n最抢眼的还是它的花蕊：长长地伸到花外，又弯出优美的弧线。凑近看，像不像一只正在飞翔的小凤凰，有翅膀，也有长长的尾巴？": "This is one of my favourite flowering shrubs. Its orange-red flowers have golden edges, a decidedly showy combination.\n\nWhat catches my eye most are the long reproductive parts projecting in graceful curves beyond the flower. Look closely: doesn’t it resemble a little phoenix in flight, with wings and a long tail?", "这是我很喜欢的观花灌木之一。橙红色的花配着金黄色的边，漂亮得很张扬。": "This is one of my favourite flowering shrubs. Its orange-red flowers have golden edges, a decidedly showy combination.", "最抢眼的还是它的花蕊：长长地伸到花外，又弯出优美的弧线。凑近看，像不像一只正在飞翔的小凤凰，有翅膀，也有长长的尾巴？": "What catches my eye most are the long reproductive parts projecting in graceful curves beyond the flower. Look closely: doesn’t it resemble a little phoenix in flight, with wings and a long tail?", "叶子也像要飞起来": "Even the leaves look ready to fly", "看完花，再看它的叶子。细细的叶轴分出两列羽片，羽片上又排着许多小叶，这就是二回羽状复叶。\n\n小叶一片挨着一片，轻盈又整齐。风一吹，整片叶子跟着晃起来，连我都生出一点想飞的感觉。": "After the flowers, I turned to the foliage. The slender central axis bears two rows of pinnae, and each pinna carries many leaflets. That makes it a twice-pinnate compound leaf.\n\nThe little leaflets sit neatly side by side, giving the whole thing a lightness. One gust sets the leaf swaying, and even I feel a little like taking flight.", "看完花，再看它的叶子。细细的叶轴分出两列羽片，羽片上又排着许多小叶，这就是二回羽状复叶。": "After the flowers, I turned to the foliage. The slender central axis bears two rows of pinnae, and each pinna carries many leaflets. That makes it a twice-pinnate compound leaf.", "小叶一片挨着一片，轻盈又整齐。风一吹，整片叶子跟着晃起来，连我都生出一点想飞的感觉。": "The little leaflets sit neatly side by side, giving the whole thing a lightness. One gust sets the leaf swaying, and even I feel a little like taking flight.", "花后留下薄薄的荚果": "Thin pods in place of the flowers", "洋金凤的荚果薄薄长长的，成熟后变成深褐色。手里的果皮已经裂开，有的还卷了起来。\n\n打开看，里面留着一粒粒圆扁的种子。花是热热闹闹的，果实却换成了沉静的褐色，同一株植物又有了另一副模样。": "The long, thin pods turn deep brown at maturity. The ones in my hand had split, and some of the walls had curled.\n\nInside were rounded, flattened seeds. After all the brilliance of the flowers, the quiet brown fruits gave me quite another view of the same plant.", "洋金凤的荚果薄薄长长的，成熟后变成深褐色。手里的果皮已经裂开，有的还卷了起来。": "The long, thin pods turn deep brown at maturity. The ones in my hand had split, and some of the walls had curled.", "打开看，里面留着一粒粒圆扁的种子。花是热热闹闹的，果实却换成了沉静的褐色，同一株植物又有了另一副模样。": "Inside were rounded, flattened seeds. After all the brilliance of the flowers, the quiet brown fruits gave me quite another view of the same plant.", "走近一点，比较它的身量": "Standing beside it for scale", "洋金凤和凤凰木的名字容易让人联想到一起。先看身量，是我在现场最直观的比较方法：常见的凤凰木能长成高大的乔木，洋金凤则多是灌木或小乔木。\n\n站到这株洋金凤旁边，花枝就在可以靠近观察的高度。不用仰望很远，就能看清那一只只小凤凰。": "Its Chinese name yángjīnfèng easily brings to mind fènghuángmù, the flamboyant tree. In the field, one of the most immediate comparisons is size. A flamboyant can grow into a tall tree, whereas this plant is more often a shrub or small tree.\n\nStanding beside it, I had a flowering branch within easy reach. No need to peer into a distant crown to make out the little phoenixes.", "洋金凤和凤凰木的名字容易让人联想到一起。先看身量，是我在现场最直观的比较方法：常见的凤凰木能长成高大的乔木，洋金凤则多是灌木或小乔木。": "Its Chinese name yángjīnfèng easily brings to mind fènghuángmù, the flamboyant tree. In the field, one of the most immediate comparisons is size. A flamboyant can grow into a tall tree, whereas this plant is more often a shrub or small tree.", "站到这株洋金凤旁边，花枝就在可以靠近观察的高度。不用仰望很远，就能看清那一只只小凤凰。": "Standing beside it, I had a flowering branch within easy reach. No need to peer into a distant crown to make out the little phoenixes."}, "20250211-01": {"一串小番茄的正面，较大的橙黄果与绿色小果挤在一起。": "A bunch seen from the front, with larger orange-yellow tomatoes pressed against smaller green fruits.", "垂下的番茄果串，枝叶之间透进阳光。": "Sunlight shines through a hanging bunch of tomatoes.", "一串串小番茄，从青绿到橙黄的果色同框。": "Bunches of small tomatoes show green and orange-yellow fruits together.", "手托番茄花序，盛开的黄花与未开放的花苞并列。": "A hand supports the tomato inflorescence; open yellow flowers sit beside unopened buds.", "刚开始发育的小果，顶部还保留着向外卷曲的绿色花萼。": "A developing fruit retains its green calyx, its lobes curled back.", "幼果与宿存花萼，果柄表面的细毛清晰可见。": "Young fruit with its persistent calyx; fine hairs show on the fruit stalk.", "成行的番茄植株，果串悬在枝叶之间。": "Rows of tomato plants with bunches of fruit hanging among the leaves.", "番茄叶片近景，叶面起伏，边缘有不规则的齿与缺刻。": "A tomato leaf has a rippled surface and irregular teeth and notches along its edge.", "果串近景，不同大小、不同成熟阶段的小番茄。": "A closer look at the different sizes and stages of ripeness in one cluster.", "番茄花的近景，尖尖的黄色花冠裂片向外伸展。": "A tomato flower’s pointed yellow corolla lobes spread outwards.", "番茄茎的近景，茎表面有密集的毛。": "Close-up of the densely hairy tomato stem.", "番茄手绘：叶片、花序、幼果与宿存花萼。": "Drawing of tomato: leaf, inflorescence, immature fruit and persistent calyx.", "同一花序上的花苞与黄色小花，后方是结果的植株。": "Buds and little yellow flowers on one inflorescence, in front of fruiting plants.", "番茄的新梢与叶片，逆光中能看见密密的茸毛。": "Dense hairs on a tomato shoot and its leaves, lit from behind.", "拍摄现场：站在结果的番茄植株旁，可以比较它的高度。": "Beside a fruiting tomato plant at the filming site, a person gives a sense of its height.", "侧看番茄的黄色花，花冠与中央突出的花部。": "Yellow tomato flower in side view, showing the corolla and the central protruding structures.", "从一串串小番茄，到黄色小花和毛茸茸的叶子，认识餐桌之外的番茄。": "From strings of cherry tomatoes to the yellow flowers and hairy leaves: a look at the tomato beyond the dinner table.", "同片提及或用于比较的对象，不另计主档案。": "Shown or mentioned for comparison in the same video. It does not add another archive entry.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智：番茄——中文名与物种资料入口": "iPlant: Chinese name and species information for tomato", "小番茄，一串串挂在枝头": "Little tomatoes lined up on the branches", "今天拜访的是番茄，也叫西红柿。眼前这一片是小巧的樱桃番茄，果子成串地挂在枝头，迷你又可爱。\n\n一串里不一定同时成熟：青绿的小果旁边，已经有果子开始转色。平时在餐桌上见到它们，总是一颗一颗的，走进田里才发现，原来它们是这样排队长大的。": "Today I called on the tomato, fānqié, also called xīhóngshì in Chinese. This patch was full of cherry tomatoes, small fruits hanging in delightful clusters.\n\nThey don’t all ripen at once. Beside green young fruits, others in the same cluster were already changing colour. At the table I usually see individual tomatoes. Out in the field I could see the way they form in a row.", "今天拜访的是番茄，也叫西红柿。眼前这一片是小巧的樱桃番茄，果子成串地挂在枝头，迷你又可爱。": "Today I called on the tomato, fānqié, also called xīhóngshì in Chinese. This patch was full of cherry tomatoes, small fruits hanging in delightful clusters.", "一串里不一定同时成熟：青绿的小果旁边，已经有果子开始转色。平时在餐桌上见到它们，总是一颗一颗的，走进田里才发现，原来它们是这样排队长大的。": "They don’t all ripen at once. Beside green young fruits, others in the same cluster were already changing colour. At the table I usually see individual tomatoes. Out in the field I could see the way they form in a row.", "黄色的小仙女": "A little fairy in yellow", "番茄的花也很值得看。绿色花萼向外展开，黄色花冠像一条小裙子，围着中间的花蕊。整朵花轻巧地垂在细细的花梗上，有一点小仙女的样子。\n\n花谢后，绿色花萼没有一起离开，而是留在渐渐长大的小果上。把花与幼果放在一起看，就能接上它们之间的变化。": "The flowers are worth a look too. The green calyx spreads out, and the yellow corolla hangs like a little skirt around the reproductive parts. Suspended from a slender stalk, the whole flower reminded me of a little fairy.\n\nAs the flower fades, the green calyx stays on the growing fruit. A flower beside a young tomato showed me how one stage leads to the next.", "番茄的花也很值得看。绿色花萼向外展开，黄色花冠像一条小裙子，围着中间的花蕊。整朵花轻巧地垂在细细的花梗上，有一点小仙女的样子。": "The flowers are worth a look too. The green calyx spreads out, and the yellow corolla hangs like a little skirt around the reproductive parts. Suspended from a slender stalk, the whole flower reminded me of a little fairy.", "花谢后，绿色花萼没有一起离开，而是留在渐渐长大的小果上。把花与幼果放在一起看，就能接上它们之间的变化。": "As the flower fades, the green calyx stays on the growing fruit. A flower beside a young tomato showed me how one stage leads to the next.", "我喜欢番茄叶子的味道": "The smell of a tomato leaf", "它的叶子有大有小，边缘是不整齐的锯齿和缺裂，叶面摸起来凹凸不平，还有毛茸茸、略黏的感觉。茎上的细毛也很明显，逆着光看尤其清楚。\n\n我很喜欢番茄叶子的味道：青草、泥土里夹着一点辛辣，再仔细闻，好像又有一点水果味。我把它叫作田园的味道，每次闻到都会莫名地乐呵呵。": "Some leaves were large and others small, with uneven teeth and lobes, a rippled surface, and a hairy, slightly sticky feel. Fine hairs on the stem showed especially clearly against the light.\n\nI love the smell of tomato leaves: grass and earth with a touch of spice, then perhaps something fruity if I sniff again. I call it the smell of the garden. For some reason it always makes me smile.", "它的叶子有大有小，边缘是不整齐的锯齿和缺裂，叶面摸起来凹凸不平，还有毛茸茸、略黏的感觉。茎上的细毛也很明显，逆着光看尤其清楚。": "Some leaves were large and others small, with uneven teeth and lobes, a rippled surface, and a hairy, slightly sticky feel. Fine hairs on the stem showed especially clearly against the light.", "我很喜欢番茄叶子的味道：青草、泥土里夹着一点辛辣，再仔细闻，好像又有一点水果味。我把它叫作田园的味道，每次闻到都会莫名地乐呵呵。": "I love the smell of tomato leaves: grass and earth with a touch of spice, then perhaps something fruity if I sniff again. I call it the smell of the garden. For some reason it always makes me smile.", "从餐桌回到田里": "From the table back to the field", "站到番茄植株旁边，才发现它已经长得比我还高。叶子、黄花和一串串果实挤在一起，眼前是一整株正在生活的植物。\n\n想到番茄，又忍不住想到番茄炒蛋、沙拉、意面和番茄汤。你更习惯把它当水果，还是当蔬菜呢？这一次，我先把它当作一株植物，好好认识了一遍。": "Only when I stood beside the plant did I realise it was taller than I was. Leaves, yellow flowers and bunches of fruit crowded together. A familiar ingredient was suddenly a whole living plant in front of me.\n\nTomatoes bring to mind tomatoes stir-fried with eggs, salads, pasta and soup. Do you usually think of them as fruit or as a vegetable? This time I took the time to get to know the plant itself.", "站到番茄植株旁边，才发现它已经长得比我还高。叶子、黄花和一串串果实挤在一起，眼前是一整株正在生活的植物。": "Only when I stood beside the plant did I realise it was taller than I was. Leaves, yellow flowers and bunches of fruit crowded together. A familiar ingredient was suddenly a whole living plant in front of me.", "想到番茄，又忍不住想到番茄炒蛋、沙拉、意面和番茄汤。你更习惯把它当水果，还是当蔬菜呢？这一次，我先把它当作一株植物，好好认识了一遍。": "Tomatoes bring to mind tomatoes stir-fried with eggs, salads, pasta and soup. Do you usually think of them as fruit or as a vegetable? This time I took the time to get to know the plant itself."}, "20250328-01": {"一串尚在展开的花，花苞与已张开的花瓣并列。": "In a cluster still opening, buds sit beside spread petals.", "灰褐色枝干旁，一串花与深色旧荚果同框。": "A flower cluster and a dark old pod beside a grey-brown stem.", "野外大树下的花藤，许多花序沿着枝藤垂挂。": "A flowering vine beneath a large tree, with many clusters hanging along its stems.", "花串正面，花瓣向两侧伸展，像小鸟张开翅膀。": "Seen from the front, petals spread to either side like a bird’s wings.", "花串靠在枝干旁，花瓣末端弯曲而尖翘。": "The flower cluster rests against a trunk; the petal tips curve up to points.", "花串旁还留着深色旧荚果，拍摄时近距离观察。": "A dark old pod remains beside the flowers, examined at close range while filming.", "淡绿近白的花串，单朵花的轮廓像停在枝上的小鸟。": "Nearly white, pale green flowers; each has the outline of a little bird perched on a branch.", "白花油麻藤手绘：花串、三出复叶、荚果与种子。": "Drawing of Mucuna birdwoodiana: flower cluster, trifoliate leaf, pods and seeds.", "林下的一组复叶，能看见三枚小叶。": "Compound leaves in the undergrowth, each with three leaflets.", "林下成片悬垂的淡绿色花串。": "Pale green clusters hang in profusion beneath the trees.", "近距离观察单朵花的花瓣组合。": "A single flower up close, showing how its petals fit together.", "同一花序上，不同开放阶段的淡绿色花朵。": "Pale green flowers at several stages of opening in one cluster.", "仰望林中的树冠，枝藤交错，花串悬在其间。": "Looking up into the forest canopy, strings of flowers hang between crossing branches and vines.", "林冠中的枝藤与花串，逆光下层层交织。": "Backlit vines and flower clusters overlap in the canopy.", "从枝叶下方望去，禾雀花成串悬在半空。": "Seen from below the foliage, Mucuna flowers hang in mid-air.", "掌心里的数枚扁圆种子，表面深褐而有光泽。": "Several flat, round seeds in a hand, glossy and dark brown.", "一朵侧向展开的花，能看见弯曲的花瓣轮廓。": "A sideways-facing flower shows the curve of its petals.", "两朵近看的禾雀花，浅绿色花瓣配着褐色花萼。": "Close-up of two Mucuna flowers with pale green petals and brown calyces.", "从花串下方仰看，淡绿色花朵向四周排列。": "Viewed from beneath the cluster, pale green flowers face out in all directions.", "低处的花序，贴近枝干与林下地面。": "A low inflorescence close to the trunk and woodland floor.", "抬头看，一串串花从横向枝藤间垂下。": "Looking up, strings of flowers hang from vines that stretch across the branches.", "溪涧的大树下，白花油麻藤挂满淡绿小鸟，像一场热闹的森林聚会。": "Beneath a large tree beside a stream, the vine is hung with pale green “birds.” It looks like quite a gathering in the forest.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "鸟革翚飞 禾雀归巢": "Birds in flight and sparrows returning to the nest", "香港植物标本室：白花油麻藤": "Hong Kong Herbarium: the plant known as 白花油麻藤", "森林里，小鸟们在开会": "The birds are having a meeting", "天呐，好多花！在梧桐山的溪涧里，我遇见了一株很大的禾雀花。大树下，一串串淡绿色的花挂满枝藤，像小鸟们正在参加森林聚会。\n\n一只像在认真思考，两三只像在讲悄悄话，另一群又像在商量什么雀族大事。第一次在野外遇见这么大的花藤，和公园里的感觉很不一样，实在太激动了。": "So many flowers! Beside a stream on Wutong Mountain I found a huge flowering vine. Beneath a tall tree, strings of pale green flowers hung from the woody stems like little birds at a woodland gathering.\n\nOne looked deep in thought, two or three seemed to be whispering, and another group appeared to be discussing serious bird business. This was the first time I’d come across such a large flowering vine in the wild. It felt quite different from seeing one in a park, and I was thrilled.", "天呐，好多花！在梧桐山的溪涧里，我遇见了一株很大的禾雀花。大树下，一串串淡绿色的花挂满枝藤，像小鸟们正在参加森林聚会。": "So many flowers! Beside a stream on Wutong Mountain I found a huge flowering vine. Beneath a tall tree, strings of pale green flowers hung from the woody stems like little birds at a woodland gathering.", "一只像在认真思考，两三只像在讲悄悄话，另一群又像在商量什么雀族大事。第一次在野外遇见这么大的花藤，和公园里的感觉很不一样，实在太激动了。": "One looked deep in thought, two or three seemed to be whispering, and another group appeared to be discussing serious bird business. This was the first time I’d come across such a large flowering vine in the wild. It felt quite different from seeing one in a park, and I was thrilled.", "这一种，叫白花油麻藤": "This one is Mucuna birdwoodiana", "因为花的样子像小鸟，大家习惯叫它禾雀花。我这次遇见的这一种，正式中文名是白花油麻藤。名字里有个“白”字，眼前的花却带着淡淡的绿色。\n\n凑近看，花萼像小鸟的头，旗瓣、翼瓣和龙骨瓣组合在一起，弯出有趣的轮廓。换一个角度，又像一群小鸟正低头啄米，真是越看越生动。": "People call them héquèhuā, “sparrow flowers”, for their bird-like shape. The plant I found has the Chinese name báihuā yóumáténg. Bái means white, although its flowers here had a pale green tint.\n\nThe calyx looked like a bird’s head. The standard, wing and keel petals together made its curved outline. From another angle the whole flock looked as if it had bent down to peck at grain. Each new view brought it further to life.", "因为花的样子像小鸟，大家习惯叫它禾雀花。我这次遇见的这一种，正式中文名是白花油麻藤。名字里有个“白”字，眼前的花却带着淡淡的绿色。": "People call them héquèhuā, “sparrow flowers”, for their bird-like shape. The plant I found has the Chinese name báihuā yóumáténg. Bái means white, although its flowers here had a pale green tint.", "凑近看，花萼像小鸟的头，旗瓣、翼瓣和龙骨瓣组合在一起，弯出有趣的轮廓。换一个角度，又像一群小鸟正低头啄米，真是越看越生动。": "The calyx looked like a bird’s head. The standard, wing and keel petals together made its curved outline. From another angle the whole flock looked as if it had bent down to peck at grain. Each new view brought it further to life.", "老枝上垂下新的花串": "Fresh sprays of flowers on old wood", "白花油麻藤是大型木质藤本。它的总状花序可以从老枝上长出来，一束一束地垂下，是老茎生花的有趣例子。\n\n抬头找，粗粗的枝藤间到处都是花串。再看低处，有的花苞还紧紧收着，有的已经展开，同一株上也能找到好几种花开的进度。": "Mucuna birdwoodiana is a large woody vine. Racemes can emerge from old branches and hang down in bunches, a lovely example of flowering on old wood.\n\nLooking up, I could see sprays everywhere among the thick stems. Lower down, some buds were still tightly closed while other flowers had opened. A single plant offered several stages at once.", "白花油麻藤是大型木质藤本。它的总状花序可以从老枝上长出来，一束一束地垂下，是老茎生花的有趣例子。": "Mucuna birdwoodiana is a large woody vine. Racemes can emerge from old branches and hang down in bunches, a lovely example of flowering on old wood.", "抬头找，粗粗的枝藤间到处都是花串。再看低处，有的花苞还紧紧收着，有的已经展开，同一株上也能找到好几种花开的进度。": "Looking up, I could see sprays everywhere among the thick stems. Lower down, some buds were still tightly closed while other flowers had opened. A single plant offered several stages at once.", "去年的荚果还挂在那里": "Last year’s pods were still hanging there", "看花的时候，我又发现了留在枝上的旧荚果，深深的褐色，和新花刚好同框。种子拿在手里，扁扁的，表面有光泽。\n\n这次近距离观察也有一点意外：我在花藤下兴奋地晃动枝条，后来脖子和后背又痒又痛。回头再看，花萼和荚果上的毛也成了不能忽略的细节。": "While looking at the flowers, I spotted old, deep brown pods still hanging beside the new blossom. The seeds were flat and glossy in my hand.\n\nClose inspection brought a surprise. In my excitement beneath the vine I shook a branch. Afterwards my neck and back were itchy and sore. Looking again, the hairs on the calyces and pods became details I certainly wouldn’t overlook.", "看花的时候，我又发现了留在枝上的旧荚果，深深的褐色，和新花刚好同框。种子拿在手里，扁扁的，表面有光泽。": "While looking at the flowers, I spotted old, deep brown pods still hanging beside the new blossom. The seeds were flat and glossy in my hand.", "这次近距离观察也有一点意外：我在花藤下兴奋地晃动枝条，后来脖子和后背又痒又痛。回头再看，花萼和荚果上的毛也成了不能忽略的细节。": "Close inspection brought a surprise. In my excitement beneath the vine I shook a branch. Afterwards my neck and back were itchy and sore. Looking again, the hairs on the calyces and pods became details I certainly wouldn’t overlook.", "再抬头，看一眼这场聚会": "One more look at the gathering", "我贴近花串闻了闻，气味比想象中浓，却没有别人形容得那么难接受。光顾着看花，几乎忘记了眼前还有一整片林子。\n\n退后一点再抬头，溪边的大树、交错的枝藤和成串的小鸟重新连成一幅画。原来让我惊喜的，不只是某一朵花，还有它在山里自由开放的样子。": "I leaned in to smell a cluster. The scent was stronger than I’d expected, but I didn’t find it as unpleasant as some people describe. I’d been looking so intently at the flowers that I nearly forgot the whole forest around them.\n\nI stepped back and looked up. The big trees beside the stream, the crossing vines and the strings of little birds made a picture again. The surprise was as much in the way this vine flowered freely on the mountain as in the shape of any single bloom.", "我贴近花串闻了闻，气味比想象中浓，却没有别人形容得那么难接受。光顾着看花，几乎忘记了眼前还有一整片林子。": "I leaned in to smell a cluster. The scent was stronger than I’d expected, but I didn’t find it as unpleasant as some people describe. I’d been looking so intently at the flowers that I nearly forgot the whole forest around them.", "退后一点再抬头，溪边的大树、交错的枝藤和成串的小鸟重新连成一幅画。原来让我惊喜的，不只是某一朵花，还有它在山里自由开放的样子。": "I stepped back and looked up. The big trees beside the stream, the crossing vines and the strings of little birds made a picture again. The surprise was as much in the way this vine flowered freely on the mountain as in the shape of any single bloom."}, "20250324-01": {"秋英手绘：花序、花苞、细裂的叶片与花后的果序。": "Drawing of cosmos: flower head, bud, finely divided leaves and fruiting head.", "浅粉与玫红相间的花序，中心是一簇黄色小花。": "A cluster of yellow florets at the centre of a pale pink and rose-coloured head.", "花海中的花苞，从闭合到展开的不同阶段。": "Buds in the flower patch at stages from tightly closed to opening.", "斜看粉色花序，能看见黄色管状小花从中央伸起。": "Seen at an angle, yellow tubular florets project from the middle of the pink head.", "侧看的紫红色秋英，薄薄的舌状花向外展开。": "Slender ray florets fan out from a purplish red cosmos head viewed from the side.", "高低错落的秋英，细长花梗托起一朵朵花序。": "Slender stalks lift cosmos flower heads to different heights.", "紫红色秋英近景，黄色花心与浅色纵纹形成对照。": "A purplish red head with a yellow centre and pale lengthwise streaks.", "几朵带玫红色环带的秋英，色彩与花形各有不同。": "Cosmos heads with rose-coloured rings, each slightly different in colour and form.", "一朵浅粉色秋英，周围的花与细叶虚化在背景里。": "A pale pink cosmos with other flowers and fine leaves softly blurred behind it.", "秋英的叶片细细分裂，花苞与开放的花就在旁边。": "Finely divided cosmos leaves beside buds and open blossoms.", "掌心里收集的几枚细长瘦果，末端有尖刺。": "A few long achenes in a hand, each with barbs at the tip.", "逐渐成熟的果序，细长的瘦果向外展开。": "As the fruit head ripens, long achenes spread outwards.", "花海中的果序与花苞，开花之后也有另一种姿态。": "Fruit heads and buds among the blossoms show another stage beyond flowering.", "花后发育中的果序，从上方能看见聚在一起的细长结构。": "A developing fruit head from above, showing the slender structures packed together.", "走进秋英花海，白色、粉色与紫红色的花铺开一片。": "An expanse of white, pink and purplish red cosmos flowers.", "正面看花序：外围淡粉色舌状花，基部带深色环带。": "Front view: pale pink ray florets form a darker band at their bases.", "侧面与正面的秋英同框，花梗细长，花姿轻盈。": "Cosmos heads from the side and the front on slender stalks.", "粉白与紫红的秋英，在风里轻轻摇晃；花、细叶和星星似的果序都值得看。": "Cosmos flowers in pink-white and purple-red sway in the wind. Their fine leaves and star-shaped fruit heads are worth a look as well.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "《中国植物志》第75卷：秋英——叶裂、花序与果实形态": "Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, vol. 75: leaves, flower heads and fruits of Cosmos", "波斯菊花海，先好好看一眼": "A moment in a sea of cosmos", "哇，波斯菊花海！粉的、白的、紫红的，一朵朵都很精神。它是草花花海里特别吸引我的一种，花色明亮，姿态却很轻。\n\n波斯菊的正式中文名是秋英，也常听人把它叫作格桑花。这些名字曾经让我很困惑：原来一个熟悉的称呼，并不总能指向同一种植物。先把眼前这一种秋英认识清楚吧。": "What a sea of cosmos! Pink, white and purplish red, each head bright and poised. Among massed bedding flowers it is one of my favourites: vivid colours carried with such lightness.\n\nBōsījú is the familiar Chinese name, and qiūyīng is the formal name used here. I’ve also heard it called gésānghuā. These names used to puzzle me because a familiar name doesn’t always refer to just one species. I started with the Cosmos bipinnatus in front of me.", "哇，波斯菊花海！粉的、白的、紫红的，一朵朵都很精神。它是草花花海里特别吸引我的一种，花色明亮，姿态却很轻。": "What a sea of cosmos! Pink, white and purplish red, each head bright and poised. Among massed bedding flowers it is one of my favourites: vivid colours carried with such lightness.", "波斯菊的正式中文名是秋英，也常听人把它叫作格桑花。这些名字曾经让我很困惑：原来一个熟悉的称呼，并不总能指向同一种植物。先把眼前这一种秋英认识清楚吧。": "Bōsījú is the familiar Chinese name, and qiūyīng is the formal name used here. I’ve also heard it called gésānghuā. These names used to puzzle me because a familiar name doesn’t always refer to just one species. I started with the Cosmos bipinnatus in front of me.", "一朵里面，还有许多小花": "Many flowers in a single head", "花朵大，颜色也艳丽，为什么看起来依然清新？我想，和它的排列很有关系。外围一圈舌状花轻薄地展开，表面还能看见细细的纵纹；中间则聚着许多黄色的管状小花。\n\n我们平常说的这一“朵”，其实是一个头状花序。我很着迷于它整齐又不呆板的序列感，换个角度看，细节还会跟着变化。": "With such large, colourful heads, why does the plant still look so fresh and light? I think the arrangement helps. The thin ray florets open out around the edge, with delicate lengthwise lines on their surfaces. Yellow tubular florets crowd the centre.\n\nWhat we commonly call one “flower” is really a flower head. I’m fascinated by the regularity of that arrangement without any hint of stiffness. Turn the head and the details change.", "花朵大，颜色也艳丽，为什么看起来依然清新？我想，和它的排列很有关系。外围一圈舌状花轻薄地展开，表面还能看见细细的纵纹；中间则聚着许多黄色的管状小花。": "With such large, colourful heads, why does the plant still look so fresh and light? I think the arrangement helps. The thin ray florets open out around the edge, with delicate lengthwise lines on their surfaces. Yellow tubular florets crowd the centre.", "我们平常说的这一“朵”，其实是一个头状花序。我很着迷于它整齐又不呆板的序列感，换个角度看，细节还会跟着变化。": "What we commonly call one “flower” is really a flower head. I’m fascinated by the regularity of that arrangement without any hint of stiffness. Turn the head and the details change.", "心动的可不止是花": "It isn’t only the flowers I love", "花海这么轻盈，叶子也功不可没。秋英的叶片二次羽状深裂，裂片细得像线，一层层铺在花下面。\n\n细茎、细叶配着高高举起的花序，风一来，整株都柔软地摇动起来。原来让我心动的，不只是花，也有花下的这片绿色。": "The leaves help give the whole patch its airy look. They are deeply divided twice in a pinnate pattern, with thread-like segments layered beneath the flower heads.\n\nFine stems and fine leaves hold the heads high, and the whole plant sways softly in a breeze. The green beneath the flowers is as much a part of what draws me here as the flowers themselves.", "花海这么轻盈，叶子也功不可没。秋英的叶片二次羽状深裂，裂片细得像线，一层层铺在花下面。": "The leaves help give the whole patch its airy look. They are deeply divided twice in a pinnate pattern, with thread-like segments layered beneath the flower heads.", "细茎、细叶配着高高举起的花序，风一来，整株都柔软地摇动起来。原来让我心动的，不只是花，也有花下的这片绿色。": "Fine stems and fine leaves hold the heads high, and the whole plant sways softly in a breeze. The green beneath the flowers is as much a part of what draws me here as the flowers themselves.", "花谢以后，像一颗小星星": "A little star after flowering", "再找一找花谢后的枝头。细长的瘦果聚在一起，向四周伸开，像一颗有棱角的小星星，也有一点外星生物的感觉。\n\n放到手心里看，每枚果实都是长长的一条，顶端还带着尖刺。盛开的花很好看，花后留下来的这一小簇，也很有精神。": "I looked along the branches where flowering had finished. Slender achenes gathered in clusters, radiating out like angular little stars. They looked a little otherworldly.\n\nIn my palm I could see that each fruit was long and narrow with sharp points at the tip. The open flowers are beautiful, but this little cluster afterwards has plenty of character too.", "再找一找花谢后的枝头。细长的瘦果聚在一起，向四周伸开，像一颗有棱角的小星星，也有一点外星生物的感觉。": "I looked along the branches where flowering had finished. Slender achenes gathered in clusters, radiating out like angular little stars. They looked a little otherworldly.", "放到手心里看，每枚果实都是长长的一条，顶端还带着尖刺。盛开的花很好看，花后留下来的这一小簇，也很有精神。": "In my palm I could see that each fruit was long and narrow with sharp points at the tip. The open flowers are beautiful, but this little cluster afterwards has plenty of character too."}, "20250115-01": {"叶缘近景，边缘可以看到细小的齿状突起。": "Tiny teeth along the leaf margin, in close-up.", "类芦丛内，细长叶片与茎交错向上生长。": "Slender leaves and stems interlace within a clump of Neyraudia.", "透光的叶面，平行排列的细纹清晰可见。": "Light passing through the leaf reveals fine parallel lines.", "逆光看长条形叶片，中部与两侧的绿色深浅不同。": "A backlit ribbon-like blade shows different greens along its centre and sides.", "从另一个角度观察小穗，细毛与绿色膨大结构同框。": "Another view of the spikelet’s hairs and green swelling.", "类芦下垂的花序分枝，逆光中泛着银白色。": "Drooping inflorescence branches shine silvery white when lit from behind.", "小穗的细毛间，可见深绿色的膨大结构。": "A dark green swelling shows between fine hairs on a spikelet.", "花序末梢近景，绿色膨大结构旁保留着许多细毛。": "Fine hairs around a green swelling at the tip of the inflorescence.", "类芦群落，蓬松的浅色花序在蓝天下展开。": "A stand of Neyraudia with pale, feathery plumes spread against the blue sky.", "丛生的茎与叶，基部可以看到逐渐干枯的叶鞘。": "The lowest leaf sheaths on the clumped stems are drying out.", "叶面近景，顺着叶片方向延伸的细密纹路。": "Close-up of fine lines running lengthwise along a leaf.", "叶片衬托下的小穗，近看细毛与绿色结构。": "Spikelet against a leaf, showing fine hairs and the green structure.", "茎叶近景，细长叶片从茎的不同高度伸出。": "Slender blades emerge at different heights along a stem.", "成片柔软下垂的花序，细密小穗在光里交叠。": "Many soft, nodding plumes; the small spikelets overlap in the light.", "类芦手绘：丛生植株、根部、茎节与小穗。": "Drawing of Neyraudia: clump, roots, stem nodes and spikelets.", "植株基部的茎与根，根部仍带着少量土粒。": "Stem base and roots with a few grains of soil still attached.", "比芦苇更轻盈的感觉，来自类芦细长下垂的花序，也来自风中的一片银白。": "Lighter than reeds: that impression comes from the slender, drooping plumes and the patch of silver-white they make in the wind.", "同片提及或用于比较的对象，不另计主档案。": "Shown or mentioned for comparison in the same video. It does not add another archive entry.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "植物智：类芦——中文名与物种资料入口": "iPlant: Chinese name and species information for 类芦", "一片温柔的银白": "A soft sweep of silvery white", "看，这一片植物，有没有一点“蒹葭苍苍，白露为霜”的感觉？远远望去，很容易让我想到芦苇，走近认识的却是另一种禾本科植物——类芦。\n\n我觉得它比印象里的芦苇更轻盈。浅色的花序铺开一片，风吹过的时候，细细的分枝一起晃动，温柔得很。": "Doesn’t this patch bring to mind the old lines about thick reeds and white dew turning to frost? At a distance it reminded me of reeds. Close up I found another member of the grass family, Neyraudia reynaudiana.\n\nTo me it looked more delicate than the reeds I remembered. Pale flower heads spread across the patch, their fine branches swaying together in the wind.", "看，这一片植物，有没有一点“蒹葭苍苍，白露为霜”的感觉？远远望去，很容易让我想到芦苇，走近认识的却是另一种禾本科植物——类芦。": "Doesn’t this patch bring to mind the old lines about thick reeds and white dew turning to frost? At a distance it reminded me of reeds. Close up I found another member of the grass family, Neyraudia reynaudiana.", "我觉得它比印象里的芦苇更轻盈。浅色的花序铺开一片，风吹过的时候，细细的分枝一起晃动，温柔得很。": "To me it looked more delicate than the reeds I remembered. Pale flower heads spread across the patch, their fine branches swaying together in the wind.", "细枝上，一串串小穗": "Spikelets along the fine branches", "这些像芦花的银白，近看是疏松的圆锥花序。许多细长分枝展开，又微微垂下来，每一条上都排着小穗。\n\n阳光照过来，细毛的边缘亮了起来。远看是一片朦胧的白，靠近才发现，它是由这么多细碎的结构组成的。": "The reed-like shimmer resolves into loose panicles. Many long, fine branches spread out and then droop a little, each lined with spikelets.\n\nThe hairs caught the sunlight along their edges. At a distance I had seen a haze of white. Close up it was made of innumerable small, distinct structures.", "这些像芦花的银白，近看是疏松的圆锥花序。许多细长分枝展开，又微微垂下来，每一条上都排着小穗。": "The reed-like shimmer resolves into loose panicles. Many long, fine branches spread out and then droop a little, each lined with spikelets.", "阳光照过来，细毛的边缘亮了起来。远看是一片朦胧的白，靠近才发现，它是由这么多细碎的结构组成的。": "The hairs caught the sunlight along their edges. At a distance I had seen a haze of white. Close up it was made of innumerable small, distinct structures.", "砂石堆里，藏着结实的根": "Tenacious roots in the gravel", "地上的花序轻轻软软，地下却是另一种性格。我在砂石里观察它的基部，根茎和须根缠得很结实，想把它完整看清还挺费劲。\n\n眼前这些根带着土粒，紧紧连在茎的下方。它竟然能在这样的地方长成这么高的一丛，真让人佩服。": "Above ground the flower heads were soft and light. Below ground I met another character. Looking at the base in sand and gravel, I found the rhizomes and fibrous roots so firmly entangled that getting an unobstructed view was difficult.\n\nThe roots held grains of soil and joined the stem firmly at its base. I was impressed that such a tall clump could grow in a place like this.", "地上的花序轻轻软软，地下却是另一种性格。我在砂石里观察它的基部，根茎和须根缠得很结实，想把它完整看清还挺费劲。": "Above ground the flower heads were soft and light. Below ground I met another character. Looking at the base in sand and gravel, I found the rhizomes and fibrous roots so firmly entangled that getting an unobstructed view was difficult.", "眼前这些根带着土粒，紧紧连在茎的下方。它竟然能在这样的地方长成这么高的一丛，真让人佩服。": "The roots held grains of soil and joined the stem firmly at its base. I was impressed that such a tall clump could grow in a place like this.", "细长叶片，也有锋利的一面": "Slender leaves with an edge", "再看叶子，是很熟悉的禾本科模样：长条形，向上伸出去，再慢慢弯下来。有的平展，有的边缘略略卷起。\n\n把叶缘放大，细小的齿就看得清楚了；叶尖也收得很细。远看温柔的一丛草，近看又藏着这些有棱角的小细节。": "The leaves had a familiar grass shape: long straps extending upwards, then gradually curving down. Some lay flat and others had slightly rolled margins.\n\nMagnification revealed fine teeth along each margin, and each blade narrowed to a fine point. For such a gentle-looking stand of grass, it had some distinctly sharp details.", "再看叶子，是很熟悉的禾本科模样：长条形，向上伸出去，再慢慢弯下来。有的平展，有的边缘略略卷起。": "The leaves had a familiar grass shape: long straps extending upwards, then gradually curving down. Some lay flat and others had slightly rolled margins.", "把叶缘放大，细小的齿就看得清楚了；叶尖也收得很细。远看温柔的一丛草，近看又藏着这些有棱角的小细节。": "Magnification revealed fine teeth along each margin, and each blade narrowed to a fine point. For such a gentle-looking stand of grass, it had some distinctly sharp details."}, "20250127-01": {"俯看水边的叶丛，一束束枝梢连成细密的绿色毯子。": "Seen from above at the water’s edge, bunches of shoot tips form a fine green carpet.", "拍摄时拨开叶丛，观察藏在水面附近的长茎。": "Foliage parted during filming to reveal long stems near the water surface.", "粉绿狐尾藻手绘：记录枝叶、细裂的叶片、根系和俯视枝梢。": "Drawing of Myriophyllum: foliage, finely divided leaf, roots and shoot tip from above.", "俯视枝梢的放射状纹理，粉绿狐尾藻像一朵朵绿色的小莲花。": "The radial pattern at the tops of the shoots resembles a patch of tiny green lotuses.", "镜头靠近叶丛内部，可以看清茎节与沿茎排列的羽毛状叶片。": "Inside the clump, nodes and feather-like leaves along the stems become visible.", "从侧面观察密集的枝叶，不同高度的嫩梢交叠在一起。": "Side view of dense foliage, with young shoot tips overlapping at different heights.", "成片的粉绿狐尾藻，浅绿色的枝梢像柔软的绒面。": "The pale green tips of a patch of Myriophyllum have a soft, velvety appearance.", "伸展开的一段植株，细长的茎和成束细根比水面上的叶丛更引人注意。": "A shoot laid out to show the slender stem and fine bundles of roots usually hidden below the foliage.", "粉绿狐尾藻的嫩梢从密集叶丛中挺起，细叶在茎上层层排列。": "Young shoots rise from dense Myriophyllum foliage, the fine leaves arranged in tiers along the stems.", "水下茎节的近景，浅色细根旁可见一枚带粉红色的嫩芽。": "Close-up of an underwater node: a pink-tinged bud beside pale fine roots.", "从上方看枝梢，轮生的细叶向四周展开，叶间还留着小水珠。": "Viewed from above, whorls of fine leaves fan out around water droplets.", "单片叶子的近景，两侧细裂片沿着中间的轴排列，像一小片羽毛。": "Close-up of a leaf with fine segments arranged along a central axis like a little feather.", "植株沿着浅水边缘生长，叶丛与旁边裸露的水面形成对照。": "The plant lines the margin of shallow water, beside a stretch of open water.", "远看像一张柔软的绿毯，近看又像一朵朵小莲花，水边的粉绿狐尾藻藏着羽毛般的细节。": "A soft green carpet from afar, little lotus rosettes close up. At the water’s edge the leaves have feathery details of their own.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "粉绿狐尾藻 · 叶片与水生形态": "粉绿狐尾藻: leaves and aquatic growth form", "粉绿狐尾藻 · 名称对照": "粉绿狐尾藻: comparison of names", "水边铺开了一张绿毯": "A green carpet along the water", "给大家看一种超级好玩的植物。远看好像一张柔软的毯子，近看又像一朵朵绿色的小莲花，乍一看，还有一点蓝绿色海洋的感觉。\n\n这是粉绿狐尾藻。它一束一束地长在水边，密密地靠在一起。把镜头放低，枝梢就像起伏的小浪；从上面看，又能看见一个个向四周展开的绿色图案。": "Here’s a wonderful plant to look at. From a distance it seemed a soft blanket, then close up a collection of little green lotuses. At a glance it even suggested a blue-green sea.\n\nThis is Myriophyllum aquaticum. Its shoots grow close together in bunches by the water. With the camera down low, their tips looked like little waves. From above I saw a series of green patterns radiating in every direction.", "给大家看一种超级好玩的植物。远看好像一张柔软的毯子，近看又像一朵朵绿色的小莲花，乍一看，还有一点蓝绿色海洋的感觉。": "Here’s a wonderful plant to look at. From a distance it seemed a soft blanket, then close up a collection of little green lotuses. At a glance it even suggested a blue-green sea.", "这是粉绿狐尾藻。它一束一束地长在水边，密密地靠在一起。把镜头放低，枝梢就像起伏的小浪；从上面看，又能看见一个个向四周展开的绿色图案。": "This is Myriophyllum aquaticum. Its shoots grow close together in bunches by the water. With the camera down low, their tips looked like little waves. From above I saw a series of green patterns radiating in every direction.", "一片叶子，也像一根羽毛": "A leaf as fine as a feather", "它的叶子实在太有意思了。原本远看毛茸茸的一团，放大之后，能看见两侧排列得很细的裂片，像一小根绿色羽毛。这样的叶片围着茎排列，一层接一层，才有了水面上这张蓬松的“毯子”。\n\n有的枝梢上还挂着小水珠。细叶、水珠和透进来的光挤在一起，只看这一小片，已经很有看头。": "The leaves were extraordinary. What looked like a fluffy mass from afar resolved under magnification into finely divided segments lined up on both sides, like a little green feather. Whorls of these leaves, one above the next, made the soft “carpet” on the water.\n\nSome tips still held droplets. Fine leaf segments, beads of water and light coming through them were enough to fill a frame with things to look at.", "它的叶子实在太有意思了。原本远看毛茸茸的一团，放大之后，能看见两侧排列得很细的裂片，像一小根绿色羽毛。这样的叶片围着茎排列，一层接一层，才有了水面上这张蓬松的“毯子”。": "The leaves were extraordinary. What looked like a fluffy mass from afar resolved under magnification into finely divided segments lined up on both sides, like a little green feather. Whorls of these leaves, one above the next, made the soft “carpet” on the water.", "有的枝梢上还挂着小水珠。细叶、水珠和透进来的光挤在一起，只看这一小片，已经很有看头。": "Some tips still held droplets. Fine leaf segments, beads of water and light coming through them were enough to fill a frame with things to look at.", "水面下面，比想象中还长": "Longer under the water than I expected", "光看露在外面的叶子，很容易以为它只是一小束。我把镜头移向水边，才发现叶丛下面还藏着细长的茎；拍摄时把一段植株伸展开来，长度让我吃了一惊。\n\n茎上还能看到一束束细根。有些嫩的部位泛着粉红，在近景里特别有生命力。原来水面上整齐的小绿丛，下面还有这么长的一段故事。": "From the leaves above the surface I might have guessed this was just a short tuft. Turning the camera towards the edge revealed slender stems beneath the leaves. When I stretched out one length of the plant for the shot, its length took me by surprise.\n\nBunches of fine roots grew from the stems. Some tender parts had a pink flush that was especially striking in close-up. There was quite a length of stem behind each neat little tuft above the water.", "光看露在外面的叶子，很容易以为它只是一小束。我把镜头移向水边，才发现叶丛下面还藏着细长的茎；拍摄时把一段植株伸展开来，长度让我吃了一惊。": "From the leaves above the surface I might have guessed this was just a short tuft. Turning the camera towards the edge revealed slender stems beneath the leaves. When I stretched out one length of the plant for the shot, its length took me by surprise.", "茎上还能看到一束束细根。有些嫩的部位泛着粉红，在近景里特别有生命力。原来水面上整齐的小绿丛，下面还有这么长的一段故事。": "Bunches of fine roots grew from the stems. Some tender parts had a pink flush that was especially striking in close-up. There was quite a length of stem behind each neat little tuft above the water.", "换个距离，再看看这一片绿": "The same green from a different distance", "一周前来时，眼前还是一小片；再扛着设备回来，看到的叶丛已经密集了许多。这是这次拍摄里很直观的变化，也让我从感叹它好看，转而留意它怎样占据水面。\n\n名字里虽然有一个“藻”字，粉绿狐尾藻却是小二仙草科的被子植物。记住这个小反差，再从水边退远一点：那一片看起来软软的绿毯，原来是许多精细枝叶共同组成的。": "A week earlier I had found a small patch. When I returned with my equipment, the foliage had grown noticeably denser. Seeing that change drew my attention beyond its beauty to the way it occupied the water surface.\n\nIts Chinese name includes zǎo, a word used for algae, but this is a flowering plant in the family Haloragaceae. Remembering that contrast, I stepped back again. The soft-looking green blanket was the work of many intricately divided leaves and shoots.", "一周前来时，眼前还是一小片；再扛着设备回来，看到的叶丛已经密集了许多。这是这次拍摄里很直观的变化，也让我从感叹它好看，转而留意它怎样占据水面。": "A week earlier I had found a small patch. When I returned with my equipment, the foliage had grown noticeably denser. Seeing that change drew my attention beyond its beauty to the way it occupied the water surface.", "名字里虽然有一个“藻”字，粉绿狐尾藻却是小二仙草科的被子植物。记住这个小反差，再从水边退远一点：那一片看起来软软的绿毯，原来是许多精细枝叶共同组成的。": "Its Chinese name includes zǎo, a word used for algae, but this is a flowering plant in the family Haloragaceae. Remembering that contrast, I stepped back again. The soft-looking green blanket was the work of many intricately divided leaves and shoots."}, "20250225-01": {"成簇的下垂花序，外侧苞片与鲜亮花瓣形成颜色对照。": "Hanging heads with vivid petals contrasting against the outer bracts.", "红花荷枝条上的叶与下垂花序，叶片深绿的正面和较浅的背面同时入镜。": "Rhodoleia leaves and hanging flower heads; dark green upper and paler lower leaf surfaces are both visible.", "掌心托着枝上留下的干燥果序，木质果壳已经张开。": "A hand supports an old fruiting head still on its branch, the woody cases already open.", "从花序侧下方观察，向外伸展的花瓣和雄蕊清晰可见。": "From slightly below and to one side, the spreading petals and stamens are clear.", "同一段枝条上，干燥的旧果序与正在开放的花序相邻。": "An old, dry fruiting head beside a newly opening inflorescence on the same branch.", "手持枝条翻看叶片，比较叶的两面和藏在叶间的花序。": "Turning the branch by hand to compare both sides of the leaf and find flower clusters tucked among them.", "摊开观察的花序，匙形花瓣间可见细长的雄蕊。": "A flower head spread open to show slender stamens among spoon-shaped petals.", "展开的红色花序近景，花瓣与许多雄蕊向外舒展。": "An open red flower head, its petals and many stamens spreading outwards.", "逆光中的花序，花丝与花瓣边缘透出明亮的轮廓。": "Backlighting outlines the filaments and the edges of the petals.", "山上拍摄时抬头观察开花的枝条，远处可见山下的城市。": "Looking up at a flowering branch on the mountain, with the city visible below in the distance.", "红花荷手绘：记录花枝、叶片、花序、果序及花部细节。": "Drawing of Rhodoleia: flowering branch, leaf, flower and fruit clusters, and floral details.", "侧看红花荷的下垂花序，粉红花瓣从褐红色苞片之间伸出。": "Side view of a hanging flower head, pink petals emerging between reddish brown bracts.", "枝条上的两簇红花荷，一簇低垂，一簇已向外展开。": "Two Rhodoleia heads on a branch: one nodding, the other already spread open.", "尚未完全展开的下垂花序，苞片与重叠的花瓣像一盏小灯。": "A partly opened, hanging head; its bracts and overlapping petals resemble a little lamp.", "抬头看枝条下方展开的花序，粉红花瓣映着叶片与天空。": "Looking up at the open heads beneath the branch, the pink petals stand out against foliage and sky.", "向上看开满花的树冠，粉红花序点缀在深绿色叶片之间。": "Looking up at a canopy of dark green leaves dotted with pink flower heads.", "枝叶间相邻的几个花序，上端的苞片层层包着花。": "Several neighbouring flower heads with overlapping bracts enclosing their upper ends.", "山上还挂着满树红花，抬头看花序，低头找旧果序，认识一款长在树上的“小荷花”。": "The hillside tree is still hung with red flowers. Look up for their clusters and down for the old fruit heads of a tree that seems to bear “lotuses.”", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "红花荷 · 花序、叶与果序形态": "红花荷: inflorescences, leaves and fruiting structures", "挂在树上的“小荷花”": "Little “lotuses” hanging in a tree", "给大家介绍一款挂在树上的“荷花”。山脚的花已经渐渐凋谢，往山上走，还能遇到开得热闹的枝头。这次拍摄的地方大约海拔九百米，抬头一看，满树都是粉红色。\n\n它叫红花荷。花藏在叶子下面，常常低着头；站到树下换个角度，那些小小的粉红色轮廓，真的有一点挂在枝头的荷花的意思。": "Here is a “lotus” that hangs in a tree. At the foot of the mountain the flowers had begun to fade. Higher up I still found branches in full bloom. I filmed these at about 900 metres above sea level, looking up into a crown full of pink.\n\nThis is hónghuāhé, Rhodoleia championii. The flowers hide below the leaves and often hang down. From beneath the tree those little pink outlines really did look like lotuses suspended from the branches.", "给大家介绍一款挂在树上的“荷花”。山脚的花已经渐渐凋谢，往山上走，还能遇到开得热闹的枝头。这次拍摄的地方大约海拔九百米，抬头一看，满树都是粉红色。": "Here is a “lotus” that hangs in a tree. At the foot of the mountain the flowers had begun to fade. Higher up I still found branches in full bloom. I filmed these at about 900 metres above sea level, looking up into a crown full of pink.", "它叫红花荷。花藏在叶子下面，常常低着头；站到树下换个角度，那些小小的粉红色轮廓，真的有一点挂在枝头的荷花的意思。": "This is hónghuāhé, Rhodoleia championii. The flowers hide below the leaves and often hang down. From beneath the tree those little pink outlines really did look like lotuses suspended from the branches.", "看起来一朵，其实是一簇": "What looks like one flower is a cluster", "靠近看，花序外面还有一层层很有特色的苞片，像给花围上了小披肩。再把视线移到里面，匙形的花瓣向外展开，细长的雄蕊挤在其间，细节比远看丰富得多。\n\n我一开始把眼前这一簇当成了一朵大花，查资料才知道，这里看见的是头状花序。换一个观察单位，同样一簇花，就有了新的看法。": "Up close I saw layers of distinctive bracts around the head, like a little cape. Inside, spoon-shaped petals spread out among crowded slender stamens. There was much more to see than the distant view suggested.\n\nI had taken the whole cluster for one big flower. Reading about it, I learned that I was looking at a flower head. Changing what I counted as a flower changed how I saw the very same cluster.", "靠近看，花序外面还有一层层很有特色的苞片，像给花围上了小披肩。再把视线移到里面，匙形的花瓣向外展开，细长的雄蕊挤在其间，细节比远看丰富得多。": "Up close I saw layers of distinctive bracts around the head, like a little cape. Inside, spoon-shaped petals spread out among crowded slender stamens. There was much more to see than the distant view suggested.", "我一开始把眼前这一簇当成了一朵大花，查资料才知道，这里看见的是头状花序。换一个观察单位，同样一簇花，就有了新的看法。": "I had taken the whole cluster for one big flower. Reading about it, I learned that I was looking at a flower head. Changing what I counted as a flower changed how I saw the very same cluster.", "花还在开，旧果序也还在": "Fresh flowers beside last season’s fruit", "除了花，枝头还留着一些深褐色的小东西。拿近一点看，是已经干燥的果序，果壳张开以后，几枚聚在一起，轮廓也像一朵小花。\n\n今年的花正在开放，旧果序还挂在旁边。新鲜的粉红色与干燥的褐色出现在同一段枝条上，很容易让人把花开花落的过程连起来。": "There were also little dark brown structures on the branches. A closer look showed dried fruit clusters. Several open capsules together had the outline of a small flower.\n\nThis year’s flowers were opening beside the old clusters. Fresh pink and dry brown on the same stretch of branch made it easy to connect one stage with the next.", "除了花，枝头还留着一些深褐色的小东西。拿近一点看，是已经干燥的果序，果壳张开以后，几枚聚在一起，轮廓也像一朵小花。": "There were also little dark brown structures on the branches. A closer look showed dried fruit clusters. Several open capsules together had the outline of a small flower.", "今年的花正在开放，旧果序还挂在旁边。新鲜的粉红色与干燥的褐色出现在同一段枝条上，很容易让人把花开花落的过程连起来。": "This year’s flowers were opening beside the old clusters. Fresh pink and dry brown on the same stretch of branch made it easy to connect one stage with the next.", "把叶子翻过来看看": "Turn a leaf over", "再看叶子。正面深绿而有光泽，翻过来却是浅浅的灰白色，摸起来也很厚实。原来花就这样被一片片革质叶遮在下面，难怪不走到树下，容易错过它们。\n\n这次视频还留下了观察花蜜和来访昆虫的片段。花序、叶片、旧果壳，各看一眼，再抬头看整棵树，红花荷的样子就慢慢完整了。": "The upper surface of a leaf is dark green and glossy. Its underside is pale greyish white, and the blade feels thick. These leathery leaves shelter the flower heads underneath. No wonder I might miss them unless I stood beneath the tree.\n\nThe video also includes glimpses of nectar and visiting insects. A look at a flower head, a leaf and an old capsule, then a look at the whole tree: my picture of this rhodoleia was gradually coming together.", "再看叶子。正面深绿而有光泽，翻过来却是浅浅的灰白色，摸起来也很厚实。原来花就这样被一片片革质叶遮在下面，难怪不走到树下，容易错过它们。": "The upper surface of a leaf is dark green and glossy. Its underside is pale greyish white, and the blade feels thick. These leathery leaves shelter the flower heads underneath. No wonder I might miss them unless I stood beneath the tree.", "这次视频还留下了观察花蜜和来访昆虫的片段。花序、叶片、旧果壳，各看一眼，再抬头看整棵树，红花荷的样子就慢慢完整了。": "The video also includes glimpses of nectar and visiting insects. A look at a flower head, a leaf and an old capsule, then a look at the whole tree: my picture of this rhodoleia was gradually coming together."}, "20250304-01": {"站在花田中观察，黄色小花和细长果荚交错分布在枝条上。": "Among the flowers, little yellow blossoms and long, narrow pods alternate along the branches.", "枝梢上逐渐展开的黄花，背景是远山与成片花田。": "Yellow flowers opening towards the shoot tip, with distant hills and fields behind.", "蜜蜂停在黄色小花上，身体和花蕊都进入近景。": "A bee on a yellow flower, its body close beside the flower’s reproductive parts.", "植株下部茎叶与上部花果一同入镜，呈现整株的生长姿态。": "The lower leaves and upper flowers and fruits show the whole plant’s habit.", "从侧面观察茎与叶，叶片表面的纹理和叶缘起伏清晰可见。": "Side view of the stem and leaves, showing surface texture and wavy edges.", "仰看花田内的茎与分枝，果荚在枝条间形成细密的线条。": "Looking up among the stems and branches, the pods form a web of fine lines.", "一只蜜蜂飞向枝梢，黄色花朵旁可见它悬空的身影。": "A bee hovers beside a yellow flower on its way to the shoot tip.", "手边几枚尚青绿的长果荚，适合近距离观察它们的形状。": "Several long, still-green pods held up close.", "一株花果并存的枝条，上端仍有黄花，下方已有许多细长果荚。": "One branch still bears flowers above and many slender pods below.", "芸薹手绘：记录花枝、茎叶、四瓣小花、果荚及种子排列。": "Drawing of Brassica: flowering shoot, stems and leaves, four-petalled flowers, pods and seed arrangement.", "四片花瓣在镜头前平展，细长果荚和更多黄花留在背景中。": "Four petals lie open towards the lens, with narrow pods and other flowers behind.", "山谷中的一片油菜花，明亮的黄色与远处山林相接。": "A bright yellow oilseed field meeting distant woodland in the valley.", "向上拍摄结着果荚的高枝，细长的轮廓映在天空中。": "Looking up at tall fruiting shoots, their slim pods silhouetted against the sky.", "从另一帧观察花枝，开放的小花与上方花蕾相互衔接。": "Another frame shows open flowers leading into buds above.", "芸薹植株的茎叶近景，浅绿色茎上长着较宽的叶片。": "Broad Brassica leaves on a pale green stem.", "花序近景，四片黄色花瓣向四周展开，花蕾聚在枝梢。": "Four yellow petals spread in each open flower, with more buds at the shoot tip.", "在山谷里找到一片油菜花，从四片黄色花瓣看到细长果荚，把春天和芸薹一起记下来。": "In a valley I came upon a field of yellow Brassica flowers. From four petals to a long seedpod, a small record of spring.", "本期比较提及的油菜类别，不作为本档案主对象。": "A type of oilseed rape mentioned for comparison.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本期采用芸薹油用变种名 Brassica rapa var. oleifera。POWO将该名称归入接受种 Brassica rapa，分类表保留接受种级；本期采用名及其异名记录另列。": "The manuscript uses the oilseed variety name Brassica rapa var. oleifera. POWO places it under the accepted species Brassica rapa. The species row uses that accepted name; the name used for this video and its synonym record are listed separately.", "Brassica rapa var. oleifera · 本期采用名与接受名对应": "Brassica rapa var. oleifera: name used in the manuscript and accepted name", "哇，我们找到春天了": "There it is: spring!", "在山谷里发现了一片油菜花。黄澄澄，亮堂堂，远处有山，眼前有花，看到这样的画面，心情一下子就好了起来。\n\n我把镜头伸进花丛，忽然觉得自己好像变成了一个小人，可以在花枝下走来走去，在田垄边悠闲地散步。原来春天不只是一片远看的颜色，也藏在这样一根根花枝之间。": "We found a patch of flowering oilseed rape in the valley. Bright yellow flowers in front of us, mountains in the distance: the sight lifted my spirits at once.\n\nI pushed the camera into the flowers and felt as if I’d shrunk small enough to wander beneath the stems or take a stroll along the ridge of soil. Spring was more than a distant sweep of colour. It was there between the individual flowering branches.", "在山谷里发现了一片油菜花。黄澄澄，亮堂堂，远处有山，眼前有花，看到这样的画面，心情一下子就好了起来。": "We found a patch of flowering oilseed rape in the valley. Bright yellow flowers in front of us, mountains in the distance: the sight lifted my spirits at once.", "我把镜头伸进花丛，忽然觉得自己好像变成了一个小人，可以在花枝下走来走去，在田垄边悠闲地散步。原来春天不只是一片远看的颜色，也藏在这样一根根花枝之间。": "I pushed the camera into the flowers and felt as if I’d shrunk small enough to wander beneath the stems or take a stroll along the ridge of soil. Spring was more than a distant sweep of colour. It was there between the individual flowering branches.", "四片花瓣，蜜蜂好忙": "Four petals and busy bees", "近看，一朵小花的四片花瓣向四周平展开，像一个小小的十字。枝梢上还有没开的花蕾，下面已经张开的花一朵接着一朵。\n\n花丛里的蜜蜂很匆忙：停一下这一朵，又飞向下一朵。跟着它移动镜头，才发现一小段枝条里也有这么多热闹。": "Up close, the four petals of each little flower spread out flat like a cross. Unopened buds remained at the tips of the shoots, with a succession of open flowers below.\n\nBees hurried from one flower to the next, pausing only briefly. As I followed one with the camera, even a short piece of stem turned out to be full of activity.", "近看，一朵小花的四片花瓣向四周平展开，像一个小小的十字。枝梢上还有没开的花蕾，下面已经张开的花一朵接着一朵。": "Up close, the four petals of each little flower spread out flat like a cross. Unopened buds remained at the tips of the shoots, with a succession of open flowers below.", "花丛里的蜜蜂很匆忙：停一下这一朵，又飞向下一朵。跟着它移动镜头，才发现一小段枝条里也有这么多热闹。": "Bees hurried from one flower to the next, pausing only briefly. As I followed one with the camera, even a short piece of stem turned out to be full of activity.", "花下面，已经有果荚了": "There are already pods beneath the flowers", "油菜为什么叫油菜？名字里的“油”，让人想到它的种子。开花的枝条下面，已经能看见一根根细长的青绿色果荚。把手放在旁边比一比，细细的一枚，里面还藏着后面的生长过程。\n\n从整片花田收回视线，再看眼前的花、花蕾和长角果，它们正在同一株上接续出现。花田好看，花田里这些不那么醒目的小线条，也很值得拍下来。": "Why does the Chinese name yóucài include “oil”? It brings the seeds to mind. Below the flowers, long slender green pods had already appeared. I held my hand beside one for scale. Such a slim pod still had much growing to do.\n\nI drew my gaze back from the whole field to flowers, buds and siliques appearing in succession on one plant. The field was lovely, but those quieter little lines among the flowers were worth photographing too.", "油菜为什么叫油菜？名字里的“油”，让人想到它的种子。开花的枝条下面，已经能看见一根根细长的青绿色果荚。把手放在旁边比一比，细细的一枚，里面还藏着后面的生长过程。": "Why does the Chinese name yóucài include “oil”? It brings the seeds to mind. Below the flowers, long slender green pods had already appeared. I held my hand beside one for scale. Such a slim pod still had much growing to do.", "从整片花田收回视线，再看眼前的花、花蕾和长角果，它们正在同一株上接续出现。花田好看，花田里这些不那么醒目的小线条，也很值得拍下来。": "I drew my gaze back from the whole field to flowers, buds and siliques appearing in succession on one plant. The field was lovely, but those quieter little lines among the flowers were worth photographing too.", "飞入菜花无处寻": "Lost among the yellow blossoms", "眼前的花让我想起杨万里的诗：“儿童急走追黄蝶，飞入菜花无处寻。”这一次就勉强把我也当成那个在菜花边探头探脑的小孩吧。\n\n这次认识的是芸薹，采用油用变种名 Brassica rapa var. oleifera。蹲下来能看见小花与果荚，站起来又是一片亮堂堂的黄色。把整株的样子也画下来，好像就把这一天的春天留住了。": "The scene brought back a poem by Yang Wanli: children run after a yellow butterfly, only to lose sight of it among yellow rape flowers. This time you can picture me as that child peering in among the stems.\n\nHere I’m recording the oilseed variety Brassica rapa var. oleifera. Crouching, I could see the little flowers and pods. Standing, I saw the whole field shining yellow. Drawing the plant felt like a way of keeping that spring day.", "眼前的花让我想起杨万里的诗：“儿童急走追黄蝶，飞入菜花无处寻。”这一次就勉强把我也当成那个在菜花边探头探脑的小孩吧。": "The scene brought back a poem by Yang Wanli: children run after a yellow butterfly, only to lose sight of it among yellow rape flowers. This time you can picture me as that child peering in among the stems.", "这次认识的是芸薹，采用油用变种名 Brassica rapa var. oleifera。蹲下来能看见小花与果荚，站起来又是一片亮堂堂的黄色。把整株的样子也画下来，好像就把这一天的春天留住了。": "Here I’m recording the oilseed variety Brassica rapa var. oleifera. Crouching, I could see the little flowers and pods. Standing, I saw the whole field shining yellow. Drawing the plant felt like a way of keeping that spring day."}, "20250106-01": {"花序转为褐色的阶段，细长结构渐渐失去鲜亮颜色。": "A browning head whose slender structures are losing their bright colour.", "叶轴上的腺体近景，浅绿色的隆起位于分枝叶片之间。": "Close-up of a gland on the leaf axis, a pale green bump between the leaf divisions.", "银合欢手绘：记录叶枝、花球、小花、荚果和种子。": "Drawing of Leucaena: leafy branch, flower heads, individual flower, pod and seeds.", "剖开的银合欢荚果，扁平果壳内的种子沿长轴排成一行。": "In a split Leucaena pod, seeds form one row along the flat case.", "嫩叶间几枚圆圆的绿色花蕾球，等待下一次开放。": "Round green heads of unopened buds among the young leaves.", "同一段枝条上，有尚绿的花蕾球、开放花球和已经转褐的旧花序。": "Green heads of buds, open heads and older brown heads share one branch.", "从侧面观察叶轴腺体，圆而浅的中心轮廓清楚可见。": "From the side, the rounded gland on the leaf axis has a shallow, clearly defined centre.", "开放的白色小花球近景，许多细长的花丝向外伸展。": "Many long filaments extend from the little white flower head.", "仰看树干分枝与叶冠，银合欢从近处看也有完整的小乔木姿态。": "Looking up the branching trunk into the canopy gives a close view of the small tree’s form.", "尚未开放的花蕾球，绿色小花蕾一颗颗紧挨在一起。": "Unopened green flower buds packed tightly into a ball.", "完整的球形花序，白色花丝围着浅绿色的中心展开。": "A round flower head, with white filaments spreading around a pale green centre.", "树干表面浅褐色树皮的近景，可见细小裂纹与起伏。": "Light brown bark in close-up, with fine cracks and uneven contours.", "蓝天下的枝条上，浅绿色花蕾球与羽状复叶同时出现。": "Pale green balls of buds and feathery leaves against a blue sky.", "分离出来的一朵小花，浅绿色的基部上伸出细长的花丝。": "A single flower separated from the head: fine filaments rise from its pale green base.", "走进拍摄地点的银合欢林，树干和细叶在路两侧交织。": "At the filming site, Leucaena trunks and fine foliage line both sides of the path.", "阳光从银合欢细密的复叶之间穿过，成排小叶呈现明暗变化。": "Sunlight makes alternating light and shadow across rows of fine Leucaena leaflets.", "掌心里的褐色种子，扁平而有光泽，大小可与手指比较。": "Shiny flat brown seeds in a hand, with fingers for scale.", "开放的花球与褐色旧花序相邻，旁边伸着整齐的小叶。": "An open head beside a brown old one, next to neat rows of leaflets.", "花球下方已有细长的绿色幼荚，枝条上保留着不同阶段。": "Young, narrow green pods beneath a flower head show several stages on one branch.", "银合欢的二回羽状复叶向外舒展，叶间夹着小花球。": "Bipinnate leaves spread out around small, round flower heads.", "从另一个角度看白色花球，细小花朵在球面上密集排列。": "Another angle shows tiny flowers tightly packed across the surface of the white head.", "从一把果荚到一团白色小花球，再到细细的羽状叶，看看路边常见的银合欢。": "A handful of pods, a ball of white flowers and fine, feathery leaves: three ways to recognise a familiar roadside tree.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "银合欢 · 复叶、花序、荚果与叶轴腺体": "银合欢: compound leaves, flower heads, pods and glands on the leaf axis", "一个好听的名字，一片熟悉的绿": "A lovely name for a familiar patch of green", "我身后的这些植物，有一个很好听的名字——银合欢。在深圳的路边、山边、水沟旁，常常会见到它；不专门停下来时，它也许只是一片熟悉的绿色背景。\n\n这次走进拍摄的这片林子，细细的树干向上伸，叶子把光筛成小块。先别急着给它的各种外号下结论，我们从眼前看得见的部分认识它。": "The trees behind me have a name I like: yínhéhuān. In Shenzhen I often see them by roads, at the foot of hills and beside drainage channels. Unless I stop, they can be just part of a familiar green backdrop.\n\nThis time I walked into the little stand I was filming. Slender trunks reached upwards and the leaves filtered the light into small patches. Before getting caught up in the plant’s various nicknames, I wanted to see what was in front of me.", "我身后的这些植物，有一个很好听的名字——银合欢。在深圳的路边、山边、水沟旁，常常会见到它；不专门停下来时，它也许只是一片熟悉的绿色背景。": "The trees behind me have a name I like: yínhéhuān. In Shenzhen I often see them by roads, at the foot of hills and beside drainage channels. Unless I stop, they can be just part of a familiar green backdrop.", "这次走进拍摄的这片林子，细细的树干向上伸，叶子把光筛成小块。先别急着给它的各种外号下结论，我们从眼前看得见的部分认识它。": "This time I walked into the little stand I was filming. Slender trunks reached upwards and the leaves filtered the light into small patches. Before getting caught up in the plant’s various nicknames, I wanted to see what was in front of me.", "一把果荚，里面有多少种子": "How many seeds in a handful of pods?", "枝头的果荚长成了一把一把，远看有一点像扫把。打开一枚，扁平的果壳里，褐色种子排得整整齐齐。再把种子倒在掌心，形状又有一点像小小的西瓜籽。\n\n“这一把里面到底有多少颗？”拍摄时数着数着，我忍不住感叹起来。相比抽象地说它结果多，一枚打开的荚果、一把放在手心里的种子，更能让我记住它。": "Bunches of pods at the ends of the branches looked rather like little brooms. I opened one. Brown seeds lay neatly in a row inside the flattened pod. Tipped into my hand, they looked a little like small watermelon seeds.\n\n“Just how many are there in this bunch?” I found myself exclaiming as I counted. An open pod and a palmful of seeds told me more than simply saying this tree produces a lot of fruit.", "枝头的果荚长成了一把一把，远看有一点像扫把。打开一枚，扁平的果壳里，褐色种子排得整整齐齐。再把种子倒在掌心，形状又有一点像小小的西瓜籽。": "Bunches of pods at the ends of the branches looked rather like little brooms. I opened one. Brown seeds lay neatly in a row inside the flattened pod. Tipped into my hand, they looked a little like small watermelon seeds.", "“这一把里面到底有多少颗？”拍摄时数着数着，我忍不住感叹起来。相比抽象地说它结果多，一枚打开的荚果、一把放在手心里的种子，更能让我记住它。": "“Just how many are there in this bunch?” I found myself exclaiming as I counted. An open pod and a palmful of seeds told me more than simply saying this tree produces a lot of fruit.", "毛茸茸的小花球": "Fuzzy white flower heads", "再来看看花。一团一团白白的，是不是很可爱？这个小球由许多小花聚在一起组成，向外伸出的细长花丝，让它看起来毛茸茸的。\n\n还没开的花蕾球是绿色的，一颗颗小花蕾紧挨在一起；有的已经开放，有的开始转褐，旁边还有刚长出来的绿色小荚果。沿着枝条找过去，能看见好几个不同的阶段。": "Aren’t those little white balls appealing? Each is a cluster of small flowers. The long, fine filaments projecting in every direction give it a fuzzy outline.\n\nUnopened heads were green balls of tightly packed buds. Some heads had opened, others had begun to turn brown, and nearby I found tiny new green pods. Following a branch brought several stages into view.", "再来看看花。一团一团白白的，是不是很可爱？这个小球由许多小花聚在一起组成，向外伸出的细长花丝，让它看起来毛茸茸的。": "Aren’t those little white balls appealing? Each is a cluster of small flowers. The long, fine filaments projecting in every direction give it a fuzzy outline.", "还没开的花蕾球是绿色的，一颗颗小花蕾紧挨在一起；有的已经开放，有的开始转褐，旁边还有刚长出来的绿色小荚果。沿着枝条找过去，能看见好几个不同的阶段。": "Unopened heads were green balls of tightly packed buds. Some heads had opened, others had begun to turn brown, and nearby I found tiny new green pods. Following a branch brought several stages into view.", "叶子也要认真看一眼": "Take a good look at the leaves too", "终于看到叶子了，我很喜欢它的样子。银合欢是二回羽状复叶：先分成一列列羽片，羽片上再排列着许多小叶。光从缝隙里透下来，细细的一片，也能织出很漂亮的树影。\n\n把镜头再移近，叶轴上还能找到小小的腺体，像一个浅坑。果荚、花球、复叶和这个小细节连在一起，下次在路边再遇到银合欢，就不只是认出一片绿了。": "At last I came to the leaves, and I loved their form. Leucaena has twice-pinnate leaves: the central axis carries rows of pinnae, each bearing many leaflets. Light comes through the gaps, and even these fine blades weave beautiful shadows.\n\nCloser still, a small gland on the leaf axis looked like a shallow pit. Pods, round flower heads, compound leaves and that tiny detail give me much more than a patch of green to recognise next time I see it by the road.", "终于看到叶子了，我很喜欢它的样子。银合欢是二回羽状复叶：先分成一列列羽片，羽片上再排列着许多小叶。光从缝隙里透下来，细细的一片，也能织出很漂亮的树影。": "At last I came to the leaves, and I loved their form. Leucaena has twice-pinnate leaves: the central axis carries rows of pinnae, each bearing many leaflets. Light comes through the gaps, and even these fine blades weave beautiful shadows.", "把镜头再移近，叶轴上还能找到小小的腺体，像一个浅坑。果荚、花球、复叶和这个小细节连在一起，下次在路边再遇到银合欢，就不只是认出一片绿了。": "Closer still, a small gland on the leaf axis looked like a shallow pit. Pods, round flower heads, compound leaves and that tiny detail give me much more than a patch of green to recognise next time I see it by the road."}, "20241223-01": {"从植株下方向上看，许多宽大叶片在头顶舒展开。": "Broad leaves spread overhead as seen from beneath the plant.", "成丛生长的蕉类植株，叶片展开在粗壮的假茎上方。": "Broad leaves spread above the thick pseudostems of a banana clump.", "本期主对象的绿色香蕉果串，果实分层向上弯曲排列。": "The video’s main subject: a bunch of green bananas curving upwards in tiers.", "蕉果靠近镜头的细节，绿色果皮与顶端深色残余形成对照。": "Close-up showing the contrast between the green skin and the dark remnants at the tip.", "视频中的蕉丛生境记录，拍摄者站在大叶下面观察。": "The observer stands beneath the large leaves in the habitat filmed for the video.", "绿色蕉果近景，果实顶端还留有干燥的花部残余。": "Dry floral remnants cling to the tips of the green bananas.", "逆光观察叶片，粗壮的中脉与两侧细密的侧脉形成整齐纹理。": "Backlighting picks out the thick midrib and densely packed side veins.", "拍摄时近看蕉类假茎，层层叶鞘沿着植株基部向上包裹。": "Close-up of the banana pseudostem: layers of leaf sheaths wrap upwards from the base.", "视频记录的蕉类大叶，叶面水珠沿着清晰的叶脉分布。": "Water droplets follow the veins of a broad banana leaf filmed in the video.", "从叶子下面仰看，阳光把宽大的蕉叶照成明亮的绿色。": "Looking up through the banana leaf, sunlight turns the broad blade a bright green.", "切开的实物果实横面，浅色果肉中央可见少量深色小点。": "Fruit in cross-section, with a few dark specks at the centre of the pale flesh.", "本期蕉类观察手绘：记录植株、叶片、花果与剖面。": "Drawing from the banana observation: plant, leaves, flowers, fruits and cross-sections.", "站在蕉丛下比较植株高度，大叶与人的身形形成直观对照。": "A person beneath the banana clump gives a sense of the plants’ height.", "叶丛中的一串绿色蕉果，从侧面看见各层果实的排列。": "Side view of tiers of green bananas among the leaves.", "从一丛像树的大草，到一片遮住天空的绿叶，再看看熟悉的香蕉果实。": "Start with a clump of enormous tree-like herbs and a green leaf broad enough to blot out the sky, then turn to the familiar fruits of the banana.", "同片对照称呼，未进一步确定其具体种名。": "A name used for comparison in the same video. The species has not been determined.", "同片提及的对象，不另计主档案。": "Mentioned in the same video and counted within this record.", "同片提及的栽培类别或品种称呼，未认定为本期镜头主对象。": "A crop type or cultivar designation mentioned in the video. It has not been identified as the main plant filmed.", "同一期视频里提及或对照了这些对象。这里单独列出，与本篇主对象区分。": "These organisms are mentioned or compared in the same video and are listed separately from the main subject.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "多类栽培或杂交香蕉的集合称呼；不是单一具体栽培品种的确认": "A collective name for cultivated and hybrid bananas, without a claim to one specific cultivar.", "Musa 'Hybrids' 是植物智采用的栽培与杂交香蕉集合称呼；本期记录香蕉，不将它指定为一个单一野生种或具体栽培品种。正式科属按POWO，园艺名称来源单列。": "Musa 'Hybrids' is the collective name used by iPlant for cultivated and hybrid bananas. The record concerns bananas, without assigning a single wild species or cultivar. Family and genus follow POWO; the horticultural name source is cited separately.", "Musa · 叶鞘、假茎和草本形态说明（属级参考）": "Musa: leaf sheaths, pseudostems and herbaceous habit (genus reference)", "香蕉 Musa Hybrids · 本期园艺集合名称依据": "Musa 'Hybrids': source for the collective horticultural name used for bananas", "好大一棵“草”": "Such an enormous herb", "站在蕉丛下面，从这个角度看过去，真想感叹一句：好大一棵树啊！换成植物学的说法，却要改口成“好大一丛草”。香蕉和同属的蕉类，是能长得很高大的草本植物。\n\n走近摸到的那一段“树干”，其实由紧紧包裹的叶鞘组成，叫作假茎。从下往上看看层层包裹的叶鞘，再抬头看叶丛，平时吃香蕉时很少想到的这一面，就在眼前了。": "Beneath the banana clump, I wanted to say, “What an enormous tree!” In botanical terms I’d have to say, “What an enormous clump of herbs!” Bananas and their relatives in the genus Musa are herbaceous plants that can grow very tall.\n\nThe “trunk” I touched was made of tightly overlapping leaf sheaths. It’s called a pseudostem. I followed the overlapping sheaths upwards, then looked into the crown. There was a whole side to bananas that I seldom think about when eating one.", "站在蕉丛下面，从这个角度看过去，真想感叹一句：好大一棵树啊！换成植物学的说法，却要改口成“好大一丛草”。香蕉和同属的蕉类，是能长得很高大的草本植物。": "Beneath the banana clump, I wanted to say, “What an enormous tree!” In botanical terms I’d have to say, “What an enormous clump of herbs!” Bananas and their relatives in the genus Musa are herbaceous plants that can grow very tall.", "走近摸到的那一段“树干”，其实由紧紧包裹的叶鞘组成，叫作假茎。从下往上看看层层包裹的叶鞘，再抬头看叶丛，平时吃香蕉时很少想到的这一面，就在眼前了。": "The “trunk” I touched was made of tightly overlapping leaf sheaths. It’s called a pseudostem. I followed the overlapping sheaths upwards, then looked into the crown. There was a whole side to bananas that I seldom think about when eating one.", "大叶子，装得下岭南的雨": "Leaves broad enough to catch a Lingnan rain", "我很喜欢这些休闲的大叶子。抬头是明亮的绿色，镜头贴近一点，中间一条粗脉，两边细细密密的纹理都出来了。叶面还留着水珠，像刚刚把一场雨接住。\n\n“雨打芭蕉”的画面，让人一下就想到这样的叶丛。雨水打在宽大的叶子上，噼里啪啦，因为有了这些蕉叶，雨好像也悠然自得了起来。": "I loved the easy sweep of those great leaves. Above me they were a bright green. Close in, a strong midrib and a fine, dense pattern on either side came into view. Droplets lingered on the surface, as though the leaf had just caught a whole shower.\n\nThe familiar image of rain drumming on banana leaves immediately brings a clump like this to mind. Rain hits those broad blades with a patter and a rattle. Somehow, with banana leaves to catch it, even the rain seems unhurried.", "我很喜欢这些休闲的大叶子。抬头是明亮的绿色，镜头贴近一点，中间一条粗脉，两边细细密密的纹理都出来了。叶面还留着水珠，像刚刚把一场雨接住。": "I loved the easy sweep of those great leaves. Above me they were a bright green. Close in, a strong midrib and a fine, dense pattern on either side came into view. Droplets lingered on the surface, as though the leaf had just caught a whole shower.", "“雨打芭蕉”的画面，让人一下就想到这样的叶丛。雨水打在宽大的叶子上，噼里啪啦，因为有了这些蕉叶，雨好像也悠然自得了起来。": "The familiar image of rain drumming on banana leaves immediately brings a clump like this to mind. Rain hits those broad blades with a patter and a rattle. Somehow, with banana leaves to catch it, even the rain seems unhurried.", "把熟悉的果实切开看看": "Cutting open a familiar fruit", "挂在植株上的绿色果串，一层一层往上弯，和水果摊上看到的香蕉又有一点不同。切开手里的果实，浅色果肉中间还能找到细小的深色点。越是熟悉的食物，近看时越容易冒出问题。\n\n香蕉为什么常常没有我们印象中那种明显的硬种子？那些小黑点又是什么？从一串青绿的果实看到手里的横切面，平时一口就吃下去的东西，这回想拿在手里多看一会儿。": "Green bunches on the plants curved upwards in successive tiers, a different sight from bananas on a fruit stall. A cut across the one in my hand revealed tiny dark dots in the pale flesh. Even the most familiar food raises questions when I look closely.\n\nWhy do bananas so often lack the obvious hard seeds we might expect? What are those little black dots? From a green bunch to a cross-section in my palm, something I would usually eat at once made me want to linger.", "挂在植株上的绿色果串，一层一层往上弯，和水果摊上看到的香蕉又有一点不同。切开手里的果实，浅色果肉中间还能找到细小的深色点。越是熟悉的食物，近看时越容易冒出问题。": "Green bunches on the plants curved upwards in successive tiers, a different sight from bananas on a fruit stall. A cut across the one in my hand revealed tiny dark dots in the pale flesh. Even the most familiar food raises questions when I look closely.", "香蕉为什么常常没有我们印象中那种明显的硬种子？那些小黑点又是什么？从一串青绿的果实看到手里的横切面，平时一口就吃下去的东西，这回想拿在手里多看一会儿。": "Why do bananas so often lack the obvious hard seeds we might expect? What are those little black dots? From a green bunch to a cross-section in my palm, something I would usually eat at once made me want to linger.", "从一串香蕉，认识更多蕉类": "From one bunch to the wider banana family", "这次认识香蕉，采用 Musa 'Hybrids' 这个园艺集合称呼，还没有确定到一个具体的栽培品种。想到野芭蕉、红蕉、大蕉、粉蕉这些名字，我才发现，熟悉的一串香蕉，也能把视线带向很大的蕉类家族。\n\n从一口熟悉的果肉，回到生长着的大叶与果串，再去想它们之间的联系，香蕉就不只是水果摊上的一种食物了。下次吃香蕉的时候，也许会先想起这片把天空遮成绿色的大叶子。": "This record uses the horticultural designation Musa 'Hybrids'. I haven’t identified a particular cultivar. Names such as wild banana, red banana, plantain and pink banana made me realise how wide a family one familiar bunch can lead me to.\n\nFrom a bite of fruit back to growing leaves and fruiting bunches, and then to the connections among them: bananas have become more than something on a market stall. Next time I eat one, I may first picture those broad leaves that made the sky look green.", "这次认识香蕉，采用 Musa 'Hybrids' 这个园艺集合称呼，还没有确定到一个具体的栽培品种。想到野芭蕉、红蕉、大蕉、粉蕉这些名字，我才发现，熟悉的一串香蕉，也能把视线带向很大的蕉类家族。": "This record uses the horticultural designation Musa 'Hybrids'. I haven’t identified a particular cultivar. Names such as wild banana, red banana, plantain and pink banana made me realise how wide a family one familiar bunch can lead me to.", "从一口熟悉的果肉，回到生长着的大叶与果串，再去想它们之间的联系，香蕉就不只是水果摊上的一种食物了。下次吃香蕉的时候，也许会先想起这片把天空遮成绿色的大叶子。": "From a bite of fruit back to growing leaves and fruiting bunches, and then to the connections among them: bananas have become more than something on a market stall. Next time I eat one, I may first picture those broad leaves that made the sky look green."}, "20241119-01": {"手中剥开的果子，浅色厚萼片一层层包裹在外。": "A fruit opened in the hand reveals layers of thick, pale sepals around the outside.", "草地上的五桠果，表面有萼片接合形成的纹路，也有破开的果子。": "Dillenia fruits on the grass; some are broken, others show the seams where the sepals meet.", "五桠果树皮呈红褐色，薄片状剥落的边缘翘起。": "Reddish brown bark of Dillenia indica, flaking in thin sheets with curled edges.", "粗干向上分成几根枝条，表面有斑驳脱落的树皮。": "A thick trunk divides into several branches, its bark peeling in patches.", "近看枝间的花，白色花瓣露出，外侧包着浅绿色萼片。": "A closer look at a flower among the branches, white petals emerging from pale green sepals.", "同片对照的大花五桠果，掌中果子带着红色与褐色斑块。": "Dillenia turbinata for comparison: a fruit with red and brown patches held in the palm.", "枝梢上展开的大叶片，平行排列的侧脉让叶面有明显褶皱感。": "Large leaves at the shoot tip have parallel lateral veins that give them a distinctly pleated look.", "树冠中的绿色圆果，散落在叶片和枝条之间。": "Round green fruits are scattered among the branches and leaves.", "从树下抬头看，粗大的分枝托着一层绿色树冠。": "Looking up, thick branches support a layer of green canopy.", "同片对照的大花五桠果剖开观察，红色外层与黄色内部形成鲜明反差。": "A cut Dillenia turbinata fruit shows a vivid contrast between its red exterior and yellow interior.", "绿叶间悬着浅色花部，外层萼片呈圆鼓鼓的形状。": "Pale flower parts hang among green leaves within rounded outer sepals.", "近看叶片，侧脉一道道通向带锯齿的叶缘。": "The lateral veins run in lines towards the serrated leaf margin.", "逆光下的花与叶片，大叶子上的脉纹格外清楚。": "Backlit flower and leaves, with especially clear veins in the large leaf.", "枝上悬着绿色五桠果，外层厚萼片紧紧合拢。": "A green fruit hangs from a branch, tightly enclosed by its thick outer sepals.", "从厚厚萼片包着的大果子，到像打了褶的绿叶，一起看看五桠果的不同模样。": "From the large fruit wrapped in thick sepals to green leaves folded into pleats, this tree shows a different face at every turn.", "文稿明确列出Dillenia turbinata，并对比花色及果期。": "The manuscript names Dillenia turbinata and compares flower colour and fruiting time.", "文稿在历史园林市场变化段落中举例提及，不认定有独立镜头。": "Mentioned in a passage about changes in the horticultural trade. A separate shot of this plant has not been identified.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与正式等级按列明的POWO/WCVP证据保留；中文为辅助对照，名称核对不等于影像鉴定。": "Scientific names and formal ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP evidence. Chinese names are provided for reference. Checking a name does not independently identify the plant in a photograph.", "Dillenia indica（NParks）": "Dillenia indica (NParks)", "五桠果（植物智）": "Dillenia indica on iPlant", "这颗“桃”，长得有点特别": "An unusual “peach”", "这次遇见的果子又大又圆，绿绿的，表面还有几道相接的纹路。它叫五桠果，也被叫作第伦桃。\n\n树下已经落了不少果子。有的外层破开，有的还紧紧合着。光看这个外形，就很难把它和我们熟悉的桃子放到一起。名字带一个“桃”，不代表它就是桃树的亲戚。": "The fruit I found was large, round and green, with seams meeting across its surface. This is wǔyāguǒ, also called dìlúntáo in Chinese.\n\nQuite a few had fallen beneath the tree. Some were split open on the outside and others still tightly closed. Their shape alone looked quite unlike a familiar peach. The “peach” in a name doesn’t make this tree a relative of the peach tree.", "这次遇见的果子又大又圆，绿绿的，表面还有几道相接的纹路。它叫五桠果，也被叫作第伦桃。": "The fruit I found was large, round and green, with seams meeting across its surface. This is wǔyāguǒ, also called dìlúntáo in Chinese.", "树下已经落了不少果子。有的外层破开，有的还紧紧合着。光看这个外形，就很难把它和我们熟悉的桃子放到一起。名字带一个“桃”，不代表它就是桃树的亲戚。": "Quite a few had fallen beneath the tree. Some were split open on the outside and others still tightly closed. Their shape alone looked quite unlike a familiar peach. The “peach” in a name doesn’t make this tree a relative of the peach tree.", "包住果子的，竟然是萼片": "The fruit is wrapped in sepals", "把外层慢慢分开，能看到一片片厚厚的浅色结构。这些包在外面的部分，是花后继续长大的萼片。\n\n原先在花外侧的萼片，后来又把里面紧紧抱住。对照枝上合拢的果子再看，就能理解它的层次了。我很喜欢这样追着一个部位看：花谢以后，它的工作还没有结束。": "Gently separating the outer layers revealed thick, pale pieces. These enclosing parts are sepals that continued to grow after flowering.\n\nThe sepals that once stood outside the flower later clasped what was developing within. Comparing this with a closed fruit on the branch made the layers easier to understand. I love following one part like this: its work didn’t end when the flower faded.", "把外层慢慢分开，能看到一片片厚厚的浅色结构。这些包在外面的部分，是花后继续长大的萼片。": "Gently separating the outer layers revealed thick, pale pieces. These enclosing parts are sepals that continued to grow after flowering.", "原先在花外侧的萼片，后来又把里面紧紧抱住。对照枝上合拢的果子再看，就能理解它的层次了。我很喜欢这样追着一个部位看：花谢以后，它的工作还没有结束。": "The sepals that once stood outside the flower later clasped what was developing within. Comparing this with a closed fruit on the branch made the layers easier to understand. I love following one part like this: its work didn’t end when the flower faded.", "同一个家族，还有另一种果子": "Another fruit in the same genus", "这一期也拿出了以前记录的大花五桠果作比较。它的果子颜色更鲜艳，剖开后，红色和黄色一下都露了出来。\n\n那次观察里，黏黏的质感也让我记了很久。这次的五桠果是Dillenia indica，对照的大花五桠果是Dillenia turbinata，属于同一个属，仍要分开认识。": "I brought out earlier material of a related species for comparison. Its fruit was more brightly coloured. When cut open it revealed red and yellow all at once.\n\nI still remembered the sticky texture from that earlier encounter. The subject this time is Dillenia indica. The comparison is Dillenia turbinata, a different species in the same genus.", "这一期也拿出了以前记录的大花五桠果作比较。它的果子颜色更鲜艳，剖开后，红色和黄色一下都露了出来。": "I brought out earlier material of a related species for comparison. Its fruit was more brightly coloured. When cut open it revealed red and yellow all at once.", "那次观察里，黏黏的质感也让我记了很久。这次的五桠果是Dillenia indica，对照的大花五桠果是Dillenia turbinata，属于同一个属，仍要分开认识。": "I still remembered the sticky texture from that earlier encounter. The subject this time is Dillenia indica. The comparison is Dillenia turbinata, a different species in the same genus.", "最让我舍不得走的，还是叶子": "The leaves were what kept me there", "果子很特别，但对我来说，五桠果最吸引人的地方还是叶片。叶子很大，翠绿翠绿的，一道道侧脉排得清清楚楚，像给叶面打了褶。\n\n抬头望上去，阳光穿过叶片，满眼都是明亮的绿。花和果子会变化，这种从树下仰望叶脉的快乐，也很值得单独记下来。": "The fruits are extraordinary, but what drew me most were the leaves. They were large and vividly green, with sharply defined side veins arranged in rows like pleats across the blade.\n\nLooking up, I saw sunlight shining through the leaves until everything was bright green. Flowers and fruits change. The pleasure of standing under a tree looking up into those veins was worth a record all its own.", "果子很特别，但对我来说，五桠果最吸引人的地方还是叶片。叶子很大，翠绿翠绿的，一道道侧脉排得清清楚楚，像给叶面打了褶。": "The fruits are extraordinary, but what drew me most were the leaves. They were large and vividly green, with sharply defined side veins arranged in rows like pleats across the blade.", "抬头望上去，阳光穿过叶片，满眼都是明亮的绿。花和果子会变化，这种从树下仰望叶脉的快乐，也很值得单独记下来。": "Looking up, I saw sunlight shining through the leaves until everything was bright green. Flowers and fruits change. The pleasure of standing under a tree looking up into those veins was worth a record all its own.", "低头看看树皮，再抬头看看树冠": "Down to the bark and back up to the crown", "最后别漏掉它的树干。红褐色树皮像薄片一样翘起、脱落，手里拿起一小片，就能看清那些层次。\n\n粗干向上分枝，枝条再托住大叶子和果子。从落在地上的果，到头顶的绿光，再到眼前的树皮，这棵树总有让我多看一眼的地方。": "I couldn’t leave without a look at the trunk. Reddish-brown bark curled away in thin flakes. Holding a piece in my hand made its layers easy to see.\n\nThe stout trunk branched upwards, and the branches held up the broad leaves and fruits. From fruit on the ground to green light overhead to bark in front of me, something on this tree always invited another look.", "最后别漏掉它的树干。红褐色树皮像薄片一样翘起、脱落，手里拿起一小片，就能看清那些层次。": "I couldn’t leave without a look at the trunk. Reddish-brown bark curled away in thin flakes. Holding a piece in my hand made its layers easy to see.", "粗干向上分枝，枝条再托住大叶子和果子。从落在地上的果，到头顶的绿光，再到眼前的树皮，这棵树总有让我多看一眼的地方。": "The stout trunk branched upwards, and the branches held up the broad leaves and fruits. From fruit on the ground to green light overhead to bark in front of me, something on this tree always invited another look."}, "20241126-01": {"拾起的浅黄绿色花，细长花丝向外伸开。": "A fallen pale yellow-green flower with slender filaments spread out.", "一大串果子贴近树干下垂，其中少数已转成橙红色。": "A large fruit cluster droops against the trunk; a few fruits have already turned orange-red.", "林荫里的狐尾椰子，叶片垂在带环纹的树干之间。": "In the shade, foxtail palm fronds hang between ringed trunks.", "掌中去除外层果肉后的深色果核，表面有粗粗的纤维纹理。": "Dark fruit stone after the flesh has been removed, showing coarse fibres on its surface.", "从树下仰望，叶丛下面挂着密密的绿色果实。": "Looking up from beneath the tree, dense clusters of green fruit hang below the fronds.", "几枚深色果核放在手心，纵向和交错的纤维纹路十分明显。": "Several dark fruit stones in a hand show lengthwise and crossing fibres.", "整株狐尾椰子，树冠像几条向四面伸出的绿色尾巴。": "The whole palm, its crown like green tails spreading in all directions.", "抬头看成排树冠，羽状叶之间悬着一串串果实。": "Looking up at a row of crowns with fruit clusters hanging between the fronds.", "成排种植的狐尾椰子，笔直树干之间有人俯身寻找落果。": "Among evenly planted foxtail palms, a person bends between the trunks to look for fallen fruit.", "从侧下方看果序，圆鼓鼓的绿色果子沿着分枝密集排列。": "Seen from below and to one side, plump green fruits crowd the branches of the cluster.", "从草坪边远看，狐尾椰子的叶丛集中在高高树干的顶部。": "From the edge of the lawn, the palms’ leaves are clustered at the tops of their tall trunks.", "掌中的橙红色果实，果皮表面带着细小褐色斑点。": "Orange-red fruit in a hand, with tiny brown speckles on its surface.", "狐尾椰子的羽状叶向下弯垂，小羽片朝多个方向伸出。": "Arching, pinnate foxtail palm fronds, their leaflets projecting in several directions.", "叶子像甩动的狐狸尾巴，果核有粗粗的纤维，再抬头看看叶丛下那一大串果子。": "The leaves resemble swishing foxtails, and the fruit stones are wrapped in coarse fibres. Look up again for the great bunch of fruit beneath the crown.", "文稿用椰子树作树形对比：“咋一看，树型有点像椰子树”。": "The manuscript compares its outline to that of a coconut palm at first glance.", "文稿用槟榔作果实形状对比：“和槟榔的果子差不多”。": "The manuscript compares the shape of its fruit to an areca nut.", "文稿提到把种子藏在“山棕下边”；没有提供其具体学名。": "The manuscript says the seeds were hidden beneath a plant called shānzōng (山棕), without giving its scientific name.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称拼写按WCVP更正为Wodyetia bifurcata；中文主显示沿用素材名狐尾椰子，狐尾棕及狐尾椰属作为中文异称保留。": "The scientific spelling has been corrected to Wodyetia bifurcata following WCVP. The main Chinese label 狐尾椰子 comes from the source material. 狐尾棕 and 狐尾椰属 are retained as alternative Chinese labels.", "Wodyetia bifurcata（NParks）": "Wodyetia bifurcata (NParks)", "二枝棕属（《深圳植物志》）": "The genus Wodyetia in Flora of Shenzhen", "又像狐狸，又叫椰子": "A fox, a coconut and a palm", "狐尾椰子，这个名字里又是狐狸，又是椰子，到底指什么呢？先抬头看看它的叶子，答案就出来了一半。\n\n长长的叶子向外弯垂，小羽片朝不同方向伸开，蓬蓬松松的。风一来，一条条绿色“大尾巴”就摆起来。站在树下看，这个名字真是越看越形象。": "The Chinese name for the foxtail palm brings together a fox and a coconut. What does it refer to? A glance up at the leaves answered at least half the question.\n\nThe long leaves arch outwards, their pinnae projecting in different directions to give them a bushy outline. When the wind blows, the big green “tails” sway. From beneath the tree that name grew more apt the longer I looked.", "狐尾椰子，这个名字里又是狐狸，又是椰子，到底指什么呢？先抬头看看它的叶子，答案就出来了一半。": "The Chinese name for the foxtail palm brings together a fox and a coconut. What does it refer to? A glance up at the leaves answered at least half the question.", "长长的叶子向外弯垂，小羽片朝不同方向伸开，蓬蓬松松的。风一来，一条条绿色“大尾巴”就摆起来。站在树下看，这个名字真是越看越形象。": "The long leaves arch outwards, their pinnae projecting in different directions to give them a bushy outline. When the wind blows, the big green “tails” sway. From beneath the tree that name grew more apt the longer I looked.", "叶丛下面，挂了好多果子": "Clusters of fruit beneath the crown", "目光从叶子往下移，一串串果子就出现了。有的还是绿色，有的已经转成橙红色，密密地挂在叶丛下面。\n\n这么多果子聚在一起，到底有多重？细细的分枝又是怎么分担重量的？我忍不住沿着果序看了半天，连树干上那些一圈圈的纹路也一起看进去了。": "Looking down from the leaves, I found bunch after bunch of fruit. Some were still green and others had turned orange-red, all hanging thickly below the crown.\n\nHow much did a cluster like that weigh? How did those fine branches share the load? I followed the fruiting stalk with my eye for a long time, taking in the rings on the trunk along the way.", "目光从叶子往下移，一串串果子就出现了。有的还是绿色，有的已经转成橙红色，密密地挂在叶丛下面。": "Looking down from the leaves, I found bunch after bunch of fruit. Some were still green and others had turned orange-red, all hanging thickly below the crown.", "这么多果子聚在一起，到底有多重？细细的分枝又是怎么分担重量的？我忍不住沿着果序看了半天，连树干上那些一圈圈的纹路也一起看进去了。": "How much did a cluster like that weigh? How did those fine branches share the load? I followed the fruiting stalk with my eye for a long time, taking in the rings on the trunk along the way.", "好看的不只有红果皮": "More than a bright red skin", "捧起落下的果子，橙红色果皮看起来很抢眼。不过，比起外面的颜色，我更喜欢清理外层以后露出的深色果核。\n\n表面那些粗硬纤维，有的纵向延伸，有的交错在一起，像把纹路刻了上去。文玩里有“千丝菩提”的称呼；对我来说，先不管它能做成什么，单是这份植物留下的纹理，就已经很好看。": "I picked up a fallen fruit. The orange-red skin was striking, but I preferred the dark stone revealed once the outside was cleaned away.\n\nCoarse, stiff fibres ran along its length or crossed one another like engraved lines. Among collectors it is called qiānsī pútí, the “thousand-thread bodhi bead”. Before thinking about what anyone might make from it, I simply enjoyed the pattern the plant had left.", "捧起落下的果子，橙红色果皮看起来很抢眼。不过，比起外面的颜色，我更喜欢清理外层以后露出的深色果核。": "I picked up a fallen fruit. The orange-red skin was striking, but I preferred the dark stone revealed once the outside was cleaned away.", "表面那些粗硬纤维，有的纵向延伸，有的交错在一起，像把纹路刻了上去。文玩里有“千丝菩提”的称呼；对我来说，先不管它能做成什么，单是这份植物留下的纹理，就已经很好看。": "Coarse, stiff fibres ran along its length or crossed one another like engraved lines. Among collectors it is called qiānsī pútí, the “thousand-thread bodhi bead”. Before thinking about what anyone might make from it, I simply enjoyed the pattern the plant had left.", "再看一眼小花，去树下找一找": "Little flowers and a search beneath the tree", "这次也拾起了一些小花。放在手心，细细的花丝和浅黄绿色花部才看得清楚。远处看的是一大棵树，近处又全是这样小小的细节。\n\n之前藏在树下的几颗落果，如今外层已经慢慢变化。我又去找了找。来回走过这排树，抬头看“大尾巴”，低头找果子，这次观察就这样一层层丰富起来。": "I also picked up a few small flowers. Only in my palm could I see the fine filaments and pale yellow-green floral parts clearly. From afar it was a tall tree. Close up it was full of tiny details like these.\n\nI went back to look for fallen fruits I’d tucked away under the tree earlier. Their outer layers had gradually changed. Walking past this row of palms, looking up for the “tails” and down for fruit, I found another layer to the observation each time.", "这次也拾起了一些小花。放在手心，细细的花丝和浅黄绿色花部才看得清楚。远处看的是一大棵树，近处又全是这样小小的细节。": "I also picked up a few small flowers. Only in my palm could I see the fine filaments and pale yellow-green floral parts clearly. From afar it was a tall tree. Close up it was full of tiny details like these.", "之前藏在树下的几颗落果，如今外层已经慢慢变化。我又去找了找。来回走过这排树，抬头看“大尾巴”，低头找果子，这次观察就这样一层层丰富起来。": "I went back to look for fallen fruits I’d tucked away under the tree earlier. Their outer layers had gradually changed. Walking past this row of palms, looking up for the “tails” and down for fruit, I found another layer to the observation each time."}, "20241209-01": {"几根直立花序伸出叶丛，黄色小花沿着花序轴排列。": "Upright inflorescences rise above the foliage, their little yellow flowers spaced along the axes.", "黄色花序侧面，顶端还有许多没有张开的花蕾。": "Side view of a yellow cluster with many unopened buds at its tip.", "花与绿色荚果同时出现在分枝上，周围是成片复叶。": "Yellow flowers and green pods share a branch amid compound foliage.", "绿色幼荚沿着花序轴向下垂，花和果实在同一枝上接续出现。": "Young green pods hang from the inflorescence axis, with flowers and fruits following one another along the same shoot.", "坡边草丛里的猪屎豆，一丛丛黄色花序向上伸出。": "Upright clusters of yellow Crotalaria flowers among grasses beside the slope.", "植株全景，叶丛上方有多根正在开花的直立花序。": "The whole plant, with several upright inflorescences flowering above the foliage.", "托起一串绿色荚果，上端还有正在开放的小花。": "A cluster of green pods supported by a hand, with a flower still open above.", "一只小蝶停在猪屎豆花序旁，背景是黄色花和绿叶。": "A small butterfly beside a Crotalaria inflorescence, against yellow flowers and green leaves.", "掌中的花部观察，黄色花瓣围着中央的浅色花部。": "A flower inspected in the hand, its yellow petals surrounding the pale central parts.", "猪屎豆的三片小叶从叶柄顶端展开，叶片呈椭圆形至倒卵形。": "Three leaflets spread from a Crotalaria leaf stalk; their shapes range from elliptical to inversely egg-shaped.", "近看一串黄色花，花瓣像一只只小小的蝴蝶。": "Close-up of yellow blossoms, their petals resembling little butterflies.", "猪屎豆自然手绘：花序、三出复叶、分枝和细部。": "Drawing of Crotalaria pallida: flower cluster, trifoliate leaves, branching and details.", "名字有点尴尬，黄色花却开得很精神；再看看一边开花一边长大的小豆荚。": "Its Chinese name is a little embarrassing, but its yellow flowers stand proud. Alongside the blossoms, the small pods are already growing.", "文稿原称“经常和白灰毛豆出现在复绿山坡上”；深圳地方标准附录对白灰毛豆列名Tephrosia candida，仅核对名称、不认定镜头身份。": "The manuscript mentions the two plants together on revegetated slopes. A Shenzhen standard lists the name Tephrosia candida for 白灰毛豆. This confirms the use of the name, not the identity of the plant in the footage.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与正式等级按列明的POWO/WCVP证据保留；中文为辅助对照，名称核对不等于影像鉴定。": "Scientific names and formal ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP evidence. Chinese names are provided for reference. Checking a name does not independently identify the plant in a photograph.", "猪屎豆（《深圳植物志》）": "猪屎豆 in Flora of Shenzhen", "名字另类，花倒是很精神": "An odd name for such lively flowers", "猪屎豆，这个名字有点让人不好意思开口。但看它的花，明亮的黄色一串串往上排，简直像一队精神的小精灵。\n\n这是小时候就常见的植物，再次停下来拍它，还是会被这股生命力吸引。名字只是认识它的开头，花、叶和果子才是我这次想仔细看的部分。": "The Chinese name zhūshǐdòu, with its reference to pig droppings, is a little embarrassing to say aloud. Yet the bright yellow flowers march up the spike like a troop of lively little sprites.\n\nI knew this plant as a child. Stopping to film it again, I still found myself drawn to its vigour. The name was only the start. This time I wanted to look closely at flowers, leaves and pods.", "猪屎豆，这个名字有点让人不好意思开口。但看它的花，明亮的黄色一串串往上排，简直像一队精神的小精灵。": "The Chinese name zhūshǐdòu, with its reference to pig droppings, is a little embarrassing to say aloud. Yet the bright yellow flowers march up the spike like a troop of lively little sprites.", "这是小时候就常见的植物，再次停下来拍它，还是会被这股生命力吸引。名字只是认识它的开头，花、叶和果子才是我这次想仔细看的部分。": "I knew this plant as a child. Stopping to film it again, I still found myself drawn to its vigour. The name was only the start. This time I wanted to look closely at flowers, leaves and pods.", "一边开花，一边长豆荚": "Flowers above, pods below", "沿着同一根花序往下看，上面还有小花，下面已经垂着绿色荚果了。新花、旧花和果实，就这样在一根轴上接了起来。\n\n小时候，我和伙伴还会拿干燥果荚摇一摇，听里面沙沙作响。这次镜头里主要是绿色幼荚，离记忆里的“小响铃”，还有一段生长的路。": "I followed a single flower spike downwards. There were still little flowers at the top while green pods hung lower down. New flowers, spent flowers and fruit followed one another along the same axis.\n\nAs children my friends and I shook the dry pods to hear the seeds rattle inside. This time I mostly filmed green young pods. They still had some growing to do before becoming the little rattles I remembered.", "沿着同一根花序往下看，上面还有小花，下面已经垂着绿色荚果了。新花、旧花和果实，就这样在一根轴上接了起来。": "I followed a single flower spike downwards. There were still little flowers at the top while green pods hung lower down. New flowers, spent flowers and fruit followed one another along the same axis.", "小时候，我和伙伴还会拿干燥果荚摇一摇，听里面沙沙作响。这次镜头里主要是绿色幼荚，离记忆里的“小响铃”，还有一段生长的路。": "As children my friends and I shook the dry pods to hear the seeds rattle inside. This time I mostly filmed green young pods. They still had some growing to do before becoming the little rattles I remembered.", "三片小叶，也很好认": "Three leaflets make a useful clue", "看完一串串黄花，再低头看看叶子。三片小叶从叶柄顶端展开，顶端圆圆钝钝的，有的还能看见浅浅凹口。\n\n叶片背面带着短柔毛，光线一照，颜色和质感又变得不太一样。每次多记住一个部位，下次在花不多的时候，也更容易把它认出来。": "After the yellow spikes I looked down at the leaves. Three leaflets spread from the end of each stalk. Their tips were blunt and rounded, some with a shallow notch.\n\nThe undersides had short soft hairs, giving them a different colour and texture as the light caught them. Every extra part I remember will help me recognise the plant another time, even when flowers are scarce.", "看完一串串黄花，再低头看看叶子。三片小叶从叶柄顶端展开，顶端圆圆钝钝的，有的还能看见浅浅凹口。": "After the yellow spikes I looked down at the leaves. Three leaflets spread from the end of each stalk. Their tips were blunt and rounded, some with a shallow notch.", "叶片背面带着短柔毛，光线一照，颜色和质感又变得不太一样。每次多记住一个部位，下次在花不多的时候，也更容易把它认出来。": "The undersides had short soft hairs, giving them a different colour and texture as the light caught them. Every extra part I remember will help me recognise the plant another time, even when flowers are scarce.", "熟悉的山坡，再认真看一遍": "Another look at a familiar slope", "退后看看，它就在坡边的草丛里，叶子铺开，黄色花序高高伸出来。这样熟悉的景象，过去常常只是路过。\n\n这次一边拍，一边又翻了翻资料，才知道猪屎豆属里还有许多不同对象。先把眼前这一种的花、三片小叶和豆荚记清楚，再去认识这个更大的家族。": "From a few steps back I could see the plant in the grass beside the slope, its leaves spreading and the yellow flower spikes held high. I had often walked past scenes like this without stopping.\n\nLooking things up as I filmed, I discovered how many species belong to Crotalaria. I wanted to get the flowers, three leaflets and pods of this one clear in my mind before exploring the rest of the genus.", "退后看看，它就在坡边的草丛里，叶子铺开，黄色花序高高伸出来。这样熟悉的景象，过去常常只是路过。": "From a few steps back I could see the plant in the grass beside the slope, its leaves spreading and the yellow flower spikes held high. I had often walked past scenes like this without stopping.", "这次一边拍，一边又翻了翻资料，才知道猪屎豆属里还有许多不同对象。先把眼前这一种的花、三片小叶和豆荚记清楚，再去认识这个更大的家族。": "Looking things up as I filmed, I discovered how many species belong to Crotalaria. I wanted to get the flowers, three leaflets and pods of this one clear in my mind before exploring the rest of the genus."}, "20261016-01": {"鲜红色花序直立在叶丛之间，重叠苞片层次清楚。": "A bright red flower spike stands upright among the leaves, its bracts overlapping in clear layers.", "从叶丛下方向上看，一列列长叶映着明亮天空。": "Looking up from beneath the clump, rows of long leaves against the bright sky.", "一只蝶停在绿色花序旁的小花上，细足落在花部边缘。": "A butterfly rests on a small flower beside a green spike, its slender legs on the edge of the flower.", "同一处的绿色与红色花序，绿色苞片间露出浅色小花。": "Green and red spikes in the same spot. A pale flower peeks out between the green bracts.", "弯弯的茎上排列着长圆状披针形叶片，叶面泛着光。": "Oblong, lance-shaped leaves along a curved stem, their surfaces catching the light.", "俯看一丛红球姜，长叶舒展开来，下方露出小小红色花序。": "A clump seen from above, long leaves spreading over a small red spike.", "俯看红色花序顶部，苞片围成紧密的螺旋。": "The red spike seen from above, its bracts forming a tight spiral.", "醒目的红色花序，外形像一枚竖立的小松果。": "The bright red flower spike resembles a small, upright pine cone.", "剖开后的浅色内部组织放在绿叶上，边缘仍留有少量深色部分。": "Pale tissue from the cut interior displayed on a green leaf. A little dark tissue remains at the edge.", "林下观察红球姜，一手托着长叶，周围是茂密叶丛。": "Holding a long leaf of shampoo ginger beneath the trees, surrounded by dense foliage.", "从顶部看红色花序，重叠苞片排成一圈圈螺旋纹样。": "Viewed from above, the overlapping red bracts form a series of spirals.", "黑色种子近照，表面有细细纹理，部分基部带着浅色组织。": "Black seeds in close-up, with finely textured surfaces and pale tissue at the base of some seeds.", "绿色花序旁开出几朵浅色小花，花朵从苞片间探出。": "Several pale flowers emerging between the bracts of a green spike.", "粉红色苞片与绿色边缘交错，花序像一枚紧凑的小松果。": "Pink bracts edged with green give the spike the compact shape of a little pine cone.", "红球姜的长叶片沿着茎两侧排列，叶尖朝外伸出。": "Long leaves line either side of the stem, their tips pointing outwards.", "苞片之间伸出浅黄白色花，花瓣边缘柔软而有褶。": "A pale, creamy-yellow flower emerges between the bracts. The soft edges of the petals are folded.", "花序从叶丛旁单独抽出，花序梗上有浅色鞘状结构。": "A spike rising separately beside the leafy stems, with pale sheaths on its stalk.", "红色“小松果”里藏着滑润汁液，苞片间还会开出浅色小花，这回终于收集到了红球姜。": "The red “pine cones” hold a slippery liquid, and pale flowers peep from between the bracts. At last I’ve been able to record shampoo ginger.", "红球姜": "Hóngqiújiāng (红球姜)", "科学名称与正式等级按列明的POWO/WCVP证据保留；中文为辅助对照，名称核对不等于影像鉴定。": "Scientific names and formal ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP evidence. Chinese names are provided for reference. Checking a name does not independently identify the plant in a photograph.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "白姜花 Hedychium coronarium J.Koenig": "White ginger lily (白姜花), Hedychium coronarium J.Koenig.", "松果姜": "Sōngguǒjiāng (松果姜), “pine-cone ginger”", "洗发姜": "Shampoo ginger (洗发姜)", "我终于收集到了红球姜，一种能挤出天然“洗发水”的植物！": "I finally found shampoo ginger, the plant you can squeeze natural “shampoo” from!", "这不是洗发水，是红球姜": "A handful of shampoo ginger", "你见过从植物里挤出来的透明汁液吗？这回我终于收集到了红球姜。轻轻一捏那个红色“小松果”，里面真的会流出汁液，揉一揉，有一种特别的滑润感。\n\n它还有Shampoo ginger这个英文称呼，直译像“洗发姜”。名字很有趣，我先把手里的触感记下来，再看看这个装着汁液的小东西到底是什么。": "Have you ever seen clear liquid squeezed from a plant? I finally got to record shampoo ginger. When I gently squeezed one of the red “pine cones”, liquid really did run out. Rubbing it between my fingers, I felt how slippery it was.\n\nIts English name, “shampoo ginger”, gives me a rather literal Chinese translation: xǐfàjiāng, or “hair-washing ginger”. I wanted to remember how the liquid felt, then take a closer look at the little structure holding it.", "一片片苞片，叠出一个小松果": "A cone made of overlapping bracts", "红色“小松果”并不是一朵大花，而是一个花序。近看外面，一片片苞片紧密重叠，从顶上看，还会排出漂亮的螺旋。\n\n这些苞片年轻时是绿色，后来逐渐变红。绿色、粉红、鲜红放在一起看，同一种植物就有了好几副模样。苞片内侧常有黏液，也是这次观察特别有趣的地方。": "The red “pine cone” is a whole flower spike. Its bracts overlap tightly, and from above you can see them forming a lovely spiral.\n\nThe young bracts are green and gradually turn red. Put the green, pink and bright red stages side by side and the same plant takes on several quite different looks. There is often mucilage on the inside of the bracts. That was one of the most interesting things I noticed.", "真正的小花，从缝隙里探出来": "Little flowers in the gaps", "那么，真正的花在哪里呢？看看绿色花序，苞片之间正有浅色小花探出来。软软的花冠，与外面整齐厚实的苞片很不一样。\n\n我还拍到了一只停在花旁的小蝶。先认清花序、苞片和花的关系，那个原来只像装饰品的“小松果”，忽然就变得鲜活了。": "So where are the flowers? Look at the green spike: pale flowers are peeping out between the bracts. Their soft corollas are quite different from the orderly layers of thick bracts on the outside.\n\nI also photographed a little butterfly perched beside a flower. Once I could see how the spike, its bracts and the flowers fitted together, what had looked like a decorative “pine cone” suddenly came to life.", "除了姜味，我还闻到了什么？": "What else could I smell besides ginger?", "它不只摸起来特别，闻起来也很有意思。除了姜的味道，我居然还闻到一点像花椒、柠檬和柑橘皮混在一起的清香。\n\n这只是我当时的闻香感受，却让我对它又多了一点记忆。颜色、纹路、触感和气味凑在一起，比只记住一个名字有趣得多。": "The smell was as interesting as the feel of the plant. Beneath the ginger scent I thought I could pick out a fresh mixture of Sichuan pepper, lemon and citrus peel.\n\nThat was simply my impression as I smelled it, but it gave me another way to remember the plant. Colour, pattern, feel and scent together are much more fun than learning a name alone.", "把镜头拉远，看看整丛叶子": "Stepping back to see the leaves", "最后把镜头从红色花序拉回叶丛。长长的叶片青青绿绿的，沿着茎两侧展开，花序从下方冒出来，藏在这一片浓绿里。\n\n原先看过白姜花，我觉得它们整丛的气质有些相像。不过这回的主角是红球姜：那一个个漂亮的红色“小松果”，已经让我很难忘了。": "Finally I drew the camera back from the red spike. Long, green leaves spread to either side of each stem. The flower spikes rose from below, tucked into all that green.\n\nI had seen white ginger lily before, and I thought the two clumps had a similar look about them. This time, though, it was shampoo ginger I had come to see. I’m unlikely to forget those beautiful little red “pine cones”.", "白姜花": "White ginger lily (白姜花)", "文稿对比叶丛姿态：“红球姜和白姜花其实还挺像”。": "The manuscript compares the leafy clumps of Zingiber zerumbet and white ginger lily.", "红球姜（《中国植物志》）": "Zingiber zerumbet in Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae", "中国科学院中国植物志编辑委员会": "Editorial Committee of Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae, Chinese Academy of Sciences", "Flora of China 编委会": "Flora of China Editorial Committee", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "你见过从植物里挤出来的透明汁液吗？这回我终于收集到了红球姜。轻轻一捏那个红色“小松果”，里面真的会流出汁液，揉一揉，有一种特别的滑润感。": "Have you ever seen clear liquid squeezed from a plant? I finally got to record shampoo ginger. When I gently squeezed one of the red “pine cones”, liquid really did run out. Rubbing it between my fingers, I felt how slippery it was.", "它还有Shampoo ginger这个英文称呼，直译像“洗发姜”。名字很有趣，我先把手里的触感记下来，再看看这个装着汁液的小东西到底是什么。": "Its English name, “shampoo ginger”, gives me a rather literal Chinese translation: xǐfàjiāng, or “hair-washing ginger”. I wanted to remember how the liquid felt, then take a closer look at the little structure holding it.", "红色“小松果”并不是一朵大花，而是一个花序。近看外面，一片片苞片紧密重叠，从顶上看，还会排出漂亮的螺旋。": "The red “pine cone” is a whole flower spike. Its bracts overlap tightly, and from above you can see them forming a lovely spiral.", "这些苞片年轻时是绿色，后来逐渐变红。绿色、粉红、鲜红放在一起看，同一种植物就有了好几副模样。苞片内侧常有黏液，也是这次观察特别有趣的地方。": "The young bracts are green and gradually turn red. Put the green, pink and bright red stages side by side and the same plant takes on several quite different looks. There is often mucilage on the inside of the bracts. That was one of the most interesting things I noticed.", "那么，真正的花在哪里呢？看看绿色花序，苞片之间正有浅色小花探出来。软软的花冠，与外面整齐厚实的苞片很不一样。": "So where are the flowers? Look at the green spike: pale flowers are peeping out between the bracts. Their soft corollas are quite different from the orderly layers of thick bracts on the outside.", "我还拍到了一只停在花旁的小蝶。先认清花序、苞片和花的关系，那个原来只像装饰品的“小松果”，忽然就变得鲜活了。": "I also photographed a little butterfly perched beside a flower. Once I could see how the spike, its bracts and the flowers fitted together, what had looked like a decorative “pine cone” suddenly came to life.", "它不只摸起来特别，闻起来也很有意思。除了姜的味道，我居然还闻到一点像花椒、柠檬和柑橘皮混在一起的清香。": "The smell was as interesting as the feel of the plant. Beneath the ginger scent I thought I could pick out a fresh mixture of Sichuan pepper, lemon and citrus peel.", "这只是我当时的闻香感受，却让我对它又多了一点记忆。颜色、纹路、触感和气味凑在一起，比只记住一个名字有趣得多。": "That was simply my impression as I smelled it, but it gave me another way to remember the plant. Colour, pattern, feel and scent together are much more fun than learning a name alone.", "最后把镜头从红色花序拉回叶丛。长长的叶片青青绿绿的，沿着茎两侧展开，花序从下方冒出来，藏在这一片浓绿里。": "Finally I drew the camera back from the red spike. Long, green leaves spread to either side of each stem. The flower spikes rose from below, tucked into all that green.", "原先看过白姜花，我觉得它们整丛的气质有些相像。不过这回的主角是红球姜：那一个个漂亮的红色“小松果”，已经让我很难忘了。": "I had seen white ginger lily before, and I thought the two clumps had a similar look about them. This time, though, it was shampoo ginger I had come to see. I’m unlikely to forget those beautiful little red “pine cones”.", "Zingiberaceae · Zingiber zerumbet（Flora of China）": "Flora of China: Zingiberaceae, Zingiber zerumbet"}, "20241108-01": {"站在花生地里，举起刚拔出的植株看看这次收获。": "In the peanut field, a freshly lifted plant held up to see the harvest.", "双手拨开茎叶，在田里准备把花生植株拔起来。": "Hands part the stems and leaves in preparation for lifting a peanut plant.", "放下来的花生植株，地下荚果成串连在基部附近。": "Plant laid down to show the clusters of underground pods near its base.", "根系和荚果近照，花生壳上有明显的网状纹路。": "Close-up of roots and pods; the shells have conspicuous net-like markings.", "花生田里的枝叶，叶片成对排列在叶轴两侧。": "Peanut foliage in the field, with paired leaflets on either side of the leaf axis.", "落花生自然手绘：叶、花、地下荚果和剖开的种子。": "Drawing of peanut: leaves, flower, underground pods and a seed cut open.", "刚从土里提起的花生，根部连着一颗颗浅色荚果。": "Newly lifted peanut plant with pale pods still attached near the roots.", "花生黄色花冠近照，旗瓣、翼瓣与中央花部相互贴近。": "Close-up of a yellow peanut flower, its banner and wing petals close to the central floral parts.", "花生叶丛近照，圆钝的小叶铺在低矮枝条上。": "Close-up of rounded leaflets spread over the low-growing branches.", "从上方看花生叶片，一片复叶通常有两对小叶。": "Seen from above, a peanut leaf usually has two pairs of leaflets.", "绿叶间一朵小黄花，花冠贴近茎部开放。": "A small yellow flower opens close to the stem among green leaves.", "花生长在土里，还是挂在树上？跟着这次拔花生，从小黄花看到地下的荚果。": "Do peanuts grow underground or hang from trees? Pull up a plant and follow the trail from its little yellow flowers to the pods below the soil.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与正式等级按列明的POWO/WCVP证据保留；中文为辅助对照，名称核对不等于影像鉴定。": "Scientific names and formal ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP evidence. Chinese names are provided for reference. Checking a name does not independently identify the plant in a photograph.", "落花生（《深圳植物志》）": "Peanut in Flora of Shenzhen", "落花生属（《中国植物志》）": "The genus Arachis in Flora Reipublicae Popularis Sinicae", "花生到底长在哪里？": "Where do peanuts grow?", "今天来到一片花生地里。眼前都是矮矮的绿叶，花生会挂在哪里呢？把植株慢慢拔起来，答案就在土下面。\n\n一颗颗带壳的花生跟着根部一起露出来。虽然这次收得不算多，捧起整株看见地下那一串小果实，还是很有收获的喜悦。": "I visited a peanut field. All I could see at first were low green leaves. Where would the peanuts be hanging? I pulled a plant up slowly and found the answer below ground.\n\nPeanuts in their shells came into view along with the roots. I didn’t harvest very many, but holding up a whole plant and seeing that cluster of fruits from underground was a delight.", "今天来到一片花生地里。眼前都是矮矮的绿叶，花生会挂在哪里呢？把植株慢慢拔起来，答案就在土下面。": "I visited a peanut field. All I could see at first were low green leaves. Where would the peanuts be hanging? I pulled a plant up slowly and found the answer below ground.", "一颗颗带壳的花生跟着根部一起露出来。虽然这次收得不算多，捧起整株看见地下那一串小果实，还是很有收获的喜悦。": "Peanuts in their shells came into view along with the roots. I didn’t harvest very many, but holding up a whole plant and seeing that cluster of fruits from underground was a delight.", "有壳的是果实，里面才是种子": "The shell encloses a fruit, and the kernels are seeds", "手里这颗带着壳的花生，是它的果实，也就是荚果。外面的壳属于果皮，剥开以后，里面一粒粒才是种子。\n\n以前吃花生，注意力全在那几粒豆仁上。如今拿着整株看，壳上的网纹、果实之间连着的细长结构，都成了可以继续观察的线索。": "The peanut in its shell in my hand is the fruit: a pod. The shell is the fruit wall, and the individual kernels inside are its seeds.\n\nWhen eating peanuts I’d usually paid attention only to the kernels. Holding the whole plant let me look at the net-like markings on the shells and the slender structures connecting the pods to the plant.", "手里这颗带着壳的花生，是它的果实，也就是荚果。外面的壳属于果皮，剥开以后，里面一粒粒才是种子。": "The peanut in its shell in my hand is the fruit: a pod. The shell is the fruit wall, and the individual kernels inside are its seeds.", "以前吃花生，注意力全在那几粒豆仁上。如今拿着整株看，壳上的网纹、果实之间连着的细长结构，都成了可以继续观察的线索。": "When eating peanuts I’d usually paid attention only to the kernels. Holding the whole plant let me look at the net-like markings on the shells and the slender structures connecting the pods to the plant.", "“落花生”的“落”，怎么来的？": "Why does the Chinese name suggest going down?", "看完地下的果，再到绿叶之间找找花。花生会开这样小小的黄花，受精以后，果针逐渐伸长，带着前端的子房向土里钻。\n\n子房进入土中，再继续发育成荚果。原来不是把一朵花直接埋下去，也不是把根叫作花生。地上开花、地下结果，这个过程真是越看越神奇。": "After looking at the fruits underground, I searched among the leaves for flowers. Peanuts have small yellow flowers. After fertilisation a peg elongates, carrying the ovary at its tip down into the soil.\n\nOnce underground the ovary continues developing into a pod. So it isn’t the whole flower that gets buried, and the peanut isn’t a root. Flowers above ground and fruit below: the closer I look, the more remarkable the process seems.", "看完地下的果，再到绿叶之间找找花。花生会开这样小小的黄花，受精以后，果针逐渐伸长，带着前端的子房向土里钻。": "After looking at the fruits underground, I searched among the leaves for flowers. Peanuts have small yellow flowers. After fertilisation a peg elongates, carrying the ovary at its tip down into the soil.", "子房进入土中，再继续发育成荚果。原来不是把一朵花直接埋下去，也不是把根叫作花生。地上开花、地下结果，这个过程真是越看越神奇。": "Once underground the ovary continues developing into a pod. So it isn’t the whole flower that gets buried, and the peanut isn’t a root. Flowers above ground and fruit below: the closer I look, the more remarkable the process seems.", "别把地上这片绿叶漏掉": "Remember the green leaves above ground", "地下的收获看过了，也看看地上的叶片。两对小叶排在一片复叶上，叶尖圆圆钝钝，整片田地被它们铺成柔和的绿色。\n\n从站在田边猜“花生在哪里”，到拔起植株，再找到小黄花，这回算是把餐桌上很熟悉的花生，重新当作一株植物认识了一遍。": "After the harvest underneath, I paused to look at the foliage. Each compound leaf bears two pairs of leaflets with blunt, rounded tips. Together they cover the field in a soft green.\n\nFrom wondering where the peanuts were to lifting a plant and finding the little yellow flowers, I had met a familiar food at the table all over again, this time as a growing plant.", "地下的收获看过了，也看看地上的叶片。两对小叶排在一片复叶上，叶尖圆圆钝钝，整片田地被它们铺成柔和的绿色。": "After the harvest underneath, I paused to look at the foliage. Each compound leaf bears two pairs of leaflets with blunt, rounded tips. Together they cover the field in a soft green.", "从站在田边猜“花生在哪里”，到拔起植株，再找到小黄花，这回算是把餐桌上很熟悉的花生，重新当作一株植物认识了一遍。": "From wondering where the peanuts were to lifting a plant and finding the little yellow flowers, I had met a familiar food at the table all over again, this time as a growing plant."}, "20241112-01": {"手中轻轻展开一朵紫花，近看花瓣与中央的浅色花部。": "A purple flower gently opened by hand, showing the petals and pale floral parts at the centre.", "葛的紫色花序，黄色斑点与深紫、浅紫花瓣形成反差。": "A yellow spot stands out against the deep purple and pale purple petals of a kudzu flower spike.", "近看三出复叶中的小叶，浅色叶脉从中脉向两侧分出。": "One leaflet of the three-part leaf, with pale veins branching to either side of the midrib.", "藤蔓沿着灌木和树冠攀爬，叶丛把支撑物的轮廓包了起来。": "Vines climbing over shrubs and tree crowns, their leaves wrapping around the outlines of the plants supporting them.", "葛自然手绘：三出复叶、花序、荚果、种子和攀援枝条。": "Field sketch of kudzu: the leaf with its three leaflets, flower cluster, pod, seeds and climbing shoot.", "花序顶端尚未开放的花蕾，形状尖尖，排列得很紧密。": "Pointed, unopened buds packed together at the tip of a cluster.", "枝间垂着几枚绿色荚果，表面有明显的棕黄色毛。": "Green pods hanging among the branches, their tawny hairs clearly visible.", "手指间的嫩茎与叶柄连接处，表面可见细毛。": "Fine hairs where a young stem and leaf stalk meet, held between the fingers.", "轻压花瓣观察花部，黄白色细长结构从中露出。": "Under light pressure from a finger, the petals part to reveal a slender yellowish-white structure.", "托起葛的荚果，扁平果荚表面覆着长毛。": "A flat pod held up to show its coat of long hairs.", "几根直立花序从叶丛中伸出，下部紫花开放，顶端花蕾密集。": "Several upright flower clusters rise above the leaves. Purple flowers are open below, with tightly packed buds at the tips.", "退远看山坡，藤本和其它草木交错，绿色一直延伸到远处。": "A wider view of the hillside, where vines and other plants mingle and the green stretches into the distance.", "托起一段正在开花的花序，小花依次排列，顶端仍有花蕾。": "Holding up a flowering cluster. The flowers are arranged along it, with buds still at the tip.", "葛的叶丛层层铺开，叶片有的边缘完整，有的出现明显裂片。": "Layers of kudzu foliage, with some leaflets entire and others clearly lobed.", "特意等葛开花，近看紫色小花和带毛荚果，再退远看看这条藤的攀爬本领。": "I waited for the kudzu to flower. Up close I could see little purple flowers and hairy pods. A few steps back, I could see just how far the vine had climbed.", "葛": "Gé (葛)", "本期主对象为POWO接受变种Pueraria montana var. lobata；8级表的种级保留父种Pueraria montana，变种名另列，不另增档案。": "POWO accepts the variety Pueraria montana var. lobata. The species row gives its parent species, Pueraria montana; the variety is listed separately within the same video record.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison, under the names used there.", "葛藤": "Géténg (葛藤)", "野葛": "Yěgé (野葛)", "野山葛": "Yěshāngé (野山葛)", "山葛藤": "Shāngéténg (山葛藤)", "葛根": "Gégēn (葛根), kudzu root", "北有人参，南有葛根？中国传统植物？葛根": "Ginseng in the north, kudzu root in the south? Getting to know a plant long familiar in China | Kudzu", "特意等到它开花": "Waiting for it to flower", "这回是特意等葛开花才过来的。一串串紫色小花伸在绿叶上方，有深紫、浅紫，中间还有一点亮黄，单看花，真是雅致得很。\n\n花序上的小花像一群聚在一起的小蝴蝶。顶端还有没打开的花蕾，下面已经热热闹闹地开了起来，值得停下脚步好好看一遍。": "I had waited for the kudzu to flower before coming here. Clusters of little purple flowers stood above the leaves, with deep purple, pale purple and a bright touch of yellow in the centre. The flowers alone were remarkably graceful.\n\nThey reminded me of a gathering of little butterflies. There were unopened buds at the tip of each cluster, while the flowers lower down were already in full bloom. It was worth stopping for a good look.", "轻轻拨一下，花里有什么？": "What’s inside the flower?", "再把一朵花拿近看，花瓣一层层贴在一起。轻轻拨动以后，里面黄白色的花部露出来了，刚才只看颜色的花，忽然又多了一层结构。\n\n这也让我想起昆虫落在花上的时候，会碰到哪里，花又会怎样变化。先把眼前看得见的动作和细节记住，问题可以继续带着走。": "I brought one flower closer and found its petals pressed together in layers. When I gently moved them, yellowish-white parts came into view. What a moment before had been a patch of colour now had an arrangement I could see.\n\nIt made me wonder where an insect would touch when it landed, and how the flower would move. I could record what I saw it doing and take those questions with me.", "这么秀气的花，长在这么能爬的藤上": "Such delicate flowers on such a vigorous climber", "镜头拉远，画风马上变了。葛的藤蔓沿着周围植物往上攀，叶子一层层铺开，连支撑物的外形也一起包了进去。\n\n近看是秀气的紫花，远看又是一片很有冲劲的绿色。小时候关于葛的记忆，总和家里的一锅汤连在一起；现在再见它，我更想顺着这条藤看看，它到底长到了哪里。": "When I pulled the camera back, the picture changed completely. Stems were climbing up through neighbouring plants. Layer upon layer of leaves had grown around their supports until even the outlines were covered.\n\nFrom close up I saw delicate purple flowers. At a distance it was all vigorous green. My childhood memories of kudzu bring back a pot of soup at home. Seeing it now, what I most want to do is follow a vine and find out how far it reaches.", "荚果毛茸茸，摸起来却有点扎": "Pods that look soft and feel prickly", "这是葛的荚果，扁扁的，长长的，表面密密覆着棕黄色的毛。托在手上看，毛的方向和果荚的轮廓都很清楚。\n\n“毛茸茸”不一定意味着柔软，我当时摸着还有一点扎。把花和果实接起来看，眼前这条藤又多了一种很容易记住的样子。": "Here are the kudzu pods: long, flat and thickly covered in tawny hairs. Holding one in my hand, I could see the outline of the pod and the direction in which the hairs lay.\n\nIt looked furry but felt a little prickly to me. Putting the flowers and the pods together gave me one more way to recognise the vine.", "最后，再看三片小叶": "One last look at the three leaflets", "葛的复叶有三片小叶。有的叶片边缘比较完整，有的则裂出几个角，同一片叶丛里也能看到形状的变化。\n\n近看叶脉，再看看茎上的毛，把这些细节和紫色花序一起记下来。下一次走到一片浓密的藤蔓旁，就不只是被那一大团绿色晃过去了。": "A kudzu leaf is compound, with three leaflets. Some had nearly unbroken margins, others had several lobes. I could see both shapes in the same patch.\n\nI looked closely at the veins, then at the hairs on the stem. Those details are now part of my memory of the purple flowers. Next time I pass a mass of vines, I’ll have something to look for among all that green.", "葛（植物智）": "葛 on iPlant", "中国科学院植物研究所": "Institute of Botany, Chinese Academy of Sciences", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "这回是特意等葛开花才过来的。一串串紫色小花伸在绿叶上方，有深紫、浅紫，中间还有一点亮黄，单看花，真是雅致得很。": "I had waited for the kudzu to flower before coming here. Clusters of little purple flowers stood above the leaves, with deep purple, pale purple and a bright touch of yellow in the centre. The flowers alone were remarkably graceful.", "花序上的小花像一群聚在一起的小蝴蝶。顶端还有没打开的花蕾，下面已经热热闹闹地开了起来，值得停下脚步好好看一遍。": "They reminded me of a gathering of little butterflies. There were unopened buds at the tip of each cluster, while the flowers lower down were already in full bloom. It was worth stopping for a good look.", "再把一朵花拿近看，花瓣一层层贴在一起。轻轻拨动以后，里面黄白色的花部露出来了，刚才只看颜色的花，忽然又多了一层结构。": "I brought one flower closer and found its petals pressed together in layers. When I gently moved them, yellowish-white parts came into view. What a moment before had been a patch of colour now had an arrangement I could see.", "这也让我想起昆虫落在花上的时候，会碰到哪里，花又会怎样变化。先把眼前看得见的动作和细节记住，问题可以继续带着走。": "It made me wonder where an insect would touch when it landed, and how the flower would move. I could record what I saw it doing and take those questions with me.", "镜头拉远，画风马上变了。葛的藤蔓沿着周围植物往上攀，叶子一层层铺开，连支撑物的外形也一起包了进去。": "When I pulled the camera back, the picture changed completely. Stems were climbing up through neighbouring plants. Layer upon layer of leaves had grown around their supports until even the outlines were covered.", "近看是秀气的紫花，远看又是一片很有冲劲的绿色。小时候关于葛的记忆，总和家里的一锅汤连在一起；现在再见它，我更想顺着这条藤看看，它到底长到了哪里。": "From close up I saw delicate purple flowers. At a distance it was all vigorous green. My childhood memories of kudzu bring back a pot of soup at home. Seeing it now, what I most want to do is follow a vine and find out how far it reaches.", "这是葛的荚果，扁扁的，长长的，表面密密覆着棕黄色的毛。托在手上看，毛的方向和果荚的轮廓都很清楚。": "Here are the kudzu pods: long, flat and thickly covered in tawny hairs. Holding one in my hand, I could see the outline of the pod and the direction in which the hairs lay.", "“毛茸茸”不一定意味着柔软，我当时摸着还有一点扎。把花和果实接起来看，眼前这条藤又多了一种很容易记住的样子。": "It looked furry but felt a little prickly to me. Putting the flowers and the pods together gave me one more way to recognise the vine.", "葛的复叶有三片小叶。有的叶片边缘比较完整，有的则裂出几个角，同一片叶丛里也能看到形状的变化。": "A kudzu leaf is compound, with three leaflets. Some had nearly unbroken margins, others had several lobes. I could see both shapes in the same patch.", "近看叶脉，再看看茎上的毛，把这些细节和紫色花序一起记下来。下一次走到一片浓密的藤蔓旁，就不只是被那一大团绿色晃过去了。": "I looked closely at the veins, then at the hairs on the stem. Those details are now part of my memory of the purple flowers. Next time I pass a mass of vines, I’ll have something to look for among all that green."}, "20241203-01": {"叶柄与扇形叶片的连接处，浅色叶柄向叶面中央延伸。": "The pale stalk extends towards the centre of the fan-shaped blade.", "叶柄基部的浅色毛被近照，手指正靠近粗糙表面观察。": "Close-up of pale hairs at the base of a leaf stalk, with a finger beside its rough surface.", "仰看叶间一大丹果实，果序分枝从树冠内向外伸出。": "Looking up at a large bunch of fruits; branches of the fruit cluster project out of the crown.", "叶间花序近照，细长分枝上密密排列着小花部。": "An inflorescence among the leaves, with small floral parts packed along its slender branches.", "一簇绿色果实近照，果皮表面光滑，顶端有细小暗点。": "Smooth green fruits in a cluster, each with a tiny dark spot at the tip.", "阳光穿过扇形叶片，狭长裂片间亮暗交替。": "Sunlight alternates with shadow between the narrow segments of the fan.", "从另一侧看树干，浅色环纹与深色纹理层层相叠。": "Another side of the trunk, with pale rings superimposed on darker markings.", "蓝灰色掌状叶片展开，许多狭长裂片从叶片基部向外放射。": "Long, narrow segments radiate from the base of the blue-grey palmate leaf.", "蓝灰色大扇形叶近照，裂片放射状排列。": "Close-up of a large blue-grey fan leaf with radiating segments.", "密集果实沿着粗分枝成簇排列，有的呈圆形，有的略带椭圆轮廓。": "Dense clusters of fruits on stout branches, some fruits round and others slightly oval.", "树干近照，一圈圈旧叶痕与粗糙表层交错。": "The rough trunk in close-up bears rings of old leaf scars.", "草坪上成排栽培的蓝脉葵，人站在大扇形叶旁观察。": "Rows of Latania on a lawn, with the observer beside the great fans.", "几片大扇形叶围着树冠展开，叶间挂着绿色果实。": "Large fans spread around the crown, with green fruits among the leaves.", "下垂花序的分枝，表面有许多细小突起。": "Branches of a hanging inflorescence with numerous tiny projections.", "从背光一侧近看叶片裂片，叶缘和褶脊有清楚的线条。": "Seen against the light, the edges and folded ridges of the leaf segments stand out.", "整株蓝脉葵，粗壮树干顶着一冠扇形叶与叶间果序。": "The whole palm, its sturdy trunk topped by a crown of fans with fruit clusters among them.", "银蓝色大扇子、带毛的叶柄和成串的果实，看看蓝脉葵与霸王棕究竟哪里不同。": "Silvery-blue fans, hairy leaf stalks and hanging clusters of fruit: what distinguishes this Latania from a Bismarck palm?", "一片大扇子，就有热带的感觉": "A fan with a tropical air", "蓝脉葵的大叶片一展开，银蓝色、灰绿色在光里变化，一片就有满满的热带感觉。第一次站在它旁边，忍不住想拿这片“大扇子”比一比。\n\n掌状分裂的叶片向外放射，叶子这么大，细看却是一条条有秩序的线。换到逆光的一边，亮暗交替，又变了一副样子。": "When one of these great leaves spreads open, its colour shifts between silvery blue and grey-green in the light. Just one fan gives the place a tropical air. The first time I stood beside one, I couldn't resist holding myself up against it for scale.\n\nThe leaf divides like a hand and its segments radiate outwards. For all its size, the blade is made up of remarkably orderly lines. Walk around to the backlit side and a new pattern of alternating light and shade appears.", "蓝脉葵的大叶片一展开，银蓝色、灰绿色在光里变化，一片就有满满的热带感觉。第一次站在它旁边，忍不住想拿这片“大扇子”比一比。": "When one of these great leaves spreads open, its colour shifts between silvery blue and grey-green in the light. Just one fan gives the place a tropical air. The first time I stood beside one, I couldn't resist holding myself up against it for scale.", "掌状分裂的叶片向外放射，叶子这么大，细看却是一条条有秩序的线。换到逆光的一边，亮暗交替，又变了一副样子。": "The leaf divides like a hand and its segments radiate outwards. For all its size, the blade is made up of remarkably orderly lines. Walk around to the backlit side and a new pattern of alternating light and shade appears.", "叶柄上的毛，也值得摸一摸": "The texture of a leaf stalk", "别只盯着叶面。长长的叶柄把大扇子托起来，到了基部和连接处，还能看到浅色毛被。凑近看，这一层质感很特别。\n\n我伸手摸了摸，并不是想象里软软的绒毛，而有些粗糙。光滑的叶面、粗糙的叶柄，同一株植物就能给人这么不同的触感。": "Look beyond the blade. A long stalk holds up that enormous fan, and at its base and the point of attachment there's a pale covering of hairs. It's a distinctive texture up close.\n\nI reached out to feel it. Rather than the soft down I'd imagined, the hairs felt quite rough. A smooth blade and a rough stalk: one plant, two very different sensations.", "别只盯着叶面。长长的叶柄把大扇子托起来，到了基部和连接处，还能看到浅色毛被。凑近看，这一层质感很特别。": "Look beyond the blade. A long stalk holds up that enormous fan, and at its base and the point of attachment there's a pale covering of hairs. It's a distinctive texture up close.", "我伸手摸了摸，并不是想象里软软的绒毛，而有些粗糙。光滑的叶面、粗糙的叶柄，同一株植物就能给人这么不同的触感。": "I reached out to feel it. Rather than the soft down I'd imagined, the hairs felt quite rough. A smooth blade and a rough stalk: one plant, two very different sensations.", "叶间那些长长的分枝是什么？": "Long branches among the fans", "大扇子之间，还藏着细长的花序分枝。镜头拉近，表面密密排列着小花部，和宽阔叶片形成了有趣的反差。\n\n蓝脉葵雌雄异株，花序也要放到具体植株上对照着看。这一回先记录眼前的形状和位置，不能只凭远远一眼，就把不同阶段、不同植株的花都混到一起。": "Long, fine branches of the inflorescence lie tucked between the fans. Through the lens I can see tiny flower parts crowded over their surface, quite a contrast with the broad blades.\n\nMale and female flowers occur on separate palms. To compare their inflorescences I need to know which plant I'm looking at. For now I'll record the shapes and positions in front of me, keeping different plants and stages distinct.", "大扇子之间，还藏着细长的花序分枝。镜头拉近，表面密密排列着小花部，和宽阔叶片形成了有趣的反差。": "Long, fine branches of the inflorescence lie tucked between the fans. Through the lens I can see tiny flower parts crowded over their surface, quite a contrast with the broad blades.", "蓝脉葵雌雄异株，花序也要放到具体植株上对照着看。这一回先记录眼前的形状和位置，不能只凭远远一眼，就把不同阶段、不同植株的花都混到一起。": "Male and female flowers occur on separate palms. To compare their inflorescences I need to know which plant I'm looking at. For now I'll record the shapes and positions in front of me, keeping different plants and stages distinct.", "树冠里，还挂着一大串绿果": "A great bunch of green fruits", "这棵树结了好多果实，圆圆的，挤在粗粗的分枝上，远看像挂了一大串还没成熟的水果。凑近，又能看见它们光滑的表面。\n\n我一直惦记着看看果核上的纹路，可这回摸到的果子还不是理想的观察状态。先把枝上的绿果好好记下来，找果核这件事，就留给下一次相遇。": "This palm has produced a remarkable number of fruits. They're round, crowded along stout branches like a big bunch of unripe fruit. Up close, their smooth surfaces are clearly visible.\n\nI've been hoping to see the markings on a fruit stone, but the fruits I could reach this time weren't at the right stage. For now I have a good record of the green bunches on the tree. The stones will have to wait.", "这棵树结了好多果实，圆圆的，挤在粗粗的分枝上，远看像挂了一大串还没成熟的水果。凑近，又能看见它们光滑的表面。": "This palm has produced a remarkable number of fruits. They're round, crowded along stout branches like a big bunch of unripe fruit. Up close, their smooth surfaces are clearly visible.", "我一直惦记着看看果核上的纹路，可这回摸到的果子还不是理想的观察状态。先把枝上的绿果好好记下来，找果核这件事，就留给下一次相遇。": "I've been hoping to see the markings on a fruit stone, but the fruits I could reach this time weren't at the right stage. For now I have a good record of the green bunches on the tree. The stones will have to wait.", "原来不是一棵矮矮的霸王棕": "A first impression corrected", "第一次看这排树，我还在想：怎么会有这么矮的霸王棕？它们的叶色和大扇子实在太像了。后来再细看、查名字，才把蓝脉葵分了出来。\n\n本篇的蓝脉葵是Latania loddigesii，属于红脉葵属；同片对照的霸王棕是Bismarckia nobilis，属于霸王棕属。长得像，也要各自记住名字，下次再见就更有意思。": "When I first saw this row of palms, I wondered why the Bismarck palms were so short. The leaf colour and great fans look remarkably alike. A closer look and a check of the names finally helped me distinguish this Latania.\n\nThe palm in this record is Latania loddigesii, of the genus Latania. The Bismarck palm I used for comparison is Bismarckia nobilis, in a different genus. Remembering both names should make the next encounter more interesting.", "第一次看这排树，我还在想：怎么会有这么矮的霸王棕？它们的叶色和大扇子实在太像了。后来再细看、查名字，才把蓝脉葵分了出来。": "When I first saw this row of palms, I wondered why the Bismarck palms were so short. The leaf colour and great fans look remarkably alike. A closer look and a check of the names finally helped me distinguish this Latania.", "本篇的蓝脉葵是Latania loddigesii，属于红脉葵属；同片对照的霸王棕是Bismarckia nobilis，属于霸王棕属。长得像，也要各自记住名字，下次再见就更有意思。": "The palm in this record is Latania loddigesii, of the genus Latania. The Bismarck palm I used for comparison is Bismarckia nobilis, in a different genus. Remembering both names should make the next encounter more interesting.", "文稿明确列出Bismarckia nobilis并安排切入霸王棕素材。": "The manuscript names Bismarckia nobilis and calls for a cutaway to that palm.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与正式等级按列明的POWO/WCVP证据保留；中文为辅助对照，名称核对不等于影像鉴定。": "Scientific names and formal ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP evidence. Chinese names are provided for reference. Checking a name does not independently identify the plant in a photograph.", "Latania loddigesii（NParks）": "Latania loddigesii (NParks)", "红脉葵属（植物智）": "The genus Latania on iPlant"}, "20261023-01": {"树冠边缘伸向天空的叶枝。": "Leafy branch at the edge of the crown reaching into the sky.", "一片透光的复叶，小叶沿叶轴两侧排列。": "Light shines through a compound leaf with leaflets on either side of its axis.", "拍摄现场，人在大树旁观察枝叶。": "At the filming site, the observer examines the foliage beside the large tree.", "叶间的一小簇果实，悬在细梗上。": "A small fruit cluster hangs on thin stalks among the leaves.", "仰看树冠中间的主干与叶枝。": "Looking up at the main trunk and leafy branches within the crown.", "人面子高大的树冠，像一把展开的绿伞。": "The tall canopy of Dracontomelon spreads like a green umbrella.", "枝头几枚圆果，表面已经转褐。": "Several round fruits at the tips of branches have turned brown.", "本期封面：掌心里多枚带凹纹的硬果核。": "Video cover: several hard, grooved fruit stones in a hand.", "从叶子下面仰看，成排小叶映着天空。": "Looking up from beneath the leaf, rows of leaflets stand out against the sky.", "树下仰望，茂密叶片遮出浓密树荫。": "Looking up from beneath the tree, thick foliage casts deep shade.", "剥开的实物果实，露出浅色果肉与硬核。": "Peeled fruit revealing pale flesh and a hard stone.", "枝头小白花组成的疏松花序。": "A loose inflorescence of small white flowers at a shoot tip.", "掌心里收集到的果实，绿色与褐黄色同框。": "Green and yellow-brown fruits gathered in a hand.", "另一帧手中的圆果，果皮斑点清晰。": "Another view of round fruits in a hand, showing speckles on their skins.", "近看果核，各不相同的凹纹像一张张小脸。": "The hollows differ from stone to stone and look like little faces.", "人面子的果实与羽状复叶藏在树冠之间。": "Fruits and pinnate leaves of Dracontomelon duperreanum tucked into the canopy.", "果核上藏着一张张小脸，人面子在树下留下了很有趣的见面礼。": "There are little faces hidden in the fruit stones. Under this tree I found the most curious introduction to it.", "这一张脸，有点愁眉苦脸": "This face looks rather glum", "你看，像不像一张人的脸？眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴，越看越像一副有表情的面孔。\n\n这些“小脸”其实是人面子的果核，质地很硬，表面天然的凹凸纹路深深浅浅。放在手心里，每一枚的神情还不太一样，难怪会有鬼脸菩提这样的商品俗称。": "Do you see a face? Eyes, a nose, a mouth: the longer I look, the more distinctly I can see an expression.\n\nThe “faces” are hard fruit stones from rénmiànzǐ, the tree whose Chinese name evokes a human face. Natural bumps and hollows vary in depth. In my palm each stone seems to wear a different expression. I can see why traders call them “goblin-face bodhi.”", "你看，像不像一张人的脸？眼睛、鼻子、嘴巴，越看越像一副有表情的面孔。": "Do you see a face? Eyes, a nose, a mouth: the longer I look, the more distinctly I can see an expression.", "这些“小脸”其实是人面子的果核，质地很硬，表面天然的凹凸纹路深深浅浅。放在手心里，每一枚的神情还不太一样，难怪会有鬼脸菩提这样的商品俗称。": "The “faces” are hard fruit stones from rénmiànzǐ, the tree whose Chinese name evokes a human face. Natural bumps and hollows vary in depth. In my palm each stone seems to wear a different expression. I can see why traders call them “goblin-face bodhi.”", "树下，已经掉了许多圆果": "Round fruits beneath the tree", "这次来时，果实已经熟了，树下落了不少。我捡起几枚看看，外面圆圆的，绿色、褐黄色夹在一起，和里面的鬼脸完全不是一种样子。\n\n剥开实物果实，外面的果肉包着坚硬果核。我在视频里尝到的是淡淡的酸甜味，比起加工后的味道，自己更喜欢这次新鲜的感觉。": "The fruits were ripe when I visited, and quite a few had fallen. I picked up several. Round on the outside, some green and some brownish yellow, they looked nothing like the faces inside.\n\nPeeling one revealed the flesh around the hard stone. The fresh fruit I tasted in the video was mildly sweet and tart. I preferred it that way to the processed kind I'd tried before.", "这次来时，果实已经熟了，树下落了不少。我捡起几枚看看，外面圆圆的，绿色、褐黄色夹在一起，和里面的鬼脸完全不是一种样子。": "The fruits were ripe when I visited, and quite a few had fallen. I picked up several. Round on the outside, some green and some brownish yellow, they looked nothing like the faces inside.", "剥开实物果实，外面的果肉包着坚硬果核。我在视频里尝到的是淡淡的酸甜味，比起加工后的味道，自己更喜欢这次新鲜的感觉。": "Peeling one revealed the flesh around the hard stone. The fresh fruit I tasted in the video was mildly sweet and tart. I preferred it that way to the processed kind I'd tried before.", "别只找果子，也看看小白花": "Little white flowers, too", "人面子的花比果核低调得多。小小的白花组成疏松花序，顶在绿色枝叶之间，远看只是树冠上的一点浅色。\n\n把花与圆果、硬果核放在一起看，同一株树的几个阶段终于串起来了。原来“人脸”只是它最后留下的一份特别小礼物。": "The flowers are far less conspicuous than the stones. Small white flowers form loose clusters among the green branches; from a distance they register as little more than a pale patch in the crown.\n\nPut the flowers alongside the round fruits and hard stones, and different stages in the life of the tree come together. The “face” is a parting gift it leaves behind.", "人面子的花比果核低调得多。小小的白花组成疏松花序，顶在绿色枝叶之间，远看只是树冠上的一点浅色。": "The flowers are far less conspicuous than the stones. Small white flowers form loose clusters among the green branches; from a distance they register as little more than a pale patch in the crown.", "把花与圆果、硬果核放在一起看，同一株树的几个阶段终于串起来了。原来“人脸”只是它最后留下的一份特别小礼物。": "Put the flowers alongside the round fruits and hard stones, and different stages in the life of the tree come together. The “face” is a parting gift it leaves behind.", "树冠撑起一把大绿伞": "A big green umbrella", "抬头再看，奇数羽状复叶一片片展开，小叶排成两列，在光里连成一大片绿荫。树高，树冠也很大，人站在旁边一下变小了。\n\n从一枚果核的怪表情，看到一整棵树的大绿伞，人面子这个名字，已经很难再忘记了。": "Looking up I see pinnate leaves ending in a single leaflet. The leaflets stand in two rows and join in the light to cast a wide patch of shade. The tree is tall, its crown spreading; a person looks very small beside it.\n\nFrom an odd expression on a single stone to the great green umbrella of a whole tree: I don't think I'll forget the name rénmiànzǐ.", "抬头再看，奇数羽状复叶一片片展开，小叶排成两列，在光里连成一大片绿荫。树高，树冠也很大，人站在旁边一下变小了。": "Looking up I see pinnate leaves ending in a single leaflet. The leaflets stand in two rows and join in the light to cast a wide patch of shade. The tree is tall, its crown spreading; a person looks very small beside it.", "从一枚果核的怪表情，看到一整棵树的大绿伞，人面子这个名字，已经很难再忘记了。": "From an odd expression on a single stone to the great green umbrella of a whole tree: I don't think I'll forget the name rénmiànzǐ.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "人面子 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 人面子"}, "20240902-01": {"本期封面：披着细毛、尚未完全展开的嫩叶。": "Video cover: a young, hairy frond not yet fully unfurled.", "尚在伸展的新叶，叶轴与细小羽片被柔毛。": "Fine hairs on the axis and small pinnae of a frond still unfurling.", "手持一片叶子翻看背面。": "Turning a frond over in the hand to inspect the underside.", "一片展开的华南毛蕨叶，羽片从中轴两侧伸出。": "Pinnae extend from either side of the axis of an unfurled Thelypteris frond.", "成株的叶片舒展在林下光影中。": "Mature fronds spread out in dappled woodland light.", "顺着叶面观察，叶裂的边缘排成细齿。": "Fine teeth along the edges of the lobes, viewed along the frond surface.", "林下多片蕨叶互相交叠的样子。": "Many fronds overlap on the woodland floor.", "侧看层层排列的羽片与羽裂。": "Side view of tiers of pinnae and their lobes.", "俯看一片绿色蕨叶，羽片长短逐渐变化。": "Viewed from above, the pinnae change gradually in length along a green frond.", "叶片背面近景，细脉与细毛可见。": "Fine veins and hairs on the underside of a frond.", "华南毛蕨，嫩叶像小拳头，长大后铺成一片毛茸茸的绿羽毛。": "The young fronds of this fern curl like little fists. As they open, they spread into a patch of softly hairy green feathers.", "先看这片毛茸茸的绿": "The feel of all that green", "林下的这片嫩绿，摸一摸，好像就能猜出名字里为什么有个“毛”字。叶轴和羽片上都有细细的毛，近看柔柔软软的。\n\n这是华南毛蕨，也有东方毛蕨的称呼。在南方走山路时，常会被它这副很精神的绿色模样吸引。": "Touch this fresh green patch under the trees and it's easy to guess why its Chinese name contains máo, “hair.” Fine hairs cover both the frond axis and its divisions. Up close they look wonderfully soft.\n\nThis fern is called Huánán máojué, or Dōngfāng máojué. Its lively green often catches my eye beside mountain paths in the south.", "林下的这片嫩绿，摸一摸，好像就能猜出名字里为什么有个“毛”字。叶轴和羽片上都有细细的毛，近看柔柔软软的。": "Touch this fresh green patch under the trees and it's easy to guess why its Chinese name contains máo, “hair.” Fine hairs cover both the frond axis and its divisions. Up close they look wonderfully soft.", "这是华南毛蕨，也有东方毛蕨的称呼。在南方走山路时，常会被它这副很精神的绿色模样吸引。": "This fern is called Huánán máojué, or Dōngfāng máojué. Its lively green often catches my eye beside mountain paths in the south.", "小拳头，慢慢展开": "A little fist opens out", "新长出来的叶子还没有完全打开，叶轴两边挂着小小的羽片，末端带着拳卷的弯。\n\n我喜欢看蕨叶这个阶段：整齐的大羽毛还没形成，却已经能看出以后伸展的方向。细毛和嫩绿色凑在一起，像是山林里刚刚醒来的小精灵。": "A new frond hasn't quite opened yet. Tiny pinnae hang on either side of the axis and the tip still has the curl of a fist.\n\nI love ferns at this stage. The orderly feather hasn't taken shape, but I can already see the direction it will grow in. The fine hairs and tender green remind me of a little woodland creature just waking up.", "新长出来的叶子还没有完全打开，叶轴两边挂着小小的羽片，末端带着拳卷的弯。": "A new frond hasn't quite opened yet. Tiny pinnae hang on either side of the axis and the tip still has the curl of a fist.", "我喜欢看蕨叶这个阶段：整齐的大羽毛还没形成，却已经能看出以后伸展的方向。细毛和嫩绿色凑在一起，像是山林里刚刚醒来的小精灵。": "I love ferns at this stage. The orderly feather hasn't taken shape, but I can already see the direction it will grow in. The fine hairs and tender green remind me of a little woodland creature just waking up.", "把叶子翻到背面": "Turn a frond over", "长大后的叶子一层层舒展开来。顺着中轴看，两侧的羽片再分出细裂，一片叶子就铺出了许多重复的小图案。\n\n我又把叶子翻过来，让镜头靠近叶背。正面看是绿色羽毛，背面则能找到细毛、叶脉和更多不容易留意的纹理，换个角度也很有意思。": "Mature fronds open in overlapping layers. Follow the central axis and the pinnae on either side divide into finer lobes, repeating a little pattern many times across one frond.\n\nI turn it over and bring the lens close to the underside. From above it's a green feather; beneath are hairs, veins and textures easy to overlook. It's well worth changing position.", "长大后的叶子一层层舒展开来。顺着中轴看，两侧的羽片再分出细裂，一片叶子就铺出了许多重复的小图案。": "Mature fronds open in overlapping layers. Follow the central axis and the pinnae on either side divide into finer lobes, repeating a little pattern many times across one frond.", "我又把叶子翻过来，让镜头靠近叶背。正面看是绿色羽毛，背面则能找到细毛、叶脉和更多不容易留意的纹理，换个角度也很有意思。": "I turn it over and bring the lens close to the underside. From above it's a green feather; beneath are hairs, veins and textures easy to overlook. It's well worth changing position.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "华南毛蕨 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 华南毛蕨"}, "20240812-01": {"叶丛近景，深浅绿色的折面相接。": "Light and dark green facets meet across the pleated foliage.", "展开的长叶从植株基部向四周伸展。": "Long, open leaves reach outwards from the base of the plant.", "本期封面：透光的绿色叶片与密集褶纹。": "Video cover: light through the densely folded green blade.", "弯成弧线的叶片，与后方直立叶片交叠。": "An arched leaf overlaps the upright blades behind it.", "大叶仙茅手绘：折纹长叶与基部花序。": "Drawing of Curculigo capitulata: long pleated leaves and basal inflorescence.", "站在植株旁，近看手边的大叶。": "The observer examines one of the large leaves beside the plant.", "植株基部密集的叶柄与展开的叶片。": "Crowded leaf stalks at the base and open blades above.", "近看花序，黄色花被片与褐色花后结构同框。": "Close-up showing yellow tepals beside brown structures left after flowering.", "基部的短花序，一簇黄色小花露在苞片之间。": "A short inflorescence at the base, yellow flowers showing between bracts.", "大叶仙茅的叶面，平行褶纹在透光处亮起来。": "Parallel pleats light up where light passes through the Curculigo blade.", "细长叶片近景，叶面像折叠过的纸扇。": "Close-up of a narrow blade folded like a paper fan.", "一片直立的深绿叶，叶面纵向褶纹清晰。": "A deep green upright leaf with distinct lengthwise folds.", "从叶丛内部观察，大大小小的叶子相互遮挡。": "From inside the clump, blades of different sizes mask one another.", "整丛大叶仙茅，长叶高低错落。": "A whole Curculigo clump with long leaves at varying heights.", "抬起一片长叶，比较叶片与人的身量。": "A long leaf held up for comparison with a person’s height.", "从另一侧看低处的小黄花。": "Another view of the little yellow flowers low on the plant.", "大叶仙茅把叶子折成一把把绿扇，低处还藏着不容易发现的黄色小花。": "Each large pleated leaf looks like a green fan. Tucked low down between the leaves are small yellow flowers that are easy to miss.", "一把把绿色的折扇": "Green folding fans", "仙气十足，说的就是眼前这片大叶仙茅。叶子翠绿，纵向的褶纹一条条排开，像刚刚展开的折扇。\n\n我把镜头贴近这些凹凸的折面，光照到的地方明亮，背光处又是深绿。明明还没看到花，已经被叶子吸引得挪不开眼了。": "There's something otherworldly about this patch of Curculigo. The bright green leaves are pleated lengthwise, like folding fans that have just been opened.\n\nI bring the camera close to those ridges and folds. The lit surfaces shine; on the shaded side the green deepens. I haven't even seen a flower yet and I can hardly take my eyes off the leaves.", "仙气十足，说的就是眼前这片大叶仙茅。叶子翠绿，纵向的褶纹一条条排开，像刚刚展开的折扇。": "There's something otherworldly about this patch of Curculigo. The bright green leaves are pleated lengthwise, like folding fans that have just been opened.", "我把镜头贴近这些凹凸的折面，光照到的地方明亮，背光处又是深绿。明明还没看到花，已经被叶子吸引得挪不开眼了。": "I bring the camera close to those ridges and folds. The lit surfaces shine; on the shaded side the green deepens. I haven't even seen a flower yet and I can hardly take my eyes off the leaves.", "如果叶子能当一只船": "A leaf for a little boat", "这片长长的大叶，也有一点小船的样子。大叶仙茅有船船叶这个别称，看到它，忍不住想把李白笔下的轻舟也请进来。\n\n抬起一片叶子看看，它比想象中还长。小时候的叶丛或许会让人想到棕榈，但大叶仙茅是仙茅科植物，不能只凭这把大叶子就把它归进棕榈科。": "One of these long leaves has the shape of a boat. A Chinese nickname means “boat leaf,” and it puts me in mind of the light skiff in a poem by Li Bai.\n\nI lift a blade and find it's even longer than I expected. A young clump could suggest a palm, but Curculigo belongs to the family Hypoxidaceae. One broad leaf doesn't make it a palm.", "这片长长的大叶，也有一点小船的样子。大叶仙茅有船船叶这个别称，看到它，忍不住想把李白笔下的轻舟也请进来。": "One of these long leaves has the shape of a boat. A Chinese nickname means “boat leaf,” and it puts me in mind of the light skiff in a poem by Li Bai.", "抬起一片叶子看看，它比想象中还长。小时候的叶丛或许会让人想到棕榈，但大叶仙茅是仙茅科植物，不能只凭这把大叶子就把它归进棕榈科。": "I lift a blade and find it's even longer than I expected. A young clump could suggest a palm, but Curculigo belongs to the family Hypoxidaceae. One broad leaf doesn't make it a palm.", "低一点，黄花躲在这里": "Yellow flowers close to the ground", "这次拍摄时，正好赶上了开花。花序在比较低的位置，缩在长叶和叶柄之间，不仔细找，很容易被整片绿叶抢走目光。\n\n黄色的小花一朵朵探出来，像给叶丛点了几颗星星。原来这株植物不只有高调的大叶，也有低处的小小热闹。": "I was lucky to catch it flowering. The inflorescences sit quite low, tucked between long leaves and their stalks. Unless you go looking, all that green easily takes over the view.\n\nLittle yellow flowers peek out one by one, like stars dotted through the clump. The leaves may put on the biggest show, but there's plenty happening down below.", "这次拍摄时，正好赶上了开花。花序在比较低的位置，缩在长叶和叶柄之间，不仔细找，很容易被整片绿叶抢走目光。": "I was lucky to catch it flowering. The inflorescences sit quite low, tucked between long leaves and their stalks. Unless you go looking, all that green easily takes over the view.", "黄色的小花一朵朵探出来，像给叶丛点了几颗星星。原来这株植物不只有高调的大叶，也有低处的小小热闹。": "Little yellow flowers peek out one by one, like stars dotted through the clump. The leaves may put on the biggest show, but there's plenty happening down below.", "文稿包裹食物的叶材对照；不推断具体箬竹种。": "Leaves used to wrap food are compared in the manuscript. No particular bamboo species was inferred.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "大叶仙茅 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 大叶仙茅"}, "20241024-01": {"手中托着几片绿色羽片，顶端和边缘呈参差的齿状。": "Green leaflets held in a hand; their tips and edges are irregularly toothed.", "从基部仰看，许多叶柄聚在一起，形成密密的丛生姿态。": "Looking up from the base shows many leaf stalks packed into a dense clump.", "把羽片翻到背面，灰白色表面与正面的深绿形成反差。": "Turning a leaflet over reveals its grey-white underside against the dark green upper surface.", "枝间成串的果子有黄、有红，也有尚未变色的绿色。": "Bunches of fruit among the branches are yellow, red and still-unripe green.", "果皮分开后，可看见灰白色内部组织，外侧仍带橙色果皮。": "The split skin reveals grey-white tissue inside, with orange rind still attached.", "彩色果串集中在叶柄之间，周围是长长的绿色羽片。": "Colourful fruit clusters sit between leaf stalks, surrounded by long green leaflets.", "叶轴与羽片连接处的近照，羽片沿两侧依次排列。": "Close-up of leaflets attached in sequence along both sides of the axis.", "叶片顶端的羽片近照，边缘有明显的不规则缺刻。": "Irregular notches on the margins of the leaflets near the tip of the frond.", "一大串黄色果实垂在叶丛下面，部分果子带着深色斑点。": "A large yellow fruit bunch hangs below the leaves; some fruits have dark spots.", "近看果序，黄、橙、红色小果沿分枝密集排列。": "Yellow, orange and red fruits crowd the branches of the cluster.", "阳光穿过山棕叶丛，长叶层层交叠，在下面留出阴凉。": "Sunlight filters through layers of palm fronds, leaving shade beneath.", "从叶片下方仰看，羽片间的缝隙透出明亮天空。": "Glimpses of bright sky through gaps between leaflets viewed from below.", "山棕的羽状大叶，狭长羽片沿着叶轴向两侧展开。": "Large pinnate Arenga leaves, with narrow leaflets spreading on either side of the axis.", "站在一大丛山棕旁，抬手指向上方伸展的羽状叶。": "The observer points to the spreading pinnate fronds beside a large Arenga clump.", "彩色果串藏在羽状大叶间，翻一翻叶背，再看看那些像被啃过的羽片边缘。": "Bright fruit clusters hide among great feather-like leaves. Turn over a leaflet, then look at its edges: they seem to have been nibbled.", "大叶子下面，藏着一串串颜色": "Colour under the leaves", "远远看山棕，先看见的是一大丛长长的叶子。往叶丛下面找一找，果子才露出来：黄的、橙的、红的，挤在一串串分枝上。\n\n同一个果序上也能看见颜色的变化。原先只是路边一团绿色，走近以后，竟然藏着这么热闹的细节。": "From a distance this Arenga palm looks like a great clump of long fronds. Look beneath them and the fruit appears: yellow, orange and red, clustered on branching stalks.\n\nSeveral colours occur even within a single cluster. What looked from the road like an ordinary patch of green hides an extraordinary amount of activity.", "远远看山棕，先看见的是一大丛长长的叶子。往叶丛下面找一找，果子才露出来：黄的、橙的、红的，挤在一串串分枝上。": "From a distance this Arenga palm looks like a great clump of long fronds. Look beneath them and the fruit appears: yellow, orange and red, clustered on branching stalks.", "同一个果序上也能看见颜色的变化。原先只是路边一团绿色，走近以后，竟然藏着这么热闹的细节。": "Several colours occur even within a single cluster. What looked from the road like an ordinary patch of green hides an extraordinary amount of activity.", "这些叶边，怎么像被啃过？": "Who's been nibbling the edges?", "山棕的大叶子像一根长羽毛，小羽片沿着叶轴向两侧排开。托起几片看，顶端和边缘参差不齐，像被谁啃了几口。\n\n这正是它很有记忆点的模样。过去看到这样的边缘，我很容易先往虫咬上想；如今再认识山棕，便会多看一眼这些羽片本来的形状。": "Each great frond resembles a long feather, with leaflets arranged along either side of its axis. I lift a few. Their tips and edges are ragged, as if someone had taken little bites out of them.\n\nIt's a memorable feature of this palm. I used to assume that edges like these meant insect damage. Now I stop to look at the natural shape of the leaflets first.", "山棕的大叶子像一根长羽毛，小羽片沿着叶轴向两侧排开。托起几片看，顶端和边缘参差不齐，像被谁啃了几口。": "Each great frond resembles a long feather, with leaflets arranged along either side of its axis. I lift a few. Their tips and edges are ragged, as if someone had taken little bites out of them.", "这正是它很有记忆点的模样。过去看到这样的边缘，我很容易先往虫咬上想；如今再认识山棕，便会多看一眼这些羽片本来的形状。": "It's a memorable feature of this palm. I used to assume that edges like these meant insect damage. Now I stop to look at the natural shape of the leaflets first.", "翻过来，叶背换了一个颜色": "Another colour underneath", "叶片正面是深绿色，翻到背面，却成了浅浅的灰绿色。光从羽片之间漏下来，明暗落在手心和叶面上，又多了一层变化。\n\n认植物时，翻一翻叶子常有惊喜。同一片羽片，两面给人的感觉这么不同，难怪我会拿在手里看了又看。": "The upper surface is dark green. Turn a leaflet over and its underside is a much paler grey-green. Light filters between the leaflets and falls in patches across my palm and the blades.\n\nTurning a leaf over often brings a surprise. These two sides make such different impressions that I find myself looking back and forth again.", "叶片正面是深绿色，翻到背面，却成了浅浅的灰绿色。光从羽片之间漏下来，明暗落在手心和叶面上，又多了一层变化。": "The upper surface is dark green. Turn a leaflet over and its underside is a much paler grey-green. Light filters between the leaflets and falls in patches across my palm and the blades.", "认植物时，翻一翻叶子常有惊喜。同一片羽片，两面给人的感觉这么不同，难怪我会拿在手里看了又看。": "Turning a leaf over often brings a surprise. These two sides make such different impressions that I find myself looking back and forth again.", "站远一点，看一丛山棕的样子": "Step back to see the clump", "镜头拉远，才知道这些长叶怎样一层层聚在一起。叶柄从基部往外伸，羽状大叶展开，下面就有了一小片阴凉。\n\n山棕还有香棕、香桄榔等称呼。眼下我想记住的，是彩色果串、参差羽片，还有阳光在这丛大叶子里轻轻摇晃的样子。": "From farther away I can see how the long leaves grow in layers. Stalks reach out from the base, spreading their pinnate blades to make a small patch of shade below.\n\nXiāngzōng and xiāngguāngláng are two other Chinese names for this palm. What I want to remember now is the colourful fruit, the ragged leaflets and the sunlight moving gently through those great fronds.", "镜头拉远，才知道这些长叶怎样一层层聚在一起。叶柄从基部往外伸，羽状大叶展开，下面就有了一小片阴凉。": "From farther away I can see how the long leaves grow in layers. Stalks reach out from the base, spreading their pinnate blades to make a small patch of shade below.", "山棕还有香棕、香桄榔等称呼。眼下我想记住的，是彩色果串、参差羽片，还有阳光在这丛大叶子里轻轻摇晃的样子。": "Xiāngzōng and xiāngguāngláng are two other Chinese names for this palm. What I want to remember now is the colourful fruit, the ragged leaflets and the sunlight moving gently through those great fronds.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "山棕 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 山棕"}, "20241008-01": {"柠檬桉手绘：披针形叶、花苞与小果。": "Drawing of lemon-scented gum: lance-shaped leaves, flower buds and small fruits.", "沿着林间小路看柠檬桉，浅色树干间还有其它植物。": "Along a woodland path, other plants grow between the pale gum trunks.", "从林下看树干群落与周围植被。": "Trunks and surrounding vegetation as seen from the woodland floor.", "观察者站在林间，人与树干同框。": "An observer standing beside the trunks in the woodland.", "树干上的浅褐色斑块与薄片边缘。": "Pale brown patches and edges of bark flakes on the trunk.", "掌心里的一簇小果，部分果实顶部已经开口。": "Small fruits in a hand, some already open at their tips.", "树皮上密集的浅凹与旧痕。": "Shallow pits and old scars cover the bark.", "本期封面：仰望柠檬桉笔直高大的浅色树干。": "Video cover: looking up along the straight, tall, pale trunk of a lemon-scented gum.", "脱皮后较光滑的树干表面。": "Smoother surface of the trunk after the bark has peeled.", "树干表面灰绿与浅色斑纹。": "Grey-green and pale markings on the trunk.", "林中高高直立的树干，从绿地向上伸出。": "Tall trunks rise straight from the green woodland floor.", "树皮近景，深浅不一的斑块相接。": "Close view of neighbouring light and dark patches of bark.", "一束深褐色干果，圆形开口朝向镜头。": "A bunch of dry dark brown fruits with round openings towards the lens.", "拍摄时近看翘起、脱落的旧树皮。": "Examining a curling piece of old bark as it flakes away.", "树干上部分枝，叶冠在高处展开。": "The trunk branches high up and its leafy crown spreads overhead.", "高高的浅色树干，脱落的旧树皮，再加上一阵柠檬气息，认识柠檬桉。": "A tall pale trunk, peeling bark and a breath of lemon: a first look at the lemon-scented gum.", "先到这位林中仙子脚下": "At the foot of an elegant tree", "玉树临风、林中仙子……看到柠檬桉，很容易想出这些形容。浅色树干笔直地伸上去，树冠却在很高的地方才铺开。\n\n我喜欢站在树下，顺着树干一直抬头看。走近感受它，还有让我很喜欢的柠檬气息；植物除了颜色和形状，也可以用气味留下印象。": "Standing before this gum, I'm inclined to reach for phrases like “a forest fairy.” The pale trunk rises straight up, and the crown doesn't begin to spread until high overhead.\n\nI like standing at the base and following that trunk upward with my eyes. Up close there's also a lemon scent I particularly enjoy. Smell can stay with me just as clearly as a shape or a colour.", "玉树临风、林中仙子……看到柠檬桉，很容易想出这些形容。浅色树干笔直地伸上去，树冠却在很高的地方才铺开。": "Standing before this gum, I'm inclined to reach for phrases like “a forest fairy.” The pale trunk rises straight up, and the crown doesn't begin to spread until high overhead.", "我喜欢站在树下，顺着树干一直抬头看。走近感受它，还有让我很喜欢的柠檬气息；植物除了颜色和形状，也可以用气味留下印象。": "I like standing at the base and following that trunk upward with my eyes. Up close there's also a lemon scent I particularly enjoy. Smell can stay with me just as clearly as a shape or a colour.", "不是没有树皮，而是在换皮": "A tree shedding its bark", "乍一看，光滑的浅色树干好像没有树皮。仔细观察，旧的外层正在薄薄地翘起、剥落，下面露出颜色不同的新表面。\n\n深灰、浅白、微绿的斑块拼在一起，每一小段树干都有不同纹理。原来那个“不要皮”的玩笑，背后是树皮不断更替的过程。": "At first glance the smooth, pale trunk looks almost bare of bark. Look closer and the old outer layer is lifting and peeling off in thin sheets, exposing a new surface of a different colour beneath.\n\nDark grey, whitish and faintly green patches fit together like pieces of a puzzle. Each section has a different pattern. The joke about this “barkless” tree turns out to be about bark continually renewing itself.", "乍一看，光滑的浅色树干好像没有树皮。仔细观察，旧的外层正在薄薄地翘起、剥落，下面露出颜色不同的新表面。": "At first glance the smooth, pale trunk looks almost bare of bark. Look closer and the old outer layer is lifting and peeling off in thin sheets, exposing a new surface of a different colour beneath.", "深灰、浅白、微绿的斑块拼在一起，每一小段树干都有不同纹理。原来那个“不要皮”的玩笑，背后是树皮不断更替的过程。": "Dark grey, whitish and faintly green patches fit together like pieces of a puzzle. Each section has a different pattern. The joke about this “barkless” tree turns out to be about bark continually renewing itself.", "高树上，也有这样小的果": "Tiny fruits from a tall tree", "看完高大的树，再把目光放到手里的小东西上。枝梗上连着一些深褐色小果，顶端圆圆的开口很有辨识度。\n\n有的还留着绿色，旁边也有顶端闭合的小圆结构。从高处的整片树冠，到掌心这一小束，尺度一下变小，细节却更丰富了。": "After that great tree I turn to the little things in my hand. Some dark brown fruits are still attached to the twig. The round openings at their tips are distinctive.\n\nSome still show green, and nearby are small round structures whose tops are closed. From a whole canopy overhead to a little cluster in my hand, the scale shrinks and the details multiply.", "看完高大的树，再把目光放到手里的小东西上。枝梗上连着一些深褐色小果，顶端圆圆的开口很有辨识度。": "After that great tree I turn to the little things in my hand. Some dark brown fruits are still attached to the twig. The round openings at their tips are distinctive.", "有的还留着绿色，旁边也有顶端闭合的小圆结构。从高处的整片树冠，到掌心这一小束，尺度一下变小，细节却更丰富了。": "Some still show green, and nearby are small round structures whose tops are closed. From a whole canopy overhead to a little cluster in my hand, the scale shrinks and the details multiply.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "柠檬桉 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 柠檬桉"}, "20240820-01": {"蕨叶旁的一朵紫色小花。": "A small purple flower beside a fern frond.", "拍摄现场，蹲在草丛旁观察毛麝香。": "At the filming site, the observer crouches beside the grass to examine Adenosma.", "本期封面：两朵紫花与细长花序。": "Video cover: two purple flowers and a slender inflorescence.", "茎节、叶柄与茎表面的细毛。": "Fine hairs on the stem, node and leaf stalk.", "近看嫩梢，一对对小叶从茎节伸出。": "Paired young leaves emerging at the nodes on a shoot tip.", "对生的绿色叶片，叶脉与齿状叶缘清晰。": "Opposite green leaves with distinct veins and toothed edges.", "林边的毛麝香，嫩叶与紫色小花同时入镜。": "Young leaves and purple flowers of Adenosma at the woodland edge.", "正面看紫花，下方花冠展开成小唇。": "Purple flower from the front, its lower corolla spreading into a small lip.", "花序近景，盛开小花与上端花苞同框。": "Open flowers and unopened buds higher up the same inflorescence.", "一朵下垂小花，花冠上可见浅色细纹。": "A hanging flower with fine pale lines on the corolla.", "毛麝香手绘：对生叶、花序与唇形花冠。": "Drawing of Adenosma: opposite leaves, inflorescence and lipped corolla.", "草与蕨叶之间，毛麝香的紫花向外伸展。": "Purple Adenosma blossoms reach out between grass and fern leaves.", "有细毛，也有淡淡香气，毛麝香把紫色小花开在林边草丛里。": "With fine hairs, a faint scent and small purple flowers, this Adenosma grows among the herbs at the edge of the woods.", "植物世界里的“麝香”": "A hint of “musk” in a plant name", "在林边遇见一株开紫花的小草，它叫毛麝香。看名字就知道，香气和细毛都是认识它时绕不开的线索。\n\n卵形叶子一对对地长，乍一看还有一点像薄荷。不过这次遇见的是车前科毛麝香属的植物，不能因为叶形相像就把它当薄荷。": "I came upon a little purple-flowered herb at the woodland edge. Its Chinese name, máoshèxiāng, points to two clues worth following: fine hairs and fragrance.\n\nThe egg-shaped leaves grow in opposite pairs. At first sight they put me in mind of mint, but this plant is an Adenosma in the plantain family. Leaf shape alone isn't enough to call it mint.", "在林边遇见一株开紫花的小草，它叫毛麝香。看名字就知道，香气和细毛都是认识它时绕不开的线索。": "I came upon a little purple-flowered herb at the woodland edge. Its Chinese name, máoshèxiāng, points to two clues worth following: fine hairs and fragrance.", "卵形叶子一对对地长，乍一看还有一点像薄荷。不过这次遇见的是车前科毛麝香属的植物，不能因为叶形相像就把它当薄荷。": "The egg-shaped leaves grow in opposite pairs. At first sight they put me in mind of mint, but this plant is an Adenosma in the plantain family. Leaf shape alone isn't enough to call it mint.", "小紫花，清新又优雅": "Small, elegant purple flowers", "枝梢上的花一朵朵开放，紫色花冠从绿色花萼间伸出来。下方展开的小唇上，浅色纹路也清清楚楚。\n\n周围都是草与蕨类，这一点点紫色反而更容易让人注意。蹲下来，让镜头靠近，才能看清小花精巧的轮廓。": "Flowers open one by one at the shoot tips. Purple corollas emerge from green calyces, and pale markings show clearly on the little lower lip.\n\nAmong the surrounding grasses and ferns, that hint of purple catches the eye. Only by crouching and bringing the camera close can I see the delicate outline of a flower.", "枝梢上的花一朵朵开放，紫色花冠从绿色花萼间伸出来。下方展开的小唇上，浅色纹路也清清楚楚。": "Flowers open one by one at the shoot tips. Purple corollas emerge from green calyces, and pale markings show clearly on the little lower lip.", "周围都是草与蕨类，这一点点紫色反而更容易让人注意。蹲下来，让镜头靠近，才能看清小花精巧的轮廓。": "Among the surrounding grasses and ferns, that hint of purple catches the eye. Only by crouching and bringing the camera close can I see the delicate outline of a flower.", "细毛和香气，都要靠近才知道": "Getting close enough for hairs and scent", "再看茎，细毛一根根竖在表面，连叶柄边缘也能找到。毛茸茸的模样，让这株小草显得格外柔软。\n\n我揉了揉叶子闻一闻，觉得像淡淡的柠檬混着薄荷。至于真正的麝香是什么味道，我没闻过，还是先把这次自己的感受记下来。": "Fine hairs stand up from the stem, and I can find them along the edges of the leaf stalks, too. They give this little herb a soft appearance.\n\nI rubbed a leaf and smelled it. To me it suggested lemon with a hint of mint. As for the musk in its name, I've never smelled real musk, so I'll stick to recording the scent I experienced.", "再看茎，细毛一根根竖在表面，连叶柄边缘也能找到。毛茸茸的模样，让这株小草显得格外柔软。": "Fine hairs stand up from the stem, and I can find them along the edges of the leaf stalks, too. They give this little herb a soft appearance.", "我揉了揉叶子闻一闻，觉得像淡淡的柠檬混着薄荷。至于真正的麝香是什么味道，我没闻过，还是先把这次自己的感受记下来。": "I rubbed a leaf and smelled it. To me it suggested lemon with a hint of mint. As for the musk in its name, I've never smelled real musk, so I'll stick to recording the scent I experienced.", "原文气味和叶形对照，不推定某一薄荷种。": "The comparison concerns smell and leaf shape; a particular mint species was not inferred.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "毛麝香 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 毛麝香"}, "20240909-01": {"手边的一枝花序，细密刚毛与轴的弯曲清晰可见。": "A plume beside a hand, showing fine bristles and a curved axis.", "落日与水面旁，高低错落的花序。": "Inflorescences of different heights stand beside the water at sunset.", "近看密集花序，粉白色与淡紫色交织。": "Pink-white and pale purple mingle in the dense plumes.", "傍晚逆光中的草丛，细长花序透出浅粉色。": "Evening backlight makes the slender grass plumes glow pale pink.", "靠近水边的一片草丛，柔软花序向不同方向弯垂。": "Near the water, a patch of soft plumes bends in different directions.", "公园草地里的观赏草群落，远处可见建筑。": "Ornamental grasses on a park lawn, with buildings in the distance.", "本期封面：浅色花序在绿叶上方铺开。": "Video cover: pale plumes spread above green leaves.", "狼尾草手绘：丛生植株、线形叶片与花序。": "Drawing of fountain grass: clump, linear leaves and inflorescence.", "从另一帧看逆光草丛，花序边缘发亮。": "Another view of the backlit grasses, with the plume edges glowing.", "风一来，公园里这一片柔软的“尾巴”就一起摇起来了。": "A breeze sets a whole patch of soft “tails” waving together in the park.", "风一来，尾巴就甩起来了": "Tails in the wind", "我们在公园里发现了这一片草丛。风一来，长长的花序一起晃动，像许多柔软的小尾巴。\n\n原本是很熟悉的园路，配上这片草，就多了一点山野的感觉。夕阳从花序后面照过来，连细细的边缘都亮了。": "We found this patch of grass in a park. As the breeze comes through, all the long flower heads sway like soft little tails.\n\nIt's a familiar park path, but the grass gives it something of the feel of open country. The setting sun catches the heads from behind and lights up their fine edges.", "我们在公园里发现了这一片草丛。风一来，长长的花序一起晃动，像许多柔软的小尾巴。": "We found this patch of grass in a park. As the breeze comes through, all the long flower heads sway like soft little tails.", "原本是很熟悉的园路，配上这片草，就多了一点山野的感觉。夕阳从花序后面照过来，连细细的边缘都亮了。": "It's a familiar park path, but the grass gives it something of the feel of open country. The setting sun catches the heads from behind and lights up their fine edges.", "走近这条毛茸茸的尾巴": "A closer look at one fuzzy tail", "拿近一枝看看，圆锥花序外面伸着密密的刚毛，手指放在旁边，才知道它其实由许多细碎结构组成。\n\n本期沿用狼尾草这个名字，不给镜头里的植株强行加上具体园艺品种名。记住这条花序的轮廓，再看它如何弯过来、摇过去，已经很好玩了。": "I bring one stem closer. Dense bristles project from the panicle, and a finger beside it gives a sense of the many small structures that make up the whole.\n\nI'm using the Chinese name lángwěicǎo, “wolf-tail grass,” for this record, without assigning the plants on camera to a particular cultivar. The outline of a head as it bends and swings is interesting enough in its own right.", "拿近一枝看看，圆锥花序外面伸着密密的刚毛，手指放在旁边，才知道它其实由许多细碎结构组成。": "I bring one stem closer. Dense bristles project from the panicle, and a finger beside it gives a sense of the many small structures that make up the whole.", "本期沿用狼尾草这个名字，不给镜头里的植株强行加上具体园艺品种名。记住这条花序的轮廓，再看它如何弯过来、摇过去，已经很好玩了。": "I'm using the Chinese name lángwěicǎo, “wolf-tail grass,” for this record, without assigning the plants on camera to a particular cultivar. The outline of a head as it bends and swings is interesting enough in its own right.", "同样的草丛，也有不同的表情": "One patch, different expressions", "顺着草丛退后一点，线形叶片和花序重新合成了一整片景观。有些迎着光，有些背着光，同一种画面也会显出不同的颜色。\n\n这期还聊到小兔子、东方狼尾草等园艺称呼。把那些名字留作对照，先看眼前这一片随风摇动的草，哪一个角度最让你想停下来呢？": "Step back along the patch and the narrow leaves and flower heads become part of a single landscape again. Some catch the light from the front, some from behind, so even the same view can change colour.\n\nIn the video I also mentioned horticultural names such as “Little Bunny” and eastern fountain grass. I'll keep those names for comparison. Looking at the grass moving in front of us, which view would make you stop?", "顺着草丛退后一点，线形叶片和花序重新合成了一整片景观。有些迎着光，有些背着光，同一种画面也会显出不同的颜色。": "Step back along the patch and the narrow leaves and flower heads become part of a single landscape again. Some catch the light from the front, some from behind, so even the same view can change colour.", "这期还聊到小兔子、东方狼尾草等园艺称呼。把那些名字留作对照，先看眼前这一片随风摇动的草，哪一个角度最让你想停下来呢？": "In the video I also mentioned horticultural names such as “Little Bunny” and eastern fountain grass. I'll keep those names for comparison. Looking at the grass moving in front of us, which view would make you stop?", "原稿的园艺名称或类群称呼；不是本期主种的独立确认，具体种或品种组合待核。": "A horticultural or group name used in the manuscript. The particular species or cultivar combination has not been confirmed.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "狼尾草 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 狼尾草"}, "20241029-01": {"本期封面：枝头悬挂的狭长荚果。": "Video cover: narrow pods hanging from the ends of branches.", "花序上的小花苞，旁边有小型昆虫。": "Small buds on an inflorescence, with a tiny insect nearby.", "白色花瓣上的一只小蚂蚁。": "A small ant on a white petal.", "几片羽状复叶垂在一起，叶面与叶背颜色不同。": "Several pinnate leaves hang together, their upper and lower surfaces contrasting in colour.", "侧看一串白花，花苞与已开的花相间。": "A string of white flowers seen sideways, with buds among the open blossoms.", "正面看白花，圆阔花瓣与下方花部相接。": "White flower from the front, with broad, round petals adjoining the lower floral parts.", "一串逐渐展开的白色蝶形花。": "A cluster of white pea-shaped flowers gradually opening.", "一簇荚果，绿色和褐色的果皮同框。": "Green and brown pods together in a cluster.", "成片枝叶间，许多荚果向下悬垂。": "Numerous pods hanging down among dense foliage.", "绿叶衬托下的白花，从侧面观察花瓣排列。": "Side view of petal arrangement in a white flower against green leaves.", "手持复叶，翻看小叶较浅的背面。": "A compound leaf held up to show the paler undersides of its leaflets.", "白灰毛豆手绘：复叶、白花与荚果。": "Drawing of Tephrosia candida: compound leaves, white flowers and pods.", "从叶下仰看，叶片间透进明亮天空。": "Bright sky shows between leaves viewed from below.", "白花近景，花瓣表面的细纹可见。": "Fine lines on the surface of the white petals, in close-up.", "一片复叶的正面，长椭圆小叶排列匀称。": "Upper side of a compound leaf with evenly spaced, long elliptical leaflets.", "逆光中，叶片像整齐排列的小羽毛。": "Backlit leaflets look like small, neatly arranged feathers.", "复叶下方的一朵白花，花瓣向外舒展。": "A white flower beneath the compound leaf, its petals stretching outwards.", "细长的新梢与尚未完全展开的小叶。": "A slender shoot with leaflets still unfolding.", "白灰毛豆的小叶沿叶轴两侧整齐排列。": "Tephrosia leaflets form neat rows on both sides of a leaf axis.", "站在植株旁观察，枝叶围在身体周围。": "The observer standing amid the branches and leaves of the plant.", "叶丛与细长荚果同时出现在枝头。": "Slender pods among the foliage at a branch tip.", "新叶旁的绿色荚果，表面可见细小纹理。": "Fine surface markings on a green pod beside new leaves.", "白花、灰毛与整齐的小叶，认识护坡复绿工作里熟悉的白灰毛豆。": "White flowers, grey hairs and orderly leaflets: a Tephrosia I came to know through work revegetating slopes.", "名字拗口，白花却很清新": "A tongue-twister of a name; a lovely white flower", "白灰毛豆、白花毛豆、灰白毛豆……这个名字我总是记得颠三倒四。这次认真记录一遍，希望下次遇到它，终于能叫对名字。\n\n先看白色的蝶形花，清清爽爽，藏在绿色叶丛之间。它是豆科灰毛豆属的植物，和餐桌上吃的毛豆可不是一回事。": "Báihuīmáodòu, báihuāmáodòu, huībáimáodòu… I always get the syllables mixed up. This time I'm recording it carefully in the hope of getting the name right at our next meeting.\n\nFirst, the white butterfly-shaped flowers, fresh among the green leaves. This is a Tephrosia in the legume family. Despite the máodòu in its name, it's a different plant from the edamame on our dinner tables.", "白灰毛豆、白花毛豆、灰白毛豆……这个名字我总是记得颠三倒四。这次认真记录一遍，希望下次遇到它，终于能叫对名字。": "Báihuīmáodòu, báihuāmáodòu, huībáimáodòu… I always get the syllables mixed up. This time I'm recording it carefully in the hope of getting the name right at our next meeting.", "先看白色的蝶形花，清清爽爽，藏在绿色叶丛之间。它是豆科灰毛豆属的植物，和餐桌上吃的毛豆可不是一回事。": "First, the white butterfly-shaped flowers, fresh among the green leaves. This is a Tephrosia in the legume family. Despite the máodòu in its name, it's a different plant from the edamame on our dinner tables.", "最让我陶醉的，是它的叶片": "The leaves are what I love most", "沿着一根叶轴，小叶一片片排得很整齐。正面深一些，翻过来又是浅浅的灰绿色，细毛给边缘镶了一圈柔软的花边。\n\n我喜欢它这种有秩序的样子。风一吹，叶片轻轻动起来，原本很规整的排列又有了灵动的感觉。": "Leaflets stand in a tidy row along each leaf axis. They're darker above, pale grey-green below, with a soft fringe of fine hairs.\n\nI like that orderly arrangement. When the wind moves the leaves gently, the pattern comes alive.", "沿着一根叶轴，小叶一片片排得很整齐。正面深一些，翻过来又是浅浅的灰绿色，细毛给边缘镶了一圈柔软的花边。": "Leaflets stand in a tidy row along each leaf axis. They're darker above, pale grey-green below, with a soft fringe of fine hairs.", "我喜欢它这种有秩序的样子。风一吹，叶片轻轻动起来，原本很规整的排列又有了灵动的感觉。": "I like that orderly arrangement. When the wind moves the leaves gently, the pattern comes alive.", "一边开花，一边结果": "Flowers and fruits at the same time", "枝头不只有花，还挂着一把把细长的豆荚。有的仍是绿色，有的已经干成深褐色；新花和旧果可以同时找到。\n\n平时远远看，它只是一丛绿。把目光移到这些果荚上，就能把开花之后的变化也接起来了。": "At the branch tips there are bunches of slender pods as well as flowers. Some are still green, others dry and dark brown; new flowers and older fruits are both easy to find.\n\nFrom a distance it just looks like a green bush. Look at those pods and you can start to follow what happens after flowering.", "枝头不只有花，还挂着一把把细长的豆荚。有的仍是绿色，有的已经干成深褐色；新花和旧果可以同时找到。": "At the branch tips there are bunches of slender pods as well as flowers. Some are still green, others dry and dark brown; new flowers and older fruits are both easy to find.", "平时远远看，它只是一丛绿。把目光移到这些果荚上，就能把开花之后的变化也接起来了。": "From a distance it just looks like a green bush. Look at those pods and you can start to follow what happens after flowering.", "从一株植物，想到一段工作经历": "A plant that brings back an old job", "以前做护坡复绿项目时，我常会碰到白灰毛豆。坡太陡、草坪不方便铺的时候，会用到包含它的混合种子喷播方案。\n\n所以遇见这株植物，对我而言不只是认识一朵白花，也像遇见一位工作里的老熟人。看花、看叶、再看挂满枝头的荚果，它的名字总算更有画面了。": "I used to come across this Tephrosia on projects restoring vegetation to slopes. Where the ground was too steep to lay turf, we used hydroseeding with a seed mixture that included it.\n\nComing across this plant feels like running into an old colleague. Between the white flowers, the leaflets and the branches full of pods, the name is finally attached to a picture.", "以前做护坡复绿项目时，我常会碰到白灰毛豆。坡太陡、草坪不方便铺的时候，会用到包含它的混合种子喷播方案。": "I used to come across this Tephrosia on projects restoring vegetation to slopes. Where the ground was too steep to lay turf, we used hydroseeding with a seed mixture that included it.", "所以遇见这株植物，对我而言不只是认识一朵白花，也像遇见一位工作里的老熟人。看花、看叶、再看挂满枝头的荚果，它的名字总算更有画面了。": "Coming across this plant feels like running into an old colleague. Between the white flowers, the leaflets and the branches full of pods, the name is finally attached to a picture.", "文稿同片提及的护坡植物或食物对照。": "Mentioned in the manuscript as a plant used on slopes or as a food comparison.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "白灰毛豆 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 白灰毛豆"}, "20241018-01": {"掌心托着一串红果，旁边几枚仍是青绿。": "A string of red fruits in the palm, a few of them still green.", "较远处的细藤、叶片与两串果实。": "A more distant view of the fine vine, leaves and two fruit clusters.", "粪箕笃的叶片沿着细藤悬垂。": "Stephania leaves hang along a slender vine.", "一簇果实中，从绿色、黄色到红色同框。": "Green, yellow and red fruits within the same cluster.", "红果沿着细藤悬挂，旁边还有绿色未熟果。": "Red fruits hang along a fine vine, with green unripe ones nearby.", "逆光中的绿色果簇，仍未转红。": "A backlit bunch of green fruits yet to turn red.", "手托两簇果实，可以比较果实大小与色彩变化。": "Two fruit clusters supported by a hand for comparison of size and colour.", "绿叶与细长藤茎在林下交错。": "Green leaves and slender vines interlace beneath the trees.", "本期封面：红宝石般的小果簇。": "Video cover: a ruby-like cluster of little fruits.", "叶子后方露出成簇红果。": "A cluster of red fruits peeks out from behind the foliage.", "一片逆光的叶，放射状叶脉透过绿色。": "Backlighting reveals radiating veins through a green leaf.", "名字很土，果实却像一串串红宝石；再看看粪箕笃的小盾牌叶。": "An earthy Chinese name for a vine with ruby-red fruit. Its leaves look like little shields.", "这个名字，和果实有点反差": "A surprising name for such bright fruits", "又遇见一株被名字耽误的植物——粪箕笃。土土的名字下面，果实却亮得像红宝石，每次都是这些小红点先把我吸引过去。\n\n近看一簇果子，有的已经通红，有的仍是青绿，还有的刚刚转黄。颜色挤在一起，真好看。": "Here's another plant whose name doesn't quite do it justice: fènjīdǔ. The name has a distinctly earthy ring, yet the fruits shine like rubies. It's always those little red dots that draw me in first.\n\nUp close, one cluster holds fruits at several stages: some bright red, others still green, others just turning yellow. The colours look lovely pressed together.", "又遇见一株被名字耽误的植物——粪箕笃。土土的名字下面，果实却亮得像红宝石，每次都是这些小红点先把我吸引过去。": "Here's another plant whose name doesn't quite do it justice: fènjīdǔ. The name has a distinctly earthy ring, yet the fruits shine like rubies. It's always those little red dots that draw me in first.", "近看一簇果子，有的已经通红，有的仍是青绿，还有的刚刚转黄。颜色挤在一起，真好看。": "Up close, one cluster holds fruits at several stages: some bright red, others still green, others just turning yellow. The colours look lovely pressed together.", "一片小小的盾牌": "A little shield", "叶子也很有特点，轮廓接近小盾牌。叶柄从叶片背面伸进来，叶脉再从这一处向四周散开。\n\n我把叶子迎着光看，原本暗绿的一面亮了起来，纹路清清楚楚。果实热闹，叶子却是安静又精致的另一种好看。": "The leaf has an outline rather like a little shield. Its stalk meets the blade from beneath, and the veins fan out in all directions from that point.\n\nI hold a leaf up to the light. The dark green brightens and its veining comes into focus. The lively fruits and quietly intricate leaves each have their own appeal.", "叶子也很有特点，轮廓接近小盾牌。叶柄从叶片背面伸进来，叶脉再从这一处向四周散开。": "The leaf has an outline rather like a little shield. Its stalk meets the blade from beneath, and the veins fan out in all directions from that point.", "我把叶子迎着光看，原本暗绿的一面亮了起来，纹路清清楚楚。果实热闹，叶子却是安静又精致的另一种好看。": "I hold a leaf up to the light. The dark green brightens and its veining comes into focus. The lively fruits and quietly intricate leaves each have their own appeal.", "沿着细藤，找下一串红果": "Follow the vine to the next cluster", "原来这一串串果实，是藏在交错的藤和叶之间的。顺着枝条慢慢找，近处一串，稍远处又一串。\n\n粪箕笃属于防己科千金藤属。记住红果、小盾牌叶和细藤这几条线索，下次在林边遇到，名字就不只是一个让人发笑的称呼了。": "The fruit clusters are tucked among overlapping vines and leaves. Follow a stem slowly and there's one bunch nearby, then another just beyond.\n\nThis climber belongs to the genus Stephania in the moonseed family. Remember the red fruit, shield-shaped leaves and slender vine; next time I see it on a woodland edge, its Chinese name will be more than something that makes me smile.", "原来这一串串果实，是藏在交错的藤和叶之间的。顺着枝条慢慢找，近处一串，稍远处又一串。": "The fruit clusters are tucked among overlapping vines and leaves. Follow a stem slowly and there's one bunch nearby, then another just beyond.", "粪箕笃属于防己科千金藤属。记住红果、小盾牌叶和细藤这几条线索，下次在林边遇到，名字就不只是一个让人发笑的称呼了。": "This climber belongs to the genus Stephania in the moonseed family. Remember the red fruit, shield-shaped leaves and slender vine; next time I see it on a woodland edge, its Chinese name will be more than something that makes me smile.", "文稿盾形叶对照。": "The manuscript compares peltate leaves.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "粪箕笃 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 粪箕笃"}, "20240916-01": {"阳光穿过紫芋叶片，黄绿色叶面与深色叶脉形成清楚对照。": "Sunlight through a purple taro leaf contrasts the yellow-green blade with its dark veins.", "一丛紫芋长在林缘，大小叶片层层交叠。": "Purple taro at a woodland edge, leaves of different sizes overlapping.", "紫芋自然手绘：宽大叶片、长叶柄、花序和地下部分。": "Drawing of purple taro: broad leaves, long stalks, inflorescence and underground parts.", "从叶面上方看，细密叶脉汇向一个小小的深色连接点。": "From above, fine veins converge on a small, dark attachment point.", "叶丛中的紫红色叶柄，旁边有一片正在展开的浅色卷叶。": "A pale, unfolding leaf beside purple-red stalks in the clump.", "宽阔叶面上留着一串水珠，叶脉向连接处汇拢。": "Droplets on a broad blade, its veins converging at the attachment point.", "叶片背面的主脉向几侧分出，轮廓映着明亮绿光。": "Main veins branching beneath the leaf, their outlines backlit in bright green.", "坐在高高的叶丛下面，周围是长叶柄撑起的大片绿叶。": "Sitting under a tall taro clump surrounded by broad leaves on long stalks.", "近看芋叶上的水珠，透明水面映着周围的绿色。": "Clear droplets on a taro leaf reflect the surrounding green.", "逆光下的叶背，紫红色叶柄与深色主脉都很明显。": "Backlit underside showing a purple-red stalk and a dark midrib.", "从叶丛下方看，紫红色和绿色叶柄交错向上伸展。": "Purple-red and green leaf stalks cross and rise overhead when viewed from below.", "在紫芋的大叶子下乘一会儿凉，看看紫红色叶柄，以及逆光里清楚展开的叶脉。": "I sit for a while in the shade of these taro leaves, looking at the purple-red stalks and the network of veins revealed by the light.", "天气太热，先在大叶子下面坐一会儿": "A little shade beneath the leaves", "天气很热，我在这一丛紫芋下面乘了一会儿凉。长长的叶柄把大片叶子撑在上面，坐到下面，像走进一个小小的绿色屋顶。\n\n远看它们只是连成一片，换到这个低低的角度，才看见叶柄之间的空隙，以及光怎么从一片片叶子旁边漏进来。": "It was hot, so I sat for a while beneath this clump of purple taro. Long stalks carry huge leaves overhead. Sitting below feels like stepping under a little green roof.\n\nFrom a distance the leaves formed a continuous patch. Down at this level I can see the spaces between the stalks and the light coming through around each blade.", "天气很热，我在这一丛紫芋下面乘了一会儿凉。长长的叶柄把大片叶子撑在上面，坐到下面，像走进一个小小的绿色屋顶。": "It was hot, so I sat for a while beneath this clump of purple taro. Long stalks carry huge leaves overhead. Sitting below feels like stepping under a little green roof.", "远看它们只是连成一片，换到这个低低的角度，才看见叶柄之间的空隙，以及光怎么从一片片叶子旁边漏进来。": "From a distance the leaves formed a continuous patch. Down at this level I can see the spaces between the stalks and the light coming through around each blade.", "紫红色，先从叶柄找起": "Look to the stalks for purple", "这次记录的紫芋，最让我注意的就是紫红色叶柄。叶面是黄绿色的，低头往叶丛里看，紫红色便从一根根长叶柄上露了出来。\n\n旁边还有卷起来、没有完全展开的新叶。深色叶柄和浅色卷叶放在一起，同一丛植物里也能看见不同生长阶段的模样。": "What struck me about the purple taro in this record was its purple-red leaf stalks. The blades are yellow-green; look down into the clump and the colour appears along those long stalks.\n\nBeside them are new leaves still rolled and not fully open. Dark stalks beside pale curled leaves let me see several stages of growth in one clump.", "这次记录的紫芋，最让我注意的就是紫红色叶柄。叶面是黄绿色的，低头往叶丛里看，紫红色便从一根根长叶柄上露了出来。": "What struck me about the purple taro in this record was its purple-red leaf stalks. The blades are yellow-green; look down into the clump and the colour appears along those long stalks.", "旁边还有卷起来、没有完全展开的新叶。深色叶柄和浅色卷叶放在一起，同一丛植物里也能看见不同生长阶段的模样。": "Beside them are new leaves still rolled and not fully open. Dark stalks beside pale curled leaves let me see several stages of growth in one clump.", "对着光，叶脉像一张展开的网": "Veins like a net against the light", "再把视线转到叶背。逆着光，深色叶脉从连接处向几个方向伸开，细一点的脉纹又继续分出去。\n\n宽宽的叶片托在长柄上，有一点像浅浅的茶杯。我喜欢这样对着光看叶子：颜色和轮廓之外，里面的线条也一下清楚了。": "I turn to the underside of a leaf. Against the light, dark veins spread from the attachment point and finer veins branch off in turn.\n\nThe broad blade sits on its long stalk a little like a shallow teacup. I love looking at leaves against the light: suddenly the lines inside are as clear as the colour and outline.", "再把视线转到叶背。逆着光，深色叶脉从连接处向几个方向伸开，细一点的脉纹又继续分出去。": "I turn to the underside of a leaf. Against the light, dark veins spread from the attachment point and finer veins branch off in turn.", "宽宽的叶片托在长柄上，有一点像浅浅的茶杯。我喜欢这样对着光看叶子：颜色和轮廓之外，里面的线条也一下清楚了。": "The broad blade sits on its long stalk a little like a shallow teacup. I love looking at leaves against the light: suddenly the lines inside are as clear as the colour and outline.", "从一串水珠，记住这一片叶子": "Remembering a leaf by its droplets", "叶面上还停着透明水珠，旁边有几滴小小的。靠近看，叶面起伏、叶脉和光影，都围在这几滴水的周围。\n\n这一期沿用文稿里的紫芋园艺名称Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo'，正式分类仍与芋这个接受种关联。看完名字，再看看这片叶子的细节，才更容易记住这次相遇。": "Transparent beads of water rest on the surface, with smaller droplets beside them. Up close the rise and fall of the blade, the veins, the light and shadows all gather around those few drops.\n\nThis record keeps the horticultural name used in the manuscript, Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo'. Its formal classification is linked to the accepted species Colocasia esculenta. Having read the name, I look back at the details of the leaf. They make the encounter easier to remember.", "叶面上还停着透明水珠，旁边有几滴小小的。靠近看，叶面起伏、叶脉和光影，都围在这几滴水的周围。": "Transparent beads of water rest on the surface, with smaller droplets beside them. Up close the rise and fall of the blade, the veins, the light and shadows all gather around those few drops.", "这一期沿用文稿里的紫芋园艺名称Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo'，正式分类仍与芋这个接受种关联。看完名字，再看看这片叶子的细节，才更容易记住这次相遇。": "This record keeps the horticultural name used in the manuscript, Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo'. Its formal classification is linked to the accepted species Colocasia esculenta. Having read the name, I look back at the details of the leaf. They make the encounter easier to remember.", "本期紫芋名称与芋采用相同POWO接受种；为两个视频档案，不合并视频。": "The taro and the plant called zǐyù (紫芋) share an accepted species in POWO but have separate video records.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "原文采用园艺称呼，未作为已核实注册品种": "The horticultural name follows the manuscript. Registration of the cultivar has not been verified.", "文稿园艺名称与原种名异名关系分开保留": "The manuscript’s horticultural name is recorded separately from the historical synonym of the species.", "本期沿用文稿中的园艺称呼 Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo'。邱园记录的是历史种名 Colocasia tonoimo Nakai 与接受种的异名关系。具体品种身份仍以文稿记录为依据。": "This video retains the horticultural designation Colocasia esculenta 'Tonoimo' used in the manuscript. Kew records the historical species name Colocasia tonoimo Nakai as a synonym of the accepted species. The specific cultivar identity rests on the manuscript.", "紫芋 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 紫芋"}, "20241104-01": {"一大片芋叶高低错落，长长叶柄从叶丛下方伸出来。": "A patch of broad taro leaves at different heights on long stalks.", "逆光下的一片芋叶，长叶柄从下方托住宽阔叶面。": "Backlit taro leaf, its broad blade supported from below by a long stalk.", "长叶柄之间透进阳光，大叶片在上方一层层展开。": "Sunlight between the long stalks; large leaves overlap overhead.", "叶面边缘微微卷起，波浪状轮廓映着绿色背景。": "The leaf edge curls slightly, outlining a wave against the green background.", "从叶丛下方看，许多直立叶柄支撑着上面的宽叶。": "Viewed from below, upright stalks support the great leaf blades.", "走进高高的芋叶丛，俯身看看下方的叶柄和生长位置。": "Leaning into the tall foliage to see where the leaf stalks grow.", "芋叶表面近照，浅色叶脉与柔和叶面相互交错。": "Pale veins across the soft surface of a taro leaf in close-up.", "从稍高处看叶丛，宽阔叶面像一把把张开的绿色伞。": "From slightly above, the wide blades look like open green umbrellas.", "水珠聚在芋叶上，旁边排着几滴更小的水珠。": "A large water droplet with several smaller drops on the taro leaf.", "站在芋叶丛中托起一片大叶子，周围是一片明亮的绿。": "The observer holds up a broad taro leaf, surrounded by bright green.", "从叶背看，叶柄连接在叶片内侧，粗细叶脉向周围分出。": "On the underside, the stalk joins within the blade, and large and small veins fan out.", "深浅不同的芋叶铺满地面，叶片大小与朝向各有不同。": "Taro leaves of varying size, shade and orientation cover the ground.", "芋叶何田田：看叶柄怎样托住大叶子，再看看水珠与一整片高低错落的绿。": "Taro leaves spread in green tiers. I follow a long stalk to the blade it supports and stop to look at the water gathered on its surface.", "广东可采芋，芋叶何田田": "In Guangdong the taro leaves grow thick", "我身边这一大片，就是平时说的芋头长出来的叶子。叶子高高低低铺开，忍不住借一句“何田田”来形容它：广东可采芋，芋叶何田田。\n\n平时想到芋头，很容易先想到餐桌。这回先看看植株，宽宽的叶子被长叶柄托住，在阳光下撑出了一片明亮的绿色。": "What I have around me is a patch of the plant that gives us taro. Leaves spread at different heights, so thick that I borrow an old poetic phrase about lotus leaves and adapt it: here in Guangdong one can gather taro; how lush its leaves are.\n\nMention taro and I usually think of the table first. Today I start with the living plants, their broad leaves held on long stalks in a bright sweep of sunlit green.", "我身边这一大片，就是平时说的芋头长出来的叶子。叶子高高低低铺开，忍不住借一句“何田田”来形容它：广东可采芋，芋叶何田田。": "What I have around me is a patch of the plant that gives us taro. Leaves spread at different heights, so thick that I borrow an old poetic phrase about lotus leaves and adapt it: here in Guangdong one can gather taro; how lush its leaves are.", "平时想到芋头，很容易先想到餐桌。这回先看看植株，宽宽的叶子被长叶柄托住，在阳光下撑出了一片明亮的绿色。": "Mention taro and I usually think of the table first. Today I start with the living plants, their broad leaves held on long stalks in a bright sweep of sunlit green.", "叶柄从哪里接上去？": "Where does the leaf stalk meet the blade?", "把视线转到叶背，就能看见叶柄和叶片连接的位置。叶柄接在叶面内侧，几条明显的叶脉从这里向周围展开。\n\n这也是我观察芋时很喜欢看的部位。不要只记一张心形大叶子的轮廓，再沿着叶柄找到着生点，叶子的结构就清楚多了。": "Look underneath and the point of attachment comes into view. The stalk joins the blade well inside its margin, and several prominent veins spread out from there.\n\nThis is one of my favourite things to look for on taro. Remember the outline of a heart-shaped leaf, then follow the stalk to where it meets the blade: the structure becomes much clearer.", "把视线转到叶背，就能看见叶柄和叶片连接的位置。叶柄接在叶面内侧，几条明显的叶脉从这里向周围展开。": "Look underneath and the point of attachment comes into view. The stalk joins the blade well inside its margin, and several prominent veins spread out from there.", "这也是我观察芋时很喜欢看的部位。不要只记一张心形大叶子的轮廓，再沿着叶柄找到着生点，叶子的结构就清楚多了。": "This is one of my favourite things to look for on taro. Remember the outline of a heart-shaped leaf, then follow the stalk to where it meets the blade: the structure becomes much clearer.", "水珠停在叶子上": "Droplets resting on a leaf", "这片叶子上还停着一串水珠，大的聚在一起，小的排在旁边。叶面微微起伏，叶脉和水珠都被光照得很清楚。\n\n从远处看是一把绿色小伞，靠近以后又是这样细小的风景。我把镜头停了一会儿，想把这片叶子当时的样子也一起留下来。": "A string of water droplets has come to rest on this blade. The large ones cluster together, smaller ones beside them. The surface undulates slightly, and the light picks out both veins and droplets.\n\nFrom a distance it's a little green umbrella; up close there's this tiny landscape. I keep the camera there for a moment to record that particular leaf as I saw it.", "这片叶子上还停着一串水珠，大的聚在一起，小的排在旁边。叶面微微起伏，叶脉和水珠都被光照得很清楚。": "A string of water droplets has come to rest on this blade. The large ones cluster together, smaller ones beside them. The surface undulates slightly, and the light picks out both veins and droplets.", "从远处看是一把绿色小伞，靠近以后又是这样细小的风景。我把镜头停了一会儿，想把这片叶子当时的样子也一起留下来。": "From a distance it's a little green umbrella; up close there's this tiny landscape. I keep the camera there for a moment to record that particular leaf as I saw it.", "走到这一片绿叶下面": "Walking in under the green", "走进叶丛里，才发现上面的宽叶下面，是这么多长长的叶柄。光从叶片之间穿下来，站在这里，连看叶子的角度都和田边不一样了。\n\n一片叶子、一根叶柄，再到一整片芋，越看越能感受到它们铺开来的气势。这次先把地上的模样认识清楚，熟悉的“芋头”也就多了另一面。": "Inside the clump I find out just how many long stalks there are beneath those broad leaves. Light streams through the gaps overhead. Looking from down here is quite different from looking in from the edge of the field.\n\nFrom one blade to its stalk, then out to the whole stand, the sweep of leaves becomes more and more apparent. Knowing the part above ground gives the familiar taro on the table another side.", "走进叶丛里，才发现上面的宽叶下面，是这么多长长的叶柄。光从叶片之间穿下来，站在这里，连看叶子的角度都和田边不一样了。": "Inside the clump I find out just how many long stalks there are beneath those broad leaves. Light streams through the gaps overhead. Looking from down here is quite different from looking in from the edge of the field.", "一片叶子、一根叶柄，再到一整片芋，越看越能感受到它们铺开来的气势。这次先把地上的模样认识清楚，熟悉的“芋头”也就多了另一面。": "From one blade to its stalk, then out to the whole stand, the sweep of leaves becomes more and more apparent. Knowing the part above ground gives the familiar taro on the table another side.", "原文叶柄着生方式对照。": "The comparison concerns where the leaf stalk attaches.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "芋 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 芋"}, "20261028-01": {"科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The observations and images come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "The scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO / WCVP records. Chinese names are provided for reference. Where the manuscript uses a different name from the accepted one, both are recorded.", "芒萁 · 文稿采用名参考": "Mángqí · source for the scientific name used in the video", "芒萁": "Mángqí (芒萁)", "像小梳子的叶片不断分叉，叶背还有一排排小花形状的孢子囊群。": "The comb-like fronds fork again and again. Turn one over and you’ll see rows of spore cases in clusters shaped like tiny flowers.", "芒萁叶背，竟然藏着一朵朵\"小花\"？这种蕨还有\"探金\"的本领?": "What are those little “flowers” on the underside of a mángqí frond? Can this fern really help find gold?", "炉箕": "Lújī (炉箕)", "探金草": "Tànjīncǎo (探金草)", "铁芒萁": "Tiěmángqí (铁芒萁)", "山芒": "Shānmáng (山芒)", "龙箕": "Lóngjī (龙箕)", "猫毛草": "Māomáocǎo (猫毛草)", "芦基": "Lújī (芦基)", "火口柴": "Huǒkǒuchái (火口柴)", "这一片，像复制出来的小梳子": "A whole patch of little combs", "身旁这片植物，家乡常叫炉箕，正式名称是芒萁。它的叶子实在很有意思：分叉、再分叉，细细的羽片像一把把小梳子。\n\n从上面看，一片叶子就有很鲜明的几何轮廓。重复却不呆板的排列，让我忍不住把镜头在它上面多停一会儿。": "Back home we call this fern lújī (炉箕). Its Chinese name in this archive is mángqí (芒萁). Look at the way a frond forks, then forks again. Each slender division looks like a little comb.\n\nFrom above, a single frond has a striking geometric outline. The pattern repeats without looking stiff. I find myself lingering over it with the camera.", "身旁这片植物，家乡常叫炉箕，正式名称是芒萁。它的叶子实在很有意思：分叉、再分叉，细细的羽片像一把把小梳子。": "Back home we call this fern lújī (炉箕). Its Chinese name in this archive is mángqí (芒萁). Look at the way a frond forks, then forks again. Each slender division looks like a little comb.", "从上面看，一片叶子就有很鲜明的几何轮廓。重复却不呆板的排列，让我忍不住把镜头在它上面多停一会儿。": "From above, a single frond has a striking geometric outline. The pattern repeats without looking stiff. I find myself lingering over it with the camera.", "小拳头里，藏着后面的叶子": "A frond tucked into a little fist", "春天，我特别喜欢找芒萁还没展开的“小拳头”。卷曲的叶端披着细毛，两侧弯过来，像把未来的大叶子先折叠好。\n\n再看看已经完全舒展的叶片，原来那些细长羽片和分叉，曾经都藏在这样小小的一卷里。": "In spring I especially like looking for the little “fists” of mángqí that haven’t opened yet. Fine hairs cover the coiled tips. The two sides curl inward, as if a full-sized frond had been folded up in advance.\n\nWhen I look at a fully open frond, I can hardly believe that all those slender divisions and forks once fitted inside a coil this small.", "春天，我特别喜欢找芒萁还没展开的“小拳头”。卷曲的叶端披着细毛，两侧弯过来，像把未来的大叶子先折叠好。": "In spring I especially like looking for the little “fists” of mángqí that haven’t opened yet. Fine hairs cover the coiled tips. The two sides curl inward, as if a full-sized frond had been folded up in advance.", "再看看已经完全舒展的叶片，原来那些细长羽片和分叉，曾经都藏在这样小小的一卷里。": "When I look at a fully open frond, I can hardly believe that all those slender divisions and forks once fitted inside a coil this small.", "送你一朵不是花的“小花”": "A handful of tiny “flowers”", "把叶子翻到背面，发现一排排浅绿色的小圆团。放大看，每团由几颗圆圆的结构围在一起，还真有一点小花、甚至小点心的样子。\n\n它们不是花，而是孢子囊群。芒萁属于蕨类植物，不开花，也不结果；这些微小结构里藏着孢子，是它生活史里另一条重要线索。": "Turn a frond over and you’ll see rows of little pale-green clusters. Through a lens, each cluster is a handful of round structures nestling together. They remind me of tiny flowers, or even little pastries.\n\nThese clusters have a name: sori. Each is a group of spore cases. Like other ferns, mángqí bears neither flowers nor fruit. The spores inside those minute cases offer another clue to its life cycle.", "把叶子翻到背面，发现一排排浅绿色的小圆团。放大看，每团由几颗圆圆的结构围在一起，还真有一点小花、甚至小点心的样子。": "Turn a frond over and you’ll see rows of little pale-green clusters. Through a lens, each cluster is a handful of round structures nestling together. They remind me of tiny flowers, or even little pastries.", "它们不是花，而是孢子囊群。芒萁属于蕨类植物，不开花，也不结果；这些微小结构里藏着孢子，是它生活史里另一条重要线索。": "These clusters have a name: sori. Each is a group of spore cases. Like other ferns, mángqí bears neither flowers nor fruit. The spores inside those minute cases offer another clue to its life cycle.", "叶轴里面，还有柔软的一条": "A soft strand inside the frond stalk", "拍摄时，我又试着从叶轴里抽出细细的一条髓部。外面看着挺结实，里面这一条却柔软得很。\n\n我想试试编个小篮子，边编边发现软材料并不好控制。认识芒萁，不止是辨认叶子，也是在这些小尝试里，记住它不同部位的手感。": "While filming, I tried pulling a thin strand of pith out of the central axis of a frond. The outside feels quite sturdy. The strand inside is surprisingly soft.\n\nI wanted to weave a little basket. As I worked, I discovered how tricky that soft material was to control. Experiments like this help me remember the fern by touch as well as by the shape of its fronds.", "拍摄时，我又试着从叶轴里抽出细细的一条髓部。外面看着挺结实，里面这一条却柔软得很。": "While filming, I tried pulling a thin strand of pith out of the central axis of a frond. The outside feels quite sturdy. The strand inside is surprisingly soft.", "我想试试编个小篮子，边编边发现软材料并不好控制。认识芒萁，不止是辨认叶子，也是在这些小尝试里，记住它不同部位的手感。": "I wanted to weave a little basket. As I worked, I discovered how tricky that soft material was to control. Experiments like this help me remember the fern by touch as well as by the shape of its fronds.", "俯看芒萁叶片，分叉的叶轴与羽片组成几何图案。": "Seen from above, the forked axes and side divisions of a mángqí frond form a geometric pattern.", "林下伸展的芒萁，羽片细长而整齐。": "Slender, evenly spaced frond divisions spread out beneath the canopy.", "不同方向展开的叶片，从上面看像重复的小梳子。": "Fronds point in different directions. From above they look like a repeating pattern of little combs.", "分叉处的叶轴，向外伸出狭长羽片。": "Narrow side divisions extend from a fork in the frond axis.", "一片展开的芒萁，轮廓接近展开的绿星。": "An open frond spreads into the shape of a green star.", "拳卷的新叶，两侧弯曲，中间留着小芽。": "A young frond curls inward on both sides, with a small bud in the middle.", "俯看几片下垂的羽片，排列细密。": "Several drooping frond divisions seen from above, their segments closely spaced.", "叶面近景，平行排开的细裂片。": "On the upper surface, slender segments lie side by side in parallel.", "一枚仍卷着的嫩叶，外面有浅色细毛。": "Fine, pale hairs cover a tender frond that is still coiled.", "近看拳卷叶端，多个小卷相互挤靠。": "Several small coils nestle together at the tip of a young frond.", "新旧叶片交叠，绿色深浅不同。": "Older and younger fronds overlap in different shades of green.", "手持一段羽片，比较叶片两面的颜色。": "Holding a section of frond to compare the colours of its two surfaces.", "林边的芒萁，叶片在光影中层层舒展。": "At the forest edge, layers of fronds open in patches of light and shade.", "坡面的芒萁群落，一片片叶子连成绿层。": "On the slope, overlapping fronds form a continuous green layer.", "林下成片芒萁沿坡生长。": "A patch of mángqí grows along a slope beneath the canopy.", "叶片背面，浅绿色孢子囊群成列排列。": "Pale-green sori form rows on the underside of a frond.", "孢子囊群近景，小圆团之间留有间隔。": "Up close, gaps separate the small, round sori.", "单个孢子囊群像由几颗小珠拼成的花。": "One sorus looks like a flower made of tiny beads.", "沿细裂片两侧排开的孢子囊群。": "Sori line both sides of a narrow frond segment.", "微距观察成簇的孢子囊，表面浅绿透亮。": "A macro view of clustered spore cases, pale green and translucent.", "本期封面：叶背一排排小花状的孢子囊群。": "Cover photograph: rows of flower-like sori on the underside of a frond.", "另一帧孢子囊群近景，排列与叶脉相伴。": "Another close-up shows how the sori follow the veins.", "叶背成列的圆形孢子囊群。": "Round sori arranged in rows on the underside of a frond.", "手指抽取叶轴中的柔软髓部。": "Pulling the soft pith out of the frond axis with my fingers.", "抽出的细条与褐色叶轴并排拿在手里。": "The extracted strand and the brown frond axis, held side by side.", "芒萁手绘：分叉叶片、卷曲新叶、孢子囊群与地下茎。": "Field sketch of mángqí showing a forked frond, a coiled young frond, sori and an underground stem.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These organisms appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "界": "Kingdom", "门": "Phylum", "纲": "Class", "亚纲": "Subclass", "目": "Order", "科": "Family", "属": "Genus", "种": "Species", "植物界": "Plants", "链型植物门": "Streptophytes", "木贼纲": "Equisetopsida", "水龙骨亚纲": "Polypodiinae", "里白目": "Gleicheniales", "里白科": "Gleicheniaceae", "芒萁属": "Dicranopteris", "蕨类植物": "Ferns", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "植物界 / Plantae": "Plants / Plantae", "链型植物门 / Streptophyta": "Streptophytes / Streptophyta", "木贼纲 / Equisetopsida": "Equisetopsida", "水龙骨亚纲 / Polypodiinae": "Polypodiinae", "里白目 / Gleicheniales": "Gleicheniales", "里白科 / Gleicheniaceae": "Gleicheniaceae", "芒萁属 / Dicranopteris": "Dicranopteris", "芒萁 / Dicranopteris pedata": "Mángqí (芒萁) / Dicranopteris pedata"}, "20241011-01": {"三片小叶组成的一组叶，顶端小叶带有浅裂。": "Three leaflets, with shallow lobes on the terminal leaflet.", "拨开绿叶，近距离寻找花与果。": "Parting green leaves to look for flowers and fruits at close range.", "叶丛上方伸起的小花序。": "A small inflorescence rising above the foliage.", "手托一组叶片，展示三片小叶的着生。": "A leaf supported in the hand to show where its three leaflets attach.", "俯看重叠的三出复叶，绿色铺成一片。": "Overlapping trifoliate leaves from above form a carpet of green.", "站在山坡边的草葛叶丛里观察。": "Observing Neustanthus among foliage at the edge of a slope.", "近看草葛叶片，叶面绿色深浅与叶裂清楚可见。": "Shades of green and the leaf lobes of Neustanthus seen up close.", "从另一方向观察草葛小花与花苞。": "Neustanthus flowers and buds viewed from another direction.", "花序近景，淡紫与白色的小花沿轴排列。": "Pale purple and white flowers along the inflorescence axis.", "林边坡面上攀展的草葛及周围植物。": "Neustanthus climbing across a woodland slope among neighbouring plants.", "较远处的草葛叶丛，沿坡面层层铺展。": "A more distant patch of Neustanthus, spreading in layers over the slope.", "花枝下垂着绿色荚果，周围还有叶片与小花。": "A green pod hangs below a flowering shoot, amid leaves and little blossoms.", "细长枝梢与尚在展开的嫩叶。": "A slender shoot tip with new leaves still unfolding.", "手中观察的细长绿色荚果。": "A long, slender green pod examined in the hand.", "本期封面：一枝带淡紫小花的花序。": "Video cover: a cluster of little pale purple flowers.", "小花序的上端与尚未展开的花苞。": "Tip of a small inflorescence with unopened buds.", "侧看一朵紫白相间的蝶形花。": "Side view of a purple-and-white pea-shaped flower.", "草葛攀过山坡，三片小叶形态各异，小巧的紫白花藏在绿叶之间。": "This vine spreads across a hillside. Its leaves divide into three variable leaflets, with little purple-and-white flowers tucked among them.", "绿叶攀过了山坡": "Green leaves over the hillside", "眼前这一片草葛，攀在山坡的其它植物上，层层叠叠地铺开。它的样子让我想到平时熟悉的葛，不过眼前的叶子更显嫩绿，花也小巧得多。\n\n走近这一片绿，先别急着只看它长得旺不旺。顺着叶子之间的空隙找，还能找到很可爱的花。": "The vine in front of me climbs over other plants on the slope, spreading in overlapping layers. It reminds me of the kudzu I know, though the leaves here look a fresher green and the flowers are much smaller.\n\nUp close, there's more to notice than how vigorously it grows. Look in the spaces between the leaves and there are lovely little flowers.", "眼前这一片草葛，攀在山坡的其它植物上，层层叠叠地铺开。它的样子让我想到平时熟悉的葛，不过眼前的叶子更显嫩绿，花也小巧得多。": "The vine in front of me climbs over other plants on the slope, spreading in overlapping layers. It reminds me of the kudzu I know, though the leaves here look a fresher green and the flowers are much smaller.", "走近这一片绿，先别急着只看它长得旺不旺。顺着叶子之间的空隙找，还能找到很可爱的花。": "Up close, there's more to notice than how vigorously it grows. Look in the spaces between the leaves and there are lovely little flowers.", "同一株上，叶子也不完全一样": "Three leaflets, many shapes", "一组叶由三片小叶组成。有的小叶边缘比较完整，有的又分出明显的裂片；放在一起看，形态变化还挺多。\n\n草葛也叫三裂叶野葛。这个名字让我特别留意叶子的裂口，不过现场看下来，也不是每一片都刻着同样的模子。": "Each leaf has three leaflets. Some have almost unbroken margins, others distinct lobes. Side by side, they show a surprising range of shapes.\n\nAnother Chinese name for this vine refers to three-lobed leaves, which drew my eye to the indentations. But the leaflets growing here haven't all been cut to the same pattern.", "一组叶由三片小叶组成。有的小叶边缘比较完整，有的又分出明显的裂片；放在一起看，形态变化还挺多。": "Each leaf has three leaflets. Some have almost unbroken margins, others distinct lobes. Side by side, they show a surprising range of shapes.", "草葛也叫三裂叶野葛。这个名字让我特别留意叶子的裂口，不过现场看下来，也不是每一片都刻着同样的模子。": "Another Chinese name for this vine refers to three-lobed leaves, which drew my eye to the indentations. But the leaflets growing here haven't all been cut to the same pattern.", "小花，紫白相间": "Purple and white flowers", "花序从叶丛间伸出来，沿着细细的轴，一朵朵小花先后开放。淡紫色配着白色，个头虽小，靠近看却很精神。\n\n绿叶已经铺了满眼，这一点点紫白反而特别吸引我。把镜头再拉近，才能看清这些小花瓣如何组合在一起。": "The inflorescences project from the leaves, with small flowers opening in succession along a fine axis. Pale purple and white make a lively combination up close.\n\nAfter a whole hillside of green, that small flash of purple and white catches my eye. It takes a closer view to see how the individual petals fit together.", "花序从叶丛间伸出来，沿着细细的轴，一朵朵小花先后开放。淡紫色配着白色，个头虽小，靠近看却很精神。": "The inflorescences project from the leaves, with small flowers opening in succession along a fine axis. Pale purple and white make a lively combination up close.", "绿叶已经铺了满眼，这一点点紫白反而特别吸引我。把镜头再拉近，才能看清这些小花瓣如何组合在一起。": "After a whole hillside of green, that small flash of purple and white catches my eye. It takes a closer view to see how the individual petals fit together.", "叶子下面，还有细长豆荚": "Slender pods beneath the leaves", "再拨开叶丛找一找，果实也有了。绿色荚果细长，下垂在花枝旁边，和蝶形花接上了豆科植物熟悉的线索。\n\n从三片小叶，到紫白花，再到一串荚果，这株原本铺在坡面上的绿，终于有了可以逐一记住的细节。": "I part the leaves again and find fruits as well. Long green pods hang beside the flowering branches, another familiar legume feature to set alongside the butterfly-shaped flowers.\n\nThree leaflets, purple-and-white flowers, then a string of pods: the sweep of green that first caught my eye now has details I can remember one by one.", "再拨开叶丛找一找，果实也有了。绿色荚果细长，下垂在花枝旁边，和蝶形花接上了豆科植物熟悉的线索。": "I part the leaves again and find fruits as well. Long green pods hang beside the flowering branches, another familiar legume feature to set alongside the butterfly-shaped flowers.", "从三片小叶，到紫白花，再到一串荚果，这株原本铺在坡面上的绿，终于有了可以逐一记住的细节。": "Three leaflets, purple-and-white flowers, then a string of pods: the sweep of green that first caught my eye now has details I can remember one by one.", "文稿食用葛对照，未据俗称推断具体种。": "The manuscript compares an edible kudzu. A species was not inferred from the common name.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "草葛 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 草葛"}, "20240827-01": {"从叶片下面看，叶柄与放射状叶脉。": "Leaf stalk and radiating veins viewed from beneath the blade.", "阳光下的树冠，许多大叶相互遮挡。": "Many large leaves overlap in the sunlit canopy.", "掌心里数枚绿色幼果，外面带细长卷曲结构。": "Green immature fruits in a hand, covered with long curled structures.", "由下向上看枝条，嫩叶与细枝交叠。": "Looking up a branch where young leaves overlap smaller twigs.", "手指旁一片薄薄的托叶。": "A thin stipule beside a fingertip.", "新折断的枝条切口，旁边是绿色叶片。": "A freshly broken shoot with green leaves nearby.", "近看茎节，托叶与长叶柄相邻。": "Close-up of a node, showing a stipule beside the long leaf stalk.", "站在树旁观察，大叶向四周伸展。": "Observer beside the tree, with large leaves extending in every direction.", "一片透光嫩叶，叶脉从叶柄着生处散开。": "Light through a young leaf reveals veins fanning from the stalk’s point of attachment.", "整棵树冠像一顶绿色帐篷，树下留出浓荫。": "The crown resembles a green tent, casting dense shade underneath.", "叶子下面的枝条与长叶柄。": "Branch and long leaf stalks under the blades.", "叶丛间的细小花果结构。": "Small floral and fruiting structures among the leaves.", "血桐手绘：盾状大叶、枝条、花序与果实。": "Drawing of Macaranga tanarius: shield-shaped leaf, branches, inflorescence and fruit.", "人站在枝旁，比较大叶与脸的大小。": "Observer beside the branch, comparing a broad leaf with the size of a face.", "本期封面：外形奇特的绿色幼果。": "Video cover: oddly shaped green immature fruits.", "血桐叶面近景，浅色叶脉铺满盾状叶片。": "Macaranga leaf surface in close-up: pale veins over a shield-shaped blade.", "另一帧枝条断面与表面汁液。": "Another view of the broken surface of the branch and the sap on it.", "血桐的大叶像大象耳朵，树冠像帐篷，细小果实却长得很出人意料。": "Leaves like elephants' ears, a crown like a tent, and tiny fruits with a most unexpected shape: three ways of seeing this Macaranga.", "名字里的“血”，让我很好奇": "What about the “blood” in its name?", "血桐，这个名字一下就把我吸引住了。拍摄时，我先去观察枝条受伤后的切口，想看看汁液究竟会有什么变化。\n\n镜头贴近断面，切口、树皮、汁液都变得很具体。比起马上替颜色变化找一个原因，我更想先把这一次看到的样子记下来。": "Xuètóng, a name that begins with the word for blood, caught my attention straight away. While filming I examined the cut surface of an injured branch to see what would happen to the sap.\n\nWith the camera close, the cut, bark and sap each came into focus. Before offering an explanation for a colour change, I'd rather record what it actually looked like on this occasion.", "血桐，这个名字一下就把我吸引住了。拍摄时，我先去观察枝条受伤后的切口，想看看汁液究竟会有什么变化。": "Xuètóng, a name that begins with the word for blood, caught my attention straight away. While filming I examined the cut surface of an injured branch to see what would happen to the sap.", "镜头贴近断面，切口、树皮、汁液都变得很具体。比起马上替颜色变化找一个原因，我更想先把这一次看到的样子记下来。": "With the camera close, the cut, bark and sap each came into focus. Before offering an explanation for a colour change, I'd rather record what it actually looked like on this occasion.", "像大象耳朵，也像小帐篷": "Elephants' ears and a little tent", "我特别喜欢它的大叶片。叶柄从背面接进来，叶脉从那一处向四周散开，阳光一透，就能看清整张叶子的纹理。\n\n把脸放到旁边比一比，真有一点大象耳朵的感觉。树上的大叶重重叠叠，又把树冠撑成了一把绿色的伞。": "I'm especially fond of the great leaves. The stalk joins the blade from beneath; veins radiate from that point, and light shining through reveals the pattern across the whole leaf.\n\nHold one next to my face and it really does suggest an elephant's ear. Up above, the leaves overlap and the crown becomes a great green umbrella.", "我特别喜欢它的大叶片。叶柄从背面接进来，叶脉从那一处向四周散开，阳光一透，就能看清整张叶子的纹理。": "I'm especially fond of the great leaves. The stalk joins the blade from beneath; veins radiate from that point, and light shining through reveals the pattern across the whole leaf.", "把脸放到旁边比一比，真有一点大象耳朵的感觉。树上的大叶重重叠叠，又把树冠撑成了一把绿色的伞。": "Hold one next to my face and it really does suggest an elephant's ear. Up above, the leaves overlap and the crown becomes a great green umbrella.", "不起眼的小果，长得很奇特": "Tiny fruits with a strange shape", "平时最先注意到的是叶子，花果反而容易错过。这次在树下找到了尚绿的小果，拿到手里一看，外面的细长结构弯弯曲曲。\n\n形状有点古怪，像几个小魔怪聚在一起。原来大叶下面，还藏着这样一组完全不同尺度的细节。": "I usually notice the leaves first and can easily miss the flowers and fruits. This time I found some green fruits beneath the tree. In my hand I could see long, slender structures curling over their surfaces.\n\nThey had a slightly outlandish look, like a gathering of little monsters. What a change of scale from the enormous leaves overhead.", "平时最先注意到的是叶子，花果反而容易错过。这次在树下找到了尚绿的小果，拿到手里一看，外面的细长结构弯弯曲曲。": "I usually notice the leaves first and can easily miss the flowers and fruits. This time I found some green fruits beneath the tree. In my hand I could see long, slender structures curling over their surfaces.", "形状有点古怪，像几个小魔怪聚在一起。原来大叶下面，还藏着这样一组完全不同尺度的细节。": "They had a slightly outlandish look, like a gathering of little monsters. What a change of scale from the enormous leaves overhead.", "退后一点，看整把绿伞": "Stand back to see the green umbrella", "近看完切口、叶脉和小果，最后再退后一点。饱满的树冠向四周展开，树下阴凉，人站过去就像走进一顶帐篷。\n\n所以除了血桐，象耳树、帐篷树这些形象的称呼，也让我特别容易记住它。高大的树有大轮廓，掌心里的果又有小轮廓，两种都值得看。": "After the cut stem, the veins and the little fruits, I step back. The full crown spreads in all directions. Walking into its shade feels like stepping inside a tent.\n\nChinese names that mean “elephant-ear tree” and “tent tree” help me remember this plant, too. The whole tree has a striking outline, and so has the fruit in the palm of my hand. Both are worth a look.", "近看完切口、叶脉和小果，最后再退后一点。饱满的树冠向四周展开，树下阴凉，人站过去就像走进一顶帐篷。": "After the cut stem, the veins and the little fruits, I step back. The full crown spreads in all directions. Walking into its shade feels like stepping inside a tent.", "所以除了血桐，象耳树、帐篷树这些形象的称呼，也让我特别容易记住它。高大的树有大轮廓，掌心里的果又有小轮廓，两种都值得看。": "Chinese names that mean “elephant-ear tree” and “tent tree” help me remember this plant, too. The whole tree has a striking outline, and so has the fruit in the palm of my hand. Both are worth a look.", "原稿比较对象；尚未核实其具体科学名称。": "A plant mentioned for comparison. Its scientific name has not been verified.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "本期原稿采用血桐变种名；POWO将该变种名作为Macaranga tanarius的异名，正式分类显示接受种。": "The manuscript uses a variety name for 血桐. POWO treats that name as a synonym of Macaranga tanarius; the formal classification shows the accepted species.", "血桐 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 血桐"}, "20240923-01": {"本期封面：长长叶片如瀑布般垂在枝梢。": "Video cover: long leaves cascading from a branch tip like a waterfall.", "树皮近景，褐色表皮纵向开裂。": "Close view of brown bark with lengthwise cracks.", "酒瓶兰顶部的叶丛，细长叶片向下披垂。": "Narrow leaves drape from a tuft at the top of Beaucarnea.", "仰看顶部叶丛，细叶从中心向四周展开。": "Looking up, slender leaves spread from the centre of the tuft.", "一束束叶片垂挂，交织成柔软的线条。": "Bundles of hanging leaves interweave in soft lines.", "膨大的茎干基部，表面布满深浅裂纹。": "Light and deep fissures cover the swollen base of the stem.", "从下向上看树干分枝与顶端叶丛。": "Looking up at branches and the terminal leaf tufts.", "人站在植株旁，长叶与分枝的树形同框。": "The observer beside the plant gives a sense of its long leaves and branching form.", "酒瓶般的基部，配上一头向下垂的细叶，酒瓶兰的名字很形象。": "A bottle-shaped base topped with a mop of long, hanging leaves: this plant lives up to its Chinese name.", "酒瓶装在了哪里": "Where is the bottle?", "身边这株酒瓶兰，名字实在很形象。往下看，茎干的基部膨大起来，像一个放在地上的大酒瓶。\n\n平时见到的常是小盆栽，眼前这一株却已经长出了分枝。把视线从基部往上移，就能看到“瓶子”顶上还带着一头头发。": "The name jiǔpínglán, “bottle orchid,” suits the plant beside me. Look down: the base of the trunk swells into what looks like a great wine bottle standing on the ground.\n\nI usually see little potted specimens, but this one is old enough to have branches. Follow the trunk upward and the “bottle” turns out to be wearing a head of hair.", "身边这株酒瓶兰，名字实在很形象。往下看，茎干的基部膨大起来，像一个放在地上的大酒瓶。": "The name jiǔpínglán, “bottle orchid,” suits the plant beside me. Look down: the base of the trunk swells into what looks like a great wine bottle standing on the ground.", "平时见到的常是小盆栽，眼前这一株却已经长出了分枝。把视线从基部往上移，就能看到“瓶子”顶上还带着一头头发。": "I usually see little potted specimens, but this one is old enough to have branches. Follow the trunk upward and the “bottle” turns out to be wearing a head of hair.", "好一头柔顺的秀发": "Quite a head of hair", "它的叶片细长，集中长在枝梢，再顺势向下垂。风一过，长长的线条跟着摇动，真的很像一顶蓬松的假发。\n\n我越看越觉得，这一头秀发都可以去给洗发水拍广告了。酒瓶兰虽带着“兰”字，却属于天门冬科，并不是兰花。": "Long, slender leaves gather at the tips of the branches and fall in loose sprays. The wind moves those long lines together, like a great fluffy wig.\n\nThe more I look, the more I think this plant could star in a shampoo advertisement. Despite the lán in its Chinese name, it's in the asparagus family rather than the orchid family.", "它的叶片细长，集中长在枝梢，再顺势向下垂。风一过，长长的线条跟着摇动，真的很像一顶蓬松的假发。": "Long, slender leaves gather at the tips of the branches and fall in loose sprays. The wind moves those long lines together, like a great fluffy wig.", "我越看越觉得，这一头秀发都可以去给洗发水拍广告了。酒瓶兰虽带着“兰”字，却属于天门冬科，并不是兰花。": "The more I look, the more I think this plant could star in a shampoo advertisement. Despite the lán in its Chinese name, it's in the asparagus family rather than the orchid family.", "树皮里，有岁月的痕迹": "Time recorded in the bark", "靠近茎干再看，树皮没有叶子那么柔顺。表面褐色，裂纹深深浅浅地连在一起，有一点龟壳的感觉。\n\n膨大的基部、粗糙树皮和顶部的细叶，三种样子放在同一株上，反差很有趣。记住这三处，下次就容易认出酒瓶兰了。": "Up close, the bark is much less silky than the leaves. Its brown surface bears a network of deep and shallow cracks, a little like a tortoise shell.\n\nThe swollen base, rough bark and fine leaves at the top make an interesting trio of textures. Those are the three features I'll look for when I meet it again.", "靠近茎干再看，树皮没有叶子那么柔顺。表面褐色，裂纹深深浅浅地连在一起，有一点龟壳的感觉。": "Up close, the bark is much less silky than the leaves. Its brown surface bears a network of deep and shallow cracks, a little like a tortoise shell.", "膨大的基部、粗糙树皮和顶部的细叶，三种样子放在同一株上，反差很有趣。记住这三处，下次就容易认出酒瓶兰了。": "The swollen base, rough bark and fine leaves at the top make an interesting trio of textures. Those are the three features I'll look for when I meet it again.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "酒瓶兰 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 酒瓶兰"}, "20240730-01": {"叶丛之间垂着成串绿色和黄褐色果实，分枝集中在树干旁。": "Strings of green and yellow-brown fruits hang among the leaves, the branching clusters near the trunk.", "树干基部散落着许多不同颜色的果实，混在土壤和落叶中。": "Fruits of many colours lie among soil and leaf litter around the trunk.", "黄绿色和橙黄色果实挤在一串串细长分枝上。": "Yellow-green and orange-yellow fruits crowd the thin branches.", "果序从叶柄之间垂下，椭圆形果子沿着分枝密集排列。": "Dense rows of oval fruits on the branches of a hanging fruit cluster.", "一只蝶停在地面的裂开落果旁，附近还有黄色果子。": "A butterfly beside a split fallen fruit, with yellow fruits nearby on the ground.", "站在树下向上看，细长羽片把天空分成一条条亮缝。": "Looking up, the narrow leaflets divide the sky into bright slivers.", "树冠内的橙黄色分枝向四面伸出，分枝表面密布细小结构。": "Orange-yellow branches spread through the crown, covered in numerous tiny structures.", "树冠的羽状叶层层展开，叶间有黄色果序。": "Layers of pinnate leaves spread around yellow fruit clusters in the crown.", "银海枣叶丛近照，狭长羽片密密排列，色调带着淡淡银灰。": "Close-up of tightly spaced narrow leaflets carrying a hint of silver-grey.", "树干表面的旧叶柄基部层层相叠，形状像一块块护甲。": "Old leaf stalk bases overlap on the trunk like plates of armour.", "近看旧叶柄基部的环列结构，表面有斑驳痕迹与苔藓。": "Close-up of old stalk bases in rings, with mottling and moss on the surface.", "在银海枣树下俯身寻找落果，周围是草地与成排棕榈。": "Looking for fallen fruit on the grass beneath rows of palms.", "从侧面看宿存叶柄，厚实基部与深色缝隙交错排列。": "Side view of thick persistent stalk bases with dark gaps between them.", "从树下仰望银海枣，长长的羽状叶围着树冠向四面伸展。": "Looking up from below Phoenix sylvestris, its long pinnate fronds spread around the crown.", "抬手看向树冠，长长羽状叶下垂，果序藏在叶丛之间。": "Looking towards the crown, where long pinnate leaves hang around hidden fruit clusters.", "掌中的橙黄色果实呈椭圆形，顶端保留深色小圆痕。": "An oval orange-yellow fruit in a hand, with a small dark round mark at the tip.", "站在带有宿存叶柄的树干旁，观察刚拾起的果实。": "Examining freshly collected fruit beside a trunk still bearing old leaf stalks.", "橙黄色果子像小枣，叶柄基部却藏着针状羽片，再看看树干上层层留下的叶柄。": "Orange-yellow fruits resemble little jujubes. Needle-like leaflets hide at the bases of the fronds; below them, layers of old leaf stalks cover the trunk.", "不是枣，为什么叫银海枣？": "A date palm rather than a jujube", "先看看叶丛下面这一串串果子。椭圆形，带着黄绿到橙黄色的变化，难怪名字里会有一个“枣”字。\n\n不过银海枣是棕榈科海枣属的植物。顺着果序往上看，再看看高处展开的大叶子，它和我们平时说的枣树，长相可就很不一样了。": "Look at the bunches of fruit under the fronds. Oval and ranging from yellow-green to orange-yellow, they explain why the word for “jujube” comes into this palm's Chinese name.\n\nIt's a Phoenix, a date palm in the palm family. Follow a fruit cluster upward to the great fronds overhead and it's quite a different sight from a jujube tree.", "先看看叶丛下面这一串串果子。椭圆形，带着黄绿到橙黄色的变化，难怪名字里会有一个“枣”字。": "Look at the bunches of fruit under the fronds. Oval and ranging from yellow-green to orange-yellow, they explain why the word for “jujube” comes into this palm's Chinese name.", "不过银海枣是棕榈科海枣属的植物。顺着果序往上看，再看看高处展开的大叶子，它和我们平时说的枣树，长相可就很不一样了。": "It's a Phoenix, a date palm in the palm family. Follow a fruit cluster upward to the great fronds overhead and it's quite a different sight from a jujube tree.", "银灰色大翅膀，基部还有小“针”": "Silver-grey wings with little needles at the base", "抬头看，它的叶子像一对对伸开的长翅膀。许多狭长羽片排在叶轴两侧，绿色里带着一点银灰，我很喜欢这种淡淡的青绿。\n\n越往叶柄基部看，羽片越短，也越像一根根针。银海枣又叫林刺葵，这个“刺”字，便有了很直观的线索。": "Look up and the fronds resemble pairs of long wings spread wide. Narrow leaflets line both sides of the axis. Their green has a touch of silver-grey, a colour I particularly like.\n\nToward the base of the leaf stalk the leaflets become shorter and more like needles. Another Chinese name, líncìkuí, includes the word for “spine”; here's a clue I can see for myself.", "抬头看，它的叶子像一对对伸开的长翅膀。许多狭长羽片排在叶轴两侧，绿色里带着一点银灰，我很喜欢这种淡淡的青绿。": "Look up and the fronds resemble pairs of long wings spread wide. Narrow leaflets line both sides of the axis. Their green has a touch of silver-grey, a colour I particularly like.", "越往叶柄基部看，羽片越短，也越像一根根针。银海枣又叫林刺葵，这个“刺”字，便有了很直观的线索。": "Toward the base of the leaf stalk the leaflets become shorter and more like needles. Another Chinese name, líncìkuí, includes the word for “spine”; here's a clue I can see for myself.", "树干上，一层层留下来的叶柄": "Layers of old leaf stalks on the trunk", "再把视线放到树干上。老叶的叶柄基部还留在那里，一层一层嵌合，像把厚厚的甲片披在外面。\n\n转个角度，能看见这些基部的边缘与缝隙；再靠近一点，表面还有岁月留下的斑驳。认完树冠和果子，这样的树干也很容易记住。": "Now I look at the trunk. The bases of old leaf stalks remain in place, interlocking in layers like thick plates of armour.\n\nFrom a different angle I can see the edges and gaps between them; closer in, their surfaces are mottled with age. Along with the crown and fruit, the trunk makes this palm easy to remember.", "再把视线放到树干上。老叶的叶柄基部还留在那里，一层一层嵌合，像把厚厚的甲片披在外面。": "Now I look at the trunk. The bases of old leaf stalks remain in place, interlocking in layers like thick plates of armour.", "转个角度，能看见这些基部的边缘与缝隙；再靠近一点，表面还有岁月留下的斑驳。认完树冠和果子，这样的树干也很容易记住。": "From a different angle I can see the edges and gaps between them; closer in, their surfaces are mottled with age. Along with the crown and fruit, the trunk makes this palm easy to remember.", "低头找落果，还遇见了小访客": "Fallen fruit and a small visitor", "这次在树下捡到了不少落果。地上的颜色比枝头还丰富，一颗颗散在土壤、落叶和树干基部之间。\n\n其中一枚裂开的果实旁，还停着一只蝶。看它在这里停留，我也跟着多看了一会儿。从高处的大翅膀到地面的小访客，同一棵树可以让人上下看个不停。": "I found plenty of fallen fruits beneath the palm. They showed even more colours than the ones overhead, scattered among soil, fallen leaves and the base of the trunk.\n\nA butterfly had settled beside one split fruit. Its pause made me pause, too. From great wings overhead to a little visitor on the ground, this palm keeps me looking up and down.", "这次在树下捡到了不少落果。地上的颜色比枝头还丰富，一颗颗散在土壤、落叶和树干基部之间。": "I found plenty of fallen fruits beneath the palm. They showed even more colours than the ones overhead, scattered among soil, fallen leaves and the base of the trunk.", "其中一枚裂开的果实旁，还停着一只蝶。看它在这里停留，我也跟着多看了一会儿。从高处的大翅膀到地面的小访客，同一棵树可以让人上下看个不停。": "A butterfly had settled beside one split fruit. Its pause made me pause, too. From great wings overhead to a little visitor on the ground, this palm keeps me looking up and down.", "文稿明确 Phoenix dactylifera，作食用椰枣对照。": "The manuscript names Phoenix dactylifera, the edible date palm, for comparison.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "银海枣 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 银海枣"}, "20240805-01": {"拍摄现场，站在锈毛莓枝丛旁观察。": "Observer beside a thicket of Rubus reflexus at the filming site.", "铺在叶片上的红色聚合果，像许多小纽扣。": "Red aggregate fruits laid on a leaf like little buttons.", "掌心里的红果与摘去果实后的花托、花萼。": "Red fruits in a hand beside a receptacle and calyx left after a fruit was removed.", "在叶丛间寻找枝头果实。": "Looking among the foliage for fruit at the branch tips.", "近看浅绿嫩叶与密集叶脉。": "Pale green young leaf with a dense network of veins.", "枝条近景，锈色毛与小皮刺清晰可见。": "Close-up of a stem with rusty hairs and small prickles.", "枝条上还未完全展开的花苞状结构。": "A bud-like structure on a branch, not fully open.", "沿枝丛向内观察，周围夹着其它植物。": "Looking into the thicket, with other plants growing between the stems.", "叶面近景，粗糙纹理与细齿清楚可见。": "Rough texture and fine teeth of a leaf, up close.", "摘去果实后，花托与宿存花萼像一朵小花。": "After the fruit is removed, the receptacle and persistent calyx resemble a little flower.", "嫩梢的叶片尚在展开，边缘带细毛。": "Fine hairs edge the still-unfolding leaves of a shoot tip.", "同一段枝条上的新旧叶片，形状与颜色不尽相同。": "Young and old leaves on one branch differ in shape and colour.", "翻看叶背，浅色叶面与放射状主脉。": "The paler underside of a leaf with radiating main veins.", "一片叶面上的深浅色斑块与放射状叶脉。": "Light and dark patches among radiating veins on a leaf.", "嫩叶、细枝和褐色细毛。": "Young leaves and slender twigs with fine brown hairs.", "锈毛莓的叶片有不同深浅的掌状裂口。": "Rubus reflexus leaves vary in how deeply their palmate lobes are cut.", "本期封面：一片大叶托着许多红果。": "Video cover: a broad leaf holding many red fruits.", "较新的叶片带一点褐绿色。": "A newer leaf with a brownish green tint.", "绿叶交叠的枝丛，有浅裂也有深裂的叶片。": "Overlapping foliage includes shallowly and deeply lobed blades.", "近看带毛的花托和翻开的花萼。": "Hairy receptacle and spread calyx in close-up.", "从上方看一组红果，许多小核果排成圆圈。": "A group of fruits from above, the small drupelets arranged in rings.", "锈毛莓手绘：掌状裂叶、带毛枝条与聚合果。": "Drawing of Rubus reflexus: palmately lobed leaf, hairy stem and aggregate fruit.", "翻开的叶背旁，几枚红果还连在枝头。": "Beside a leaf turned over to show the underside, red fruits remain on the branch.", "从侧面看叶片展开的不同阶段。": "Side view of leaves in different stages of unfolding.", "红果像一排小纽扣，枝叶带着锈色细毛，锈毛莓的细节很耐看。": "Red fruits like buttons, rusty hairs on the twigs and leaves: the details of this Rubus reward a closer look.", "叶子上，摆了一排红纽扣": "Red buttons on a leaf", "夏天爬山，遇见这样红彤彤的小果，很难不多看几眼。锈毛莓的果实小巧，一粒粒摆在叶子上，像排好了队的小纽扣。\n\n靠近看，每一枚又由许多小核果聚在一起，透亮的红色很精神。随手一摆，就觉得是一幅很好看的图案。": "On a summer mountain walk, these bright red fruits are hard to pass by. They are small enough to line up on a leaf like little buttons.\n\nLook closely and each is made of many little drupelets crowded together, their translucent red remarkably vivid. Even a casual arrangement makes a lovely pattern.", "夏天爬山，遇见这样红彤彤的小果，很难不多看几眼。锈毛莓的果实小巧，一粒粒摆在叶子上，像排好了队的小纽扣。": "On a summer mountain walk, these bright red fruits are hard to pass by. They are small enough to line up on a leaf like little buttons.", "靠近看，每一枚又由许多小核果聚在一起，透亮的红色很精神。随手一摆，就觉得是一幅很好看的图案。": "Look closely and each is made of many little drupelets crowded together, their translucent red remarkably vivid. Even a casual arrangement makes a lovely pattern.", "锈毛，原来长在这里": "Where the rusty hairs grow", "它的名字是长了铁锈和毛发的莓吗？把镜头贴近枝条，答案一下就出来了：茎、叶柄、花梗上，能找到密密的锈色细毛。\n\n摸叶子的感觉也不是软绵绵的，反而有点像砂纸、麻布。再留意这些小皮刺，原来可爱的红果旁，也藏着很容易勾住人的细节。": "Does the xiùmáoméi, a name suggesting “rusty-haired berry,” really have something rusty and hairy about it? The camera settles the question: stems, leaf stalks and flower stalks all bear dense, rust-coloured hairs.\n\nThe leaves feel less soft than I'd imagined, more like sandpaper or coarse linen. Look out for the little prickles, too. Beside those appealing fruits are features that can easily catch on a passer-by.", "它的名字是长了铁锈和毛发的莓吗？把镜头贴近枝条，答案一下就出来了：茎、叶柄、花梗上，能找到密密的锈色细毛。": "Does the xiùmáoméi, a name suggesting “rusty-haired berry,” really have something rusty and hairy about it? The camera settles the question: stems, leaf stalks and flower stalks all bear dense, rust-coloured hairs.", "摸叶子的感觉也不是软绵绵的，反而有点像砂纸、麻布。再留意这些小皮刺，原来可爱的红果旁，也藏着很容易勾住人的细节。": "The leaves feel less soft than I'd imagined, more like sandpaper or coarse linen. Look out for the little prickles, too. Beside those appealing fruits are features that can easily catch on a passer-by.", "叶子翻一面，又是一幅画": "The reverse of a leaf is another picture", "锈毛莓的叶子也很耐看。有的裂口浅，有的分得深，新叶老叶的颜色还不一样；翻到背面，主脉与细脉像另一张精细地图。\n\n文稿里收集过几种依据叶形划分的种下名称，这次先不凭一片叶就替眼前植株指定变种。把这些变化好好记下来，已经够有意思了。": "The leaves merit a look in their own right. Some are shallowly lobed, others cut more deeply; the colours change with age. Turn one over and the midrib and finer veins form another intricate map.\n\nIn the manuscript I collected several names for taxa below species level distinguished by leaf shape. I won't try to assign a variety on the strength of a single leaf. The variation is interesting enough to record as it stands.", "锈毛莓的叶子也很耐看。有的裂口浅，有的分得深，新叶老叶的颜色还不一样；翻到背面，主脉与细脉像另一张精细地图。": "The leaves merit a look in their own right. Some are shallowly lobed, others cut more deeply; the colours change with age. Turn one over and the midrib and finer veins form another intricate map.", "文稿里收集过几种依据叶形划分的种下名称，这次先不凭一片叶就替眼前植株指定变种。把这些变化好好记下来，已经够有意思了。": "In the manuscript I collected several names for taxa below species level distinguished by leaf shape. I won't try to assign a variety on the strength of a single leaf. The variation is interesting enough to record as it stands.", "果子离开，还留下一朵“小花”": "A little “flower” left behind", "拿开红果后，花托与宿存花萼还保留着。中央一块浅色，周围几片向外翻，又像一朵毛茸茸的小花。\n\n红色小果很好看，这个留下来的褐色轮廓也不差。从果子看到花托，再回头看长着锈毛的枝叶，名字终于和一整株植物连起来了。": "Once the red fruit comes away, the receptacle and persistent calyx remain. There's a pale centre with parts turned out around it, like a little hairy flower.\n\nThe red fruit is lovely, but the brown outline left behind has its own appeal. From fruit to receptacle, then back to the rusty-haired stems and leaves: now I can connect the name to the whole plant.", "拿开红果后，花托与宿存花萼还保留着。中央一块浅色，周围几片向外翻，又像一朵毛茸茸的小花。": "Once the red fruit comes away, the receptacle and persistent calyx remain. There's a pale centre with parts turned out around it, like a little hairy flower.", "红色小果很好看，这个留下来的褐色轮廓也不差。从果子看到花托，再回头看长着锈毛的枝叶，名字终于和一整株植物连起来了。": "The red fruit is lovely, but the brown outline left behind has its own appeal. From fruit to receptacle, then back to the rusty-haired stems and leaves: now I can connect the name to the whole plant.", "原稿依据叶形列出的种下名称；未据此给本期镜头指定某一变种。": "An infraspecific name listed from leaf shape in the manuscript. The footage has not been assigned to a particular variety.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "锈毛莓 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 锈毛莓"}, "20241001-01": {"树干分枝向上伸展，撑起绿色树冠。": "Branches reach upwards to support the green crown.", "树干表面浅绿、灰褐相间的斑纹。": "Pale green and grey-brown mottling on the trunk.", "近看逐渐翘起、剥落的树皮边缘。": "Edges of the bark curling up as it peels.", "拍摄现场，成行树木与草地。": "Rows of trees and a lawn at the filming site.", "掌心里几片已经脱落的薄树皮。": "Thin pieces of fallen bark in the palm of a hand.", "叶间挂着许多带翅果实，有绿也有褐。": "Green and brown winged fruits hang among the leaves.", "掰开观察的干果，露出内部纤维状结构。": "A dry fruit broken open to reveal fibres inside.", "本期封面：枝条上成簇的带翅果实。": "Video cover: clusters of winged fruits on a branch.", "一束浅绿色叶片，叶脉纹理清楚。": "A group of pale green leaves with distinct veins.", "树冠下的观察者，展现植株高大的身量。": "An observer beneath the canopy shows the scale of the tree.", "逆光中的叶片，细密叶脉透过明亮的绿色。": "Fine veins visible through the bright green of a backlit leaf.", "阿江榄仁手绘：叶枝、带翅果实与树皮。": "Drawing of Terminalia arjuna: leafy branch, winged fruits and bark.", "掌心托着绿色的带翅果实。": "A green winged fruit in the palm.", "树皮近景，新旧表皮形成斑驳色块。": "Old and new bark make a patchwork of colours.", "向着蓝天伸出的新枝，叶片沿枝条排列。": "New shoots stretch towards a blue sky, leaves arranged along the branches.", "抬头看阿江榄仁的树冠，细枝与绿叶交织。": "Looking up into an arjuna tree at fine branches intertwined with green leaves.", "站在树下仰望，人与高大树干同框。": "The observer looks up beside the tall trunk.", "近看枝头果实与叶片，果翅向外展开。": "Close-up of fruit and leaves at a branch tip, the fruit’s wings spreading outwards.", "从端部看深褐色果实，果翅排列像一颗小星星。": "Viewed end-on, the wings of a dark brown fruit form a little star.", "高大的阿江榄仁，挂着迷你杨桃般的果实，树皮也会一片片换新。": "A tall Terminalia bears fruits like miniature star fruits. Even the bark is interesting: the old layer comes away in flakes.", "先认识这位“大懒人”": "Meeting a “big lazy fellow”", "今天介绍一位“大懒人”——阿江榄仁。这个名字读起来像在叫一个人，走近一看，它还真是高大又健壮。\n\n我站到树下抬头看，主干一路伸上去，绿色树冠已经高高地铺在头顶。先抱一抱这个“阿江”，再去找它的小秘密。": "Today's tree is ājiāng lǎnrén. Say its name aloud in Chinese and it's easy to hear a playful “lazy fellow” in lǎnrén. It even sounds like a person's name. Up close our friend turns out to be tall and powerfully built.\n\nI look up from below. The main trunk goes straight on up to a green crown spread high above my head. First a hug for Ājiāng, then a search for its little secrets.", "今天介绍一位“大懒人”——阿江榄仁。这个名字读起来像在叫一个人，走近一看，它还真是高大又健壮。": "Today's tree is ājiāng lǎnrén. Say its name aloud in Chinese and it's easy to hear a playful “lazy fellow” in lǎnrén. It even sounds like a person's name. Up close our friend turns out to be tall and powerfully built.", "我站到树下抬头看，主干一路伸上去，绿色树冠已经高高地铺在头顶。先抱一抱这个“阿江”，再去找它的小秘密。": "I look up from below. The main trunk goes straight on up to a green crown spread high above my head. First a hug for Ājiāng, then a search for its little secrets.", "树上挂着迷你杨桃": "Miniature star fruits in the branches", "最有趣的是它的果实。绿色的、已经变褐的，都能在枝头找到；外面几道突起的翅，让我一下想到了杨桃。\n\n拿近看，这些“棱”不是软软的果肉，而是果实向外伸出的硬翅。从一端看过去，又像一颗小星星。迷你杨桃这个比喻，是不是很贴切？": "The fruits intrigue me most. Green ones and ones already turning brown share the branches. Several projecting wings instantly put me in mind of star fruit.\n\nUp close, the ridges turn out to be hard wings projecting from the fruit rather than soft flesh. Seen end-on, the fruit resembles a tiny star. The comparison fits rather well, doesn't it?", "最有趣的是它的果实。绿色的、已经变褐的，都能在枝头找到；外面几道突起的翅，让我一下想到了杨桃。": "The fruits intrigue me most. Green ones and ones already turning brown share the branches. Several projecting wings instantly put me in mind of star fruit.", "拿近看，这些“棱”不是软软的果肉，而是果实向外伸出的硬翅。从一端看过去，又像一颗小星星。迷你杨桃这个比喻，是不是很贴切？": "Up close, the ridges turn out to be hard wings projecting from the fruit rather than soft flesh. Seen end-on, the fruit resembles a tiny star. The comparison fits rather well, doesn't it?", "逆着光看叶脉": "Looking through the leaves", "阿江榄仁也有柳叶榄仁的别称。它的叶片细长，嫩叶是很精神的浅绿色，成排伸在枝条两侧。\n\n我很喜欢从叶子下面往上看。阳光一透，主脉、细脉都清清楚楚，像铺开了一张精细的小地图。": "Another Chinese name for this tree means “willow-leaved Terminalia.” The slender blades spread along both sides of the branches. New leaves are a lively pale green.\n\nI love looking up from underneath. When sunlight comes through, the midrib and finer veins show as clearly as a little map.", "阿江榄仁也有柳叶榄仁的别称。它的叶片细长，嫩叶是很精神的浅绿色，成排伸在枝条两侧。": "Another Chinese name for this tree means “willow-leaved Terminalia.” The slender blades spread along both sides of the branches. New leaves are a lively pale green.", "我很喜欢从叶子下面往上看。阳光一透，主脉、细脉都清清楚楚，像铺开了一张精细的小地图。": "I love looking up from underneath. When sunlight comes through, the midrib and finer veins show as clearly as a little map.", "一片片，换下旧树皮": "Old bark comes away in flakes", "除了果实与叶子，树干也很有看头。外面旧的树皮一片片翘起、脱落，留下颜色不同的新旧斑块。\n\n捡起落下来的薄片，再看看眼前斑斑驳驳的树干，原来这位“大懒人”也有自己慢慢换新的时候。": "There's plenty to see on the trunk as well as in the leaves and fruits. The old outer bark curls up and flakes away, leaving patches of old and new surface in different colours.\n\nI pick up a thin fallen flake and look again at the mottled trunk. Even the tree I jokingly call the big lazy fellow is slowly renewing itself.", "除了果实与叶子，树干也很有看头。外面旧的树皮一片片翘起、脱落，留下颜色不同的新旧斑块。": "There's plenty to see on the trunk as well as in the leaves and fruits. The old outer bark curls up and flakes away, leaving patches of old and new surface in different colours.", "捡起落下来的薄片，再看看眼前斑斑驳驳的树干，原来这位“大懒人”也有自己慢慢换新的时候。": "I pick up a thin fallen flake and look again at the mottled trunk. Even the tree I jokingly call the big lazy fellow is slowly renewing itself.", "文稿用于比较果形；不是本期主对象。": "The manuscript compares fruit shape; this plant is not the featured subject.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "阿江榄仁 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 阿江榄仁"}, "20241015-01": {"黑面神手绘：叶枝、雌雄花及果实。": "Drawing of Phyllanthus lucens: leafy shoot, male and female flowers, and fruits.", "嫩叶下方的小绿花。": "A little green flower beneath young leaves.", "掌心中裂开的红果和脱落的果瓣。": "A split red fruit and its fallen valves in a hand.", "叶腋里的浅绿色小花与幼果。": "Small pale green flowers and young fruits at the leaf axils.", "细细花梗上垂下的小花。": "A tiny flower hanging on a slender stalk.", "一枚正在转红的果实，旁边仍是绿色幼果。": "A fruit turning red beside still-green immature fruits.", "逆光中的嫩叶，比老叶颜色更浅。": "Young backlit leaves are paler than the older ones.", "手边的结果枝，能比较叶片与幼果大小。": "Fruiting branch beside a hand, showing the sizes of leaves and fruits.", "小枝上排列的叶片，高低错落地展开。": "Leaves spread from a small branch at different heights.", "裂开的橙红色果实，与枝上的青果同框。": "A split orange-red fruit beside green ones on the branch.", "拍摄现场，观察枝叶与小花。": "Examining foliage and small flowers at the filming site.", "从另一帧观察叶间的小花与短枝。": "Another view of the flowers and short shoots among the leaves.", "本期封面：一串沿枝排列的绿色幼果。": "Video cover: a row of green young fruits along a branch.", "手持叶枝，翻看较浅的叶背。": "A leafy branch held up to show the paler leaf undersides.", "近看绿色花萼围成的盘状花部。": "A closer look at the disc-shaped structure formed by the green calyx.", "小枝顶端的嫩叶与浅绿小花。": "Young leaves and pale green flowers at a shoot tip.", "黑面神的深绿色叶片，细叶脉清楚可见。": "Fine veins in a dark green Phyllanthus lucens leaf.", "同一枝上的下垂小花与较宽的绿色花萼。": "Hanging flowers and broad green calyces on one branch.", "绿色幼果周围，宿存花萼像小托盘。": "The persistent calyx forms a little saucer around each green fruit.", "霸气的黑面神，长着清新的小绿花，枝上还有由绿转红的小果。": "For all its formidable Chinese name, this Phyllanthus has delicate little green flowers and fruits that turn from green to red.", "黑面神，先看这片绿": "A fierce name and a fresh wash of green", "黑面神驾到！听名字，像是统领山头的角色；真正走近它，看到的却是细细的枝条和很清新的绿叶。\n\n鬼画符、钟馗草、铁甲将军……原稿里收集到的俗称，一个比一个有故事。先把这些名字放在心里，看看这株植物本身长什么样。": "Here comes hēimiànshén, the “black-faced god”! The name sounds as though it ought to rule the hillside. Up close what I see are slender twigs and fresh green leaves.\n\nThe manuscript has a whole string of vernacular names, invoking ghostly charms, the exorcist Zhong Kui and a general in armour. I'll keep them in mind but first look at the plant itself.", "黑面神驾到！听名字，像是统领山头的角色；真正走近它，看到的却是细细的枝条和很清新的绿叶。": "Here comes hēimiànshén, the “black-faced god”! The name sounds as though it ought to rule the hillside. Up close what I see are slender twigs and fresh green leaves.", "鬼画符、钟馗草、铁甲将军……原稿里收集到的俗称，一个比一个有故事。先把这些名字放在心里，看看这株植物本身长什么样。": "The manuscript has a whole string of vernacular names, invoking ghostly charms, the exorcist Zhong Kui and a general in armour. I'll keep them in mind but first look at the plant itself.", "小秤砣，还是小托盘": "Little weights or little trays?", "花小小的，藏在叶子下面。有些用细长的梗垂下来，像一个个小秤砣；另一些绿色花萼展开，更像浅浅的小托盘。\n\n黑面神没有显眼的花瓣，绿色的花萼反而成了近看时最有趣的部分。翻开枝条，才发现霸气的名字还配着这样细致的小花。": "The tiny flowers hide beneath the leaves. Some hang from long thin stalks like little weights from a balance; on others, a green calyx opens out like a shallow tray.\n\nThere are no showy petals. Up close it's the green calyx that catches my attention. Turn a branch over and that formidable name reveals surprisingly delicate flowers.", "花小小的，藏在叶子下面。有些用细长的梗垂下来，像一个个小秤砣；另一些绿色花萼展开，更像浅浅的小托盘。": "The tiny flowers hide beneath the leaves. Some hang from long thin stalks like little weights from a balance; on others, a green calyx opens out like a shallow tray.", "黑面神没有显眼的花瓣，绿色的花萼反而成了近看时最有趣的部分。翻开枝条，才发现霸气的名字还配着这样细致的小花。": "There are no showy petals. Up close it's the green calyx that catches my attention. Turn a branch over and that formidable name reveals surprisingly delicate flowers.", "小绿果，也会换上红衣": "Green fruits changing into red", "再沿着枝条找，已经有许多绿色小果，花萼还在外面托着它们。一枚转红的果实特别抢眼，旁边却还排着一串青绿。\n\n近看裂开的果实，红色果瓣翻向外侧，又是另一种有棱角的样子。叶、花、果一起看，黑面神就从一个酷名字变成了眼前可以记住的植物。": "Farther along the branch I find plenty of small green fruits, the calyces still supporting them. One fruit has turned red and stands out against a whole row of green ones.\n\nOn a split fruit the red valves turn outward into a more angular shape. Leaves, flowers and fruits together turn a striking name into a plant I can recognise.", "再沿着枝条找，已经有许多绿色小果，花萼还在外面托着它们。一枚转红的果实特别抢眼，旁边却还排着一串青绿。": "Farther along the branch I find plenty of small green fruits, the calyces still supporting them. One fruit has turned red and stands out against a whole row of green ones.", "近看裂开的果实，红色果瓣翻向外侧，又是另一种有棱角的样子。叶、花、果一起看，黑面神就从一个酷名字变成了眼前可以记住的植物。": "On a split fruit the red valves turn outward into a more angular shape. Leaves, flowers and fruits together turn a striking name into a plant I can recognise.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "科学名称与等级按所列POWO/WCVP记录保留；中文是辅助对照，原稿采用名如与接受名不同则分别记录。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the cited POWO/WCVP record. Chinese names are supplied for comparison. A manuscript name that differs from the accepted name is recorded separately.", "黑面神 · 文稿采用名参考": "Reference for the name used in the manuscript: 黑面神"}, "20240522-01": {"远看树冠，红色花簇沿着分枝成片展开。": "Seen from a distance, red flowers spread in patches along the branching crown.", "满树红花层层铺开，下方的绿叶衬出树冠轮廓。": "Layers of red blossom spread above the green leaves that outline the crown.", "掌心里的凤凰木种子，种皮深褐、有光泽，形状细长。": "Long, glossy dark brown seeds in a hand.", "横向伸展的树枝，红色花簇点缀在疏密相间的绿叶中。": "Horizontal branches with red clusters dotted through foliage of varying density.", "蓝天下，红花、羽状复叶与旧荚果同时出现在枝头。": "Red blossoms, pinnate leaves and old pods together against a blue sky.", "掌中拆开的花瓣和萼片，带斑纹的一片花瓣与其它红花瓣并列。": "Petals and sepals separated in the palm, including one marked petal beside plain red ones.", "仰看开花枝条，深褐色长荚果悬在红花之间。": "Looking up at long dark brown pods hanging among red flowers.", "枝梢上的花蕾与开放花，下面是成排排列的小叶。": "Buds and open flowers at a shoot tip, with rows of small leaflets below.", "凤凰木伸向天空的枝条，红花与细密复叶交错，枝间还有深色长荚果。": "Flame tree branches reaching skywards, with red flowers, finely divided leaves and long dark pods.", "从另一个角度看花簇，红色花瓣、细长花丝和未开花蕾同时可见。": "Another angle on the cluster shows red petals, thin filaments and unopened buds.", "红花近景，细长雄蕊从花瓣之间向外伸出。": "Long stamens extend between red petals.", "手持拆开的花部展示，可见五枚向外展开的萼片和中央的细长花部。": "A flower opened in a hand shows five spread sepals and slender structures in the centre.", "从树干下方向上看，树冠将花、叶和天空连成一片。": "From the base of the trunk, the crown brings flowers, leaves and sky into one view.", "一簇凤凰木花与绿色花蕾，旁边伸着细密的羽状叶。": "A cluster of red blossoms and green buds beside finely divided foliage.", "低处的开花枝条，红花与一层层细小叶片交错。": "Red blossoms intermingle with layers of fine leaflets on a low branch.", "花朵近景，红色花瓣中有一片带白色与黄色斑纹。": "Among the red petals, one is marked with white and yellow.", "五月被凤凰木染红了，从满树繁花走近一片花瓣，再抬头看叶缝中的天空。": "The flowering trees turn May red. I go from a whole crown of blossom to a single petal, then look up at the sky through the leaves.", "花一开，五月就红了": "When the flowers open, May turns red", "凤凰木的花一开，好像整个五月都红了。枝头的花一层一层，叶子也是一层一层，远远就能把目光吸引过去。\n\n“叶如飞凰之羽，花若丹凤之冠”，用这句话想象它的名字，很形象。羽毛似的细叶，配着红彤彤的花，这一次就从树下走近看看。": "When these trees come into flower, May itself seems to turn red. The flowers are layered at every branch tip, the leaves in overlapping tiers, eye-catching even from afar.\n\nThe Chinese name fènghuángmù evokes the phoenix: the fine leaves are like the bird's feathers, the flowers like its crimson crest. Standing under the tree, I get closer to see for myself.", "凤凰木的花一开，好像整个五月都红了。枝头的花一层一层，叶子也是一层一层，远远就能把目光吸引过去。": "When these trees come into flower, May itself seems to turn red. The flowers are layered at every branch tip, the leaves in overlapping tiers, eye-catching even from afar.", "“叶如飞凰之羽，花若丹凤之冠”，用这句话想象它的名字，很形象。羽毛似的细叶，配着红彤彤的花，这一次就从树下走近看看。": "The Chinese name fènghuángmù evokes the phoenix: the fine leaves are like the bird's feathers, the flowers like its crimson crest. Standing under the tree, I get closer to see for myself.", "红色里面，藏着一片花纹": "One patterned petal in a sea of red", "凑近一朵花，才发现不是所有花瓣都一个样。红色花瓣中，有一片带着白色、黄色和红色的斑纹，像专门留下来的小标记。\n\n细长的雄蕊从中间伸出来，绿色花蕾还排在旁边。把花翻转，再把分开的花部放在掌心里看，原来一团热闹的红，也有很清楚的结构。": "In a single flower the petals aren't all alike. Among the red ones, one petal bears patches of white, yellow and red, as though it had been deliberately marked out.\n\nLong stamens reach out from the centre, with green buds beside them. I turn the flower over, then look at the separate parts on my palm. The exuberant splash of red has a very definite structure.", "凑近一朵花，才发现不是所有花瓣都一个样。红色花瓣中，有一片带着白色、黄色和红色的斑纹，像专门留下来的小标记。": "In a single flower the petals aren't all alike. Among the red ones, one petal bears patches of white, yellow and red, as though it had been deliberately marked out.", "细长的雄蕊从中间伸出来，绿色花蕾还排在旁边。把花翻转，再把分开的花部放在掌心里看，原来一团热闹的红，也有很清楚的结构。": "Long stamens reach out from the centre, with green buds beside them. I turn the flower over, then look at the separate parts on my palm. The exuberant splash of red has a very definite structure.", "枝头的长荚，掌心的小种子": "Long pods overhead, little seeds in my palm", "花枝之间还挂着深色的长荚果。抬头时它们像弯弯的线条，拿到种子再看，却是一把细长、深褐、有光泽的小东西。\n\n这么硬的种皮，要怎样等到发芽的时候？拍摄时我很好奇。先把问题留下，从果荚到种子的样子记清楚，再去寻找答案。": "Dark, elongated pods hang among the flowering branches. Seen from below they're curved lines; the seeds in my hand are slender, deep brown and glossy.\n\nHow does a seed with such a hard coat get to the point of germinating? It was a question I had as I filmed. For now I want to get the pod and the seeds clear in my mind; I can look for the answer afterwards.", "花枝之间还挂着深色的长荚果。抬头时它们像弯弯的线条，拿到种子再看，却是一把细长、深褐、有光泽的小东西。": "Dark, elongated pods hang among the flowering branches. Seen from below they're curved lines; the seeds in my hand are slender, deep brown and glossy.", "这么硬的种皮，要怎样等到发芽的时候？拍摄时我很好奇。先把问题留下，从果荚到种子的样子记清楚，再去寻找答案。": "How does a seed with such a hard coat get to the point of germinating? It was a question I had as I filmed. For now I want to get the pod and the seeds clear in my mind; I can look for the answer afterwards.", "树荫里的一米阳光": "Sunlight through the canopy", "看完花和种子，还是忍不住抬头。红花与绿叶相映，阳光从一层层叶片的缝隙里洒下来。\n\n夏天在这样一棵树下看天空，该有多好。一株凤凰木的印象，不只是“花很红”，还有细碎的树影、伸出去的枝条，和树下这一小片凉意。": "After looking at the flowers and seeds I can't resist glancing upward again. Red flowers against green leaves; sunlight filters through the gaps in one layer of foliage after another.\n\nWhat a place to look up at a summer sky. I'll remember more than just how red the flowers were: there's the finely broken shade, the branches reaching out and this small patch of cool beneath the tree.", "看完花和种子，还是忍不住抬头。红花与绿叶相映，阳光从一层层叶片的缝隙里洒下来。": "After looking at the flowers and seeds I can't resist glancing upward again. Red flowers against green leaves; sunlight filters through the gaps in one layer of foliage after another.", "夏天在这样一棵树下看天空，该有多好。一株凤凰木的印象，不只是“花很红”，还有细碎的树影、伸出去的枝条，和树下这一小片凉意。": "What a place to look up at a summer sky. I'll remember more than just how red the flowers were: there's the finely broken shade, the branches reaching out and this small patch of cool beneath the tree.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "凤凰木 · 名称与正式分类": "Delonix regia: name and formal classification"}, "20240611-01": {"一根分枝上有花蕾、开放花与膨大的绿色幼果。": "Buds, an open flower and a swollen green fruit on one branch.", "整丛植株的茎叶，细长花梗从叶丛上方伸起。": "Slender flowering stalks rise above the foliage of the whole clump.", "手边的花朵近景，斑点、花丝和中央花部都清楚可见。": "A flower beside a hand, with its spots, filaments and central structures visible.", "茂密的剑形叶丛，后方有零星花枝。": "Dense sword-shaped leaves with a few flowering stems behind.", "橙红色花被片上布满深色斑点，花朵朝镜头展开。": "Dark spots across orange-red tepals on a flower facing the lens.", "一朵朝侧方开放的花，细长花梗与旁边花蕾构成轻巧轮廓。": "A flower opens sideways on a slender stalk beside buds, forming a delicate outline.", "裂开的浅色果壳中露出黑亮的种子。": "Glossy black seeds visible inside a split, pale capsule.", "开放花与绿色幼果、花蕾同框，呈现不同阶段。": "Open flower, green immature fruit and bud show different stages.", "成熟果实开裂后，成簇黑色种子仍留在枝头。": "Clusters of black seeds remain on the branch after the ripe fruit splits.", "蹲在植株旁观察花枝，人的身形为花梗高度提供对照。": "An observer crouching beside the flowering shoot gives a sense of the stalk’s height.", "花后卷合的花被近景，像一根橙红色的小麻花。": "The perianth after flowering, twisted into a little orange-red curl.", "从正面观察六枚展开的花被片，人的手指与花朵大小形成对照。": "Six spreading tepals from the front, with fingers for scale.", "花丛里同时有开放花、花蕾和花后的细长结构。": "Open flowers, buds and slender structures left after flowering share the clump.", "叶面近景，中间和边缘的浅色线条延伸向叶尖。": "Pale lines in the middle and at the edges of a leaf extend towards the tip.", "射干手绘：记录剑形叶、开花枝与花后形态；图中沿用原稿旧学名。": "Drawing of Iris domestica: sword-shaped leaves, flowering shoot and spent flower. The artwork retains the scientific name used in the original manuscript.", "从上方看叶丛，扁平叶片彼此错开。": "Flat leaf blades overlap at angles in a view from above.", "侧向展开的一朵花，深色斑点分布在橙红色花被片上。": "Side-facing bloom with dark spots on its orange-red tepals.", "侧看直立叶片，细长叶面映出不同深浅的绿色。": "Upright leaves seen sideways show a range of greens on their narrow blades.", "绿色蒴果近景，可见果实表面几条明显的纵向起伏。": "Lengthwise ridges on a green capsule in close-up.", "射干的剑形叶片平平展开，交错排在植株基部。": "Flat, sword-shaped Iris leaves overlap at the base of the plant.", "橙红花朵长着豹纹，花谢后卷成小麻花，射干的叶、花和黑亮种子都很有个性。": "The orange-red flowers wear leopard spots, then twist into little braids as they fade. The leaves, flowers and glossy black seeds all have a character of their own.", "君子也爱豹纹": "Elegance with leopard spots", "这样望过去，花梗高高举起，下面是一丛清爽的长叶，确实有一点君子翩翩的感觉。再走近，橙红色的花上竟然满是斑斑点点——君子也爱豹纹啊。\n\n它叫射干，读作yè gān。名字可能不熟，花的个性却很容易让人记住。": "Seen from a little way off, the high flowering stalks and clump of clean-cut leaves have a rather courtly air. Up close, the orange-red flowers turn out to be covered in spots: even a dignified figure can wear leopard print.\n\nIts Chinese name is 射干, pronounced yè gān. The name may be unfamiliar, but a flower with this much personality is easy to remember.", "这样望过去，花梗高高举起，下面是一丛清爽的长叶，确实有一点君子翩翩的感觉。再走近，橙红色的花上竟然满是斑斑点点——君子也爱豹纹啊。": "Seen from a little way off, the high flowering stalks and clump of clean-cut leaves have a rather courtly air. Up close, the orange-red flowers turn out to be covered in spots: even a dignified figure can wear leopard print.", "它叫射干，读作yè gān。名字可能不熟，花的个性却很容易让人记住。": "Its Chinese name is 射干, pronounced yè gān. The name may be unfamiliar, but a flower with this much personality is easy to remember.", "把花里的细节看清楚": "A closer look inside a flower", "六枚花被片向外平展开，底色是橙红色，深色斑点一直延伸到花的中间。镜头靠近，细长的花丝与中央花部也显出来了。\n\n同一根花枝上，还有没开的花蕾和正在膨大的小果。我们把含苞、开放和花后的样子连起来看，就不只认识一张盛开的正面照了。": "Six tepals spread out flat. Dark spots cover the orange-red background right into the centre. Through the lens I can see the slender filaments and central flower parts more clearly.\n\nThe same flowering stem bears unopened buds and little fruits just beginning to swell. Put those stages together and I get to know more than one full-face view of an open bloom.", "六枚花被片向外平展开，底色是橙红色，深色斑点一直延伸到花的中间。镜头靠近，细长的花丝与中央花部也显出来了。": "Six tepals spread out flat. Dark spots cover the orange-red background right into the centre. Through the lens I can see the slender filaments and central flower parts more clearly.", "同一根花枝上，还有没开的花蕾和正在膨大的小果。我们把含苞、开放和花后的样子连起来看，就不只认识一张盛开的正面照了。": "The same flowering stem bears unopened buds and little fruits just beginning to swell. Put those stages together and I get to know more than one full-face view of an open bloom.", "小麻花之后，黑亮的种子": "Twisted tepals and glossy black seeds", "花谢以后，花被卷起来，像一根细细的小麻花。这是我觉得特别有趣的阶段，花不再平展，却没有马上从视线里消失。\n\n再看成熟的果实，浅色果壳已经裂开，里面露出一粒粒黑亮种子。远看像一小串珠子，可别把种子和外面的果壳认作同一个部分。": "When the flower fades, the tepals curl into a slender twist. I find this stage particularly interesting: the flower no longer spreads flat, but it doesn't disappear at once.\n\nLater the pale walls of the ripe fruit split to reveal glossy black seeds. From a distance they look like a little string of beads. The seeds and the shell that held them are two different parts.", "花谢以后，花被卷起来，像一根细细的小麻花。这是我觉得特别有趣的阶段，花不再平展，却没有马上从视线里消失。": "When the flower fades, the tepals curl into a slender twist. I find this stage particularly interesting: the flower no longer spreads flat, but it doesn't disappear at once.", "再看成熟的果实，浅色果壳已经裂开，里面露出一粒粒黑亮种子。远看像一小串珠子，可别把种子和外面的果壳认作同一个部分。": "Later the pale walls of the ripe fruit split to reveal glossy black seeds. From a distance they look like a little string of beads. The seeds and the shell that held them are two different parts.", "叶子像剑，也像一把扇": "Swords arranged like a fan", "最后看看叶子。长长的，扁扁的，一片片错开，既像细剑，也像一把慢慢打开的扇子。\n\n叶与花是两种不同的气质，放在一起却很协调。路边常见的植物，适当停一下、低头看一眼，也许就会遇到这样一朵让人意外的花。": "Finally I look at the foliage. Long, flat leaves overlap, suggesting both slender swords and a fan beginning to open.\n\nLeaf and flower have quite different characters, yet the combination works beautifully. Stop and look down beside a familiar road and a flower like this can still take you by surprise.", "最后看看叶子。长长的，扁扁的，一片片错开，既像细剑，也像一把慢慢打开的扇子。": "Finally I look at the foliage. Long, flat leaves overlap, suggesting both slender swords and a fan beginning to open.", "叶与花是两种不同的气质，放在一起却很协调。路边常见的植物，适当停一下、低头看一眼，也许就会遇到这样一朵让人意外的花。": "Leaf and flower have quite different characters, yet the combination works beautifully. Stop and look down beside a familiar road and a flower like this can still take you by surprise.", "文稿仅以叶形比较，没有给出另一个种的科学名称。": "The manuscript compares leaf shape without naming a second species scientifically.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "原稿采用名Belamcanda chinensis为POWO所列异名；本库正式分类使用接受名Iris domestica，属名为鸢尾属Iris。": "POWO lists the manuscript name Belamcanda chinensis as a synonym. This archive uses the accepted Iris domestica, in the genus Iris.", "射干 · 原稿旧名对应的中文资料": "Iris domestica: Chinese source for the historical name used in the manuscript", "Iris domestica · 接受名及旧名异名关系": "Iris domestica: accepted name and historical synonym", "射干 · 文稿采用名参考": "Iris domestica: reference for the name used in the manuscript"}, "20240723-01": {"从花序侧面看，淡红花丝和白色花被片形成轻巧线条。": "Side view: pinkish filaments and white tepals trace fine lines in the flower cluster.", "宽大绿叶之间举起的白色花簇。": "A white flower cluster rises between broad green leaves.", "林边的文殊兰生长环境，宽长叶片从基部向四周展开。": "Crinum at a woodland edge, broad leaves spreading in all directions from the base.", "侧向花序里，展开的花与尚未张开的花苞并列。": "Side view of an inflorescence containing both open blossoms and unopened buds.", "在植株旁低头观察文殊兰，花梗和宽长叶片同时可见。": "Examining Crinum beside the plant shows both the stalks and the broad, long leaves.", "手托一簇白花，细长花被片在花序中交错伸展。": "A cluster of white blossoms held up to show the long, narrow, crossing tepals.", "文殊兰手绘：记录植株、长叶和伞状花序。": "Drawing of Crinum asiaticum: plant, long leaves and umbel.", "尚未完全开放的一簇，花苞从花序中央向外伸出。": "A cluster not yet fully open, with buds projecting from its centre.", "文殊兰的白色花序举在长叶上方，细长花部从中间向外展开。": "The white Crinum flower cluster rises above long leaves, its slender floral parts spreading from the centre.", "开放花、直立花苞与花序基部在同一画面中。": "Open flowers, upright buds and the base of the inflorescence in one view.", "花簇近景，白色狭长花被片与伸出的花药相互交错。": "Close-up of narrow white tepals intermingled with protruding anthers.", "一朵展开的白花，花丝细长，花药留在末端。": "An open white flower with long filaments and anthers at their tips.", "狭长花苞近景，表面可见细小水滴。": "Tiny water droplets on the surface of a narrow bud.", "文殊兰的长条形绿叶，基部层层包裹。": "Long green Crinum leaves with overlapping bases.", "同片对照的蜘蛛兰：花中部有白色膜状副花冠，外侧细长花被片像伸开的脚。": "Spider lily shown for comparison: a white membranous corona in the centre, with long outer tepals like outstretched legs.", "从侧上方看叶丛，长叶向外拱展。": "From slightly above and to one side, the long leaves arch outwards.", "侧看白色花朵，可见带淡红色的细长花丝。": "Side view of a white flower with delicate pinkish filaments.", "不是兰花，也不是大蒜；文殊兰把一束白色细花举在长叶上方，同片还对照了蜘蛛兰。": "A cluster of slender white flowers rises above long leaves. This Crinum is neither an orchid nor garlic; a spider lily in the same video makes a useful comparison.", "一束白花，举得亭亭玉立": "A white bouquet held high", "长长的花梗撑起一束白花，白色花被片细细长长，花丝也像轻巧的线。风一吹，它们就在绿叶上方微微摇动。\n\n这是文殊兰。名字里带着“兰”，却是石蒜科文殊兰属的植物。先别被名字带走，看看这一整束花的样子，是不是很端庄？": "A long stalk holds up a cluster of white flowers. The tepals are long and narrow, the filaments like fine threads. A breeze sets them swaying just above the green leaves.\n\nThis is wénshūlán. Despite the orchid-like lán in its name, it belongs to the genus Crinum in the amaryllis family. Look at the whole spray: there's something rather stately about it.", "长长的花梗撑起一束白花，白色花被片细细长长，花丝也像轻巧的线。风一吹，它们就在绿叶上方微微摇动。": "A long stalk holds up a cluster of white flowers. The tepals are long and narrow, the filaments like fine threads. A breeze sets them swaying just above the green leaves.", "这是文殊兰。名字里带着“兰”，却是石蒜科文殊兰属的植物。先别被名字带走，看看这一整束花的样子，是不是很端庄？": "This is wénshūlán. Despite the orchid-like lán in its name, it belongs to the genus Crinum in the amaryllis family. Look at the whole spray: there's something rather stately about it.", "细看花里的线条": "Lines inside the flowers", "我把花簇托近一点看，白色花被片向外展开，淡红色花丝把花药举在末端。还没开的花苞，像一枚枚收拢的小画笔。\n\n同一簇里，有的已经舒展，有的仍然紧紧合着。看着这样丝丝条条的花，很容易只记住一团白；换几个角度，轮廓才慢慢变清楚。": "I bring the cluster closer. The white tepals spread outward, and pale reddish filaments carry the anthers at their tips. Unopened buds look like little paintbrushes with the bristles drawn together.\n\nIn the same cluster some flowers have spread wide while others are tightly closed. All those fine lines can merge into a patch of white; from different angles their outlines slowly become clearer.", "我把花簇托近一点看，白色花被片向外展开，淡红色花丝把花药举在末端。还没开的花苞，像一枚枚收拢的小画笔。": "I bring the cluster closer. The white tepals spread outward, and pale reddish filaments carry the anthers at their tips. Unopened buds look like little paintbrushes with the bristles drawn together.", "同一簇里，有的已经舒展，有的仍然紧紧合着。看着这样丝丝条条的花，很容易只记住一团白；换几个角度，轮廓才慢慢变清楚。": "In the same cluster some flowers have spread wide while others are tightly closed. All those fine lines can merge into a patch of white; from different angles their outlines slowly become clearer.", "同样白花，蜘蛛兰多了一条裙子": "The spider lily wears a little skirt", "文殊兰和蜘蛛兰，都有长叶和细长的白色花部，乍一看很相像。比较时，我最喜欢找它们花中间的那一点不同。\n\n同片的蜘蛛兰，中央有一片白色膜状的副花冠，像穿了一条小裙子。把这张对照图放在文殊兰旁边，再回头看主对象，就容易记住各自的花形了。": "Crinum and the spider lily both have long leaves and narrow white floral parts, and they can look very similar at first sight. I like to look for the difference at the centre of the flower.\n\nThe spider lily in the same video has a white, membranous corona in the middle, like a little skirt. After seeing the comparison beside the Crinum, it's much easier to remember which flower shape belongs to which plant.", "文殊兰和蜘蛛兰，都有长叶和细长的白色花部，乍一看很相像。比较时，我最喜欢找它们花中间的那一点不同。": "Crinum and the spider lily both have long leaves and narrow white floral parts, and they can look very similar at first sight. I like to look for the difference at the centre of the flower.", "同片的蜘蛛兰，中央有一片白色膜状的副花冠，像穿了一条小裙子。把这张对照图放在文殊兰旁边，再回头看主对象，就容易记住各自的花形了。": "The spider lily in the same video has a white, membranous corona in the middle, like a little skirt. After seeing the comparison beside the Crinum, it's much easier to remember which flower shape belongs to which plant.", "花下还有一丛长叶": "A clump of long leaves below", "再把视线放低，文殊兰的叶子也值得单独看。叶片很长，从基部向外展开，有的直立，有的慢慢弯下来，给白色花序留出一片深绿背景。\n\n从远处看花，到近处看花部，再退回来看看整株，文殊兰就不只是一个有点佛系的名字了。我把这一丛长叶和上方的白花，一起留在手绘里。": "Lower down, the foliage deserves a look of its own. Long blades spread from the base, some upright, others curving down, making a deep green backdrop to the white flower heads.\n\nI look from far off, move in close to see the flower parts, then step back to take in the whole plant. Now wénshūlán is more than a name with Buddhist associations. My sketch keeps the long leaves together with the white flowers above.", "再把视线放低，文殊兰的叶子也值得单独看。叶片很长，从基部向外展开，有的直立，有的慢慢弯下来，给白色花序留出一片深绿背景。": "Lower down, the foliage deserves a look of its own. Long blades spread from the base, some upright, others curving down, making a deep green backdrop to the white flower heads.", "从远处看花，到近处看花部，再退回来看看整株，文殊兰就不只是一个有点佛系的名字了。我把这一丛长叶和上方的白花，一起留在手绘里。": "I look from far off, move in close to see the flower parts, then step back to take in the whole plant. Now wénshūlán is more than a name with Buddhist associations. My sketch keeps the long leaves together with the white flowers above.", "文稿明确给出该科学名，白花主对象之外的比较对象。": "The scientific name is explicit in the manuscript. This is a comparison with the white-flowered main subject.", "文稿明确给出该科学名，用副花冠等作比较，不与文殊兰合并。": "The manuscript gives this scientific name and compares the floral corona. It is distinct from the Crinum featured here.", "原稿以中文名称举例；不凭泛称或文字错误指定镜头中的种。": "The manuscript gives examples using Chinese names. General names or possible typing errors were not used to identify species in the footage.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "POWO接受的变种Crinum asiaticum var. sinicum；八级表的种级为其上级Crinum asiaticum，变种等级另列，不将接受变种误记为异名。": "POWO accepts Crinum asiaticum var. sinicum. The species row gives Crinum asiaticum, its parent species, and an additional row gives the accepted variety.", "文殊兰 · POWO接受变种记录": "Crinum: POWO record for the accepted variety", "蜘蛛兰 · 同片比较对象": "Hymenocallis: plant compared in the same video"}, "20240701-01": {"叶丛间直立的朝天蕉花序，粉红苞片从绿色背景里露出来。": "An upright Musa velutina inflorescence among the leaves, its pink bracts prominent against the green.", "粉红苞片托着一排浅色花，蜜蜂和其它小昆虫同时入镜。": "A pink bract supports a row of pale flowers, with bees and other small insects nearby.", "上方花部近景，几只昆虫停在粉红苞片与花附近。": "Insects resting near the pink bracts and flowers at the top.", "粉红小果近景，果皮表面带着细细绒毛。": "Fine down on the skin of a little pink banana.", "合拢与展开的粉红苞片，形状像向上的小尖角。": "Closed and open pink bracts rising like small pointed horns.", "朝天蕉手绘：记录直立花果序、粉红小果与叶片。": "Drawing of Musa velutina: upright flowering and fruiting shoot, pink fruits and leaf.", "手边迷你的粉红果串，可与手指比较果实大小。": "A miniature pink bunch beside fingers for scale.", "朝天展开的花序，浅色花朵与深粉苞片形成对照。": "The upward-facing inflorescence contrasts pale flowers and deep pink bracts.", "站在植株旁比较高度，粉红花果序位于宽叶之间。": "A person beside the plant for scale, with pink flowers and fruit among broad leaves.", "向上生长的粉红色果串，果实在直立轴上分层排列。": "A bunch of pink bananas growing upwards, fruits arranged in tiers along an upright axis.", "宽大蕉叶的近景，中脉两侧细密叶脉排列整齐。": "A broad banana leaf in close-up, with fine, regular veins on either side of the midrib.", "展开的苞片间露出浅色花朵，一只蜜蜂停在花旁。": "Pale flowers emerge between open bracts, with a bee beside one blossom.", "从侧面看果皮绒毛和粉红色质感。": "Side view of the fine hairs and pink surface of the fruit.", "下方的粉红果串与上方仍在展开的花部同时出现在一根直立轴上。": "Pink fruits below and flowers still opening above on a single upright axis.", "不会“蕉绿”的粉红小蕉，果串朝天，花朵与蜜蜂也在同一枝上热闹着。": "A pink little banana holds its fruits upright, with flowers and visiting bees on the very same stalk. There's a Chinese wordplay here about a banana that never turns green or anxious.", "一串从不“蕉绿”的小蕉": "A little banana with nothing to worry about", "在一片大绿叶中，这串粉红色的小果实在太显眼了。果皮鲜艳，个头又小，伸手在旁边比一下，真的很迷你。\n\n它叫朝天蕉。看着它一副小小的傲娇样，我忍不住开玩笑：这么粉红的一串，怎么“蕉绿”得起来呢？": "Against those great green leaves, the little pink fruits are impossible to miss. Brightly coloured and small, they really do look miniature beside my hand.\n\nCháotiānjiāo means “skyward banana.” Watching this tiny, rather self-assured bunch, I can't resist a pun: jiāolǜ can sound like both “banana green” and “anxious.” How could a bunch this pink be either?", "在一片大绿叶中，这串粉红色的小果实在太显眼了。果皮鲜艳，个头又小，伸手在旁边比一下，真的很迷你。": "Against those great green leaves, the little pink fruits are impossible to miss. Brightly coloured and small, they really do look miniature beside my hand.", "它叫朝天蕉。看着它一副小小的傲娇样，我忍不住开玩笑：这么粉红的一串，怎么“蕉绿”得起来呢？": "Cháotiānjiāo means “skyward banana.” Watching this tiny, rather self-assured bunch, I can't resist a pun: jiāolǜ can sound like both “banana green” and “anxious.” How could a bunch this pink be either?", "朝天，原来是这样长的": "Growing skyward", "顺着果串往上看，花果序直立着，像把一面小旗举向天空。下方已经有了粉红小果，上方还有苞片和花，开花结果的阶段挤在同一枝上。\n\n虽然和熟悉的香蕉同属芭蕉属，眼前这一株的姿态却很不同。绿叶那么大，粉红果串那么小，这个反差越看越有趣。": "Follow the fruit cluster upward: the flowering and fruiting stalk stands erect like a little flag raised to the sky. Pink fruits have formed below, while bracts and flowers remain above. Several stages crowd onto a single stalk.\n\nIt belongs to the same genus as the familiar banana, Musa, but it holds itself quite differently. I love the contrast between those enormous green leaves and the little bunch of pink fruit.", "顺着果串往上看，花果序直立着，像把一面小旗举向天空。下方已经有了粉红小果，上方还有苞片和花，开花结果的阶段挤在同一枝上。": "Follow the fruit cluster upward: the flowering and fruiting stalk stands erect like a little flag raised to the sky. Pink fruits have formed below, while bracts and flowers remain above. Several stages crowd onto a single stalk.", "虽然和熟悉的香蕉同属芭蕉属，眼前这一株的姿态却很不同。绿叶那么大，粉红果串那么小，这个反差越看越有趣。": "It belongs to the same genus as the familiar banana, Musa, but it holds itself quite differently. I love the contrast between those enormous green leaves and the little bunch of pink fruit.", "花旁边，蜜蜂也来了": "A bee by the flowers", "刚好拍到蜜蜂停在花旁。粉红苞片展开，里面是一排浅色花，靠近镜头看，比远处那一团粉色丰富多了。\n\n花、果、宽大的叶子，各有各的出场方式。它不只是一个谐音梗里的“不蕉绿”，还是一株让我在绿叶间停下来，认真看了好一会儿的朝天蕉。": "I caught a bee resting beside a flower. Pink bracts open to reveal a row of pale flowers. Up close there's much more to see than the patch of pink visible from a distance.\n\nFlowers, fruits and broad leaves each make their own entrance. Beyond the pun, this is a plant that made me stop among the leaves and take a good long look.", "刚好拍到蜜蜂停在花旁。粉红苞片展开，里面是一排浅色花，靠近镜头看，比远处那一团粉色丰富多了。": "I caught a bee resting beside a flower. Pink bracts open to reveal a row of pale flowers. Up close there's much more to see than the patch of pink visible from a distance.", "花、果、宽大的叶子，各有各的出场方式。它不只是一个谐音梗里的“不蕉绿”，还是一株让我在绿叶间停下来，认真看了好一会儿的朝天蕉。": "Flowers, fruits and broad leaves each make their own entrance. Beyond the pun, this is a plant that made me stop among the leaves and take a good long look.", "对比日常香蕉；已有独立园艺集合档案，不认定为朝天蕉。": "The familiar cultivated banana has a separate record covering a horticultural group. It is not identified here as Musa velutina.", "原稿泛称，没有为本期对比画面指定野生种。": "A general name from the manuscript; no wild species has been assigned to the plant shown for comparison.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "朝天蕉 Musa velutina · 接受名与正式分类": "Musa velutina: accepted name and formal classification"}, "20240528-01": {"细看相邻叶片，叶面光泽与浅色纹路相互映衬。": "Close view of neighbouring leaves, their glossy surfaces and pale markings complementing one another.", "近看分枝花序，小花与未开放的结构沿着细梗排列。": "Small flowers and still-closed structures line slender stalks of the branching inflorescence.", "拍摄时手边的花序近景，可见紫色花部与尚未展开的花蕾。": "The inflorescence beside a hand shows purple floral parts and unopened buds.", "分枝花序上的小花成组排列，紫色在绿色背景中十分醒目。": "Small flowers in groups on a branched inflorescence, their purple conspicuous against green.", "叶脉近景，两侧细线从中脉向外延伸。": "Fine lateral veins extend from the midrib in close-up.", "站在成片叶丛旁观察，人的身形与植株高度形成对照。": "The observer beside a stand of leaves provides a sense of the plants’ height.", "紫色花部近景，外表带着浅色粉感。": "A pale, powdery-looking surface on the purple flower parts.", "窄画幅的叶丛局部，叶面映着明亮的绿色反光。": "A narrow view of the foliage, with bright green reflections on leaf surfaces.", "灰紫色小花聚在细长花序上，花序下部有带状苞片。": "Grey-purple flowers cluster along a narrow inflorescence with strap-like bracts below.", "整片水竹芋植株，密集叶面连成一片绿浪。": "The densely packed surfaces of Thalia leaves form a wave of green.", "一组灰紫色小花近景，边缘起伏和粉状表面清楚可见。": "Wavy edges and a powdery surface on a group of small grey-purple flowers.", "逆光的叶片，主脉和两侧细密叶脉清晰可见。": "Backlit leaf showing the midrib and fine lateral veins.", "叶丛的侧面，宽大叶片从细长叶柄上向上伸展。": "Side view of broad blades extending upwards from slender stalks.", "水竹芋成片的直立叶片，在光中显出几层不同的绿色。": "Light reveals several shades of green in a stand of upright Thalia leaves.", "从侧面看花序，紫色花部与花后的深色结构相邻。": "Side view of purple flowers beside dark structures left after flowering.", "从叶丛内部看，叶片高低交错，轮廓疏密有别。": "Inside the clump, leaves overlap at different heights, with outlines close together or spaced apart.", "再力花这个名字很有力量，小花却是低调的灰紫色，叶丛和花里的细节都值得放大。": "A forceful Chinese name for a plant with quietly grey-violet flowers. Both the clump of leaves and the tiny details inside the flowers are worth a closer view.", "再力花，名字先给人打了气": "A name that gives me a lift", "水竹芋还有个很有力量的名字：再力花。一听就有一种“再来一点力气”的感觉，让人忍不住想笑。\n\n它是南方绿化里常见的水生植物。走到一整片叶丛旁，宽大的绿叶高高低低地站着，远看已经很舒服；花在哪里？得把镜头移近一些。": "This Thalia has another Chinese name, zàilìhuā. To my ear it suggests “one more burst of strength,” which can't help making me smile.\n\nIt's an aquatic plant often used in landscaping in the south. Beside a whole clump the broad green blades stand at different heights, restful even from afar. But where are the flowers? I have to bring the camera closer.", "水竹芋还有个很有力量的名字：再力花。一听就有一种“再来一点力气”的感觉，让人忍不住想笑。": "This Thalia has another Chinese name, zàilìhuā. To my ear it suggests “one more burst of strength,” which can't help making me smile.", "它是南方绿化里常见的水生植物。走到一整片叶丛旁，宽大的绿叶高高低低地站着，远看已经很舒服；花在哪里？得把镜头移近一些。": "It's an aquatic plant often used in landscaping in the south. Beside a whole clump the broad green blades stand at different heights, restful even from afar. But where are the flowers? I have to bring the camera closer.", "低调的灰紫色小花": "Small flowers in muted violet", "花序从叶丛上方伸出，小花却没有绿叶那么抢眼。我很喜欢这一种灰灰的紫色，像是把鲜艳调低了一点，安静又耐看。\n\n近看，几组小花沿着细长的分枝排列，开放的、没有展开的、已经转暗的挤在一起。远处的一点紫色，原来也是由这么多小结构组成的。": "The inflorescences rise above the foliage, but the individual flowers are far less conspicuous than the leaves. I like their greyish violet, as if someone had turned the colour down a little.\n\nGroups of flowers line the slender branches. Open flowers, unopened ones and others already darkening jostle together. The hint of purple I saw from afar contains all these little structures.", "花序从叶丛上方伸出，小花却没有绿叶那么抢眼。我很喜欢这一种灰灰的紫色，像是把鲜艳调低了一点，安静又耐看。": "The inflorescences rise above the foliage, but the individual flowers are far less conspicuous than the leaves. I like their greyish violet, as if someone had turned the colour down a little.", "近看，几组小花沿着细长的分枝排列，开放的、没有展开的、已经转暗的挤在一起。远处的一点紫色，原来也是由这么多小结构组成的。": "Groups of flowers line the slender branches. Open flowers, unopened ones and others already darkening jostle together. The hint of purple I saw from afar contains all these little structures.", "花里面，还有一个小机关": "A little mechanism inside", "拍摄时，我还留意了花里面那一点白色结构。触发后的快速运动，是这一期特别想看清的细节；不把画面放慢，很容易只看到一瞬间。\n\n这种花柱运动与传粉有关。不过，看到花里留着小昆虫，还不能直接认定它靠吃虫子生活。先把动作和花形分别记清楚，问题才有了可以继续追的方向。": "I paid particular attention to a small white structure inside the flower. It moves quickly when triggered, something I wanted to see clearly in this episode. Without slowing the footage down I would catch only an instant.\n\nThis movement of the style is involved in pollination. Finding a small insect caught in the flower isn't enough to conclude that the plant feeds on insects. Recording the movement and the flower's shape gives me something specific to investigate.", "拍摄时，我还留意了花里面那一点白色结构。触发后的快速运动，是这一期特别想看清的细节；不把画面放慢，很容易只看到一瞬间。": "I paid particular attention to a small white structure inside the flower. It moves quickly when triggered, something I wanted to see clearly in this episode. Without slowing the footage down I would catch only an instant.", "这种花柱运动与传粉有关。不过，看到花里留着小昆虫，还不能直接认定它靠吃虫子生活。先把动作和花形分别记清楚，问题才有了可以继续追的方向。": "This movement of the style is involved in pollination. Finding a small insect caught in the flower isn't enough to conclude that the plant feeds on insects. Recording the movement and the flower's shape gives me something specific to investigate.", "花看够了，再看一片绿": "Stepping back to the green", "回到叶子上，才发现细密叶脉同样有秩序。叶面有的迎着光，亮亮的，有的背向镜头，颜色就深一些。\n\n一片一片的叶，组成眼前这一片绿。看花时镜头总想再靠近，退回来以后，又觉得成片生长的样子实在很美。再力花的趣味，近处与远处都有。": "Back at the leaves, I notice how regularly the fine veins are arranged. Some surfaces face the light and shine; those turned away from the camera look darker.\n\nOne leaf after another makes up the whole sweep of green. When I'm looking at a flower I want to bring the lens ever closer. Step back and it's the beauty of the whole stand that strikes me. This plant rewards both views.", "回到叶子上，才发现细密叶脉同样有秩序。叶面有的迎着光，亮亮的，有的背向镜头，颜色就深一些。": "Back at the leaves, I notice how regularly the fine veins are arranged. Some surfaces face the light and shine; those turned away from the camera look darker.", "一片一片的叶，组成眼前这一片绿。看花时镜头总想再靠近，退回来以后，又觉得成片生长的样子实在很美。再力花的趣味，近处与远处都有。": "One leaf after another makes up the whole sweep of green. When I'm looking at a flower I want to bring the lens ever closer. Step back and it's the beauty of the whole stand that strikes me. This plant rewards both views.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "水竹芋（再力花）· 中文名称": "Thalia dealbata: Chinese names", "Thalia dealbata Fraser · 正式接受记录": "Thalia dealbata Fraser: accepted name record", "Marantaceae · 花柱弹动与二次花粉呈现": "Marantaceae: style movement and secondary pollen presentation"}, "20240715-01": {"花部近景，紫色斑点沿着白色细长结构延伸。": "Purple spots along the slender white floral parts.", "从另一侧观察，花被片下垂，上方花部向外舒展。": "From the other side the tepals droop and the floral parts above them reach outwards.", "侧向花朵与旁边花后结构同框，宽叶留在背景中。": "A side-facing flower and a later stage, with a broad leaf in the background.", "带紫色斑点的花朵近景，花被片与上方花部有明显层次。": "Close view of a purple-spotted flower, showing the tepals and a distinct tier of floral parts above.", "本期记录的油点草属植物，宽叶沿茎排列，叶面可见弧形脉纹。": "The Tricyrtis in this observation: broad leaves with curved veins arranged along the stem.", "叶面带黄色斑痕的局部，不仅凭这一张静态照片判断斑痕成因。": "Yellow marks on part of a leaf. This photograph alone does not establish their cause.", "本期观察手绘：记录叶片、花枝、花和果实，图中保留原稿采用名。": "Field sketch of leaves, a flowering stem, a flower and a fruit. The lettering retains the name from the manuscript.", "山路旁的林下生境，纤细花枝在树干边伸起。": "Woodland beside the mountain path, with slender flowering stems by a tree trunk.", "枝端的花后幼果，顶端还留着浅色残余结构。": "A young fruit at a shoot tip, still bearing pale remnants of the flower.", "绿色花后结构近景，顶端仍有白色残余部分。": "Close view of a green structure after flowering, with white remnants still at its tip.", "从上方看林下植株，绿叶间露出几朵带紫色斑点的小花。": "Seen from above, small purple-spotted flowers show between the green leaves.", "一朵朝镜头开放的小花，附近有数枚绿色幼果。": "A flower facing the lens, with several green young fruits nearby.", "林下树干旁的植株，细长花枝伸到宽叶上方。": "A plant beside a woodland trunk, with slender flowering stems above broad leaves.", "同一根枝条上几枚发育中的果实，形状长短略有不同。": "Developing fruits of slightly different shapes and lengths on one branch.", "手边的一根花枝，便于比较小花与花后结构大小。": "A flowering stem beside my hand for scale, showing a flower and a later stage.", "同片花朵侧面，白色花被片上的紫斑和上方细长花部清楚可见。": "Side view: purple spots on the white tepals and slender floral parts above them.", "从上方看展开的小花，斑点分布在白色花被片表面。": "An open flower from above, showing the spots scattered over its white tepals.", "梧桐山路旁，一朵白花戴着紫色的斑点帽子。旁边还有细长的小果，一起藏在宽叶之间。本期照片尚未独立鉴定到种。": "On a path up Wutong Mountain a white flower wears a purple-spotted cap. Slender young fruits lie beside it among the broad leaves. The plant in these photographs has not been independently identified to species.", "山路旁的小仙女": "A little surprise beside the path", "前几天爬山时发现它开花了，这次特意带着设备来记录。大家忙着喘气、往上走，它却在路旁安安静静地开着，稍不注意就会错过。\n\n我在原稿里把它记作油点草。花小小的，白色上点着紫斑，清新又优雅；这么精致的一点花，藏在林子里，实在让人惊喜。": "I saw this plant flowering on a climb a few days ago and came back with my camera. People were busy catching their breath and pressing on uphill; the flowers were quietly opening beside the path, easy to pass without a glance.\n\nI recorded it under the Chinese name yóudiǎncǎo (油点草). It was such a surprise to find so delicate a flower in the woods: small, white and speckled with purple.", "像帽子，也像倒立的小章鱼": "A cap, or a tiny upside-down octopus?", "把镜头贴近，花的层次一下子丰富起来。下面是几枚展开的花被片，上方又伸出细细的花部，白色上都点着深浅不一的紫色。\n\n像小丑的帽子，也像倒立的小章鱼，还有一点旋转木马的样子。越是想给它找一个比喻，越会发现眼前的结构比想象中还复杂。": "Bringing the lens closer reveals one layer after another. Below are several spreading tepals. Slender floral parts reach out above them, the white surfaces dotted with purple of varying intensity.\n\nIt reminds me of a clown’s cap, a little upside-down octopus, even a carousel. The more comparisons I try, the more intricate the flower seems.", "花果同在，叶子也别漏掉": "Flowers, fruits and the leaves below", "花旁边已经有绿色的小果，顶端还留着花后的浅色结构。几根枝条上，新花与花后的阶段同时存在，正好一起记录下来。\n\n再看叶子，宽宽的，叶脉从中间弯向两边，颜色没有花那么热闹，却把花枝稳稳衬了出来。从花看到果，再看到叶，才算没有白来这一趟。": "Green young fruits already sit beside the flowers, with pale flower parts still attached at the tips. Several branches have both newly opened flowers and later stages, so I could record them together.\n\nThe leaves are broad, with veins curving out from the centre. Their colours are quieter than those of the flowers, but they make a fine backdrop for the flowering stems. It was worth coming back to see all three: flower, fruit and leaf.", "梧桐山油点草 · Tricyrtis macropoda Miq.（卷四，第472页）": "Tricyrtis macropoda Miq. on Wutong Mountain (Flora of Shenzhen, vol. 4, p. 472)", "Tricyrtis macropoda · 地方志用名所对应的邱园记录": "Kew record for Tricyrtis macropoda, the name used in the local flora", "Tricyrtis chinensis · 2001年原始分类描述": "Tricyrtis chinensis: the original taxonomic description (2001)", "本期油点草按邱园接受种 Tricyrtis chinensis Hir.Takah.bis（中华油点草）归档。植物智收录的《深圳植物志》将梧桐山油点草记为 Tricyrtis macropoda Miq.（卷四，第472页）。邱园分别接受这两个种。本期照片尚未独立鉴定到种。": "This record follows Kew’s accepted name Tricyrtis chinensis Hir.Takah.bis. The Flora of Shenzhen on iPlant records the Wutong Mountain plant as Tricyrtis macropoda Miq. (vol. 4, p. 472). Kew accepts both as separate species. The plant photographed for this video has not been independently identified to species.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "原稿名称与梧桐山历史用名": "The manuscript’s name and its historical local use at Wutong Mountain."}, "20240604-01": {"展开的绿色苞片内，尚绿色的小果密集排列。": "Small, still-green fruits packed inside an open green spathe.", "同一画面中的两个佛焰苞，浅绿苞片内外形态不同。": "Two spathes in the same frame, showing different views of the pale green bracts.", "同一丛植株上，橙红果串与绿色苞片相邻。": "An orange-red fruit cluster beside a green spathe on the same clump.", "叶丛旁几个长形结构并列，其中包着不同发育阶段的花果序。": "Several elongated structures beside the leaves enclose flower and fruit clusters at different stages.", "林下成片的海芋叶丛，树冠在上方形成荫蔽。": "Patches of Alocasia beneath the shade of the canopy.", "手持拆开的果序展示，果实取去后露出内部轴状结构。": "A fruit cluster held open. Removing the fruits reveals the axis inside.", "果串近景，一颗颗橙红果实表面有光泽。": "A close view of the glossy orange-red fruits.", "海芋宽大的叶片带着水珠，叶面起伏在光里十分明显。": "Droplets on a broad leaf, its rippled surface picked out by the light.", "浅色佛焰苞内可见棒状的肉穗花序。": "A rod-shaped spadix inside the pale spathe.", "成熟的橙红色果实密集排列成串，外侧留着干燥苞片。": "Ripe orange-red fruits crowded together, with a dry spathe still attached.", "拍摄时拆开一段果串作观察，少量果实与浅色内部结构留在手边。": "A section of a fruit cluster opened for the photograph, with a few fruits and some pale inner tissue visible in hand.", "展开的佛焰苞侧面，浅色棒状花序位于中央。": "The open spathe in profile, with the pale spadix in the middle.", "从侧上方看叶丛，叶形与叶脉同时可见。": "The clump viewed at an angle from above, showing both leaf outlines and veins.", "叶面近景，粗壮叶脉从叶柄连接附近向外伸展。": "Thick veins spreading from near the point where the stalk meets the blade.", "一丛宽大叶片，高低叠在林下的绿色背景中。": "Broad leaves at several heights overlap against the green woodland backdrop.", "植株基部的粗壮茎段，周围留有枯叶与旧叶柄。": "A stout section of stem at the base, surrounded by dead leaves and old leaf stalks.", "站在海芋旁比较叶片与植株高度，大叶子远高于人的肩部。": "Standing beside the plant for scale. The large leaves are well above shoulder height.", "海芋手绘：记录大叶、叶脉与花序结构。": "Field sketch of Alocasia odora showing the large leaves, their veins and the inflorescence.", "从一片滴着水的大叶子，看到佛焰苞、肉穗花序和橙红果串，认识海芋的几副面孔。": "I started with a water-beaded leaf and found a spathe, a spadix and a cluster of orange-red fruits. Each offered a different view of Alocasia odora.", "海芋": "Hǎiyù (海芋)", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "龟背竹；魔芋；半夏": "Guībèizhú (龟背竹), móyù (魔芋) and bànxià (半夏).", "滴水观音": "Dīshuǐ guānyīn (滴水观音), “dripping Guanyin”", "姑婆芋": "Gūpóyù (姑婆芋)", "滴水芋": "Dīshuǐyù (滴水芋)", "滴水观音是很危险的植物？从植物学角度了解一下它，天南星科海芋": "Is “dripping Guanyin” dangerous? A botanical look at Alocasia odora, a member of the arum family.", "好大一片叶子啊": "What an enormous leaf!", "走到海芋旁边，第一反应就是：好大一片叶子啊。宽宽的叶面撑在长叶柄上，几片叠在一起，满眼都是热带的绿色。\n\n叶面还带着水滴。海芋也常被叫作滴水观音，听到这个名字，再看眼前的大叶子，确实很容易展开联想。": "The first thing I thought as I walked up was, what an enormous leaf! Wide blades stood on long stalks, overlapping until all I could see was tropical green.\n\nDroplets still clung to the leaves. This plant is often called dīshuǐ guānyīn, “dripping Guanyin”. With those big, wet leaves in front of me, the name immediately conjured an image.", "浅色苞片里，藏着另一种花": "Inside the pale spathe", "花的样子和日常说的一朵小花很不一样。外面一片浅绿到黄白色的佛焰苞，像轻轻围起来的小帘子，中间藏着棒状的肉穗花序。\n\n站近一些，换个侧面看，苞片和里面的花序就分得清楚了。原来那一整套有点奇特的造型，不能简单当成一片花瓣。": "This looks quite unlike the little flower we usually picture. A pale green to yellowish-white spathe wraps loosely around the centre like a curtain. Inside sits the rod-shaped flower cluster, or spadix.\n\nFrom close up, looking in from the side, I could tell the spathe from the inflorescence it surrounded. There was far more to that curious shape than a single petal.", "颜色一亮，已经是果实了": "The flash of bright colour is fruit", "叶丛间还有一串很醒目的橙红色。靠近才看清，许多小果实挤得密密的，外面还留着已经干燥的苞片。\n\n旁边另有尚青绿的阶段。浅色花序、绿色小果、橙红果串，虽然形状差得很远，沿着这一丛找一找，却能把它们接起来。": "Among the leaves I spotted a striking cluster of orange-red. Up close I could see it was made up of little fruits crowded together. A dried spathe still clung to the outside.\n\nNearby there was a cluster at an earlier, green stage. The pale inflorescence, green fruits and orange-red cluster looked so different, yet here I could follow one stage into the next in the same clump.", "回到这片大叶子的森林": "Back in the forest of leaves", "再把镜头放回叶子上。粗壮叶脉往四周伸，深浅不一的绿色顺着叶面起伏，有的地方水珠还没有散。\n\n近处看细节，远处看一整丛，海芋总是很有存在感。我最想记下的，就是站在它旁边时，好像一下钻进了一小片热带雨林的感觉。": "I turned the camera back to the leaves. Thick veins radiated across them. Shades of green followed the ripples in each blade, and here and there beads of water still lingered.\n\nWhether I stood close to look at the details or stepped back to see the whole clump, it was hard to miss this plant. What I most wanted to remember was the feeling of standing beside it, as though I’d stepped into a little patch of tropical rainforest.", "龟背竹": "Guībèizhú (龟背竹)", "原稿作为佛焰苞与肉穗花序的同片比较，未给出具体科学名称。": "The manuscript compares the spathe and spadix without naming a particular species.", "魔芋": "Móyù (魔芋)", "半夏": "Bànxià (半夏)", "海芋 · 中文名与别名对照": "Alocasia odora: Chinese name and alternatives", "植物智 iPlant": "iPlant", "Alocasia odora · 正式名称与分类": "Alocasia odora: scientific name and classification", "英国皇家植物园邱园 POWO / WCVP": "Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew · POWO / WCVP", "走到海芋旁边，第一反应就是：好大一片叶子啊。宽宽的叶面撑在长叶柄上，几片叠在一起，满眼都是热带的绿色。": "The first thing I thought as I walked up was, what an enormous leaf! Wide blades stood on long stalks, overlapping until all I could see was tropical green.", "叶面还带着水滴。海芋也常被叫作滴水观音，听到这个名字，再看眼前的大叶子，确实很容易展开联想。": "Droplets still clung to the leaves. This plant is often called dīshuǐ guānyīn, “dripping Guanyin”. With those big, wet leaves in front of me, the name immediately conjured an image.", "花的样子和日常说的一朵小花很不一样。外面一片浅绿到黄白色的佛焰苞，像轻轻围起来的小帘子，中间藏着棒状的肉穗花序。": "This looks quite unlike the little flower we usually picture. A pale green to yellowish-white spathe wraps loosely around the centre like a curtain. Inside sits the rod-shaped flower cluster, or spadix.", "站近一些，换个侧面看，苞片和里面的花序就分得清楚了。原来那一整套有点奇特的造型，不能简单当成一片花瓣。": "From close up, looking in from the side, I could tell the spathe from the inflorescence it surrounded. There was far more to that curious shape than a single petal.", "叶丛间还有一串很醒目的橙红色。靠近才看清，许多小果实挤得密密的，外面还留着已经干燥的苞片。": "Among the leaves I spotted a striking cluster of orange-red. Up close I could see it was made up of little fruits crowded together. A dried spathe still clung to the outside.", "旁边另有尚青绿的阶段。浅色花序、绿色小果、橙红果串，虽然形状差得很远，沿着这一丛找一找，却能把它们接起来。": "Nearby there was a cluster at an earlier, green stage. The pale inflorescence, green fruits and orange-red cluster looked so different, yet here I could follow one stage into the next in the same clump.", "再把镜头放回叶子上。粗壮叶脉往四周伸，深浅不一的绿色顺着叶面起伏，有的地方水珠还没有散。": "I turned the camera back to the leaves. Thick veins radiated across them. Shades of green followed the ripples in each blade, and here and there beads of water still lingered.", "近处看细节，远处看一整丛，海芋总是很有存在感。我最想记下的，就是站在它旁边时，好像一下钻进了一小片热带雨林的感觉。": "Whether I stood close to look at the details or stepped back to see the whole clump, it was hard to miss this plant. What I most wanted to remember was the feeling of standing beside it, as though I’d stepped into a little patch of tropical rainforest."}, "20240708-01": {"放大看一枚绿色蒴果，软刺般的疣状表面清楚可见。": "A magnified green capsule with a warty surface resembling soft prickles.", "尚未完全开放的浅色花枝，狭长花苞沿着花序排列。": "A pale cluster still opening, with narrow buds arranged along the stalk.", "同片花色对照：浅粉橙色的小花举在宽叶上方，未单独确定栽培品种。": "Flower colour comparison: pale pink-orange flowers above broad leaves; the cultivar was not independently identified.", "同片花色对照：红色花部侧面，花蕾仍卷合着。": "Flower colour comparison: side view of red floral parts beside a still-tightly rolled bud.", "浅色花的局部，淡黄白色细长花部向外伸展。": "Long pale yellow-white floral parts extending outwards.", "卷着的新叶从叶丛中向上抽出，旁边已有平展的大叶。": "A rolled new leaf rises beside a fully spread blade.", "绿色蒴果表面布满细小疣状突起，花后结构留在旁边。": "A green capsule covered in tiny wart-like bumps, beside structures left after flowering.", "卷叶与平展叶同框，后方粉色花朵已虚化。": "A rolled leaf beside a flat one; pink flowers are blurred behind.", "浅色花苞聚在弯曲花序轴的一端，叶丛形成绿色背景。": "Pale buds cluster at one end of a curved axis against green foliage.", "同片花色对照：粉红色花部展开，绿色叶片在旁。": "Flower colour comparison: pink floral parts spreading beside a green leaf.", "同片花色对照：一朵粉红花从细长花梗上侧向展开。": "Flower colour comparison: a pink flower opening sideways on a slender stalk.", "同片花色对照：乳白色细长花部，基部带浅黄。": "Flower colour comparison: narrow creamy white floral parts with a touch of pale yellow at the base.", "逆光观察叶片，密集叶脉沿中脉两侧延伸。": "Backlighting shows dense rows of veins extending on either side of the midrib.", "掌心里的深色圆形种子，大小与手指纹路形成对照。": "Dark round seeds in the palm, with skin ridges for scale.", "拍摄时站在植株旁，近处有花果枝，后方还能看到红色花。": "Observer beside the plant, with flowers and fruits nearby and red blossoms farther back.", "本期美人蕉观察手绘：记录叶片、花枝及花部。": "Drawing from the canna observation: leaves, flowering shoot and floral parts.", "手持果枝作观察，几枚绿果大小不同，表面都有密集小突起。": "A fruiting shoot held up to show green capsules of different sizes, all densely covered in bumps.", "同片浅色花旁的大叶，叶面纹理与花枝相互衬托。": "A broad leaf beside a pale flower in the same video, its surface texture set against the flowering shoot.", "美人蕉类植株展开的大叶，中脉突出，叶面绿得明亮。": "A large, fully spread canna leaf, bright green with a prominent midrib.", "同片花色对照：红色花枝向上伸，部分花部尚未展开。": "Flower colour comparison: a red flowering shoot with some parts still unopened.", "花如美人，叶似芭蕉，卷着的新叶、不同花色和满身小疣的绿果，都很有意思。": "Flowers like beauties, leaves like banana leaves: tightly rolled new blades, flowers in several colours and green fruits covered in little warts all have a place in this Canna story.", "花如美人，叶似芭蕉": "A southern beauty with banana-like leaves", "今天介绍一位南方美人——美人蕉。小时候在水边经常看见它，一说起这个名字，眼前就会浮出那些大叶子和高高的花枝。\n\n这一期也看了好几种花色：红的、粉的，还有浅浅的乳白。名字都绕着“美人蕉”打转，样子却各有不同，先并排看看它们的花形。": "Today's southern beauty is měirénjiāo, the canna. As a child I often saw it beside the water. Say its name even now and I picture broad leaves and flowers on tall stalks.\n\nThis time I looked at several colours: red, pink and a pale creamy white. They all go by names involving měirénjiāo, but they have different looks. I'll start by comparing the shape of the flowers side by side.", "今天介绍一位南方美人——美人蕉。小时候在水边经常看见它，一说起这个名字，眼前就会浮出那些大叶子和高高的花枝。": "Today's southern beauty is měirénjiāo, the canna. As a child I often saw it beside the water. Say its name even now and I picture broad leaves and flowers on tall stalks.", "这一期也看了好几种花色：红的、粉的，还有浅浅的乳白。名字都绕着“美人蕉”打转，样子却各有不同，先并排看看它们的花形。": "This time I looked at several colours: red, pink and a pale creamy white. They all go by names involving měirénjiāo, but they have different looks. I'll start by comparing the shape of the flowers side by side.", "叶子一片片慢慢打开": "Leaves opening one after another", "我特别喜欢看它的新叶。刚抽出来时卷得紧紧的，像把一片绿收成了细长的筒；旁边已经展开的叶子，又大又平，纹理清清楚楚。\n\n叶叶递开，卷着的、半开的、舒展的都能找到。花很醒目，叶子这样慢慢出场的过程，也让我舍不得不多看两眼。": "I particularly like the new leaves. As they emerge they're tightly rolled, as though a patch of green had been wound into a long narrow tube. Beside them the fully open blades are broad and flat, their texture clearly visible.\n\nRolled, half open, fully spread: several stages sit side by side. The flowers are conspicuous, but I find it just as hard to look away from the slow unfurling of the leaves.", "我特别喜欢看它的新叶。刚抽出来时卷得紧紧的，像把一片绿收成了细长的筒；旁边已经展开的叶子，又大又平，纹理清清楚楚。": "I particularly like the new leaves. As they emerge they're tightly rolled, as though a patch of green had been wound into a long narrow tube. Beside them the fully open blades are broad and flat, their texture clearly visible.", "叶叶递开，卷着的、半开的、舒展的都能找到。花很醒目，叶子这样慢慢出场的过程，也让我舍不得不多看两眼。": "Rolled, half open, fully spread: several stages sit side by side. The flowers are conspicuous, but I find it just as hard to look away from the slow unfurling of the leaves.", "这些绿球，是花后的果实": "The green balls are fruits", "花枝上还挂着几枚绿色小球。凑近，表面满是疣状的小突起，像一颗颗尚未成熟的绿杨梅。\n\n这是蒴果。拿近一点观察，大的、小的挨在一起，花后的结构还留在旁边。掌心里的深色圆种子，又把这一段变化往后接了一步。": "A few green balls still hang from the flowering stalks. Up close their surfaces have so many wart-like bumps that they resemble unripe green Chinese bayberries.\n\nThey're capsules. Large and small ones sit close together, with remnants of the flowers beside them. Dark round seeds in my palm take the sequence a step further.", "花枝上还挂着几枚绿色小球。凑近，表面满是疣状的小突起，像一颗颗尚未成熟的绿杨梅。": "A few green balls still hang from the flowering stalks. Up close their surfaces have so many wart-like bumps that they resemble unripe green Chinese bayberries.", "这是蒴果。拿近一点观察，大的、小的挨在一起，花后的结构还留在旁边。掌心里的深色圆种子，又把这一段变化往后接了一步。": "They're capsules. Large and small ones sit close together, with remnants of the flowers beside them. Dark round seeds in my palm take the sequence a step further.", "不同花色，一起留在这一期": "Several flower colours in one video", "再回头看花，红色的线条鲜明，粉色的轻巧，浅色的又是另一种气质。细长花部有的展开，有的仍卷合着，和绿叶放在一起，各有自己的好看。\n\n这些园艺面孔不必只凭花色急着认成同一个品种。把同片对照分别记下来，日后再遇见时，就多了几个可以继续比较的小线索。": "Looking back at the flowers, I see bold lines in the red, a lightness in the pink, and another quality altogether in the pale ones. Some of the long narrow flower parts spread wide; others are still rolled. Each has its own appeal against the green leaves.\n\nColour alone isn't enough to assign these garden plants to a cultivar. I'll keep the comparisons from this video separate so I have something to check against when I meet them again.", "再回头看花，红色的线条鲜明，粉色的轻巧，浅色的又是另一种气质。细长花部有的展开，有的仍卷合着，和绿叶放在一起，各有自己的好看。": "Looking back at the flowers, I see bold lines in the red, a lightness in the pink, and another quality altogether in the pale ones. Some of the long narrow flower parts spread wide; others are still rolled. Each has its own appeal against the green leaves.", "这些园艺面孔不必只凭花色急着认成同一个品种。把同片对照分别记下来，日后再遇见时，就多了几个可以继续比较的小线索。": "Colour alone isn't enough to assign these garden plants to a cultivar. I'll keep the comparisons from this video separate so I have something to check against when I meet them again.", "原稿列举的园艺类别，未提供能唯一确定具体品种的名称或学名。": "The manuscript lists horticultural types, without names precise enough to identify individual cultivars.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "美人蕉 Canna indica · 原稿主对象名称": "Canna indica: name used for the main subject in the manuscript", "Canna indica · 正式接受种": "Canna indica: accepted species"}, "20240617-01": {"拍摄时在植株旁看花，宽长叶片从人身旁伸展。": "The observer looks at flowers beside long, broad leaves.", "花朵正面，黄色唇瓣上的红色线纹清楚可见。": "Front view of a blossom with red lines on the yellow lip.", "站在斑叶植株旁，花叶艳山姜在周围深绿背景中显得明亮。": "The variegated plant beside the observer stands out against darker foliage.", "斑叶间垂下的一串花，花苞与开放阶段混在一起。": "A hanging cluster among variegated leaves contains both buds and open flowers.", "花叶艳山姜手绘：记录斑叶、下垂花序与单花。": "Drawing of variegated Alpinia zerumbet: leaf, hanging inflorescence and a single flower.", "逆光中的斑叶和下垂花序，叶片黄绿纹理成为背景。": "Backlit variegated leaves and a hanging inflorescence against green and yellow stripes.", "两片叶子之间，深绿与浅黄色条纹形成鲜明对照。": "Dark green and pale yellow stripes contrast on two neighbouring leaves.", "花苞阶段的花序，白色、粉红和浅绿交错排列。": "A cluster in bud combines white, pink and pale green.", "手边一串幼果，表面可见浅色纵向条纹。": "A bunch of young fruits beside a hand, with pale lengthwise stripes on their surfaces.", "下垂花序侧面，一朵已开的花露出黄色和红色的纹理。": "Side view of the hanging cluster; an open blossom shows its yellow and red markings.", "一段叶枝的斑叶，每片叶子的黄绿分布都不完全相同。": "On a single shoot, the distribution of green and yellow differs from leaf to leaf.", "一串尚未完全展开的花苞，白色表面顶端带着淡粉红。": "Partly opened buds, with white surfaces tinged pale pink at their tips.", "叶枝间一小串白色花苞，顶端泛着浅粉色。": "A few white buds tinged pale pink at the tips among leafy branches.", "花后的下垂花序，圆形幼果与保留的褐色花部相邻。": "A hanging cluster after flowering: round young fruits beside persistent brown floral parts.", "花叶艳山姜斑叶近景，粗细不同的条纹铺满叶面。": "Close-up of a variegated blade striped with lines of varying widths.", "花序的另一角度，白色花部和褐色花后结构同时入镜。": "Another view shows white floral parts beside brown structures left after flowering.", "开放花近景，白色花部中伸出带红色纹路的黄色唇瓣。": "An open flower in close-up: a yellow lip marked with red lines protrudes from the white floral parts.", "靠近枝条观察多朵开放花，黄色唇瓣从白色花部中伸出。": "Several flowers examined beside a branch; yellow lips project from the white floral parts.", "花叶艳山姜叶面的黄绿斑纹，细长条纹顺着叶脉方向延伸。": "Yellow-green markings on a variegated ginger leaf, with narrow stripes running along its veins.", "叶子像画上黄绿笔触，花苞像白玉带着桃尖尖，看看花叶艳山姜怎样给绿化调色。": "Streaks of yellow and green look painted on the leaves, and the white buds have little peach-pink tips. This shell ginger brings a whole new palette to a planting.", "白玉一样的花苞": "Buds like white jade", "南方绿化里很常见的花叶艳山姜，我想先从花说起。一串串花序垂下来，花苞白白亮亮，顶端还带一点粉嫩的桃尖尖。\n\n像小小的白玉，也像等着打开的小瓷器。远看只觉得花很多，靠近才会发现，每一个将开未开的花苞都很有表情。": "This variegated shell ginger is a familiar sight in southern landscaping, but I'd like to start with the flowers. The clusters hang down in strings. Each bud is glossy white with a little peach-pink point.\n\nThey remind me of polished white jade, or tiny pieces of porcelain waiting to open. From far off I see a mass of flowers; up close each bud on the verge of opening has a character of its own.", "南方绿化里很常见的花叶艳山姜，我想先从花说起。一串串花序垂下来，花苞白白亮亮，顶端还带一点粉嫩的桃尖尖。": "This variegated shell ginger is a familiar sight in southern landscaping, but I'd like to start with the flowers. The clusters hang down in strings. Each bud is glossy white with a little peach-pink point.", "像小小的白玉，也像等着打开的小瓷器。远看只觉得花很多，靠近才会发现，每一个将开未开的花苞都很有表情。": "They remind me of polished white jade, or tiny pieces of porcelain waiting to open. From far off I see a mass of flowers; up close each bud on the verge of opening has a character of its own.", "打开以后，里面好热闹": "A surprise inside", "等花打开，原来白白的里面还藏着黄色和红色。黄色唇瓣向外伸开，上面细细的红纹像专门画过的一样。\n\n同一串上，有的已经开放，有的仍含着花苞，有的开始转成花后的样子。顺着花序往下看，这种一朵接一朵的变化很让人着迷。": "When a bud opens, there's yellow and red inside all that white. A yellow lip projects outward with fine red lines so precise that they look painted on.\n\nOn one hanging cluster some flowers are open, others are still buds and others have begun to fade. Trace it downward and the sequence from one flower to the next is absorbing.", "等花打开，原来白白的里面还藏着黄色和红色。黄色唇瓣向外伸开，上面细细的红纹像专门画过的一样。": "When a bud opens, there's yellow and red inside all that white. A yellow lip projects outward with fine red lines so precise that they look painted on.", "同一串上，有的已经开放，有的仍含着花苞，有的开始转成花后的样子。顺着花序往下看，这种一朵接一朵的变化很让人着迷。": "On one hanging cluster some flowers are open, others are still buds and others have begun to fade. Trace it downward and the sequence from one flower to the next is absorbing.", "花后，还有一串小圆果": "Round fruits after the flowers", "花看够了，再找找花后的枝条。圆圆的小果实挂成一串，表面有明显的纵向线条，旁边还留着褐色的旧花部。\n\n从白玉一样的花苞，到张开的花，再到这些小圆果，一段花序就够看好一会儿。先把眼前的形态记清楚，比只记住一个熟悉的香料名字更踏实。": "Once I've had my fill of the flowers I look for the branches that have finished blooming. The round fruits hang in a string, with conspicuous lengthwise ridges. Brown remnants of old flowers lie beside them.\n\nFrom white jade buds to open flowers to little round fruits, a single cluster can hold my attention for a long time. I'd rather remember these shapes than rely on a familiar spice name alone.", "花看够了，再找找花后的枝条。圆圆的小果实挂成一串，表面有明显的纵向线条，旁边还留着褐色的旧花部。": "Once I've had my fill of the flowers I look for the branches that have finished blooming. The round fruits hang in a string, with conspicuous lengthwise ridges. Brown remnants of old flowers lie beside them.", "从白玉一样的花苞，到张开的花，再到这些小圆果，一段花序就够看好一会儿。先把眼前的形态记清楚，比只记住一个熟悉的香料名字更踏实。": "From white jade buds to open flowers to little round fruits, a single cluster can hold my attention for a long time. I'd rather remember these shapes than rely on a familiar spice name alone.", "我喜欢用它给一片绿调色": "A splash of colour among green plants", "回到叶子上，就知道为什么花叶艳山姜能在绿化中这么显眼。黄绿条纹清清楚楚，像有人拿着画笔，一道一道画上去的。\n\n我很喜欢它这种调色的本领。放进一片深绿背景里，叶子已经亮起来，花再从叶间垂下，一整株就像有了自己的小灯光。": "Look back at the leaves and it's clear why this ginger stands out in a planting. The yellow-and-green stripes are so distinct they look as though someone had laid them on, one brushstroke at a time.\n\nI love the way it changes the colours around it. Set against a mass of dark green, the leaves already seem to light up; when flowers hang among them, the whole plant looks as though it had brought its own lights.", "回到叶子上，就知道为什么花叶艳山姜能在绿化中这么显眼。黄绿条纹清清楚楚，像有人拿着画笔，一道一道画上去的。": "Look back at the leaves and it's clear why this ginger stands out in a planting. The yellow-and-green stripes are so distinct they look as though someone had laid them on, one brushstroke at a time.", "我很喜欢它这种调色的本领。放进一片深绿背景里，叶子已经亮起来，花再从叶间垂下，一整株就像有了自己的小灯光。": "I love the way it changes the colours around it. Set against a mass of dark green, the leaves already seem to light up; when flowers hang among them, the whole plant looks as though it had brought its own lights.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "园艺名称与原种科学名对应": "Comparison of the horticultural name with the scientific name of the parent species.", "本期主对象按花叶艳山姜园艺名称记录；正式八级分类采用艳山姜Alpinia zerumbet的POWO接受种链，园艺品种名另列。": "The main subject is the variegated horticultural plant recorded as 花叶艳山姜. Its formal classification follows the species Alpinia zerumbet. The horticultural name is recorded separately.", "花叶艳山姜 Variegata · 园艺名称依据": "Source for the horticultural name of variegated Alpinia zerumbet", "艳山姜 · 原种正式分类": "Alpinia zerumbet: formal species classification"}, "20240624-01": {"一株向上伸展的蕺菜，白色苞片托着黄绿色穗状花序。": "An upright shoot bears a yellow-green spike on white bracts.", "一段枝条上，白色苞片与黄绿色小花序并列。": "White bracts beside a little yellow-green spike along a shoot.", "蕺菜手绘：记录心形叶、枝条及白色苞片托起的花序。": "Drawing of Houttuynia cordata: heart-shaped leaves, shoots and spike supported by white bracts.", "一段枝条上的心形叶和白色苞片，细茎向上弯折。": "Heart-shaped leaf and white bracts on a slender stem bent upwards.", "一只昆虫悬在花序旁，白色苞片在下方展开。": "An insect hovers beside a spike above outspread white bracts.", "花序近景，黄绿色的小花部聚在中央，外侧是平展的白色苞片。": "Close-up of a spike: tiny yellow-green flower parts cluster in the centre above flat white bracts.", "手指旁一片心形叶，可见叶柄连接处的凹缺。": "A heart-shaped leaf beside a finger, showing the notch where its stalk joins the blade.", "手边的完整花枝，叶片、细茎与花序同时可见。": "The whole flowering shoot beside a hand, showing leaves, slender stem and spike.", "从上方看花叶相间的蕺菜丛，白色花序散布在绿叶中。": "Seen from above, white-bracted flower spikes are dotted among green leaves.", "取下白色苞片后观察穗状花序，许多细小花部密集排列。": "With the white bracts removed, many tiny flower parts can be seen packed along the spike.", "俯看白色苞片围着的花序，周围是密集的心形叶。": "Looking down on a spike surrounded by white bracts and a dense mass of heart-shaped leaves.", "以手作背景观察花枝，便于比较花序与叶片大小。": "A flowering shoot against a hand for comparison of spike and leaf sizes.", "心形绿叶之间开着白色苞片托起的花序。": "White bracts support flower spikes among heart-shaped green leaves.", "整片蕺菜叶丛，不同大小的叶子彼此覆盖。": "A patch of Houttuynia with overlapping leaves of different sizes.", "植株的整体姿态，叶片高低错落，花序举在上方。": "The whole plant with leaves at different heights and spikes held above them.", "从侧面看弯折向上的细茎，部分位置泛着红褐色。": "Slender stem bent upwards, reddish brown in places, in side view.", "蕺菜的心形叶片与细茎，叶面在光中有明暗变化。": "Heart-shaped Houttuynia leaves and slender stems, with light and shade on the blades.", "熟悉的鱼腥草，开花时像穿了白裙子的小姑娘；换个距离，看清真正的小花在哪里。": "The familiar fish mint looks like a girl in a white skirt when it flowers. A closer look reveals where the true flowers are.", "折耳根，也叫鱼腥草": "Two familiar names for one plant", "说起鱼腥草，很多人先想到的是它的味道。有人喜欢，有人刚闻到就要皱眉，光是这个名字，就已经很有画面感。\n\n折耳根、鱼腥草，都是熟悉的俗称；它的正式中文名叫蕺菜。这次刚好赶上开花，不妨先把餐桌上的印象放一放，看看它长在绿叶间是什么模样。": "Say “fish mint” and many people think of its smell. Some love it, others wrinkle their noses on first acquaintance. Even the Chinese name yúxīngcǎo, “fishy-smelling herb,” paints a picture.\n\nZhé'ěrgēn and yúxīngcǎo are familiar everyday names; its formal Chinese name is jícài. I caught it flowering this time. For a moment let's leave the dinner table and look at it growing among the leaves.", "说起鱼腥草，很多人先想到的是它的味道。有人喜欢，有人刚闻到就要皱眉，光是这个名字，就已经很有画面感。": "Say “fish mint” and many people think of its smell. Some love it, others wrinkle their noses on first acquaintance. Even the Chinese name yúxīngcǎo, “fishy-smelling herb,” paints a picture.", "折耳根、鱼腥草，都是熟悉的俗称；它的正式中文名叫蕺菜。这次刚好赶上开花，不妨先把餐桌上的印象放一放，看看它长在绿叶间是什么模样。": "Zhé'ěrgēn and yúxīngcǎo are familiar everyday names; its formal Chinese name is jícài. I caught it flowering this time. For a moment let's leave the dinner table and look at it growing among the leaves.", "穿白裙子的小姑娘": "A girl in a white skirt", "心形叶片之间，白色“小花”高高举着，像一个穿白裙子的小姑娘，正准备转个圈。\n\n靠近看，白白的那几片其实是苞片，真正细小的花聚在中央的穗状花序上。把镜头放大，原先一眼略过的黄绿色部分，竟然也有这么丰富的细节。": "Above the heart-shaped leaves a little white “flower” is held high, like a girl in a white skirt about to spin around.\n\nClose up, the white parts are bracts. The true flowers are tiny, clustered on the central spike. Through the camera that yellow-green bit I'd barely noticed turns out to have a wealth of detail.", "心形叶片之间，白色“小花”高高举着，像一个穿白裙子的小姑娘，正准备转个圈。": "Above the heart-shaped leaves a little white “flower” is held high, like a girl in a white skirt about to spin around.", "靠近看，白白的那几片其实是苞片，真正细小的花聚在中央的穗状花序上。把镜头放大，原先一眼略过的黄绿色部分，竟然也有这么丰富的细节。": "Close up, the white parts are bracts. The true flowers are tiny, clustered on the central spike. Through the camera that yellow-green bit I'd barely noticed turns out to have a wealth of detail.", "再看看心形叶和细茎": "Heart-shaped leaves and slender stems", "平时见到的往往是叶子和茎，今天也认真看一遍。叶片有心形的凹缺，叶缘和细茎上有些地方泛着红色，整段枝条弯弯地往上走。\n\n我把手放在后面比一比，发现这一小枝其实挺优雅。绿叶、红褐细茎和上面的白，放在一起，已经很像一枝自然的小花材。": "Leaves and stems are what I usually see, so today I give them a proper look as well. Each leaf is notched at the base like a heart. Parts of the margins and fine stems are tinged with red, and the shoot curves gently upward.\n\nI put a hand behind it for scale and realise how graceful the little spray is. The green leaves, reddish-brown stem and white above them look like something already arranged for a vase.", "平时见到的往往是叶子和茎，今天也认真看一遍。叶片有心形的凹缺，叶缘和细茎上有些地方泛着红色，整段枝条弯弯地往上走。": "Leaves and stems are what I usually see, so today I give them a proper look as well. Each leaf is notched at the base like a heart. Parts of the margins and fine stems are tinged with red, and the shoot curves gently upward.", "我把手放在后面比一比，发现这一小枝其实挺优雅。绿叶、红褐细茎和上面的白，放在一起，已经很像一枝自然的小花材。": "I put a hand behind it for scale and realise how graceful the little spray is. The green leaves, reddish-brown stem and white above them look like something already arranged for a vase.", "熟悉的植物，也能换个看法": "A familiar plant seen differently", "近看花，远看叶丛，蕺菜的样子和只记得“有腥味”时很不一样。小昆虫也会来到花旁，镜头一停，又多了一点动静。\n\n同一株植物，换一个关注点，就能重新认识一遍。这一次我先把它的花和叶画下来，下次再听到折耳根这个名字，也许会先想起绿叶间的那条小白裙子。": "Close up at the flowers, then back among the foliage: there's more to this plant than the “fishy smell” I used to remember first. Little insects visit the flowers, too, and when I pause with the camera there's another flicker of movement.\n\nShift the focus and it feels like meeting the same plant afresh. This time I've drawn its flowers and leaves. Next time someone says zhé'ěrgēn, perhaps I'll think first of that little white skirt among the leaves.", "近看花，远看叶丛，蕺菜的样子和只记得“有腥味”时很不一样。小昆虫也会来到花旁，镜头一停，又多了一点动静。": "Close up at the flowers, then back among the foliage: there's more to this plant than the “fishy smell” I used to remember first. Little insects visit the flowers, too, and when I pause with the camera there's another flicker of movement.", "同一株植物，换一个关注点，就能重新认识一遍。这一次我先把它的花和叶画下来，下次再听到折耳根这个名字，也许会先想起绿叶间的那条小白裙子。": "Shift the focus and it feels like meeting the same plant afresh. This time I've drawn its flowers and leaves. Next time someone says zhé'ěrgēn, perhaps I'll think first of that little white skirt among the leaves.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "蕺菜 · 名称与别名": "Houttuynia cordata: name and alternative names", "Houttuynia cordata · 正式分类": "Houttuynia cordata: formal classification"}, "20250711-01": {"枝条交错，深色老枝旁伸出新枝。": "Intertwined branches, with new shoots beside dark old stems.", "低矮叶丛覆盖着石块间的地面。": "Low foliage covers the ground in the gaps between stones.", "小紫花与青果同时出现在相邻枝梢。": "Small purple flowers and green fruits on neighbouring shoot tips.", "俯看湿润的枝梢，叶片层层展开。": "A damp shoot tip from above, its leaves opening in layers.", "俯看枝梢，几朵紫花朝不同方向开放。": "Several purple flowers at the shoot tip open in different directions.", "木质枝贴着石面横向延伸。": "A woody branch runs flat along the rock surface.", "从石坡上看过去，一簇簇单叶蔓荆长在碎石间。": "Clumps of Vitex rotundifolia grow among the stones on a rocky slope.", "托起横生的枝条，能看清它的长度与分枝。": "Lifting a horizontal branch reveals its length and branching.", "尚未开放的花蕾高出叶片，叶面挂着水珠。": "Buds rise above the leaves, which still hold droplets of water.", "放大一枚青果，果面和包在下方的萼清晰可见。": "Enlarged view of a green fruit and the calyx cupping its base.", "一朵唇形小花，浅色斑纹通向花喉。": "A small lipped flower with pale markings leading towards the throat.", "侧面看花喉，浅色茸毛与紫色裂片形成对照。": "Side view of the throat, with pale hairs contrasting against purple lobes.", "花枝上既有花蕾，也有已经展开的花冠。": "Both buds and open corollas on a flowering shoot.", "从上方看，叶丛沿着石隙铺开。": "From above, foliage spreads along cracks in the rock.", "圆圆的青果簇在枝梢，两边是对生的叶片。": "Round green fruits clustered at a shoot tip between opposite leaves.", "石间横伸的枝条上，叶片成对生长。": "Paired leaves grow on a branch extending horizontally between rocks.", "几朵紫花开在银绿色的叶丛上。": "Purple blossoms above silvery green leaves.", "退后一步看果枝，它从碎石间向上生长。": "From one step back, the fruiting shoot can be seen rising from loose stones.", "在桥上被一小丛紫花吸引，走下去才看清，它的枝条贴着石头一路伸向远处。": "A little patch of purple flowers caught my eye from a bridge. Only after walking down did I see stems running out over the stones.", "从桥上看见一点紫": "A glimpse of purple from a bridge", "深圳这么热的天，乱石堆里居然还有小紫花。我原本在桥上，见到这一点颜色才走下来。站近了看，小枝一根根举起来，下面的叶子却贴着石头铺了一大片。": "Even in the heat of Shenzhen, there are little purple flowers among these rough stones. I was up on the bridge when the colour caught my eye and drew me down. Close to the plant I could see short shoots rising individually, with the leaves below spreading over the stones in a broad mat.", "蹲下来，看看小花的嘴唇": "Crouching to look at the lips of a flower", "对着一朵花细看，紫色花冠分成上下两唇，中间那片带着浅色斑纹，花喉还有细毛。这朵朝向我，旁边那朵又把侧脸转过去，同一簇花值得换几个角度看。": "Face a flower and the purple corolla divides into an upper and a lower lip. The central lobe has pale markings, and fine hairs line the throat. One flower faces me, its neighbour turns away in profile. A single cluster is worth looking at from several angles.", "花梢旁边已经结了果": "Fruits beside the flowering tips", "同一丛里，还有几枝顶着圆圆的青果。花冠落了，花萼还留在下面。镜头慢慢推近，以前只记得紫花，现在连包住果子的那一圈也记住了。": "In the same patch, several shoots are already topped with round green fruits. The corollas have fallen; the calyx remains underneath. I move the lens gradually closer. I used to remember only the purple flowers; now I'll remember the little ring around the fruit, too.", "一个“蔓”字，藏在石头之间": "A creeping stem among the stones", "我把一根枝条托起来，好柔软呀。它沿着地面往四周伸，直立的小枝上，银绿色的单叶对生得很整齐。揉一揉叶子，又闻到熟悉的气味，想起前面拍过的黄荆。同一个牡荆属，一种在山上遇见，一种就趴在眼前的沙石间。": "I lift a stem in my hand. It's wonderfully supple. It spreads outward along the ground, bearing short upright shoots with neat pairs of silvery-green, undivided leaves. Rub a leaf and there's the familiar scent: I remember the Vitex negundo I photographed earlier. Two members of the same genus, one met in the hills, the other creeping along the sand and stones at my feet.", "文稿用同属的黄荆对照沙石间匍匐的单叶蔓荆。": "The manuscript compares Vitex negundo with V. rotundifolia creeping among stones and sand.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260113-01": {"拨开枝叶，靠近墙面观察变粗的老藤。": "Parting the leaves to look at a thick old stem against the wall.", "围墙上的藤叶转红，露出上方的屋檐。": "Vine leaves turn red on the enclosure wall beneath the eaves.", "秋冬色彩的叶片在枝头重叠，有绿、有红，也有紫。": "Green, red and purple leaves overlap near the branch tips in autumn and winter.", "浅色墙面上的卷须末端膨大，形成一颗颗小吸盘。": "The tendril tips have expanded into tiny adhesive discs on a pale wall.", "藤条旁留下深色的附着痕迹。": "Dark attachment marks beside the vine.", "用手指比对细小的卷须和贴在墙上的末端。": "A finger for scale beside a fine tendril and its attached tip.", "在浓密的夏绿叶墙旁记录藤蔓的生长。": "Recording the vine beside a wall covered in dense summer foliage.", "从墙下仰看垂下的藤条，紫色花在墙顶另作背景。": "Looking up at hanging stems, with purple flowers in the background above the wall.", "新伸的细梢和卷须还在寻找附着的位置。": "New shoot tips and tendrils still seeking a place to attach.", "手掌旁边，两列彩色叶子沿墙攀爬。": "Two rows of coloured leaves climbing the wall beside my hand.", "从侧面看藤条贴着墙，叶片朝光伸展。": "A side view of the stems against the wall, with the leaves facing the light.", "较完整的花序从两片叶子间探出来。": "A more complete flower cluster reaches out between two leaves.", "粗枝与细藤交错，贴着树干向上攀附。": "Thick and thin stems cross as they climb against a tree trunk.", "绿藤沿白墙上方铺开。": "Green stems spreading along the top of a white wall.", "叶间有一簇小圆蕾，近处可以看见分枝的花序。": "Small round buds among the leaves; up close the inflorescence branches.", "绿色藤叶连成大片，沿着枝条铺开。": "A sweep of green leaves along the stems.", "红色叶片上，浅色的脉络在阳光中格外醒目。": "Pale veins stand out on a sunlit red leaf.", "三条细藤自下而上贴着墙伸展。": "Three slender vines climb up the wall.", "一面墙被绿叶和红叶画出了颜色。把镜头移到藤梢，才看见它留在墙上的小脚印。": "Green and red leaves have painted a wall. It took a closer look at the ends of the vines for me to notice the little footprints they leave behind.", "看看爬墙的“脚”": "Find the climber’s feet", "今天认识一种会爬墙的植物。它的“脚”藏在哪里？靠近藤梢，细细的卷须有好几个分叉，末端贴在墙上，膨成一个个小吸盘。以前路过只看见一片绿，今天是顺着这些小点找过去的。": "Today I am looking at a plant that can climb a wall. Where does it hide its feet? Near a shoot tip, fine tendrils divide into several branches. The tips press against the wall and swell into tiny adhesive discs. I used to walk past and see only a sweep of green. Today I followed those little dots.", "半面墙，铺成一幅绿画": "Half a wall painted green", "在楼梯的半墙上，它像一层自己长出来的绿篱。顺着藤条看，叶子有的转向左，有的转向右，错开着把墙面铺满。再拨开下面一片叶子，就能看到贴着墙的老藤已经长得很粗。": "Along the low wall beside the steps, the vine looks like a hedge that has grown there by itself. Some leaves turn to the left and others to the right, fitting together to cover the wall. Part a few leaves near the bottom and you can see how thick the old stem has grown against the masonry.", "绿叶也会换颜色": "Green leaves change colour too", "这片藤我看了好几年。夏天可见浓绿的叶幕，秋冬再来，墙面换成红色和橘黄色。我把镜头留在一片尚未完全转色的叶子上，原来绿色和红色也可以同时留在一片叶里。": "I have been watching this vine for several years. In summer it makes a dense green curtain. When I come back in autumn or winter, the wall is red and orange. I lingered over a leaf partway through the change: green and red can share a single blade.", "落叶之后，墙上还留着什么": "What is left after the leaves fall?", "夏天在叶子间还看见过小小的花序，到了落叶时节，墙上的藤条和附着的小点便更显眼。小时候只记得墙上这些深色“脚印”；这一次沿着卷须找到它们，再看就认识了。": "In summer I spotted small flower clusters among the leaves. Once the leaves drop, the stems and their little points of attachment stand out on the wall. As a child I only remembered those dark footprints. This time I traced them back to the tendrils, and now I know what I am looking at.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20250826-01": {"叶腋旁边，一颗绿色的小圆果挂在细梗上。": "A round green fruit hangs on a slender stalk beside a leaf axil.", "朴树的冠幅很宽，粗枝在高处伸向树冠边缘。": "The crown spreads broadly, with heavy branches reaching out towards its edges.", "人站在横伸的大枝下，显出枝干的尺度。": "A person beneath a broad horizontal branch gives a sense of its scale.", "从另一侧看青果和叶脉。": "Green fruit and leaf veins from another angle.", "站在树下仰看，高处的枝条向四面展开。": "Looking up from below, the high branches spread in all directions.", "更多带果的枝条隐藏在层层叶片之间。": "More fruiting twigs are hidden between layers of leaves.", "压低视线看果枝，叶面和果实有深浅不同的绿色。": "From lower down, the fruiting branch shows different shades of green in fruit and leaf.", "站在草坪上回望，老朴树低矮宽阔的树冠与远山相映。": "View back from the lawn: the old hackberry’s low, spreading crown against distant hills.", "浅绿色新叶近景，叶脉和叶缘清晰可见。": "Pale green new leaf in close-up, with veins and margin visible.", "从下方看长着小青果的枝条。": "Looking up at a twig bearing a small green fruit.", "枝条和新叶挡住一部分阳光，从树下仰看格外明亮。": "New leaves and branches partly block the sunlight, glowing when viewed from beneath the tree.", "透过新叶，可以看见细枝上垂着的小青果。": "A small green fruit hangs from a fine twig behind new leaves.", "走进一棵老朴树的树冠下，先认它伸展的长枝，再在新叶之间找一颗小青果。": "Beneath the canopy of an old Celtis, I follow the long spreading limbs, then look among the new leaves for a little green fruit.", "去拜访一棵老朴树": "A visit to an old tree", "今天来拜访身后的这棵大树。远远看，它的树冠铺得真宽。走到大枝下面，才知道刚才在草坪上看到的那条横线有多粗。你好呀，老朴树！": "Today I'm visiting the big tree behind me. From a distance its crown spreads remarkably wide. Only when I walk under a great branch do I realise how thick that horizontal line I could see from the lawn really is. Hello, old hackberry!", "我喜欢这一树新绿": "A canopy of new green", "它名字里有个“朴”，叶子可一点也不破。刚长出来的叶子嫩绿，摸起来像纸片。抬头看，一丝丝叶脉透着光。我喜欢这棵树给人的感觉，枝条舒展，叶间还留得住天空。": "There's a play on the sound of its Chinese name, pòshù: whatever the name might suggest, its leaves are far from shabby. Newly opened, they're tender green and feel like slips of paper. Above my head light shines through each fine vein. I like the feeling this tree gives me: the branches spread wide and still leave glimpses of sky between the leaves.", "没找到米粒花，先找到小青果": "A little green fruit instead of the flower I came for", "我在枝间找了许久，想看看那像米粒一样的小花。这回没遇到花，却看到好些近圆的小果子，藏在一片片绿叶旁边。不换个角度，眼睛很容易把同样绿色的它们略过去。": "I looked among the branches for those tiny flowers the size of rice grains. No flowers this time, but I found plenty of nearly round little fruits tucked beside green leaves. Unless I change my angle of view, my eyes pass right over them: they're the same green as the leaves.", "给下一次相遇留个约定": "Something for a return visit", "我还想在冬天蓝蓝的天空下看它满树黄叶。这回镜头里只有绿色，黄叶就留给下一次吧。有人听见“朴树”会想到歌，我站在树下想起的，却是这些刚刚展开的叶子。拜拜，老朴树，你这么大，我是抱不动了。": "I'd still like to see this tree in yellow leaf against a blue winter sky. The camera has only green this time; the yellow will have to wait for another visit. For some people the name Pǔ Shù brings a singer and his songs to mind. Standing here, I think of these leaves that have just unfolded. Goodbye, old tree. You're much too big for me to wrap my arms around.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript."}, "20260203-01": {"几枝蓝花鼠尾草并排开放，花序有高有低。": "Flowering spikes of S. farinacea standing side by side at different heights.", "一朵已经打开的小花朝向镜头。": "An open flower facing the camera.", "蓝花鼠尾草的花序近景，上部还有未开花蕾。": "A close view of a spike of S. farinacea, with unopened buds near the tip.", "拉近镜头，看到花穗上小花的深紫色与浅色斑纹。": "A closer view of deep purple flowers with paler markings.", "同片的朱唇，红色小花分散在细长的花序上。": "Also in the video: the red flowers of S. coccinea are spaced out along slender spikes.", "同片的深蓝鼠尾草，蓝色花冠从深色花萼中伸出。": "Also in the video: the blue corollas of 'Black and Blue' emerge from dark calyces.", "同片的白花林地鼠尾草，成排白花在绿叶间竖起。": "Also in the video: white spikes of 'Porzellan' rise in rows above the green leaves.", "主对象蓝花鼠尾草的一枝花穗，深蓝紫的小花沿轴排列。": "Salvia farinacea, the main subject: deep blue-violet flowers along the axis of a spike.", "退远一点看花境，蓝花鼠尾草的颜色从其它植物间显出来。": "From further back, the colour of S. farinacea stands out among the other border plants.", "同片的幻紫鼠尾草，较深的花萼托着紫色花冠。": "Also in the video: 'Purple Majesty', with purple corollas held in darker calyces.", "同片的萨丽芳天蓝色鼠尾草，花有白色与淡蓝紫色。": "Also in the video: 'Sallyfun Sky Blue', with white and pale blue-violet flowers.", "本期主对象蓝花鼠尾草，成丛花穗高出绿叶。": "The main subject, S. farinacea, with groups of spikes above the green foliage.", "同片的四月夜林荫鼠尾草，蓝紫色花穗直立。": "Also in the video: upright blue-violet spikes of 'April Night'.", "叶片近景，细看叶缘与叶面纹理。": "A closer look at the leaf margin and the texture of the blade.", "换个角度看墨西哥鼠尾草的花序和细长叶片。": "Another view of the inflorescence and narrow leaves of S. leucantha.", "同片的墨西哥鼠尾草，紫色花序带着明显的绒毛感。": "Also in the video: the conspicuously velvety purple inflorescence of S. leucantha.", "从侧面观察萨丽芳天蓝色鼠尾草的浅色花穗。": "The pale spikes of 'Sallyfun Sky Blue' seen from the side.", "蓝紫色的花穗常被误认作薰衣草。这一期先认蓝花鼠尾草，再看看同片那些颜色和花形不同的亲戚。": "Those blue-violet spikes are easily mistaken for lavender. I start with Salvia farinacea, then compare it with the other sages in the video to see how their colours and flowers differ.", "花境里这片蓝紫色是谁": "Which sage is making that blue haze?", "站在蓝紫色花海旁，很容易想起薰衣草。可我眼前这一片是蓝花鼠尾草。退远一点，它在花境里把一片紫色压在绿叶上；走近些，一枝枝竖起的花穗又有了自己的形状。": "Standing next to a drift of blue-violet flowers, I immediately think of lavender. What I am looking at is Salvia farinacea. From a distance it lays a band of purple over the green of the border; up close I can pick out each upright flower spike.", "把一枝花穗看清楚": "Take a closer look at one spike", "镜头贴近，花穗上并不是从下到上一起开。有些小花已经张开，有些还是花蕾。蓝紫色的花冠上还有浅色的地方。再去看同片的萨丽芳天蓝色鼠尾草，那种淡蓝紫跟眼前这片深色很不一样。": "The flowers on a spike do not all open at once. Some are already out, while others are still buds. There are pale markings on the blue-violet corollas. Compare them with 'Sallyfun Sky Blue' in the same video: its pale bluish purple is quite different from this deeper colour.", "绒绒的紫，和另一种蓝": "Fuzzy purple and a different blue", "墨西哥鼠尾草也在这一期出现了，最容易吸引我的是花序上的绒毛感。朱唇则开红花，几朵小花疏疏地伸出来。它们并排放在图集里，就不容易把这一期出现的所有颜色都当成蓝花鼠尾草自己的花了。": "Salvia leucantha also appears in this video. The first thing that attracts me is the velvety look of its flowering spikes. Salvia coccinea has red flowers instead, with a few projecting from each slender spike. Putting the photographs side by side makes it clear which colours belong to which sage.", "花萼也是辨别的线索": "Look at the calyx as well", "再看深蓝鼠尾草，花冠是明亮的蓝，衬在后面的花萼却很深。林荫鼠尾草还有白花和冷紫花的园艺品种。从花海回到一朵花，颜色、花萼、花序的疏密都能帮我重新认一遍。": "Take another look at 'Black and Blue': the corolla is bright blue against a much darker calyx. Salvia nemorosa also has cultivars with white or cool purple flowers. Going from the whole border to a single bloom, I can use the colour, the calyx and the spacing of the flowers to tell them apart.", "本期以蓝花鼠尾草为主对象。其它鼠尾草和园艺品种为同片对照，保留各自名称。": "Salvia farinacea is the main subject of this record. The other sages and cultivars in the video are listed separately for comparison.", "这些对象在同一期视频中作为对照出现，各自保留其名称。": "These plants appear in the same video for comparison. Each is listed under its own name.", "科学名称与等级按链接记录保留；中文名称为辅助对照。": "Scientific names and ranks follow the linked record. Chinese names are provided for reference.", "素材来源自视频和作者的文稿整理。": "The photographs, drawings and field notes come from the video and the author’s manuscript.", "园艺名称依本期文稿；链接为所属种的分类来源。": "The horticultural name follows the manuscript. The link gives the classification of its species.", "同片比较记录。": "Shown for comparison in the same video."}};
